(1, '', '', '<h6 class=\"letter-space-4 text-gray-darkgray text-uppercase mt-0 mb-0\">ALL ABOUT</h6>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-uppercase font-weight-600 mt-0 font-28 line-bottom\">WELCOME TO BM GROUP OF INSTITUTIONS</h2>\r\n<h4 class=\"text-theme-colored\">IS0 9001:2008 Institute Approved by AICTE New Delhi</h4>\r\n<p>BM Group of Institutions is managed by Mata Kaushalya Devi Charitable Trust, Gurgaon under the encouraging patronage of prominent educationists of the Gurgaon region of Haryana. The trust aims at providing quality education at affordable fees along with preparing young minds to face the competitive world on all fronts. The lush green campus, spread over 13 acres, is situated near Farrukh Nagar. The campus offers a host of hi-tech ultra-modern facilities to ensure well-planned education to its students.<br><br>BM College of Technology &amp; Management aims at building human minds. The group is determined to prepare a team of young scholars who are enthusiastic enough to rise to the need of the hour and resolved to fight the evils of society. The curriculum framed for imparting education inculcates the ideas of humanism, modesty, morality and spiritual values. We try to revitalize the spirit of patriotism which has received a set back in recent times by inspiring the students to follow the great legacy of our rich cultural heritage.<br><br><br></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-uppercase text-center text-theme-colored title line-bottom\">OUR&nbsp;<span class=\"text-theme-color-2 font-weight-400\"><strong>CULTURE<br><br></strong></span></h2>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"89769bff-a9a4-4719-b334-2316387b7621\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\r\n<p>BM Group of Institutions stands out with its professional attitude, vibrant environment, and dedicated faculty, nurturing students\' talents and potential. Through excellent facilities and guidance, students thrive in a competitive yet supportive atmosphere, fostering holistic development and strong moral values. Notably, the institution embraces diversity and inclusivity, offering opportunities to all, including the underprivileged and differently-abled individuals, promoting social responsibility. This commitment to excellence and inclusivity has positioned BM Group of Institutions as a leader in India\'s educational landscape, continually evolving to meet the needs of a dynamic world while fostering global collaboration and innovation.<br><br></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-uppercase text-center text-theme-colored title line-bottom\">OUR PROFILE</h2>\r\n<h5 class=\"text-uppercase text-center text-theme-colored title line-bottom\"><span class=\"text-theme-color-2 font-weight-400\"><strong><br><br>BM Group of Institutions, a co-educational day-cum-boarding college under Mata Kaushalya Devi Charitable Trust, Gurgaon, hosts approximately 1400 students across various disciplines like MBA, M.Tech, B.Tech, BBA, BCA, and Diploma Courses. Renowned for its pursuit of excellence, it has spearheaded the establishment of educational campuses in Gurgaon, emphasizing quality alongside quantity. With a commitment to lifelong learning, the college fosters a love for learning and strives to equip students with both intellectual and practical skills to navigate future challenges successfully.<br></strong></span><br><br><br></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden juice:-ml-3\">\r\n<div class=\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '', '221123091641about_img.jpg'),
(2, 'The Rise of A2P Realtech: Exploring the Real Estate Industry\'s Fastest Growing Company', '10', '<p>In today\'s dynamic real estate industry, one company is making waves and garnering attention as the fastest growing player in the market. A2P Realtech has emerged as a powerhouse, revolutionizing the way we think about real estate services. With their innovative approach and cutting-edge technology, A2P Realtech is reshaping the industry and setting new standards for excellence.</p><p>Driven by a passion for innovation and a relentless commitment to customer satisfaction, A2P Realtech has quickly become a trusted name in the real estate world. Their unique blend of expertise, technology, and personalized service has earned them a loyal customer base and a reputation for delivering exceptional results.</p><p>As the demand for smarter, more efficient real estate solutions continues to grow, A2P Realtech is leading the way with their forward-thinking approach. Whether you\'re a buyer, seller, or investor, A2P Realtech has the tools and expertise to help you navigate the real estate market with ease.</p><p>Join us as we delve into the rise of A2P Realtech and explore how this game-changing company is transforming the real estate industry.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>The growth of the real estate industry</h2><p>The real estate industry has experienced remarkable growth in recent years, driven by a multitude of factors. The increasing demand for housing, both residential and commercial, has fueled a surge in construction and investment activities. As the global economy continues to evolve, the real estate sector has become a vital component of economic development, providing employment opportunities, generating revenue, and shaping the landscape of communities around the world.</p><p>The rise of urbanization and the growing preference for urban living have further accelerated the growth of the real estate industry. Rapid population growth, particularly in major metropolitan areas, has created a pressing need for more housing, commercial spaces, and infrastructure. This has led to a surge in real estate development projects, catering to the diverse needs of individuals, businesses, and communities.</p><p>Moreover, the low-interest-rate environment and the availability of various financing options have made real estate investments more accessible to a wider range of investors. The growing interest in real estate as an asset class has attracted both individual and institutional investors, seeking to diversify their portfolios and capitalize on the potential for long-term appreciation. This influx of investment has further fueled the growth and dynamism of the real estate industry, driving innovation and competition among market players.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>The rise of A2P Realtech in the real estate market</h2><p>Amidst the dynamic landscape of the real estate industry, a company has emerged as a frontrunner, captivating the attention of both industry insiders and the broader public. A2P Realtech, a innovative real estate technology company, has rapidly established itself as a disruptive force, redefining the way real estate services are delivered.</p><p>Founded with a vision to revolutionize the real estate industry, A2P Realtech has leveraged its deep understanding of the market, coupled with its expertise in cutting-edge technology, to develop a comprehensive suite of solutions that cater to the evolving needs of real estate professionals and consumers. From streamlining the transaction process to enhancing data-driven decision-making, A2P Realtech has consistently pushed the boundaries of what\'s possible in the real estate sector.</p><p>The company\'s meteoric rise can be attributed to its unwavering commitment to innovation and customer-centricity. By continuously investing in research and development, A2P Realtech has introduced groundbreaking tools and platforms that have transformed the way real estate transactions are conducted. Its ability to anticipate market trends and rapidly adapt to changing consumer preferences has been a key driver of its success, positioning the company as a trusted partner for real estate professionals and investors alike.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>A2P Realtech\'s unique approach to real estate</h2><p>At the heart of A2P Realtech\'s success lies its unique approach to real estate, which sets it apart from traditional industry players. The company\'s focus on leveraging technology to enhance the real estate experience has been a game-changer, empowering both real estate professionals and consumers with innovative solutions.</p><p>One of the hallmarks of A2P Realtech\'s approach is its emphasis on data-driven decision-making. By harnessing the power of advanced analytics and machine learning, the company has developed sophisticated algorithms that can analyze vast amounts of real estate data, identify trends, and provide actionable insights to its clients. This data-centric approach has enabled real estate professionals to make more informed decisions, optimize their strategies, and deliver superior results for their clients.</p><p>Furthermore, A2P Realtech\'s commitment to customer experience has been a driving force behind its success. The company has invested heavily in creating user-friendly platforms and intuitive interfaces that streamline the real estate journey for both buyers and sellers. From seamless property search and listing management to efficient transaction processing and post-sale support, A2P Realtech has consistently prioritized the needs of its customers, ensuring they receive a personalized and hassle-free experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>A2P Realtech\'s innovative technology and solutions</h2><p>At the core of A2P Realtech\'s success lies its relentless pursuit of innovation and its ability to develop cutting-edge technology solutions that address the evolving needs of the real estate industry. The company\'s technology-driven approach has been a game-changer, transforming the way real estate professionals and consumers interact with the market.</p><p>One of the standout innovations from A2P Realtech is its proprietary real estate analytics platform. This powerful tool leverages advanced data analytics and machine learning algorithms to provide real-time market insights, enabling real estate professionals to make more informed decisions, optimize their strategies, and stay ahead of the competition. From identifying emerging trends and pricing patterns to predictive modeling and risk assessment, this platform has become an indispensable resource for industry players.</p><p>Another key innovation from A2P Realtech is its seamless transaction management system. This end-to-end platform streamlines the entire real estate transaction process, from property listing and lead generation to contract negotiation and closing. By automating various administrative tasks and integrating with third-party services, the system has significantly reduced the time and effort required to complete a transaction, ultimately enhancing the overall efficiency and profitability for real estate professionals.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Success stories of A2P Realtech</h2><p>The success of A2P Realtech can be seen in the numerous case studies and testimonials that showcase the company\'s impact on the real estate industry. From individual real estate agents to large-scale real estate firms, A2P Realtech has consistently delivered tangible results, helping its clients achieve their goals and exceed their expectations.</p><p>The founders Mr. Amit Verma, first generation entrepreneurs &amp; visionaries have over 20 years of comprehensive &amp; rich experience in real estate and capital market. A2P&nbsp;philosophy is entirely client-centric, with a clear &amp; sharp focus on providing long-term value addition to clients while maintaining the highest standards of excellence, ethics and professionalism.</p><p>Under the founder’s expert management and guidance, A2P&nbsp;has achieved a pre-eminent position across India. It has emerged as one of the most dynamic and progressive Group company across India.</p><p>One notable success story is that of a small real estate agency that struggled to keep up with the demands of the fast-paced market. By partnering with A2P Realtech, the agency was able to leverage the company\'s advanced analytics platform to gain a deeper understanding of local market trends and make more informed pricing decisions. This, coupled with the streamlined transaction management system, allowed the agency to increase its deal volume by 30% and improve its profitability, ultimately positioning it as a leading player in the local market.</p><p>Another example is a large real estate investment firm that sought to optimize its portfolio management strategies. A2P Realtech\'s data-driven insights and predictive analytics tools enabled the firm to identify underperforming properties, make strategic acquisitions, and maximize the returns on its investments. The firm\'s executives have praised A2P Realtech\'s solutions, stating that they have been instrumental in driving the firm\'s growth and maintaining its competitive edge in the industry.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>A2P Realtech\'s impact on the real estate market</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The rise of A2P Realtech has had a profound impact on the real estate industry, disrupting the status quo and setting new standards for excellence. The company\'s innovative approach and technology-driven solutions have not only transformed the way real estate professionals operate but have also empowered consumers to navigate the market with greater confidence and efficiency.</p><p>One of the most significant impacts of A2P Realtech has been the increased transparency and efficiency in the real estate industry. By providing real-time market data, streamlining transaction processes, and enhancing communication between all stakeholders, the company has helped to reduce the friction and information asymmetry that have traditionally plagued the industry. This, in turn, has led to a more level playing field, where both professionals and consumers can make more informed decisions and achieve better outcomes.</p><p>Furthermore, A2P Realtech\'s focus on data-driven decision-making has had a ripple effect across the industry. As more real estate professionals and firms adopt the company\'s analytics platforms and tools, the industry as a whole is becoming more data-savvy and sophisticated in its approach to market analysis and strategic planning. This shift towards data-driven decision-making has not only improved the overall performance of real estate businesses but has also fostered a culture of innovation and continuous improvement within the industry.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>The future of A2P Realtech and the real estate industry</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As the real estate industry continues to evolve and adapt to the changing landscape, the future of A2P Realtech and its role in shaping the industry\'s trajectory are of paramount importance. The company\'s unwavering commitment to innovation and its ability to anticipate market trends suggest that it is poised for continued growth and success.</p><p>One of the key drivers of A2P Realtech\'s future success will be its ability to stay ahead of the curve and continue to develop cutting-edge technology solutions that address the industry\'s most pressing challenges. With the rapid advancements in areas such as artificial intelligence, blockchain, and the Internet of Things, the company will need to remain at the forefront of technological innovation to maintain its competitive edge and deliver even more value to its clients.</p><p>Additionally, the company\'s focus on expanding its geographic reach and diversifying its service offerings will be crucial in cementing its position as a dominant player in the real estate industry. As the global real estate market continues to evolve, A2P Realtech will need to adapt its strategies and solutions to cater to the unique needs of different regional markets, ensuring that its impact is felt across a wider spectrum of the industry.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>A2P Realtech\'s services and offerings</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At the heart of A2P Realtech\'s success lies its comprehensive suite of real estate services and solutions, which cater to the diverse needs of industry professionals and consumers alike. From innovative technology platforms to personalized advisory services, the company has established itself as a one-stop-shop for all real estate-related needs.</p><p>One of the company\'s flagship offerings is its real estate analytics platform, which provides in-depth market insights, predictive modeling, and data-driven recommendations to help clients make informed decisions. This powerful tool has become a game-changer for real estate professionals, enabling them to stay ahead of market trends, optimize their strategies, and deliver exceptional results for their clients.</p><p>In addition to its analytics platform, A2P Realtech also offers a comprehensive suite of transaction management solutions, streamlining the entire real estate transaction process from start to finish. This includes features such as automated property listings, lead generation, contract negotiation, and seamless closing procedures, all designed to enhance efficiency and profitability for real estate professionals.</p><p>A2P come with a range of value added services depending on the need of our clients</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>Conclusion: The significance of A2P Realtech in the real estate industry</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The rise of A2P Realtech has undoubtedly been a transformative force in the real estate industry, redefining the way real estate services are delivered and setting new standards for innovation and excellence. Through its unwavering commitment to technology, data-driven decision-making, and customer-centric approach, the company has emerged as a true industry leader, captivating the attention of real estate professionals and consumers alike.</p><p>As the real estate industry continues to evolve, the significance of A2P Realtech\'s role cannot be overstated. The company\'s ability to anticipate market trends, develop cutting-edge solutions, and deliver tangible results has positioned it as a driving force behind the industry\'s transformation. By empowering real estate professionals with the tools and insights they need to succeed, and by providing consumers with a seamless and efficient real estate experience, A2P Realtech has become an indispensable partner in the pursuit of greater success and prosperity within the real estate sector.</p><p>Looking ahead, the future of A2P Realtech and its continued impact on the real estate industry remain bright. With its steadfast focus on innovation, its dedication to customer satisfaction, and its unwavering commitment to shaping the industry\'s trajectory, the company is poised to remain at the forefront of the real estate landscape for years to come. As the real estate industry continues to evolve, the role of A2P Realtech will undoubtedly become increasingly critical, serving as a beacon of innovation, efficiency, and excellence in an ever-changing markets.</p>', '', '020724085802shutterstock_696395281.avif'),
(3, 'Discovering A2P Realtech Vision for Real Estate', '', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Introducing A2P Realtech Vision, the groundbreaking technology that is reshaping the real estate industry as we know it. With its cutting-edge features and revolutionary approach, A2P Realtech Vision is unlocking the future of real estate. Imagine being able to virtually tour a property from the comfort of your own home, experiencing every nook and cranny as if you were physically there. That\'s the power of A2P Realtech Vision &ndash; a game-changer in the world of property viewing.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">But it doesn\'t stop there. A2P Realtech Vision goes beyond virtual tours, offering state-of-the-art augmented reality (AR) and virtual reality (VR) experiences. Through immersive technologies, users can not only visualize properties in real-time but also see potential renovations, interior design options, and even the neighborhood\'s future development plans. With its user-friendly interface and incredible attention to detail, A2P Realtech Vision is revolutionizing the way properties are viewed, bought, and sold. Say goodbye to outdated photographs and static floor plans &ndash; this technology brings real estate to life in a way never seen before. Experience the future of real estate with A2P Realtech Vision and unlock a whole new world of possibilities. Are you ready to step into the future?</p>', '', '1409240904061709629338761.jpg'),
(4, 'A2P Realtech: Pioneering a New Era in Real Estate with Our Unwavering Mission', '', '<p>Welcome to A2P Realtech, where we are spearheading a new era in the real estate industry with our unwavering mission to provide exceptional property solutions. With a team of dedicated professionals and a commitment to innovation and customer satisfaction, we are revolutionizing the way people buy, sell, and invest in real estate. At A2P Realtech, we understand the importance of finding the perfect property that meets your needs and aspirations. Our extensive network allows us to offer a wide range of residential and commercial properties that are tailored to suit every budget and requirement.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re a first-time homebuyer, an experienced investor, or a business owner looking for the ideal commercial space, we have the expertise and resources to assist you throughout the entire process. With our customer-centric approach, we prioritize transparency, trust, and integrity in every transaction. Our goal is to help you make informed decisions by providing accurate and reliable information about the properties in our portfolio. We strive to exceed your expectations by delivering exceptional service and creating long-lasting relationships with our clients. Experience the future of real estate with A2P Realtech and let us be your trusted partner in achieving your property goals.</p>', '', '140924090538Noida-residential-sales-jump-77-per-cent-in-H1-of-2018-FB-1200x628-compressed.jpg'),
(5, 'Welcome to A2P Realtech Private Limited', '', '<p class=\"OutlineParagraph\">In today\'s dynamic real estate industry, one company is making waves and garnering attention as the fastest growing player in the market. A2P Realtech has emerged as a powerhouse, revolutionizing the way we think about real estate services. With their innovative approach and cutting-edge technology, A2P Realtech is reshaping the industry and setting new standards for excellence.</p>\r\n<p class=\"OutlineParagraph\">Driven by a passion for innovation and a relentless commitment to customer satisfaction, A2P Realtech has quickly become a trusted name in the real estate world. Their unique blend of expertise, technology, and personalized service has earned them a loyal customer base and a reputation for delivering exceptional results.</p>\r\n<p class=\"OutlineParagraph\">&nbsp;</p>', 'A2P IS A VALUED AND FIRST CHOICE FOR ALL REPUTED PREMIUM BRAND ACROSS INDIA AND ABROAD', '070325094848A2P REALTECH ABOUT US.jpg'),
(6, '', '', '<h2 class=\"text-uppercase text-center font-weight-600 mt-0 text-sss text-black line-bottom\">MESSAGE FROM DIRECTOR</h2>\r\n<p><img class=\"text-center m-auto\" src=\"https://www.bmctm.com/engineering/upload/dte.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"298\" height=\"228\"><br><br></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-danger\"><strong>Dr. Pawan Pruthi</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 class=\"text-danger font-15\"><strong>\"In pursuance of our Vision, Mission and Goals, we at BM Group of Institutions make inclusive efforts to shape up our Laboratories,Library and Academic deliverables with state- ofthe- art technology in such a manner that it gives every student adequate opportunities to groom themselves with the best academics as well as personality traits,to be able to meet challenges ofthe outside world very successfully.\"</strong><br><br></h4>\r\n<p class=\"text-primary\"><em>My Dear Students,</em></p>\r\n<p>I am delighted to learn that you are aspiring for admission to BM Group of Institutions. The information provided in this prospectus to answer of your questions about this institution; its Academic Programmes, its Faculty and infrastructure and facilities.<br><br>We have mandate from various sanctioning authorities for running four year Engineering Degree Course leading to Bachelor of Engineering (B.Tech), M.Tech, MBA, BBA, BCA &amp; Diploma Courses. The admissions to these courses are made through JEE &amp; MAT examination conducted throughout the country. Our major objective is that our students during their stay with us &amp; they pass out from this institution, should be able to manage the academic as well as professional challenges, not only in India, but globally. We endeavour that our students should become academically strong, with excellent communication skills, high moral values, leadership qualities and professional competence. They should be worthy sons of the country, possessing high degree of integrity, honesty and quality conciousness.<br><br><br><br>Besides imparting quality education, as per the designed syllabus of the Gurugram University, we continuously facilitate progress of our students through faculty and management.<br><br>We have a well established system of interaction with parents / guardians regarding academic achievements of their wards. We regularly conduct class tests, quizzes and tutorials. These activities keep the students very active all the time.<br><br>We have well planned value added courses, resulting in overall development of personality at all levels, starting from first semester to the eighth semester. Thus we ensure to groom our students to become world-class managers and leaders.<br><br><br>In pursuance of our Vision, Mission and Goals, we at BM Group of Institutions make inclusive efforts to shape up our Laboratories, Library and Academic deliverables with state-ofthe- art technology in such a manner that it gives every student adequate opportunities to groom themselves with the best academics as well as personality traits, to be able to meet challenges ofthe outside world very successfully.<br><br></p>', '', ''),
(7, '', '', '<h2 class=\"text-uppercase text-center font-weight-600 mt-0 text-sss text-black line-bottom\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">MESSAGE FROM REGISTRAR<br><br></span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"font-17\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>BM College of Technology &amp; Management</strong> is one of the prestigious educational institutions in NCR whose mission is to meet the educational and cultural needs of the society by providing programs and services of the highest quality. It has committed itself to develop and enhance various academic programs in the areas of science, business and information technology. It plays a significant role in leading cultural, social and economic development in the country. It is indeed my pleasure to welcome you to <strong>BM College of Technology &amp; Management</strong><br></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>BM College of Technology &amp; Management(BMCTM) </strong>has always been committed to providing its students with the finest education and a supportive learning environment. BMCTM works diligently to bridge the gap between the typical academic classroom experience and providing the education necessary for the day-to-day demands of business and society. Additionally, the college recognizes that our students must be well-prepared to be valuable members of a rapidly changing society where it desires responsible and participative citizens.<br></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">In light of these demands, the college must be continuously improving academically and administratively. Therefore, the college has begun making major changes that directly impact and involve every aspect of the college that will allow our students to excel and be successful in career and life.<br></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>BM College of Technology &amp; Management</strong> prepares courses of study for online delivery and self-study, and our students obtain quality learning by taking highly enriched modules of instruction and by undertaking academic exercises in a sequential manner. Its method of learning is through the online and offline study of lessons prepared by subject matter experts and moderated by the faculty. The academic programs we offer will not only provide the students with a wide range of courses to suit their individual needs and ambition but will also nurture their sense of purpose and vision. All these are achieved through <strong>BMCTM </strong>classrooms which are rich, highly interactive and among the best that can be found anywhere in NCR today.<br></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Our faculty is comprised of experienced professors from many prestigious foreign and local universities with strong educational credentials and a desire to teach. I encourage all to explore <strong>BMCTM</strong> programs in order to expand their educational and career possibilities. Join us as we drive towards very high quality and relevant education derived from a non-intimidating academic setting. Admission is open to learners from all parts of the world as long as they have reliable internet, postal and telecommunication services. Please browse our Website <strong>(https://www.bmctm.com)</strong> to discover the wonderful world of <strong>BM College of Technology &amp; Managemen</strong>t.</span></p>', '', '110121105447g2.jpg'),
(8, '', '', '<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Our Mission:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mata Kaushalya Devi Charitable trust\'s mission is to : Establish role model colleges in professional education to pursue high quality research in niche area of strength. Be responsive &amp; sensitive to the regional, national &amp; societal needs. Strive hard to be an epitome of perfection. Prepare the college to reach the level of university.</span><br><br></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Our Vision:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mata Kaushalya Devi Charitable trust through its colleges shall stimulate both the hearts and minds of scholars, empower them to contribute to the welfare of the society at large, train to adapt themselves to the changing needs of the economy, educate them for cultural leadership and ensure peace, harmony and prosperity for all.</span></p>\r\n<p><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Our Goal:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The Institute For, It&rsquo;s Day To Day Functioning, Has Set The Following Goal To</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1. Academic Integrity and Accountability, Respect for the views of one and all, Appreciation of Intellectual Excellence and creativity.<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2. Collaborate and interact with Industries and Research Institutions of repute.<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3. Design and develop Student Centred learning material and distant learning material in relevant branches of Engineering &amp; Management.<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">4. Generate and create resources for Evening Learning Programmes and Extra Curricular Activities, Programme for students, after the college hours.<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">5. Generate and create resources for running Value Added Programmes for overall personality development of Sutdents.<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Invite experts from industry as well as from Premier Institutions on a regular basis to deliver lectures on topics of current interest.<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">6. Generate and create resources for running Various Sports Programme for overall development of students.<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">7. Impart Training to faculty on a regular basis for improving their quality e.g., Teaching Methodologies, Commitment, Regularity, Academic Ethics, Professional Ethics &amp; practices.<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">8. Add research programmes in various branches of engineering, technology and management.</span></p>\r\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The Institute for, its day to day functioning, has set the following goal to - :</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Set-up and create an Institution of excellence in Engineering, Management, Pharmacy &amp; Education with very high intellectual standard.</span></p>', '', '110121111639g5.jpg'),
(9, '', '', '', '', ''),
(10, '', '', '', '', ''),
(11, 'Privacy Policy', '', '<p>Are you concerned about your digital privacy? Look no further than A2P Realtech Pvt Ltd\'s Privacy Policy, designed with your protection in mind. In this increasingly connected world, safeguarding personal information is paramount, and A2P Realtech Pvt Ltd takes this responsibility seriously. Our comprehensive Privacy Policy ensures that your data remains secure and only used for the purposes it was intended. At A2P Realtech Pvt Ltd, we understand the importance of trust and transparency when it comes to handling your personal information. Our Privacy Policy outlines the measures we take to protect your data from unauthorized access, disclosure, or misuse. We utilize the latest encryption technology to ensure the confidentiality of your information. Our commitment to privacy doesn\'t end there. A2P Realtech Pvt Ltd also provides you with the ability to control and manage your personal data. We offer opt-out options and give you the power to choose which information you want to share with us. When it comes to maintaining your digital privacy, A2P Realtech Pvt Ltd is your trusted partner. With our robust Privacy Policy in place, you can have peace of mind knowing that your personal information is safe and protected.</p>', '', ''),
(12, 'Terms And Conditions', '', '<p>Welcome to A2P Realtech Pvt Ltd. By accessing and using our website, services, and products, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following&nbsp;<strong>Terms and Conditions</strong>. Please read them carefully before using our services. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must discontinue use of our services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>By accessing, browsing, or using the A2P Realtech Pvt Ltd website or services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions, including any future modifications. If you do not agree to these terms, you may not use our services.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>2. Use of Services</h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>You agree to use our services for lawful purposes only. You shall not engage in any activities that:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Violate any local, state, national, or international laws or regulations.</li>\r\n<li>Infringe upon the rights of others, including intellectual property, privacy, or personal rights.</li>\r\n<li>Transmit any harmful or malicious software, spam, or other harmful content.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>3. Account Responsibility</h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To access certain features of our services, you may be required to create an account. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account information and for all activities that occur under your account. You must notify us immediately if you become aware of any breach of security or unauthorized use of your account.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All content, materials, and services provided by A2P Realtech Pvt Ltd, including but not limited to text, graphics, logos, images, software, and multimedia, are the intellectual property of A2P Realtech Pvt Ltd or its licensors. Unauthorized use, reproduction, or distribution of any materials is strictly prohibited without prior written consent.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>5. Modifications to Services</h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A2P Realtech Pvt Ltd reserves the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of our services at any time without prior notice. We are not liable for any inconvenience or damages resulting from such modifications.</p>\r\n<p>For any questions regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:team@a2prealtech.com\">team@a2prealtech.com</a>&nbsp;</p>', '', '120121065904grading.jpg'),
(13, 'WELCOME TO BM GROUP OF INSTITUTIONS', '', '<p>BM Group of Institutions is managed by Mata Kaushalya Devi Charitable Trust, Gurgaon under the encouraging patronage of prominent educationists of the Gurgaon region of Haryana. The trust aims at providing quality education at affordable fees along with preparing young minds to face the competitive world on all fronts. The lush green campus, spread over 13 acres, is situated near Farrukh Nagar. The campus offers a host of hi-tech ultra-modern facilities to ensure well-planned education to its students. BM College of Technology &amp; Management aims at building human minds.<br><br>The group is determined to prepare a team of young scholars who are enthusiastic enough to rise to the need of the hour and resolved to fight the evils of society. .</p>', '', '1705240748450705240633171.building.jpeg'),
(14, '', '', '<h3 align=\"center\">EMTC ? REGISTRATION &amp; AFFILATION\r\n</h3><p>Embolden management &amp; technical council (EMTC) Registered under MCA (ministry of corporate affairs govt. of India) as a Non-Profitable Education Organization to enhance the management, technical &amp; professional skills of students, Working Persons.  an ISO 9001-2015 Certified accredited by UKQC is the appointed accreditation body for United Kingdom responsible for providing accreditation of conformity assessment bodies (IQRC) in the fields of certification and inspection. Accreditation by UK demonstrates the competence and independence of these (IQRC)\r\n</p>', '', '');
INSERT INTO `about` (`id`, `name`, `short`, `des`, `short2`, `photo`) VALUES
(15, '', '', '<h3 align=\"center\">Admissions process at EMTC\r\n</h3><p>1.All the admission to students who fulfill the qualitative requirements will be based on applications only. There is no entrance test for admission Course. It is Direct.\r\n2.Application for admission should be made in the prescribed form along with relevant fee.</p><p>\r\n3.The filled in applications should be submitted to the Institute on or before the last date specified. The Institute is not responsible for any postal delay.\r\n</p><p>4.Students need not send/submit their original certificates. The following self-attested documents are to be enclosed with filled ? in application</p><ul><li>(a) Proof of age i.e. birth certificate. </li><li>(b) High School Certificate / marksheet.??????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????? <img style=\"width: 296.824px; height: 197.6px; float: right;\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" data-filename=\"ad.jpg\"><br></li><li>(c) Copy of the Certificate of last academic qualification.???????????????????????????????????????????????? <br></li><li> (d) 2 additional PP size photograph for the issue of final examination mark sheet.\r\n</li></ul><p>5. Admitted students will be allotted an enrolment number for future correspondence etc.\r\n</p><p>6. All fees should be paid by A/C payee Bank Draft in favor of Embolden Management and Technical Council payable at New Delhi.\r\n</p><p>7. Study Material will be sent/issued periodically as per the mode of course fee payment opted by the Student.\r\n</p><p>8. Fee once paid shall neither be returned nor adjusted against any other programme of EMTC.\r\n</p><p>9. Fee schedule should be strictly observed by student for payment of fee by Installment, failing which dispatch/issue of study material etc. shall be withheld.\r\n</p><p>10. Change of course shall not be considered after enrollment.\r\n</p><p>11. The filled in application along with the required documents and fee should be sent by Registered Post/Speed Post/Courier of office address\r\n</p>', '', ''),
(16, '', '', '<p>Each and every programme of <b>EMTC </b>is designed as per the industrial requirement. We provide well planned and competitive education system to our students which are defined as to groom working knowledge of industry.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p>We shape each and every student for the current market requirements and for this we provide several kinds of skill set training to students with regular period of time.\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p>Our well defined education system enables every student to make their career bright for the future. Our professional and highly experienced faculty provides in depth knowledge of complete subjects which are helpful in several industries for the projects. We believe in placing every student of <b>EMTC </b>in several international organizations which results into our success.\r\n\r\n</p><p><b>EMTC </b>is a competent authority itself to impart certifications based on their experience to meet the educational standard of the courses as laid down by the institute to which a student wishes for admission. Our certification is an added benefit for the working class in securing better prospects and is not valid for government jobs or higher studies.\r\n</p>', '', '110121110556g3.jpg'),
(17, '', '', '<p>w</p>', '', '');

