(6, 'Synergy 2023 A2P Realtech Shines as Title Sponsor at Apeejay Dwarka Spectacular Annual Fest', '070525083843A2P-Realtech-Apeejay-School2023.jpg', '<h1 class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Geomanist Book\', \'serif\'; color: black; background: white;\">Synergy 2023 : A2P Realtech Shines as Title Sponsor at Apeejay Dwarka\'s Spectacular Annual Fest!&nbsp;</span></strong></span></h1>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Geomanist Book\', \'serif\'; color: black; background: white;\">As the vibrant pulse of Apeejay Dwarka\'s annual fest thunders to life, all eyes are on Synergy 2023, a showcase of innovation, creativity, and spirited celebration. This year, the spotlight shines brightly on A2P Realtech, stepping up as the title sponsor and promising a fusion of technology and entertainment that sets the stage for unforgettable experiences. With an exciting lineup of performances, workshops, and exhibitions, the fest not only highlights the talents of students but also reinforces A2P Realtech\'s commitment to fostering growth within the community. As guests immerse themselves in the electrifying atmosphere, they can expect nothing less than a spectacular display that embodies the ethos of collaboration and synergy. Join us at Apeejay Dwarka as we celebrate this magnificent event that promises to leave an indelible mark on everyone who comes through its doors. Get ready for an extraordinary journey where innovation meets celebration!</span></span></p>', '', 'Synergy 2023 : A2P Realtech Shines as Title Sponsor at Apeejay Dwarka\'s Spectacular Annual Fest! ', 'Synergy 2023, Apeejay Dwarka, A2P Realtech, Title Sponsor, Apeejay annual', 'Meta Description ', 0, 1);

