t=\"427\"><strong data-end=\"441\" data-start=\"429\">Connects</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"554\" data-start=\"445\">\r\n<li data-end=\"500\" data-start=\"445\"><strong data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"447\">Dwarka (Delhi)</strong> to <strong data-end=\"500\" data-start=\"469\">Kherki Daula Toll (Gurgaon)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"554\" data-start=\"503\">Direct link between <strong data-end=\"540\" data-start=\"525\">IGI Airport</strong> and <strong data-end=\"554\" data-start=\"545\">NH-48</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"622\" data-start=\"555\">Eases pressure off NH-8 and provides an <strong data-end=\"622\" data-start=\"594\">alternate route to Delhi</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"665\" data-start=\"629\">🏗️ <strong data-end=\"665\" data-start=\"637\">2. Infrastructure Marvel</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"666\">\r\n<li data-end=\"740\" data-start=\"666\"><strong data-end=\"707\" data-start=\"668\">8-lane access-controlled expressway</strong> with service roads on both sides</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"816\" data-start=\"741\">Includes <strong data-end=\"790\" data-start=\"752\">tunnels, flyovers, and underpasses</strong> for seamless traffic flow</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"817\">Equipped with:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"836\">\r\n<li data-end=\"885\" data-start=\"836\"><strong data-end=\"885\" data-start=\"838\">Automated Traffic Management Systems (ATMS)</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"930\" data-start=\"888\"><strong data-end=\"930\" data-start=\"890\">Smart traffic signals &amp; surveillance</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"933\"><strong data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"935\">Pedestrian walkways and cycling tracks</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1026\" dat