center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 50.7962%;\" data-end=\"2719\" data-start=\"2681\">\r\n<p>DLF Garden City, Vatika City Homes</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Types of Properties Available on Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon Haryana</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Great question! Dwarka Expressway in <strong data-end=\"57\" data-start=\"37\">Gurgaon, Haryana</strong> has emerged as a high-potential corridor offering a <strong data-end=\"139\" data-start=\"110\">diverse mix of properties</strong> for different buyer segments&mdash;from first-time homeowners to ultra-luxury investors.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"308\" data-start=\"224\">Here&rsquo;s a breakdown of the <strong data-end=\"283\" data-start=\"250\">types of properties available</strong> along Dwarka Expressway:</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"308\" data-start=\"224\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"350\" data-start=\"315\">🏡 <strong data-end=\"350\" data-start=\"321\">1. Residential Properties</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"396\" data-start=\"352\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"396\" data-start=\"359\">Apartments (High-Rise &amp; Mid-Rise)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"626\" data-start=\"397\">\r\n<li data-end=\"429\" data-start=\"397\">Configurations: 1 BHK to 5 BHK</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"587\" data-start=\"430\">Types:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"587\" data-start=\"441\">\r\n<li data-end=\"477\" data-start=\"441\">Affordable (e.g., Signature Global)</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"480\">Mid-segment (e.g., Hero Homes, ATS)</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"587\" data-start=\"519\">Luxury &amp; Ultra-Luxury (e.g. M3M Mansion, Sobha City, The Palatial)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"626\" data-start=\"588\">Sizes: 600 sq. ft. to 6,000+ sq. ft.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"653\" data-start=\"628\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"653\" data-start=\"635\">Builder Floors</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"824\" data-start=\"654\">\r\n<li data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"654\">Low-rise independent floors (often in G+4 formats)</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"745\" data-start=\"707\">Common in sectors like 105, 108, 112</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"782\" data-start=\"746\">Great for privacy &amp; personal space</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"824\" data-start=\"783\">Popular developers: BPTP, ROF, SS Group</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"879\" data-start=\"826\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"1050\" data-start=\"1020\">Villas &amp; Independent Homes</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1169\" data-start=\"1051\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1105\" data-start=\"1051\">Limited but growing availability in luxury townships</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1169\" data-start=\"1106\">Located in gated communities (e.g., Sobha International City)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1176\">🏢 <strong data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1182\">2. Commercial Properties</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1250\" data-start=\"1212\">🔸 <strong data-end=\"1250\" data-start=\"1219\">SCO (Shop-Cum-Office) Plots</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1396\" data-start=\"1251\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1318\" data-start=\"1251\">Freehold commercial land with permission to build retail + office</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1359\" data-start=\"1319\">Hot locations: Sector 83, 84, 104, 113</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1396\" data-start=\"1360\">Builders: M3M, Elan, Orris, Vatika</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1433\" data-start=\"1398\">🔸 <strong data-end=\"1433\" data-start=\"1405\">Retail Shops &amp; Showrooms</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1540\" data-start=\"1434\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1487\" data-start=\"1434\">In commercial complexes or high-street retail zones</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1540\" data-start=\"1488\">Ideal for cafes, salons, boutiques, and franchises</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1566\" data-start=\"1542\">🔸 <strong data-end=\"1566\" data-start=\"1549\">Office Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1725\" data-start=\"1567\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1624\" data-start=\"1567\">Premium office towers (some part of mixed-use projects)</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1669\" data-start=\"1625\">Demand from startups, corporates, and MNCs</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1725\" data-start=\"1670\">Locations: Near Cyber City extension &amp; Sector 114&ndash;115</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"1767\" data-start=\"1732\">🏢 <strong data-end=\"1767\" data-start=\"1738\">3. Mixed-Use Developments</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2013\" data-start=\"1768\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1828\" data-start=\"1768\">Blend of <strong data-end=\"1828\" data-start=\"1779\">residential + retail + office + entertainment</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1938\" data-start=\"1829\">Examples:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"1938\" data-start=\"1843\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1862\" data-start=\"1843\">Elan Empire (106)</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1884\" data-start=\"1865\">M3M Capital (113)</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1938\" data-start=\"1887\">DLF Downtown (Upcoming near Cyber City Extension)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"2013\" data-start=\"1939\">Offer lifestyle convenience with walk-to-work &amp; shop-in-complex concepts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"2068\" data-start=\"2020\">🧱 <strong data-end=\"2068\" data-start=\"2026\">4. Under-Construction vs Ready-to-Move</strong></h2>\r\n<table style=\"width: 57.3284%; height: 166.172px; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" data-end=\"2291\" data-start=\"2070\">\r\n<thead data-end=\"2089\" data-start=\"2070\">\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.3906px;\" data-end=\"2089\" data-start=\"2070\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 33.3735%; background-color: #236fa1;\">\r\n<p><strong><button></button>Type</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 66.6265%; background-color: #236fa1;\">\r\n<p><strong>Benefits</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.3906px;\" data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2110\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 33.3735%;\" data-end=\"2135\" data-start=\"2110\">\r\n<p><strong data-end=\"2134\" data-start=\"2112\">Under Construction</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 66.6265%;\" data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2135\">\r\n<p>Lower entry price, flexible payment plans, and appreciation potential</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.3906px;\" data-end=\"2291\" data-start=\"2205\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 33.3735%;\" data-end=\"2225\" data-start=\"2205\">\r\n<p><strong data-end=\"2224\" data-start=\"2207\">Ready-to-Move</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 66.6265%;\" data-end=\"2291\" data-start=\"2225\">\r\n<p>Immediate possession, no GST, transparency in layout &amp; quality</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"2340\" data-start=\"2298\">📍 <strong data-end=\"2340\" data-start=\"2304\">Popular Sectors by Property Type</strong></h2>\r\n<table style=\"width: 25.0945%;\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" data-end=\"2605\" data-start=\"2342\">\r\n<thead data-end=\"2368\" data-start=\"2342\">\r\n<tr data-end=\"2368\" data-start=\"2342\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 24.1546%; background-color: #236fa1;\">\r\n<p><strong><button></button>Sector</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 75.8454%; background-color: #236fa1;\">\r\n<p><strong>Property Type</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-end=\"2439\" data-start=\"2396\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 24.1546%;\" data-end=\"2406\" data-start=\"2396\">\r\n<p>102&ndash;106</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 75.8454%;\" data-end=\"2439\" data-start=\"2406\">\r\n<p>Apartments, Luxury Residences</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-end=\"2490\" data-start=\"2440\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 24.1546%;\" data-end=\"2451\" data-start=\"2440\">\r\n<p>109, 113</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 75.8454%;\" data-end=\"2490\" data-start=\"2451\">\r\n<p>Ultra-Luxury Apartments, Commercial</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-end=\"2525\" data-start=\"2491\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 24.1546%;\" data-end=\"2501\" data-start=\"2491\">\r\n<p>110&ndash;112</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 75.8454%;\" data-end=\"2525\" data-start=\"2501\">\r\n<p>Builder Floors, SCOs</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-end=\"2564\" data-start=\"2526\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 24.1546%;\" data-end=\"2535\" data-start=\"2526\">\r\n<p>83&ndash;88A</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 75.8454%;\" data-end=\"2564\" data-start=\"2535\">\r\n<p>Plots, Affordable Housing</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-end=\"2605\" data-start=\"2565\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 24.1546%;\" data-end=\"2573\" data-start=\"2565\">\r\n<p>84&ndash;86</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 75.8454%;\" data-end=\"2605\" data-start=\"2573\">\r\n<p>Integrated Townships, Retail</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<h2><strong>Benefits of Investing in Dwarka Expressway &nbsp;Properties</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Investing in <strong data-end=\"43\" data-start=\"13\">Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> offers numerous benefits, making it one of the most attractive real estate destinations in India. Here&rsquo;s a breakdown of the key advantages:</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"235\" data-start=\"190\">1. <strong data-end=\"235\" data-start=\"196\">Strategic Location and Connectivity</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"734\" data-start=\"236\">\r\n<li data-end=\"452\" data-start=\"236\"><strong data-end=\"278\" data-start=\"238\">Direct Access to Delhi &amp; IGI Airport</strong>: The Dwarka Expressway provides seamless connectivity between <strong data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"341\">Gurgaon</strong> and <strong data-end=\"366\" data-start=\"357\">Delhi</strong>, and it\'s just a short drive away from <strong data-end=\"451\" data-start=\"406\">Indira Gandhi International Airport (IGI)</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"453\"><strong data-end=\"485\" data-start=\"455\">Easy Access to Major Roads</strong>: It links to <strong data-end=\"508\" data-start=\"499\">NH-48</strong> (Delhi-Gurgaon Expressway) and is connected to <strong data-end=\"576\" data-start=\"556\">Old Gurgaon Road</strong>, ensuring smooth connectivity with surrounding areas.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"734\" data-start=\"631\">The <strong data-end=\"670\" data-start=\"637\">upcoming metro and rapid rail</strong> systems, like <strong data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"685\">RRTS</strong>, will further enhance its accessibility.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"783\" data-start=\"741\">2. <strong data-end=\"783\" data-start=\"747\">Rapid Infrastructure Development</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1311\" data-start=\"784\">\r\n<li data-end=\"943\" data-start=\"784\"><strong data-end=\"816\" data-start=\"786\">World-Class Infrastructure</strong>: The expressway is equipped with <strong data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"850\">8 lanes</strong>, service roads, flyovers, and underpasses, making commuting smooth and efficient.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1144\" data-start=\"944\">The <strong data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"950\">Dwarka Expressway project</strong> is a part of the <strong data-end=\"1019\" data-start=\"997\">Smart City Mission</strong> and is expected to bring in advanced infrastructure with <strong data-end=\"1125\" data-start=\"1077\">smart lighting, automated traffic management</strong>, and green spaces.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1311\" data-start=\"1145\">Major upcoming projects include the <strong data-end=\"1205\" data-start=\"1183\">Diplomatic Enclave</strong> and <strong data-end=\"1243\" data-start=\"1210\">Yashobhoomi Convention Centre</strong>, which will further improve the area&rsquo;s connectivity and livability.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"1353\" data-start=\"1318\">3. <strong data-end=\"1353\" data-start=\"1324\">Robust Real Estate Growth</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1978\" data-start=\"1354\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1599\" data-start=\"1354\"><strong data-end=\"1387\" data-start=\"1356\">Rapid Property Appreciation</strong>: Due to its prime location and upcoming infrastructural projects, the area has shown consistent property price appreciation (6-12% annually). This trend is expected to continue, making it a lucrative investment.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1844\" data-start=\"1600\"><strong data-end=\"1617\" data-start=\"1602\">High Demand</strong>: As more commercial and residential projects are completed, demand for both <strong data-end=\"1724\" data-start=\"1694\">rental and sale properties</strong> continues to grow, particularly from professionals working in <strong data-end=\"1801\" data-start=\"1787\">Cyber City</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1818\" data-start=\"1803\">Udyog Vihar</strong>, and other business hubs.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1978\" data-start=\"1845\">The <strong data-end=\"1873\" data-start=\"1851\">proximity to Delhi</strong>, modern infrastructure, and the growing number of commercial offices are contributing to this rising demand.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"2019\" data-start=\"1985\">4. <strong data-end=\"2019\" data-start=\"1991\">Diverse Property Options</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2608\" data-start=\"2020\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2187\" data-start=\"2020\"><strong data-end=\"2047\" data-start=\"2022\">Variety of Properties</strong>: From <strong data-end=\"2075\" data-start=\"2054\">luxury apartments</strong> and <strong data-end=\"2098\" data-start=\"2080\">builder floors</strong> to <strong data-end=\"2124\" data-start=\"2102\">affordable housing</strong> and <strong data-end=\"2138\" data-start=\"2129\">plots</strong>, there is something for every investor&rsquo;s budget.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2407\" data-start=\"2188\"><strong data-end=\"2214\" data-start=\"2190\">Premium Developments</strong>: High-end projects like <strong data-end=\"2254\" data-start=\"2239\">M3M Mansion</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2270\" data-start=\"2256\">Sobha City</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"2306\" data-start=\"2276\">The Palatial by Hero Homes</strong> offer luxury living options, while projects like <strong data-end=\"2376\" data-start=\"2356\">Signature Global</strong> cater to middle-income buyers.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2608\" data-start=\"2408\"><strong data-end=\"2438\" data-start=\"2410\">Commercial Opportunities</strong>: The presence of <strong data-end=\"2469\" data-start=\"2456\">SCO plots</strong> and office spaces in the region provides strong rental yield prospects, particularly for investors looking for <strong data-end=\"2607\" data-start=\"2581\">commercial real estate</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"2658\" data-start=\"2615\">5. <strong data-end=\"2658\" data-start=\"2621\">Strong Return on Investment (ROI)</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3076\" data-start=\"2659\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2879\" data-start=\"2659\"><strong data-end=\"2683\" data-start=\"2661\">High Rental Yields</strong>: Due to the growing demand for residential and commercial spaces, investors can expect attractive rental yields (3-6%), particularly in high-demand sectors like <strong data-end=\"2859\" data-start=\"2845\">Cyber City</strong> and <strong data-end=\"2878\" data-start=\"2864\">Sector 104</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3076\" data-start=\"2880\"><strong data-end=\"2908\" data-start=\"2882\">Appreciation Potential</strong>: Property prices in the area have consistently increased, driven by infrastructural developments and strong demand from professionals, NRIs, and real estate investors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"3125\" data-start=\"3083\">6. <strong data-end=\"3125\" data-start=\"3089\">Proximity to Major Business Hubs</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3565\" data-start=\"3126\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3383\" data-start=\"3126\"><strong data-end=\"3156\" data-start=\"3128\">Cyber City &amp; Udyog Vihar</strong>: These commercial hubs are just minutes away, making Dwarka Expressway ideal for both <strong data-end=\"3265\" data-start=\"3243\">residential living</strong> and <strong data-end=\"3292\" data-start=\"3270\">office investments</strong>. The presence of major MNCs ensures a steady stream of high-paying tenants and homebuyers.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3565\" data-start=\"3384\"><strong data-end=\"3411\" data-start=\"3386\">Proximity to Aerocity</strong>: With <strong data-end=\"3430\" data-start=\"3418\">Aerocity</strong> being a key business and hospitality zone near IGI Airport, properties along the expressway are likely to benefit from this proximity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"3605\" data-start=\"3572\">7. <strong data-end=\"3605\" data-start=\"3578\">Future Growth Prospects</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"4045\" data-start=\"3606\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3852\" data-start=\"3606\"><strong data-end=\"3628\" data-start=\"3608\">Developing Areas</strong>: As one of the fastest-developing areas in Gurgaon, Dwarka Expressway&rsquo;s potential for future growth is immense. Key areas like <strong data-end=\"3771\" data-start=\"3756\">New Gurgaon</strong> and <strong data-end=\"3794\" data-start=\"3776\">Sector 114-115</strong> are being transformed into high-demand residential zones.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4045\" data-start=\"3853\"><strong data-end=\"3876\" data-start=\"3855\">Upcoming Projects</strong>: Major developments like the <strong data-end=\"3928\" data-start=\"3906\">Diplomatic Enclave</strong>, <strong data-end=\"3945\" data-start=\"3930\">Global City</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"3985\" data-start=\"3951\">International Airport Terminal</strong> in the near vicinity will further enhance the area\'s value.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"4084\" data-start=\"4052\">8. <strong data-end=\"4084\" data-start=\"4058\">High-Quality Lifestyle</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"4426\" data-start=\"4085\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4229\" data-start=\"4085\"><strong data-end=\"4107\