ge: EN-GB;\">Mistake</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: Relying on hearsay or surface-level information without digging deeper into the market and specific property dynamics.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l25 level1 lfo37; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">How to Avoid</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">:</span></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l25 level2 lfo37; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Research <strong>location trends</strong>, <strong>future infrastructure developments</strong>, and <strong>historical price movements</strong> in the area.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l25 level2 lfo37; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Compare property prices</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\"> across similar localities to gauge competitiveness.</span></li>\r\n</u