ndash;80% of the property value).</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l26 level2 lfo38; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Consider <strong>interest rate fluctuations</strong> and how they&rsquo;ll affect your monthly payments.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l26 level2 lfo38; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Always have a buffer for emergencies.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">3. Ignoring Rental Demand and Yield Potential</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo39; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Mistake</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: Not considering rental income potential or purchasing a property in an area with low demand for tenants.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo39; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">How to Avoid</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">:</span></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l9 level2 lfo39; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Assess rental yields</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\"> in the area before making a purchase decision.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l9 level2 lfo39; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Choose properties near business hubs, universities, or hospitals to ensure a <strong>steady flow of tenants</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l9 level2 lfo39; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Look at vacancy rates</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">&mdash;a lower vacancy rate often indicates high demand.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">4. Overlooking Hidden Costs</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l18 level1 lfo40; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Mistake</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: Focusing only on the initial property cost and ignoring ongoing maintenance, property tax, insurance, and management fees.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l18 level1 lfo40; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">How to Avoid</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">:</span></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l18 level2 lfo40; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Factor in <strong>all costs</strong>, including monthly maintenance, property tax, legal fees, and management fees, when calculating ROI.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l18 level2 lfo40; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Set aside funds for <strong>property maintenance</strong> to keep it in top condition.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">5. Neglecting Legal Due Diligence</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l24 level1 lfo41; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Mistake</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: Failing to verify the property&rsquo;s legal title, ownership, and RERA compliance.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 36.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l24 level1 lfo41; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">How to Avoid</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">:</span></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l24 level2 lfo41; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Ensure the property has <strong>clear legal title</strong> and is <strong>RERA-registered</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l24 level2 lfo41; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Confirm approvals and documents for construction, land use, and ownership (e.g., <strong>No Objection Certificates (NOC)</strong>).</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l24 level2 lfo41; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Avoid properties with <strong>pending legal disputes</strong>.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">6. Failing to Plan for Liquidity</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo42; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Mistake</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: Real estate is not a liquid asset. Many investors neglect to have an exit strategy in case of an emergency or sudden need for cash.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo42; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">How to Avoid</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">:</span></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l8 level2 lfo42; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Diversify your investments (e.g., consider <strong>liquid assets like stocks or bonds</strong>).</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l8 level2 lfo42; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Set a clear exit strategy</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\"> and timeframe for resale or rent.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">7. Not Having a Long-Term Vision</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l42 level1 lfo43; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Mistake</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: Real estate investments require patience, but some investors may expect immediate returns or decide to sell too quickly when returns don&rsquo;t meet short-term expectations.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l42 level1 lfo43; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">How to Avoid</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">:</span></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l42 level2 lfo43; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Have a clear <strong>investment horizon</strong> (5&ndash;10 years) and a focus on <strong>long-term capital appreciation</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; 