AAACEA1IaPM7ACAADaBQAAHwAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\r\nAAAgAgAAY2xpcGJvYXJkL2RyYXdpbmdzL2RyYXdpbmcxLnhtbFBLAQItABQABgAIAAAAIQCSfYfg\r\nHQcAAEkgAAAaAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA0FAABjbGlwYm9hcmQvdGhlbWUvdGhlbWUxLnhtbFBLAQIt\r\nABQABgAIAAAAIQCcZkZBuwAAACQBAAAqAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGIMAABjbGlwYm9hcmQvZHJhd2lu\r\nZ3MvX3JlbHMvZHJhd2luZzEueG1sLnJlbHNQSwUGAAAAAAUABQBnAQAAZQ0AAAAA\r\n\" filled=\"f\">\r\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" rotation=\"t\" aspectratio=\"t\" verticies=\"t\" text=\"t\"\r\n  shapetype=\"t\"/>\r\n <w:wrap type=\"none\"/>\r\n <w:anchorlock/>\r\n</v:rect><![endif]--><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><v:shape\r\n id=\"_x0000_i1053\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style=\'width:451.3pt;height:.1pt\'>\r\n <v:imagedata croptop=\"-65520f\" cropbottom=\"65520f\"/>\r\n</v:shape><span style=\'mso-element:field-end\'></span><![endif]--></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Sector 113: Prime Location for Residential and Commercial Development</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Sector 113 is the first sector on the Dwarka Expressway after crossing into Haryana, making it a highly sought-after location for real estate development. Its proximity to Delhi and the airport adds to its appeal for both homebuyers and investors.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Residential Developments:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l16 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">M3M Capital</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: An ultra-luxury project offering 2.5 to 4.5 BHK apartments with amenities like a 9-hole golf course, 75,000 sq. ft. clubhouse, and ample green spaces.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l16 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Smart World Sector 113</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: Features 2 and 3 BHK luxury apartments with modern amenities, catering to the growing demand for quality housing in the area.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l16 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">M3M Mansion</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: Offers 3.5 and 4.5 BHK Luxury Apartments with sizes ranging from approximately 2,080 to 3,000 square feet. The residences are designed to provide a blend of modern architecture and serene green spaces, redefining high-end urban living.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Commercial Developments:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">M3M SCO 113 Market</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: A commercial project featuring retail spaces designed to cater to the needs of the growing residential community in Sector 113.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Infrastructure and Connectivity:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">The sector boasts well-developed infrastructure, including renowned schools like Presidium and Mount Carmel, hospitals such as Sheetla Mata Trust and Fortis, and upcoming malls and office buildings within walking distance. The presence of a metro station at Sector 25 further enhances connectivity, making Sector 113 a convenient location for residents and businesses alike . </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-element:field-begin;mso-field-lock:yes\'></span><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>SHAPE <span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>\\* MERGEFORMAT <span style=\'mso-element:field-separator\'></span><![endif]--><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:rect\r\n id=\"Horizontal_x0020_Line_x0020_3\" o:spid=\"_x0000_s1053\" style=\'width:451.3pt;\r\n height:.1pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square;mso-left-percent:-10001;\r\n mso-top-percent:-10001;mso-position-horizontal:absolute;\r\n mso-position-horizontal-relative:char;mso-position-vertical:absolute;\r\n mso-position-vertical-relative:line;mso-left-percent:-10001;mso-top-percent:-10001;\r\n v-text-anchor:top\' o:gfxdata=\"UEsDBBQABgAIAAAAIQC75UiUBQEAAB4CAAATAAAAW0NvbnRlbnRfVHlwZXNdLnhtbKSRvU7DMBSF\r\ndyTewfKKEqcMCKEmHfgZgaE8wMW+SSwc27JvS/v23KTJgkoXFsu+P+c7Ol5vDoMTe0zZBl/LVVlJ\r\ngV4HY31Xy4/tS3EvRSbwBlzwWMsjZrlprq/W22PELHjb51r2RPFBqax7HCCXIaLnThvSAMTP1KkI\r\n+gs6VLdVdad08ISeCho1ZLN+whZ2jsTzgcsnJwldluLxNDiyagkxOquB2Knae/OLUsyEkjenmdzb\r\nmG/YhlRnCWPnb8C898bRJGtQvEOiVxjYhtLOxs8AySiT4JuDystlVV4WPeM6tK3VaILeDZxIOSsu\r\nti/jidNGNZ3/J08yC1dNv9v8AAAA//8DAFBLAwQUAAYACAAAACEArTA/8cEAAAAyAQAACwAAAF9y\r\nZWxzLy5yZWxzhI/NCsIwEITvgu8Q9m7TehCRpr2I4FX0AdZk2wbbJGTj39ubi6AgeJtl2G9m6vYx\r\njeJGka13CqqiBEFOe2Ndr+B03C3WIDihMzh6RwqexNA281l9oBFTfuLBBhaZ4ljBkFLYSMl6oAm5\r\n8IFcdjofJ0z5jL0MqC/Yk1yW5UrGTwY0X0yxNwri3lQgjs+Qk/+zfddZTVuvrxO59CNCmoj3vCwj\r\nMfaUFOjRhrPHaN4Wv0VV5OYgm1p+LW1eAAAA//8DAFBLAwQUAAYACAAAACEAhDnhCLECAADaBQAA\r\nHwAAAGNsaXBib2FyZC9kcmF3aW5ncy9kcmF3aW5nMS54bWykVFFP2zAQfp+0/2D5HdKk7UojAoKu\r\nsElsVJRpz9fETaw5tme7acuv5+ykNLBpD6yRUp/vvi933519frmrBWmYsVzJjManA0qYzFXBZZnR\r\nH483J2eUWAeyAKEky+ieWXp58fHDOaSlAV3xnCCDtClktHJOp1Fk84rVYE+