JOCxAgAA2QUAAB8AAAAAAAAAAAAA\r\nAAAAIAIAAGNsaXBib2FyZC9kcmF3aW5ncy9kcmF3aW5nMS54bWxQSwECLQAUAAYACAAAACEAkn2H\r\n4B0HAABJIAAAGgAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAOBQAAY2xpcGJvYXJkL3RoZW1lL3RoZW1lMS54bWxQSwEC\r\nLQAUAAYACAAAACEAnGZGQbsAAAAkAQAAKgAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABjDAAAY2xpcGJvYXJkL2RyYXdp\r\nbmdzL19yZWxzL2RyYXdpbmcxLnhtbC5yZWxzUEsFBgAAAAAFAAUAZwEAAGYNAAAAAA==\r\n\" filled=\"f\">\r\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" rotation=\"t\" aspectratio=\"t\" verticies=\"t\" text=\"t\"\r\n  shapetype=\"t\"/>\r\n <w:wrap type=\"none\"/>\r\n <w:anchorlock/>\r\n</v:rect><![endif]--><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><v:shape\r\n id=\"_x0000_i1049\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style=\'width:451.3pt;height:.1pt\'>\r\n <v:imagedata croptop=\"-65520f\" cropbottom=\"65520f\"/>\r\n</v:shape><span style=\'mso-element:field-end\'></span><![endif]--></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1588\">Types of ROI in Real Estate</h3>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 6144px; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; width: 50.4913%;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6144\" cellpadding=\"0\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"2237\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1697\">\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1697\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; width: 34.0269%;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Type</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; width: 65.9731%;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Description</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\" data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1913\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; width: 34.0269%;\" data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1834\" data-col-size=\"sm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1831\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Cash-on-Cash Return</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; width: 65.9731%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1913\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Compares annual cash flow to the cash invested. Ideal for leveraged deals.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"2021\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; width: 34.0269%;\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1942\" data-col-size=\"sm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1932\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Rental Yield</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; width: 65.9731%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2021\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Measures annual rental income relative to property value.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2129\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; width: 34.0269%;\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2050\" data-col-size=\"sm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2036\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Cap Rate</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; width: 65.9731%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2129\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Evaluates property income vs value, especially for commercial real estate.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2237\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; width: 34.0269%;\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2158\" data-col-size=\"sm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2152\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Appreciation ROI</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; width: 65.9731%;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2237\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Focuses on the increase in property value over time.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-element:field-begin;mso-field-lock:yes\'><button class=\"bg-token-bg-primary hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-md-heavy\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 