cmVscy8ucmVsc1BLAQItABQABgAIAAAAIQDQMg99sgIAANsFAAAfAAAAAAAAAAAA\r\nAAAAACACAABjbGlwYm9hcmQvZHJhd2luZ3MvZHJhd2luZzEueG1sUEsBAi0AFAAGAAgAAAAhAJJ9\r\nh+AdBwAASSAAABoAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADwUAAGNsaXBib2FyZC90aGVtZS90aGVtZTEueG1sUEsB\r\nAi0AFAAGAAgAAAAhAJxmRkG7AAAAJAEAACoAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAZAwAAGNsaXBib2FyZC9kcmF3\r\naW5ncy9fcmVscy9kcmF3aW5nMS54bWwucmVsc1BLBQYAAAAABQAFAGcBAABnDQAAAAA=\r\n\" filled=\"f\">\r\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" rotation=\"t\" aspectratio=\"t\" verticies=\"t\" text=\"t\"\r\n  shapetype=\"t\"/>\r\n <w:wrap type=\"none\"/>\r\n <w:anchorlock/>\r\n</v:rect><![endif]--><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><v:shape\r\n id=\"_x0000_i1048\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style=\'width:451.3pt;height:.1pt\'>\r\n <v:imagedata croptop=\"-65520f\" cropbottom=\"65520f\"/>\r\n</v:shape><span style=\'mso-element:field-end\'></span><![endif]--></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2268\">How to Improve ROI</h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l20 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2349\"><strong data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2298\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Buy Below Market Value</span></strong>: Increases potential gain when market value rises.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l20 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2441\"><strong data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2365\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Add Value</span></strong>: Renovations, better tenants, or upgrades can raise rents and resale price.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l20 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2532\"><strong data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2462\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Optimize Costs</span></strong>: Efficient property management reduces maintenance and vacancy costs.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l20 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2626\"><strong data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2547\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Leverage</span></strong>: Using borrowed funds strategically can enhance ROI, though it increases risk.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-element:field-begin;mso-field-lock:yes\'></span><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>SHAPE <span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>\\* MERGEFORMAT <span style=\'mso-element:field-separator\'></span><![endif]--><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:rect\r\n id=\"Horizontal_x0020_Line_x0020_11\" o:spid=\"_x0000_s1048\" style=\'width:451.3pt;\r\n height:.1pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square;mso-left-percent:-10001;\r\n mso-top-percent:-10001;mso-position-horizontal:absolute;\r\n mso-position-horizontal-relative:char;mso-position-vertical:absolute;\r\n mso-position-vertical-relative:line;mso-left-percent:-10001;mso-top-percent:-10001;\r\n v-text-anchor:top\' o:gfxdata=\"UEsDBBQABgAIAAAAIQC75UiUBQEAAB4CAAATAAAAW0NvbnRlbnRfVHlwZXNdLnhtbKSRvU7DMBSF\r\ndyTewfKKEqcMCKEmHfgZgaE