unity, risk, and financial strategy in real estate. Whether you&rsquo;re a first-time investor or building a portfolio, understanding and maximizing ROI is key to long-term success.</p>\r\n<h3>Key Features of M3M Capital Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"225\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Expansive Green Spaces</span></strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"499\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l32 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"289\"><strong data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"250\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">9-Hole Golf Course</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Integrated within the community, offering a serene and recreational environment.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l32 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"355\"><strong data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"314\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Central Green Area</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Spanning 8 to 9 acres, providing ample open space for residents.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l32 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"499\"><strong data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"379\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Lush Surroundings</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">The project is enveloped by a 500-acre green belt, ensuring a pollution-free and tranquil setting.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"533\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Architectural Excellence</span></strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"840\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l36 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"597\"><strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"556\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">High-Rise Towers</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">G+36 structures designed for panoramic views and optimal natural light.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l36 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"667\"><strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"626\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">3-Side Open Apartments</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Ensuring cross-ventilation and unobstructed vistas of Delhi greens and central greens.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l36 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"840\"><strong data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"720\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Air-Conditioned Double-Height Entrance Lobbies</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Adding to the grandeur and luxury feel.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"876\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Security &amp; Infrastructure</span></strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1163\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l38 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"946\"><strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"905\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">7-Tier Security System</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Including CCTV surveillance for enhanced safety.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l38 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"1014\"><strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"973\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">High-Speed Elevators</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">With additional service lifts for convenience.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l38 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1163\"><strong data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1043\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Ample Basement Parking</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Ensuring sufficient space for residents and visitors.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1194\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Premium Amenities</span></strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l12 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1266\"><strong data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1225\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">75,000 Sq. Ft. Clubhouse</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Equipped with a food court, gymnasium, yoga and meditation hall, and more.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l12 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1336\"><strong data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1295\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Outdoor Sports Complex</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Featuring badminton, lawn tennis, and basketball courts.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l12 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1399\"><strong data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1358\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Kids\' Play Area</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Designed to cater to the younger residents.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l12 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1548\"><strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1428\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Infinity Swimming Pool</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Providing a luxurious recreational experience.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1577\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Residential Options</span></strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1840\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l17 level1 lfo14; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1635\"><strong data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1594\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Unit Types</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">2.5 BHK, 3.5 BHK, and 4.5 BHK apartments.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l17 level1 lfo14; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1693\"><strong data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1652\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Area Range</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">From 1,310 sq. ft. to 2,298 sq. ft., catering to various family sizes and preferences.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l17 level1 lfo14; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1840\"><strong data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1720\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Semi-Furnished Homes</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Equipped with branded modular kitchens, hob, and chimney.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-element:field-begin;mso-field-lock:yes\'></span><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>SHAPE <span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>\\* MERGEFORMAT <span style=\'mso-element:field-separator\'></span><![endif]--><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:rect\r\n id=\"Horizontal_x0020_Line_x0020_17\" o:spid=\"_x0000_s1047\" style=\'width:451.3pt;\r\n height:.1pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square;mso-left-percent:-10001;\r\n mso-top-percent:-10001;mso-position-horizontal:absolute;\r\n mso-position-horizontal-relative:char;mso-position-vertical:absolute;\r\n mso-position-vertical-relative:line;mso-left-percent:-10001;mso-top-percent:-10001;\r\n v-text-anchor:top\' o:gfxdata=\"UEsDBBQABgAIAAAAIQC75UiUBQEAAB4CAAATAAAAW0NvbnRlbnRfVHlwZXNdLnhtbKSRvU7DMBSF\r\ndyTewfKKEqcMCKEmHfgZgaE8wMW+SSwc27JvS/v23KTJgkoXFsu+P+c7Ol5vDoMTe0zZBl/LVVlJ\r\ngV4HY31Xy4/tS3EvRSbwBlzwWMsjZrlprq/W22PELHjb51r2RPFBqax7HCCXIaLnThvSAMTP1KkI\r\n+gs6VLdVdad08ISeCho1ZLN+whZ2jsTzgcsnJwldluLxNDiyagkxOquB2Knae/OLUsyEkjenmdzb\r\nmG/YhlRnCWPnb8C898bRJGtQvEOiVxjYhtLOxs8AySiT4JuDystlVV4WPeM6tK3VaILeDZxIOSsu\r\nti/jidNGNZ3/J08yC1dNv9v8AAAA//8DAFBLAwQUAAYACAAAACEArTA/8cEAAAAyAQAACwAAAF9y\r\nZWxzLy5yZWxzhI/NCsIwEITvgu8Q9m7TehCRpr2I4FX0AdZk2wbbJGTj39ubi6AgeJtl2G9m6vYx\r\njeJGka13CqqiBEFOe2Ndr+B03C3WIDihMzh6RwqexNA281l9oBFTfuLBBhaZ4ljBkFLYSMl6oAm5\r\n8IFcdjofJ0z5jL0MqC/Yk1yW5UrGTwY0X0yxNwri3lQgjs+Qk/+zfddZTVuvrxO59CNCmoj3vCwj\r\nMfaUFOjRhrPHaN4Wv0VV5OYgm1p+LW1eAAAA//8DAFBLAwQUAAYACAAAACEAk9bSZ7ICAADaBQAA\r\nHwAAAGNsaXBib2