ning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Dwarka Expressway Completion</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: The completion of the Dwarka Expressway has significantly improved connectivity between Delhi and Gurgaon, making sectors along the expressway highly desirable for both residential and commercial developments. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo18; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Metro Expansion</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: Gurgaon is set to benefit from the Delhi-Alwar Regional Rapid Transit System (RRTS) and the extension of metro services, enhancing connectivity and accessibility across the city. </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-element:field-begin;mso-field-lock:yes\'></span><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>SHAPE <span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>\\* MERGEFORMAT <span style=\'mso-element:field-separator\'></span><![endif]--><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:rect\r\n id=\"Horizontal_x0020_Line_x0020_24\" o:spid=\"_x0000_s1044\" style=\'width:451.3pt;\r\n height:.1pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square;mso-left-percent:-10001;\r\n mso-top-percent:-10001;mso-position-horizontal:absolute;\r\n mso-position-horizontal-relative:char;mso-position-vertical:absolute;\r\n mso-position-vertical-relative:line;mso-left-percent:-10001;mso-top-percent:-10001;\r\n v-text-anc