3.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Emerging Trends</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l23 level1 lfo19; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Integrated Townships</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: Developments combining residential, commercial, retail, and recreational facilities are gaining popularity, offering a \"live-work-play\" environment that appeals to modern buyers.</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l23 level1 lfo19; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Affordable Housing</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: Areas like Sohna and New Gurgaon are witnessing growth in affordable housing projects, supported by government initiatives and favorable loan interest rates, making homeownership more accessible.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-element:field-begin;mso-field-lock:yes\'></span><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>SHAPE <span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>\\* MER