</span><![endif]--></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"190\"><strong>Investor Testimonials for M3M Capital Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"237\"><strong data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"237\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri Light\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">1. Roushan Kumar &ndash; Real Estate Agent</span></strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"402\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l24 level1 lfo25; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"255\"><strong data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"250\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Rating</span></strong>: 5/5</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l24 level1 lfo25; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"309\"><strong data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"270\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Feedback</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">\"Centrally Located with Good Connectivity\"</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"322\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri Light\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">2. Himanshu Sangwan &ndash; Investor</span></strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"592\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l15 level1 lfo26; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"499\"><strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"458\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Feedback</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">\"One of the best townships in India. After seeing the new launch projects by M3M in recent years and their construction status, no one can deny the fact that M3M is the king in Gurgaon real estate.\"</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"512\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri Light\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">3. Sunny &ndash; Investor</span></strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"771\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo27; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"678\"><strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"637\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Feedback</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">\"Perfect place to invest in Gurgaon. This is the best project for Delhi and Gurgaon residents as it is in the middle of both and in the center of Delhi NCR.\"</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"771\"><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-element:field-begin;mso-field-lock:yes\'></span><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>SHA