tratio=\"t\" verticies=\"t\" text=\"t\"\r\n  shapetype=\"t\"/>\r\n <w:wrap type=\"none\"/>\r\n <w:anchorlock/>\r\n</v:rect><![endif]--><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><v:shape\r\n id=\"_x0000_i1038\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style=\'width:451.3pt;height:.1pt\'>\r\n <v:imagedata croptop=\"-65520f\" cropbottom=\"65520f\"/>\r\n</v:shape><span style=\'mso-element:field-end\'></span><![endif]--></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"812\"><strong>Location &amp; Connectivity</strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"853\"><span class=\"relative\">Sector 113 is strategically located along the Dwarka Expressway, offering:</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"1114\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l33 level1 lfo28; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"895\"><span class=\"relative\">Proximity to </span><strong data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"34\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Delhi and Gurgaon</span></strong><span class=\"relative\">&nbsp;enhances accessibility.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l33 level1 lfo28; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"937\"><span class=\"relative\">Easy access to </span><strong data-start=\"15\" data-end=\"54\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Indira Gandhi International Airport</span></strong><span class=\"relative\">.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l33 level1 lfo28; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"979\"><span class=\"relative\">Nearby </span><strong data-start=\"7\" data-end=\"26\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">reputed schools</span></strong><span class=\"relative\"> and </span><strong data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"44\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">hospitals</span></strong><span class=\"relative\">, such as Delhi Public School and Medanta.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l33 level1 lfo28; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1021\"><span class=\"relative\">Connectivity to major commercial hubs like </span><strong data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"57\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Cyber City</span></strong><span class=\"relative\"> and </span><strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"77\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Udyog Vihar</span></strong><span class=\"relative\">.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-element:field-begin;mso-field-lock:yes\'></span><span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>SHAPE <span\r\nstyle=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> </span>\\* MERGEFORMAT <span style=\'mso-element:field-separator\'></span><![endif]--><