argin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Residential &amp; Commercial Real Estate</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo32; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Diverse Offerings</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: M3M Capital provides a range of residential options, including 2.5, 3.5, and 4.5 BHK apartments, catering to various buyer segments. The project also features a <strong>9-hole golf course</strong> and a <strong>75,000 sq. ft. clubhouse</strong>, enhancing its appeal.</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo32; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Commercial Prospects</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">: The development of <strong>M3M Capital Walk</strong> introduces retail shops and office spaces, capitalizing on the growing demand for commercial properties in the region. </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><s