5\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style=\'width:451.3pt;height:.1pt\'>\r\n <v:imagedata croptop=\"-65520f\" cropbottom=\"65520f\"/>\r\n</v:shape><span style=\'mso-element:field-end\'></span><![endif]--></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Final Word</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Whether you\'re a <strong>homebuyer seeking a premium lifestyle</strong> or an <strong>investor eyeing solid returns</strong>, <strong>M3M Capital ticks all the boxes</strong>&mdash;location, luxury, liquidity, and long-term growth.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Apple Color Emoji\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Apple Color Emoji\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">👉</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\"> <strong>M3M Capital is not just a property&mdash;it\'s a future-proof investment.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', 'ROI M3M Capital', 'The Impressive ROI of M3M Capital in Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon', 'ROI of M3M, Capital, Sector 113, M3M Capital ROI, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech', 'Nestled in the rapidly evolving landscape of Gurgaon, M3M Capital in Sector 113 stands as a beacon of investment potential. As the Dwarka Expressway continues to redefine connectivity and convenience, this premium development offers not only luxurious living but also an impressive return on investment (ROI) that captivates both seasoned investors and homebuyers alike. The area\'s strategic location, complemented by world-class amenities, makes M3M Capital more than just a residence; it’s an opportunity for financial growth. In today’s competitive real estate market, understanding the dynamics behind such lucrative ROI is essential for anyone looking to make informed decisions. Join us as we explore the compelling reasons why M3M Capital could be your next strategic investment in Gurgaon, and how it promises to elevate your lifestyle while securing your financial future.', 'A2P Realtech', 0, 1, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `offer` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `des1`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `by_blog`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(72, 'The ROI Potential of Shapoorji Pallonji Joyville in Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '160525113303ROI-SHAPOORJI-PALLONJI-JOYVILLE-SEC-102.jpg', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">As the real estate landscape in Gurgaon continues to evolve, one project stands out for its remarkable investment potential&mdash;Shapoorji Pallonji Joyville in Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">This emerging neighborhood is not just about exquisite living spaces; it\'s also about seizing opportunities that promise impressive returns on investment. Designed with a forward-thinking approach, Joyville embodies a modern lifestyle combined with thoughtful amenities and community-centric planning. Investors are increasingly drawn to this dynamic locale, thanks to its strategic connectivity and the promise of robust infrastructural development.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">With ongoing projects further enhancing accessibility and demand, Shapoorji Pallonji Joyville provides a golden opportunity for those looking to make a savvy investment. Explore how this project can maximize your financial growth while offering a luxurious lifestyle that is hard to resist. Discover the ROI potential that makes Joyville the go-to choice for discerning investors seeking both elegance and value.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 9.1pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Geomanist\',\'serif\';\">The ROI Potential of Shapoorji Pallonji Joyville in Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Investing in Shapoorji Pallonji Joyville in Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, offers promising returns, driven by strategic location, robust infrastructure, and strong market demand.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Joyville is situated in Sector 102, Gurgaon, near the Dwarka Expressway, which provides seamless connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, NH-8, and Sohna Road. The area is well-connected to major commercial hubs like Cyber City and MG Road, enhancing its appeal for professionals and families. Additionally, the upcoming metro station and existing transportation options further bolster its accessibility. </span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Real Estate Appreciation</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">The average price per square foot in Sector 102 has seen a significant increase of 31.31% over the past year, reaching ₹13,390. This growth reflects the area\'s rising desirability and infrastructure development. Specifically, Shapoorji Pallonji Joyville has experienced a 5.01% appreciation in the last year, with current rates around ₹15,800 per sq.ft., indicating strong demand and investor confidence. </span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Project Highlights</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l25 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Configurations</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: 2, 3, and 4 BHK apartments</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l25 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Size Range</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: 915 to 2,160 sq.ft.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l25 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Amenities</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: 24,000 sq.ft. clubhouse, multiple parks, smart home features, and high-speed internet connectivity </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Nearby Infrastructure &amp; Amenities</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">The locality boasts excellent educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and retail centers. Schools like Global Heights and Imperial Heritage School are within a few kilometers, while hospitals such as Medanta and Manipal Hospital are easily accessible. Shopping malls like Satya The Hive and Raheja Mall cater to residents\' retail needs. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 9.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: \'Geomanist\',\'serif\';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 9.1pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Geomanist\',\'serif\';\">Overview of Sector 102 and Dwarka Expressway</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Sector 102, located along the Dwarka Expressway in Gurgaon, is rapidly transforming into a prime residential and commercial hub. The completion of the Dwarka Expressway has significantly enhanced connectivity and infrastructure in the area, making it an attractive destination for homebuyers and investors.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Dwarka Expressway: A Game-Changer for Connectivity</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">The Dwarka Expressway, also known as NH 248-BB, is a 29 km elevated, 8-lane expressway connecting Shiv Murti in Delhi to Kherki Daula Toll Plaza in Gurgaon. This strategic corridor aims to alleviate congestion on NH-48 and provide seamless connectivity between Delhi, Gurgaon, and </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">The expressway features modern infrastructure, including tunnels, underpasses, and flyovers, and is expected to reduce travel time significantly between Delhi and Gurgaon. Its completion is anticipated to boost property values in adjacent sectors by up to 40% . </span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Sector 102: Strategic Location and Development</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Sector 102 is strategically situated along the Dwarka Expressway, offering easy access to key areas such as the Indira Gandhi International Airport, Dwarka, and major commercial hubs in Gurgaon. Its central location makes it an ideal choice for professionals and families seeking connectivity and convenience.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">The sector has witnessed a surge in real estate development, with numerous residential and commercial projects underway. Developers are attracted to the area due to its proximity to the expressway and the anticipated increase in demand for housing and commercial spaces. </span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Real Estate Trends and Investment Potential</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">The completion of the Dwarka Expressway has spurred significant interest in Sector 102, leading to a rise in property prices and rental yields. According to a report by PropEquity, the average price of new projects along the expressway reached ₹17,357 per sq.ft. in July 2024, reflecting a 101% increase from July 2021 . </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Investors are particularly drawn to the sector\'s potential for capital appreciation and rental income, driven by the enhanced connectivity and ongoing infrastructural developments. The presence of quality educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and retail centers further adds to the sector\'s appeal.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Commercial and Social Infrastructure</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Sector 102 is evolving into a well-rounded community with a mix of residential, commercial, and social infrastructure. The sector is home to several schools, hospitals, and shopping centers, providing residents with essential amenities within proximity. The development of commercial spaces is also on the rise, catering to the growing demand from businesses seeking office spaces along the expressway.</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3; box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; outline: none; vertical-align: initial; word-break: break-word; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Understanding ROI in Real Estate Investments</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Return on Investment (ROI)</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> in real estate measures the efficiency or profitability of an investment property. It helps investors evaluate how well a property is performing relative to the cost incurred in acquiring and maintaining it.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">How to Calculate ROI in Real Estate</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">The most basic ROI formula:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">ROI = (Net Profit / Total Investment) &times; 100</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Where:</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l19 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Net Profit</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> = Rental Income (or Sale Proceeds) &minus; Operating Costs &minus; Purchase Cost</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l19 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Total Investment</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> = Purchase Price + Renovation + Legal Fees + Other Costs</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Example: ROI from Rental Income</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Let&rsquo;s say you:</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Buy a flat for ₹1.5 Cr</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Spend ₹5 lakh on furnishing and closing costs</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Rent it out for ₹45,000/month = ₹5.4 lakh/year</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Annual maintenance and property tax = ₹1.2 lakh</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Net Income = ₹5.4 lakh &minus; ₹1.2 lakh = ₹4.2 lakh/year</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><br><strong>Total Investment = ₹1.55 Cr</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">ROI = (4.2 lakh / 1.55 Cr) &times; 100 &asymp; 2.7% (annual rental ROI)</span></strong></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">ROI from Property Appreciation</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">If you sell the property after 5 years at ₹2 Cr:</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Profit = ₹2 Cr &minus; ₹1.55 Cr = ₹45 lakh</span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Annualized ROI</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> = Use <strong>CAGR</strong> (Compound Annual Growth Rate) formula:</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">CAGR = [(Final Value / Initial Value)^(1/n)] &minus; 1</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">CAGR = [(2 Cr / 1.55 Cr)^(1/5)] &minus; 1 &asymp; 5.2% annually</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Combine this with rental income, and your <strong>total ROI</strong> may exceed <strong>7&ndash;8% annually</strong>, depending on appreciation.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Key Factors Affecting Real Estate ROI</span></strong></h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l28 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Location &amp; Connectivity</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> (e.g., near expressways, airports)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l28 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Property Type &amp; Demand</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> (luxury vs. affordable)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l28 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Rental Yield Potential</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> (monthly returns)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l28 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Capital Appreciation</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> (future sale value)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l28 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Maintenance &amp; Holding Costs</span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l28 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Government Policies</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> (tax benefits, RERA compliance)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l28 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Time Horizon</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> (short-term flipping vs. long-term hold)</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Real Estate ROI Benchmarks in India</span></strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Rental Yields</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> in cities like Gurgaon: ~2&ndash;4% annually</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Capital Appreciation</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: 5&ndash;10% annually in developing corridors (like Dwarka Expressway)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">ROI Strategy Tips for Investors</span></strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l17 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Invest early in emerging locations (e.g., Sector 102 during early Dwarka Expressway development)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l17 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Choose RERA-registered, reputable developers (like Shapoorji Pallonji)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l17 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Consider both <strong>rental yield</strong> and <strong>appreciation potential</strong></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l17 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Monitor <strong>infrastructure updates</strong>, metro lines, and upcoming commercial projects</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l17 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Leverage home loan benefits to boost <strong>leveraged ROI</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 9.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; font-family: \'Geomanist\',\'serif\';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2>Key Features of Shapoorji Pallonji Joyville</h2>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"245\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Sustainable &amp; Green Living</span></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"544\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"393\"><strong data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"275\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Extensive Green Spaces</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Over 3 acres dedicated to central greens and 9 pocket amenity spaces, including three themed floral courts&mdash;Topaz, Coral, and Sapphire&mdash;featuring air-purifying tree species</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"544\"><strong data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"424\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Air Quality Enhancement</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Installation of air purifiers in common areas and selection of tree species that maximize oxygen production, repel dust, and reduce noise pollution.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"579\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Smart &amp; Comfortable Homes</span></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l15 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"729\"><strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"609\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Gigafiber Connectivity</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Homes are powered by JioFiber, offering high-speed internet up to 1 Gbps, HD voice calling, smart TV integration, and advanced gaming platforms.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l15 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"872\"><strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"752\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Climate Control</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Air conditioning units installed in all bedrooms, living, and dining areas, ensuring comfort throughout the year.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l15 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"1015\"><strong data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"895\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Safety Features</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Each apartment is equipped with gas leak detectors, panic alarm buttons, and IP series video door phones for enhanced security.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l15 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1159\"><strong data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1039\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Vastu Compliance</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">The design adheres to Vastu principles, promoting positive energy flow within the living spaces.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1190\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">World-Class Amenities</span></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1768\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l26 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1327\"><strong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1207\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Clubhouse</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">A 24,000 sq. ft. clubhouse offering a swimming pool, gymnasium, mini theatre, cafeteria, and more.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l26 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1472\"><strong data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1352\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Sports Facilities</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Amenities include a tennis court, jogging track, yoga deck, and multi-utility games area.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l26 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1621\"><strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1501\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Children\'s Play Areas</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Dedicated spaces such as a kids\' play area and tot lot area ensure safe recreation for young residents.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l26 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1768\"><strong data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1648\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Additional Features</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Facilities like valet car parking, amphitheater, skating rink, and BBQ area enhance the community experience.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1811\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">Construction &amp; Design Excellence</span></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"2248\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1955\"><strong data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1835\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Mivan Technology</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative\">Utilization of Mivan technology in construction ensures durability and precision in building structures.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto;