in every unit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2391\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2391\">3-tier <strong data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2391\">security &amp; access control</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2434\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2434\"><strong data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2416\">Landscaped podiums</strong> with water bodies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2492\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2492\"><strong data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2492\">EV Charging Stations &amp; Green Building Certification</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2539\"><strong data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2539\">Why Invest with A2P Realtech?</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2600\">As a trusted real estate advisory, <strong data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2592\">A2P Realtech</strong> offers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2658\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2658\">Verified property listings with <strong data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2658\">zero hidden charges</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2706\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2706\">Personalized <strong data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2689\">site visits</strong> and consultation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2749\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2749\"><strong data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2749\">Negotiated prices &amp; exclusive offers</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2786\">Full <strong data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2786\">legal and loan assistance</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2791\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2829\"><strong data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2829\">Book Your Dream Home Today</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"3016\">Whether you\'re a luxury seeker or a long-term investor, <strong data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2917\">The Palatial by Hero Homes</strong> is a rare opportunity to own a home that&rsquo;s more than just four walls &mdash; it&rsquo;s a lifestyle statement.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3094\">👉 <strong data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3045\">Contact A2P Realtech</strong> for pricing, floor plans, and a free site visit:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3176\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3127\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3127\">📲 Mail: team@a2prealtech.com</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3153\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3153\">🌐 Visit: <a href=\"../\">https://a2prealtech.com/</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3176\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3176\">📍 Office: S-3 2nd floor Malik plaza plot No -5 sector 4 Dwarka New Delhi 110078</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'The Palatial by Hero Homes Price, Location & Features | A2P Realtech', 'The Palatial by Hero Homes in Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram – Price, Location & Features | A2P Realtech', 'Price, The Palatial by Hero Homes, Dwarka Expressway, Sector 104, Gurgaon, A2P Realtech', 'Looking to invest in ultra-luxury real estate in Gurugram? The Palatial by Hero Homes in Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, is redefining elite living with its cutting-edge design, premium amenities, and unmatched connectivity. Curated for high-end buyers and investors alike, this project is making waves in NCR\'s luxury property segment — and A2P Realtech brings you the full breakdown.', 'A2P Realtech', 0, 1, NULL, NULL),
(88, 'Live Like Royalty Explore The Palatial by Hero Homes with A2P Realtech', '220725073558Live-Like-Royalty-The-Palatial-by_hero_homes (1).jpg', '<h1 data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"337\"><strong data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"337\">Live Like Royalty: Explore The Palatial by Hero Homes with A2P Realtech</strong></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"792\">Imagine waking up every day in a home that feels like a five-star resort &mdash; spacious, intelligent, elegant, and utterly private. Welcome to <strong data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"508\">The Palatial by Hero Homes</strong>, where luxury isn&rsquo;t just a feature &mdash; it&rsquo;s a lifestyle. Strategically located in <strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"632\">Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram</strong>, this premium development offers a rare blend of regal design, cutting-edge amenities, and world-class living &mdash; exclusively brought to you by <strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"791\">A2P Realtech</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"845\"><strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"845\">An Address That Reflects Your Status</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"1056\">The name &ldquo;Palatial&rdquo; says it all. Hero Homes has gone beyond conventional luxury by creating an environment fit for modern royalty &mdash; homes where aesthetics meet function, and every detail is crafted to impress.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1220\">Whether you&rsquo;re looking for a serene family home or an elite investment opportunity, <strong data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1219\">The Palatial is a standout option in Gurugram\'s luxury real estate market</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1225\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1287\"><strong data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1287\">Unbeatable Location: Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1396\">Situated in one of the most rapidly growing corridors of NCR, The Palatial offers seamless connectivity to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1588\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1437\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1437\"><strong data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1414\">IGI Airport</strong> &ndash; Just 20 minutes away</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1471\"><strong data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1471\">Delhi via Dwarka Expressway</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1532\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1532\"><strong data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1502\">Gurugram&rsquo;s business hubs</strong> like Cyber City &amp; Udyog Vihar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1588\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1588\">Top-tier schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and more</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1726\">This location is poised to benefit tremendously from upcoming infrastructure projects, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1731\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1767\"><strong data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1767\">Configurations &amp; Pricing</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1854\">Choose from expansive 3.5 BHK, and 4.5 BHK residences designed with modern luxury in mind.</p>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 27.8912%; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1922\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1922\">\r\n<th style=\"width: 43.2065%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1872\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1871\">Unit Type</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 51.9022%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1894\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1889\">Carpet Area</strong></th>\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.8913%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2061\">\r\n<th style=\"width: 43.2065%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1708\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1707\">Configuration</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 51.9022%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1736\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1735\">Carpet Area (Approx.)</strong></th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 4.8913%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1758\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2130\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 43.2065%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3.5 BHK Apartment</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.9022%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>2833 Sq. Ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.8913%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1909\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 43.2065%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>4.5 BHK Apartment</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 51.9022%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3457 Sq. Ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.8913%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2286\"><em data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2286\">Prices subject to change. Contact A2P Realtech for current availability and offers.</em></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2291\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2327\"><strong data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2327\">Palatial-Grade Amenities</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2408\">At The Palatial, amenities aren\'t just add-ons &mdash; they&rsquo;re signature experiences.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2661\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2447\">Grand Clubhouse with Rooftop Lounge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2478\">Infinity Pool &amp; Jacuzzi Area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2501\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2501\">Private Mini-Theatre</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2525\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2525\">Smart Home Automation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2565\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2565\">High-Speed Elevators &amp; Concierge Desk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2604\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2604\">Multi-tier Security &amp; Access Control</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2661\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2661\">Meditation Zones, Kids Play Area, and EV Charging Bays</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2666\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2725\"><strong data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2725\">Why Choose A2P Realtech as Your Realty Partner?</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2922\">As Gurugram\'s trusted real estate advisory, <strong data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2787\">A2P Realtech</strong> offers more than just property listings &mdash; we deliver <strong data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2863\">tailored solutions</strong>, full transparency, and <strong data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2910\">end-to-end service</strong>, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"3087\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2950\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2950\">Personalized site visits</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2978\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2978\">Loan and legal assistance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3038\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3038\">Builder-direct pricing (no brokerage on primary bookings)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3087\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3087\">Early access to inventory and pre-launch deals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3092\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3133\"><strong data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3133\">Book a Royal Site Visit Today</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3298\">Don\'t just dream about luxury &mdash; <strong data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3184\">experience it</strong>. Let A2P Realtech take you inside <strong data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3249\">The Palatial by Hero Homes</strong>, where your next chapter in elite living begins.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3447\">👉 <strong data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3337\">Schedule your private tour now</strong>:<br data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3341\">📲 Mail: [<a href=\"mailto:team@a2prealtech.com\">team@a2prealtech.com</a>&nbsp;<br data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3376\">🌐 Website: <a href=\"https://www.a2prealtech.com\">www.a2prealtech.com</a>&nbsp;<br data-start=\"3408\" data-end=\"3411\">📍 Visit Us: S-3 2nd floor Malik plaza plot No -5 sector 4 Dwarka New Delhi 110078</p>\r\n<div class=\"contact-page__social\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3452\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3505\"><strong data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3505\">&nbsp;Luxury Is Just a Decision Away</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3743\">The Palatial by Hero Homes isn\'t just about owning a home &mdash; it\'s about owning a <strong data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"3607\">legacy of luxury</strong>. With refined architecture, an iconic location, and unmatched amenities, this is your chance to <strong data-start=\"3704\" data-end=\"3725\">live like royalty</strong> every single day.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3745\" data-end=\"3806\"><strong data-start=\"3745\" data-end=\"3806\">Choose A2P Realtech &mdash; your gateway to luxury real estate.</strong></p>', 'Live Like Royalty: Explore The Palatial by Hero Homes with A2P Realtech', 'Live Like Royalty: Explore The Palatial by Hero Homes with A2P Realtech', 'The Palatial by Hero Homes, Dwarka Expressway, Sector 104, Royalty Explore, Live Like Royalty, Gurgaon, ', 'Imagine waking up every day in a home that feels like a five-star resort — spacious, intelligent, elegant, and utterly private. Welcome to The Palatial by Hero Homes, where luxury isn’t just a feature — it’s a lifestyle. Strategically located in Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram, this premium development offers a rare blend of regal design, cutting-edge amenities, and world-class living — exclusively brought to you by A2P Realtech.', 'A2P Realtech', 0, 1, NULL, NULL);
