r;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1574\">₹5.5L&ndash;₹6.25L</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1609\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1594\">Location Edge</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1646\">Entry to Delhi</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1684\">Near Metro/IICC</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1723\">Dense residential catchment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1873\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1758\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1746\">Brand Perception</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1795\">Medium (emerging)</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1834\">Premium</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1873\">High mid-range</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"2021\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1908\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1894\">Leasing Record</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1945\">Claimed 100% success (developer)</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1986\">Proven track record with global brands</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2021\">Active leasing, strong footfall</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2125\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2176\"><strong data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2176\">3. Leasing Strategy: Maximize ROI</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2218\"><strong data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2218\">Three options for income generation:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2363\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2275\"><strong data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2273\">Build &amp; Lease Retail Floor (Ground + Mezzanine)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2363\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2320\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2320\">Restaurants, cafes, salons, boutiques</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2363\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2363\">Expected yield: ₹130&ndash;₹200/sq ft/month</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2488\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2411\"><strong data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2409\">Lease Upper Floors for Offices/Studios</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2488\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2455\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2455\">Coworking, coaching centers, clinics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2488\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2488\">Yield: ₹80&ndash;₹120/sq ft/month</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2530\"><strong data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2528\">Franchise Out to National Brands</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2582\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2582\">Many brands seek plug-and-play units in SCOs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2633\">Reach claims assistance in tenant acquisition</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2665\"><strong data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2663\">Projected Yield Example:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2791\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2715\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2715\">150 sq. yd plot, G+4 (&asymp;6,000 sq. ft built-up)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2767\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2767\">Gross rental @ ₹125/sq ft &rarr; <strong data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2765\">₹7.5 lakh/month</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2791\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2791\">ROI: ~11&ndash;13% annually</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3198\">ROI Summary Over 5 Years (Including Capital Appreciation)</h2>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #c2e0f4; border: 1px solid #000000;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3838\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3279\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3279\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3207\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Year</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3243\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3227\">Reach Buzz 114</strong> &ndash; Est. ROI (%)</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3279\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3262\">Emaar EBD 114</strong> &ndash; Est. ROI (%)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3838\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3438\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3366\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Y1</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3401\">9.5%</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3401\" data-end=\"3438\">10.5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3518\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3446\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Y2</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3481\">10%</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3518\">11%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3519\" data-end=\"3598\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-start=\"3519\" data-end=\"3526\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Y3</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3561\">10.5% + 10% cap gain</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3598\">11.5% + 12% cap gain</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3678\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3606\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Y4</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3606\" data-end=\"3641\">11%</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3678\">12%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3758\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Y5</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3721\">11.5% + 12% cap gain</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3721\" data-end=\"3758\">13% + 14% cap gain</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3838\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-start=\"3759\" data-end=\"3790\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3789\">5-Year Total Est. Return</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3811\">~80&ndash;90% cumulative</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; border-width: 1px;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3838\"><strong data-start=\"3813\" data-end=\"3836\">~95&ndash;110% cumulative</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"79\">About A2P Realtech Dwarka Expressway in Gurgaon</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"238\">\r\n<li data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"159\">\r\n<p data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"159\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P Realtech Pvt. Ltd. is a Delhi&ndash;NCR real-estate channel partner/broker operating since 2015, serving both residential and <strong data-start=\"124\" data-end=\"138\">commercial</strong> properties across Gurgaon, including shops and SCO plots</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"238\">\r\n<p data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"238\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">They specialize in the <strong data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"57\">Dwarka Expressway micro-market</strong> (Sectors 81&ndash;115, New Gurgaon), offering deep local insights and access to developers like DLF, M3M, Sobha, Emaar, Godrej, Hero Homes, Reach Buzz Elan, BPTP and more</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"243\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"289\">How to Book SCO Plots via A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"328\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Here&rsquo;s how the process typically works:</span></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"374\">1. Initial Contact &amp; Project Exploration</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"454\">\r\n<li data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"414\">\r\n<p data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"414\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Reach out to A2P Realtech&mdash;via phone, email, or website&mdash;to express your interest in <strong data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"117\">SCO plots on Dwarka Expressway</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"454\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Specify the plot size, sector (e.g. Sector 114, 95A, 88 A, etc.), budget range and any preferred builders.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"495\">2. Property Shortlisting &amp; Insights</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"616\">\r\n<li data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"535\">\r\n<p data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"535\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P Realtech will provide you with curated options across RERA‑approved developers.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"616\">\r\n<p data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"616\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">You&rsquo;ll receive comparisons of plot sizes, location advantages, layouts, price/sq yd, and payment plans</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"652\">3. Site Visit &amp; Plot Selection</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"736\">\r\n<li data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<p data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"694\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Schedule a <strong data-start=\"11\" data-end=\"41\">site visit or virtual tour</strong>&mdash;if you\'re remote or NRI&mdash;to see the available SCO blocks in person or via 360&deg; walkthroughs.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"736\">\r\n<p data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"736\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Based on layout and footfall potential, choose your preferred plot number and size.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"768\">4. Documentation &amp; Booking</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"894\">\r\n<li data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"810\">\r\n<p data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"810\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Submit KYC docs (Aadhaar or passport, address proof, PAN card, photo, etc.).</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"852\">\r\n<p data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"852\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Sign the booking form and pay the token advance&mdash;typically <strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"72\">₹5&ndash;10 lakh</strong> depending on the project.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"894\">\r\n<p data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"894\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P will share a <strong data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"48\">Booking Confirmation Letter</strong> along with a tentative allotment and payment schedule.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"919\">5. Payment Schedule</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\n<li data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"961\">\r\n<p data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"961\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Choose payment plan: could be <strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"86\">construction-linked, time-linked or subvention-based</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\n<p data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1003\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Make stage-wise payments as per schedule&mdash;ideally aligned with construction milestones.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1038\">6. Sale Agreement &amp; Allotment</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1164\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1080\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1080\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">The formal <strong data-start=\"11\" data-end=\"33\">Agreement for Sale</strong> gets drafted and signed.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1122\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Receipts, plot details &amp; sale terms are documented.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1164\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1164\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">RERA-approved developers and relevant fees (like EDC/IDC, GST) are included per standard norms.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1206\">7. Possession &amp; Post‑Booking Support</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1248\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">On completion, take <strong data-start=\"20\" data-end=\"34\">possession</strong> when final payment is made.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1290\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1290\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P Realtech assists during registration, legal checklist, and handover.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1373\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">They also support interior coordination, leasing advice, resale facilitation, and after‑sale support</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1378\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1408\">Quick Comparison Table</h2>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex 