nd=\"2435\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">They offer <strong data-start=\"11\" data-end=\"38\">official channel access</strong>, not just listings&mdash;this includes pre-launch inventory, special prices, priority allotments and flexible plans</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2518\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2518\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Post-booking support is solid, including legal aid, registration, leasing management, interior coordination, and resale help</span> <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"../blog_detail/best-real-estate-agents-channel-partner-and-brokers-in-dwarka-expressway-gurgaon-haryana.php?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">a2prealtech.com</span></span></span></a></span></span>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2546\">Getting Started</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2587\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">To start the booking process:</span></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2915\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2671\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2671\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"33\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Contact A2P Realtech directly</strong> via phone or email : <a href=\"mailto:team@a2prealtech.com\">team@a2prealtech.com</a> . (Their registered office: S‑3, 2nd Floor Malik Plaza, Sector 4, Dwarka, New Delhi)</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2739\">Share your requirements (sector preferences, plot size, budget).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2865\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2865\">Ask about current incentives, allotted inventory, and builder tie‑ups for SCO projects in sectors like 95A, 114, 88A, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2915\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2915\">Begin with a site visit or virtual video tour.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Dwarka Expressway SCO Plots', 'Book SCO Plots on Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon | A2P Realtech | Best Commercial Investment 2025', 'SCO plots Dwarka Expressway, commercial plots Gurgaon, SCO plots Gurgaon booking, A2P Realtech SCO plots, shop cum office plots Gurgaon, SCO projects sector 114, SCO plots near Delhi border, Emaar EBD 114 plots, Reach Buzz SCO 114, M3M SCO plots Gurgaon, SCO plots for sale Dwarka Expressway, commercial property Gurgaon, invest in SCO plots, best SCO plots Gurgaon, new SCO projects 2025, SCO booking A2P Realtech, retail plots Dwarka Expressway, SCO plots RERA approved, Gurgaon commercial real estate, Dwarka Expressway property investment', 'Explore premium RERA-approved SCO plots on Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon with A2P Realtech. Compare projects like Emaar EBD 114, Reach Buzz 114 & M3M 114 Market. Book your commercial plot now for high returns in 2025.', 'A2P Realtech', 0, 1, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `offer` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `des1`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `by_blog`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(92, 'Top SCO Projects for Sale on Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '300725042158TOP-SCP-PROJECTS-ON-SEC-114-DWARKA-EXPRESSWAY-GURGAON.jpg', '<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Geomanist Book\', \'serif\'; color: black; background: white;\">Top SCO projects on Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">Are you ready to invest in the future of Gurgaon? The Dwarka Expressway, often hailed as the lifeline of the city, is now a hotspot for superior SCO (Shop-Cum-Office) projects that are redefining commercial real estate. With its strategic location and seamless connectivity, this bustling corridor not only promises high footfall but also delivers impressive returns on investment. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: black; background: white;\">Whether you&rsquo;re an aspiring business owner or a seasoned investor, the top SCO projects for sale along the Dwarka Expressway offer a unique opportunity to blend retail and office spaces, maximizing both functionality and revenue. Imagine setting up your business in a thriving area that connects key sectors of the city, where modern infrastructure meets abundant lifestyle amenities. In this article, we will explore some of the finest SCO projects available, guiding you to make informed decisions that can elevate your business potential and financial growth. Dive in and discover the best options tailored for your entrepreneurial ambitions!</span></p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"87\">Sector 114 &mdash; Leading SCO Developments</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"981\"><strong data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"979\">1. Reach Buzz 114 (Reach Buzz 114 SCO Plots)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\n<li data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1064\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A premium commercial development by Reach Group in Sector 114, spread across ~5 acres.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1064\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Provides <strong data-start=\"9\" data-end=\"25\">78 SCO units</strong> with plot sizes from <strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"68\">~113 to 305 sq yd</strong>, spread out in an open‑boulevard format.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1313\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Features include G+4 buildable rights, double‑frontage plots, wide frontage, surface parking, power backup, premium infrastructure.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"136\"><strong data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"134\">2. M3M 114 Market (M3M Xpressway SCO)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"531\">\r\n<li data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"215\">\r\n<p data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"215\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Located directly on Dwarka Expressway, Sector 114. Offers excellent road and metro connectivity, just ~5&ndash;7 minutes from IGI Airport, IICC, and Diplomatic Enclave II.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"294\">\r\n<p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"294\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Spread across ~3.86&ndash;4 acres with <strong data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"53\">73&ndash;105 SCO plots</strong> sized between <strong data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"87\">75 to 115 sq yd</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"452\">\r\n<p data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"452\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Built with <strong data-start=\"11\" data-end=\"36\">G+4 floors + basement</strong>, pedestrian‑friendly layout, full power backup, landscaped avenues, gaming/fun zones, terrace cafes, clubhouse, cafeteria, and more.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"531\">\r\n<p data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"531\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Well‑known in real estate circles, praised for location and connectivity and strong investor interest.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"536\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"588\"><strong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"586\">3. Emaar Business District 114 (EBD 114)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<li data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n<p data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"671\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Emaar India&rsquo;s flagship SCO offering in Sector 114, directly on Dwarka Expressway, developed on ~6.4 acres.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"754\">\r\n<p data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"754\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Comprises <strong data-start=\"10\" data-end=\"27\">~86 SCO plots</strong>, with buildable area up to <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"80\">G+4 (max 15 m height)</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"837\">\r\n<p data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"837\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Designed for a mix of fine‑dining, offices, retail chains, cultural venues, caf&eacute; zones, performance plaza, food truck plaza, interactive fountain, etc</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<p data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"920\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Positioned as a <strong data-start=\"16\" data-end=\"43\">premier investment zone</strong> with high visibility and integrated infrastructure.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1313\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1342\">Comparison Table</h2>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"2573\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1533\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1533\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1368\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Project</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1394\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Size / Units</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1417\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Plot Size</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1470\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Build Structure</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1533\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Features &amp; Highlights</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"2573\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"2011\">