=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2529\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">G+4 buildable rights</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2573\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Boutique style, wide frontage, dual access, ready to move</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2613\">Why These Projects Stand Out</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2905\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2697\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2697\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"40\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Strategic Dwarka Expressway frontage</strong>&mdash;all projects offer premium visibility and access.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2780\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2780\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"28\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Flexible built‑up rights</strong>: G+4 floors plus basements or terrace rights, accommodating diverse uses.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2863\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2863\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"29\" data-is-only-node=\"\">High anticipated footfall</strong> with proximity to dense residential clusters, business hubs, IICC, airport, metro</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2905\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2905\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"32\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Strong developer credentials</strong>: M3M, Emaar, and Reach group are reputed names with prior delivery track records.AMELA</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2910\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"3230\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3101\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3101\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3258\">Recommendations</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3614\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3374\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3374\">For <strong data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3324\">investors looking for value entry and early possession</strong>, <strong data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3344\">M3M 114 Market</strong> offers a solid opportunity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3507\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3507\">For <strong data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3432\">premium branding, retail or restaurant ventures</strong>, <strong data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3451\">Emaar EBD 114</strong> suits where visibility and curated experience matter.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3614\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3614\">For <strong data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3544\">larger plot configurations</strong> or immediate use-ready spaces, <strong data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3594\">Reach Buzz 114</strong> is well-positioned.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"139\"><strong data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"139\">Sector 114, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon &ndash; Overview</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"161\"><strong data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"161\">Location</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"494\">Sector 114 is one of the <strong data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"204\">prime sectors</strong> on the <strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"233\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> (also called the Northern Peripheral Road), situated right on the <strong data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"324\">Delhi-Gurgaon border</strong>. It shares proximity with <strong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"379\">Dwarka Sector 21 (Delhi)</strong>, <strong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"395\">Sector 113</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"415\">Sector 115</strong>, making it a key location for <strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"493\">both residential and commercial real estate</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"499\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"541\"><strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"541\">Infrastructure &amp; Connectivity</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<li data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"660\">\r\n<p data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"660\"><strong data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"565\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> (150 m wide, 8-lane): Seamless link between <strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"625\">IGI Airport</strong>, <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"637\">Dwarka</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"659\">NH-48 (NH-8)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"765\">\r\n<p data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"765\"><strong data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"690\">Delhi Metro (Blue Line)</strong>: Nearest metro station is <strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"737\">Dwarka Sector 21</strong>, approx. <strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"758\">10 mins</strong> drive.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<p data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"863\">Upcoming <strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"824\">Delhi&ndash;Gurgaon Urban Extension Road (UER-II)</strong> &amp; <strong data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"834\">SPR</strong> enhance future connectivity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<p data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"964\">Close to <strong data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"900\">Diplomatic Enclave II</strong> and <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"953\">India International Convention Centre (IICC)</strong> in Dwarka.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"969\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1002\"><strong data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1002\">Real Estate Profile</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1030\"><strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1030\">Commercial Hub</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1099\">Sector 114 has emerged as a <strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1082\">commercial hot spot</strong>, especially for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1155\"><strong data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1133\">SCO (Shop-Cum-Office) Plots</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1155\">retail spaces</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1193\"><strong data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1193\">High-street commercial projects</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1246\"><strong data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1213\">Office spaces</strong>, cafes, showrooms, clinics, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1280\">Top commercial projects include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1396\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1301\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1301\"><strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1301\">M3M 114 Market</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1345\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1345\"><strong data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1345\">Emaar Business District 114 (EBD 114)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1366\"><strong data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1366\">Reach Buzz 114</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1396\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1396\"><strong data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1396\">Spaze Grand Central 114</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1441\"><strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1441\">Residential Projects (Upcoming)</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1574\">While Sector 114 is mainly commercial, it is surrounded by <strong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1524\">residential sectors</strong> like 104, 113, 115, and 112, which host projects from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1650\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1591\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1591\">Tata Housing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1591\">Hero Homes</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1614\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1614\">Shapoorji Pallonji</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1629\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1629\">Indiabulls</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1650\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1650\">Puri Constructions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1650\">M3M</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1655\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1682\"><strong data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1682\">Key Highlights</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1738\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1738\"><strong data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1714\">5&ndash;7 mins from IGI Airport</strong> via Dwarka Expressway</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1804\"><strong data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1758\">Next to Delhi</strong>, ideal for cross-border commercial activity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1863\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1863\"><strong data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1829\">High ROI potential</strong> for SCO investors and retailers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1941\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1941\"><strong data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1905\">Catchment of over 10 lakh residents</strong> in surrounding sectors and Dwarka</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2016\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2016\">Proposed <strong data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1980\">ISBT and metro corridor</strong> to enhance footfall and transport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2090\"><strong data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2044\">Modern infrastructure</strong>: wide roads, underground cabling, green belts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2095\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2126\"><strong data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2126\">Investment Outlook</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2500\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2243\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2243\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2172\">commercial property investors</strong>, especially SCO buyers looking for freehold plots with high visibility</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2337\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2337\">Strong <strong data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2279\">rental yield potential</strong> due to airport proximity and dense surrounding population</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2415\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2415\"><strong data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2374\">Infrastructure is well-planned</strong>; rapid development makes it future-ready</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2500\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2500\">Preferred for <strong data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2449\">retail brands</strong>, restaurants, salons, and service-based businesses</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2505\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2538\">Challenges (Short Term)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2773\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2633\">Some <strong data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2575\">construction work ongoing</strong>, especially for roads, drains, and civic infrastructure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2706\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2706\"><strong data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2656\">Public transport</strong> still developing (metro line extension pending)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2773\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2773\"><strong data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2729\">Price volatility</strong> for SCO plots in early phase of handovers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2778\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2792\">Summary</h2>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"3570\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2890\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2890\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2815\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Feature</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2890\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3570\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3084\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3009\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Location</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3084\" data-col-size=\"md\">Delhi-Gurgaon border, Dwarka Expressway (Northern Peripheral Road)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3181\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3106\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Key Roads</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3181\" data-col-size=\"md\">Dwarka Expressway, NH-48, UER-II, SPR</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3278\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3203\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Main Use</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3278\" data-col-size=\"md\">High-street commercial (SCO), retail, some upcoming residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3376\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3300\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Developer Brands</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3376\" data-col-size=\"md\">M3M, Emaar, Spaze, Reach</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3473\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3398\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ideal For</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3398\" data-end=\"3473\" data-col-size=\"md\">SCO investors, retailers, clinics, showrooms, service businesses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3570\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3495\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Nearby Facilities</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3495\" data-end=\"3570\" data-col-size=\"md\">IGI Airport, Diplomatic Enclave, IICC, Dwarka Metro</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"194\"><strong data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"194\">Benefits of Investing in SCO Projects &ndash; Sector 114, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"253\">1. <strong data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"253\">Strategic Location on Delhi&ndash;Gurgaon Border</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"553\">\r\n<li data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"385\">\r\n<p data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"385\">Sector 114 is right next to <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"301\">Dwarka, Delhi</strong>, making it one of the <strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"384\">few sectors in Gurgaon with direct access to the capital</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"462\">\r\n<p data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"462\">Just <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"422\">10 minutes to IGI Airport</strong> and <strong data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"461\">Dwarka Sector 21 Metro Station</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"553\">\r\n<p data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"553\">Close to <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"499\">Diplomatic Enclave II</strong> and <strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"552\">India International Convention Centre (IICC)</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"648\"><em data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"648\"><strong>Result:</strong> High-end clientele, strong daily footfall, and long-term appreciation potential.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"653\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"704\">2. <strong data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"704\">High-Visibility Commercial Frontage</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"924\">\r\n<li data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"809\">\r\n<p data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"809\">SCO plots in Sector 114 are <strong data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"747\">freehold</strong> and <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"769\">street-facing</strong>, offering great branding opportunities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"924\">\r\n<p data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"924\">Located directly on the <strong data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"869\">Dwarka Expressway (150m wide)</strong>, with <strong data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"900\">huge passing traffic</strong> from Delhi and Gurgaon.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"1005\"><em data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1005\">Ideal for showrooms, cafes, clinics, salons, coaching centers, banks, etc.</em></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1054\">&nbsp;3. <strong data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1054\">Flexible Construction &amp; Use</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1289\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1170\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1083\">SCO plots typically offer:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1170\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1119\"><strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1119\">G+4 construction + basement</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1147\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1147\"><strong data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1147\">100% land ownership</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1170\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1170\"><strong data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1170\">Terrace rights</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1289\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1289\">No restrictions on types of business&mdash;can be used for <strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1288\">retail, offices, restaurants, medical or co-working setups</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1365\"><em data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1365\">Maximum design flexibility = higher returns and multi-tenant options.</em></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1428\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1428\">&nbsp;4. <strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1428\">Strong Rental Yield &amp; Capital Appreciation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1721\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1529\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1529\">Sector 114 is surrounded by <strong data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1491\">dense residential catchments</strong> in Sectors 113, 115, 112, and Dwarka.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1612\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1612\">High demand from businesses looking for <strong data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1600\">prime, visible locations</strong> near Delhi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1721\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1721\">Average rental yield: <strong data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1646\">6%&ndash;8%</strong>, with capital appreciation potential of <strong data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1704\">10%+ annually</strong> in early stages.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1801\"><em data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1801\">Invest early = better appreciation and tenant demand as the area matures.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1806\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1850\">&nbsp;5. <strong data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1850\">Backed by Reputed Developers</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1982\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1882\">SCO projects by top builders:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1982\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1905\"><strong data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1905\">M3M 114 Market</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1927\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1927\"><strong data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1927\">Emaar EBD 114</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1959\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1959\"><strong data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1959\">Spaze Grand Central 114</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1982\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1982\"><strong data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1982\">Reach Buzz 114</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2100\">These builders offer timely delivery, branded development, and reliable infrastructure (parking, lifts, utilities).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2171\"><em data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2171\">Reduces risk and adds long-term credibility for your investment.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2176\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2220\">&nbsp;6. <strong data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2220\">Massive Infrastructure Push</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2387\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2387\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2240\">Ongoing upgrades:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2387\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2296\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2296\">Drainage &amp; stormwater systems (to prevent flooding)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2341\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2341\">New connecting roads to Dwarka and NH-48</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2387\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2387\">Proposed metro extensions and ISBT nearby</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2460\"><em data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2460\">Better infrastructure = more footfall = higher business potential.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2465\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2512\">7. <strong data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2512\">Catchment of Affluent Consumers</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2614\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2614\">Surrounded by <strong data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2564\">premium residential communities</strong> from Tata, Sobha, Indiabulls, Shapoorji Pallonji.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2677\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2677\">Close to <strong data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2644\">corporate hubs</strong> like Cyber City and Udyog Vihar.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2781\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2781\">Target customer base includes <strong data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2780\">working professionals, frequent flyers, and international visitors</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2868\"><em data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2868\">Perfect for premium businesses like caf&eacute;s, designer stores, or boutique clinics.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2873\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2919\">Summary: Why Invest in SCO Sector 114?</h2>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"3740\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"3011\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"3011\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2947\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Factor</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"3011\" data-col-size=\"md\">Why It Matters</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3740\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3193\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3129\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Location</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3193\">Delhi-border + Expressway + Airport proximity</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3284\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3220\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flexibility</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3284\">G+4 + basement + terrace rights</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3375\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3311\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rental Potential</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3375\">6&ndash;8%+ yields from early investment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3467\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3402\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Developer Credibility</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3467\">M3M, Emaar, Spaze, Reach</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3558\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3494\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Footfall &amp; Visibility</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3558\">Huge road frontage, strong brand exposure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3649\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3585\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Infrastructure Growth</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3649\">Metro, road network, drainage, ISBT</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3740\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3676\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Asset Type</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3740\">Freehold land with commercial development rights</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"234\"><strong data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"234\">Key Features of Top SCO Projects</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"283\"><strong data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"283\">1. Prime Location &amp; High Visibility</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"499\">\r\n<li data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"356\">\r\n<p data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"356\">Located on <strong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"326\">main roads or expressways</strong> (e.g., <strong data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"355\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"422\">\r\n<p data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"422\">Near <strong data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"384\">residential hubs</strong>, <strong data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"404\">metro stations</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"422\">airports</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"499\">\r\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"499\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"465\">footfall-driven businesses</strong> like retail, F&amp;B, salons, clinics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"504\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"559\"><strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"559\">2. Freehold, Clear-Titled Commercial Plots</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<li data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"619\">\r\n<p data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"619\">Full <strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"585\">land ownership</strong> (unlike leased commercial spaces)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"683\">\r\n<p data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"683\">Registered in buyer&rsquo;s name with complete flexibility in usage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n<p data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"737\"><strong data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"712\">DTCP and RERA approved</strong> in most reputed projects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"742\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"793\"><strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"793\">3. G+4 Construction Rights + Basement</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<li data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"844\">Most top SCOs allow <strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"844\">G+4 floors plus basement</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"893\">Rights to build and customize interior layouts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<p data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"971\"><strong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"921\">Terrace usage allowed</strong> (great for rooftop cafes, gyms, co-working, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"976\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1013\"><strong data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1013\">4. Flexible Business Use</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1232\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1066\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1066\">Retail showrooms (fashion, furniture, electronics)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1115\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1115\">Offices (IT, real estate, finance, co-working)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1144\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1144\">F&amp;B (cafes, lounges, QSRs)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1191\">Healthcare (clinics, labs, wellness centers)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1232\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1232\">Education (coaching, training centers)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1280\"><strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1280\">5. Modern Urban Infrastructure</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1345\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1345\"><strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1306\">Wide internal roads</strong>, underground cabling, drainage systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1408\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1408\"><strong data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1364\">Power backup</strong>, fire safety, water supply, street lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1447\">Ample <strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1447\">surface + basement parking</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1500\"><strong data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1500\">6. Community-Driven Design</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1671\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1562\">Planned as <strong data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1541\">open high-street retail</strong> &ndash; not enclosed malls</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1615\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1615\"><strong data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1583\">Walkable zones</strong>, landscaped plazas, food courts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1671\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1671\">Events and promotions space in many top-tier projects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1676\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1710\"><strong data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1710\">7. Reputed Developers</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1801\">Top SCO developers ensure better construction quality, approvals, and after-sales support:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1834\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1834\"><strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1834\">M3M (e.g., M3M 114 Market)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1862\"><strong data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1862\">Emaar (e.g., EBD 114)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1900\"><strong data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1900\">Spaze (e.g., Grand Central 114)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1935\"><strong data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1935\">Reach (e.g., Reach Buzz 114)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1940\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1974\"><strong data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1974\">8. High ROI Potential</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2189\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2035\">Appreciation due to strategic location + rising population</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2103\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2103\"><strong data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2060\">Rental yield ~6&ndash;8%</strong>, depending on frontage, size, and footfall</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2189\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2189\">Fast-growing micro-markets like <strong data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2159\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> boost long-term capital gains</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"270\"><strong data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"270\">Top &amp; Popular SCO Projects on Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<hr data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"275\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"317\"><strong data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"317\">1. M3M 114 Market (Sector 114)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"669\">\r\n<li data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"346\">\r\n<p data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"346\"><strong data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"333\">Developer</strong>: M3M India</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"373\">\r\n<p data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"373\"><strong data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"357\">Size</strong>: 73&ndash;105 plots</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"420\">\r\n<p data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"420\"><strong data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"392\">Build Rights</strong>: G+4 + basement + terrace</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"510\">\r\n<p data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"510\"><strong data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"430\">USP</strong>: Right on Dwarka Expressway, premium frontage, ideal for high-footfall retail</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"560\">\r\n<p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"560\"><strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"523\">Status</strong>: Under construction, RERA-approved<br data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"620\"><em data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"669\">Ideal for: Boutiques, caf&eacute;s, salons, clinics</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"674\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"726\"><strong data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"726\">2. Emaar Business District 114 (EBD 114)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"1036\">\r\n<li data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"757\">\r\n<p data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"757\"><strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"742\">Developer</strong>: Emaar India</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<p data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"784\"><strong data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"768\">Size</strong>: 86 SCO plots</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"828\">\r\n<p data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"828\"><strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"803\">Build Rights</strong>: G+4 floors + basement</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"904\">\r\n<p data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"904\"><strong data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"838\">USP</strong>: High-end architectural design, located at Delhi&ndash;Gurgaon border</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<p data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"938\"><strong data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"917\">Status</strong>: Under development<br data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"974\"><em data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1036\">Ideal for: Branded retail, fine dining, commercial chains</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1083\"><strong data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1083\">3. Reach Buzz 114 (Sector 114)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1353\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1114\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1114\"><strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1099\">Developer</strong>: Reach Group</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1142\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1142\"><strong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1125\">Size</strong>: ~78 SCO plots</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1175\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1175\"><strong data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1158\">Plot Size</strong>: 113&ndash;305 sq yd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1353\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1353\"><strong data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1231\">USP</strong>: Dual access, boutique-style shops, ready-to-move plots<br data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1290\"><em data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1353\">Ideal for: Designer stores, restaurants, small enterprises</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1358\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1396\"><strong data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1396\">4. Spaze Grand Central 114</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1427\"><strong data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1412\">Developer</strong>: Spaze Group</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1460\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1460\"><strong data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1438\">Size</strong>: ~120&ndash;200 SCO plots</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1496\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1496\"><strong data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1479\">Build Rights</strong>: G+4 + terrace</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1564\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1564\"><strong data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1506\">USP</strong>: Corner visibility, wide frontage, smart infrastructure<br data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1596\"><em data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1641\">Ideal for: Mixed retail and office usage</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1646\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1729\"><strong data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1729\">5. Vatika Crossover (Sector 82A &ndash; near Dwarka Expressway/NH-8 junction)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1761\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1761\"><strong data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1745\">Developer</strong>: Vatika Group</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1840\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1840\"><strong data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1771\">USP</strong>: Close to residential zones and NH-8, great for service businesses</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1933\"><strong data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1859\">Build Rights</strong>: G+4 + terrace<br data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1877\"><em data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1933\">Ideal for: Medical, coaching, professional services</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1938\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1983\"><strong data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1983\">6. Orris Gateway SCO (Sector 82A)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2014\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2014\"><strong data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"1999\">Developer</strong>: Orris Group</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2095\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2095\"><strong data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2024\">USP</strong>: Mid-segment commercial plots near New Gurgaon and Dwarka Expressway</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2197\"><strong data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2114\">Build Rights</strong>: Freehold + G+4<br data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2133\"><em data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2197\">Ideal for: Small business setups, retail stores, franchises</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"224\"><strong data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"224\">Financing Options for SCO Investments</strong></h2>\r\n<hr data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"229\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"281\"><strong data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"281\">1. Commercial Property Loan (Term Loan)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<li data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"372\">\r\n<p data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"372\">Offered by banks &amp; NBFCs like <strong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"372\">HDFC, ICICI, SBI, PNB, Bajaj Finance, Indiabulls, etc.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"425\">\r\n<p data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"425\">Can finance <strong data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"403\">up to 65&ndash;75%</strong> of the property value</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"466\">\r\n<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"466\"><strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"443\">Loan tenure</strong>: Up to <strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"466\">10&ndash;15 years</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"562\">\r\n<p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"562\"><strong data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"486\">Interest rate</strong>: Typically <strong data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"515\">9.5% to 12.5%</strong>, depending on the lender and applicant profile</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<p data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"574\">Requires:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<li data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"600\">\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"600\">Good <strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"600\">credit score</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"635\">\r\n<p data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"635\">Documented <strong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"635\">business income</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<p data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"694\"><strong data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"668\">Property sanctioned plan</strong> and approvals (RERA/DTCP)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"779\"><em data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"779\">Best for: Investors buying plots from reputed builders (like M3M, Emaar, Spaze)</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"827\"><strong data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"827\">2. Loan Against Property (LAP)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1085\">\r\n<li data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"884\">\r\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"884\">Mortgage your existing residential/commercial property</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<p data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"920\">Use the funds to invest in an SCO</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"980\">\r\n<p data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"980\">Loan amount: <strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"980\">60&ndash;70% of the mortgaged property&rsquo;s value</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1007\">\r\n<p data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1007\">Interest: <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1007\">9&ndash;11% p.a.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1085\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1085\">Flexibility: Funds can be used for <strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1085\">purchase, construction, or expansion</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1170\"><em data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1170\">Best for: Investors who own property but want to avoid commercial loan scrutiny</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1175\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1212\"><strong data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1212\">3. Builder Payment Plans</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1305\">Most SCO builders (M3M, Spaze, Emaar) offer <strong data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1295\">developer-backed financing schemes</strong>, such as:</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1353\">&nbsp;a) <strong data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1353\">Construction Linked Plan (CLP)</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1515\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1400\">Payments are made as per construction stages</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1446\">Reduces risk of upfront lump-sum investment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1515\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1515\">You pay only <strong data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1483\">10&ndash;20% at booking</strong>, then as the project progresses</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1564\">&nbsp;b) <strong data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1547\">Subvention Plan</strong> <em data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1564\">(if available)</em></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1609\">You pay a small portion (e.g. 10%) upfront</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1654\">Builder pays the <strong data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1654\">EMIs until possession</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1698\">Offered through tie-ups with select banks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1760\"><em data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1760\">Best for: Investors wanting low early-stage cash outflow</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1829\"><strong data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1829\">4. Lease Rental Discounting (LRD) &ndash; Post Possession</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"2023\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1912\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1912\">After leasing out your SCO, you can take a loan against future <strong data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1912\">rental income</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1962\">Banks offer <strong data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1962\">loan based on rental agreements</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2023\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2023\">Ideal for unlocking liquidity without selling the property</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2089\"><em data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2089\">Best for: Passive income generators who want working capital</em></p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2134\">&nbsp;Documentation Typically Required</h2>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2221\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2221\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2160\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Document Type</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2221\" data-col-size=\"md\">Examples</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2395\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2334\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity &amp; Address</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2395\">PAN, Aadhaar, Passport, Utility bills</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2482\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2421\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Financials</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2482\">ITRs (last 2&ndash;3 years), Bank statements, GST returns</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2569\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2508\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Business Proof</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2569\">Company registration, partnership deed, trade license</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2656\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2595\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Property Papers</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2656\">Builder agreement, Allotment letter, RERA/DTCP approval</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2683\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Income Proof (Salaried)</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2744\">Salary slips, Form 16 (if salaried co-applicant)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2749\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2799\">Sample Loan Illustration (For ₹2.5 Cr SCO)</h2>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"3262\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\n<th style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2829\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Particulars</th>\r\n<th style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2829\" data-end=\"2866\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Approx. Value</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"3262\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2998\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2961\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Property Price</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2998\">₹2.5 Cr</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3064\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3027\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Loan Sanctioned (70%)</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3064\">₹1.75 Cr</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3130\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3093\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Interest Rate</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3130\">10.5%</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3196\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3159\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tenure</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3196\">10 years</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3262\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3225\" data-col-size=\"sm\">EMI (approx.)</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3225\" data-end=\"3262\">₹2.35&ndash;2.45 L/month</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3267\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3295\">Tips Before Applying</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3597\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3390\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3390\">Check <strong data-start=\"3305\" data-end=\"3333\">pre-approved loan offers</strong> from your bank if you&rsquo;re a salaried or existing customer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3452\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3452\">Choose <strong data-start=\"3400\" data-end=\"3413\">CLP plans</strong> if project possession is &gt;2 years away</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3453\" data-end=\"3517\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3517\">Opt for <strong data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3494\">pre-EMI plans or subvention</strong> for smoother cash flow</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3597\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3597\">Always <strong data-start=\"3527\" data-end=\"3554\">compare processing fees</strong>, prepayment charges, and insurance bundles</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"227\">The Future of SCO Projects on Dwarka Expressway</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"265\">1. <strong data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"265\">Strategic Growth Corridor</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"613\">\r\n<li data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"372\">\r\n<p data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"372\">Dwarka Expressway is a <strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"319\">key development corridor</strong> connecting Delhi&rsquo;s Dwarka area to Gurgaon and NH-48.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"443\">Expected to become a <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"431\">major commercial and retail hub</strong> because of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"613\">\r\n<li data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"476\">\r\n<p data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"476\">Proximity to <strong data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"476\">IGI Airport</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"545\">Expansion of <strong data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"509\">Delhi Metro</strong> and ISBT (Inter-State Bus Terminal)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"613\">Development of <strong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"590\">residential townships</strong> around Sectors 112&ndash;115</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"618\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"675\">2. <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"675\">Rising Demand for Flexible Commercial Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"996\">\r\n<li data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"776\">SCOs provide <strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"707\">flexible use</strong>&mdash;shops, offices, clinics, co-working spaces, food &amp; beverage outlets.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"911\">\r\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"911\">Growing startups, SMEs, retail brands, and service providers prefer SCOs due to <strong data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"881\">ownership benefits</strong> and <strong data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"910\">better space control</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"996\">\r\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"996\">Demand from <strong data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"973\">healthcare, education, and wellness sectors</strong> will boost SCO uptake.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1061\">3. <strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1061\">Infrastructure Enhancements Boost Accessibility</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1374\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1164\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1164\">Planned metro line extensions and road widening projects will enhance <strong data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1163\">connectivity and footfall</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1278\">Improved infrastructure will attract <strong data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1241\">national and international brands</strong>, elevating the commercial ecosystem.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1374\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1374\">Facilities like <strong data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1351\">underground utilities, power backup, smart parking</strong> are becoming standard.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1420\">4. <strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1420\">Appreciation &amp; Rental Growth</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1531\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1531\">Early investments in SCO plots on Dwarka Expressway have shown <strong data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1517\">strong capital appreciation</strong> (8&ndash;12% CAGR).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1663\">As the area matures, <strong data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1610\">rental yields are expected to stabilize or increase</strong>, especially near metro corridors and airport routes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1743\">Investors can expect <strong data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1742\">steady income streams and good resale opportunities</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1748\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1788\">5. <strong data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1788\">Government &amp; Policy Support</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"2121\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1933\">Haryana government&rsquo;s focus on <strong data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1847\">smart city initiatives</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1873\">industrial growth</strong> near Dwarka Expressway supports commercial property growth.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2010\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"2010\">Simplified approvals and RERA regulations add transparency and confidence.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2121\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2121\">Policies encouraging <strong data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2060\">mixed-use developments</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2084\">green buildings</strong> will improve project sustainability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2126\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2183\">6. <strong data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2183\">Emergence of Lifestyle &amp; Experiential Retail</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2481\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2275\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2275\">Future SCO projects are evolving from just office-retail complexes to <strong data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2274\">lifestyle hubs</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2397\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2397\">Integration of cafes, fitness centers, boutique stores, and entertainment options will make SCO spaces more attractive.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2481\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2481\">Demand for <strong data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2453\">smart, tech-enabled retail experiences</strong> will shape new SCO designs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2486\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2519\">7. <strong data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2519\">Potential Challenges</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2723\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2591\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2591\">Temporary infrastructure disruptions during metro and road expansion.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2652\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2652\">Pricing volatility in the short term as market stabilizes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2723\">Need for better last-mile connectivity and public transport options.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2728\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2769\"><strong data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2769\">Summary Table: Future Outlook</strong></h2>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"3508\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2863\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2863\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2802\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Aspect</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2863\" data-col-size=\"md\">Outlook</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"3508\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"3047\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2986\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Connectivity</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"3047\">Metro + Airport access + ISBT = increasing footfall</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3139\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3078\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Commercial Demand</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3139\">Growing demand from startups, SMEs, health, and retail</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3232\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3171\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rental Yields &amp; Appreciation</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3232\">Expected growth in rental returns and property values</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3323\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3262\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Infrastructure</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3323\">Upgraded utilities, smart parking, green building focus</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3416\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3354\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Policy Environment</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3416\">Pro-investment policies &amp; regulatory transparency</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3508\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3446\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Market Dynamics</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3508\">Shift toward lifestyle &amp; experiential retail environments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3513\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3537\"><strong data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3537\">Bottom Line</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3848\">Dwarka Expressway SCO projects in sectors like 114 are set to become <strong data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3635\">key commercial hotspots</strong> with strong growth in demand, infrastructure, and investor interest. Early entry can secure high appreciation and robust rental incomes as the corridor develops into a fully integrated urban commercial ecosystem.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Top SCO Projects for Sale on Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Top SCO Projects for Sale on Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'SCO plots Dwarka Expressway, Shop cum office projects Gurgaon, commercial property Dwarka Expressway, M3M SCO sector 114, Orris Gateway SCO, Emaar SCO plots Gurgaon, SCO investment Gurgaon, SCO plots for sale Dwarka Expressway, best SCO projects New Gurgaon, Vatika Crossover SCO, Signature Global Twin Square, freehold commercial plots Gurgaon, SCO retail space Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon SCO market, SCO plots near IGI Airport, commercial plots Dwarka Expressway, top SCO projects Gurgaon 2025, A2P Realtech, Dwarka Expressway, ', 'Are you ready to invest in the future of Gurgaon? The Dwarka Expressway, often hailed as the lifeline of the city, is now a hotspot for superior SCO (Shop-Cum-Office) projects that are redefining commercial real estate. With its strategic location and seamless connectivity, this bustling corridor not only promises high footfall but also delivers impressive returns on investment. Whether you’re an aspiring business owner or a seasoned investor, the top SCO projects for sale along the Dwarka Expressway offer a unique opportunity to blend retail and office spaces, maximizing both functionality and revenue. Imagine setting up your business in a thriving area that connects key sectors of the city, where modern infrastructure meets abundant lifestyle amenities. In this article, we will explore some of the finest SCO projects available, guiding you to make informed decisions that can elevate your business potential and financial growth. Dive in and discover the best options tailored for your entrepreneurial ambitions!', 'A2P Realtech', 0, 1, NULL, NULL);
