>\r\n<p data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2613\"><strong data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2565\">USP:</strong> Strong construction quality and timely delivery</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2618\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2645\">🔹 <strong data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2645\">Chintels India</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2744\">An emerging name in NCR real estate, Chintels focuses on <strong data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2724\">functional luxury</strong> and smart design.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2895\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2783\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2783\"><strong data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2763\">Key Project:</strong> <a href=\"../service_detail/chintels-serenity-sector-109-on-dwarka-expressway-gurgaon.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chintels Serenity</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2844\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2844\"><strong data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2800\">Specialty:</strong> Ready-to-move-in homes, open green spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2895\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2895\"><strong data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2855\">USP:</strong> Mid-luxury segment with excellent value</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2900\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2935\">🔹 <strong data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2935\">Indiabulls Real Estate</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"3030\">A well-established national developer offering <strong data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3004\">affordable luxury</strong> in strategic locations.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3192\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3075\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3075\"><strong data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3049\">Key Project:</strong> <a href=\"../service_detail/indiabulls-estate-and-club-sector-104-dwarka-expressway-gurgaon.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Indiabulls Centrum Park</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3141\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3141\"><strong data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3092\">Specialty:</strong> Mixed-use development, family-centric features</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3192\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3192\"><strong data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3152\">USP:</strong> Competitive pricing with quality finish</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"139\"><strong data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"139\">Amenities &amp; Lifestyle Features in Dwarka Expressway Luxury Projects</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"423\">Luxury living on <strong data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"179\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> goes far beyond spacious apartments &mdash; it\'s about a complete lifestyle experience. Top developers in this corridor offer <strong data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"325\">world-class amenities</strong>, blending comfort, technology, and wellness to cater to modern families, professionals, and NRIs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"499\">Here&rsquo;s what you can expect from luxury properties along Dwarka Expressway:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"504\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"543\">🏊 <strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"543\">1. Resort-Style Clubhouses</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"740\">\r\n<li data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"617\">\r\n<p data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"617\">Multiple clubhouses with <strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"617\">caf&eacute;s, lounges, libraries, and fine dining</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"676\">\r\n<p data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"676\">Indoor games rooms, multipurpose halls, banquet spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"740\">\r\n<p data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"740\">Dedicated areas for yoga, meditation, and wellness sessions</p>