ta-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3808\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3765\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3764\">Rental Assistance</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3808\" data-col-size=\"md\">Leasing residential or commercial units</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3887\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3846\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3845\">Real Estate Portfolio Advisory</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3846\" data-end=\"3887\" data-col-size=\"md\">Investment strategy for long-term ROI</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3892\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"3934\">🧱 Top Areas Covered by A2P Realtech</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3936\" data-end=\"4018\">A2P Realtech primarily works in the <strong data-start=\"3972\" data-end=\"4006\">Dwarka Expressway micro-market</strong>, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4020\" data-end=\"4145\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4020\" data-end=\"4044\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4044\"><strong data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4044\">Sectors 102 to 115</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4061\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4047\" data-end=\"4061\"><strong data-start=\"4047\" data-end=\"4061\">Sector 37D</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4090\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4090\"><strong data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4090\">Sector 88A / 89A / 99A</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4108\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4108\"><strong data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4108\">New Gurgaon</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4109\" data-end=\"4145\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4145\"><strong data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4145\">SPR (Southern Peripheral Road)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4147\" data-end=\"4150\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4191\">🏆 Testimonials from Recent Clients</h3>\r\n<blockquote data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4392\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4195\" data-end=\"4392\">&ldquo;I was confused between Sector 113 and Sector 109. A2P Realtech not only explained the pros and cons but also helped me book at a pre-launch price. Highly professional.&rdquo;<br data-start=\"4364\" data-end=\"4367\">&mdash; <em data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4392\">Rohit M., Delhi NCR</em></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<blockquote data-start=\"4394\" data-end=\"4538\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4538\">&ldquo;Their after-sales support is impressive. Helped me with home loan and even post-possession services.&rdquo;<br data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4501\">&mdash; <em data-start=\"4505\" data-end=\"4538\">Shweta A., NRI Investor (Dubai)</em></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4540\" data-end=\"4543\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4572\">📞 Contact A2P Realtech</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4574\" data-end=\"4795\"><strong data-start=\"4574\" data-end=\"4594\">Office Location:</strong> Near Dwarka Expressway, Sector 4, Dwarka New Delhi<br data-start=\"4638\" data-end=\"4641\"><strong data-start=\"4669\" data-end=\"4679\">Email:</strong> <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"4680\" data-end=\"4700\">team@a2prealtech.com</a><br data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4703\"><strong data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4715\">Website:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.a2prealtech.com\">www.a2prealtech.com</a><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"4716\" data-end=\"4766\">&nbsp;</a></p>', 'For Luxury home seekers', 'A2P Realtech: Your Trusted Real Estate Partner Near Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'A2P Realtech, real estate agents near Dwarka Expressway, property dealers Dwarka Expressway, best real estate consultant Gurgaon, buy property Dwarka Expressway, flats near Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech Gurgaon, residential projects Dwarka Expressway, commercial property Gurgaon, top property consultants Gurgaon, Dwarka Expressway real estate, real estate agency Dwarka Expressway, invest in Gurgaon property, trusted real estate agent Gurgaon', 'A2P Realtech is a trusted real estate consultant near Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon. Explore expert property advice, top builder tie-ups, and investment opportunities in 2025.', 'A2P Realtech', 0, 1, NULL, NULL);
