(122, 'Buy 3BHK Flat on Dwarka Expressway Price and Guide ', '20251008181540_Why-Buy-3BHK-Flat-on-Dwarka-Expressway-Gurgaon.jpg', '<h1 data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"173\"><strong data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"173\">Buy 3BHK Flat on Dwarka Expressway &ndash; Price, Amenities, Location Guide (2025 Update)</strong></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"705\">Dwarka Expressway is rapidly transforming into one of the most sought-after real estate destinations in Delhi-NCR. With seamless connectivity, modern infrastructure, and a plethora of high-quality residential projects, the expressway is attracting both investors and end-users. If you&rsquo;re planning to <strong data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"541\">buy a <a href=\"../blog_detail/buy-3bhk-flats-or-apartments-on-dwarka-expressway-gurgaon.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">3BHK flat on Dwarka Expressway</a></strong>, this comprehensive guide will help you explore the <strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"646\">price trends, amenities, top locations, builders</strong>, and everything you need to make a smart decision in 2025.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"710\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"771\"><strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"771\">Why Choose Dwarka Expressway for Buying a 3BHK Flat?</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"996\">Dwarka Expressway, also known as the <strong data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"844\">Northern Peripheral Road (NPR)</strong>, connects <strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"874\">Dwarka in Delhi</strong> to <strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"900\">Gurgaon in Haryana</strong>, offering unmatched strategic importance. Here&rsquo;s why it&rsquo;s becoming the top pick for homebuyers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<li data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1088\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1088\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1028\">Excellent Connectivity</strong> to NH-8, IGI Airport, and upcoming Delhi-Mumbai Expressway.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1162\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1162\">🏙️ <strong data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1162\">Proximity to Cyber City, Udyog Vihar, and major corporate hubs.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1235\">🌆 <strong data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1195\">Rapid urban development</strong> with new malls, schools, and hospitals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1353\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1353\">🏗️ <strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1278\">World-class residential projects</strong> by reputed builders like DLF, Sobha, Godrej, Shapoorji Pallonji, and more.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1440\">💸 <strong data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1373\">Better ROI</strong> compared to saturated areas like Gurgaon Sector 49 or South Delhi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1445\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2423\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2489\"><strong data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2489\">Top Locations to Buy 3BHK Flats on Dwarka Expressway</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2539\"><strong data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2539\">1. Sector 109 &ndash; Premium Residential Zone</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2704\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2596\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2596\">Close to <strong data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2566\">IGI Airport</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2595\">Diplomatic Enclave 2</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2651\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2651\">Home to high-end projects by <strong data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2650\">Sobha, ATS, Raheja</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2704\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2704\">Peaceful environment with wide roads and greenery.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2757\"><strong data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2757\">2. Sector 104 &ndash; Best for Mid-Segment Buyers</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2924\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2829\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2829\">Affordable 3BHK options from builders like <strong data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2828\">Puri, Hero Homes, M3M</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2874\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2874\">Near upcoming <strong data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2864\">metro corridor</strong> and NH-8.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2924\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2924\">Great for first-time buyers and young families.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2965\"><strong data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2965\">3. Sector 37D &ndash; Value for Money</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3145\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3023\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3023\">Ideal for budget buyers looking for <strong data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3022\">spacious 3BHKs</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3091\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3091\">Close to <strong data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3060\">Basai Railway Station</strong> and upcoming commercial belts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3145\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3145\">Projects by <strong data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3144\">Signature Global, BPTP, Ramprastha</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3193\"><strong data-start=\"3151\" data-end=\"3193\">4. Sector 84&ndash;86 &ndash; Fastest Growing Zone</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3366\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3258\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3258\">Great mix of <strong data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3257\">residential, retail, and commercial projects</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3321\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3321\">Excellent access to <strong data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3299\">KMP Expressway</strong> and <strong data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3320\">Dwarka E-way</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3366\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3366\">High rental yields due to IT parks nearby.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3371\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3433\"><strong data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3433\">Top Builders Offering 3BHK Flats on Dwarka Expressway</strong></h2>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\r\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 60.3175%; height: 201.515px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"4440\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3559\">\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3559\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1536%; height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3458\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3448\">Builder</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.1095%; height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3509\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3460\" data-end=\"3481\">Flagship Projects</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.4776%; height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3559\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3533\">Project Highlights</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3815\">\r\n