1pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2 BHK</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">3 BHK</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">4 BHK</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.9063%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">915-1368</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">1692-1852</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2160</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.9699%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Ready to Move</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.8095%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"159\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tashee Capital Gateway-111</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.6704%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"152\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tashee Group</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.6439%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"124\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Phase I(3 BHK)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Phase I(4 BHK)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Phase-II (5 BHK)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.9063%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">1695-2359</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2675-2990</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">3735-</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.9699%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 1.2;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Ready to Move</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.8095%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"159\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Kashish Manor One-111</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 22.6704%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"152\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">KASHISH</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.6439%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"124\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">1BHK</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2BHK</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">3BHK</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">4BHK</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">5BHK Villa</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.9063%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">895</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">1455-1715</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2325</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">5450</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">5600</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.9699%; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Ready to Move</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"4488\" data-end=\"4594\">These are only some examples. The exact price will depend on floor, facing, furnishing, parking, view etc.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4596\" data-end=\"4599\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4601\" data-end=\"4646\">5. What to Check When Buying a Ready Flat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4648\" data-end=\"4721\">Even though the flat is ready, there are many important things to verify:</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4723\" data-end=\"4749\">5.1 Legal &amp; Approvals</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4751\" data-end=\"4987\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4751\" data-end=\"4897\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4753\" data-end=\"4897\">Ensure <strong data-start=\"4760\" data-end=\"4784\">all legal clearances</strong> are in place: RERA registration, occupancy certificate (OC), fire safety, environment clearance if applicable.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4898\" data-end=\"4987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4900\" data-end=\"4987\">Check status of the title deed; freehold vs leasehold; ensure there are no litigations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"4989\" data-end=\"5024\">5.2 Infrastructure &amp; Amenities</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5267\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5107\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5028\" data-end=\"5107\">Is water supply reliable? Electricity backup / generator service as promised?</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5176\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5176\">Condition of lifts, common corridors, parking, security systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5177\" data-end=\"5267\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5267\">Green cover, parks, walking/jogging tracks, clubhouses, gyms etc. Are they functional?</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5269\" data-end=\"5313\">5.3 Internal Road &amp; Connectivity Status</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5315\" data-end=\"5622\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5315\" data-end=\"5507\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5317\" data-end=\"5507\">As some internal/sector roads are still being improved, check last‑mile connectivity: how far to the expressway access, condition of approach roads.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5508\" data-end=\"5622\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5510\" data-end=\"5622\">Traffic, noise level: flats fronting main roads may have noise; buffer zones, solid walls or green belts help.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5624\" data-end=\"5655\">5.4 Layout &amp; Build Quality</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5657\" data-end=\"5950\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5657\" data-end=\"5780\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5659\" data-end=\"5780\">Quality of construction: look for cracks, finishing (tiles, paint, fittings), whether everything promised is delivered.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5781\" data-end=\"5872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5783\" data-end=\"5872\">Ventilation &amp; natural light: flats with open sides, window space; avoid dark interiors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5873\" data-end=\"5950\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5875\" data-end=\"5950\">Parking allocation: covered vs open; whether visitor parking is adequate.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"5952\" data-end=\"5984\">5.5 Cost and Hidden Charges</h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5986\" data-end=\"6126\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5986\" data-end=\"6044\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5988\" data-end=\"6044\">Maintenance charges: check current rates, escalations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6045\" data-end=\"6090\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6047\" data-end=\"6090\">Property tax, society fees, parking fees.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6091\" data-end=\"6126\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6093\" data-end=\"6126\">Any dues from seller if resale.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6128\" data-end=\"6131\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6133\" data-end=\"6166\">6. Advantages &amp; Disadvantages</h3>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\r\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"6168\" data-end=\"6688\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"6168\" data-end=\"6211\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6168\" data-end=\"6211\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(53, 152, 219); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"6168\" data-end=\"6181\" data-col-size=\"md\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">Advantages</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(53, 152, 219); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"6181\" data-end=\"6211\" data-col-size=\"md\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">Disadvantages / Challenges</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"6222\" data-end=\"6688\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"6222\" data-end=\"6314\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"6222\" data-end=\"6258\" data-col-size=\"md\">Immediate possession; no waiting.</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"6258\" data-end=\"6314\" data-col-size=\"md\">Premium price vs similar size in under‑construction.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6315\" data-end=\"6454\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"6315\" data-end=\"6381\" data-col-size=\"md\">Transparent view of flat &amp; neighborhood; can inspect carefully.</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"6381\" data-end=\"6454\" data-col-size=\"md\">Some societies may have connectivity issues / missing internal roads.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6455\" data-end=\"6535\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"6455\" data-end=\"6491\" data-col-size=\"md\">Amenities likely full functional.</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"6491\" data-end=\"6535\" data-col-size=\"md\">Society maintenance charges may be high.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"6536\" data-end=\"6688\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"6536\" data-end=\"6617\" data-col-size=\"md\">Better bargaining power in resale (for ready flats in lesser‑known societies).</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"6617\" data-end=\"6688\" data-col-size=\"md\">Resale flats may have wear &amp; tear; some renovation may be required.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6690\" data-end=\"6693\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6695\" data-end=\"6727\">7. Tips to Get the Best Deal</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"6729\" data-end=\"7206\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6729\" data-end=\"6852\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6732\" data-end=\"6852\"><strong data-start=\"6732\" data-end=\"6762\">Compare multiple societies</strong> in same sector to understand what price differences exist for amenities, facing, floor.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6853\" data-end=\"6945\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6856\" data-end=\"6945\"><strong data-start=\"6856\" data-end=\"6882\">Negotiate with sellers</strong> on aspects like parking cost, furnishings, or minor repairs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6946\" data-end=\"7041\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6949\" data-end=\"7041\"><strong data-start=\"6949\" data-end=\"6973\">Check resale history</strong> in that society to see how much similar flats were sold recently.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7042\" data-end=\"7130\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7045\" data-end=\"7130\">Make sure <strong data-start=\"7055\" data-end=\"7082\">all documents are clear</strong> before payment. Use escrow or bank approvals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7131\" data-end=\"7206\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7134\" data-end=\"7206\">Factor in <strong data-start=\"7144\" data-end=\"7161\">ongoing costs</strong> &ndash; maintenance, society charges, utilities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7208\" data-end=\"7211\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7213\" data-end=\"7242\">8. Market &amp; Price Outlook</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7244\" data-end=\"7697\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7244\" data-end=\"7421\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7246\" data-end=\"7421\">Dwarka Expressway property prices have <strong data-start=\"7285\" data-end=\"7296\">doubled</strong> in recent years due to better connectivity, road completion, and increased demand.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7422\" data-end=\"7577\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7424\" data-end=\"7577\">Experts believe prices may continue rising at <strong data-start=\"7470\" data-end=\"7480\">10‑20%</strong> over next few years given infrastructure improvements (metro, improved roads, more amenities).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7578\" data-end=\"7697\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7580\" data-end=\"7697\">For buyers, buying a ready flat now may protect you from future price inflation and also give rental income sooner.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7699\" data-end=\"7702\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7720\" data-end=\"8193\">If you\'re seeking a ready‑to‑move 3 BHK flat on Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, this is a golden window. With many good options already available, you can enjoy the benefits of immediate occupancy, transparent quality, and strong investment potential. Just make sure to do your homework&mdash;legal checks, site visits, comparing options. With the right choice, you can get excellent value for money, a home that meets your expectations, and a property that grows in value over time.</p>', 'Looking for ready-to-move 3 BHK flats in Gurgaon?', 'Ready‑to‑Move 3 BHK Flats on Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon — A Smart Home‑Buyer’s Guide', 'ready to move 3 BHK flats Dwarka Expressway, 3 BHK apartments Gurgaon, 3 BHK flats for sale Dwarka Expressway, ready flats Gurgaon, buy 3 BHK Dwarka Expressway, ready to move flats near Delhi, 3 BHK property Dwarka Expressway, luxury 3 BHK flats Gurgaon, RERA approved flats Dwarka Expressway, ready possession 3 BHK Gurgaon, best 3 BHK flats Gurgaon, flats near IGI Airport Gurgaon', 'Explore ready-to-move 3 BHK flats on Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon. Prime location, best prices, luxury amenities & excellent connectivity.', 'A2P Realtech', 0, 1, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `offer` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `des1`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `by_blog`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(126, 'New Flats on Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '20251013075832_New-Flats-on-Dwarka-Expressway-Gurgaon.jpg', '<h1 data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"418\">New Flats on Dwarka Expressway &ndash; Near Metro, Airport &amp; Cyber City</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"837\">The Dwarka Expressway corridor in NCR continues to be one of the hottest real‐estate zones. With improved infrastructure, upcoming transit links, and strong demand from buyers wanting proximity to both Delhi and Gurgaon, new flats here are highly prized. If you\'re considering buying, here&rsquo;s a deep dive into why flats on Dwarka Expressway are in demand, what new projects are surfacing, and what you should look for.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"842\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"887\">1. Why Dwarka Expressway Is So Desirable</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"918\">a. Strategic Connectivity</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<li data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<p data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"1129\">The expressway connects <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"964\">Dwarka (Delhi)</strong> to <strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"994\">Kherki Daula (Gurgaon)</strong>, creating an alternate route which alleviates traffic on NH‑48 and other overloaded corridors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1407\">A proposed metro corridor has been approved: from <strong data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1226\">HUDA City Centre to Cyber City (Gurgaon)</strong> with a <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1247\">spur line</strong> to Dwarka Expressway. This 28.5 km elevated metro line (27 stations) will significantly improve last‑mile connectivity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1596\">There&rsquo;s also a <strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1442\">5.1 km tunnel</strong> being built to connect IGI Airport and NH‑48 via Dwarka Expressway, which will reduce travel time and congestion.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1638\">b. Appreciation &amp; Real Estate Trends</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1854\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1854\">Prices along Dwarka Expressway have almost <strong data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1709\">doubled in 4&ndash;5 years</strong>. For example, average rates rose from ~ <strong data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1778\">₹9,434 per sq ft in 2020</strong> to ~ <strong data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1813\">₹18,668+ per sq ft in 2024</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"2031\">There is strong demand for 3‑BHK and 4‑BHK flats; many of the new launches and absorption over past years have been in these segments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2064\">c. Amenity &amp; Lifestyle Pull</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2352\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2211\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2211\">Developers are designing projects with <strong data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2127\">luxury amenities</strong>, green/open spaces, wellness features, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2352\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2352\">Projects are often RERA approved, with sustainable features (green architecture) &amp; better layouts.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2397\">2. Key New Projects You Should Know</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2519\">Here are a few of the new or soon‑launching flat/apartment projects on Dwarka Expressway that are especially noteworthy:</p>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\r\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTa