>3 BHK</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">4BHK</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.469px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.95pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">957-1080</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">1243-1485</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2890-3921</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.672px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"143\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">New Launch</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 16; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 27.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 230.156px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.95pt;\" width=\"174\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Chintamanis 103</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.9688px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.95pt;\" width=\"110\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Oxirich Group</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 119.141px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.95pt;\" width=\"89\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2029</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 184.594px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">3 BHK+Servant Room, </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">4 BHK+Servant Room,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Pent House</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 148.469px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.95pt;\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">1845-2355</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2516</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">3682-5033</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 162.672px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 27.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"143\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Under Construction</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4388\" data-end=\"4391\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4434\">3. Price Ranges &amp; What Influences Them</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4556\">To make an informed decision, you&rsquo;ll want to understand how much flats cost, and what factors push the price up or down.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4558\" data-end=\"5217\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4558\" data-end=\"4735\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4735\"><strong data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4584\">Current average rate</strong>: Many flats are priced between <strong data-start=\"4616\" data-end=\"4648\">₹15,000 to₹25,000 per sq ft</strong> depending on sector, builder, and amenities.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4998\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4738\" data-end=\"4998\">Ultra‑luxury, large 4 or 5 BHK flats (especially in top sectors like 106, 113) push into much higher bracket. For example, some 4‑bedroom homes have been priced between <strong data-start=\"4907\" data-end=\"4935\">₹4.8 crore to ₹8.6 crore</strong> (depending on size).&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4999\" data-end=\"5217\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5217\">Affordability is better in sectors further from the core, or in projects with fewer premium features. Projects in Sectors 103, 80, possibly 112 offer relatively better value.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5219\" data-end=\"5245\"><strong data-start=\"5219\" data-end=\"5236\">Price drivers</strong> include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5247\" data-end=\"5597\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5247\" data-end=\"5322\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5249\" data-end=\"5322\">Distance to key transit points (metro stations, airport, main highways)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5323\" data-end=\"5367\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5325\" data-end=\"5367\">Reputation and track record of developer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5368\" data-end=\"5454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5370\" data-end=\"5454\">The layout and size (bigger flats cost more per sq ft, especially penthouses etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5455\" data-end=\"5520\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5457\" data-end=\"5520\">Amenities: pool, clubhouse, landscaping, green certifications</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5521\" data-end=\"5597\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5523\" data-end=\"5597\">Infrastructure around (roads, water supply, sewerage, power backup etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5599\" data-end=\"5602\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5604\" data-end=\"5657\">4. Connectivity: Metro, Airport, Cyber City &amp; More</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5659\" data-end=\"5781\">One of the main selling points of these flats is how close they are (or will be) to major infrastructure and transit hubs.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5783\" data-end=\"6868\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5783\" data-end=\"6140\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5785\" data-end=\"6140\"><strong data-start=\"5785\" data-end=\"5794\">Metro</strong>: As mentioned, the metro corridor between HUDA City Centre &rarr; Cyber City with a spur to Dwarka Expressway (Sector 101 / Basai Village) is approved and in planning / early execution. This will significantly reduce travel time, especially for those commuting into Gurgaon or to business hubs in Cyber City.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6141\" data-end=\"6397\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6143\" data-end=\"6397\"><strong data-start=\"6143\" data-end=\"6158\">IGI Airport</strong>: The expressway and the tunnel link to NH‑48 improves access to IGI Airport from Gurgaon / Expressway sectors. Once the tunnel is fully operational, it reduces travel time and traffic bottlenecks.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6398\" data-end=\"6626\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6400\" data-end=\"6626\"><strong data-start=\"6400\" data-end=\"6414\">Cyber City</strong>: Many buyers work in or near Cyber City. Having Metro + Expressway + good road access makes flats in Dwarka Expressway appealing because you can reach Cyber City more reliably, avoiding huge peak time traffic.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6627\" data-end=\"6868\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6629\" data-end=\"6868\">Also, improvements in <strong data-start=\"6651\" data-end=\"6674\">road infrastructure</strong> (widening, flyovers, smoother linkages) are being done. Bus depots proposed, and relocation of toll plazas (like Kherki Daula) will help reduce delays.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6870\" data-end=\"6873\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"6875\" data-end=\"6920\">5. What to Watch Out For / Buyer Checklist</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6922\" data-end=\"7020\">When buying new flats in this area, here are things that buyers often miss but are very important:</p>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\r\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"7022\" data-end=\"7981\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"7022\" data-end=\"7049\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"7022\" data-end=\"7049\">\r\n<th style=\"background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7022\" data-end=\"7031\" data-col-size=\"md\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">Factor</span></th>\r\n<th style=\"background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7031\" data-end=\"7049\" data-col-size=\"lg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">Why It Matters</span></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"7060\" data-end=\"7981\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"7060\" data-end=\"7201\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7060\" data-end=\"7130\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7062\" data-end=\"7129\">Legal Approvals (RERA, building permits, environment clearance)</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7130\" data-end=\"7201\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Ensures project is legitimate, helps avoid delays or legal hassles.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7202\" data-end=\"7341\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7202\" data-end=\"7233\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7204\" data-end=\"7232\">Possession date &amp; delays</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"7233\" data-end=\"7341\">Infrastructure delays or changes in regulation can delay possession. Know the track record of developer.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7342\" data-end=\"7523\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7342\" data-end=\"7383\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7344\" data-end=\"7382\">Connectivity promised vs. existing</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7383\" data-end=\"7523\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Some features (metro, tunnel, roads) are still under construction or in planning. Ensure what is promised is feasible and see timelines.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7524\" data-end=\"7676\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7524\" data-end=\"7562\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7526\" data-end=\"7561\">Amenities and maintenance costs</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7562\" data-end=\"7676\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Good amenities are great, but they come with recurring costs. Check society maintenance charges, upkeep costs.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7677\" data-end=\"7823\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7677\" data-end=\"7696\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7679\" data-end=\"7695\">Hidden costs</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7696\" data-end=\"7823\" data-col-size=\"lg\">PLC (Preferential Location Charges), parking charges, GST, legal fees, stamp duty, broker commission etc. These can add up.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"7824\" data-end=\"7981\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7824\" data-end=\"7856\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"7826\" data-end=\"7855\">Resale / rental potential</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"7856\" data-end=\"7981\" data-col-size=\"lg\">If you may move later, how easy will resale be? How good is rental demand? Proximity to transit &amp; business centres helps.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7983\" data-end=\"7986\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7988\" data-end=\"8024\">6. Summary: Who Should Buy &amp; When</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8026\" data-end=\"8614\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8026\" data-end=\"8208\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8028\" data-end=\"8208\"><strong data-start=\"8028\" data-end=\"8041\">Ideal for</strong>: Professionals working in Gurgaon / Delhi / near IGI Airport / Cyber City; buyers wanting a future‑ready home; those who want premium amenities + good connectivity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8209\" data-end=\"8461\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8211\" data-end=\"8461\"><strong data-start=\"8211\" data-end=\"8226\">Best timing</strong>: If you find a good pre‑launch or early launch from a credible builder in a well‑connected sector, that could give you better value (lower price, more choice). Once projects finish and amenities join up, prices will continue rising.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8462\" data-end=\"8614\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8464\" data-end=\"8614\"><strong data-start=\"8464\" data-end=\"8478\">Trade‑offs</strong>: If you pay premium for connectivity, you may have to compromise on size or accept that some infrastructure is still under development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8616\" data-end=\"8619\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"266\">🏆 Contact <strong data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"200\">A2P Realtech</strong> &ndash; Your Trusted Partner for Luxury Properties on Dwarka Expressway</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"376\">Looking for the best deals on <strong data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"347\">luxury apartments, flats, villas, or duplexes</strong> along <strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"375\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>?</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"696\">🔹 <strong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"397\">A2P Realtech</strong> is the <strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"457\">first choice of serious investors and homebuyers</strong> seeking premium properties in this high-growth corridor.<br data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"517\">🔹 With a proven track record and in-depth market knowledge, A2P Realtech offers <strong data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"647\">exclusive inventory, early access to launches</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"675\">negotiated pricing</strong> with top developers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"729\">🏅 Why Choose A2P Realtech?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"1142\">\r\n<li data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"831\">\r\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"831\">✅ Awarded by <strong data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"767\">Top 10 Developers</strong> for excellence in <strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"829\">Dwarka Expressway luxury property sales</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n<p data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"947\">✅ Specialists in <strong data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"884\">RERA-approved luxury projects</strong>: 3, 4 &amp; 5 BHK Apartments, High-End Villas, Duplex Penthouses</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1007\">\r\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1007\">✅ Personalized investment advice and end-to-end support</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1142\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1142\">✅ Strong presence in <strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1053\">Sectors 102 to 113</strong>, including top projects by Sobha, Godrej, Central Park, Whiteland, Smart World, and more</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1322\">📞 <strong data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1177\">Contact A2P Realtech Today</strong> to schedule a site visit or get access to <strong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1241\">pre-launch offers</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1265\">exclusive deals</strong> on the most sought-after homes on <strong data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1321\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>.</p>', 'Luxury flats on Dwarka Expressway', 'New Flats on Dwarka Expressway – Near Metro, Airport & Cyber City', 'Dwarka Expressway flats, luxury apartments Dwarka Expressway, flats for sale Gurgaon, Dwarka Expressway property, 3 BHK apartment Dwarka Expressway, 4 BHK flats Gurgaon, new launch projects Dwarka Expressway, ready to move flats Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech, villas on Dwarka Expressway, duplex apartments Gurgaon, invest in Dwarka Expressway, top real estate agents Gurgaon, RERA approved flats Dwarka Expressway', 'Discover why Dwarka Expressway is the top real estate hotspot for luxury living and smart investment. This blog covers the latest new flat launches, premium apartments, villas, and duplexes, and key advantages like metro connectivity, proximity to IGI Airport, and access to Cyber City. Learn about upcoming projects, price trends, and how A2P Realtech, an award-winning real estate partner, can help you secure the best deals from top developers. Whether you\'re buying your dream home or investing for the future — this guide has everything you need.', 'A2P Realtech', 0, 1, NULL, NULL);
