data-start=\"7442\" data-end=\"7483\">7.2 Understand Possession Timelines</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7484\" data-end=\"7613\">Projects under pre-launch or early-launch phases may have extended delivery timelines. Factor this into your investment strategy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7615\" data-end=\"7664\">7.3 Assess Connectivity &amp; Local Development</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7665\" data-end=\"7793\">Study upcoming roads, metro plans, hospital and school availability, as these significantly impact rentability and resale value.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7795\" data-end=\"7838\">7.4 Evaluate Long-Term Growth Drivers</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7839\" data-end=\"7976\">Areas with expanding employment centres, industrial developments, and increasing urbanisation tend to see stronger property price growth.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7978\" data-end=\"7981\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7983\" data-end=\"8040\">Section 8: Community &amp; Lifestyle Around Smartworld GIC</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8042\" data-end=\"8098\">Beyond the project itself, the neighbourhood adds value:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8100\" data-end=\"8574\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8100\" data-end=\"8252\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8102\" data-end=\"8252\"><strong data-start=\"8102\" data-end=\"8137\">Quality Schools and Healthcare:</strong> Established and reputed institutions are within reachable commute zones.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8253\" data-end=\"8400\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8255\" data-end=\"8400\"><strong data-start=\"8255\" data-end=\"8279\">Retail &amp; Essentials:</strong> Daily conveniences and retail hubs are planned within and around the township.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8401\" data-end=\"8574\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8403\" data-end=\"8574\"><strong data-start=\"8403\" data-end=\"8427\">Recreational Spaces:</strong> Parks, green belts, and open areas improve quality of life and appeal to families and professionals alike.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8576\" data-end=\"8579\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"85