gurations</strong> <em data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"357\">without overcommitting to unverifiable specs</em> (important for credibility and compliance).</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"424\">You can use this for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"543\">\r\n<li data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"457\">\r\n<p data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"457\">Website &ldquo;About Project&rdquo; page</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"483\">\r\n<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"483\">Investor presentation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"511\">\r\n<p data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"511\">Luxury brochure content</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"543\">\r\n<p data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"543\">Channel partner pitch decks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"548\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"596\">**Live Grand Today. Build Wealth Tomorrow.</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"645\">Sobha 63A, Golf Course Extension Road, Gurgaon**</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"733\"><strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"733\">An Ultra-Luxury Address Designed for Elevated Living and Intelligent Investment</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"1062\">In a city that constantly reinvents itself, very few addresses truly stand the test of time. <strong data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"841\">Sobha 63A</strong>, located on the prestigious <strong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"909\">Golf Course Extension Road, Gurgaon</strong>, is one such landmark development&mdash;created for discerning homeowners and forward-looking investors who value <strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1061\">quality, location, and long-term growth</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1442\">This is not just another residential project. Sobha 63A represents a <strong data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1174\">carefully curated lifestyle ecosystem</strong>, where ultra-luxury living converges with one of Gurgaon&rsquo;s strongest appreciation corridors. Whether you are planning to <strong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1350\">live in it, lease it, or hold it as a legacy asset</strong>, Sobha 63A offers a rare balance of <strong data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1441\">present-day grandeur and future financial security</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1494\"><strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1494\">Why Sobha 63A Is More Than Just a Home</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1708\">Luxury today is no longer limited to aesthetics. True luxury lies in <strong data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1633\">space, privacy, craftsmanship, connectivity, and long-term value</strong>. Sobha 63A embodies all of these pillars, making it equally attractive to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1875\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1785\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1785\"><strong data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1725\">End users</strong> seeking a refined, comfortable, and prestigious lifestyle</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1875\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1875\"><strong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1801\">Investors</strong> looking for consistent appreciation, rental demand, and asset stability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"2039\">Backed by <strong data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1947\">Sobha&rsquo;s unmatched reputation for construction excellence</strong>, this project is designed to deliver value not just at possession, but for decades to come.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2044\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2101\"><strong data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2101\">A Location That Guarantees Lifestyle and Returns</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2167\"><strong data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2167\">Golf Course Extension Road &ndash; Gurgaon&rsquo;s Growth Powerhouse</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2463\">Golf Course Extension Road has emerged as one of the <strong data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2272\">most sought-after residential corridors in NCR</strong>, and for good reason. Unlike saturated micro-markets, this region continues to witness <strong data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2427\">infrastructure upgrades, premium development, and rising demand</strong> from both end users and corporates.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2501\"><strong data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2501\">Key location advantages include:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2580\">Seamless connectivity to <strong data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2549\">Golf Course Road</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2565\">Sohna Road</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2580\">NH-48</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2652\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2652\">Smooth access to <strong data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2652\">Cyber City, Udyog Vihar, and major business hubs</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2740\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2740\">Close proximity to <strong data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2708\">Southern Peripheral Road (SPR)</strong>, further enhancing connectivity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2828\">Rapidly developing commercial and social infrastructure boosting capital appreciation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"3002\">For investors, this translates into <strong data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2890\">strong ROI potential</strong>. For residents, it means <strong data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"3001\">shorter commutes, better lifestyle access, and a premium neighborhood environment</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3007\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3057\"><strong data-start=\"3012\" data-end=\"3057\">High ROI Potential Backed by Fundamentals</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3102\"><strong data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3102\">Why Sobha 63A Makes Financial Sense</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3227\">Real estate investment is ultimately about <strong data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3188\">location, brand, scarcity, and demand</strong>&mdash;and Sobha 63A scores high on all four.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3256\"><strong data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3256\">Key investment drivers:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3581\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3336\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3336\">Limited supply of <strong data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3304\">ultra-luxury residences</strong> on Golf Course Extension Road</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3421\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3421\">Strong demand from senior professionals, CXOs, and HNIs for premium rental homes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3495\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3424\" data-end=\"3495\">Sobha&rsquo;s brand equity ensuring <strong data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3495\">resale confidence and price stability</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3496\" data-end=\"3581\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3581\">Infrastructure-led appreciation driven by road connectivity and commercial growth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3583\" data-end=\"3614\">This makes Sobha 63A ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3724\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3651\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3651\"><strong data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3651\">Long-term capital appreciation</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3678\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3678\"><strong data-start=\"3654\" data-end=\"3678\">Premium rental yield</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3724\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3681\" data-end=\"3724\"><strong data-start=\"3681\" data-end=\"3724\">Wealth preservation in a tangible asset</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3729\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3783\"><strong data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3783\">Thoughtfully Designed Ultra-Luxury Residences</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3825\"><strong data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3825\">Flat Configurations at Sobha 63A</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3977\">Sobha 63A offers <strong data-start=\"3844\" data-end=\"3890\">spacious, intelligently planned residences</strong>, designed to cater to modern luxury preferences while maintaining privacy and comfort.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4011\"><strong data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"4011\">Available Configurations</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4078\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4047\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4047\"><strong data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4047\">3 BHK Ultra-Luxury Apartments</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4078\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4078\"><strong data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4078\">4 BHK Premium Residences</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4080\" data-end=\"4133\">Each configuration is thoughtfully planned to ensure:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4165\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4136\" data-end=\"4165\">Optimal <strong data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4165\">space utilization</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4217\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4217\">Excellent <strong data-start=\"4178\" data-end=\"4217\">natural light and cross ventilation</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4218\" data-end=\"4284\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4220\" data-end=\"4284\">Clear demarcation between <strong data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4284\">living, dining, and private spaces</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4285\" data-end=\"4345\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4345\">Large balconies that extend the living experience outdoors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4347\" data-end=\"4373\">These homes are ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4520\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4421\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4421\">Families seeking <strong data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4421\">spacious, elegant living</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4422\" data-end=\"4475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4424\" data-end=\"4475\">Professionals looking for a <strong data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4475\">prestigious address</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4476\" data-end=\"4520\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4478\" data-end=\"4520\">Investors targeting <strong data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4520\">high-value tenants</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4522\" data-end=\"4525\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4527\" data-end=\"4587\"><strong data-start=\"4530\" data-end=\"4587\">3 BHK Residences &ndash; Refined Luxury for Modern Families</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4730\">The <strong data-start=\"4593\" data-end=\"4613\">3 BHK apartments</strong> at Sobha 63A are designed for those who want <strong data-start=\"4659\" data-end=\"4692\">generous space without excess</strong>, blending practicality with elegance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4732\" data-end=\"4751\"><strong data-start=\"4732\" data-end=\"4751\">Key highlights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4752\" data-end=\"4980\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4752\" data-end=\"4814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4814\">Expansive living and dining areas perfect for entertaining</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4815\" data-end=\"4874\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4817\" data-end=\"4874\">Well-proportioned bedrooms offering privacy and comfort</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"4928\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4877\" data-end=\"4928\">Modern kitchens designed for efficiency and style</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4929\" data-end=\"4980\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4980\">Balconies that offer serene views and fresh air</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4982\" data-end=\"5008\">These homes are ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5108\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5009\" data-end=\"5029\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5011\" data-end=\"5029\">Growing families</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5030\" data-end=\"5054\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5032\" data-end=\"5054\">Senior professionals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5055\" data-end=\"5108\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5057\" data-end=\"5108\">End users upgrading from mid-segment luxury homes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5269\">From an investment standpoint, 3 BHK units typically enjoy <strong data-start=\"5169\" data-end=\"5193\">strong rental demand</strong> due to their versatility and affordability within the ultra-luxury segment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5271\" data-end=\"5274\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5276\" data-end=\"5324\"><strong data-start=\"5279\" data-end=\"5324\">4 BHK Residences &ndash; Grand Living Redefined</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5326\" data-end=\"5438\">The <strong data-start=\"5330\" data-end=\"5350\">4 BHK residences</strong> at Sobha 63A redefine luxury for those who desire <strong data-start=\"5401\" data-end=\"5437\">space, exclusivity, and prestige</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5440\" data-end=\"5461\"><strong data-start=\"5440\" data-end=\"5461\">Features include:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5712\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5523\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5464\" data-end=\"5523\">Large living and dining spaces for hosting and gatherings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5524\" data-end=\"5586\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5526\" data-end=\"5586\">Spacious master bedrooms with luxurious en-suite bathrooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5587\" data-end=\"5649\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5589\" data-end=\"5649\">Multiple balconies enhancing openness and lifestyle appeal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5650\" data-end=\"5712\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5652\" data-end=\"5712\">Dedicated areas for home office, study, or private lounges</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5714\" data-end=\"5747\">These residences are perfect for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5748\" data-end=\"5846\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5748\" data-end=\"5766\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5750\" data-end=\"5766\">Large families</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5767\" data-end=\"5795\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5769\" data-end=\"5795\">HNIs and business owners</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5796\" data-end=\"5846\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5798\" data-end=\"5846\">Buyers seeking a <strong data-start=\"5815\" data-end=\"5833\">statement home</strong> in Gurgaon</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5848\" data-end=\"5976\">From an investment lens, 4 BHK units attract <strong data-start=\"5893\" data-end=\"5936\">elite tenants and premium resale buyers</strong>, ensuring long-term value appreciation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5978\" data-end=\"5981\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5983\" data-end=\"6041\"><strong data-start=\"5986\" data-end=\"6041\">Architectural Excellence and Superior Craftsmanship</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6043\" data-end=\"6184\">Sobha&rsquo;s reputation is built on <strong data-start=\"6074\" data-end=\"6110\">backward-integrated construction</strong>, meaning they control quality at every stage&mdash;from materials to execution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6186\" data-end=\"6223\">At Sobha 63A, residents benefit from:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6224\" data-end=\"6395\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6224\" data-end=\"6259\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6226\" data-end=\"6259\">Superior structural engineering</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6260\" data-end=\"6298\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6262\" data-end=\"6298\">High-quality fittings and finishes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6299\" data-end=\"6342\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6301\" data-end=\"6342\">Precision-driven construction standards</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6343\" data-end=\"6395\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6345\" data-end=\"6395\">Homes designed for longevity and low maintenance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6397\" data-end=\"6441\">This commitment to quality directly impacts:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6442\" data-end=\"6530\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6442\" data-end=\"6471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6444\" data-end=\"6471\"><strong data-start=\"6444\" data-end=\"6471\">Lower maintenance costs</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6472\" data-end=\"6497\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6474\" data-end=\"6497\"><strong data-start=\"6474\" data-end=\"6497\">Higher resale value</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6498\" data-end=\"6530\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6500\" data-end=\"6530\"><strong data-start=\"6500\" data-end=\"6530\">Long-term asset durability</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6532\" data-end=\"6535\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"6537\" data-end=\"6587\"><strong data-start=\"6540\" data-end=\"6587\">World-Class Amenities for a Grand Lifestyle</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6589\" data-end=\"6749\">Luxury living extends beyond the four walls of your home. Sobha 63A offers a <strong data-start=\"6666\" data-end=\"6712\">comprehensive suite of lifestyle amenities</strong>, designed to enrich everyday living.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6751\" data-end=\"6789\"><strong data-start=\"6755\" data-end=\"6789\">Lifestyle &amp; Wellness Amenities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6790\" data-end=\"6972\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6790\" data-end=\"6836\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6792\" data-end=\"6836\">Grand clubhouse with elegant social spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6837\" data-end=\"6872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6839\" data-end=\"6872\">State-of-the-art fitness center</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6873\" data-end=\"6929\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6875\" data-end=\"6929\">Swimming pool designed for relaxation and recreation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6930\" data-end=\"6972\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6932\" data-end=\"6972\">Wellness zones for yoga and meditation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6974\" data-end=\"7002\"><strong data-start=\"6978\" data-end=\"7002\">Recreation &amp; Leisure</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7003\" data-end=\"7156\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7003\" data-end=\"7047\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7005\" data-end=\"7047\">Landscaped gardens and green open spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7048\" data-end=\"7078\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7050\" data-end=\"7078\">Walking and jogging tracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7079\" data-end=\"7114\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7081\" data-end=\"7114\">Dedicated children&rsquo;s play areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7115\" data-end=\"7156\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7117\" data-end=\"7156\">Indoor and outdoor recreational zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7158\" data-end=\"7186\"><strong data-start=\"7162\" data-end=\"7186\">Safety &amp; Convenience</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7187\" data-end=\"7304\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7187\" data-end=\"7216\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7189\" data-end=\"7216\">Advanced security systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7217\" data-end=\"7245\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7219\" data-end=\"7245\">Controlled access points</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7246\" data-end=\"7271\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7248\" data-end=\"7271\">Well-lit common areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7272\" data-end=\"7304\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7274\" data-end=\"7304\">Dedicated parking facilities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7306\" data-end=\"7330\">These amenities enhance:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7331\" data-end=\"7404\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7331\" data-end=\"7364\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7333\" data-end=\"7364\">Quality of life for end users</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7365\" data-end=\"7404\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7367\" data-end=\"7404\">Rental attractiveness for investors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7406\" data-end=\"7409\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7411\" data-end=\"7461\"><strong data-start=\"7414\" data-end=\"7461\">A Low-Density, Exclusive Living Environment</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7463\" data-end=\"7552\">Unlike overcrowded developments, Sobha 63A emphasizes <strong data-start=\"7517\" data-end=\"7541\">low-density planning</strong>, ensuring:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7553\" data-end=\"7626\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7553\" data-end=\"7573\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7555\" data-end=\"7573\">More open spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7574\" data-end=\"7593\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7576\" data-end=\"7593\">Greater privacy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7594\" data-end=\"7626\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7596\" data-end=\"7626\">Reduced noise and congestion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7628\" data-end=\"7675\">This makes the project especially appealing to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7676\" data-end=\"7767\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7676\" data-end=\"7702\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7678\" data-end=\"7702\">Families with children</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7703\" data-end=\"7723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7705\" data-end=\"7723\">Senior residents</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7724\" data-end=\"7767\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7726\" data-end=\"7767\">Buyers seeking peaceful, refined living</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7769\" data-end=\"7772\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7774\" data-end=\"7824\"><strong data-start=\"7777\" data-end=\"7824\">Surrounded by Premium Social Infrastructure</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7826\" data-end=\"7891\">Living at Sobha 63A means being close to everything that matters.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7893\" data-end=\"7925\"><strong data-start=\"7897\" data-end=\"7925\">Educational Institutions</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7926\" data-end=\"8019\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7926\" data-end=\"7975\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7928\" data-end=\"7975\">Reputed international and CBSE schools nearby</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7976\" data-end=\"8019\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7978\" data-end=\"8019\">Easy access to premium educational hubs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8021\" data-end=\"8039\"><strong data-start=\"8025\" data-end=\"8039\">Healthcare</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8040\" data-end=\"8154\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8040\" data-end=\"8107\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8042\" data-end=\"8107\">Leading multi-specialty hospitals within short driving distance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8108\" data-end=\"8154\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8110\" data-end=\"8154\">24/7 medical facilities in close proximity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8156\" data-end=\"8186\"><strong data-start=\"8160\" data-end=\"8186\">Retail &amp; Entertainment</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8187\" data-end=\"8284\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8187\" data-end=\"8205\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8189\" data-end=\"8205\">High-end malls</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8206\" data-end=\"8233\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8208\" data-end=\"8233\">Fine-dining restaurants</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8234\" data-end=\"8284\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8236\" data-end=\"8284\">Caf&eacute;s, multiplexes, and lifestyle destinations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8286\" data-end=\"8403\">This ecosystem not only enhances daily convenience but also significantly boosts <strong data-start=\"8367\" data-end=\"8402\">property desirability and value</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8405\" data-end=\"8408\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"8410\" data-end=\"8447\"><strong data-start=\"8413\" data-end=\"8447\">Why End Users Choose Sobha 63A</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8449\" data-end=\"8482\">For homeowners, Sobha 63A offers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8483\" data-end=\"8635\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8483\" data-end=\"8508\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8485\" data-end=\"8508\">A prestigious address</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8509\" data-end=\"8542\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8511\" data-end=\"8542\">Superior construction quality</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8543\" data-end=\"8584\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8545\" data-end=\"8584\">Spacious, thoughtfully designed homes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8585\" data-end=\"8635\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8587\" data-end=\"8635\">A safe, secure, and well-connected environment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8637\" data-end=\"8719\">It is a place where families can <strong data-start=\"8670\" data-end=\"8718\">grow, celebrate, and create lasting memories</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8721\" data-end=\"8724\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"8726\" data-end=\"8762\"><strong data-start=\"8729\" data-end=\"8762\">Why Investors Trust Sobha 63A</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8764\" data-end=\"8798\">For investors, Sobha 63A delivers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8799\" data-end=\"8953\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8799\" data-end=\"8840\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8801\" data-end=\"8840\">Strong capital appreciation potential</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8841\" data-end=\"8884\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8843\" data-end=\"8884\">High rental demand from premium tenants</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8885\" data-end=\"8916\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8887\" data-end=\"8916\">Brand-backed asset security</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8917\" data-end=\"8953\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8919\" data-end=\"8953\">Location-driven growth prospects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8955\" data-end=\"9044\">It is an investment that combines <strong data-start=\"8989\" data-end=\"9043\">emotional satisfaction with financial intelligence</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9046\" data-end=\"9049\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"9051\" data-end=\"9087\"><strong data-start=\"9054\" data-end=\"9087\">A Legacy Asset for the Future</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9089\" data-end=\"9264\">Real estate decisions made today shape financial security tomorrow. Sobha 63A is not just a purchase&mdash;it is a <strong data-start=\"9198\" data-end=\"9219\">legacy investment</strong>, designed to deliver returns in the form of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9265\" data-end=\"9334\">\r\n<li data-start=\"9265\" data-end=\"9289\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9267\" data-end=\"9289\">Lifestyle enrichment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9290\" data-end=\"9310\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9292\" data-end=\"9310\">Financial growth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9311\" data-end=\"9334\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9313\" data-end=\"9334\">Long-term stability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9336\" data-end=\"9339\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"9341\" data-end=\"9401\"><strong data-start=\"9344\" data-end=\"9401\">Where Luxury Living Meets Smart Investing</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9403\" data-end=\"9606\"><strong data-start=\"9403\" data-end=\"9444\">Sobha 63A, Golf Course Extension Road</strong>, stands at the intersection of <strong data-start=\"9476\" data-end=\"9499\">grandeur and growth</strong>. It is a destination where you don&rsquo;t have to choose between living well and investing wisely&mdash;you get both.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"9608\" data-end=\"9652\"><strong data-start=\"9608\" data-end=\"9652\">Live Grand Today. Build Wealth Tomorrow.</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>', 'Sobha 63A 3 BHK price', 'An Iconic Address at Sobha 63A – Designed to Live In, Priced to Appreciate', 'Sobha 63A, Sobha 63A Gurgaon, Sobha Golf Course Extension Road, ultra luxury apartments Gurgaon, luxury flats in Gurgaon, Sobha luxury homes, 3 BHK luxury apartments Gurgaon, 4 BHK luxury apartments Gurgaon, Golf Course Extension Road projects, luxury residential projects Gurgaon, premium apartments Gurgaon, Sobha upcoming projects, Gurgaon real estate investment, high ROI property Gurgaon, luxury homes near Golf Course Extension Road', 'Live grand today at Sobha 63A, ultra-luxury 3 & 4 BHK apartments on Golf Course Extension Road, Gurgaon. Prime location, world-class amenities, high ROI & long-term appreciation.', 'A2P Realtech', 0, 1, '', NULL);
INSERT INTO `offer` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `des1`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `by_blog`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(155, 'Sobha 63A Golf Course Gurgaon 3 and 4BHK Luxury Residences Where Elite Living Meets Smart Investment', '20260213154528_3-AND-4BHK-SOBHA-63A-GOLF-COURSE-GURGAON.jpg', '<div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:55px] grow flex\">\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:25b6a344-c5c8-4777-80fa-739be4c5f567-0\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-2\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"82d050b4-4a49-4fca-bda2-254a13a3d4c8\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"94\">Sobha 63A Gurgaon &ndash; 3 &amp; 4 BHK Luxury Residences Where Elite Living Meets Smart Investment</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"611\">In the ever-evolving skyline of Gurugram, luxury is no longer just about premium finishes and gated security&mdash;it&rsquo;s about lifestyle, connectivity, and long-term value. <strong data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"283\">Sobha 63A Gurgaon</strong> stands as a benchmark of refined urban living, offering meticulously designed 3 &amp; 4 BHK luxury residences in one of the most prestigious locations of the city. Developed by the globally reputed real estate brand <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Sobha Limited</span></span>, this project redefines what it means to live grandly while investing wisely.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"777\">If you are looking for a home that offers elegance, exclusivity, and exponential appreciation potential, Sobha 63A Gurgaon is not just a property&mdash;it is a statement.</p>\r\n<h1 data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1096\">Project Overview</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1129\"><strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1117\">Project Name:</strong>&nbsp;Sobha 63A</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1195\"><strong data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1145\">Location:</strong>&nbsp;Sector 63A, Golf Course Extension Road, Gurgaon</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1224\"><strong data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1213\">Total Area:</strong>&nbsp;12 Acres</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1248\"><strong data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1244\">Total Towers:</strong>&nbsp;5</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1280\"><strong data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1265\">Structure:</strong>&nbsp;G+40 Storeys</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1314\"><strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1312\">Configurations Available:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1340\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1340\">3 BHK &ndash; 2300 Sq.Ft.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1366\">4 BHK &ndash; 2700 Sq.Ft.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1400\">4.5 BHK &ndash; Up to 3000 Sq.Ft.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1525\">This development is designed for low-density luxury living, ensuring privacy, exclusivity, and spacious green surroundings.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"782\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"835\">Why Sector 63A Gurgaon is the Next Luxury Hotspot</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"1043\">Location has always been the biggest driver of real estate success. Sector 63A in Gurugram is strategically positioned along Golf Course Extension Road, one of the most premium real estate corridors in NCR.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1070\">Seamless Connectivity</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1119\">Direct access to Golf Course Extension Road</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1207\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1207\">Close proximity to <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Gurgaon</span></span>&rsquo;s prime business districts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1281\">Quick connectivity to <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Delhi</span></span> via NH-48</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1337\">Easy reach to <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Indira Gandhi International Airport</span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1533\">For working professionals, business owners, and NRIs, this location offers unmatched convenience. When you invest here, you invest in accessibility, and accessibility translates to appreciation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1538\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1592\">Sobha 63A Gurgaon &ndash; A Masterpiece by Sobha Limited</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1858\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Sobha Limited</span></span> is synonymous with quality construction, architectural excellence, and on-time delivery. With a legacy spanning decades and landmark projects across India and the Middle East, Sobha brings world-class craftsmanship to Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1887\">Sobha 63A Gurgaon reflects:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"2039\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1926\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1926\">Impeccable construction standards</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1962\">International design aesthetics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1999\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1999\">Attention to every minute detail</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2039\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2039\">Premium specifications and finishes</p>\r\n</li>\r\