(298, 'Max Estate', '', '', 'Max Estate 360 in Sector 36A, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon offers premium 3 & 4 BHK apartments with luxury amenities, sustainable design, and dedicated senior living. A perfect blend of comfort, wellness, and modern living.', '3 and 4 BHK Luxury Properties in MAX Estate Gurgaon', 'Max Estate 360 Gurgaon, Max Sector 36A Dwarka Expressway, Max Estate 360 3 BHK Flats, ,4 BHK Apartments Dwarka Expressway, Luxury Flats in Gurgaon, Max Estates Sector 36A  Antara Senior Living Gurgaon  Premium residential projects in Gurgaon  Buy property on Dwarka Expressway  Luxury apartments near IGI Airport,  Max Estates, Dwarka Expressway launch,  Intergenerational living Gurgaon', '', 'maxestate', 0, 1, 23),
