(303, 'SOBHA', '211024084932SObha City Gurgaon Sector 108.jpg', '<p>Welcome to Sobha City Gurgaon, where luxury living meets modern elegance. A2P Realtech presents an exquisite collection of 2 and 3 BHK apartments designed to fulfill your dream of owning a perfect home. With thoughtful architecture and world-class amenities, these apartments offer a lifestyle like no other.&nbsp;</p>', 'Welcome to Sobha City Gurgaon, where luxury living meets modern elegance. A2P Realtech presents an exquisite collection of 2 and 3 BHK apartments designed to fulfill your dream of owning a perfect home. ', 'SOBHA CITY SECTOR 108 GURGAON', 'Sobha City, A2P Realtech', 'Welcome to Sobha City Gurgaon, where luxury living meets modern elegance. A2P Realtech presents an exquisite collection of 2 and 3 BHK apartments designed to fulfill your dream of owning a perfect home. ', 'sobha', 0, 1, 23),
(304, 'Hero Homes', '291124093026PREMIUM 4BHK HOME DWARKA EXPRESSWAY-A2P REALTECH.jpg', '<p>Looking for your dream home? Look no further than Hero Homes, the perfect choice for your ideal living space. With a reputation for excellence and innovation in the real estate industry, Hero Homes offers a unique and extraordinary living experience that goes beyond your expectations. In this article, we will explore five compelling reasons why Hero Homes should be your top choice. Reason</p>\r\n<p>#1: Unrivaled Quality and Craftsmanship. Hero Homes is committed to delivering homes built to the highest industry standards. Every detail is meticulously designed with the homeowner in mind, ensuring exceptional quality and craftsmanship. Reason</p>\r\n<p>#2: Prime Locations. Hero Homes carefully selects prime locations that offer convenience, accessibility, and a vibrant lifestyle. Whether you\'re looking for a bustling city location or a peaceful suburban oasis, Hero Homes has the perfect spot for you. Reason</p>\r\n<p>#3: World-Class Amenities. Enjoy a plethora of world-class amenities at Hero Homes, designed to enhance your lifestyle and provide endless comfort and entertainment. From state-of-the-art fitness centers to lush green spaces, every detail is carefully curated. Reason</p>\r\n<p>#4: Sustainable Living. Hero Homes is dedicated to sustainable living, incorporating eco-friendly practices and technologies into their projects. Live in harmony with the environment while reducing your carbon footprint. Reason</p>\r\n<p>#5: Excellent Customer Service. Hero Homes prides itself on its commitment to exceptional customer service. Their professional and knowledgeable team is always ready to assist you at every step of the way, ensuring a seamless and stress-free home buying experience. Discover the extraordinary and make Hero Homes your top choice for your dream home.</p>', 'Hero Homes, the perfect choice for your ideal living space', 'Hero Homes should be your top choice', 'HERO Homes', 'Hero Homes offers a unique and extraordinary living experience that goes beyond your expectations', 'herohomes', 0, 1, 23),
(306, 'EXPERION', '230125060708EXPERION SECTOR 112 A2P REALTECH.jpg', '', 'Experion Windchants sector 112', 'Experion Windchants sector 112', 'Experion Windchants, Sector 112', 'Welcome to the world of Experion Windchants in Sector 112, Gurgaon, where exceptional luxury meets incredible affordability in the resale market. ', 'experion', 0, 1, 23),
(307, 'TATA Housing', '2401251101372, 3, 4, 5 BHK Apartment in Gurgaon Gateway Sector 112 (2).jpg', 'Welcome to Tata Gurgaon Gateway, the epitome of luxury and convenience in Sector 112, Gurgaon. Nestled amidst nature and designed to perfection, this residential development by Tata Realty offers a harmonious blend of contemporary living and serene surroundings. Imagine waking up to breathtaking views of lush green landscapes and enjoying an array of modern amenities at your fingertips.&amp;nbsp;', 'Tata Gurgaon Gateway 112 : The Perfect Blend of Luxury and Convenience in Sector 112, Gurgaon', 'Buy the Apartment in Tata Gurgaon Gateway Sector 112 says A2P Realtech', 'Tata Gurgaon Gateway Sector 112, A2P Realtech, Tata Housing, Tata, Apartment in Sector 112', 'Looking to buy an apartment in the vibrant city of Gurgaon? Look no further than Tata Gurgaon Gateway, the latest offering from A2P Realtech', 'tatahousing', 0, 1, 23),
(308, 'OCUS', '', 'Ocus Medley is a new Commercial Mall complex by Ocus Groups&amp;nbsp;located at Sector 99 Dwarka Exprressway', 'Ocus Medley is a new Commercial Mall complex by Ocus Groups located at Sector 99 Dwarka Exprressway', 'Ocus Medley', 'Ocus Medley, Commercial Mall, Complex', 'Ocus Medley is a new Commercial Mall complex by Ocus Groups located at Sector 99 Dwarka Exprressway', 'ocus', 0, 1, 23),
