(153, 'M3M Capital Walk Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '070225085304M3M_Capital_Walk113.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>24x7 Uninterrupted Power Supply</li>\r\n<li>24X7 Water Supply</li>\r\n<li>Amphitheater</li>\r\n<li>Banquet Hall</li>\r\n<li>Business Center</li>\r\n<li>Cafeteria</li>\r\n<li>Car Parking</li>\r\n<li>Carrom Board</li>\r\n<li>CCTV</li>\r\n<li>Children\'s Play Area</li>\r\n<li>Club House</li>\r\n<li>Community Hall</li>\r\n<li>Day Care Center</li>\r\n<li>Entrance Lobby</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 271, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p>M3M Capital Walk in Sector 113, Gurgaon, is a premium commercial project that offers a range of retail and business spaces. Strategically located along the Dwarka Expressway, this project caters to modern retail needs with a vibrant mix of shops, dining options, and entertainment zones. M3M Capital Walk is designed with contemporary architecture, featuring wide boulevards, spacious storefronts, and ample parking facilities. Its prime location ensures excellent footfall and connectivity, making it an ideal destination for businesses looking to establish a presence in a thriving commercial hub.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>M3M Capital Walk Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon is a commercial development by M3M India, strategically located in Sector 113, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. This project offers a blend of retail spaces, office areas, entertainment zones, and dining options, aiming to create a comprehensive commercial hub.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>M3M Capital Walk Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon Price</strong></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 84.0273%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 51.0393%;\"><col style=\"width: 48.9607%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>FLOOR&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>SIZE</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Ground Floor</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">373 - 3201 SQ.FT&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Lower Ground Floor</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">373 - 3201 SQ.FT&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">First Floor</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">373 - 3201 SQ.FT&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Second Floor</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">373 - 3201 SQ.FT&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Location:</strong> Situated at the junction of Delhi and Gurgaon, M3M Capital Walk provides excellent connectivity to major landmarks, including the Indira Gandhi International Airport, Dwarka Metro Station, and the upcoming Diplomatic Enclave.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Diverse Commercial Spaces:</strong> The project includes double-height showrooms, anchor stores on every floor, and dedicated areas for entertainment and F&amp;B, catering to a wide range of business needs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Modern Amenities:</strong> Amenities such as ample parking space, high-speed elevators, 24-hour security, and a variety of recreational facilities enhance the overall appeal of the development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Financial considerations and ROI projections for investors</strong></p>\r\n<p>When considering an investment in M3M Capital Walk, financial projections and potential returns on investment (ROI) are crucial factors to evaluate. Given the growing commercial real estate market in Delhi, experts forecast a strong potential for both rental income and capital appreciation. With the area\'s rapid development and increasing demand for commercial spaces, investors can anticipate favorable rental yields that are likely to rise as the project attracts more businesses and customers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Additionally, the mixed-use nature of M3M Capital Walk positions it advantageously to generate diverse income streams. Retail spaces, office premises, and serviced apartments all contribute to the potential for steady cash flow. This diversification helps mitigate risks associated with market fluctuations, as income from one segment may offset downturns in another. Financial analysts predict that M3M Capital Walk could yield an ROI of 10-15% annually, making it an attractive option for investors seeking stable financial returns.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Moreover, long-term capital appreciation is another positive financial aspect to consider. As Sector 113 continues to develop and establish itself as a commercial hub, property values are expected to rise significantly. Investors who enter the market early can benefit from substantial appreciation over time, maximizing their investment potential. Financial models suggest that, over a five to ten-year horizon, M3M Capital Walk could see a property value increase of 30-40%, making it a compelling choice for those looking to build long-term wealth through real estate investment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages of M3M Capital Walk, Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></p>\r\n<p>M3M Capital Walk is a strategically located commercial development along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> in Sector 113, Gurgaon. It offers excellent connectivity and proximity to key areas, making it an attractive investment opportunity.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Location Benefits</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Prime Location on&nbsp;Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Located along the <strong>100+ meter wide</strong> Dwarka Expressway, which is set to be a major commercial and residential hub.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Seamless Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>10 mins</strong> from <strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport (IGI Airport)</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>15 mins</strong> from <strong>Cyber City &amp; Udyog Vihar</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Direct access to South Delhi and Dwarka</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Proximity to Residential &amp; Commercial Hubs</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Close to <strong>20,000+ families</strong> in nearby residential societies</li>\r\n<li>Surrounded by premium residential projects from developers like M3M, Godrej, and Smart World</li>\r\n<li>Near <strong>International Schools, Five-Star Hotels, and Multi-Specialty Hospitals</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Upcoming Infrastructure Developments</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Metro Corridor</strong> along Dwarka Expressway</li>\r\n<li><strong>Diplomatic Enclave 2</strong>, which will further boost demand</li>\r\n<li>Proposed <strong>ISBT &amp; Railway Station</strong> in close proximity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Business &amp; Retail Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>High footfall expected due to <strong>luxury retail, office spaces, and entertainment zones</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Double-height showrooms, anchor stores, and food courts</strong> attracting premium brands</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Why Invest in M3M Capital Walk, Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon ?</strong></p>\r\n<p>M3M Capital Walk is a <strong>premium commercial project</strong> strategically located on <strong>Dwarka Expressway, Sector 113, Gurgaon</strong>. It offers <strong>high-return investment opportunities</strong> with retail spaces, office zones, and entertainment areas designed for maximum footfall and business growth.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Key Reasons to Invest in M3M Capital Walk Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>1</strong><strong>&nbsp;Prime Location with High Visibility</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Located on <strong>Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong>, which is emerging as a major <strong>commercial &amp; residential corridor</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Direct connectivity</strong> to <strong>Delhi, IGI Airport, NH-8, and Gurgaon business hubs</strong> like Cyber City &amp; Udyog Vihar.</li>\r\n<li>Surrounded by <strong>premium residential projects</strong>, ensuring a steady flow of visitors and customers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2</strong><strong>&nbsp;Strong Commercial Potential &amp; High Footfall</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Retail spaces, food courts, and entertainment zones</strong> to attract high-end brands and customers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Double-height showrooms &amp; anchor stores</strong> provide a luxury shopping experience.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for <strong>investment in leased retail spaces</strong>, ensuring steady rental income.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3</strong><strong>&nbsp;Upcoming Infrastructure Boost</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Metro connectivity planned</strong> along <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, boosting accessibility.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proposed Diplomatic Enclave 2</strong> nearby will attract international businesses &amp; expatriates.</li>\r\n<li>Proximity to <strong>Delhi\'s commercial hubs</strong>, further driving demand.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4</strong><strong>&nbsp;High Appreciation &amp; ROI Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Fast-developing location</strong> ensures property value appreciation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Assured rental income potential</strong> due to high demand from businesses &amp; brands.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Low initial investment options</strong> with flexible payment plans.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5</strong><strong>&nbsp;Trusted Developer - M3M India</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>M3M has a strong track record of delivering <strong>high-quality commercial and residential projects</strong> in Gurgaon.</li>\r\n<li>M3M properties have historically given <strong>high ROI</strong> and <strong>great resale value</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Key Features &amp; Amenities of M3M Capital Walk, Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"386\" data-start=\"96\">M3M Capital Walk is a premium <strong data-end=\"160\" data-start=\"126\">high-street commercial project</strong> designed to provide a world-class shopping, business, and entertainment experience. It offers <strong data-end=\"324\" data-start=\"255\">retail spaces, office zones, entertainment hubs, and dining areas</strong>, making it a <strong data-end=\"383\" data-start=\"338\">prime investment and business destination</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" data-end=\"391\" data-start=\"388\"></div>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"417\" data-start=\"393\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-end=\"462\" data-start=\"419\"><strong data-end=\"460\" data-start=\"421\">Prime Location on&nbsp;Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"614\" data-start=\"463\">\r\n<li data-end=\"549\" data-start=\"463\">Strategically located in <strong data-end=\"513\" data-start=\"490\">Sector 113, Gurgaon</strong>, offering excellent connectivity.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"614\" data-start=\"550\"><strong data-end=\"611\" data-start=\"552\">Close to IGI Airport, Cyber City, NH-8, and South Delhi</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"662\" data-start=\"616\"><strong data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"618\">Premium High-Street Retail &amp; Showrooms</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"891\" data-start=\"663\">\r\n<li data-end=\"735\" data-start=\"663\"><strong data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"665\">Double-height retail spaces</strong> (with higher visibility for brands).</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"820\" data-start=\"736\"><strong data-end=\"770\" data-start=\"738\">Anchor stores on every floor</strong> to attract top n