935026!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '373 - 3201 SQ.FT ', ' Sector 113', '', '', '01WJWZXJ', 20, 'M3M Capital Walk Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'M3M Capital Walk Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'M3M Capital Walk in Sector 113, Gurgaon, is a premium commercial project that offers a range of retail and business spaces. Strategically located along the Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', NULL, NULL),
(154, 'DLF Garden City Central Sector 84', '17092406544944282024034434_2.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>24x7 Uninterrupted Power Supply</li>\r\n<li>24X7 Water Supply</li>\r\n<li>Amphitheater</li>\r\n<li>Banquet Hall</li>\r\n<li>Business Center</li>\r\n<li>Cafeteria</li>\r\n<li>Car Parking</li>\r\n<li>Carrom Board</li>\r\n<li>CCTV</li>\r\n<li>Children\'s Play Area</li>\r\n<li>Club House</li>\r\n<li>Community Hall</li>\r\n<li>Day Care Center</li>\r\n<li>Entrance Lobby</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 272, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p>DLF Garden City Central in Sector 84, Gurgaon, is a prime commercial development designed to offer an array of retail and office spaces. Located within the bustling DLF Garden City, this project blends modern design with functionality, catering to both businesses and shoppers. It features contemporary architecture, spacious layouts, and ample parking facilities, making it an attractive destination for retail outlets, restaurants, and offices. Its strategic location provides excellent connectivity to the Dwarka Expressway, NH-8, and other key areas of Gurgaon, ensuring high visibility and easy access for both residents and visitors.</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d14038.168174846045!2d76.96815663846026!3d28.402896811034914!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d3d7a6e683151%3A0xe7a96df9a97b7df!2sSector%2084%2C%20Gurugram%2C%20Haryana%20122004!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1726556047918!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 84', '', '', 'OZVHMYVO', 20, 'DLF Garden City Central Sector 84', 'DLF Garden City Central Sector 84', 'DLF Garden City Central Sector 84', NULL, NULL);
