(155, 'EBD 114 Sector 114', '170924101939EBD114_Slider001-1620x832.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>24x7 Uninterrupted Power Supply</li>\r\n<li>24X7 Water Supply</li>\r\n<li>Amphitheater</li>\r\n<li>Banquet Hall</li>\r\n<li>Business Center</li>\r\n<li>Cafeteria</li>\r\n<li>Car Parking</li>\r\n<li>Carrom Board</li>\r\n<li>CCTV</li>\r\n<li>Children\'s Play Area</li>\r\n<li>Club House</li>\r\n<li>Community Hall</li>\r\n<li>Day Care Center</li>\r\n<li>Entrance Lobby</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 273, '', '', '', '030525065836Emaar EBD 114 Nxt A4 Brochure Digital.pdf', '', '', '', '<h2>EBD 114, Sector 114, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon,</h2>\r\n<p>EBD 114, located in Sector 114, Gurgaon, is a premium commercial development offering a mix of retail and business spaces. Positioned along the Dwarka Expressway, this project caters to modern retail and commercial needs with its thoughtfully designed layout and contemporary architecture. EBD 114 provides a vibrant environment for businesses, featuring wide boulevards, attractive storefronts, and a range of dining and entertainment options. Its prime location ensures excellent connectivity to both Gurgaon and Delhi, making it an ideal hub for entrepreneurs, retailers, and investors seeking high visibility and footfall in a thriving commercial area.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Project Specifications</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Plot Sizes</strong>: 129 to 154 Sq. Yard.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Building Structure</strong>: Ground + 4 floors with basement and terrace rights, allowing a maximum height of 15 meters.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Ownership</strong>: Freehold land ownership, ensuring long-term asset security.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Units</strong>: 86 limited edition SCO plots</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"344\" data-start=\"283\">Key Reasons Why EBD 114 is a Good Investment Opportunity:</h3>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"394\" data-start=\"346\">1.&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"394\" data-start=\"354\">Strategic Location and Connectivity:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"786\" data-start=\"398\">\r\n<li data-end=\"617\" data-start=\"398\">\r\n<p data-end=\"617\" data-start=\"400\"><strong data-end=\"421\" data-start=\"400\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> is one of the most important infrastructure projects in the NCR region. It connects <strong data-end=\"524\" data-start=\"506\">Dwarka (Delhi)</strong> to <strong data-end=\"539\" data-start=\"528\">Gurgaon</strong>, ensuring seamless connectivity between Delhi, Gurgaon, and other NCR cities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"786\" data-start=\"621\">\r\n<p data-end=\"786\" data-start=\"623\">Once the <strong data-end=\"659\" data-start=\"632\">Dwarka Expressway Metro</strong> station becomes operational, this will further boost property values in the area, making it even more desirable for investors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"788\">2. <strong data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"796\">Rapid Infrastructure Development:</strong></h4>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1258\" data-start=\"837\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1077\" data-start=\"837\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1077\" data-start=\"839\">The area is undergoing massive infrastructural growth. This includes modern roads, utilities, and recreational spaces. The development of sectors around the expressway has already begun to attract both residential and commercial projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1258\" data-start=\"1081\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1258\" data-start=\"1083\">The <strong data-end=\"1112\" data-start=\"1087\">International Airport</strong> (near Dwarka) and <strong data-end=\"1150\" data-start=\"1131\">commercial hubs</strong> like <strong data-end=\"1170\" data-start=\"1156\">Cyber City</strong> are a short drive away, which is a big pull factor for both professionals and families.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1306\" data-start=\"1260\">3. <strong data-end=\"1306\" data-start=\"1268\">Demand for Residential Properties:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1799\" data-start=\"1310\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1563\" data-start=\"1310\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1563\" data-start=\"1312\">Gurgaon is one of the key residential hubs in the NCR region. With sectors along the Dwarka Expressway being developed rapidly, there\'s a growing demand for high-quality residential units, including <strong data-end=\"1532\" data-start=\"1511\">luxury apartments</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1546\" data-start=\"1534\">2-3 BHKs</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"1562\" data-start=\"1552\">villas</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1799\" data-start=\"1567\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1799\" data-start=\"1569\">Many developers are focusing on building <strong data-end=\"1642\" data-start=\"1610\">premium residential projects</strong> in this location. <strong data-end=\"1672\" data-start=\"1661\">EBD 114</strong> has both ongoing and upcoming residential developments, which means future demand for properties will likely continue to rise.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1847\" data-start=\"1801\">4. <strong data-end=\"1847\" data-start=\"1809\">Commercial and Retail Development:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2212\" data-start=\"1851\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2027\" data-start=\"1851\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2027\" data-start=\"1853\">In addition to residential development, there is a lot of <strong data-end=\"1942\" data-start=\"1911\">commercial and retail space</strong> coming up. This makes the area ideal for both residential and mixed-use development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2212\" data-start=\"2031\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2212\" data-start=\"2033\">The increasing presence of <strong data-end=\"2074\" data-start=\"2060\">corporates</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2088\" data-start=\"2076\">IT parks</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"2111\" data-start=\"2094\">business hubs</strong> in the area means there will be a constant influx of professionals looking for accommodation nearby.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2273\" data-start=\"2214\">5. <strong data-end=\"2273\" data-start=\"2222\">Potential for High Returns on Investment (ROI):</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2706\" data-start=\"2277\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2497\" data-start=\"2277\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2497\" data-start=\"2279\"><strong data-end=\"2303\" data-start=\"2279\">Capital appreciation</strong> in the region has been significant over the last few years, and given the growing demand for properties along the Dwarka Expressway, <strong data-end=\"2448\" data-start=\"2437\">EBD 114</strong> is expected to see continued value appreciation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2706\" data-start=\"2501\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2706\" data-start=\"2503\">The area&rsquo;s commercial developments, metro connectivity, and strategic location will likely lead to an increase in property values in the medium to long term, making it an attractive option for investors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2761\" data-start=\"2708\">6. <strong data-end=\"2761\" data-start=\"2716\">Proximity to Major Social Infrastructure:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3016\" data-start=\"2765\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3016\" data-start=\"2765\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3016\" data-start=\"2767\">The presence of <strong data-end=\"2794\" data-start=\"2783\">schools</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2809\" data-start=\"2796\">hospitals</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2820\" data-start=\"2811\">malls</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"2843\" data-start=\"2826\">business hubs</strong> nearby makes this a desirable area for residents. The growth in social infrastructure will only continue to attract new buyers and renters to the region, driving up demand.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"3021\" data-start=\"3018\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3052\" data-start=\"3023\">Investment Opportunities:</h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"3127\" data-start=\"3054\">Here are some specific investment options you can explore in <strong data-end=\"3126\" data-start=\"3115\">EBD 114</strong>:</p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"3164\" data-start=\"3129\">1. <strong data-end=\"3164\" data-start=\"3137\">Residential Properties:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"4031\" data-start=\"3168\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3472\" data-start=\"3168\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3472\" data-start=\"3170\"><strong data-end=\"3201\" data-start=\"3170\">Ready-to-Move-In Apartments</strong>: If you\'re looking for a quick investment opportunity, you could consider <strong data-end=\"3307\" data-start=\"3276\">ready-to-move-in apartments</strong> in completed or near-completed projects. These tend to attract buyers who are looking to settle quickly, especially professionals working in nearby commercial hubs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3800\" data-start=\"3476\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3800\" data-start=\"3478\"><strong data-end=\"3524\" data-start=\"3478\">Pre-Launch and Under-Construction Projects</strong>: Investing in <strong data-end=\"3564\" data-start=\"3539\">pre-launch properties</strong> can offer good returns, especially if you&rsquo;re comfortable with the wait. Given the demand in the area, developers are likely to offer <strong data-end=\"3722\" data-start=\"3698\">early-bird discounts</strong>, which can increase the value of your property once construction is complete.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4031\" data-start=\"3804\">\r\n<p data-end=\"4031\" data-start=\"3806\"><strong data-end=\"3839\" data-start=\"3806\">Villas and Premium Residences</strong>: There is also a growing demand for high-end villas and luxury apartments in the region. If you&rsquo;re looking for a higher-ticket investment, this segment could offer attractive long-term gains.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"4067\" data-start=\"4033\">2. <strong data-end=\"4067\" data-start=\"4041\">Commercial Properties:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"4632\" data-start=\"4071\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4391\" data-start=\"4071\">\r\n<p data-end=\"4391\" data-start=\"4073\"><strong data-end=\"4089\" data-start=\"4073\">Office Space</strong>: As Gurgaon continues to be a hub for IT, finance, and corporate offices, investing in commercial office spaces near Dwarka Expressway could be profitable. Companies are increasingly moving toward this region due to its proximity to the airport and strong connectivity to Delhi and other parts of NCR.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4632\" data-start=\"4395\">\r\n<p data-end=\"4632\" data-start=\"4397\"><strong data-end=\"4413\" data-start=\"4397\">Retail Space</strong>: With growing demand for retail outlets, especially in upcoming malls and commercial complexes, investing in <strong data-end=\"4540\" data-start=\"4523\">retail spaces</strong> could give you rental income while also benefiting from the area&rsquo;s appreciation over time.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"4662\" data-start=\"4634\">3. <strong data-end=\"4662\" data-start=\"4642\">Land Investment:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"5048\" data-start=\"4666\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4893\" data-start=\"4666\">\r\n<p data-end=\"4893\" data-start=\"4668\">Investing in <strong data-end=\"4698\" data-start=\"4681\">plots of land</strong> can be another option, particularly if you are looking for long-term gains. With the area&rsquo;s rapid urbanization and development, the value of land will likely appreciate as more projects come up.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"5048\" data-start=\"4897\">\r\n<p data-end=\"5048\" data-start=\"4899\">You can also consider <strong data-end=\"4950\" data-start=\"4921\">joint venture investments</strong> with developers, where you provide the land, and they handle construction, splitting the returns.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"5080\" data-start=\"5050\">4. <strong data-end=\"5080\" data-start=\"5058\">Real Estate Funds:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"5390\" data-start=\"5084\">\r\n<li data-end=\"5390\" data-start=\"5084\">\r\n<p data-end=\"5390\" data-start=\"5086\">If you don&rsquo;t want to directly buy property but still want to invest in the growing real estate sector in Gurgaon, you could explore <strong data-end=\"5259\" data-start=\"5218\">real estate investment trusts (REITs)</strong> or funds that focus on Gurgaon&rsquo;s real estate market. This allows you to diversify your investment with lower capital requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"211\" data-start=\"198\">Location:</h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"212\">\r\n<li data-end=\"362\" data-start=\"212\">\r\n<p data-end=\"362\" data-start=\"214\"><strong data-end=\"235\" data-start=\"214\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> is one of Gurgaon\'s most strategic and fast-developing corridors, connecting <strong data-end=\"328\" data-start=\"318\">Dwarka</strong> (Delhi) to <strong data-end=\"351\" data-start=\"340\">Gurgaon</strong> (Haryana).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"363\">\r\n<p data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"365\">Sector 114 is close to key commercial and residential developments, and it\'s a prime location for residents and businesses.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"533\" data-start=\"504\">Key Features of the Area:</h3>\r\n<ol data-end=\"1543\" data-start=\"534\">\r\n<li data-end=\"684\" data-start=\"534\">\r\n<p data-end=\"684\" data-start=\"537\"><strong data-end=\"564\" data-start=\"537\">Residential Development</strong>: EBD 114 is part of a growing area with a mix of high-end residential projects, including luxury apartments and villas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"689\">\r\n<p data-end=\"710\" data-start=\"692\"><strong data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"692\">Connectivity</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"714\">\r\n<li data-end=\"886\" data-start=\"714\">\r\n<p data-end=\"886\" data-start=\"716\">The Dwarka Expressway provides quick access to both Delhi and Gurgaon, which makes commuting easy for professionals working in major hubs like Cyber City and Udyog Vihar.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"890\">\r\n<p data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"892\">The upcoming <strong data-end=\"940\" data-start=\"905\">Dwarka Expressway metro station</strong> will further boost connectivity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1185\" data-start=\"975\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1185\" data-start=\"978\"><strong data-end=\"991\" data-start=\"978\">Amenities</strong>: This locality is close to key facilities like schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and parks. Some well-known developments are nearby, offering ready-to-move-in homes and modern infrastructure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1349\" data-start=\"1187\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1349\" data-start=\"1190\"><strong data-end=\"1211\" data-start=\"1190\">Commercial Growth</strong>: The Dwarka Expressway region is seeing rapid commercial development, with several IT parks, office spaces, and retail centers coming up.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1543\" data-start=\"1351\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1543\" data-start=\"1354\"><strong data-end=\"1376\" data-start=\"1354\">Real Estate Market</strong>: Due to the growing demand for properties in the area, both residential and commercial real estate prices are on the rise, making it an attractive spot for investors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1566\" data-start=\"1545\">Future Prospects:</h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1817\" data-start=\"1567\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1681\" data-start=\"1567\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1681\" data-start=\"1569\">The upcoming <strong data-end=\"1609\" data-start=\"1582\">Dwarka Expressway metro</strong> and improved road infrastructure will make travel even more convenient.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1817\" data-start=\"1682\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1817\" data-start=\"1684\"><strong data-end=\"1709\" data-start=\"1684\">Social Infrastructure</strong> (schools, hospitals, malls) is improving, making it an attractive area for both families and professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"186\" data-start=\"0\">Booking a unit in <strong data-end=\"69\" data-start=\"18\">EBD 114, Sector 114, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> through <strong data-end=\"94\" data-start=\"78\">A2P Realtech</strong> can be an exciting opportunity! Here\'s a general guide on how you can go about the process:</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"186\" data-start=\"0\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"245\" data-start=\"188\">Steps to Book a Unit in EBD 114 through A2P Realtech:</h3>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"287\" data-start=\"247\">1. <strong data-end=\"287\" data-start=\"255\">Research and Initial Inquiry</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"774\" data-start=\"291\">\r\n<li data-end=\"774\" data-start=\"291\">\r\n<p data-end=\"560\" data-start=\"293\"><strong data-end=\"317\" data-start=\"293\">Contact A2P Realtech</strong>: Get in touch with the real estate agent or sales team at <strong data-end=\"392\" data-start=\"376\">A2P Realtech</strong>. You can find their contact details on their website or social media. They will provide details about available units in <strong data-end=\"525\" data-start=\"514\">EBD 114</strong> and guide you through the options.</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"774\" data-start=\"566\">\r\n<li data-end=\"655\" data-start=\"566\">\r\n<p data-end=\"655\" data-start=\"568\">Website: Check if A2P Realtech has an official website for listings or contact details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"774\" data-start=\"661\">\r\n<p data-end=\"774\" data-start=\"663\">Phone/Email: Directly call or email them to inquire about unit availability, sizes, pricing, and payment plans.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"798\" data-start=\"776\">2. <strong data-end=\"798\" data-start=\"784\">Site Visit</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1235\" data-start=\"802\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"802\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"804\"><strong data-end=\"829\" data-start=\"804\">Schedule a Site Visit</strong>: It&rsquo;s always a good idea to visit the site to get a feel of the area, check the amenities, and inspect the property. A2P Realtech will help you organize a <strong data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"985\">site visit</strong> if you are unable to visit the property directly.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1235\" data-start=\"1053\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1235\" data-start=\"1055\"><strong data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"1055\">Virtual Tour</strong>: If you\'re unable to visit in person, ask for a <strong data-end=\"1136\" data-start=\"1120\">virtual tour</strong> of the property. Some real estate agencies provide virtual walkthroughs or high-definition images.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1265\" data-start=\"1237\">3. <strong data-end=\"1265\" data-start=\"1245\">Choose Your Unit</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1772\" data-start=\"1269\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1616\" data-start=\"1269\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1514\" data-start=\"1271\"><strong data-end=\"1289\" data-start=\"1271\">Unit Selection</strong>: Depending on your preferences (e.g., number of bedrooms, floor plan, facing, etc.), you can choose from the available units. A2P Realtech will provide detailed information about the different unit configurations, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1616\" data-start=\"1520\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1536\" data-start=\"1520\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1536\" data-start=\"1522\">Size (sq. ft.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1554\" data-start=\"1542\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1554\" data-start=\"1544\">Floor plan</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1567\" data-start=\"1560\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1567\" data-start=\"1562\">Price</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1573\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1575\">Payment plans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1616\" data-start=\"1594\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1616\" data-start=\"1596\">Completion timelines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1772\" data-start=\"1620\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1772\" data-start=\"1622\"><strong data-end=\"1647\" data-start=\"1622\">Clarify Legal Aspects</strong>: Ensure that you ask A2P Realtech about <strong data-end=\"1708\" data-start=\"1688\">ownership titles</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1723\" data-start=\"1710\">approvals</strong>, and any regulatory issues with the development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1800\" data-start=\"1774\">4. <strong data-end=\"1800\" data-start=\"1782\">Book Your Unit</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2481\" data-start=\"1804\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2027\" data-start=\"1804\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2027\" data-start=\"1806\"><strong data-end=\"1822\" data-start=\"1806\">Booking Form</strong>: Once you&rsquo;ve selected the unit, A2P Realtech will provide you with a <strong data-end=\"1908\" data-start=\"1892\">booking form</strong>. Fill it out and submit the necessary documents (usually <strong data-end=\"1978\" data-start=\"1966\">ID proof</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1997\" data-start=\"1980\">address proof</strong>, and sometimes <strong data-end=\"2025\" data-start=\"2013\">PAN card</strong>).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2242\" data-start=\"2031\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2242\" data-start=\"2033\"><strong data-end=\"2050\" data-start=\"2033\">Token Payment</strong>: Be prepared to make an <strong data-end=\"2100\" data-start=\"2075\">initial token payment</strong> or booking amount. The booking amount could vary depending on the builder or developer, and A2P Realtech will guide you through this process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2481\" data-start=\"2246\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2481\" data-start=\"2248\"><strong data-end=\"2267\" data-start=\"2248\">Agreement Draft</strong>: After the booking, you will receive an <strong data-end=\"2329\" data-start=\"2308\">Agreement to Sale</strong> or a <strong data-end=\"2353\" data-start=\"2335\">Sale Agreement</strong>. Make sure to read and understand all the terms and conditions before signing. You may want to have a lawyer review it as well.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2507\" data-start=\"2483\">5. <strong data-end=\"2507\" data-start=\"2491\">Payment Plan</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2975\" data-start=\"2511\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2774\" data-start=\"2511\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2618\" data-start=\"2513\"><strong data-end=\"2538\" data-start=\"2513\">Choose a Payment Plan</strong>: The developer (or A2P Realtech) will offer you various payment plans, such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2774\" data-start=\"2624\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2668\" data-start=\"2624\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2668\" data-start=\"2626\"><strong data-end=\"2668\" data-start=\"2626\">Construction Linked Payment Plan (CLP)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2716\" data-start=\"2674\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2716\" data-start=\"2676\"><strong data-end=\"2716\" data-start=\"2676\">Possession Linked Payment Plan (PLP)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2744\" data-start=\"2722\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2744\" data-start=\"2724\"><strong data-end=\"2744\" data-start=\"2724\">Subvention Plans</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2774\" data-start=\"2750\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2774\" data-start=\"2752\"><strong data-end=\"2774\" data-start=\"2752\">Down Payment Plans</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2975\" data-start=\"2778\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2975\" data-start=\"2780\">Discuss with A2P Realtech which payment plan best suits your financial situation. You will need to make the initial payment and then follow the schedule based on the payment plan you&rsquo;ve selected.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"3006\" data-start=\"2977\">6. <strong data-end=\"3006\" data-start=\"2985\">Loan or Financing</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3286\" data-start=\"3010\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3186\" data-start=\"3010\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3186\" data-start=\"3012\">If you\'re financing your purchase through a home loan, A2P Realtech may assist you in the <strong data-end=\"3123\" data-start=\"3102\">home loan process</strong> by connecting you with <strong data-end=\"3171\" data-start=\"3147\">lending institutions</strong> or <strong data-end=\"3184\" data-start=\"3175\">banks</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3286\" data-start=\"3190\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3286\" data-start=\"3192\">They will provide you with the necessary documentation required by the bank for loan approval.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"3328\" data-start=\"3288\">7. <strong data-end=\"3328\" data-start=\"3296\">Final Agreement and Handover</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3605\" data-start=\"3332\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3436\" data-start=\"3332\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3436\" data-start=\"3334\">After completing the payment process and all formalities, you&rsquo;ll receive the <strong data-end=\"3435\" data-start=\"3411\">final sale agreement</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3605\" data-start=\"3440\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3605\" data-start=\"3442\">A2P Realtech will keep you updated on the <strong data-end=\"3507\" data-start=\"3484\">construction status</strong> of the project. Once construction is completed, they will assist you in the <strong data-end=\"3596\" data-start=\"3584\">handover</strong> process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d14020.697179367273!2d77.0009906864667!3d28.534480412842576!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1a0a91c00ebb%3A0x213db9fd595442d1!2sSector%20114%2C%20Bajghera%2C%20Gurugram%2C%20Haryana!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1726568442185!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 114', '', '', 'HEWA5M75', 20, 'EBD 114 Sector 114', 'EBD 114 Sector 114', 'EBD 114 Sector 114', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(156, 'EBD 89 Sector 89', '1709241022495349474-163816-ebd-89.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>24x7 Uninterrupted Power Supply</li>\r\n<li>24X7 Water Supply</li>\r\n<li>Amphitheater</li>\r\n<li>Banquet Hall</li>\r\n<li>Business Center</li>\r\n<li>Cafeteria</li>\r\n<li>Car Parking</li>\r\n<li>Carrom Board</li>\r\n<li>CCTV</li>\r\n<li>Children\'s Play Area</li>\r\n<li>Club House</li>\r\n<li>Community Hall</li>\r\n<li>Day Care Center</li>\r\n<li>Entrance Lobby</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 291, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p>EBD 89, located in Sector 89, Gurgaon, is a premium commercial development designed to provide a vibrant mix of retail and business spaces. With modern architecture and a thoughtfully planned layout, the project offers an excellent environment for businesses, including retail shops, offices, and dining establishments. Situated in a rapidly growing area, EBD 89 enjoys proximity to key residential and commercial hubs, ensuring a steady flow of visitors. Its strategic location along major road networks offers excellent connectivity, making it an ideal destination for businesses looking for high visibility and accessibility in a thriving part of Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of EBD 89 Sector 89 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Emaar Business District 89 (EBD 89) is a premium commercial development situated in Sector 89, Gurgaon, along the rapidly evolving Dwarka Expressway corridor. This area is emerging as a significant business hub within New Gurgaon, offering a blend of retail, office, and leisure spaces.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Project Overview</strong></p>\r\n<p>EBD 89 is designed as a modern commercial complex featuring SCO (Shop-Cum-Office) plots. These plots allow for mixed-use development, accommodating both retail and office spaces. Key highlights include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Type</strong>: Shop-Cum-Office (SCO) Plots</li>\r\n<li><strong>Plot Configuration</strong>: B+G+4+Terrace, with a maximum development allowance of 5 floors and a basement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Plot Sizes</strong>: Typically ranging from 100 to 300 square yards.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Frontage</strong>: Approximately 125 meters on a 75-meter-wide sector road, ensuring high visibility and accessibility.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Design Features</strong>: Uniform fa&ccedil;ade, open-air boulevards, pedestrian-friendly promenades, and ample parking space.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Amenities</strong>: 24&times;7 security with CCTV surveillance, high-speed elevators, landscaped gardens, water features, and provisions for a weekly bazaar.</li>\r\n<li><strong>RERA Registration</strong>: Yes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Location &amp; Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<p>Strategically positioned along the Dwarka Expressway, EBD 89 offers excellent connectivity:</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>: Direct access to the expressway facilitates smooth travel to Delhi and other parts of Gurgaon.</li>\r\n<li><strong>NH-48</strong>: Approximately 5 minutes away, connecting to major destinations.</li>\r\n<li><strong>IGI Airport</strong>: Around 20 minutes, enhancing business travel convenience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proposed Metro Station</strong>: Located about 17 km away at Huda City Centre, with plans for future metro connectivity.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Nearby Hubs</strong>: Proximity to commercial centers like Cyber City and Udyog Vihar.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Residential Developments Nearby</strong></p>\r\n<p>The vicinity of EBD 89 is witnessing significant residential growth, attracting professionals and families:</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Smart World Gems</strong>: A 52.275-acre project offering 2 and 3 BHK independent floors, with modern amenities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>NBCC Heights</strong>: Ready-to-move 2 and 3 BHK apartments with sizes ranging from 1,140 to 2,125 sq. ft., featuring earthquake-resistant structures and premium amenities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Godrej Zenith</strong>: Spanning 14 acres, offering 3.5 and 4 BHK units with luxurious features like rooftop pools and multiple clubhouses. These developments contribute to a growing residential catchment, enhancing the potential customer base for businesses in EBD 89.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><strong>Why Invest in EBD 89 Sector 89 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon ?&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\"></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Investing in&nbsp;<strong>Emaar Business District 89 (EBD 89)</strong> in Sector 89, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon is seen as a strategic move for several reasons. Here\'s a breakdown of <strong>why EBD 89 is considered a promising investment</strong>:</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>1. Prime Location Advantage</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway Connectivity</strong>: Direct access to the 8-lane Dwarka Expressway, reducing travel time to Delhi and IGI Airport.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Near Future Metro Line</strong>: A proposed metro station nearby will significantly boost footfall and connectivity.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Residential Catchment</strong>: Surrounded by over 20,000+ residential units (e.g., Godrej, NBCC Heights, Smart World), ensuring a strong customer base.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>2. SCO (Shop-Cum-Office) Format</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Freehold Commercial Plots</strong>: Investors get full ownership with the flexibility to lease, sell, or develop.</li>\r\n<li><strong>B+G+4 Development</strong>: Allowed to build up to 5 floors, enabling multiple income streams (retail + office + F&amp;B).</li>\r\n<li><strong>No Lease Restrictions</strong>: Unlike malls, there are no limitations from a developer or mall management.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>3. Trusted Developer &ndash; Emaar India</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Global reputation with a strong portfolio in India.</li>\r\n<li>Past successful projects: EBD 65, EBD 114, Palm Drive, and Marbella.</li>\r\n<li>Timely delivery record and quality construction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><strong>4. Rising Commercial Demand in New Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Commercial Gap</strong>: There is limited Grade-A commercial supply in this part of Gurgaon, boosting demand for retail and office space.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Rental Yield Potential</strong>: Investors can expect attractive rental returns due to rising demand from retailers and corporates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>5. Appreciation Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Sector 89 Price Trends</strong>: Property rates have appreciated 8&ndash;12% year-on-year.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Infrastructure Development</strong>: Ongoing construction of roads, expressways, and metro projects is driving up land values.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Early Entry Opportunity</strong>: EBD 89 is among the early commercial offerings in a fast-developing residential zone.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>6. Amenities &amp; Design</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Wide 75m road frontage with 125m visibility.</li>\r\n<li>Ample open parking, high-street retail aesthetics, and pedestrian-friendly layout.</li>\r\n<li>Provision for weekly markets, open-air cafes, and event spaces for better footfall.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>7. Regulatory Safety</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>RERA registered.</li>\r\n<li>Transparent buying process with legal clarity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Bottom Line:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>EBD 89</strong> offers a balanced mix of location, brand trust, income potential, and future growth. It\'s especially ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Retailers targeting high-footfall zones.</li>\r\n<li>Investors seeking long-term capital appreciation.</li>\r\n<li>Business owners wanting to establish a visible, well-connected office or store.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<h3><strong>Process to book a Unit in EBD 89 Sector 89 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon through A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>To book a unit in <strong>Emaar Business District 89 (EBD 89)</strong>, Sector 89, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these steps:</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Contact A2P Realtech</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>A2P Realtech Private Limited</strong> is a real estate consulting company specializing in commercial and residential projects. They are based in Delhi and can assist you with the booking process for EBD 89.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Initiate Contact</strong></p>\r\n<p>Reach out to A2P Realtech via phone, WhatsApp, or email to express your interest in booking a unit at EBD 89. Provide them with your preferred plot size and any specific requirements you may have.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Site Visit</strong></p>\r\n<p>Schedule a site visit through A2P Realtech to view the available units at EBD 89. This will give you a better understanding of the location and the available options.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Booking Process</strong></p>\r\n<p>Once you\'ve selected a unit, A2P Realtech will guide you through the booking process, which typically includes:</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Documentation</strong>: Providing necessary identification and address proof.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Agreement</strong>: Signing the allotment letter or sale agreement.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Payment</strong>: Paying the booking amount as per the payment plan.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Registration</strong>: Finalizing the registration process upon project completion.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Plans</strong></p>\r\n<p>Emaar offers various payment plans for EBD 89, including:</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Construction Linked Plan</strong>: Payments are made at different stages of construction.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Down Payment Plan</strong>: A lump sum payment at the time of booking, with possible discounts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>A2P Realtech will provide detailed information on the available plans and assist you in selecting the one that best suits your financial preferences.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h4><strong>Legal and Regulatory Compliance</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Ensure that all agreements and documents are RERA registered. EBD 89 is RERA registered under the Haryana Real Estate Regulatory Authority (HARERA), ensuring transparency and legal compliance.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d14036.187597384116!2d76.92682699338913!3d28.417841678613577!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d162406ae3dc1%3A0x8ed881fc7cc9cae1!2sSector%2089%2C%20Gurugram%2C%20Haryana%20122004!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1726568539473!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 89', '', '', 'W610F2OM', 20, 'EBD 89 Sector 89', 'EBD 89 Sector 89', 'EBD 89 Sector 89', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(157, 'EBD 83 Sector 83', '170924102623khnaet5vkesvaodszn1k.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>24x7 Uninterrupted Power Supply</li>\r\n<li>24X7 Water Supply</li>\r\n<li>Amphitheater</li>\r\n<li>Banquet Hall</li>\r\n<li>Business Center</li>\r\n<li>Cafeteria</li>\r\n<li>Car Parking</li>\r\n<li>Carrom Board</li>\r\n<li>CCTV</li>\r\n<li>Children\'s Play Area</li>\r\n<li>Club House</li>\r\n<li>Community Hall</li>\r\n<li>Day Care Center</li>\r\n<li>Entrance Lobby</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 273, '', '', '', '050525071203EBD 83 Sector 83 Plan details in PPT.pdf', '', '', '', '<p>EBD 83, located in Sector 83, Gurgaon, is a high-end commercial project offering a variety of retail and office spaces. Designed with modern architecture, the development aims to create a dynamic business and shopping environment. With spacious layouts, well-planned infrastructure, and an inviting atmosphere, EBD 83 provides an ideal platform for retail outlets, restaurants, and corporate offices. Positioned in a rapidly growing area, it benefits from excellent connectivity to major roads, including NH-8 and the Dwarka Expressway, ensuring easy access and high visibility, making it a prime destination for business and commercial activities in Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<h2>Overview of Emaar Business District (EBD) 83, Sector 83, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</h2>\r\n<p>Emaar, a renowned real estate developer, is creating a sophisticated and modern business environment through <strong>EBD 83</strong>. The district is designed as a <strong>commercial hub</strong>, offering a range of office spaces, retail outlets, and other commercial facilities. Given its strategic location and the developer\'s reputation, this project is considered one of the most promising commercial developments on the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>The <strong>unit sizes</strong> at <strong>Emaar Business District (EBD) 83</strong>, located in <strong>Sector 83</strong>, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, vary depending on the type of commercial space you\'re interested in. The development offers <strong>office spaces</strong>, <strong>retail spaces</strong>, and possibly other configurations designed for modern businesses and corporations.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Office Space Sizes in EBD 83:</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Small Office Units:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Size Range</strong>: 500 &ndash; 1,500 sq. ft.</li>\r\n<li>These units are ideal for <strong>startups</strong>, <strong>small businesses</strong>, or <strong>co-working spaces</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Flexible layout options allow customization to suit business needs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Medium Office Units:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Size Range</strong>: 1,500 &ndash; 3,000 sq. ft.</li>\r\n<li>These are suitable for <strong>small to medium-sized enterprises (SMEs)</strong>, especially for companies looking for a larger space but not requiring an entire floor.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Large Office Units:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Size Range</strong>: 3,000 &ndash; 10,000 sq. ft. or more.</li>\r\n<li>These are ideal for <strong>corporates</strong>, <strong>multinational companies</strong>, or <strong>large-scale offices</strong> that need expansive, flexible space.</li>\r\n<li>Some buildings may offer <strong>full-floor leasing</strong> options for large enterprises.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Floor Plates (Full Floors):</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Size Range</strong>: Typically around <strong>15,000 &ndash; 20,000 sq. ft.</strong> per floor, depending on the building design.</li>\r\n<li>These can be leased or sold as <strong>entire floors</strong> for large businesses or firms that need dedicated space.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Retail Space Sizes in EBD 83:</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Small Retail Units:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Size Range</strong>: 200 &ndash; 1,000 sq. ft.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for <strong>small businesses</strong>, <strong>showrooms</strong>, <strong>cafes</strong>, or <strong>service-oriented stores</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>These units cater to <strong>high-footfall areas</strong> within the complex, such as entrances or near common amenities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Medium Retail Units:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Size Range</strong>: 1,000 &ndash; 3,000 sq. ft.</li>\r\n<li>These units are suitable for <strong>restaurants</strong>, <strong>furniture stores</strong>, <strong>fitness centers</strong>, or <strong>larger showrooms</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Large Retail Units:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Size Range</strong>: 3,000 &ndash; 5,000 sq. ft. or more.</li>\r\n<li>Larger units may be designed for <strong>department stores</strong>, <strong>supermarkets</strong>, or <strong>brands</strong> that need significant space for their operations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Customizable Units:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>One of the attractive features of <strong>EBD 83</strong> is the flexibility in <strong>unit sizes</strong>. Office and retail spaces can often be <strong>combined</strong>, and some units are customizable to meet the specific needs of tenants. For example, you can modify an office unit to create an <strong>open-plan layout</strong>, or retail units may be tailored for specific uses.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mezzanine Floors</strong>: Some units in EBD 83 might have the option of incorporating a <strong>mezzanine floor</strong> to add more usable space, especially for businesses that need additional storage or administrative space.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Key Highlights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Scalability</strong>: Whether you\'re a <strong>small business</strong> looking for 500 sq. ft. or a <strong>large corporation</strong> in need of 10,000 sq. ft., EBD 83 provides scalable solutions to meet different business needs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Flexibility</strong>: With flexible leasing options and customizable layouts, businesses can optimize their space for productivity.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Amenities</strong>: Units in EBD 83 are equipped with <strong>modern amenities</strong> such as <strong>centralized air conditioning</strong>, <strong>high-speed elevators</strong>, <strong>24/7 security</strong>, and <strong>ample parking</strong> to provide a comfortable and professional environment for all tenants.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Why is Size Important in ROI?</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Smaller Units</strong> (500 &ndash; 1,500 sq. ft.): These units are generally easier to lease out and attract smaller businesses or startups, providing a stable <strong>rental yield</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Larger Units</strong> (3,000 &ndash; 10,000 sq. ft.): Larger units provide a higher <strong>rental income</strong> but can have a slower leasing process due to the <strong>larger tenant requirements</strong>. However, they offer the <strong>potential for long-term leasing contracts</strong> from larger corporations, which can provide consistent revenue.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"EBD 83 Sector 83 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features of Emaar Business District (EBD) 83:</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Location:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Dwarka Expressway</strong>: EBD 83 is situated right along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, making it highly accessible from both <strong>Gurgaon</strong> and <strong>Delhi</strong>. The Expressway itself is a vital connectivity link between <strong>Dwarka (Delhi)</strong> and <strong>Gurgaon</strong>, improving the region\'s accessibility to major business centers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Distance to Major Hubs</strong>: It is near several corporate parks, business hubs, and residential complexes. Key locations like <strong>Cyber City</strong>, <strong>Cyber Hub</strong>, and <strong>Udyog Vihar</strong> are just a short drive away, making this district ideal for businesses.</li>\r\n<li><strong>International Airport</strong>: The <strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport</strong> is a 15&ndash;20-minute drive, which makes it an attractive location for businesses with international operations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Commercial Infrastructure:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>EBD 83 offers <strong>state-of-the-art office spaces</strong> and <strong>retail outlets</strong>, designed to cater to a variety of businesses, including <strong>startups</strong>, <strong>small &amp; medium enterprises (SMEs)</strong>, <strong>IT companies</strong>, and <strong>corporates</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Flexible Office Spaces</strong>: The district includes flexible office configurations, offering both <strong>small office units</strong> and <strong>large commercial spaces</strong>, catering to diverse business needs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Modern Amenities:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>High-Speed Elevators</strong>: Multiple elevators ensure ease of movement within the building, making it ideal for large corporate teams.</li>\r\n<li><strong>24/7 Security</strong>: Advanced security systems, including CCTV surveillance, access control, and security personnel, ensure safety within the premises.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Parking Facilities</strong>: Ample parking space for both employees and visitors.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Centralized Air Conditioning</strong>: HVAC systems provide comfort for employees throughout the day.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Power Backup</strong>: 24/7 power backup ensures uninterrupted business operations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Sustainability and Green Features:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>LEED-certified Buildings</strong>: Many of the office buildings are designed to meet <strong>LEED (Leadership in Energy and Environmental Design)</strong> standards, focusing on sustainability and reducing the carbon footprint.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Green Spaces and Landscaping</strong>: The district is designed to include green landscapes, parks, and open spaces, providing a pleasant environment for work.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Retail Spaces:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>EBD 83 also includes <strong>retail spaces</strong> that cater to the daily needs of people working in the district, offering cafes, restaurants, convenience stores, and more.</li>\r\n<li>This makes it an attractive destination not only for businesses but also for consumers, adding an element of convenience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Flexible Leasing Options:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>EBD 83 offers businesses the flexibility of <strong>long-term and short-term leases</strong>, which is ideal for startups and growing businesses that need scalability in office spaces.</li>\r\n<li>The leasing options also provide flexibility in terms of expansion as the business grows.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Dedicated Commercial Zone:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>EBD 83 is entirely focused on commercial use, ensuring a <strong>business-only zone</strong> without residential interruptions. This is a significant advantage for companies seeking a professional environment and high-quality infrastructure.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Why Invest in EBD 83, Sector 83, Dwarka Expressway?</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Prime Location for Businesses</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>On the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, EBD 83 is well-connected to other commercial hubs like <strong>Cyber City</strong>, <strong>Manesar</strong>, <strong>Gurgaon&rsquo;s Golf Course Road</strong>, and even <strong>New Delhi</strong>. It&rsquo;s strategically positioned for businesses that need to operate in Gurgaon and Delhi.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Capital Appreciation Potential</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The area has witnessed rapid infrastructure growth, and with the ongoing development of the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, this location is set to experience high <strong>capital appreciation</strong> in the coming years. The area&rsquo;s real estate market is growing due to the increasing demand for commercial office spaces in and around Gurgaon.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Residential Developments</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Nearby residential projects such as <strong>Emaar MGF&rsquo;s</strong> other developments and other high-rise residential complexes in sectors like 104, 106, and 109 ensure a steady influx of potential workers and customers for businesses in EBD 83.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Corporate Hub and Business Growth</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>EBD 83 is set to attract a wide variety of businesses, including <strong>IT companies</strong>, <strong>business startups</strong>, and <strong>MNCs</strong>, especially given the <strong>growing trend of flexible office spaces</strong>. Companies are increasingly looking to relocate to Gurgaon, and EBD 83 provides them with an ideal location.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Social Infrastructure</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The area is close to <strong>schools</strong>, <strong>hospitals</strong>, <strong>shopping malls</strong>, and other essential services, which makes it an attractive place for both employers and employees.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Retail and Hospitality</strong>: With ongoing commercial and retail developments, the area offers opportunities for investment in retail or hospitality as well.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Investment Opportunities in EBD 83:</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Commercial Office Spaces:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>EBD 83 offers a variety of <strong>office spaces</strong> for lease or sale. Investing in these units can provide high rental yields due to the location\'s attractiveness to businesses. As more companies move into the area, demand for commercial spaces is expected to rise, leading to potential appreciation in property value.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Retail Investment:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Investing in <strong>retail units</strong> in the district can also be lucrative, as the area will attract workers, clients, and visitors who need essential services. The retail spaces within <strong>EBD 83</strong> could see a high footfall, making it a good option for those looking to invest in <strong>commercial retail properties</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Land Investment:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>If you\'re looking for a long-term investment, purchasing <strong>land</strong> around EBD 83 could be another opportunity. As commercial development continues, the value of land in and around the area will likely increase.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Co-working Spaces</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>With the rising popularity of <strong>co-working spaces</strong>, EBD 83 can be an ideal location to set up or invest in such facilities. Many startups and entrepreneurs are looking for flexible office spaces, which could present a profitable investment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Risks and Considerations:</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Market Fluctuations</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The real estate market can fluctuate, and while Gurgaon is a growing business hub, external factors like government policies, economic downturns, or a slower-than-expected market recovery could affect the returns.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Construction Delays</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Some commercial developments experience delays in construction, so it&rsquo;s important to get a clear timeline from the developers and check their past project completion history.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Regulatory Changes</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Always verify the legal and regulatory aspects before making an investment. This includes ensuring proper approvals, clear land titles, and adherence to environmental standards.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3><strong>Factors Influencing ROI in EBD 83:</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"458\" data-start=\"427\">1. <strong data-end=\"457\" data-start=\"435\">Strategic Location</strong>:</h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"462\">\r\n<li data-end=\"714\" data-start=\"462\"><strong data-end=\"498\" data-start=\"464\">Proximity to Dwarka Expressway</strong>: Being directly connected to <strong data-end=\"549\" data-start=\"528\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>, one of the key development corridors in Gurgaon, EBD 83 benefits from excellent connectivity to major commercial and residential hubs in <strong data-end=\"699\" data-start=\"688\">Gurgaon</strong> and <strong data-end=\"713\" data-start=\"704\">Delhi</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"718\">The <strong data-end=\"752\" data-start=\"724\">proximity to the airport</strong> and <strong data-end=\"771\" data-start=\"757\">Cyber City</strong> makes EBD 83 an attractive location for businesses. Commercial spaces in areas with great connectivity and high foot traffic, such as this, generally see a better ROI.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"941\">2. <strong data-end=\"983\" data-start=\"949\">Type of Commercial Development</strong>:</h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"988\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1341\" data-start=\"988\"><strong data-end=\"1007\" data-start=\"990\">Office Spaces</strong> in EBD 83 cater to a wide range of companies, from <strong data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"1059\">startups</strong> to <strong data-end=\"1101\" data-start=\"1075\">established corporates</strong>, including companies looking for <strong data-end=\"1161\" data-start=\"1135\">flexible office spaces</strong>. The demand for <strong data-end=\"1191\" data-start=\"1178\">IT spaces</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1214\" data-start=\"1193\">co-working spaces</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"1241\" data-start=\"1220\">corporate offices</strong> is rising, particularly in the <strong data-end=\"1294\" data-start=\"1273\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> region, which gives EBD 83 a competitive edge.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1345\"><strong data-end=\"1364\" data-start=\"1347\">Retail spaces</strong> in the area are also lucrative due to the growing number of businesses and workers in the area. As more employees from nearby commercial hubs move into the area, the demand for amenities like cafes, restaurants, and retail shops will increase.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1654\" data-start=\"1610\">3. <strong data-end=\"1653\" data-start=\"1618\">Reputation of Developer (Emaar)</strong>:</h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2013\" data-start=\"1658\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2013\" data-start=\"1658\"><strong data-end=\"1669\" data-start=\"1660\">Emaar</strong> is a renowned developer with a strong track record in delivering high-quality commercial and residential properties. The brand value and trust associated with Emaar often attract both tenants and investors. <strong data-end=\"1905\" data-start=\"1877\">A well-established brand</strong> like Emaar usually adds <strong data-end=\"1945\" data-start=\"1930\">credibility</strong> to the project, which positively influences ROI over the long term.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2064\" data-start=\"2015\">4. <strong data-end=\"2063\" data-start=\"2023\">Upcoming Infrastructure Developments</strong>:</h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2578\" data-start=\"2068\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2384\" data-start=\"2068\">The <strong data-end=\"2101\" data-start=\"2074\">Dwarka Expressway Metro</strong> station, which is expected to be operational in the coming years, will significantly enhance the connectivity of the area. The increased access and convenience are expected to drive demand for both office and retail spaces, making EBD 83 more attractive to businesses and investors.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2578\" data-start=\"2388\">Additionally, the overall <strong data-end=\"2460\" data-start=\"2416\">growth of the Dwarka Expressway corridor</strong> will increase property values as more <strong data-end=\"2514\" data-start=\"2499\">residential</strong> and <strong data-end=\"2542\" data-start=\"2519\">commercial projects</strong> come up, further enhancing the ROI.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2618\" data-start=\"2580\">5. <strong data-end=\"2617\" data-start=\"2588\">Leasing and Rental Yields</strong>:</h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3150\" data-start=\"2622\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2937\" data-start=\"2622\"><strong data-end=\"2649\" data-start=\"2624\">Leasing Opportunities</strong>: EBD 83\'s <strong data-end=\"2677\" data-start=\"2660\">office spaces</strong> cater to a mix of large corporations and small-medium enterprises (SMEs), offering varied leasing options that can yield stable rental income. The demand for commercial properties in Gurgaon continues to grow, especially in well-connected regions like EBD 83.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3150\" data-start=\"2941\"><strong data-end=\"2967\" data-start=\"2943\">Retail Rental Yields</strong>: Retail spaces in <strong data-end=\"2996\" data-start=\"2986\">EBD 83</strong> could also offer good returns, given the increasing demand for services by businesses and the large number of employees working in the surrounding areas.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" data-end=\"3155\" data-start=\"3152\"></div>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3191\" data-start=\"3157\"><strong data-end=\"3190\" data-start=\"3161\">Market Competition in ROI</strong>:</h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"3384\" data-start=\"3193\">To understand how <strong data-end=\"3221\" data-start=\"3211\">EBD 83</strong> fares in terms of ROI compared to other commercial developments in <strong data-end=\"3300\" data-start=\"3289\">Gurgaon</strong>, it&rsquo;s important to compare it to similar projects in the area. Let\'s break it down:</p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"3440\" data-start=\"3386\">1. <strong data-end=\"3439\" data-start=\"3394\">Dwarka Expressway Commercial Developments</strong>:</h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"4250\" data-start=\"3444\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4009\" data-start=\"3444\"><strong data-end=\"3456\" data-start=\"3446\">EBD 83</strong> is one of the key commercial hubs along the <strong data-end=\"3522\" data-start=\"3501\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>, but it faces competition from several other developments, such as:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"4009\" data-start=\"3596\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3723\" data-start=\"3596\"><strong data-end=\"3638\" data-start=\"3598\">M3M Urbana Business Park (Sector 67)</strong>: A large commercial development with office spaces, retail outlets, and F&amp;B options.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3847\" data-start=\"3729\"><strong data-end=\"3763\" data-start=\"3731\">BPTP Park Centra (Sector 30)</strong>: Another prominent business park that offers office spaces, retail units, and more.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4009\" data-start=\"3853\"><strong data-end=\"3888\" data-start=\"3855\">Ambience Business Park (NH-8)</strong>: Offers Grade-A office spaces and is located on the <strong data-end=\"3970\" data-start=\"3941\">Gurgaon-Dwarka Expressway</strong>, with a strong rental yield potential.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"4250\" data-start=\"4013\">These competitors are also offering modern office spaces, retail outlets, and have similar proximity to the Dwarka Expressway, which puts pressure on <strong data-end=\"4175\" data-start=\"4165\">EBD 83</strong> to differentiate itself and maintain competitive rental rates and pricing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"4296\" data-start=\"4252\">2. <strong data-end=\"4295\" data-start=\"4260\">Cyber City and Golf Course Road</strong>:</h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"4974\" data-start=\"4300\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4748\" data-start=\"4300\"><strong data-end=\"4316\" data-start=\"4302\">Cyber City</strong>, located in <strong data-end=\"4352\" data-start=\"4329\">Gurgaon&rsquo;s Sector 25</strong> and <strong data-end=\"4377\" data-start=\"4357\">Golf Course Road</strong>, has been a major commercial hub for MNCs, IT firms, and office spaces for the past decade. These areas are <strong data-end=\"4506\" data-start=\"4486\">well-established</strong> and offer high demand, but the supply of office spaces in these areas is limited due to land scarcity, making <strong data-end=\"4627\" data-start=\"4617\">EBD 83</strong> an attractive alternative for businesses looking to set up near <strong data-end=\"4706\" data-start=\"4692\">Cyber City</strong> but at potentially more affordable rates.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4974\" data-start=\"4752\">However, because Cyber City is already a well-established commercial hub, it might offer slightly <strong data-end=\"4876\" data-start=\"4852\">higher rental yields</strong>, making it a more competitive option when compared to <strong data-end=\"4941\" data-start=\"4931\">EBD 83</strong>, particularly in the short-term.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"5011\" data-start=\"4976\">3. <strong data-end=\"5010\" data-start=\"4984\">Manesar and Sohna Road</strong>:</h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"5473\" data-start=\"5015\">\r\n<li data-end=\"5473\" data-start=\"5015\">Areas like <strong data-end=\"5039\" data-start=\"5028\">Manesar</strong> and <strong data-end=\"5058\" data-start=\"5044\">Sohna Road</strong> offer competitive office spaces at more <strong data-end=\"5120\" data-start=\"5099\">affordable prices</strong> when compared to <strong data-end=\"5148\" data-start=\"5138\">EBD 83</strong>. These locations have <strong data-end=\"5213\" data-start=\"5171\">emerged as alternative commercial hubs</strong>, catering to industrial companies and manufacturing sectors, which may not be as attractive for IT or service-based companies. However, for <strong data-end=\"5383\" data-start=\"5354\">cost-conscious businesses</strong>, these areas might pose competition to <strong data-end=\"5433\" data-start=\"5423\">EBD 83</strong> on the basis of <strong data-end=\"5472\" data-start=\"5450\">cost-effectiveness</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"5547\" data-start=\"5475\">4. <strong data-end=\"5546\" data-start=\"5483\">Golf Course Extension Road &amp; Southern Peripheral Road (SPR)</strong>:</h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"6050\" data-start=\"5551\">\r\n<li data-end=\"6050\" data-start=\"5551\">The <strong data-end=\"5587\" data-start=\"5557\">Golf Course Extension Road</strong> and <strong data-end=\"5620\" data-start=\"5592\">Southern Peripheral Road</strong> also have a mix of <strong data-end=\"5674\" data-start=\"5640\">high-end commercial properties</strong>, such as <strong data-end=\"5701\" data-start=\"5684\">DLF Cyber Hub</strong>, <strong data-end=\"5716\" data-start=\"5703\">Worldmark</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"5740\" data-start=\"5722\">Infinity Tower</strong>. These locations are more expensive, but they still compete with <strong data-end=\"5816\" data-start=\"5806\">EBD 83</strong> in terms of providing high-quality infrastructure and proximity to major commercial hubs. The advantage of <strong data-end=\"5934\" data-start=\"5924\">EBD 83</strong> is that it\'s relatively <strong data-end=\"5968\" data-start=\"5959\">newer</strong> and offers <strong data-end=\"6007\" data-start=\"5980\">affordable rental rates</strong> compared to some of these prime locations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" data-end=\"6055\" data-start=\"6052\"></div>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"6088\" data-start=\"6057\"><strong data-end=\"6087\" data-start=\"6061\">Expected ROI in EBD 83</strong>:</h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\" data-end=\"7531\" data-start=\"6090\">\r\n<li data-end=\"6612\" data-start=\"6090\"><strong data-end=\"6113\" data-start=\"6093\">Office Space ROI</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"6612\" data-start=\"6118\">\r\n<li data-end=\"6430\" data-start=\"6118\">The <strong data-end=\"6147\" data-start=\"6124\">annual rental yield</strong> for <strong data-end=\"6169\" data-start=\"6152\">office spaces</strong> in commercial districts like EBD 83 typically ranges between <strong data-end=\"6243\" data-start=\"6231\">6% to 8%</strong>. Given the location along <strong data-end=\"6291\" data-start=\"6270\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> and its development, EBD 83 is likely to see <strong data-end=\"6347\" data-start=\"6337\">stable</strong> and <strong data-end=\"6376\" data-start=\"6352\">steady rental income</strong> as more businesses establish themselves in the area.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"6612\" data-start=\"6434\">With the <strong data-end=\"6467\" data-start=\"6445\">metro connectivity</strong> and the anticipated <strong data-end=\"6498\" data-start=\"6488\">growth</strong> of the region, there is potential for an <strong data-end=\"6569\" data-start=\"6540\">increase in rental demand</strong>, which could lead to higher ROI over time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"7075\" data-start=\"6614\"><strong data-end=\"6637\" data-start=\"6617\">Retail Space ROI</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"7075\" data-start=\"6642\">\r\n<li data-end=\"6910\" data-start=\"6642\">For <strong data-end=\"6665\" data-start=\"6648\">retail spaces</strong>, the ROI could vary between <strong data-end=\"6707\" data-start=\"6694\">7% to 10%</strong> depending on the footfall and the tenant profile. As EBD 83 becomes more developed and more people start working in the area, demand for retail outlets (cafes, restaurants, gyms, etc.) will likely rise.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"7075\" data-start=\"6914\">Retail spaces in well-located business districts generally have <strong data-end=\"6998\" data-start=\"6980\">higher returns</strong> than office spaces, especially if the area becomes a <strong data-end=\"7074\" data-start=\"7052\">commercial hotspot</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"7531\" data-start=\"7077\"><strong data-end=\"7104\" data-start=\"7080\">Capital Appreciation</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"7531\" data-start=\"7109\">\r\n<li data-end=\"7355\" data-start=\"7109\"><strong data-end=\"7135\" data-start=\"7111\">Capital appreciation</strong> in <strong data-end=\"7149\" data-start=\"7139\">EBD 83</strong> could be strong over the next <strong data-end=\"7193\" data-start=\"7180\">5&ndash;7 years</strong>. As infrastructure improves, especially with the metro link, and the demand for commercial space in the region increases, property values are likely to increase.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"7531\" data-start=\"7359\">Investors who buy early, especially when the prices are still relatively competitive, could see significant <strong data-end=\"7486\" data-start=\"7469\">capital gains</strong> as the area matures and grows in popularity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"7557\" data-start=\"7538\"><strong data-end=\"7557\" data-start=\"7542\">Conclusion:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"8047\" data-start=\"7559\"><strong data-end=\"7595\" data-start=\"7559\">Emaar Business District (EBD) 83</strong> is well-positioned in the <strong data-end=\"7643\" data-start=\"7622\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> market to offer competitive <strong data-end=\"7679\" data-start=\"7672\">ROI</strong> potential, though it faces competition from other commercial hubs like <strong data-end=\"7765\" data-start=\"7751\">Cyber City</strong>, <strong data-end=\"7781\" data-start=\"7767\">Sohna Road</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"7807\" data-start=\"7787\">Golf Course Road</strong>. However, due to its <strong data-end=\"7851\" data-start=\"7829\">strategic location</strong>, <strong data-end=\"7878\" data-start=\"7853\">modern infrastructure</strong>, and upcoming infrastructure projects like the <strong data-end=\"7953\" data-start=\"7926\">Dwarka Expressway Metro</strong>, it stands as a promising investment for both <strong data-end=\"8017\" data-start=\"8000\">rental yields</strong> and <strong data-end=\"8046\" data-start=\"8022\">capital appreciation</strong>.</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"8292\" data-start=\"8049\">\r\n<li data-end=\"8165\" data-start=\"8049\"><strong data-end=\"8069\" data-start=\"8051\">Short-Term ROI</strong>: Competitive, with steady rental yields, especially for <strong data-end=\"8143\" data-start=\"8126\">office spaces</strong> and <strong data-end=\"8164\" data-start=\"8148\">retail units</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"8292\" data-start=\"8166\"><strong data-end=\"8185\" data-start=\"8168\">Long-Term ROI</strong>: High potential for <strong data-end=\"8230\" data-start=\"8206\">capital appreciation</strong> as the area continues to develop and attract more businesses.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Step-by-Step Process to Book a Unit in Emaar Business District (EBD) 83</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"394\" data-start=\"348\"><strong data-end=\"394\" data-start=\"353\">Step 1: Research and Select Your Unit</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"398\">\r\n<li data-end=\"759\" data-start=\"398\"><strong data-end=\"430\" data-start=\"400\">Identify Your Requirements</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"759\" data-start=\"438\">\r\n<li data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"438\">Determine the <strong data-end=\"470\" data-start=\"454\">type of unit</strong> you\'re interested in (office space, retail space, etc.).</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"657\" data-start=\"533\">Decide on the <strong data-end=\"557\" data-start=\"549\">size</strong> you require (e.g., 500 sq. ft. for small office spaces or 3,000+ sq. ft. for larger office spaces).</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"759\" data-start=\"663\">Consider the <strong data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"678\">floor preference</strong> (e.g., ground floor for retail or upper floors for offices).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"763\"><strong data-end=\"787\" data-start=\"765\">Review the Options</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"795\">\r\n<li data-end=\"905\" data-start=\"795\">Visit the <strong data-end=\"824\" data-start=\"807\">Emaar website</strong> or contact <strong data-end=\"858\" data-start=\"836\">real estate agents</strong> who specialize in the Emaar Business District.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"911\">Look at <strong data-end=\"936\" data-start=\"921\">price lists</strong>, <strong data-end=\"954\" data-start=\"938\">availability</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"976\" data-start=\"960\">layout plans</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1027\" data-start=\"979\"><strong data-end=\"1027\" data-start=\"984\">Step 2: Contact the Sales Team or Agent</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1488\" data-start=\"1031\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1265\" data-start=\"1031\"><strong data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"1033\">Reach out to the Emaar Sales Team</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"1265\" data-start=\"1078\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1265\" data-start=\"1078\">You can contact the official <strong data-end=\"1129\" data-start=\"1109\">Emaar sales team</strong> for <strong data-end=\"1144\" data-start=\"1134\">EBD 83</strong>. This can be done by visiting their office, calling their helpline, or filling out an inquiry form on the Emaar website.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"1488\" data-start=\"1269\"><strong data-end=\"1306\" data-start=\"1271\">Engage a Real Estate Consultant</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"1488\" data-start=\"1314\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1488\" data-start=\"1314\">If you&rsquo;re more comfortable with professional advice, consider working with a real estate agent who has access to the latest offerings and can guide you through the process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1534\" data-start=\"1490\"><strong data-end=\"1534\" data-start=\"1495\">Step 3: Site Visit &amp; Final Decision</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2005\" data-start=\"1538\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1894\" data-start=\"1538\"><strong data-end=\"1565\" data-start=\"1540\">Schedule a Site Visit</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"1894\" data-start=\"1573\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1573\">Before committing to a unit, arrange a site visit to <strong data-end=\"1638\" data-start=\"1628\">EBD 83</strong> to check the location, view, amenities, and infrastructure. This helps in making an informed decision.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1894\" data-start=\"1747\">The site visit will also give you a chance to ask questions regarding <strong data-end=\"1844\" data-start=\"1819\">construction progress</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1862\" data-start=\"1846\">availability</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"1893\" data-start=\"1868\">customization options</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"2005\" data-start=\"1898\"><strong data-end=\"1920\" data-start=\"1900\">Select Your Unit</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"2005\" data-start=\"1928\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2005\" data-start=\"1928\">After the site visit, confirm the unit type and size that meets your needs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2049\" data-start=\"2007\"><strong data-end=\"2049\" data-start=\"2012\">Step 4: Negotiation and Agreement</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2532\" data-start=\"2053\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2338\" data-start=\"2053\"><strong data-end=\"2078\" data-start=\"2055\">Negotiate the Terms</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"2338\" data-start=\"2086\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2196\" data-start=\"2086\">Discuss the <strong data-end=\"2109\" data-start=\"2100\">price</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2127\" data-start=\"2111\">payment plan</strong>, and other terms of the lease or sale with the sales team or agent.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2338\" data-start=\"2202\">If you are purchasing, negotiate the <strong data-end=\"2255\" data-start=\"2241\">total cost</strong>, including any additional charges for <strong data-end=\"2309\" data-start=\"2294\">maintenance</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2318\" data-start=\"2311\">GST</strong>, or <strong data-end=\"2337\" data-start=\"2323\">stamp duty</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"2532\" data-start=\"2342\"><strong data-end=\"2377\" data-start=\"2344\">Sign a Letter of Intent (LOI)</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"2532\" data-start=\"2385\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2528\" data-start=\"2385\">Once you&rsquo;ve agreed on the terms, an <strong data-end=\"2430\" data-start=\"2423\">LOI</strong> (Letter of Intent) may be signed. This document expresses your intent to purchase/lease the unit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2581\" data-start=\"2533\"><strong data-end=\"2581\" data-start=\"2538\">Step 5: Due Diligence and Documentation</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2965\" data-start=\"2585\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2965\" data-start=\"2585\"><strong data-end=\"2634\" data-start=\"2587\">Verification of Legal and Financial Aspects</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"2965\" data-start=\"2642\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2811\" data-start=\"2642\"><strong data-end=\"2661\" data-start=\"2644\">Due diligence</strong> is important. Ensure that the <strong data-end=\"2711\" data-start=\"2692\">legal documents</strong> are in order, such as <strong data-end=\"2749\" data-start=\"2734\">title deeds</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2769\" data-start=\"2751\">land approvals</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"2810\" data-start=\"2775\">property registration documents</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2961\" data-start=\"2817\">If you are purchasing, you will also need to check <strong data-end=\"2896\" data-start=\"2870\">financial arrangements</strong>, including the <strong data-end=\"2929\" data-start=\"2912\">loan approval</strong> from your bank (if applicable).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"3016\" data-start=\"2966\"><strong data-end=\"3016\" data-start=\"2971\">Step 6: Payment of Initial Booking Amount</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3342\" data-start=\"3020\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3342\" data-start=\"3020\"><strong data-end=\"3048\" data-start=\"3022\">Pay the Booking Amount</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"3342\" data-start=\"3056\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3182\" data-start=\"3056\">Once you&rsquo;re satisfied with the unit and have agreed on the price, you will be required to pay an <strong data-end=\"3181\" data-start=\"3155\">initial booking amount</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3268\" data-start=\"3188\">The booking amount can range from <strong data-end=\"3237\" data-start=\"3224\">5% to 10%</strong> of the total cost of the unit.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3342\" data-start=\"3274\">This amount will be deducted from the final price of the property.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"3393\" data-start=\"3344\"><strong data-end=\"3393\" data-start=\"3349\">Step 7: Signing the Sale/Lease Agreement</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3861\" data-start=\"3397\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3567\" data-start=\"3397\"><strong data-end=\"3424\" data-start=\"3399\">Prepare the Agreement</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"3567\" data-start=\"3432\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3567\" data-start=\"3432\">After the booking amount is paid, Emaar will provide you with a <strong data-end=\"3516\" data-start=\"3498\">Sale Agreement</strong> (if buying) or a <strong data-end=\"3553\" data-start=\"3534\">Lease Agreement</strong> (if leasing).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"3861\" data-start=\"3571\"><strong data-end=\"3592\" data-start=\"3573\">Review and Sign</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"3861\" data-start=\"3600\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3720\" data-start=\"3600\">Go through the document carefully, review all terms (payment schedule, possession date, etc.), and sign the agreement.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3857\" data-start=\"3726\">You may also need to provide <strong data-end=\"3774\" data-start=\"3757\">KYC documents</strong> (such as <strong data-end=\"3796\" data-start=\"3784\">ID proof</strong>, <strong data-end=\"3815\" data-start=\"3798\">address proof</strong>, <strong data-end=\"3849\" data-start=\"3817\">company registration details</strong>, etc.).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"3906\" data-start=\"3862\"><strong data-end=\"3906\" data-start=\"3867\">Step 8: Make the Remaining Payments</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"4443\" data-start=\"3910\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4150\" data-start=\"3910\"><strong data-end=\"3939\" data-start=\"3912\">Follow the Payment Plan</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"4150\" data-start=\"3947\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4150\" data-start=\"3947\">The remaining amount will usually be paid in <strong data-end=\"4010\" data-start=\"3994\">installments</strong> according to the payment plan, which is often tied to <strong data-end=\"4092\" data-start=\"4065\">construction milestones</strong> (if purchasing) or <strong data-end=\"4136\" data-start=\"4112\">pre-determined dates</strong> (if leasing).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"4443\" data-start=\"4154\"><strong data-end=\"4176\" data-start=\"4156\">Payment Schedule</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"4443\" data-start=\"4184\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4443\" data-start=\"4184\">The <strong data-end=\"4206\" data-start=\"4190\">payment plan</strong> may be broken down into stages, including:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"square\" data-end=\"4443\" data-start=\"4257\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4292\" data-start=\"4257\"><strong data-end=\"4277\" data-start=\"4259\">Booking Amount</strong> (paid upfront)</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4355\" data-start=\"4300\"><strong data-end=\"4329\" data-start=\"4302\">Construction Milestones</strong> (for purchase agreements)</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4443\" data-start=\"4363\"><strong data-end=\"4384\" data-start=\"4365\">Possession Fees</strong> (final payments after construction completion or handover)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"4481\" data-start=\"4445\"><strong data-end=\"4481\" data-start=\"4450\">Step 9: Handover/Occupation</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"4837\" data-start=\"4485\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4753\" data-start=\"4485\"><strong data-end=\"4509\" data-start=\"4487\">Possession of Unit</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"4753\" data-start=\"4517\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4640\" data-start=\"4517\">Once the final payment is made and all documentation is complete, you will be handed over the <strong data-end=\"4627\" data-start=\"4613\">possession</strong> of the unit.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4753\" data-start=\"4646\">In case of <strong data-end=\"4675\" data-start=\"4659\">retail units</strong>, you may need to complete interior customization before opening for business.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"4837\" data-start=\"4757\">For <strong data-end=\"4780\" data-start=\"4763\">office spaces</strong>, the building is often ready for immediate <strong data-end=\"4836\" data-start=\"4824\">fit-outs</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" data-end=\"4842\" data-start=\"4839\"></div>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"4888\" data-start=\"4844\"><strong data-end=\"4888\" data-start=\"4848\">Documents You Will Need for Booking:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"5356\" data-start=\"4890\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4976\" data-start=\"4890\"><strong data-end=\"4910\" data-start=\"4892\">Identity Proof</strong>: PAN Card, Aadhaar Card, Passport, or Voter ID (for individuals).</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"5104\" data-start=\"4977\"><strong data-end=\"5011\" data-start=\"4979\">Company Registration Details</strong>: (for corporate buyers) &ndash; MOA (Memorandum of Association), Partnership Deed, or Company PAN.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"5162\" data-start=\"5105\"><strong data-end=\"5124\" data-start=\"5107\">Address Proof</strong>: Utility bill, rental agreement, etc.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"5221\" data-start=\"5163\"><strong data-end=\"5180\" data-start=\"5165\">Photographs</strong>: Passport-sized photos for KYC purposes.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"5275\" data-start=\"5222\"><strong data-end=\"5249\" data-start=\"5224\">Authorization Letters</strong>: For corporate investors.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"5356\" data-start=\"5276\"><strong data-end=\"5294\" data-start=\"5278\">Bank Details</strong>: For payment processing and loan details if taking financing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" data-end=\"5361\" data-start=\"5358\"></div>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"5400\" data-start=\"5363\"><strong data-end=\"5400\" data-start=\"5367\">Step 10: Post-Booking Support</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"5880\" data-start=\"5404\">\r\n<li data-end=\"5678\" data-start=\"5404\"><strong data-end=\"5440\" data-start=\"5406\">Customizations &amp; Interior Work</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"5678\" data-start=\"5448\">\r\n<li data-end=\"5570\" data-start=\"5448\">If you are planning on doing a custom <strong data-end=\"5508\" data-start=\"5488\">interior fit-out</strong>, you can proceed with construction once the handover is done.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"5674\" data-start=\"5576\">Some developers like Emaar may also offer <strong data-end=\"5648\" data-start=\"5620\">interior design services</strong> or recommend contractors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"5880\" data-start=\"5682\"><strong data-end=\"5703\" data-start=\"5684\">Regular Updates</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"5880\" data-start=\"5711\">\r\n<li data-end=\"5880\" data-start=\"5711\">Keep in touch with the sales or customer service team for updates on the progress of your booking, expected possession date, and any potential changes in the timeline.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" data-end=\"5885\" data-start=\"5882\"></div>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"5936\" data-start=\"5887\"><strong data-end=\"5936\" data-start=\"5891\">Key Considerations Before Booking a Unit:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"6734\" data-start=\"5938\">\r\n<li data-end=\"6118\" data-start=\"5938\"><strong data-end=\"5960\" data-start=\"5940\">Legal Clearances</strong>: Make sure all legal paperwork, approvals, and certifications (including <strong data-end=\"6055\" data-start=\"6034\">RERA registration</strong>, <strong data-end=\"6075\" data-start=\"6057\">land ownership</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"6103\" data-start=\"6081\">building approvals</strong>) are in place.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"6384\" data-start=\"6119\"><strong data-end=\"6142\" data-start=\"6121\">Market Conditions</strong>: Research the <strong data-end=\"6174\" data-start=\"6157\">market trends</strong> in the <strong data-end=\"6203\" data-start=\"6182\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> area. With ongoing infrastructure development, the property value is expected to appreciate, but it&rsquo;s always wise to ensure the project aligns with your long-term investment goals.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"6555\" data-start=\"6385\"><strong data-end=\"6411\" data-start=\"6387\">Possession Timelines</strong>: Ensure that Emaar has a <strong data-end=\"6462\" data-start=\"6437\">clear possession date</strong> or <strong data-end=\"6494\" data-start=\"6466\">expected completion date</strong>, especially if you\'re purchasing an under-construction unit.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"6734\" data-start=\"6556\"><strong data-end=\"6575\" data-start=\"6558\">Payment Plans</strong>: Understand the <strong data-end=\"6613\" data-start=\"6592\">payment structure</strong> (e.g., <strong data-end=\"6649\" data-start=\"6621\">construction-linked plan</strong>, <strong data-end=\"6677\" data-start=\"6651\">possession-linked plan</strong>, etc.) and be comfortable with the installment schedule.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d14039.30366341824!2d76.95974863636977!3d28.39432548909559!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d3d9b422c1ce9%3A0x34ae954d0bb6a321!2sSector%2083%2C%20Gurugram%2C%20Haryana%20122004!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1726568739075!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 83', '', '', 'XJ6U6Y1M', 20, 'EBD 83 Sector 83', 'EBD 83 Sector 83', 'EBD 83 Sector 83', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(158, 'The Omaxe State Dwarka Sector 19', '190625063712omaxe-with-a2p-realtech-Investment.jpg', '<ul style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<div data-widget_type=\"heading.default\" data-settings=\"{\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"5405e37\">\r\n<div>\r\n<h2>What Makes This Project Unique &amp;</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-widget_type=\"heading.default\" data-settings=\"{\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"b1f5399\">\r\n<div>\r\n<h2>One-Of-Its-Kind For Investors?</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<blockquote>5-10 Mins Drive from the IGI Airport</blockquote>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<blockquote>A Vicinity of 500-700 meters from Asia&rsquo;s Largest Golf Course</blockquote>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<blockquote>Proximity to Sector 9 and Sector 12 Metro Stations.</blockquote>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<blockquote>10 Minutes Drive from Yashobhoomi Convention Centre</blockquote>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<blockquote>A Few Minutes Drive from Prominent Commercial Hubs in Delhi and Gurgaon</blockquote>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<blockquote>20-35 Minutes Drive from Residential Zones like Janakpuri, Rajouri Garden, Punjabi Bagh, and others.</blockquote>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 276, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h1>The Omaxe State Dwarka: Revolutionizing Retail and Investment in India with A2P REALTECH PVT LTD</h1>\r\n<p>Welcome to the future of retail and investment in India: The&nbsp;Omaxe State Dwarka. This groundbreaking project, brought to you by A2P REALTECH PVT LTD, is set to revolutionize the way we think about commercial spaces. With its prime location in Dwarka, one of Delhi\'s most sought-after areas, and its state-of-the-art amenities, The Omaxe State Dwarka offers an unprecedented opportunity for businesses and investors alike.</p>\r\n<p>The Omaxe State Dwarka is designed to cater to the needs of modern retailers, with spacious and well-appointed shops, ample parking space, and excellent connectivity. The project aims to create a vibrant and thriving retail ecosystem, attracting both local shoppers and visitors from afar. With its innovative design and strategic location, The Omaxe State Dwarka is poised to become a hub for retail and investment activity in the region.</p>\r\n<p>A2P REALTECH PVT LTD, known for its commitment to delivering high-quality real estate projects, has left no stone unturned in creating a world-class development that meets the highest standards of excellence. The Omaxe State Dwarka is the result of their vision and expertise, combining cutting-edge design, top-notch infrastructure, and unparalleled customer service.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re a business owner looking to expand your operations or an investor seeking lucrative opportunities, The Omaxe State Dwarka is a game-changer. Get ready to be a part of the future of retail and investment in India.</p>\r\n<h2>The significance of retail and investment in India</h2>\r\n<p>India has emerged as one of the most promising and dynamic markets for retail and investment in the world. With a rapidly growing economy, a burgeoning middle class, and increasing urbanization, the demand for quality retail spaces and lucrative investment opportunities has never been higher.</p>\r\n<p>The retail sector in India has seen exponential growth in recent years, driven by the rising disposable incomes, changing consumer preferences, and the increasing penetration of organized retail. From traditional markets to modern shopping malls, the Indian retail landscape has undergone a significant transformation, offering a wide range of products and services to cater to the diverse needs of the population.</p>\r\n<p>Similarly, the real estate sector in India has become a prime destination for both domestic and foreign investors. The country\'s robust economic growth, favorable demographic trends, and supportive government policies have made it an attractive investment destination, with opportunities ranging from residential properties to commercial&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>The role of A2P REALTECH PVT LTD in revolutionizing retail and investment</h2>\r\n<p>A2P REALTECH PVT LTD, the developer behind The Omaxe State Dwarka, has a proven track record of delivering high-quality real estate projects that cater to the evolving needs of the market. With a deep understanding of the Indian real estate landscape and a commitment to innovation, the company has consistently pushed the boundaries of what is possible in the industry.</p>\r\n<p>At the heart of A2P REALTECH PVT LTD\'s approach is a relentless focus on customer satisfaction. The company\'s team of experts works closely with clients to understand their unique requirements and develop tailored solutions that meet their needs. This customer-centric philosophy has been instrumental in the success of The Omaxe State Dwarka, as the project has been designed with the end-user in mind, whether they are retail businesses or investors.</p>\r\n<p>The Omaxe State Dwarka is a testament to A2P REALTECH PVT LTD\'s commitment to excellence and innovation. The project\'s cutting-edge design, state-of-the-art amenities, and strategic location have all been carefully considered to create a truly transformative retail and investment destination. By leveraging the latest technologies and industry best practices, the company has set a new benchmark for commercial real estate development in India, paving the way for a future where retail and investment opportunities are truly unparalleled.</p>\r\n<h2>Investment opportunities in The Omaxe State Dwarka</h2>\r\n<p>The Omaxe State Dwarka presents a unique and compelling investment opportunity for those seeking to capitalize on the growing retail and commercial real estate landscape in India. With its prime location, exceptional infrastructure, and strong tenant demand, the project offers investors the potential for stable and long-term returns.</p>\r\n<p>One of the key advantages of investing in The Omaxe State Dwarka is the project\'s strategic location in Dwarka, a rapidly developing region that has become a hub for commercial and residential activity in the Delhi-NCR area. The area\'s growing population, rising disposable incomes, and increasing demand for quality retail and commercial spaces make it an attractive investment destination.</p>\r\n<p>Investors in The Omaxe State Dwarka can also benefit from the project\'s state-of-the-art amenities and infrastructure, which include ample parking, high-speed internet connectivity, and a robust security system. These features not only enhance the overall appeal of the project but also contribute to its long-term sustainability and profitability. Furthermore, the project\'s carefully curated tenant mix and strong marketing efforts ensure a steady stream of foot traffic and rental income for investors.</p>\r\n<h2>Retail opportunities in The Omaxe State Dwarka</h2>\r\n<p>The Omaxe State Dwarka presents an unparalleled opportunity for retailers looking to establish a presence in one of the most vibrant and rapidly growing markets in India. With its strategic location, exceptional infrastructure, and commitment to creating a thriving retail ecosystem, the project offers businesses a unique platform to reach and engage with a diverse customer base.</p>\r\n<p>One of the key advantages of setting up a retail operation in The Omaxe State Dwarka is the project\'s accessibility and connectivity. Situated near major transportation hubs, including the Dwarka Expressway and the upcoming Dwarka Metro Station, the project offers seamless access to both local and regional customers, making it an ideal location for businesses seeking to expand their reach.</p>\r\n<p>The project\'s state-of-the-art infrastructure, including high-speed internet, reliable power supply, and advanced security systems, ensures a hassle-free and efficient operating environment for retailers. Additionally, the carefully curated tenant mix and dynamic marketing strategies employed by A2P REALTECH PVT LTD are designed to drive footfall and ensure long-term success for the businesses.</p>\r\n<h2>Testimonials from satisfied investors and retailers</h2>\r\n<p>\"Investing in The Omaxe State Dwarka has been a game-changer for our portfolio. The project\'s strategic location, exceptional infrastructure, and strong tenant demand have provided us with a stable and lucrative investment opportunity. We\'ve been impressed by the dedication and professionalism of the A2P REALTECH PVT LTD team, who have consistently delivered on their promises and ensured the long-term success of our investment.\" - Rajesh Sharma, Seasoned Investor</p>\r\n<p>\"As a retailer, setting up our store in The Omaxe State Dwarka has been a truly rewarding experience. The project\'s accessibility, high-quality amenities, and vibrant atmosphere have allowed us to reach a wider customer base and achieve remarkable growth. The support and guidance provided by the A2P REALTECH PVT LTD team have been invaluable, and we are excited to be a part of this thriving retail ecosystem.\" - Neha Gupta, Successful Retailer</p>\r\n<p>\"The Omaxe State Dwarka has exceeded our expectations in every way. The project\'s design, infrastructure, and overall execution have been truly impressive, and we are proud to be associated with this development. The A2P REALTECH PVT LTD team has demonstrated a deep understanding of the market and a commitment to delivering a world-class project that caters to the evolving needs of both investors and retailers.\" - Aditya Chopra, Prominent Business Owner</p>\r\n<h2>The future of retail and investment in India</h2>\r\n<p>The Omaxe State Dwarka is not just a real estate project; it is a testament to the transformative potential of the Indian retail and investment landscape. As the country continues to experience rapid economic growth and urbanization, the demand for quality commercial spaces and lucrative investment opportunities will only continue to rise.</p>\r\n<p>The Omaxe State Dwarka, with its innovative design, state-of-the-art infrastructure, and strategic location, is poised to become a benchmark for the future of retail and investment in India. By setting new standards of excellence and catering to the evolving needs of businesses and investors, the project has the potential to reshape the way we think about commercial real estate development in the country.</p>\r\n<p>As more investors and retailers recognize the immense potential of The Omaxe State Dwarka, the project is likely to become a hub of activity and a catalyst for further growth and development in the region. The project\'s success will not only benefit the businesses and investors who have placed their trust in it but also the broader community, as it contributes to the economic and social well-being of the area.</p>\r\n<h2>Conclusion: Why The Omaxe State Dwarka is the ideal choice for retail and investment opportunities in India</h2>\r\n<p>In conclusion, The Omaxe State Dwarka is the embodiment of the future of retail and investment in India. Developed by the visionary team at A2P REALTECH PVT LTD, this project offers a unique blend of features and benefits that cater to the evolving needs of businesses and investors alike.</p>\r\n<p>From its prime location in the heart of Dwarka to its state-of-the-art infrastructure and amenities, The Omaxe State Dwarka has been designed to provide an unparalleled experience for both retailers and investors. The project\'s strategic positioning, innovative design, and commitment to customer satisfaction have made it a game-changer in the Indian real estate landscape.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you are a business owner looking to expand your operations or an investor seeking lucrative opportunities, The Omaxe State Dwarka is the ideal choice. With its strong tenant demand, stable cash flows, and long-term growth potential, the project offers a compelling investment proposition that is sure to deliver exceptional returns. As the Indian retail and investment market continues to evolve, The Omaxe State Dwarka stands as a shining example of what is possible when vision, expertise, and innovation come together to create a truly transformative development.</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3503.9164470625938!2d77.03663327616277!3d28.57227158681341!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1bb60b0952bb%3A0x48ccdb44e433c7cc!2sThe%20Omaxe%20State!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1728501279640!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '7500000', '75, 000 Sq. Ft. Sports Arena', 'Sector 19, Dwarka, New Delhi', '', '', 'RGDR5HQ9', 20, 'The Omaxe State Dwarka: Revolutionizing Retail and Investment in India with A2P REALTECH PVT LTD', 'What Makes This Project Unique & One-Of-Its-Kind For Investors? 5-10 Mins Drive from the IGI Airport A Vicinity of 500-700 meters from Asia’s Largest Golf Course Proximity to Sector 9 and Sector 12 Metro Stations. 10 Minutes Drive from Yashobhoomi Convention Centre A Few Minutes Drive from Prominent Commercial Hubs in Delhi and Gurgaon 20-35 Minutes Drive from Residential Zones like Janakpuri, Rajouri Garden, Punjabi Bagh, and others.', 'Welcome to the future of retail and investment in India: The Omaxe State Dwarka. This groundbreaking project, brought to you by A2P REALTECH PVT LTD, is set to revolutionize the way we think about commercial spaces. With its prime location in Dwarka, one of Delhi\'s most sought-after areas, and its state-of-the-art amenities, The Omaxe State Dwarka offers an unprecedented opportunity for businesses and investors alike.', NULL, NULL),
(159, 'M3M Mansion Luxury Apartment Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '130225072739M3M_mansion_Sec_113_Gurgaon_Dwarka_Expressway.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>24x7 Uninterrupted Power Supply</li>\r\n<li>24X7 Water Supply</li>\r\n<li>Amphitheater</li>\r\n<li>Banquet Hall</li>\r\n<li>Business Center</li>\r\n<li>Cafeteria</li>\r\n<li>Car Parking</li>\r\n<li>Carrom Board</li>\r\n<li>CCTV</li>\r\n<li>Children\'s Play Area</li>\r\n<li>Club House</li>\r\n<li>Community Hall</li>\r\n<li>Day Care Center</li>\r\n<li>Entrance Lobby</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 271, '', '181024062054map.jpg', '181024062054map (1).jpg', '', '', '', '', '<h1>Spacious 3.5 &amp; 4.5 BHK Residences in Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway,&nbsp;Gurgaon</h1>\r\n<p>&nbsp;M3M Mansion, a luxurious residential enclave nestled in the heart of Sector 113 on Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon. Designed to redefine opulence and sophistication, M3M Mansion offers a lifestyle of unparalleled comfort and exclusivity. With its strategic location and premium amenities, this residential masterpiece embodies sheer elegance and contemporary living at its finest. Experience the epitome of urban living at M3M Mansion, where every detail is meticulously crafted to cater to your discerning taste. From spacious living spaces to thoughtfully curated facilities, this residential gem transcends expectations to deliver a truly exceptional living experience. Discover a harmonious blend of modern architecture and lavish comforts, promising residents a life of absolute luxury and convenience. Step into a world where every moment is infused with grandeur and style &ndash; welcome to M3M Mansion at Sector 113, where luxury meets lifestyle effortlessly.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>M3M Mansion represents the ideal combination of luxury and convenience, appealing to discerning buyers seeking an exceptional living experience. The meticulously designed residences, complete with high-end finishes and spacious layouts, redefine modern luxury. The extensive array of amenities caters to a diverse range of lifestyles, ensuring that every resident can find their niche within the community. The strategic location of M3M Mansion further enhances its appeal by providing easy access to essential services and vibrant urban life. This focus on convenience allows residents to enjoy a lifestyle that balances luxury with practicality, making daily life more enjoyable and less stressful. The positive testimonials from satisfied homeowners reinforce the project\'s commitment to quality and community, highlighting the genuine satisfaction of those who have chosen to make M3M Mansion their home. Ultimately, M3M Mansion stands out as a premier choice in the luxury real estate market, offering a living experience that goes beyond expectations. With a strong reputation, innovative design, and a holistic approach to living, it is clear why M3M Mansion is the perfect choice for those seeking both luxury and convenience in their next home. Investing in M3M Mansion is not just about acquiring a property; it is about embracing a lifestyle that embodies sophistication, comfort, and community.</p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 31.2719%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 1px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0px; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"width: 71.8697%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">Configuration</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 28.0741%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">Size (Sq. Ft)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.8697%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">3.5 BHK + Servant&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.0741%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">2080</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.8697%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">3.5 BHK + Study + Study</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.0741%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">2310</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.8697%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">3.5 BHK + Servant + Study</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.0741%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">2342</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.8697%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">4.5 BHK + Study</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.0741%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">2700</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.8697%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">4.5 BHK + Study + Servant</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.0741%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">3000 to 3415</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.8697%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">Penthouse</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.0741%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">6510</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.8697%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">3 BHK + Family Lounge + Servant</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.0741%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">4290</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.8697%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">4 BHK + Family Lounge + Servant</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28.0741%; padding: 1px; border-color: #000000;\">5900 to 5960</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of Sector 113 M3M Mansion Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon &amp; Its Location Advantages</strong></h2>\r\n<p>M3M Mansion is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 113, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. Developed by M3M India, this project offers spacious 3.5 and 4.5 BHK high-rise apartments, with sizes ranging from approximately 2,080 to 3,000 square feet. The residences are designed to provide a blend of modern architecture and serene green spaces, redefining high-end urban living.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>9-Hole Golf Course:</strong> Residents can enjoy an elite golfing experience within the premises.</li>\r\n<li><strong>World-Class Outdoor Pool:</strong> A pristine pool designed for both recreation and luxury.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Expansive Green Spaces:</strong> Acres of lush greenery and open areas promote a healthy and invigorating lifestyle.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Grand Clubhouse:</strong> A 60,000 sq. ft. clubhouse, the largest on Dwarka Expressway, offering a vibrant social space for residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Scenic Views:</strong> Unmatched vistas of the Delhi Reserve Greens enhance the living experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Luxury Amenities:</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Swimming Pool</strong> &ndash; Temperature-controlled pool with a pool deck.<br><strong>State-of-the-Art Gymnasium</strong> &ndash; Fully equipped for a premium fitness experience.<br><strong>Spa &amp; Wellness Center</strong> &ndash; High-end wellness facilities for relaxation.<br><strong>Indoor &amp; Outdoor Sports Facilities</strong> &ndash; Includes squash courts, badminton, and tennis courts.<br><strong>Children&rsquo;s Play Area</strong> &ndash; Dedicated kids\' zone with safe and engaging activities.<br><strong>Multipurpose Hall &amp; Banquet</strong> &ndash; Ideal for community gatherings and private events.<br><strong>Library &amp; Reading Lounge</strong> &ndash; Peaceful spaces for book lovers.<br><strong>Music &amp; Art Room</strong> &ndash; Creative spaces for art and music enthusiasts.<br><strong>Jogging &amp; Cycling Tracks</strong> &ndash; Dedicated lanes for a healthy lifestyle.<br><strong>Yoga &amp; Meditation Deck</strong> &ndash; Serene spaces for mindfulness and relaxation.<br><strong>Dedicated Pet Area</strong> &ndash; Pet-friendly zones within the complex.<br><strong>Luxury Retail &amp;&nbsp;Caf&eacute;</strong> &ndash; High-end shopping and dining options within the project.</p>\r\n<p>These amenities are designed to cater to the diverse needs of residents, ensuring a luxurious and comfortable lifestyle.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Location Advantages:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Sector 113 offers distinct advantages due to its strategic location:</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Major Hubs:</strong> The project provides seamless connectivity to NH-8, Dwarka Expressway, Cyber City, and other key business hubs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Educational Institutions:</strong> Top schools and upcoming universities are easily accessible, making it ideal for families.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Healthcare Facilities:</strong> Renowned hospitals are in close vicinity, ensuring prompt medical attention when needed.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Shopping and Entertainment:</strong> Upscale shopping malls and entertainment centers are nearby, catering to leisure and lifestyle needs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport:</strong> Approximately 10 km away, enhancing travel convenience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Metro Station:</strong> About 3 km from the project, providing easy access to Delhi and surrounding areas.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Diplomatic Enclave:</strong> Approximately 2.5 km away, adding to the area\'s prestige.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Upcoming Developments:</strong> Close to the upcoming DU biggest university and ISBT, as well as Asia\'s largest 8-hole golf course, all within a 3 km radius.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These location advantages make M3M Mansion a sought-after address for those seeking a balanced urban lifestyle with unparalleled connectivity and amenities.</p>\r\n<p>In summary, M3M Mansion in Sector 113, Gurgaon, offers a luxurious living experience with its thoughtfully designed residences, world-class amenities, and strategic location, making it an ideal choice for discerning homebuyers.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>To book a unit in M3M Mansion, Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon through A2P Realtech, you can follow these steps:</strong></h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Contact A2P Realtech:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Phone:</strong> Call <strong>A2P Realtech team</strong> to discuss available units, pricing, and any ongoing offers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Email:</strong> Send your inquiries to <strong>team@a2prealtech.com</strong> for detailed information.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Site Visit:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Arrange a visit to the M3M Mansion site to explore the property firsthand.</li>\r\n<li>During the visit, assess the unit layouts, amenities, and the overall environment to ensure it aligns with your preferences.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Discuss Payment Plans:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Inquire about the available payment plans.</li>\r\n<li>Understand the booking amount, installment schedules, and any financial arrangements offered.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Complete Booking Formalities:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Once you\'ve selected a unit, fill out the necessary booking forms provided by A2P Realtech.</li>\r\n<li>Submit the required documents, which may include identification proofs, address proofs, and financial documents.</li>\r\n<li>Pay the booking amount as per the agreed terms to secure your unit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Stay Informed:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>After booking, maintain regular communication with A2P Realtech for updates on construction progress, possession timelines, and any other pertinent information.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>By following these steps, you can efficiently book a unit in M3M Mansion through A2P Realtech. Ensure that all terms are clearly understood and documented to facilitate a smooth transaction.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', 'https://maps.app.goo.gl/7QSvRpu2FbpksqyB8', '', '45000000', 'Unit Area : 2342 SQFT', 'Sector 113 Gurgaon', '', '', '5AQYF1M0', 23, 'M3M Mansion Luxury Apartment Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'M3M Mansion Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'M3M Mansion The Perfect Blend of Luxury and Convenience', NULL, NULL),
(160, 'Experience Opulent Living at M3M Mansion Sector 113', '070225090028M3M_Mansion_113 _blog.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>Luxurious Clubhouse</li>\r\n<li>Squash Court</li>\r\n<li>Badminton Court</li>\r\n<li>Gymnasium</li>\r\n<li>Kids Play Area</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Skating</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>SURROUNDING LANDMARKS</strong></li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;IGI AIRPORT</li>\r\n<li>INTERNATIONAL SPORTS HUB</li>\r\n<li>BHARAT VANDANA PARK</li>\r\n<li>DWARKA GOLF CLUB</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;YASHOBHUMI</li>\r\n<li>DIPLOMATIC ENCLAVE II</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 271, '', '1910240721233bhk (1).jpg', '1910240721233bhk.jpg', '', '', '', '', '<p>Golf-Inspired Ultra-Luxury Residences Unveiling Grand Apartments and Penthouses-A2P Realtech Experience opulent living like never before at M3M Mansion, a haven of luxuriously designed residences in the heart of the city. Inspired by golf, these ultra-luxury apartments and penthouses redefine elegance and sophistication. Nestled amidst lush landscapes and boasting world-class amenities, M3M Mansion offers a truly holistic living experience. With exquisite interiors, breathtaking views, and a host of recreational facilities, these grand residences epitomize opulence and luxury. Enjoy the perfect blend of privacy and exclusivity in spacious apartments and penthouses that are thoughtfully designed to cater to your every need. Whether it\'s unwinding in the serene surroundings, indulging in a game of golf, or simply relaxing by the pool, M3M Mansion offers a lifestyle that is both indulgent and relaxing. Strategically located, M3M Mansion provides convenient access to the city\'s finest dining, shopping, and entertainment destinations. With a reputation for excellence, M3M Mansion promises an unparalleled living experience that is sure to captivate even the most discerning individuals. Welcome to the epitome of luxury living at M3M Mansion, where every moment is a celebration of grandeur and refinement.</p>', '', '', '45000000', 'Size on Request', 'M3M Mansion Sector 113', '', '', 'HGIQDPFY', 23, 'Experience Opulent Living at M3M Mansion', 'M3M Mansion, Sector 113, A2P Realtech, Penthouses', 'Experience Opulent Living at M3M Mansion  Golf-Inspired Ultra-Luxury Residences Unveiling Grand Apartments and Penthouses-A2P Realtech', NULL, NULL);
