(161, 'Sobha City Gurgaon', '100725050048Sobha-City-Sector-108-Dwarka-Expressway-Gurgaon.jpg', '<h2 data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1044\">Amenities &amp; Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1129\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"14\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Clubhouses</strong>: Two clubhouses (~40&ndash;50K?sq?ft total)</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1214\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1214\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"21\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Sports Facilities</strong>: 90?m diameter cricket ground, tennis courts (3), indoor badminton (2), basketball, squash, volleyball, and a 9?hole putting green</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1299\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1299\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"24\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Resort-style lakelet</strong>: 1?acre lake with Olympic?sized pool &amp; island deck, plus kids&rsquo; pool</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1382\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"15\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Other perks</strong>: Party lawn (1.25?acre), camping ground, rooftop gardens, jogging/biking trail, pet park, community farm, amphitheatre, dedicated seniors&rsquo; zone, 24&times;7 security</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 270, '', '21102408452012cf8d0ea18001779261f8fd5d3cc1.jpg', '2110240845200f2fd60e829f3e9c2faaf55c074556.jpg', '', '', '', '', '<p>Welcome to Sobha City Gurgaon, where luxury living meets modern elegance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A2P Realtech presents an exquisite collection of 2 and 3 BHK apartments designed to fulfill your dream of owning a perfect home.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With thoughtful architecture and world-class amenities, these apartments offer a lifestyle like no other.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Located in the heart of Gurgaon, Sobha City is the epitome of luxury and convenience. Every aspect of these homes has been meticulously crafted to provide you with the utmost comfort and sophistication.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From spacious interiors to panoramic views, every detail has been carefully considered to create a haven that you can truly call your own. Sobha City Gurgaon is more than just a residential complex; it is a community that fosters a sense of belonging and togetherness.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With landscaped gardens, a state-of-the-art clubhouse, and a range of recreational facilities, there is always something to do for residents of all ages.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re looking to relax by the pool or engage in fitness activities, there is no shortage of options. Discover your dream home at Sobha City Gurgaon and experience the true essence of luxury living.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"111\">&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"111\">Project Overview</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"348\">\r\n<li data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"269\">\r\n<p data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"269\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"16\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Size &amp; Scope</strong>: Spanning 39 acres with over <strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"60\">8.5 acres</strong> of lush green open spaces</span> &nbsp;<span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Now hosting 22 towers (&ldquo;Vista Residences&rdquo;) with 396 units, total units ~1,700+</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"348\">\r\n<p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"348\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"23\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Tower Configuration</strong>: G+18 to G+24, low density layout (4 flats per floor) ensuring privacy; peripheral placement provides unobstructed views</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"377\">&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"377\">Unit Types &amp; Prices</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"711\">\r\n<li data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"458\">\r\n<p data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"458\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"9\" data-is-only-node=\"\">2BHK</strong> (<span class=\"caption_subdued_medium configurationCards__cardAreaSubHeadingOne\">1381 - 1692 sq.ft.</span>):&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"543\">\r\n<p data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"543\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"9\" data-is-only-node=\"\">3BHK</strong> (<span class=\"caption_subdued_medium configurationCards__cardAreaSubHeadingOne\">1711 - 2343 sq.ft.</span>):&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"628\">\r\n<p data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"628\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"30\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Larger units (3.5&ndash;4.5 BHK)</strong>: 2,343sqft</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"711\">\r\n<p data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"711\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"19\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Premium segment</strong> (4BHK &ldquo;Vista Residences&rdquo;):&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"716\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"755\">&nbsp;Prime Location &amp; Connectivity</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n<li data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"840\">\r\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"840\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Direct access off <strong data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"45\">Upper Dwarka Expressway</strong>, 15min from IGI Airport, 15min from Cyber City, ~10min to Delhi&rsquo;s Dwarka</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"840\">\r\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"840\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Bordered by Delhi&rsquo;s protected green belts on two sides; development flaunts a 500m wide frontage on a 75m operational road</span> 3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n<p data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"1008\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Upcoming infrastructure: MCG planning connector from CRPF Chowk, and GMDA&rsquo;s elevated SPR corridor will boost accessibility further</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1013\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1044\">&nbsp;Amenities &amp; Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1129\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"14\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Clubhouses</strong>: Two clubhouses (40&ndash;50K sqft total)</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1214\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1214\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"21\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Sports Facilities</strong>: 90m diameter cricket ground, tennis courts (3), indoor badminton (2), basketball, squash, volleyball, and a 9hole putting green</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1299\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1299\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"24\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Resort-style lakelet</strong>: 1acre lake with Olympic?sized pool &amp; island deck, plus kids&rsquo; pool</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1382\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"15\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Other perks</strong>: Party lawn (1.25?acre), camping ground, rooftop gardens, jogging/biking trail, pet park, community farm, amphitheatre, dedicated seniors&rsquo; zone, 24&times;7 security</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1414\">Timeline &amp; Status</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1582\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1499\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1499\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"14\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Possession</strong>: Phases underway, final Vista phase expected from 2028</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1582\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1582\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"8\" data-is-only-node=\"\">RERA</strong>: Registered under GGM/410/142/2020/26 &amp; multiple earlier RERA numbers</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1587\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1618\">&nbsp;Why Choose Sobha City?</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"2023\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1710\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1710\"><strong data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1651\">Premium urban park living</strong>: Extensive greenery, low density, high quality finishes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1814\"><strong data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1749\">Exceptional lifestyle amenities</strong>: Clubhouses, sports, recreation &mdash; comparable to resort living.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1939\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1939\"><strong data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1844\">Excellent connectivity</strong>: Access to Delhi, IGI Airport, Gurgaon IT hub, plus enhanced via upcoming road developments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"2023\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"2023\"><strong data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1962\">Privacy &amp; views</strong>: Peripheral towers, no shared walls, flanked by green belts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>Why Invest in Sobha City Sector 108 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon ?</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"259\">Investing in <strong data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"67\">Sobha City, Sector 108, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> offers several compelling advantages &mdash; both for homebuyers seeking premium living and for investors eyeing long-term capital appreciation. Here\'s a breakdown of the <strong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"258\">key reasons to invest</strong>:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"264\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"297\">&nbsp;1. <strong data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"297\">Brand Trust: SOBHA</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"557\">\r\n<li data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"453\">\r\n<p data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"453\"><strong data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"314\">Reputation</strong>: SOBHA is one of India&rsquo;s most trusted luxury developers, known for quality construction, timely delivery, and in-house design/engineering.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"557\">\r\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"557\"><strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"472\">Track Record</strong>: Legacy of delivering high-end homes with attention to detail and premium materials.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"562\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"622\">&nbsp;2. <strong data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"622\">Prime Location: Sector 108, Dwarka Expressway</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"1098\">\r\n<li data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"752\">\r\n<p data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"752\"><strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"647\">Proximity to Delhi</strong>: Just 0.5km from the Delhi border; excellent access to Dwarka, IGI Airport (15 mins), and South Delhi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"900\"><strong data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"776\">Emerging Corridor</strong>: Located on the <strong data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"841\">Dwarka Expressway (Northern Peripheral Road)</strong> &mdash; one of the hottest upcoming investment corridors in NCR.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"1098\">\r\n<p data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"926\"><strong data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"925\">Connectivity Boost</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1098\">\r\n<li data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"976\">\r\n<p data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"976\">Upcoming <strong data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"976\">Urban Extension Road-II (UER-II)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1022\">\r\n<p data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1022\">Metro Phase-IV expansion (Dwarka&ndash;Gurgaon)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1098\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1098\">Close to <strong data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1061\">Diplomatic Enclave-II</strong> and proposed AIIMS Jhajjar extension</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1103\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1159\">3. <strong data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1159\">Massive Township with Low-Density Living</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1435\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1263\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1263\"><strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1186\">Spread over 39 acres</strong>, Sobha City is among the <strong data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1241\">largest gated communities</strong> on Dwarka Expressway.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1347\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1347\">Low density: Only 4 apartments per floor &rarr; more privacy and better airflow/light.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1435\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1435\">Surrounded by Delhi\'s reserved green zones &rarr; protected from future over-construction.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1481\">&nbsp;4. <strong data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1481\">Best-in-Class Amenities</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1829\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1630\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1630\"><strong data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1510\">2 luxurious clubhouses</strong>, 90m <strong data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1534\">cricket ground</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1558\">Olympic-sized pool</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1581\">resort-style lake</strong>, 3 tennis courts, indoor badminton, squash, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1723\">More than <strong data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1671\">8.5 acres of open greens</strong>, jogging tracks, party lawn, pet park, senior zone.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1829\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1829\">You essentially get a <strong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1768\">resort lifestyle</strong> with sports, leisure, wellness, and social zones integrated.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1834\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1885\">&nbsp;5. <strong data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1885\">Strong Investment &amp; Rental Potential</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"2157\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1979\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1979\">Property values on <strong data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1956\">Dwarka Expressway have appreciated by 15&ndash;25%</strong> in the past few years.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2073\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2073\">Proximity to <strong data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2010\">IGI Airport</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2030\">DLF Cyber City</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2051\">Udyog Vihar</strong> boosts rental yields.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2157\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2157\">High demand for <strong data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2121\">premium gated communities</strong> among expats, corporates, and NRIs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2162\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2212\">&nbsp;6. <strong data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2212\">RERA Approved &amp; Phased Development</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2422\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2283\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2283\">Multiple RERA-registered phases &rarr; transparency and legal compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2422\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2422\">Possession already started in early phases; newer &ldquo;Vista Residences&rdquo; readying for 2028 &rarr; good for both end-use and staggered investment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2427\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2475\">&nbsp;7. <strong data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2475\">Sustainable &amp; Future-Proof Living</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2655\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2559\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2559\">Green construction practices, rainwater harvesting, solar power for common areas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2655\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2655\">Landscaped green zones, zero-discharge community planning, low carbon footprint architecture.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2660\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2688\">&nbsp;8. <strong data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2688\">Peace of Mind</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2843\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2788\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2788\">Excellent security systems: 24x7 CCTV, gated access, fire safety, and visitor management systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2843\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2843\">Well-managed society with in-house maintenance team.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2848\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2871\">&nbsp;Summary Table:</h3>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse