" data-col-size=\"md\">Clubhouse, sports, lake, senior/pet zones, large open greens</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3586\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3511\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Community</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3586\" data-col-size=\"md\">Low-density, elite, secure gated society</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"3687\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"3613\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Connectivity</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\" data-start=\"3613\" data-end=\"3687\" data-col-size=\"md\">Airport, Cyber City, Metro, Diplomatic Enclave within 15&ndash;20 mins reach</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\" dir=\"auto\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-5\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col\">\r\n<div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"user\" data-message-id=\"f23ac18d-07fc-49f9-b34d-eb371d9f8d96\">\r\n<div cla