\"248\" data-end=\"251\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"301\">Step 2: Share Your Budget &amp; Preferences</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"461\">\r\n<li data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"382\">\r\n<p data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"382\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Specify your requirements: <strong data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"50\">2, 3, 3.5, or 4BHK</strong>, unit size preferences (1,381sqft for 2BHK, upwards to 2,343 sqft for larger units)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"382\">\r\n<p data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"382\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Mention your <strong data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"33\">preferred budget</strong> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"466\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"517\">Step 3: Project Presentation &amp; Site Visit</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"773\">\r\n<li data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n<p data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"559\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P Realtech will share:</span></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n<li data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"645\">\r\n<p data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"645\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Unit availability, floor plans, prices, payment plan</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n<p data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"731\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Amenities overview: clubhouses, lakelet, sports facilities on 39-acre campus</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"773\">\r\n<p data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"773\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">They&rsquo;ll set up a <strong data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"31\">site visit</strong> or virtual tour with a representative guiding you.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"778\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"819\">&nbsp;Step 4: Select &amp; Book Your Unit</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"1083\">\r\n<li data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"863\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Choose the unit that fits your criteria (orientation, view, tower).</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"1083\">\r\n<p data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"907\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P will assist in:</span></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1083\">\r\n<li data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<p data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"953\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Filling out the booking form</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1039\">\r\n<p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1039\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Collecting initial payment (usually <strong data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"52\">5Lakhs EOI</strong>)</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1083\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1083\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Collecting documents: ID proof, address, PAN, address proof, as required.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1088\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1125\">&nbsp;Step 5: Payment &amp; Allotment</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1252\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1210\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1210\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">You&rsquo;ll follow the <strong data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"38\">payment schedule</strong></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1252\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1252\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">After verification &amp; payment, you receive the <strong data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"71\">unit allotment letter</strong> and go through the <strong data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"118\">Builder&ndash;Buyer Agreement</strong>.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1295\">&nbsp;Step 6: Monitor &amp; Coordinate</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1339\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1339\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P keeps you posted on construction milestones and payment reminders.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1381\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">They facilitate meetings with Sobha for <strong data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"63\">legal verifications</strong>, RERA compliance, and document exchange.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1386\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1425\">&nbsp;Step 7: POSSESSION &amp; HANDOVER</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1552\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1510\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1510\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Pay balance along with <strong data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"58\">registration stamp duty charges</strong> at possession (project possession expected from <strong data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"115\">2028</strong>)</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1552\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1552\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Collect keys, complete documentation of handover.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1557\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1588\">Why Use A2P Realtech?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1715\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1673\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">They specialize in Gurgaon properties and serve as a single point of coordination between you and the developer</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1715\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1715\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Experienced in assisting clients with <strong data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"85\">negotiations, document checks, bank liaison</strong>, and construction updates.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1720\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1754\">&nbsp;Checklist Before Booking</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"2004\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1838\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Confirm <strong data-start=\"8\" data-end=\"29\">RERA registration</strong> of the unit/phase (multiple RERA numbers listed)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1881\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1881\">Review the <strong data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1868\">payment plan</strong> in writing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1942\">Check pathways for <strong data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1929\">cancellation or refund</strong>, if needed</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"2004\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"2004\">Consider <strong data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2004\">unit orientation, tower specs, floor selection</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2009\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2177\">Would you like me to connect you with A2P Realtech directly, arrange a site tour, or compare Sobha City phases and pricing options? Just let me know your preferences!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\" dir=\"auto\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-6\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\">\r\n<h6 class=\"sr-only\">&nbsp;</h6>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3505.7989347949!2d76.99343637604261!3d28.515696489375735!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d10b3cc51e083%3A0x431929af5ec098e5!2sSOBHA%20City%20Gurugram!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1752170254813!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 108 gurgaon', '', '', 'GZBI8IRZ', 19, 'Discover Your Dream Home at Sobha City Gurgaon Luxury 2 & 3 BHK Apartments by A2P Realtech', 'Sobha City Gurgaon, A2P Realtech, Luxury Apartment', 'A2P Realtech presents an exquisite collection of 2 and 3 BHK apartments designed to fulfill your dream of owning a perfect home.', NULL, NULL),
(162, 'Sobha', '20251212162839_Sobha-Sector-106.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Waiting Lounge</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Steam Room</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Bar/Chill-out Lounge &nbsp; Spa</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Barbecue Area</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Reflexology Park</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Party Hall</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Badminton Court</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Table Tennis</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Kid\'s Pool</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Gymnasium</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Squash Court</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Yoga / Meditation Area</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Indoor Games</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Cycling &amp; Jogging Track&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Banquet Hall</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Infinity Pool</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Cafeteria</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 303, '', '121124115520SOBHA 3 BHK + Utility Space 3230 Sq.Ft. floor plan.png', '121124115520SOBHA 4 BHK + Utility 3914 Sq.Ft. floor plan.png', '', '', '', '', '<p>Welcome to the unparalleled luxury of Sobha Apartments in Sector 106 Gurgaon. If you\'re seeking a truly elevated living experience in one of India\'s most vibrant cities, look no further. Sobha\'s commitment to excellence and attention to every detail ensures that these apartments are the ultimate choice for those who appreciate the finer things in life. With a perfect blend of exquisite design, world-class amenities, and a prime location, Sobha Apartments in Sector 106 Gurgaon offer a lifestyle that is truly unparalleled. Each apartment is crafted to perfection, with spacious layouts, high-end finishes, and beautiful views that create a sense of tranquility and sophistication. Located in Sector 106, Gurgaon, Sobha Apartments provide easy access to the city\'s major commercial hubs, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and entertainment options. Whether you\'re a young professional, a growing family, or a retiree seeking a peaceful retreat, these apartments cater to your every need. Discover the epitome of luxury living at Sobha Apartments in Sector 106 Gurgaon. Indulge in the finest amenities, bask in the breathtaking views, and experience a lifestyle that is second to none. Make the ultimate choice and elevate your living experience today, Call A2P Realtech Pvt Ltd on +91-8130525001 to get the more details of Sobha Sector 106 Gurgaon Luxury Project, A2P Realtech will give you comprehensive guide which can help you to take right decision.</p>\r\n<p>SOBHA Sector 106 Floor Type and Price Type Area&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><col style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Type</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Area (Sq.Ft.)</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Price (Rs.)</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">1 BHK</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">677</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Rs.&nbsp;1.5 Cr</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">3 BHK</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">3044</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Rs.&nbsp;7.30 Cr</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">3 BHK + Utility Space</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">3230</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Rs.&nbsp;7.75 Cr</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">4 BHK + Utility</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">3914</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Rs.&nbsp;9.39 Cr</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '5.51 Acres', 'Sector 106 Gurgaon', '', '', '98LMG49C', 19, 'The Unparalleled Luxury of Sobha: Your Ultimate Choice for Apartments in Sector 106 Gurgaon', 'Sobha, Luxury, dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech', 'Sobha\'s commitment to excellence and attention to every detail ensures that these apartments are the ultimate choice for those who appreciate the finer things in life. ', NULL, NULL),
(163, 'Retail Shops at Sobha Sector 106 ', '191124083916Sobha Sector 106 Retail Shops in Dwarka Expressway- A2P Realtech.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>Schools</li>\r\n<li>Hospitals</li>\r\n<li>Malls</li>\r\n<li>Recreational Centers</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; 24/7 security surveillance</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Ample parking space for both two-wheelers and four-wheelers</li>\r\n<li>High-speed elevators</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Power backup</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Well-maintained common areas</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Green spaces and landscaped areas are integrated into the design</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 303, '', '191124083916master-plan.jpg', '1911240839161.jpg', '', '', '', '', '<p>Attention, shopaholics! Get ready to immerse yourself in a retail paradise like no other at Sobha Sector 106 Gurgaon, brought to you by A2P Realtech. With its exclusive deals and irresistible discounts, this destination is a shopaholic\'s dream come true. Step into a world of luxury retail shops that cater to every need and desire. From high-end fashion boutiques to trendy accessories stores, Sobha Sector 106 Gurgaon has it all. Indulge in the latest fashion trends, treat yourself to exquisite jewelry, or revamp your home with stunning d&eacute;cor items &ndash; the options are endless. But that\'s not all. Sobha Sector 106 Gurgaon offers a seamless shopping experience with its state-of-the-art facilities. Ample parking space, convenient access, and attentive staff ensure that you can enjoy your shopping spree without any hassles. Don\'t miss out on the chance to discover exclusive deals and discounts at Sobha Sector 106 Gurgaon. Prepare to be amazed by the incredible shopping experience that awaits you at this premium destination. Shop till you drop and create memories that will last a lifetime.</p>', '', '', '', 'Various sizes', 'Sector 106 ', '', '', 'LN1RN30O', 20, 'Discover Exclusive Deals on Retail Shops at Sobha Sector 106 Gurgaon with A2P Realtech', 'Sobha Retail Shops Sector 106, Retail Shops, Sobha, A2P Realtech', 'Attention, shopaholics! Get ready to immerse yourself in a retail paradise like no other at Sobha Sector 106 Gurgaon, brought to you by A2P Realtech', NULL, NULL),
(164, 'Hero Homes', '2911241033445 Reasons why Hero Homes should be your top choice.jpg', '<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">Application-based home automation system</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">Fingerprint scanner enabled main door lock with a 5-tier security system</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">IGBC gold pre-certification homes</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">Electric car charging points</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">Zero vehicular traffic at ground level</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">9 Acres of wellness including healing garden, ayurveda hub, reflexology and hanging gardens</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">25000sqft clubhouse and 50+ new age amenities</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 304, '', '291124103344Floor PLan.png', '', '', '', '', '', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>5 Reasons why Hero Homes should be your top choice Looking for your dream home?</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Look no further than Hero Homes, the perfect choice for your ideal living space. With a reputation for excellence and innovation in the real estate industry, Hero Homes offers a unique and extraordinary living experience that goes beyond your expectations. In this article, we will explore five compelling reasons why Hero Homes should be your top choice.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Reason #1</strong>: Unrivaled Quality and Craftsmanship. Hero Homes is committed to delivering homes built to the highest industry standards. Every detail is meticulously designed with the homeowner in mind, ensuring exceptional quality and craftsmanship.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Reason #2</strong>: Prime Locations. Hero Homes carefully selects prime locations that offer convenience, accessibility, and a vibrant lifestyle. Whether you\'re looking for a bustling city location or a peaceful suburban oasis, Hero Homes has the perfect spot for you.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Reason #3:</strong> World-Class Amenities. Enjoy a plethora of world-class amenities at Hero Homes, designed to enhance your lifestyle and provide endless comfort and entertainment. From state-of-the-art fitness centers to lush green spaces, every detail is carefully curated.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Reason #4: </strong>Sustainable Living. Hero Homes is dedicated to sustainable living, incorporating eco-friendly practices and technologies into their projects. Live in harmony with the environment while reducing your carbon footprint.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Reason #5:</strong> Excellent Customer Service. Hero Homes prides itself on its commitment to exceptional customer service. Their professional and knowledgeable team is always ready to assist you at every step of the way, ensuring a seamless and stress-free home buying experience. Discover the extraordinary and make Hero Homes your top choice for your dream home.</p>', '', '', '', '1359 - 1689 sq.ft.', 'Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'T8KS2FWF', 19, '5 Reasons why Hero Homes should be your top choice', 'HERO Homes, Dwarka Expressway, Premium House, Luxury Apartment', 'Looking for your dream home? Look no further than Hero Homes, the perfect choice for your ideal living space. With a reputation for excellence and innovation in the real estate industry, Hero Homes offers a unique and extraordinary living experience that goes beyond your expectations', NULL, NULL);
