tate-of-the-art amenities, and unparalleled quality', NULL, NULL),
(169, 'TATA Gurgaon Gateway Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '2401251112432, 3, 4, 5 BHK Apartment in Gurgaon Gateway Sector 112 (2).jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Tata Gurgaon Gateway&nbsp;Amenities</strong></li>\r\n<li>Car Parking</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;24X7 Security</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;CCTV Camera</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Club House</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Fire Fighting</li>\r\n<li>Gym</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Jogging Track</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Lift</li>\r\n<li>Maintenance Staff</li>\r\n<li>Park</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Water Storage</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Gymnasium</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Housekeeping</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Power Backup</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Swimming Pool</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 307, '', '2401251112432bhk TATA GURGAON GATEWAY FLOOR PLAN.jpg', '2401251112433BHK  Double Height Deck Balcony floor plan GURGAON GATEWAY.jpg', '', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>Tata Gurgaon Gateway &nbsp;The Perfect Blend of Luxury and Convenience in Sector 112, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Welcome to Tata Gurgaon Gateway, the epitome of luxury and convenience in Sector 112, Gurgaon. Nestled amidst nature and designed to perfection, this residential development by Tata Realty offers a harmonious blend of contemporary living and serene surroundings. Imagine waking up to breathtaking views of lush green landscapes and enjoying an array of modern amenities at your fingertips. With spacious and well-appointed apartments, Tata Gurgaon Gateway is your escape from the chaos of city life, while still being conveniently connected to key areas in Gurgaon. Whether you\'re relaxing by the pool, working out in the state-of-the-art fitness center, or spending quality time with your loved ones in the landscaped gardens, every moment at Tata Gurgaon Gateway will rejuvenate your senses and enhance your lifestyle. Strategically located in Sector 112, the development offers easy access to the Dwarka Expressway, making commuting to Delhi and other parts of Gurgaon a breeze. Moreover, with top-notch schools, hospitals, and shopping complexes in close proximity, you\'ll always have everything you need within reach. Experience the perfect blend of luxury and convenience at Tata Gurgaon Gateway. Come home to a life of tranquility and indulgence.</p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 734px;\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 12.25pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 541.328px;\">\r\n<p><strong>Type</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 189.391px;\">\r\n<p><strong>Area (Sq.Ft.)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 11.6pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 541.328px;\">\r\n<p>2BHK + Study + Private Garden</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 189.391px;\">\r\n<p>1880</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 11.6pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 541.328px;\">\r\n<p>3BHK ONLY</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 189.391px;\">\r\n<p>2215</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 12.25pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 541.328px;\">\r\n<p>3BHK + Double Height Deck Balcony</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 189.391px;\">\r\n<p>2520/2525</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 11.6pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 541.328px;\">\r\n<p>3BHK + Servant + Double Height Deck Balcony</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 189.391px;\">\r\n<p>2870/2895/2925</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of Tata Gurgaon Gateway, Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Tata Gurgaon Gateway is a <strong>luxury residential project</strong> by <strong>Tata Housing</strong>, strategically located in <strong>Sector 112, Gurgaon</strong>, along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>. Designed for an elite urban lifestyle, this <strong>premium development</strong> offers <strong>spacious apartments</strong> with world-class amenities, modern architecture, and excellent connectivity to Delhi and Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Highlights of Tata Gurgaon Gateway</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment Configurations</strong>: 2.5, 3, and 3.5 BHK luxury apartments<br><strong>Unit Sizes</strong>: Ranging from <strong>1,580 sq. ft. to 2,925 sq. ft.</strong><br><strong>Project Area</strong>: <strong>9 acres</strong>, with <strong>6 towers</strong> and <strong>358 residential units</strong><br><strong>Green &amp; Sustainable Living</strong>: Low-density project with <strong>lush landscaped gardens</strong> and open spaces<br><strong>Premium Amenities</strong>: Clubhouse, <strong>infinity pool, fitness center, yoga studio, children&rsquo;s play area, and jogging track</strong></p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Prime Location on Dwarka Expressway</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Situated along the 150-meter-wide Dwarka Expressway</strong>, ensuring smooth connectivity to key areas in Delhi-NCR.</li>\r\n<li>Well-connected to <strong>NH-8, Central Gurgaon, and major business hubs</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Seamless Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Upcoming <strong>metro station nearby</strong>, enhancing convenience for residents.</li>\r\n<li>Close to <strong>Cyber City, Udyog Vihar, and Golf Course Road</strong>, ensuring an easy commute to major employment centers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Surrounded by High-End Residential &amp; Commercial Hubs</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Located in a <strong>developing upscale neighborhood</strong>, ensuring strong investment potential.</li>\r\n<li>Close to <strong>top schools, hospitals, malls, and entertainment zones</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Investment Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>High appreciation value</strong> due to the rapid growth of the <strong>Dwarka Expressway corridor</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for <strong>homebuyers seeking a luxury lifestyle</strong> and <strong>investors looking for long-term growth</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Tata Gurgaon Gateway enjoys a <strong>prime location</strong> in <strong>Sector 112, Gurgaon</strong>, along the rapidly developing <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, making it one of the most sought-after luxury residential projects in the area.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Situated on&nbsp;Dwarka Expressway</strong> &ndash; A <strong>150-meter-wide expressway</strong>, ensuring seamless travel between <strong>Gurgaon and Delhi</strong>.<br><strong>0 km from Delhi</strong> &ndash; One of the closest luxury residential projects to the capital.<br><strong>5 minutes from&nbsp;Dwarka &amp; Diplomatic Enclave</strong> &ndash; Close to the upcoming <strong>Diplomatic Enclave</strong>, increasing its exclusivity and future value.<br><strong>16 km from&nbsp;IGI Airport</strong> &ndash; Quick access to <strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport</strong>, ideal for frequent travelers.<br><strong>Upcoming Metro Connectivity</strong> &ndash; Close to the <strong>planned metro corridor</strong>, enhancing <strong>public transport accessibility</strong>.<br><strong>Easy Access to NH-8</strong> &ndash; Direct connectivity to major commercial hubs like <strong>Cyber City, Udyog Vihar, and Golf Course Road</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Steps to Book a Unit in Tata Gurgaon Gateway, Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon through A2P Realtech</strong></h2>\r\n<h3>If you are looking to book a <strong>luxury apartment</strong> in <strong>Tata Gurgaon Gateway</strong> through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these simple steps:</h3>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>1. Initial Inquiry &amp; Consultation</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Contact A2P&nbsp;Realtech</strong> via their website, phone, or office visit.<br>Discuss&nbsp;<strong>available unit sizes, floor plans, pricing, and payment plans</strong>.<br>Get insights on&nbsp;<strong>amenities, project completion timeline, and investment potential</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>2. Site Visit &amp; Apartment Selection</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Schedule a <strong>site visit</strong> with A2P Realtech to explore the project.<br>&nbsp;Choose a <strong>2.5, 3, or 3.5 BHK apartment</strong> based on your <strong>requirements and budget</strong>.<br>&nbsp;Get assistance in selecting a <strong>floor, layout, and preferred view</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>3. Booking &amp; Documentation</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Fill out the <strong>booking application form</strong> with your personal and financial details.<br>&nbsp;Submit <strong>KYC documents</strong> (Aadhaar, PAN card, passport, address proof, and bank details).<br>&nbsp;Pay the <strong>initial booking amount</strong> as per the <strong>Tata Housing payment plan</strong>.<br>&nbsp;Receive a <strong>booking confirmation receipt</strong> from A2P Realtech and Tata Housing.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>4. Builder-Buyer Agreement &amp; Payment Process</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Sign the <strong>Builder-Buyer Agreement (BBA)</strong> with Tata Housing.<br>&nbsp;Follow the <strong>payment schedule</strong> (Construction-Linked Plan, Down Payment Plan, or Flexi Payment Plan).<br>&nbsp;Ensure timely payments to avoid <strong>cancellation or penalties</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>5. Unit Allotment &amp; Possession</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Once payments are completed, receive the <strong>Allotment Letter</strong>.<br>&nbsp;Post-construction, get <strong>possession of your luxury apartment</strong> along with all legal formalities.<br>&nbsp;Move into your <strong>new home at Tata Gurgaon Gateway</strong>!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For more details and a <strong>hassle-free booking process</strong>, get in touch with <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, and their team will guide you through every step.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '5665 Sq. Ft.', 'Sector 112 Gurgaon Dwarka Expressway', '', '', 'B7UGVOLX', 19, 'Tata Gurgaon Gateway :  The Perfect Blend of Luxury and Convenience in Sector 112, Gurgaon', 'Tata Gurgaon Gateway, Luxury Apartment, Sector 112, A2P Realtech, Luxury Apartment in Sector 112, Tata Housing, Tata Project', 'Welcome to Tata Gurgaon Gateway, the epitome of luxury and convenience in Sector 112, Gurgaon. Nestled amidst nature and designed to perfection, this residential development by Tata Realty offers a harmonious blend of contemporary living and serene surroundings. ', NULL, NULL),
(170, 'M3M Capital Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '070225090219M3M_Capital_Sec_113.jpg', '<p><strong>M3M Capital&nbsp;Amenities</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Car Parking</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;24X7 Security</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;CCTV Camera</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Club House</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Fire Fighting</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Gym</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Jogging Track</li>\r\n<li>Lift</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Maintenance Staff</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Park</li>\r\n<li>Water Storage</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Gymnasium</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Housekeeping</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Power Backup</li>\r\n<li>Swimming Pool</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 271, '', '280125063338FLOOR PLAN OF M3M CAPITAL 3BHK.jpg', '280125063338FLOOR PLAN OF M3M CAPITAL1.jpg', '', '', '', '', '<h2>Get best deals in <strong>M3M Capital Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon with A2P Realtech</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Welcome to M3M Capital, where luxury living reaches new heights. Located in Sector 113, this exquisite residential development offers a one-of-a-kind experience for those seeking the pinnacle of elegance and comfort. Step into a world of refined indulgence as you explore the meticulously designed apartments at M3M Capital.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>M3M Capital is a luxurious residential project located in Sector 113, Gurgaon, strategically positioned along the Dwarka Expressway near the Delhi-Gurgaon border. Developed by M3M India Pvt Ltd., this expansive 17-acre development offers a range of 2.5, 3.5, and 4.5 BHK apartments, with sizes varying from 1,310 to 2,298 square feet</p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 754px;\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 426.328px;\">\r\n<p><strong>Type</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 324.594px;\">\r\n<p><strong>Area (Sq.Ft.)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 426.328px;\">\r\n<p>2.5 BHK&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 324.594px;\">\r\n<p>1310</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 426.328px;\">\r\n<p>3.5 BHK</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 324.594px;\">\r\n<p>1665 to 1695</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 426.328px;\">\r\n<p>4.5 BHK</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 324.594px;\">\r\n<p>2060</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 426.328px;\">\r\n<p>4.5 BHK&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 324.594px;\">\r\n<p>2298</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>When considering the purchase of a residential flat like M3M Capital 113 in Gurgaon, there are several factors to evaluate to determine if it\'s worth it for you:</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Design and Layout:</strong> The apartments are thoughtfully designed with a three-side open layout, ensuring ample natural light and ventilation. Residents can enjoy panoramic views of the Delhi Reserve Greens and the central greens within the complex.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Amenities</strong>: M3M Capital boasts a 9-hole golf course and a spacious clubhouse spanning approximately 75,000 square feet. Additional amenities include a swimming pool, multi-cuisine restaurant, art studios, snooker, spa, wellness center, gym, mini-theater, and professional maintenance services. The development also emphasizes security with perimeter security, CCTV surveillance, and smart card access.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment Features:</strong> Each unit comes equipped with laminated wooden flooring in bedrooms, modular kitchens fitted with chimneys and hobs, air-conditioning in bedrooms and living areas, and branded sanitary fittings in bathrooms. Ample covered parking space is available in the basement.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of M3M Capital Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>M3M Capital is a premium residential project strategically located in <strong>Sector 113, Gurgaon</strong>, along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, near the Delhi-Gurgaon border. Developed by <strong>M3M India Pvt. Ltd.</strong>, this high-rise development spans <strong>17 acres</strong> and offers luxury <strong>2.5, 3.5, and 4.5 BHK apartments</strong> designed for a modern lifestyle.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Highlights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Spacious &amp; Well-Designed Apartments</strong>: Three-side open layouts ensuring ample natural light and ventilation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>World-Class Amenities</strong>: Includes a <strong>9-hole golf course</strong>, a <strong>75,000 sq. ft. clubhouse</strong>, a <strong>swimming pool</strong>, spa, gym, multi-cuisine restaurant, and <strong>mini-theater</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Smart &amp; Secure Living</strong>: Features <strong>perimeter security, CCTV surveillance, and smart card access</strong> for residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Premium Interiors</strong>: Modular kitchens with branded fittings, wooden flooring in bedrooms, and fully air-conditioned apartments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><strong>Location Advantages of M3M Capital, Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>M3M Capital enjoys a <strong>prime location</strong> on <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, offering seamless connectivity between <strong>Delhi and Gurgaon</strong>.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Connectivity &amp; Accessibility:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>0 Km from Delhi</strong>: Strategically located on the Delhi-Gurgaon border.</li>\r\n<li><strong>7 Minutes to IGI Airport</strong>: Easy access to <strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>5 Minutes to Diplomatic Enclave II</strong>: Close to major diplomatic and business hubs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Upcoming Metro Station Nearby</strong>: Enhancing public transport connectivity.</li>\r\n<li><strong>5 Minutes to Asia&rsquo;s Largest Convention Center (IICC)</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Nearby Landmarks:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Commercial &amp; Business Hubs</strong>: Cyber City, Udyog Vihar, and Golf Course Road are within a short drive.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Retail &amp; Entertainment</strong>: Close to shopping malls, cinemas, and fine dining restaurants.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Educational Institutions</strong>: Reputed schools and universities are in close proximity.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Healthcare Facilities</strong>: Top-tier hospitals and healthcare centers nearby.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\r\n<p>M3M Capital Sector 113 offers a <strong>blend of luxury, convenience, and connectivity</strong>, making it a top choice for homebuyers and investors looking for high-end residences in <strong>Gurgaon&rsquo;s fast-developing corridor</strong>. Its <strong>prime location along Dwarka Expressway</strong>, along with <strong>world-class amenities</strong>, makes it one of the most sought-after projects in <strong>NCR</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>Would you like details on pricing, floor plans, or investment potential?</p>\r\n<h3><strong>To book a unit in M3M Capital Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon through A2P Realtech,</strong> you can follow these steps:</h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Contact A2P Realtech</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Call:</strong> speak directly with A2P Realtech sales representative.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Online Inquiry</strong>: Visit their website and fill out the inquiry form to request a callback or more information.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Site Visit</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Arrange a visit to the M3M Capital project site to view the available units and amenities firsthand.</li>\r\n<li>During the visit, discuss your preferences and requirements with the A2P Realtech representative.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Select Your Unit</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Choose the unit type that best suits your needs from the available options (e.g., 2.5 BHK, 3.5 BHK, 4.5 BHK).</li>\r\n<li>Review the floor plans, unit sizes, and pricing details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Booking Process</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Once you\'ve selected a unit, you\'ll need to complete a booking application form provided by A2P Realtech.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>Pay the booking amount as specified.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"6\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Documentation and Agreement</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Submit the necessary documents, such as identification proofs and address proofs, as required.</li>\r\n<li>Review and sign the allotment letter and buyer\'s agreement, which outline the terms and conditions of the purchase.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Payment Plan</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Discuss the payment schedule with A2P Realtech. M3M Capital offers various payment plans, including construction-linked and possession-linked options.</li>\r\n<li>Ensure you understand the payment milestones and adhere to them to avoid any penalties.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Loan Assistance (If Needed)</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>If you require financing, A2P Realtech can assist in connecting you with banking partners for home loan processing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Possession and Handover</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Upon completion of the project and full payment, you\'ll receive possession of your unit as per the agreed timeline.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Note</strong>: It\'s essential to verify all details, including pricing, payment plans, and booking procedures, directly with A2P Realtech, as they may vary. Ensure that all communications and transactions are documented for future reference.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Sector+113,+Bajghera,+Gurugram,+Haryana+122017/@28.5239758,76.9455053,12z/data', '', '', '15 Acres', 'Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'EJY5YSVT', 19, 'M3M Capital Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon', 'M3M Capital, Sector 113 Gurgaon, Premium Apartment , A2P Realtech', 'Experience Luxury Living in M3M Capital: Your Dream Premium Apartment in Sector 113', NULL, NULL);
