(171, 'Emaar New Project Urban Ascent in Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway', '070225090554Emmar_New_Project_a2p_Realtech.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>Swimming Pool</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Gymnasium</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Club House</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Children\'s Play Area</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; EV Charging Stations</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Landscape Garden</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Gazebo</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Amphitheatre</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp; Jogging Track</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 273, '', '3101250816174bhk 2206.6 SQ.FT.jpg', '3101250816174BHK 1959.03 SQ.FT.jpg', '280225055552Urban Ascent Brochure.pdf', '', '', '', '<h2>Emaar New Project Urban Ascent in Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway</h2>\r\n<p>Discover the epitome of luxury living with Emaar\'s exquisite new project in Sector 112. This highly anticipated development showcases Emaar\'s commitment to creating unparalleled spaces that redefine the meaning of opulence and refinement. Spanning acres of prime real estate, this project seamlessly blends architectural brilliance with impeccable design, promising a truly elevated lifestyle. Immerse yourself in a world of sophistication and grandeur as you step into these meticulously crafted residences. Each luxurious unit is thoughtfully designed to maximize comfort and functionality, ensuring every aspect of modern living is catered to. From expansive living spaces to state-of-the-art amenities, every detail has been carefully considered to provide residents with an elevated living experience. Located in Sector 112, this project offers unparalleled connectivity to key areas of the city, making it the perfect home for those seeking convenience and accessibility. Indulge in a world-class lifestyle within a vibrant community that exudes elegance and charm. Experience the ultimate embodiment of luxury living with Emaar\'s newest masterpiece in Sector 112. Embrace an extraordinary lifestyle that truly reflects your taste and aspirations.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 97.5776%; height: 144px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 32.5674%;\"><col style=\"width: 29.7147%;\"><col style=\"width: 37.7179%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36.1719px;\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>2BHK APARTMENT</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>3BHK APARTMENT</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>4BHK APARTMENT</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 53.5625px;\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>1248.61&nbsp;sq.ft.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(116.0&nbsp;sq.m.)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>1485.42 - 1862.15 sq.ft.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(138.0 - 173.0&nbsp;sq.m.)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>1959.03 - 2206.6 sq.ft.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(182.0 - 205.0&nbsp;sq.m.)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of Sector 112,&nbsp;Gurgaon &amp; Its Location Advantages</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong>Sector 112, Gurgaon</strong>, is a rapidly developing area strategically located along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, making it one of the most sought-after investment destinations in the NCR region. The sector is witnessing significant infrastructural development and offers a mix of <strong>luxury residential projects, commercial hubs, and green spaces</strong>, making it an ideal location for homebuyers and investors alike.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3><strong>Key Location Advantages of Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h3>\r\n<ol start=\"2\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Connectivity:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Located <strong>right on Dwarka Expressway (NH-248BB)</strong>, ensuring <strong>seamless connectivity</strong> to Delhi, Gurgaon, and major business districts.</li>\r\n<li><strong>15 minutes from Indira Gandhi International Airport</strong>, making it an attractive option for frequent travelers and professionals.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Close to Cyber City, Udyog Vihar, and other major corporate hubs</strong>, providing excellent job opportunities.</li>\r\n<li>Well-connected to <strong>NH-48 (Delhi-Jaipur Highway)</strong> and <strong>Sohna Road</strong>, improving intra-city mobility.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Upcoming Infrastructure Development:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> is set to become operational soon, reducing travel time between <strong>Gurgaon and Delhi</strong> significantly.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proposed Metro Corridor</strong> under the Gurugram Master Plan will further enhance connectivity.</li>\r\n<li>Close proximity to the <strong>Delhi-Mumbai Industrial Corridor (DMIC)</strong>, a major growth driver for real estate in the region.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Premium Residential Developments:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Sector 112 is home to some of the most luxurious residential projects, including <strong>Emaar Urban Ascent, Experion Windchants, and Earth Elacasa</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Offers <strong>modern amenities, green surroundings, and high-end infrastructure</strong> for a premium living experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Access to Top Educational Institutions &amp; Healthcare Facilities:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Schools Nearby:</strong> Delhi Public School, St. Xavier&rsquo;s High School, Mount Carmel School.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Hospitals:</strong> Medanta - The Medicity, Columbia Asia Hospital, Fortis Hospital, Artemis Hospital.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Retail &amp; Entertainment Hubs:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Nearby Shopping Centers &amp; Malls:</strong> Ambience Mall, MGF Metropolitan, and upcoming high-street retail hubs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Recreational Facilities:</strong> Golf courses, five-star hotels, and entertainment zones in close vicinity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>High ROI &amp; Investment Potential:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Sector 112 is emerging as a real estate hotspot</strong>, with property prices expected to appreciate significantly once the <strong>Dwarka Expressway is fully operational</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Demand from professionals and NRIs</strong> due to its proximity to business districts and the airport.</li>\r\n<li>Presence of <strong>renowned developers like Emaar, Experion, and Earth Infrastructure</strong> ensures high-quality developments with long-term investment potential.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Why Invest in Sector 112, Gurgaon?</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic location</strong> with top-notch connectivity.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Infrastructure growth</strong> and future development prospects.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Premium residential projects</strong> offering world-class amenities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to commercial hubs, educational institutions, and hospitals.</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Potential for high capital appreciation and rental yields.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>With its prime location and upcoming infrastructure projects, <strong>Sector 112 is undoubtedly one of the best investment destinations in Gurgaon</strong>. Whether you\'re looking for a home or a long-term investment, this sector offers immense potential for growth and prosperity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Key features and amenities of&nbsp;Emaar\'s new project Urban Ascent Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon<br></strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Emaar\'s latest luxury residential project, <strong>Urban Ascent</strong>, in Sector 112, Gurgaon, offers a blend of modern design and premium amenities. Strategically located along the Dwarka Expressway, this development provides seamless connectivity to major hubs in both Gurgaon and Delhi.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Spacious Residences:</strong> Urban Ascent offers 3.5 and 4.5 BHK apartments with high ceilings and large windows, ensuring ample natural light and panoramic views.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Modern Interiors:</strong> Each apartment is equipped with marble flooring in living and dining areas, glass railings on balconies, modular kitchens with chimneys and hobs, and appliances such as an oven, microwave, refrigerator, washing machine, and RO system.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Amenities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Clubhouse:</strong> A 36,000 square foot clubhouse featuring a restaurant, caf&eacute;, banquet hall, squash court, indoor games area, and separate swimming pools for adults and children.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Fitness and Recreation:</strong> Facilities include a jogging track, yoga pavilion, Zen garden, open-air theatre, gymnasium, and a multi-purpose court with tennis and basketball facilities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Family-Friendly Spaces:</strong> Dedicated children\'s play areas, outdoor gym, and a pet park cater to diverse family needs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Security and Sustainability:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Advanced Security:</strong> Features like biometric digital locks at apartment main doors, video door phones, and 24/7 CCTV coverage ensure resident safety.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sustainable Living:</strong> Pre-certified with an IGBC Gold rating, the project incorporates rainwater harvesting, water-efficient plumbing, waste recycling, solar-powered common areas, and provisions for EV charging.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Key Destinations:</strong> Less than 0.5 km from Dwarka Expressway, providing direct connectivity to NH-48 and major business hubs in Gurugram and Delhi.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Nearby Facilities:</strong> Close to educational institutions like Delhi Public School and healthcare facilities such as Medanta - The Medicity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Urban Ascent is designed to offer residents an elevated lifestyle enriched with world-class amenities, seamless connectivity, and sustainable living spaces</p>\r\n<h3><strong>How to book a unit in&nbsp;Emaar\'s new project Urban Ascent Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgoan with A2P&nbsp;Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Booking a unit in Emaar\'s <strong>Urban Ascent</strong> project in Sector 112, Gurgaon, involves several steps to ensure a smooth and informed purchasing experience. Here\'s a concise guide to assist you:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Explore the Project:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Project Details:</strong> Familiarize yourself with the project\'s offerings, such as unit sizes, configurations, and unique features.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Schedule a Site Visit:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Contact A2P Realtech:</strong> Reach out to A2P Realtech\'s sales team to arrange a site visit. This firsthand experience will provide valuable insights into the project\'s location, construction progress, and surrounding infrastructure.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Understand the Payment Plan:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Booking Amount:</strong> Be prepared to pay a booking amount to reserve your unit.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Payment Schedule:</strong> Review the detailed payment plan, which outlines the installment structure aligned with construction milestones.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Complete Necessary Documentation:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Application Form:</strong> Fill out the booking application form provided by A2P Realtech.</li>\r\n<li><strong>KYC Documents:</strong> Submit required Know Your Customer (KYC) documents, including identification and address proofs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Allotment and Agreement:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Allotment Letter:</strong> Upon processing your booking, you\'ll receive an allotment letter confirming your unit.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Builder-Buyer Agreement:</strong> Sign the agreement, which details the terms and conditions of the purchase.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Monitor Construction and Possession:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Regular Updates:</strong> Stay informed about construction progress through official communications.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Possession:</strong> Upon project completion and receipt of the Occupancy Certificate (OC), the final payment is made, and possession of the unit is handed over.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Contact Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>A2P Realtech Sales Team:</strong> For personalized assistance and detailed information, contact A2P Realtech\'s sales representatives directly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>By following these steps and maintaining clear communication with A2P Realtech\'s sales team, you can navigate the booking process efficiently and secure your desired unit in Urban Ascent.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/dir//EMAAR+Urban+Ascent,+near+HP+Petrol+Pump,+Block+D,+Sector+112,+Choma,+Gurugram,+Haryana+122017/@28.6182405,76.9728305,12z/data=!4m18!1m8!3m7!1s0x390d1b53d050408f:0x3b39c1bb26630a21!2sEMAAR+Urban+Ascent!8m2!3d28.5218944!4d77.0214977!15sChBlbWFhciBzZWN0b3IgMTEyIgOIAQGSARRjb25zdHJ1Y3Rpb25fY29tcGFueeABAA!16s%2Fg%2F11lynp31gw!4m8!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x390d1b53d050408f:0x3b39c1bb26630a21!2m2!1d77.0214977!2d28.5218944!3e9?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDEyOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D', '', '', '2206.6 sq.ft', 'Sector 112 Gurgaon Dwarka Expressway', '', '', '2SQTXCGS', 23, 'Emaar\'s Exquisite New Project Urban Ascent in Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway', 'EMAAR New Project, EMAAR Sec 112, A2P Realtech, Sector 112', 'Discover the epitome of luxury living with Emaar\'s exquisite new project in Sector 112. This highly anticipated development showcases Emaar\'s commitment to creating unparalleled spaces that redefine the meaning of opulence and refinement.', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(176, 'Smartworld One DXP Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '230225061302Smart_World_Sector_113_Gurgaon_Dwarka_Expressway.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>Luxury clubhouse</li>\r\n<li>Swimming Pool</li>\r\n<li>Sports Club</li>\r\n<li>SPA</li>\r\n<li>Lounge</li>\r\n<li>24x7 Gymnasium Overlooking Central Greens</li>\r\n<li>Yoga Studio</li>\r\n<li>Indoor Games</li>\r\n<li>Gymnasium</li>\r\n<li>Double Glazed Glass Windows for Noise and Heat insulation.</li>\r\n<li>Amphitheatre</li>\r\n<li>Jogging</li>\r\n<li>Air - Conditioned lobbies</li>\r\n<li>Salon</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 293, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h1><strong>Smartworld One DXP Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h1>\r\n<p>Step into the future with a mesmerizing journey through Sector 113 on Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon&mdash;the epitome of innovation and modern living at DXP. As the world embraces smart technology, this enclave stands out as a beacon of futuristic living. From smart homes to sustainable infrastructure, Sector 113 offers a dazzling blend of convenience and luxury, redefining the essence of urban lifestyle. Immerse yourself in a realm where cutting-edge technology meets unparalleled comfort, where every corner tells a story of innovation and elegance. Discover how Sector 113 on Dwarka Expressway is leading the way in shaping the smartworld landscape, setting new benchmarks for sustainable urban development. Join us as we delve into the heart of Gurgaon\'s Futuristic DXP, a visionary neighborhood that promises a life beyond ordinary.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"banner\" width=\"624\" height=\"281\"></p>\r\n<p>Smartworld One DXP is an under-construction residential project by Smartworld Developers, located in Sector 113, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. The development offers a range of luxury apartments, including 2.5, 3.5, and 4.5 BHK configurations, with sizes ranging from 1,806 to 3,203 square feet.</p>\r\n<p>Smartworld One DXP in Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, spans a large area of <strong data-end=\"110\" data-start=\"84\">approximately 16 acres</strong>. This expansive project is designed to accommodate around <strong data-end=\"196\" data-start=\"169\">1,100 residential units</strong>, offering a spacious and comfortable living environment for its residents. The project is thoughtfully laid out to include ample green spaces, modern amenities, and a well-organized community design, ensuring a high quality of life for those who choose to live here.</p>\r\n<p>The units at Smartworld One DXP, Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, come in a variety of sizes to cater to different preferences and needs. The project offers the following unit configurations:</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>2.5 BHK</strong> apartments with sizes ranging from <strong>1,806 to 1,822 square feet</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>3.5 BHK</strong> apartments with sizes ranging from <strong>2,343 to 2,358 square feet</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>4.5 BHK</strong> apartments with sizes ranging from <strong>3,111 to 3,203 square feet</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These spacious apartments are designed to provide ample room for families, with contemporary layouts that ensure both comfort and functionality.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Smartworld One DXP in Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, enjoys several location advantages that make it an attractive investment and living option. Some of the key benefits are:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Strategic Connectivity:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway:</strong> The location is directly connected to the Dwarka Expressway, providing smooth and fast access to important areas in Gurgaon and Delhi.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to IGI Airport:</strong> The Indira Gandhi International Airport is about 20-25 minutes away, making it ideal for frequent travelers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Rapid Metro:</strong> The upcoming metro station near the project will enhance connectivity to various parts of Gurgaon and Delhi, reducing commuting time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Access to Key Locations:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Cyber City and MG Road:</strong> Just a short drive away from major commercial hubs like Cyber City and MG Road, making it convenient for business professionals.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka and Central Delhi:</strong> Easy access to Dwarka and Delhi, which are just a few kilometers away, offering a wide range of amenities, shopping, and entertainment options.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Educational and Healthcare Institutions:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Reputed Schools &amp; Colleges:</strong> Leading educational institutions like The Shri Ram School and KR Mangalam University are within a 10&ndash;15-minute drive.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Top Hospitals:</strong> Renowned hospitals such as Medanta and Fortis are also nearby, ensuring that healthcare facilities are easily accessible.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Social Infrastructure:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Shopping &amp; Entertainment:</strong> With major malls like Ambience Mall, DLF Mega Mall, and the upcoming retail spaces in the area, residents will have easy access to shopping, dining, and entertainment options.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Restaurants and Cafes:</strong> Multiple dining options and entertainment hubs are available nearby, ensuring a vibrant lifestyle.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Green &amp; Peaceful Environment:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Less Congestion:</strong> Sector 113 is not as crowded as other parts of Gurgaon, ensuring a quieter, more peaceful environment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Green Spaces:</strong> The area is surrounded by lush green spaces, which promotes a healthier lifestyle and offers beautiful views.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Future Growth Potential:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Developing Infrastructure:</strong> As the Dwarka Expressway and surrounding infrastructure continue to develop, the area is expected to witness significant appreciation in property value.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Commercial &amp; Residential Projects:</strong> With several residential and commercial projects coming up in the vicinity, the area is poised for future growth and increased demand.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These factors combined make Smartworld One DXP a well-connected and attractive location for homebuyers and investors alike.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Key Reasons to Invest in Smartworld One DXP Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Investing in Smartworld One DXP, Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, offers several compelling reasons. Here are the key reasons to consider this development:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Prime Location with Excellent Connectivity:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Location:</strong> Located on the Dwarka Expressway, Smartworld One DXP is well-connected to major parts of Gurgaon and Delhi. This ensures easy accessibility to key business hubs, commercial centers, and important landmarks.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to IGI Airport:</strong> With just a 20-25 minute drive to the Indira Gandhi International Airport, it&rsquo;s a highly convenient location for frequent flyers and business professionals.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Upcoming Metro Station:</strong> The area is set to benefit from the upcoming metro station, further enhancing connectivity and reducing commute times.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. High Potential for Appreciation:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Rapid Development of Dwarka Expressway:</strong> The area along the Dwarka Expressway is witnessing rapid infrastructural development, which will likely increase property values in the coming years. It is expected to become a major residential and commercial hub.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Future Growth:</strong> As more commercial, retail, and residential projects come up in the region, the demand for properties in Sector 113 will increase, leading to long-term capital appreciation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Modern Luxury Living:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Top-Notch Amenities:</strong> Smartworld One DXP offers a range of high-end amenities such as a co-working space, gymnasium, swimming pool, yoga studio, rooftop jogging track, and more, ensuring a comfortable and luxurious lifestyle.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Designed by Renowned Architects:</strong> The development is designed by UHA, London, and landscaped by Element Design Studio, Singapore, ensuring world-class architecture and aesthetics.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. RERA-Registered for Transparency:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>RERA Compliance:</strong> The project is RERA-registered (RC/REP/HARERA/GGM/645/377/2022/120), ensuring legal transparency and adherence to all regulatory guidelines. This gives investors peace of mind and ensures that the project will be completed on time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. High-Quality Construction:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Premium Construction:</strong> Smartworld One DXP offers high-quality construction with attention to detail, using the best materials to ensure durability and longevity of the property.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sustainable Development:</strong> The project is designed with sustainability in mind, incorporating green spaces, energy-efficient features, and other eco-friendly elements that align with modern living trends.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Spacious and Thoughtfully Designed Homes:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Variety of Configurations:</strong> The project offers spacious 2.5, 3.5, and 4.5 BHK apartments, catering to different family sizes and preferences.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Modern Layouts:</strong> The apartments are designed to offer maximum space utilization, with contemporary layouts that ensure comfort and functionality.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Well-Established Social Infrastructure:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Reputable Educational Institutions:</strong> Leading schools and universities are within a short drive, making it an ideal choice for families with children.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Healthcare Facilities:</strong> Top hospitals like Medanta and Fortis are easily accessible, ensuring quality healthcare services are nearby.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Entertainment and Retail Options:</strong> With major malls like Ambience Mall and DLF Mega Mall nearby, as well as dining and entertainment hubs, residents will have access to all necessary conveniences.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Focus on Safety and Security:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Gated Community:</strong> The project is a gated community with 24/7 security, ensuring the safety and well-being of residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Smart Technology Integration:</strong> Many modern residential projects, including this one, integrate smart technology for enhanced security, convenience, and energy efficiency.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. Competitive Pricing:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Affordable Luxury:</strong> Smartworld One DXP offers premium amenities and facilities at competitive pricing, making it a great option for buyers looking for luxury living at an attractive price point.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Value for Money:</strong> Given the project\'s location, amenities, and future growth potential, the investment provides excellent value for money.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>10. Future-Proof Investment:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Ongoing Development:</strong> With continuous infrastructure upgrades in and around the area, including roads, metro, and social amenities, Sector 113 is set to become a major residential and commercial destination in the near future.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<h2><strong>Amenities of Smartworld One DXP, Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Smartworld One DXP, Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, offers a wide range of modern and luxurious amenities designed to provide residents with a comfortable and elevated lifestyle. Here are the key amenities available at the project:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Clubhouse and Social Zones:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Satellite Club Zones:</strong> Separate club zones for different age groups to ensure that everyone, from children to adults, enjoys a social space designed for their needs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Exclusive Lounge Areas:</strong> A dedicated space for socializing, relaxing, or hosting private events, providing a perfect setting for leisure and community gatherings.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Fitness &amp; Wellness:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>State-of-the-Art Gymnasium:</strong> Equipped with modern fitness machines and overlooking the central greens, offering a refreshing environment for workouts.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Yoga Studio:</strong> A peaceful space for yoga and meditation to help residents maintain a healthy and balanced lifestyle.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Swimming Pool:</strong> A well-designed swimming pool for relaxation, exercise, or leisure.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Rooftop Jogging Track:</strong> A scenic jogging track on the rooftop for fitness enthusiasts to stay active while enjoying the outdoors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Co-Working Spaces:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>24/7 Co-Working Space:</strong> Smartworld One DXP provides a modern co-working environment for residents who need a flexible space for work or meetings, blending convenience and productivity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Green and Open Spaces:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Central Greens:</strong> Expansive landscaped green spaces for residents to relax, walk, or enjoy outdoor activities. This ensures a serene and tranquil environment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Dedicated Play Zones for Children:</strong> Safe and well-designed play areas where children can enjoy themselves within a secure environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Sports and Recreational Facilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Indoor and Outdoor Sports Zones:</strong> The development includes facilities for sports activities, ensuring both indoor and outdoor sports enthusiasts have dedicated spaces for their recreational needs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Multipurpose Court:</strong> A space for various games and activities for residents to engage in sports and fitness in a community setting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Smart Home Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Advanced Technology Integration:</strong> The project includes smart home solutions for convenience, safety, and energy efficiency, such as smart security, lighting, and climate control systems.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Convenience and Comfort:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>24/7 Water and Power Supply:</strong> The development ensures an uninterrupted supply of essential utilities like water and electricity for the comfort of residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>High-Speed Lifts:</strong> Efficient and modern elevators to ensure quick and easy movement between floors.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Visitor Parking:</strong> Dedicated spaces for guests and visitors, making it easier for residents to entertain visitors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Safety and Security:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>24/7 Security Surveillance:</strong> The project is equipped with comprehensive security systems, including CCTV surveillance, to ensure the safety and well-being of residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Gated Community with Access Control:</strong> Restricted entry points, ensuring only authorized individuals have access to the residential area.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Fire Safety Measures:</strong> Adequate fire safety equipment and measures for the safety of residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. Sustainable and Eco-Friendly Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Rainwater Harvesting:</strong> A system designed to collect and store rainwater for use, promoting sustainability and reducing dependency on external water sources.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Energy-Efficient Features:</strong> Environment-friendly construction and energy-efficient solutions to minimize the development\'s carbon footprint.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>10. Retail and Convenience:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Retail Spaces Within the Project:</strong> The development includes retail outlets and convenience stores within the premises for daily essentials, making it easy for residents to access shopping and services.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>To book a unit in <strong>Smartworld One DXP, Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, you can follow these steps:</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Step 1: Contact A2P Realtech</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Reach out to A2P Realtech</strong> via their website, phone number, or email to express your interest in booking a unit at Smartworld One DXP.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Alternatively, you can visit our office Sector 4 Dwarka New delhi complete address mention on our websites</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Step 2: Provide Your Preferences</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Select Your Desired Unit:</strong> Based on the available configurations (2.5 BHK, 3.5 BHK, or 4.5 BHK), choose the unit that best fits your requirements in terms of size, price, and location within the development.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Discuss Budget and Financing Options:</strong> A2P Realtech can assist in helping you understand the payment plans, prices, and available financing options, including home loans.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 3: Site Visit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Site Visit:</strong> If you haven&rsquo;t already seen the property, schedule a visit to Smartworld One DXP with the help of A2P Realtech. This allows you to explore the development, check the amenities, and view the unit layout in person.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 4: Confirm Your Choice</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Once you are satisfied with your selection, <strong>confirm your booking</strong> with A2P Realtech. You may be required to fill out an application form or agreement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 5: Documentation and Agreement</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Provide Necessary Documents:</strong> Submit the required documents such as identification proof, address proof, and income proof, along with the application form.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sign the Agreement:</strong> After reviewing all terms and conditions, you will sign the sale agreement. This document will outline the terms of your purchase, including payment schedules, possession date, and other important details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 6: Payment</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Make an Initial Payment:</strong> A token amount or booking amount is generally required to secure your unit.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Payment Plan:</strong> Depending on the project&rsquo;s payment structure, you will need to follow the agreed payment plan, which could include a combination of down payments, EMI options, and final payments upon possession.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 7: Finalizing Your Purchase</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Final Payment and Handover:</strong> Once all payments are made, A2P Realtech will help facilitate the final formalities, including possession and registration of the property.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 8: Keep Track of Updates</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Project Updates:</strong> A2P Realtech will keep you informed about the progress of the development, including expected possession dates and any updates regarding the completion of the project.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>By following these steps, you can efficiently book your unit at Smartworld One DXP through A2P Realtech and ensure a smooth and transparent process.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', '', '', '', '16 acres', 'Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'BPZOHRA2', 23, 'Smartworld One DXP Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Smartworld One DXP, Sector 113, A2P Realtech, Luxury Apartment, Dwarka Expressway', 'Smartworld One DXP in Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, spans a large area of approximately 16 acres. This expansive project is designed to accommodate around 1,100 residential units, offering a spacious and comfortable living environment for its residents. The project is thoughtfully laid out to include ample green spaces, modern amenities, and a well-organized community design, ensuring a high quality of life for those who choose to live here.', NULL, NULL);
