">146.32 Sq.ft</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Plot Sizes:</strong> The development offers SCO plots ranging from approximately 115 to 267 square yards, providing flexibility to suit different business requirements.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Structure:</strong> Each plot is approved for Ground + 4 storeys with a basement, allowing businesses to maximize their operational space.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Amenities:</strong> The project boasts ample surface parking, 100% power backup, provisions for individual AC units, and well-planned pedestrian pathways, ensuring a comfortable experience for both business owners and visitors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Delhi:</strong> Situated just 0 km from Delhi, the project offers seamless connectivity to the capital city.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> Direct access from the 150-meter-wide Dwarka Expressway and close proximity to the proposed metro station enhance the project\'s connectivity.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Nearby Facilities:</strong> The area is in the vicinity of prestigious schools, excellent hospitals, and is part of a rapidly developing zone, making it a strategic location for businesses.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>With over 20,000 families residing within a 5 km radius and an expected footfall of over 5 lakh people in the future, M3M SCO 113 Market presents a promising opportunity for businesses looking to establish a presence in a thriving community.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of M3M SCO 113 Market, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>M3M SCO 113 Market is a premium commercial development in <strong>Sector 113, Gurgaon</strong>, strategically located along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>. It offers <strong>Shop Cum Office (SCO) plots</strong>, providing a unique opportunity for businesses to establish high-street retail outlets, corporate offices, and restaurants in a prime location.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Key Highlights of M3M SCO 113 Market</strong></h2>\r\n<p>? <strong>SCO Plots Range</strong>: Approximately <strong>115 - 267 square yards</strong><br>? <strong>Building Configuration</strong>: Ground + 4 Floors with a Basement<br>? <strong>Approved Land Use</strong>: Retail Shops, Office Spaces, Restaurants, and Showrooms<br>? <strong>Parking &amp; Facilities</strong>: Ample parking space, 100% power backup, and modern infrastructure<br>? <strong>High Visibility &amp; Footfall</strong>: Surrounded by a growing residential and commercial hub</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Location Advantages of M3M SCO 113 Market Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Prime Location on Dwarka Expressway</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Situated on the <strong>150-meter-wide</strong> Dwarka Expressway, offering seamless connectivity to Delhi and Gurgaon.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Direct access</strong> from the expressway ensures high visibility and business exposure.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Proximity to Delhi</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Located <strong>just 0 km from Delhi</strong>, making it an attractive business destination for companies looking to cater to both Gurgaon and Delhi clientele.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Well-Connected by Metro &amp; Road</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proposed metro station</strong> in close vicinity for easy accessibility.</li>\r\n<li>Direct road access to NH-8, IGI Airport, and key business districts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Growing Residential Community</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Surrounded by <strong>premium residential projects</strong>, ensuring a high footfall of potential customers.</li>\r\n<li>Expected to attract over <strong>5 lakh visitors</strong> in the near future.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Near Essential Services</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Close to top hospitals, international schools, shopping malls, and entertainment hubs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>M3M SCO 113 Market offers a <strong>lucrative investment opportunity</strong> in a rapidly developing commercial corridor, ensuring <strong>high returns and long-term growth potential</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Steps to Book a Unit in M3M SCO 113 Market, Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon through A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you&rsquo;re looking to book a unit in <strong>M3M SCO 113 Market</strong> via <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these simple steps:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Initial Inquiry &amp; Consultation</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Contact <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> through their official website, phone, or visit their office.</li>\r\n<li>Discuss your requirements, budget, and available units in <strong>M3M SCO 113 Market</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Get details on pricing, payment plans, and available SCO plots.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Site Visit &amp; Selection</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Schedule a <strong>site visit</strong> with A2P Realtech to inspect the location, layout, and available plots.</li>\r\n<li>Choose a suitable <strong>SCO plot</strong> based on size, location, and business needs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Booking Process</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Submit the booking application form</strong> with necessary details.</li>\r\n<li>Pay the <strong>initial booking amount</strong> as per M3M&rsquo;s pricing and payment plan.</li>\r\n<li>Receive a <strong>booking confirmation receipt</strong> from A2P Realtech and M3M Group.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Documentation &amp; Payment</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Provide <strong>KYC documents</strong> (Aadhaar, PAN card, business registration, etc.).</li>\r\n<li>Sign the <strong>Builder Buyer Agreement (BBA)</strong> with M3M India.</li>\r\n<li>Follow the <strong>payment schedule</strong> (Construction-Linked Plan, Down Payment Plan, or Flexi Payment).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Allotment &amp; Possession</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Receive the <strong>Allotment Letter</strong> after completing the necessary payments.</li>\r\n<li>Once construction is completed, get <strong>possession of your unit</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Start your business operations in a prime commercial hub!</li>\r\n</ul>', '<iframe src=', '', '', '', '113 Market Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'U1Y02NSU', 20, 'M3M SCO 113 Market, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon', 'm3m, SCO market, Sector 113, Gurgaon, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech Shop cum Office', 'M3M SCO 113 Market is a commercial development located in Sector 113, Gurgaon, strategically positioned along the Dwarka Expressway. This project offers Shop Cum Office (SCO) plots designed to cater to a variety of business needs, including high-end retail shops, office spaces, terrace restaurants, and more.', NULL, NULL),
(180, 'Smart world one DXP Street Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '230225055850Smart_World_oneDXP_Street_A2P_Realtech.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Bar and lounge</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Billiards&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Spa</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Cafe Lounge</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Car parking&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Concierge Service</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Business center&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Gym</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Laundromat</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Restaurant&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">24-hour security</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 293, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>Smart world one DXP Street Sector 113&nbsp; Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon Commercial</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Smart World One DXP Street is a premium commercial development located in Sector 113, Gurgaon, strategically positioned along the Dwarka Expressway. This project offers a blend of modern architecture and luxurious amenities, designed to provide an elevated business experience.</p>\r\n<p><strong><u>Smart World One DXP Street Price List:</u></strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 409.35pt; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 237.547px; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><strong>Floor</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 305.25px; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><strong>BSP Per Sq. Ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 237.547px; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>Ground Floor</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 305.25px; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>45000</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 237.547px; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>First Floor</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 305.25px; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>24900</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 237.547px; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>Second Floor</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 305.25px; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>18900</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 23.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 237.547px; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>Third Floor ( Food Court)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 305.25px; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>15250</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Commercial Spaces:</strong> The development offers a variety of commercial units suitable for retail outlets, office spaces, and dining establishments, catering to diverse business needs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Modern Amenities:</strong> Businesses and visitors can enjoy facilities such as ample parking space, high-speed elevators, 24/7 security, and power backup, ensuring a seamless operational environment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Smart Infrastructure:</strong> Equipped with advanced technology, the project provides high-speed internet connectivity, energy-efficient systems, and app-based security monitoring, enhancing convenience and safety.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Key Destinations:</strong> Smart World One DXP Street is located just minutes away from IGI Airport (approximately 7 minutes), South Delhi (20 minutes), and the Diplomatic Enclave (5 minutes), making it an ideal location for businesses targeting both Gurgaon and Delhi clientele.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Situated on the Dwarka Expressway, the project offers seamless access to major highways, upcoming metro stations, and is in close proximity to renowned educational institutions and healthcare facilities, ensuring a steady footfall of potential customers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This development is currently under construction, with a focus on creating a vibrant commercial hub that complements the adjacent residential projects. For more detailed information, including pricing and availability, you can visit the official Smart World One DXP website.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of Smart World One DXP Street, Sector 113, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Smart World One DXP Street is a <strong>premium commercial development</strong> in <strong>Sector 113, Gurgaon</strong>, strategically located along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>. Designed to be a futuristic business hub, this project offers <strong>high-street retail shops, office spaces, and entertainment zones</strong>, making it an excellent investment opportunity.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Highlights of Smart World One DXP Street</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Commercial Spaces</strong>: Retail shops, office spaces, and restaurants<br><strong>Modern Infrastructure</strong>: Smart technology-enabled business spaces<br><strong>Building Configuration</strong>: Well-designed high-street retail with premium frontage<br><strong>Parking &amp; Facilities</strong>: Ample parking, 24/7 security, high-speed elevators, and power backup<br><strong>Surrounded by Premium Residences</strong>: High footfall potential due to nearby residential communities</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><strong>Location Advantages of Smart World One DXP Street</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Prime Location on Dwarka Expressway</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Located along the <strong>150-meter-wide</strong> Dwarka Expressway, ensuring <strong>high visibility and accessibility</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Direct access to <strong>NH-8</strong>, connecting to key business hubs in Gurgaon.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Proximity to Delhi &amp; Key Destinations</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>0 km from Delhi</strong>, making it a prime business destination for companies catering to both Gurgaon and Delhi customers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>7 minutes</strong> from <strong>IGI Airport</strong>, ensuring excellent connectivity for global businesses.</li>\r\n<li><strong>5 minutes</strong> from <strong>Diplomatic Enclave</strong>, increasing the project&rsquo;s prestige.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Seamless Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proposed metro station nearby</strong>, enhancing accessibility.</li>\r\n<li>Well-connected to <strong>Cyber City, Golf Course Road, and Udyog Vihar</strong>&mdash;major commercial hubs of Gurgaon.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Growing Residential &amp; Business Community</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Surrounded by <strong>luxury residential projects</strong>, leading to <strong>high customer footfall</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>An expected <strong>footfall of over 5 lakh visitors</strong>, boosting business potential.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Close to Key Facilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Near top <strong>hospitals, schools, shopping malls, and entertainment hubs</strong>, making it an attractive retail and office destination.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Investment Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>High appreciation value</strong> due to its prime location and growing commercial demand.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for <strong>retail brands, corporate offices, restaurants, and entertainment businesses</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>With <strong>state-of-the-art infrastructure, prime connectivity, and a thriving commercial environment</strong>, Smart World One DXP Street offers <strong>a lucrative opportunity for investors and businesses</strong> looking to establish a strong presence in Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Steps to Book a Unit in Smart World One DXP Street, Sector 113, Gurgaon, Dwarka Expressway through A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you&rsquo;re looking to book a <strong>retail shop, office space, or commercial unit</strong> in <strong>Smart World One DXP Street</strong> via <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these simple steps:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Initial Inquiry &amp; Consultation</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Contact <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> via their <strong>website, phone, or office visit</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Discuss your <strong>business needs, unit sizes, pricing, and investment options</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Get details on <strong>payment plans, construction status, and project benefits</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Site Visit &amp; Unit Selection</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Schedule a <strong>site visit</strong> with A2P Realtech to explore the project.</li>\r\n<li>Choose a <strong>commercial unit</strong> based on your <strong>business type, location preference, and budget</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Booking Process</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Submit the booking application form</strong> with necessary details.</li>\r\n<li>Pay the <strong>initial booking amount</strong> as per Smart World&rsquo;s payment plan.</li>\r\n<li>Receive a <strong>booking confirmation receipt</strong> from A2P Realtech and Smart World Developers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Documentation &amp; Agreement</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Provide <strong>KYC documents</strong> (Aadhaar, PAN card, business registration, etc.).</li>\r\n<li>Sign the <strong>Builder Buyer Agreement (BBA)</strong> with Smart World Developers.</li>\r\n<li>Follow the <strong>payment schedule</strong> (Construction-Linked Plan, Down Payment Plan, or Flexi Plan).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Allotment &amp; Possession</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Receive the <strong>Allotment Letter</strong> after completing necessary payments.</li>\r\n<li>Once construction is completed, get <strong>possession of your commercial unit</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Start your <strong>business operations</strong> in this <strong>prime commercial hub</strong>!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>For further assistance, contact <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, and their expert team will guide you through the entire booking process seamlessly.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '', 'Sector 113  Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', '0OF3N3JF', 20, 'Smart world one DXP Street Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Smart world one DXP Street Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech, Gurgaon, Smart World', 'Smart World One DXP Street is a premium commercial development located in Sector 113, Gurgaon, strategically positioned along the Dwarka Expressway. This project offers a blend of modern architecture and luxurious amenities, designed to provide an elevated business experience.', NULL, NULL),
