_TABLE.AREA_UNIT_TOGGLE\">Balcony/Varmdah- 413 Sq. Ft</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Basement - 456.61 Sq. Ft</div>\r\n<div>Common Floor- 393.08 Sq. Ft&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<strong>495 SQ. YDS. SECOND FLOOR PLAN</strong><br><strong>4 BHK + 6T + Basement</strong>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<div>\r\n<div data-custominfo=\"{\" data-label=\"SUMMARY_TABLE.AREA_UNIT_TOGGLE\">\r\n<div><strong>Built-up Area</strong>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>3106 Sq. Ft. (<strong>Second Floor </strong>-1833.10 Sq. Ft.<br>\r\n<div data-custominfo=\"{\" data-label=\"SUMMARY_TABLE.AREA_UNIT_TOGGLE\">Balcony/Varmdah- 413 Sq. Ft</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Basement - 466.61 Sq. Ft</div>\r\n<div>Common Floor- 393.08 Sq. Ft&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of AMSTORIA Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>AMSTORIA is an upscale residential plot development located in Sector 102, Gurgaon, strategically positioned along the Dwarka Expressway. This area is known for its rapid urban growth, with excellent connectivity to key parts of Gurgaon, Delhi, and the IGI Airport. Here\'s an overview of what AMSTORIA offers:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Location &amp; Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Location:</strong> Situated along the Dwarka Expressway, AMSTORIA enjoys excellent connectivity to major business hubs in Gurgaon, such as Cyber City and Golf Course Road. The project is also well-connected to Delhi via the upcoming expressway.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Key Areas:</strong> The site is just minutes away from the Dwarka metro station, and within easy reach of the IGI Airport, making it highly accessible.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Plot Sizes &amp; Development</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The project spans 133 acres, offering premium residential plots that start from sizes around 200 square yards, giving prospective homeowners plenty of space to design their dream homes.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Luxury Living:</strong> AMSTORIA is designed to offer a high standard of living, with a focus on large, spacious plots for luxurious custom-built homes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Amenities &amp; Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Cluster Living Concept:</strong> The project is designed to create a sense of community among residents, offering a harmonious environment with gated clusters.</li>\r\n<li><strong>World-Class Amenities:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Clubhouse</li>\r\n<li>Swimming pool</li>\r\n<li>Fitness center</li>\r\n<li>Jogging tracks</li>\r\n<li>24/7 security with surveillance systems</li>\r\n<li>Green spaces and parks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Sustainability:</strong> The development focuses on sustainable living with eco-friendly infrastructure and abundant green spaces.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Nearby Infrastructure &amp; Services</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Educational Institutions:</strong> The development is surrounded by reputed schools, such as DPS and Gurugram Global Heights, making it an ideal choice for families.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Shopping and Healthcare:</strong> AMSTORIA is close to key retail centers, hospitals, and commercial hubs, ensuring a comfortable and convenient lifestyle.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Investment Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>High Appreciation Potential:</strong> Given its location along the Dwarka Expressway and proximity to major city landmarks, AMSTORIA is expected to see substantial value appreciation over time.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Quality Development:</strong> The project is being developed by BPTP, a well-known real estate developer with a reputation for delivering quality projects.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Price &amp; Payment Plans</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The pricing for plots in AMSTORIA begins at approximately ?5 crore, depending on the size and location of the plot within the development.</li>\r\n<li>Flexible payment options are available for buyers, including easy installment plans.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>In summary, AMSTORIA in Sector 102, Gurgaon, is an ideal option for those seeking to invest in a luxurious, well-connected, and future-proof residential plot in the heart of an emerging urban hub along the Dwarka Expressway.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Location Advantages of AMSTORIA Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>AMSTORIA in Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, offers several location advantages that make it a highly attractive investment and living option. Here are the key benefits:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Strategic Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway:</strong> The project is strategically located along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, which connects Gurgaon and Delhi seamlessly. This provides excellent connectivity to key areas in both cities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to IGI Airport:</strong> AMSTORIA is located just a few kilometers away from <strong>Indira Gandhi International (IGI) Airport</strong>, making it ideal for frequent flyers and business travelers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Quick Access to Delhi:</strong> The expressway offers a rapid connection to <strong>Dwarka</strong> and other important parts of Delhi, reducing travel time significantly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Proximity to Key Commercial Hubs</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Cyber City and Golf Course Road:</strong> The location is near major business districts like <strong>Cyber City</strong> and <strong>Golf Course Road</strong>, home to numerous corporate offices, which makes it highly convenient for professionals working in these areas.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Connectivity to NH-8:</strong> AMSTORIA has easy access to the <strong>National Highway-8 (NH-8)</strong>, a major arterial road that connects Gurgaon with Delhi and other regions of Haryana, ensuring quick travel to business and commercial zones.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Access to Public Transport</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Metro Connectivity:</strong> The <strong>Dwarka metro station</strong> is just a short drive away, providing easy access to the Delhi Metro network, making it convenient for commuting within Delhi and beyond.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Bus Terminals:</strong> The project is well connected to local and inter-city bus services, ensuring ease of travel within the city and to other regions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Nearby Social Infrastructure</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Educational Institutions:</strong> The area is home to renowned schools like <strong>Delhi Public School (DPS)</strong>, <strong>Gurugram Global Heights</strong>, and others, making it an ideal place for families with children.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Healthcare Facilities:</strong> AMSTORIA is surrounded by top-notch hospitals and healthcare centers, such as <strong>Medanta Medicity</strong> and <strong>Artemis Hospital</strong>, ensuring residents have easy access to quality medical services.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Shopping and Entertainment:</strong> The development is located near popular shopping centers and malls like <strong>Ambience Mall</strong>, <strong>MGF Metropolitan Mall</strong>, and <strong>Sohna Road</strong>, offering plenty of options for retail therapy, dining, and entertainment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Green and Peaceful Environment</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Away from the City&rsquo;s Hustle:</strong> While it is well-connected to the city, AMSTORIA enjoys a peaceful and green environment, providing residents with a tranquil living experience, away from the noise and congestion of central Gurgaon.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Abundant Green Spaces:</strong> The project itself emphasizes sustainable living with ample green areas and parks, enhancing the overall quality of life.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Future Growth Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Ongoing Infrastructure Development:</strong> The Dwarka Expressway is witnessing rapid infrastructure development, including the construction of new flyovers, metro stations, and residential complexes, all of which will further enhance connectivity and property value.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Development of New Commercial and Residential Spaces:</strong> The area around Dwarka Expressway is evolving rapidly into a commercial and residential hub, with numerous upcoming projects that will increase its attractiveness for investors and residents alike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Proximity to Government Projects and Landmarks</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>International Embassies and Diplomatic Enclave:</strong> Being close to Delhi&rsquo;s diplomatic enclave, the region holds significant political importance and is well-placed for long-term capital appreciation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Smart City Developments:</strong> The area is also part of the broader <strong>Smart City Project</strong> in Gurgaon, aiming to improve urban infrastructure, utilities, and services, making it a future-ready location.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Safety and Security</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Gated Community:</strong> AMSTORIA offers a secure, gated community with 24/7 surveillance and security, ensuring peace of mind for its residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Low Traffic Density:</strong> Compared to more crowded parts of Gurgaon, the Dwarka Expressway area experiences relatively lower traffic density, contributing to a safer and more pleasant environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>In conclusion, the location of AMSTORIA in Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, offers unmatched connectivity, access to world-class amenities, and the promise of future growth. Whether you\'re a professional, a family, or an investor, the location advantages make it an ideal choice for long-term residence and investment.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Steps to Book a Unit in AMSTORIA Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon through A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>To book a unit in <strong>AMSTORIA Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these general steps:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Contact A2P Realtech</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Reach Out for Initial Inquiry:</strong> The first step is to contact <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, either via their website, phone, or email. You can inquire about the available plots in AMSTORIA and gather information regarding plot sizes, pricing, and payment plans.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Provide Your Requirements:</strong> Share your preferences regarding plot size, budget, and any specific location preferences within the development.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Site Visit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Visit:</strong> A2P Realtech can arrange a site visit for you to explore the project firsthand. This will help you assess the location, surroundings, amenities, and the overall layout of the development.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Clarify Any Doubts:</strong> During the visit, you can ask questions about the project, availability, infrastructure, or anything else you\'re concerned about.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Choose the Plot</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Plot Selection:</strong> After reviewing the options, select the plot that fits your requirements. A2P Realtech can guide you based on your preferences regarding plot location, size, and budget.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Confirm the Plot Number:</strong> Once you have selected the plot, confirm the specific plot number and area.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Document Submission</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Provide Necessary Documents:</strong> To proceed with the booking, you will need to submit certain documents. This typically includes:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>ID Proof</strong> (Aadhaar Card, Passport, etc.)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Address Proof</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>PAN Card</strong> (for tax purposes)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Photograph</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Proof of Income</strong> (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Agreement Signing:</strong> A formal agreement will be signed with A2P Realtech, outlining all the terms and conditions, including the price, payment schedule, and possession details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Payment Process</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Advance Payment:</strong> Once you\'ve confirmed your plot and signed the agreement, you will need to make an advance payment as per the agreed terms.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Payment Plan Selection:</strong> A2P Realtech may offer flexible payment plans, such as installment options or lump-sum payments. Choose a plan that works best for your financial situation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Receipt of Payment:</strong> Ensure that you get a payment receipt or acknowledgment from A2P Realtech for any payments made.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Booking Confirmation</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Booking Confirmation Letter:</strong> After the payment, A2P Realtech will issue a <strong>Booking Confirmation Letter</strong>, which will officially reserve your plot at AMSTORIA.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Plot Allotment:</strong> The confirmation will include details of your plot, payment schedule, and any other important information.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Completion of Formalities</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Further Paperwork:</strong> Complete any further paperwork required for the transfer of the property or registration process. A2P Realtech will assist you in completing all the formalities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Legal and Title Verification:</strong> The developer will carry out all necessary legal checks and ensure that the title and ownership of the plot are clear.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Possession and Handover</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Possession Details:</strong> Once all payments are completed and the development reaches a stage where the property is ready for possession, A2P Realtech will arrange for the handover of the plot.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Completion Certificate:</strong> A completion certificate may be issued when the property is fully ready for use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. Post-Booking Assistance</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Customer Support:</strong> A2P Realtech provides post-booking assistance, which includes updates on project progress, payment reminders, and help with any queries you may have.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Additional Tips:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Consult A2P Realtech&rsquo;s Team:</strong> For any specific questions regarding the booking process, always feel free to consult A2P Realtech&rsquo;s customer service or sales team. They can provide details on any ongoing promotions, discounts, or special schemes available for booking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>By following these steps, you can ensure a smooth and hassle-free process when booking your unit in AMSTORIA Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', '', '', '', '133-acre ', 'Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'UY24RGKQ', 19, 'BPTP AMSTORIA Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'BPTP AMSTORIA , BPTP, AMSTORIA, Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech', 'AMSTORIA is an upscale residential plot development located in Sector 102, Gurgaon, strategically positioned along the Dwarka Expressway', NULL, NULL);
