(182, 'VERTI GREENS BPTP Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '260225040608VERTI-GREENS-BPTP-Sector-102-A2P-REALTECH1.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>Entrance Lobby</li>\r\n<li>CCTV Camera Security</li>\r\n<li>Squash Court</li>\r\n<li>Swimming Pool</li>\r\n<li>Yoga/ Meditation Area</li>\r\n<li>Club House</li>\r\n<li>Padel Court</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Badminton Court</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Pick leball Court</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Indoor Swimming Pool</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Gym</li>\r\n<li>Yoga Studio</li>\r\n<li>Banquet Hall</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Spa</li>\r\n<li>Business Center</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;AV Room</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 294, '', '', '', '260225034803BPTP-Presentation Verti greens - CP GREENS.pdf.pdf', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>VERTI GREENS BPTP Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>BPTP Amstoria Verti-Greens is a premium residential project located in Sector 102, Gurugram, along the Dwarka Expressway. Spanning approximately 12.05 acres, this development comprises seven high-rise towers with configurations of 2BHK and 3BHK luxury apartments, ranging from 1,600 to 2,400 sq. ft.</p>\r\n<p><strong>2BHK &amp; 3BHK luxury apartments</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>2BHK &ndash; 1600 SQ. FT</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>3 BHK- 2400 SQ.FT</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Size Range:</strong> <strong>1,600 to 2,400 sq. ft.</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Possession:</strong> Expected soon (under construction)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Expansive Amenities:</strong> The project offers a 1.55 lakh sq. ft. club and amenity zone, including 15 sky gardens across five towers, providing residents with serene green spaces and breathtaking views.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>State-of-the-Art Facilities:</strong> Residents can enjoy a sculpture garden, Miyawaki forest, tree groves, rooftop gardens, events lawn, reading area, water features, cascading fountains, outdoor dining spaces, and a pet corner. For active living, the indoor sports zone includes two squash courts, a pickleball court, a badminton court, and a fitness center. Additional premium amenities encompass private dining rooms, a fine dining restaurant, a theatre room, an expansive banquet hall, and a convenience store.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Location:</strong> Situated in Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, the project offers seamless connectivity to Gurugram and Delhi. Key business hubs like Cyber City and shopping destinations such as Ambience Mall are approximately 20-25 minutes away, while the New Diplomatic Enclave, Dwarka Golf Course, and Yashobhoomi are a short 15-minute drive. Essential conveniences, including Delhi Public School and Sheetla Mata Devi Hospital, are within a 5-minute radius. The Indira Gandhi International Airport is accessible within 30 minutes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Advanced Design and Safety:</strong> Each residence is designed to maximize natural light and ventilation, fostering a well-being-centric lifestyle. The development boasts four apartments per floor, seven high-speed lifts per tower, and advanced earthquake resistance (Zone V) exceeding standard norms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The project is RERA-registered under the number RC/REP//HARERA/GGM/910/642/205/13, ensuring transparency and adherence to government regulations.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of Verti Greens by BPTP &ndash; Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong>Verti Greens</strong> is a premium residential development by <strong>BPTP Group</strong>, located in <strong>Sector 102, Gurgaon</strong>, along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>. The project is part of the <strong>BPTP Amstoria township</strong>, which is known for its <strong>luxurious lifestyle, green living spaces, and modern amenities</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Key Highlights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Location:</strong> Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</li>\r\n<li><strong>Developer:</strong> BPTP Group</li>\r\n<li><strong>Project Type:</strong> High-rise residential apartments</li>\r\n<li><strong>RERA Number:</strong> <strong>RC/REP//HARERA/GGM/910/642/205/13</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Area:</strong> Approx. <strong>12.05 acres</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Towers:</strong> 7 high-rise towers</li>\r\n<li><strong>Configurations:</strong> 2BHK &amp; 3BHK luxury apartments</li>\r\n<li><strong>Size Range:</strong> <strong>1,600 to 2,400 sq. ft.</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Possession:</strong> Expected soon (under construction)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><strong>Amenities &amp; Features:</strong></h2>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Nature-Inspired Living:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>15 Sky Gardens</strong> across five towers</li>\r\n<li><strong>Miyawaki Forest &amp; Tree Groves</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Sculpture Garden &amp; Cascading Water Features</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Outdoor Dining &amp; Pet Corner</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Luxury Club &amp; Sports Facilities:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>1.55 lakh sq. ft. clubhouse &amp; amenity zone</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Indoor Sports:</strong> Squash, badminton, pickleball, fitness center</li>\r\n<li><strong>Swimming Pool &amp; Yoga Deck</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Private Dining &amp; Fine Dining Restaurant</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Theatre Room &amp; Banquet Hall</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Safety &amp; Convenience:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Four apartments per floor</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>7 high-speed elevators per tower</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Earthquake-resistant structure (Zone V compliant)</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Convenience Store &amp; Reading Area</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Location &amp; Connectivity:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Well-connected to Gurgaon &amp; Delhi</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>5 min</strong> &ndash; Delhi Public School, Sheetla Mata Hospital</li>\r\n<li><strong>15 min</strong> &ndash; New Diplomatic Enclave, Dwarka Golf Course, Yashobhoomi Convention Center</li>\r\n<li><strong>20-25 min</strong> &ndash; Cyber City, Ambience Mall</li>\r\n<li><strong>30 min</strong> &ndash; Indira Gandhi International Airport</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><strong>Why Choose Verti Greens?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>? <strong>Luxury Residences</strong> with sky gardens and modern architecture<br>? <strong>Prime Location</strong> along Dwarka Expressway, ensuring connectivity &amp; future growth<br>? <strong>Premium Amenities</strong> for an upscale lifestyle<br>? <strong>Trusted Developer (BPTP Group)</strong> with a solid reputation in the real estate market</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Steps to Book a Unit in Verti Greens by BPTP &ndash; Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon through A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you&rsquo;re interested in booking a unit in <strong>Verti Greens by BPTP</strong> through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these steps:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Contact A2P Realtech for Availability &amp; Pricing</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Visit their website:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.a2prealtech.com/\" target=\"_new\">A2P Realtech</a> (if available)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Call/WhatsApp:</strong> Reach out to their sales team for current unit availability and pricing details.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Email Inquiry:</strong> Send an email requesting a brochure, floor plans, and other project details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Schedule a Site Visit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Book a <strong>site visit</strong> with an A2P Realtech representative to explore the <strong>sample apartments, amenities, and location advantages</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Check the <strong>connectivity, nearby infrastructure, and future developments</strong> in Sector 102, Gurgaon.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Select Your Preferred Unit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Choose between <strong>2BHK and 3BHK apartments</strong>, based on your budget and preference.</li>\r\n<li>Confirm the <strong>floor plan, view, and unit location</strong> within the project.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Booking Process &amp; Payment</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Pay the <strong>booking amount</strong> as per BPTP&rsquo;s payment plan.</li>\r\n<li>Submit the required <strong>KYC documents</strong> (Aadhar Card, PAN Card, Passport-size photos, and Address Proof).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Get Allotment &amp; Agreement Signing</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>After booking, you\'ll receive an <strong>Allotment Letter</strong> from BPTP.</li>\r\n<li>Sign the <strong>Builder-Buyer Agreement</strong> and make the initial payment as per the schedule.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Loan Assistance (If Required)</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>A2P Realtech can assist with <strong>home loan processing</strong> from leading banks.</li>\r\n<li>Compare loan offers, check eligibility, and finalize financing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Regular Updates &amp; Possession</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Stay in touch with A2P Realtech for <strong>construction updates</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>On completion, complete final payments and register the property before taking possession.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Would you like assistance with pricing, offers, or loan options?</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3507.266715707176!2d76.97062997604148!3d28.471513291373473!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d175834c9de41%3A0x3998a147fb38994f!2sBPTP%20Amstoria%20Verti%20Greens!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1766563706298!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', 'Size Range: 1,600 to 2,400 sq. ft.', 'Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'D9WSGMFP', 19, 'VERTI GREENS BPTP Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'VERTI GREENS BPTP,Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech, BPTP', 'BPTP Amstoria Verti-Greens is a premium residential project located in Sector 102, Gurugram, along the Dwarka Expressway. Spanning approximately 12.05 acres, this development comprises seven high-rise towers with configurations of 2BHK and 3BHK luxury apartments, ranging from 1,600 to 2,400 sq. ft.', NULL, NULL),
(183, 'M3M Crown Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '270225064743M3M-CROWN-SECTOR-111-A2P-REALTECH.jpg', '<ul>\r\n<li>SPA</li>\r\n<li>Coffee Shop</li>\r\n<li>Parking</li>\r\n<li>Gardens</li>\r\n<li>Indoor Games</li>\r\n<li>Out Door Games</li>\r\n<li>Club House</li>\r\n<li>Wifi</li>\r\n<li>GYM</li>\r\n<li>CCTV</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 271, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>M3M Crown Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>M3M Crown is a premium residential development situated in Sector 111, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. This project offers luxurious 3 and 4 BHK apartments, with sizes ranging from 1,605 to 2,670 square feet.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 318.4pt;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Type***</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>RERA Area***</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3BHK</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>1605 Sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3 BHK</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>1665 Sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3BHK+Study</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>1825 Sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3BHK+Study</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>1895 Sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3BHK+Study+Utility</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>2080 Sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3BHK+Utility</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>2105 Sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3BHK+Study+Utility</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>2170 Sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>4BHK+Utility</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>2305 Sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>4BHK+Utility</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>2400 Sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>4BHK+Study+Utility</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>2570 Sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>4BHK+Study+Utility</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>2670 Sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 252.172px;\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 169.359px;\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Location:</strong> <a href=\"../service_list/m3m.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">M3M</a> Crown is part of the Smart City Delhi Airport project, a self-sustained mixed-use development on Dwarka Expressway. It is just 7 minutes\' drive from the Indira Gandhi International Airport, offering excellent connectivity to Delhi and other parts of Gurgaon.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Amenities:</strong> The development boasts a 5.5-acre central landscape with a 1.1 km pathway, providing ample green space for residents. A stunning waterfront club features a 14,000 sq. ft. swimming pool, enhancing the luxury living experience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Design and Layout:</strong> The apartments are designed with modern aesthetics and high-quality finishes. The project includes shaded walkways to facilitate easy pedestrian movement and a thoughtfully designed lake that creates an unparalleled experience with nature.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Investment Potential:</strong> M3M Crown offers a 30:40:30 payment plan with up to 11% return on investment, making it an attractive option for investors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Project Details:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Configuration:</strong> 3 and 4 BHK apartments</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sizes:</strong> 1,605 to 2,670 sq. ft.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Starting Price:</strong> Approximately ?2.1 crore</li>\r\n<li><strong>Possession Date:</strong> Expected by April 2027</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><strong>M3M Crown Overview - Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>M3M Crown is an upscale residential development located in Sector 111, Gurgaon, along the rapidly developing Dwarka Expressway. The project is designed to offer a blend of luxurious living and world-class amenities, making it one of the most sought-after addresses in Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<p>The development consists of premium 3 and 4 BHK apartments, with sizes ranging from 1,605 to 2,670 sq. ft. It is an ideal choice for families seeking a modern, luxurious lifestyle, with spacious homes, green surroundings, and state-of-the-art facilities.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Key Features of M3M Crown Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway:</strong></h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Luxury Living</strong>: The project offers luxurious 3 and 4 BHK apartments that are designed with modern aesthetics, offering spacious layouts and high-quality finishes.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Central Landscape &amp; Green Spaces</strong>: The project spans over 5.5 acres of central landscaping, including a scenic 1.1 km walking path, creating a peaceful and serene environment for residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Waterfront Club</strong>: A key highlight is the waterfront club that features a 14,000 sq. ft. swimming pool and other recreational facilities, ensuring a premium living experience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Smart City Integration</strong>: The project is part of the Smart City Delhi Airport project, which is a self-sustained, mixed-use development aimed at offering residents a connected, high-tech living environment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Payment Plans &amp; Investment Potential</strong>: M3M Crown offers an attractive payment plan (30:40:30) and is projected to yield a significant return on investment (ROI) due to its location and luxurious offerings.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages of M3M Crown:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Location on Dwarka Expressway</strong>: M3M Crown is strategically located along the Dwarka Expressway, which ensures smooth connectivity to key areas of Gurgaon and Delhi. The Dwarka Expressway is a fast-growing infrastructure corridor that significantly reduces travel time and enhances accessibility.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Indira Gandhi International Airport</strong>: One of the biggest advantages of M3M Crown\'s location is its proximity to IGI Airport. It is just a 7-minute drive away, making it highly convenient for frequent travelers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Connectivity to Major Hubs</strong>: The development enjoys excellent connectivity to key business hubs in Gurgaon, such as Cyber City, MG Road, and Golf Course Road. Additionally, it provides easy access to the diplomatic area of Dwarka in Delhi.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Close to Proposed Metro Corridor</strong>: The project is near a proposed metro station, which will further enhance the area\'s connectivity and make commuting even easier for residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Infrastructure &amp; Social Amenities</strong>: The surrounding area is seeing rapid infrastructure development, with top schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and entertainment centers all within a short distance, making it an ideal location for families.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Part of Delhi&rsquo;s Smart City Plan</strong>: Being a part of the Delhi Airport Smart City project, M3M Crown benefits from the planned infrastructure improvements, including improved road networks, smart traffic management, and sustainability initiatives.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2><strong>Luxury Amenities at M3M Crown, Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>M3M Crown offers an array of high-end amenities designed to provide residents with an unparalleled living experience. These amenities are crafted to ensure both relaxation and recreation, enhancing the overall lifestyle within the community. Here\'s a look at the luxury amenities you can expect at M3M Crown:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. 5.5-Acre Central Landscape</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The development features an expansive 5.5-acre central landscape that is designed to create a serene and refreshing environment.</li>\r\n<li>It includes lush green spaces, landscaped gardens, and shaded walkways, perfect for a leisurely stroll or simply relaxing amidst nature.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>2. Waterfront Club</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The project boasts a <strong>Waterfront Club</strong>, a premium recreational facility for residents to unwind and socialize.</li>\r\n<li><strong>14,000 sq. ft. swimming pool</strong>: One of the most luxurious amenities, it serves as a perfect relaxation spot with expansive views.</li>\r\n<li>The club is designed with modern facilities to cater to both relaxation and fitness needs, ensuring residents have a resort-like experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. State-of-the-Art Fitness Center</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The development includes a <strong>fully-equipped fitness center</strong> with the latest gym equipment, offering an exclusive space for fitness enthusiasts.</li>\r\n<li>It also offers designated areas for yoga and meditation, helping residents maintain a healthy mind and body.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Multipurpose Sports Court</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>M3M Crown offers <strong>sports amenities</strong> like tennis courts, basketball courts, and more, allowing residents to stay active while enjoying a variety of sports activities.</li>\r\n<li>It&rsquo;s designed to promote an active and healthy lifestyle for families and sports lovers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Clubhouse and Recreational Facilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>A <strong>luxurious clubhouse</strong> offers spaces for residents to gather, host events, and socialize.</li>\r\n<li>The clubhouse features various recreational zones, including areas for indoor games like billiards, table tennis, and card rooms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. 24x7 Security &amp; Surveillance</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>To ensure residents\' safety, M3M Crown is equipped with <strong>24/7 security systems</strong> including CCTV surveillance, manned security at key entry points, and access control systems for gated entry.</li>\r\n<li>It provides a sense of security and peace of mind to families.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Children\'s Play Area</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The development includes <strong>dedicated play areas</strong> for children, designed with safe, modern play equipment to ensure a fun and secure environment for kids to enjoy their time outdoors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Spa and Wellness Center</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The spa and wellness center provides residents with a place to rejuvenate and relax. From massages to wellness therapies, it&rsquo;s a place where residents can pamper themselves and experience complete relaxation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. High-Speed Elevators &amp; 24/7 Power Backup</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>To ensure convenience, M3M Crown is equipped with <strong>high-speed elevators</strong> that provide quick access to all floors.</li>\r\n<li>The entire property has <strong>24/7 power backup</strong> to ensure uninterrupted living.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>10. Parking &amp; Visitor Spaces</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Ample <strong>parking spaces</strong> are available for residents, with designated visitor parking spots, ensuring convenience for residents and guests alike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>11. Designer Water Features &amp; Aesthetic Landscaping</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The project is designed with <strong>water features</strong>, including fountains and lakes, that enhance the aesthetic appeal of the surroundings and provide a tranquil environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>12. Dedicated Servant Quarters</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>In line with luxurious living, M3M Crown offers <strong>servant quarters</strong> for additional convenience and comfort.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>13. Eco-friendly Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The development integrates <strong>green initiatives</strong> like rainwater harvesting, energy-efficient lighting, and waste management systems, contributing to a sustainable and eco-friendly lifestyle.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>14. 24/7 Concierge Services</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Residents can enjoy the convenience of a <strong>dedicated concierge service</strong> for various needs, such as booking transportation, event planning, or any personal requests that enhance the quality of life.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>15. Exclusive Retail Spaces</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>M3M Crown also includes high-end <strong>retail spaces</strong> within the complex, offering convenience for residents to shop for daily essentials or luxury items without leaving the property.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3>To book a unit in <strong>M3M Crown, Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, you can follow these steps:</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Step 1: Contact A2P Realtech</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Reach Out</strong>: Begin by contacting A2P Realtech, which can be done via phone, email, or through their website. You can inquire about the availability of units in M3M Crown, including floor plans, pricing, and payment options.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Get Details</strong>: Discuss your preferences for unit type (3 BHK or 4 BHK), preferred floor, and any other specifications like facing, view, etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 2: Property Site Visit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Visit</strong>: After confirming your interest, schedule a site visit to M3M Crown. This will allow you to experience the project firsthand, inspect the show apartments, and understand the facilities and amenities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Tour with A2P Representative</strong>: A representative from A2P Realtech will assist you during the visit, answering your questions and providing additional information.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 3: Finalize the Unit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Choose Your Unit</strong>: After the site visit, finalize the specific unit you want to book based on availability, floor preference, and budget.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Confirm the Details</strong>: Double-check the details regarding the unit\'s specifications, such as size, price, and payment terms, with A2P Realtech.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 4: Documentation &amp; Agreement</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Submit Documents</strong>: You will need to provide necessary documents like ID proof, address proof, and KYC details for the booking.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Booking Amount</strong>: Pay the <strong>booking amount</strong> (which is typically a small percentage of the unit cost) to secure the unit.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sign the Agreement</strong>: After the booking amount is received, you will be required to sign the <strong>Booking Agreement</strong> and provide your confirmation for the selected unit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 5: Payment Plan Selection</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Discuss Payment Options</strong>: A2P Realtech will help you select the most suitable payment plan. Common plans include:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Subvention Plan</strong>: Pay a certain percentage upfront, with the remaining due upon possession.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Construction Linked Plan</strong>: Pay according to construction milestones.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Possession Linked Plan</strong>: Pay based on possession stages.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 6: Payment Processing</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Make Payments</strong>: Once you have selected a payment plan, start making the payments as per the schedule.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Receipt of Payment</strong>: Ensure you receive proper receipts for all payments made.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 7: Confirmation of Unit Allotment</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>After completing the necessary formalities and payments, you will receive an <strong>allotment letter</strong> from M3M Properties, confirming your unit and the expected possession date.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 8: Handover Process</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Once the construction is completed, you will be notified about the <strong>possession date</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>After the possession is granted, A2P Realtech will assist with the <strong>handover process</strong>, ensuring you receive the keys to your unit and any remaining formalities are completed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Additional Tips:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Inquire About Offers</strong>: Ask A2P Realtech if there are any ongoing promotions, offers, or discounts available for M3M Crown.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Financing Assistance</strong>: If you need home loan assistance, A2P Realtech can guide you through the loan process by connecting you with banks or financial institutions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Track Construction Progress</strong>: Stay updated on the construction progress and possession date through A2P Realtech or M3M customer service.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>By following these steps, you can easily book a unit in M3M Crown with the help of A2P Realtech and enjoy a seamless process from inquiry to possession.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '1,605 to 2,670 ', 'Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'GQHCN56V', 19, 'M3M Crown Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon', 'M3M Crown, Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech, Luxury Property, ', 'M3M Crown is a premium residential development situated in Sector 111, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. This project offers luxurious 3 and 4 BHK apartments, with sizes ranging from 1,605 to 2,670 square feet. The starting price for these residences is approximately ?2.1 crore. ', NULL, NULL);
