(184, 'Smart world One DXP Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon Haryana', '280225064732Smart-World-OneDXP-Sector-11-A2P-Realtech.jpg', '<h4 data-end=\"325\" data-start=\"305\"><strong data-end=\"325\" data-start=\"309\">1. Clubhouse</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"433\" data-start=\"329\">\r\n<li data-end=\"433\" data-start=\"329\">A <strong data-end=\"373\" data-start=\"333\">spacious and well-equipped clubhouse</strong> for social gatherings, recreational activities, and events.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"435\"><strong data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"439\">2. Swimming Pool</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"555\" data-start=\"463\">\r\n<li data-end=\"555\" data-start=\"463\">A beautifully designed <strong data-end=\"505\" data-start=\"488\">swimming pool</strong> where residents can relax and enjoy leisure time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"557\"><strong data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"561\">3. Gymnasium</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"672\" data-start=\"581\">\r\n<li data-end=\"672\" data-start=\"581\">A <strong data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"585\">state-of-the-art gym</strong> with modern fitness equipment to cater to fitness enthusiasts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"701\" data-start=\"674\"><strong data-end=\"701\" data-start=\"678\">4. Co-working Space</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"792\" data-start=\"705\">\r\n<li data-end=\"792\" data-start=\"705\"><strong data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"707\">24/7 co-working spaces</strong> ideal for remote workers, freelancers, and business needs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"794\"><strong data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"798\">5. Indoor &amp; Outdoor Sports Facilities</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"988\" data-start=\"843\">\r\n<li data-end=\"988\" data-start=\"843\">Dedicated areas for <strong data-end=\"903\" data-start=\"865\">sports and recreational activities</strong>, including indoor games and outdoor sports like <strong data-end=\"965\" data-start=\"952\">badminton</strong>, <strong data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"967\">tennis</strong>, and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1019\" data-start=\"990\"><strong data-end=\"1019\" data-start=\"994\">6. Landscaped Gardens</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1126\" data-start=\"1023\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1126\" data-start=\"1023\"><strong data-end=\"1054\" data-start=\"1025\">Themed landscaped gardens</strong> and green spaces designed to provide a serene and peaceful environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1156\" data-start=\"1128\"><strong data-end=\"1156\" data-start=\"1132\">7. Multipurpose Hall</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1246\" data-start=\"1160\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1246\" data-start=\"1160\">A <strong data-end=\"1185\" data-start=\"1164\">multipurpose hall</strong> for hosting community events, parties, and other activities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1279\" data-start=\"1248\"><strong data-end=\"1279\" data-start=\"1252\">8. Children\'s Play Area</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1283\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1283\">A <strong data-end=\"1310\" data-start=\"1287\">dedicated play zone</strong> with various activities for kids, making it a child-friendly environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1424\" data-start=\"1386\"><strong data-end=\"1424\" data-start=\"1390\">9. Retail &amp; Convenience Stores</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1547\" data-start=\"1428\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1547\" data-start=\"1428\">On-site <strong data-end=\"1455\" data-start=\"1438\">retail stores</strong> and convenience outlets for daily necessities, offering ease and convenience for residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1589\" data-start=\"1549\"><strong data-end=\"1589\" data-start=\"1553\">10. 24/7 Security &amp; Surveillance</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1705\" data-start=\"1593\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1705\" data-start=\"1593\"><strong data-end=\"1623\" data-start=\"1595\">Round-the-clock security</strong> with <strong data-end=\"1650\" data-start=\"1629\">CCTV surveillance</strong>, ensuring a safe living environment for all residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1739\" data-start=\"1707\"><strong data-end=\"1739\" data-start=\"1711\">11. High-Speed Elevators</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1842\" data-start=\"1743\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1842\" data-start=\"1743\"><strong data-end=\"1776\" data-start=\"1745\">Modern high-speed elevators</strong> in each tower, ensuring quick and efficient access to all floors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1868\" data-start=\"1844\"><strong data-end=\"1868\" data-start=\"1848\">12. Power Backup</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1977\" data-start=\"1872\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1977\" data-start=\"1872\"><strong data-end=\"1895\" data-start=\"1874\">24/7 power backup</strong> to ensure continuous electricity supply and no interruptions in daily activities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2007\" data-start=\"1979\"><strong data-end=\"2007\" data-start=\"1983\">13. Parking Facility</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2107\" data-start=\"2011\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2107\" data-start=\"2011\"><strong data-end=\"2041\" data-start=\"2013\">Dedicated parking spaces</strong> for residents and visitors, ensuring ample space and convenience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2147\" data-start=\"2109\"><strong data-end=\"2147\" data-start=\"2113\">14. Solar Water Heating System</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2253\" data-start=\"2151\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2253\" data-start=\"2151\">Use of <strong data-end=\"2176\" data-start=\"2160\">solar energy</strong> for water heating, enhancing sustainability and reducing energy consumption.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2294\" data-start=\"2255\"><strong data-end=\"2294\" data-start=\"2259\">15. Rainwater Harvesting System</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2380\" data-start=\"2298\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2380\" data-start=\"2298\"><strong data-end=\"2324\" data-start=\"2300\">Rainwater harvesting</strong> to promote sustainability and conserve water resources.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2414\" data-start=\"2382\"><strong data-end=\"2414\" data-start=\"2386\">16. Fire Safety Features</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2543\" data-start=\"2418\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2543\" data-start=\"2418\"><strong data-end=\"2452\" data-start=\"2420\">Advanced fire safety systems</strong>, including smoke detectors, fire alarms, and sprinklers, ensuring the safety of residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2590\" data-start=\"2545\"><strong data-end=\"2590\" data-start=\"2549\">17. High-Quality Interiors &amp; Finishes</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2704\" data-start=\"2594\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2704\" data-start=\"2594\">Premium <strong data-end=\"2625\" data-start=\"2604\">interior finishes</strong>, including high-quality flooring, fittings, and modern kitchens and bathrooms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2748\" data-start=\"2706\"><strong data-end=\"2748\" data-start=\"2710\">18. Health and Wellness Facilities</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2856\" data-start=\"2752\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2856\" data-start=\"2752\">Dedicated spaces for <strong data-end=\"2783\" data-start=\"2775\">yoga</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2799\" data-start=\"2785\">meditation</strong>, and wellness activities, promoting a healthy lifestyle.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"2893\" data-start=\"2858\"><strong data-end=\"2893\" data-start=\"2862\">19. 24/7 Concierge Services</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3038\" data-start=\"2897\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3038\" data-start=\"2897\"><strong data-end=\"2921\" data-start=\"2899\">Concierge services</strong> to assist residents with various needs, such as booking travel, arranging maintenance, and other lifestyle services.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"3068\" data-start=\"3040\"><strong data-end=\"3068\" data-start=\"3044\">20. Visitor&rsquo;s Lounge</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3141\" data-start=\"3072\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3141\" data-start=\"3072\">A <strong data-end=\"3106\" data-start=\"3076\">welcoming visitor&rsquo;s lounge</strong> where guests can wait comfortably.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"3170\" data-start=\"3143\"><strong data-end=\"3170\" data-start=\"3147\">21. Gated Community</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3264\" data-start=\"3174\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3264\" data-start=\"3174\">A <strong data-end=\"3204\" data-start=\"3178\">secure gated community</strong> with controlled access, offering privacy and peace of mind.</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 293, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>Smart world One DXP Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon, Haryana</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Smart World One DXP is a premium residential project located in Sector 113, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. Developed by <strong>Smart World Developers</strong>, the project offers a modern, luxury living experience with a focus on both comfort and convenience. Here&rsquo;s a more detailed look at the project:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; background-color: rgb(53, 152, 219); border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.7528%; height: 694.25px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8037%; text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Inventory</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.1963%; text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Size</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: rgb(236, 240, 241); border-style: solid; height: 207.953px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8037%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 207.953px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>3.5 BHK</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.1963%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 207.953px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>2551 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n<p>2594 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n<p>2654 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n<p>2715 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n<p>2843 Sq.Ft,&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: rgb(236, 240, 241); border-style: solid; height: 323.125px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8037%; text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 323.125px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>4.5 BHK</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.1963%; text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 323.125px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>3069 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n<p>3093 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n<p>3141 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n<p>3150 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n<p>3199 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n<p>3248 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n<p>3327 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n<p>2654 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: rgb(236, 240, 241); border-style: solid; height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8037%; text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Penthouse 1</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.1963%; text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>7475 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8037%; text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Penthouse 2</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.1963%; text-align: center; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>7954 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Project Overview</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Location:</strong> Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Configuration:</strong> The project includes spacious 3.5, 4.5, apartments and Penthouse, designed to meet the needs of different family sizes.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Structure:</strong> Smart World One DXP is set to feature <strong>16 towers</strong>, each with <strong>2 basement levels</strong>, <strong>ground floor</strong>, and <strong>29 residential floors</strong>, ensuring a high-end living experience in a vertical community.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Design:</strong> The architecture is thoughtfully planned, with the <strong>facade designed by UHA, London</strong>, and the landscaping developed by <strong>Element Design Studio, Singapore</strong>. This brings together international expertise in design and aesthetics.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features and Amenities</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Clubhouse:</strong> A large, well-equipped clubhouse for social events and gatherings.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Swimming Pool:</strong> A beautifully designed swimming pool for recreation and relaxation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Gymnasium:</strong> A modern, fully-equipped gym to cater to fitness enthusiasts.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Co-working Space:</strong> Smart World One DXP offers a <strong>24/7 co-working space</strong>, which is a first of its kind in the Delhi-NCR region, ideal for remote work, startups, and business needs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sports Facilities:</strong> Dedicated spaces for various sports, ensuring a healthy and active lifestyle for the residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Landscaped Gardens:</strong> The project features <strong>themed landscaping</strong>, providing a calm and serene environment that is ideal for relaxation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Location:</strong> Located along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, the project provides excellent connectivity to various important places in the region, including the <strong>Delhi International Airport</strong> and the <strong>Diplomatic Enclave</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Nearby Areas:</strong> The project is close to key business hubs, shopping malls, hospitals, and educational institutions, offering ease of access to all necessities of daily life.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Major Roads:</strong> The location ensures easy access to other parts of Gurgaon, Delhi, and beyond, making commuting convenient.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Investment Potential in Smart world oneDXP Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The investment potential of <strong>Smart World One DXP</strong> in <strong>Sector 113</strong>, <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, Gurgaon is quite promising due to a combination of several key factors that contribute to its appeal as a lucrative real estate investment. Here are the primary reasons why this project stands out in terms of investment:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Strategic Location</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> is one of the most sought-after areas in Gurgaon, offering excellent connectivity to both <strong>Delhi</strong> and <strong>Gurgaon</strong>. The proximity to the <strong>Delhi International Airport</strong> (about 15-20 minutes), <strong>Diplomatic Enclave</strong>, and major business hubs in <strong>Gurgaon</strong> makes it an attractive destination for residents and investors alike.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Accessibility</strong> to key areas, including <strong>Cyber City</strong>, <strong>MG Road</strong>, and <strong>Dwarka</strong>, makes it a prime location for both residential and commercial purposes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Infrastructure and Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> is a rapidly developing area, with ongoing infrastructure projects improving connectivity and driving up property values.</li>\r\n<li>Major roads like the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> and the <strong>NH8</strong> ensure smooth access to business districts, shopping centers, and healthcare facilities.</li>\r\n<li>The <strong>DMIC (Delhi-Mumbai Industrial Corridor)</strong>, set to further boost development in the region, could make this area even more attractive for future investors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Prime Developer</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Smart World Developers</strong> is a well-established name in the real estate industry, known for delivering high-quality projects. Their reputation adds confidence to the project\'s long-term value.</li>\r\n<li>Their focus on <strong>premium</strong> and <strong>luxury</strong> residential offerings ensures that the project caters to high-net-worth individuals (HNIs) and professionals, which enhances the property\'s desirability.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Future Growth Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The rapid growth of the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> area, which is expected to become a major commercial and residential hub, positions Smart World One DXP for significant <strong>capital appreciation</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>The ongoing development of nearby <strong>commercial spaces</strong>, as well as the construction of key infrastructure like metro stations and expressways, is expected to boost the region\'s real estate prices in the coming years.</li>\r\n<li>The completion of the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> itself, and the <strong>Delhi-Mumbai Industrial Corridor (DMIC)</strong> will lead to better connectivity and infrastructure, positively affecting property values.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Luxury Living in a Growing Market</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The project offers <strong>luxury apartments</strong> (3.5, 4.5, BHK and Penthouse), which are attractive to a segment of high-income buyers looking for spacious and modern living spaces with high-end amenities.</li>\r\n<li>With the <strong>expansion of the corporate sector</strong> in Gurgaon and the rise of the <strong>NCR (National Capital Region)</strong> as a hub for professionals, demand for luxury living spaces is expected to rise.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. High Rental Yield Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Given its location and the luxury offerings of Smart World One DXP, the apartments are likely to attract high-paying tenants, especially expatriates, corporate employees, and top professionals.</li>\r\n<li>The demand for <strong>rental properties</strong> in Gurgaon remains strong, driven by the growing number of businesses setting up in the city. This could lead to high <strong>rental yields</strong> for investors looking for income-generating properties.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Established Infrastructure</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The project is surrounded by a robust infrastructure network, including <strong>schools</strong>, <strong>hospitals</strong>, <strong>shopping malls</strong>, and other essential services. This adds convenience to potential residents and increases the long-term value of the property.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Upcoming Amenities and Developments</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The project promises a range of world-class amenities, including a <strong>swimming pool</strong>, <strong>gymnasium</strong>, <strong>co-working spaces</strong>, and more, making it an attractive option for those seeking a luxurious, convenient lifestyle.</li>\r\n<li>Moreover, the overall development of the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> area is poised to enhance the <strong>appeal of the location</strong> even further, providing added value for property owners.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. Government Focus on the Area</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The government\'s focus on improving infrastructure in Gurgaon, especially in the Dwarka Expressway region, is expected to drive real estate prices upwards. Projects like the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, <strong>multi-level flyovers</strong>, and <strong>metro connectivity</strong> are key contributors to the development of this region.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><strong>Location Advantages of Smart world One DXP Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>location</strong> of <strong>Smart World One DXP</strong> in <strong>Sector 113</strong>, <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, Gurgaon offers several key advantages that make it a highly attractive destination for both homebuyers and investors. Here are the <strong>primary location advantages</strong> of this development:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Proximity to Major Transportation Hubs</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway Connectivity</strong>: The project is directly located along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, one of the most prominent infrastructure projects in the region, which connects <strong>Dwarka (Delhi)</strong> to <strong>Gurgaon</strong>. This expressway offers smooth connectivity to major parts of the National Capital Region (NCR).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Delhi International Airport (IGI)</strong>: The location is just about <strong>15-20 minutes away</strong> from the <strong>Delhi International Airport</strong>, making it highly convenient for frequent flyers and business travelers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Metro Connectivity</strong>: The upcoming <strong>Dwarka Expressway metro station</strong> will significantly improve access to public transport, enhancing connectivity to major hubs in <strong>Delhi</strong> and <strong>Gurgaon</strong>. The expansion of the <strong>Delhi Metro</strong> network will further improve commuting options.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Strategic Location for Business and Commercial Hubs</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Business Hubs</strong>: The project is strategically situated near major business districts in <strong>Gurgaon</strong>, including <strong>Cyber City</strong>, <strong>Cyber Hub</strong>, and <strong>Udyog Vihar</strong>. These areas house some of the biggest multinational corporations and offer numerous job opportunities, making it ideal for professionals working in these zones.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Diplomatic Enclave</strong>: The location is also close to the <strong>Diplomatic Enclave</strong> and important government offices in <strong>Dwarka</strong> and <strong>New Delhi</strong>, making it an attractive residential area for diplomats, expatriates, and professionals from the diplomatic and international business communities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Access to Key Commercial and Retail Destinations</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Shopping and Entertainment</strong>: The area is close to several major shopping malls and retail destinations, including <strong>Ambience Mall</strong>, <strong>MGF Metropolitan Mall</strong>, and <strong>Sahara Mall</strong>, providing residents with easy access to shopping, dining, and entertainment options.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Healthcare and Education</strong>: The project is situated near leading educational institutions such as <strong>The Shri Ram School</strong> and <strong>K.R. Mangalam World School</strong>, as well as <strong>top-tier hospitals</strong> like <strong>Medanta Medicity</strong> and <strong>Fortis Memorial Research Institute</strong>, ensuring convenient access to healthcare and quality education.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Future Growth and Development</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The <strong>Dwarka Expressway region</strong> is expected to experience substantial future growth due to ongoing infrastructure developments, such as the <strong>Dwarka Expressway\'s</strong> completion and the <strong>Delhi-Mumbai Industrial Corridor (DMIC)</strong>. These developments are set to enhance connectivity and increase the area\'s attractiveness for both residential and commercial projects.</li>\r\n<li>The <strong>Gurgaon-Manesar Urban Complex</strong>, a planned urban development area, will further contribute to the growth of <strong>Sector 113</strong> and surrounding regions, potentially leading to higher property value appreciation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Easy Access to Major Roads and Highways</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>National Highway 8 (NH-8)</strong>: The location provides quick access to <strong>NH-8</strong>, which connects to major cities like <strong>Delhi</strong>, <strong>Jaipur</strong>, and <strong>Mumbai</strong>. This makes commuting between cities easy, offering both convenience and flexibility.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Southern Peripheral Road (SPR)</strong>: The <strong>SPR</strong>, connecting to other parts of Gurgaon, is easily accessible from the project, providing additional connectivity to residential and commercial zones.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Proximity to Green Spaces and Recreational Areas</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The area around <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> is known for its <strong>planned green spaces</strong> and <strong>recreational areas</strong>, providing a serene environment for residents. The region offers a mix of natural beauty and modern infrastructure, perfect for those seeking a balanced lifestyle.</li>\r\n<li>Residents will enjoy easy access to parks, walking tracks, and other outdoor facilities, enhancing their overall living experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Upcoming Infrastructure Projects</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> is set to transform the entire area into a major urban hub. With ongoing development projects, including flyovers, elevated roads, and the <strong>Dwarka Expressway Metro Corridor</strong>, the area will become even better connected, further enhancing the convenience and desirability of living in the region.</li>\r\n<li>As <strong>Gurgaon</strong> continues to expand, the <strong>Sector 113</strong> area is expected to see an increase in residential and commercial developments, making it a prime location for both investment and living.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Proximity to Key Government and Commercial Centers</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Embassy Road and Diplomatic Enclave</strong> are within easy reach, making the location ideal for expatriates and diplomats.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Cyber City</strong> and <strong>Cyber Hub</strong> (major corporate hubs) are also close by, offering employment opportunities and easy access to dining, entertainment, and recreational spaces.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>To book a unit in <strong>Smart World One DXP</strong>, Sector 113, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these steps:</h3>\r\n<p><strong>1. Contact A2P Realtech</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Reach out to A2P Realtech</strong>: Get in touch with their sales team through their official contact details. You can find their contact information on their website or directly call them for assistance.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Visit the Office or Website</strong>: You can either visit their office or book a unit through their <strong>official website</strong> or app, if available.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Provide Your Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Select Your Preferred Unit</strong>: Inform the sales team at A2P Realtech about your requirements, such as the preferred <strong>flat size</strong> (2.5, 3.5, or 4.5 BHK), <strong>floor preference</strong>, and any other specific needs you may have.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Discuss Budget and Payment Plans</strong>: Discuss your budget and any available payment plans. Smart World One DXP may offer different payment options (e.g., <strong>subvention schemes</strong>, <strong>flexible payment plans</strong>, or <strong>construction-linked plans</strong>).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Site Visit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Site Visit</strong>: A2P Realtech will typically arrange for you to visit the <strong>Smart World One DXP</strong> site to view the property in person. This helps you assess the project location, amenities, and available units.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Tour the Model Apartments</strong>: You may be shown <strong>model apartments</strong> to get an idea of the layout, finishes, and available amenities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Documentation Process</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Submit Required Documents</strong>: Once you choose your unit, you will need to submit <strong>KYC documents</strong> (such as ID proof, address proof, etc.) and any other documents required for the booking.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sign the Booking Form</strong>: A2P Realtech will provide you with a <strong>booking form</strong> where you will confirm the details of your chosen unit and the agreed-upon payment plan.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Pay the Booking Amount</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Booking Amount</strong>: Pay the <strong>booking amount</strong> (usually a token advance) as per the agreement. This amount will be deducted from the total sale price of the unit.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Payment Options</strong>: You may pay via <strong>cheque</strong>, <strong>demand draft</strong>, or <strong>bank transfer</strong> depending on A2P Realtech\'s accepted modes of payment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Confirmation and Allotment</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Receive Booking Confirmation</strong>: Once the payment is made, A2P Realtech will issue a <strong>booking confirmation</strong> along with the allotment letter.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Agreement of Sale</strong>: A formal <strong>agreement of sale</strong> will be drafted and signed. This agreement will outline all terms and conditions related to your purchase, including the total price, payment schedule, possession date, and other specifics.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Payment as Per the Plan</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Follow the Payment Schedule</strong>: After booking, you will need to pay according to the chosen <strong>payment plan</strong> (construction-linked, time-linked, etc.). Payments are typically made in stages based on the project\'s construction progress.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Keep Track of Installments</strong>: Make sure to track each payment installment as per the schedule. A2P Realtech will assist you in managing this.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Possession and Handover</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Final Payment</strong>: Once the construction reaches the possession stage, you will need to make the final payment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Take Possession</strong>: After the final payment, A2P Realtech will arrange the <strong>possession</strong> of your unit at <a href=\"../service_detail/smartworld-one-dxp-sector-113-dwarka-expressway-gurgaon.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Smart World One DXP</strong></a>. The team will ensure that the unit is ready for handover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. Post-Sale Services</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Assistance with Interior and Moving In</strong>: After possession, A2P Realtech may assist with any post-sale services, including the <strong>interior setup</strong> and guidance for moving in.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Customer Support</strong>: For any queries or issues, their customer support team will be available to assist you.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>10. Registration of Property</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Registration of Unit</strong>: Lastly, the property will need to be registered with the local authorities. A2P Realtech can assist you with the legal documentation and property registration process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>By following these steps with <strong data-end=\"3990\" data-start=\"3974\">A2P Realtech</strong>, you can seamlessly book your unit at <strong data-end=\"4052\" data-start=\"4029\">Smart World One DXP</strong> and proceed with the purchasing process.</p>', '', '', '', '', 'Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon Haryana', '', '', 'W0TX51WC', 19, 'Smart world One DXP Sector 113 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon, Haryana', 'Smart world , One DXP, Dwarka Expressway, Sector 111, A2P Realtech', 'Smart World One DXP is a premium residential project located in Sector 111, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Smart World Developers, the project offers a modern, luxury living experience with a focus on both comfort and convenience. Here’s a more detailed look at the project', NULL, NULL);
