#3598db; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>INVENTORY NAME</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.8077%; text-align: center; border-color: #3598db; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SIZE&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.3906px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.1383%; border-color: #3598db;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>3 BHK Apartment</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.8077%; border-color: #3598db;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>2,450 Sq. Ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.3906px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.1383%; border-color: #3598db;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>3 BHK Apartment</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.8077%; border-color: #3598db;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>2,700 Sq. Ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 43.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.1383%; text-align: center; border-color: #3598db;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>3 BHK Penthouse</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.8077%; border-color: #3598db;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>4, 210 Sq. Ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.1383%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>4 BHK Apartment</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.8077%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3,075 Sq. Ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.1383%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>4 BHK Apartment</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.8077%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3,395 Sq. Ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.1383%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>4 BHK Penthouse</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.8077%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>5,322 Sq. Ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.1383%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>5 BHK Apartment</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.8077%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>4,095 Sq. Ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.1383%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>5 BHK Apartment</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.8077%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>4,495 Sq. Ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.1383%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>5 BHK Penthouse</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.8077%; border-color: #3598db; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>6,362 Sq. Ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Project Highlights in short:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Location</strong>: The project is strategically situated in <strong>Sector 106</strong>, right next to the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, which ensures excellent connectivity to key areas in Gurgaon and Delhi. The location is also close to <strong>IGI Airport</strong>, making it ideal for frequent travelers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Spread</strong>: Elan The Presidential spans over <strong>30 acres</strong>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features &amp; Amenities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Luxury Amenities</strong>: The project is packed with ultra-luxurious amenities including a state-of-the-art clubhouse, gymnasium, swimming pool, landscaped gardens, and more.</li>\r\n<li><strong>World-Class Design &amp; Architecture</strong>: The design focuses on a futuristic approach with cutting-edge architecture, offering a high standard of living and optimal use of space.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Panoramic Views</strong>: Many of the apartments in Elan The Presidential offer stunning panoramic views of the city skyline and surrounding areas.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Concierge Services</strong>: To enhance the lifestyle experience, the project also offers personalized concierge services to cater to residents\' needs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Security &amp; Safety</strong>: The development ensures the highest standards of security, including 24/7 surveillance, security personnel, and gated access.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><strong>Key Location Advantages of Elan the presidential sector 106 Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong>Elan The Presidential</strong> in Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon offers several key location advantages, making it a highly desirable residential project. Here\'s an overview of the location benefits:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Prime Connectivity:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>: Elan The Presidential is located directly on the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, one of the most important and rapidly developing roads connecting Gurgaon to Delhi. This ensures smooth access to both Delhi and other parts of Gurgaon, providing excellent connectivity for residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>IGI Airport</strong>: The project is just a short drive away from <strong>Indira Gandhi International (IGI) Airport</strong>, making it ideal for frequent travelers. The proximity to the airport ensures easy access to both domestic and international flights.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Delhi Border</strong>: With the Dwarka Expressway, residents have quick access to <strong>Delhi</strong>, allowing for easy commuting to key business hubs like <strong>Cyber City</strong>, <strong>Udyog Vihar</strong>, and <strong>Central Delhi</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Proximity to Business Hubs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Cyber City &amp; Udyog Vihar</strong>: The project is strategically located close to major commercial hubs in Gurgaon, such as <strong>Cyber City</strong> and <strong>Udyog Vihar</strong>, which house numerous corporate offices and tech parks. This makes it an attractive option for professionals working in these areas.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Gurgaon&rsquo;s Financial &amp; Commercial Districts</strong>: It is also near Gurgaon&rsquo;s key financial and commercial areas like <strong>MG Road</strong>, <strong>Sohna Road</strong>, and <strong>Golf Course Road</strong>, which are home to a wide range of multinational companies and retail outlets.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Educational Institutions &amp; Healthcare:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Schools &amp; Universities</strong>: The location is close to renowned educational institutions like <strong>The British International School</strong>, <strong>K.R. Mangalam University</strong>, and others. This makes it a convenient location for families with children.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Healthcare</strong>: Several leading hospitals such as <strong>Medanta</strong>, <strong>Artemis Hospital</strong>, and <strong>Fortis Memorial Research Institute</strong> are within easy reach, ensuring quick medical assistance whenever required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Social Infrastructure &amp; Retail:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Shopping &amp; Entertainment</strong>: The area has access to a wide range of shopping malls, entertainment hubs, and retail outlets. <strong>Ambience Mall</strong>, <strong>DLF Mall of India</strong>, and <strong>MGF Metropolitan Mall</strong> are all located nearby, offering a variety of shopping, dining, and entertainment options.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Restaurants and Cafes</strong>: There are numerous fine dining restaurants, cafes, and bars in and around the Dwarka Expressway area, ensuring a vibrant social life for residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Green and Serene Environment:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Open Spaces &amp; Greenery</strong>: The project is designed to offer spacious living with landscaped gardens and green spaces. The area around Sector 106 is less congested compared to other parts of Gurgaon, providing a peaceful and serene environment for residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Aravalli Range</strong>: The location also benefits from being near the <strong>Aravalli Range</strong>, offering residents a connection to nature and panoramic views of lush greenery and open spaces.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Upcoming Developments:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The Dwarka Expressway area is undergoing rapid infrastructural development, which promises to enhance connectivity and property value in the coming years. The <strong>Dwarka Expressway metro station</strong> is also planned, which will further improve public transportation options for residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Development of Social Amenities</strong>: With the area being a key growth corridor in Gurgaon, future developments such as commercial complexes, recreational facilities, and educational institutions will further enhance the area&rsquo;s livability.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. High-Value Location:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>As one of the most coveted locations in Gurgaon, Sector 106 on the Dwarka Expressway offers a high potential for property appreciation. The area&rsquo;s growing infrastructure and strategic location make it a sound investment choice for homeowners and investors alike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Elan The Presidential</strong> in Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, is designed to offer an unparalleled living experience, combining luxury, convenience, and modern amenities. Here are the <strong>key features and amenities</strong> of the project:</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Luxurious Residential Units</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Elan The Presidential offers <strong>3,</strong> <strong>4 and 5-Bedroom Apartments &amp; Penthouse</strong>, ranging from <strong>2,450 to 6,362 sq. ft.</strong> These apartments are designed to provide expansive living spaces and offer privacy, comfort, and luxury.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Futuristic Architecture and Design</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The project features <strong>cutting-edge architecture</strong> that incorporates both modern design and functionality. It is built to meet international standards, focusing on efficient space utilization and aesthetic appeal.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Panoramic Views</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Many apartments offer <strong>stunning panoramic views</strong> of the city skyline and surrounding greenery, providing a serene and tranquil living environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Personalized Concierge Services</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>A <strong>personalized concierge service</strong> is available for residents, ensuring that their day-to-day needs are met with ease and convenience. This includes booking reservations, travel arrangements, and assistance with other lifestyle needs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>High-End Interiors and Finishes</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Each apartment boasts <strong>premium finishes</strong>, including marble flooring, premium fixtures, modular kitchens, and smart home technology, ensuring a high standard of living.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Amenities:</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Clubhouse</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The development includes an <strong>ultra-luxurious clubhouse</strong>, which is equipped with a range of recreational and relaxation facilities like lounges, reading rooms, and event spaces.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Swimming Pool</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>A <strong>state-of-the-art swimming pool</strong> is available for residents to unwind and relax, offering a perfect space for recreation and leisure.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Fitness Center (Gym)</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>A fully-equipped <strong>fitness center</strong> allows residents to maintain an active lifestyle with high-end gym equipment and fitness classes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Spa and Wellness Center</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>A <strong>spa and wellness center</strong> provides residents with opportunities for relaxation and rejuvenation, offering massages and other wellness services.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Landscape Gardens</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The property includes <strong>landscaped gardens</strong> and lush green spaces that create a peaceful atmosphere and promote a connection with nature.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Indoor &amp; Outdoor Sports Facilities</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Indoor and outdoor sports</strong> amenities, such as a <strong>badminton court</strong>, <strong>tennis court</strong>, and <strong>children&rsquo;s play area</strong>, ensure residents have options to stay active and enjoy recreational activities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>24/7 Security</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The development has <strong>round-the-clock security</strong>, including surveillance cameras, security personnel, and gated access to ensure the safety of all residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>High-Speed Elevators</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The towers are equipped with <strong>high-speed elevators</strong> to ensure efficient movement within the building, providing convenience and accessibility to all residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Smart Home Features</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Smart home automation systems</strong> enable residents to control various aspects of their homes, such as lighting, temperature, and security, from their smartphones.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Dedicated Parking</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Elan The Presidential offers <strong>ample parking space</strong> with designated spots for residents and guests, ensuring convenience and safety.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Multi-Purpose Hall</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The development includes a <strong>multi-purpose hall</strong> for hosting events like parties, gatherings, and celebrations, adding a social dimension to the community.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Retail Spaces</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The property may include <strong>retail spaces</strong> within the development for everyday conveniences, such as grocery stores, cafes, and other essential services.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Power Backup</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The complex provides <strong>24/7 power backup</strong> to ensure uninterrupted services in all areas, including common areas and residential units.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Rainwater Harvesting</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>To promote sustainable living, Elan The Presidential incorporates <strong>rainwater harvesting systems</strong> to reduce water consumption and conserve resources.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Wi-Fi Connectivity in Common Areas</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>High-speed <strong>Wi-Fi connectivity</strong> is available in common areas, allowing residents to stay connected even while they enjoy communal spaces.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Waste Management System</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The development incorporates an efficient <strong>waste management system</strong> to maintain cleanliness and sustainability throughout the property.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3><strong>How to book a unit in Elan the presidential sector 106 Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaonwith A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>To book a unit in <strong>Elan The Presidential</strong> in Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these steps:</p>\r\n<p><strong>Steps to Book a Unit:</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Contact A2P Realtech:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Reach out to A2P Realtech</strong> through their website or contact details. You can find the contact information on their official site or reach out to their sales team directly.</li>\r\n<li>You can also call their sales team at the provided phone numbers or email them for more details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Site Visit:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Arrange a site visit</strong> with A2P Realtech. This allows you to explore the project in person, check out the available units, understand the layout, and experience the amenities firsthand.</li>\r\n<li>During the visit, you can also get all your queries answered regarding the project, pricing, floor plans, etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Select the Unit:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Based on your preferences for the <strong>apartment size</strong>, <strong>configuration</strong> (4 or 5 BHK), and <strong>floor</strong>, choose the unit that suits your requirements.</li>\r\n<li>A2P Realtech will provide you with a list of available units and help you select the one that fits your budget and preferences.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Discuss Pricing &amp; Payment Plan:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Discuss the <strong>pricing</strong> and available <strong>payment plans</strong> with the sales team.</li>\r\n<li>They will guide you through the <strong>payment structure</strong>, such as <strong>booking amount</strong>, <strong>down payment</strong>, and <strong>installments</strong> during the construction phase.</li>\r\n<li>Inquire about any <strong>offers, discounts</strong>, or <strong>financing options</strong> available at the time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Documentation &amp; Agreement:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Once you&rsquo;ve selected your unit, A2P Realtech will guide you through the documentation process, including the <strong>sale agreement</strong> and <strong>booking form</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Ensure you provide the required <strong>identity proofs</strong>, <strong>address proof</strong>, and other documents as needed for the booking.</li>\r\n<li>Sign the <strong>booking agreement</strong> and pay the <strong>booking amount</strong> as per the payment terms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Payment Process:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>After signing the agreement, you&rsquo;ll be required to make the <strong>initial payment</strong>. The amount and the payment timeline will depend on the payment plan agreed upon.</li>\r\n<li>A2P Realtech can assist you with the payment process and provide options for <strong>bank loans</strong> if necessary.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Confirm Booking:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>After completing the payment and signing all necessary documents, your unit will be officially booked in <strong>Elan The Presidential</strong>. You&rsquo;ll receive a <strong>receipt</strong> of your booking and other related documents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Post-Booking Support:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>A2P Realtech will continue to provide <strong>post-booking support</strong>, updating you on the <strong>construction progress</strong>, <strong>possession dates</strong>, and any other relevant information.</li>\r\n<li>They will also assist you in case you need to make further payments or have any questions during the process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Contact Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>A2P Realtech Official Website</strong>: Visit their website for more details about available units and contact information.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sales Contact</strong>: You can directly call or email their sales team to initiate the booking process. They typically offer dedicated helplines and customer support.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>By following these steps and collaborating with <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, you can smoothly book your unit at <strong>Elan The Presidential</strong> and secure your luxury home in Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '30 acres ', 'sector 106 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'TJ6CQDBJ', 19, 'Elan the presidential sector 106 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Elan The Presidential is a premium residential project located in Sector 106 along the Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon often referred to as the ', 'Elan The Presidential, Luxury Apartment, Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, ', NULL, NULL),
