\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><strong>3 BHK</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1389 Sq. Ft</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><strong>3 BHK</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1689 Sq. Ft</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><strong>4 BHK&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2450 Sq. Ft</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Project Overview:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Location:</strong> Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</li>\r\n<li><strong>Developer:</strong> Hero Realty Private Limited</li>\r\n<li><strong>Status:</strong> Ready to Move Apartment</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Area:</strong> Approximately 9 acres</li>\r\n<li><strong>Number of Towers:</strong> 8</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Master Bedroom:</strong> Wooden flooring</li>\r\n<li><strong>Other Rooms:</strong> Vitrified tiles</li>\r\n<li><strong>Air Conditioning:</strong> Split ACs in all bedrooms</li>\r\n<li><strong>Wardrobes:</strong> Inbuilt durable wardrobes in the master bedroom</li>\r\n<li><strong>Kitchen:</strong> Modular design</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sanitary Fittings:</strong> Branded and high-quality</li>\r\n<li><strong>Intercom Facility:</strong> Inbuilt for enhanced communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Metro Connectivity:</strong> 2 minutes from the proposed metro station</li>\r\n<li><strong>Educational and Healthcare Facilities:</strong> Close to schools and hospitals</li>\r\n<li><strong>Major Highways:</strong> Easy access to NH-8 and SPR</li>\r\n<li><strong>Airport Access:</strong> Approximately 25 minutes\' drive to IGI Airport</li>\r\n<li><strong>Commercial Hubs:</strong> Proximity to corporate offices and retail centers</li>\r\n<li><strong>Railway Station:</strong> 15 minutes\' drive from Gurgaon Railway Station</li>\r\n<li><strong>Shopping Malls:</strong> Nearby malls include Gurgaon Dreamz Mall, Ansal Plaza, and Neo Square Mall</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Apartment Status</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Ready to move Apartment</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Pricing:</strong></p>\r\n<p>For the most current pricing and to explore the best deals, it\'s recommended to contact the <strong>A2P Realtech sales</strong> team directly.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Luxury Amenities at Hero Homes, Sector 104,&nbsp;Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Hero Homes in Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, offers a wide array of luxury amenities to ensure a high-end and comfortable living experience. The project is designed with modern features and facilities that cater to the needs of every resident. Here are some of the key luxury amenities:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Clubhouse and Recreation Facilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Clubhouse:</strong> A fully-equipped clubhouse with a variety of recreational facilities including lounges, indoor games, and spaces for social gatherings.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Multipurpose Hall:</strong> A spacious hall for events, parties, and community activities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Fitness &amp; Wellness Amenities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Swimming Pool:</strong> A luxurious outdoor swimming pool to relax and unwind.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Gymnasium:</strong> A state-of-the-art fitness center with modern equipment to cater to fitness enthusiasts.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Yoga &amp; Meditation Areas:</strong> Dedicated spaces for yoga, meditation, and mindfulness activities, ensuring a serene environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Sports Facilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Tennis Courts:</strong> Outdoor tennis courts for sports lovers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Badminton Courts:</strong> Indoor badminton courts for year-round play.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Basketball Court:</strong> A well-designed basketball court for both casual and professional use.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Jogging Track:</strong> A beautifully landscaped jogging and walking track for fitness and relaxation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Children\'s Play Area:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Kids&rsquo; Play Zone:</strong> A safe, fun, and interactive play area for children with modern playground equipment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sandpit and Splash Pool:</strong> Special zones designed for younger children to play and enjoy.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Green Spaces &amp; Landscaping:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Landscaped Gardens:</strong> Lush green gardens with walking paths, seating areas, and tranquil spots for residents to enjoy nature.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Open Recreational Spaces:</strong> Ample open spaces designed for community activities, socializing, and leisure time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Advanced Security Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>24x7 Security:</strong> Trained security personnel ensuring the safety and well-being of residents at all times.</li>\r\n<li><strong>CCTV Surveillance:</strong> Round-the-clock surveillance in key areas of the community for enhanced security.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Gated Community:</strong> Controlled entry and exit to maintain privacy and security.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Convenience Services:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Intercom Facility:</strong> A fully integrated intercom system for communication within the complex.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Power Backup:</strong> Uninterrupted power supply with backup systems in place to ensure comfort during outages.</li>\r\n<li><strong>High-Speed Elevators:</strong> Modern, high-speed elevators for quick and easy access to all floors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Sustainable Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Rainwater Harvesting:</strong> Eco-friendly rainwater harvesting systems to conserve water.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Waste Management:</strong> Efficient waste segregation and management systems to promote cleanliness and sustainability.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Energy-Efficient Lighting:</strong> LED lighting and energy-efficient systems across the community for lower energy consumption.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. Parking &amp; Transportation:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Ample Parking Space:</strong> Well-planned and spacious parking areas for residents and visitors.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Electric Vehicle Charging Stations:</strong> Provision for electric vehicle charging within the premises.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>10. Retail and Commercial Spaces:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Retail Zones:</strong> Convenience shopping areas within the complex for daily essentials.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Cafes &amp; Restaurants:</strong> On-site dining options offering a variety of culinary experiences for residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Steps to Book a Unit in Hero Homes Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon through A2P Realtech:</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>1. Initial Inquiry:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Contact A2P Realtech:</strong> Reach out to A2P Realtech via phone, email, or their website to express your interest in booking a unit in Hero Homes. They will assist you with the current availability, pricing, and available configurations (2BHK, 3BHK).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Provide Basic Information:</strong> Share your requirements, including the preferred unit size and budget, so they can guide you accordingly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Site Visit (Optional but Recommended):</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Site Visit:</strong> If you haven\'t already visited Hero Homes, A2P Realtech will help you schedule a visit to the site. This will allow you to explore the amenities, see the construction progress, and choose the unit that fits your preferences.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Guided Tour:</strong> A representative from A2P Realtech or Hero Homes will accompany you to provide detailed information about the project, floor plans, and specifications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Select Your Unit:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Choose a Unit:</strong> Based on availability and your preferences, select a unit (size, floor, and facing) that suits your needs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Confirm Details:</strong> Ensure that you confirm the final unit details, including its floor, view, and any other specifications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Review Payment Plan &amp; Documentation:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Understand Payment Plan:</strong> A2P Realtech will provide you with a detailed payment plan. Typically, the payment plan includes:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>30% payment upon booking</li>\r\n<li>30% payment after receiving the Occupancy Certificate (OC)</li>\r\n<li>Remaining 40% payment at possession.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Documents:</strong> A2P Realtech will guide you on the necessary documentation required to complete the booking. This includes identity proof, address proof, and other legal formalities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Make the Initial Booking Payment:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Pay the Booking Amount:</strong> After you finalize the unit, you&rsquo;ll be required to pay the initial booking amount (typically 30% of the total cost).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Payment Methods:</strong> Payments can generally be made through bank transfer, cheque, or online payment as per A2P Realtech\'s guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Receive Confirmation &amp; Allotment Letter:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Confirmation:</strong> After the payment, A2P Realtech will confirm your booking and provide you with a receipt.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Allotment Letter:</strong> You will receive an official allotment letter from Hero Homes, confirming your unit number and other important details.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Follow-up Payments &amp; Documents:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Follow-up Payments:</strong> Based on the payment schedule, make the subsequent payments as per the plan.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Documentation for Handover:</strong> A2P Realtech will assist you in providing the necessary documentation to ensure a smooth handover when the unit is ready for possession.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Possession of the Unit:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Receive Possession:</strong> Once your unit is ready for possession, A2P Realtech will coordinate with Hero Homes to ensure a smooth handover of your apartment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Final Payment:</strong> Upon possession, the remaining amount (if any) will need to be cleared to complete the transaction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p>By following these steps with the assistance of <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, your booking process for a unit in Hero Homes Sector 104 will be smooth and hassle-free. They will be your guide from the initial inquiry to the final possession of your luxury apartment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', 'Approximately 9 acres', 'Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', '4Y4JJ4BP', 19, 'Hero Homes luxury projects Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Hero Homes, Luxury Projects, Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, Luxury Apartment', 'Hero Homes is a luxury residential project located in Sector 104 along the Dwarka Expressway in Gurgaon. Developed by Hero Realty Private Limited, a subsidiary of the renowned Hero Group, the project emphasizes modern architecture and a wellness-inspired living experience', NULL, NULL);
