(187, 'Experion Windchants Villas Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '070325093328Experion-Windchants-Villas-Sector-112-A2P-Realtech.jpg', '<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Clubhouse</strong>: A state-of-the-art clubhouse offering a range of recreational activities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Swimming Pool</strong>: An outdoor pool for relaxation and fitness.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Gymnasium</strong>: A fully equipped fitness center with modern workout equipment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Tennis Court</strong>: A professionally designed tennis court for residents to enjoy.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Basketball Court</strong>: A court for basketball enthusiasts.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Cricket Pitch</strong>: A dedicated space for cricket lovers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Landscaped Gardens</strong>: Beautiful gardens for walks, relaxation, and children\'s play areas.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Children\'s Play Area</strong>: A dedicated safe zone for children to play and interact.</li>\r\n<li><strong>1.4 km Skywalk</strong>: One of the largest residential skywalks in Asia, offering panoramic views and recreation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Multipurpose Hall</strong>: For community events and gatherings.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Water Bodies</strong>: Private water bodies and landscaped water features around the villas for a serene atmosphere.</li>\r\n<li><strong>24/7 Security</strong>: Round-the-clock security with surveillance systems for the safety of residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Power Backup</strong>: Uninterrupted power supply to ensure convenience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Smart Home Features</strong>: Some villas come with home automation systems for better control and convenience.</li>\r\n</ol>', 0, 1, 283, '', '', '', '080325053309dummy.pdf', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>Experion Windchants Villas Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Experion Windchants is a luxury residential project located in Sector 112 along the Dwarka Expressway in Gurgaon, India. Developed by Experion Developers, the project spans approximately 23 acres and offers a range of high-end residential options, including 2.5 BHK, 3.5 BHK, 4.5 BHK apartments, as well as villas, duplexes, and penthouses.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Villa Sizes and Configurations:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>4 BHK Villas</strong>: These villas offer spacious living areas and are designed to provide maximum comfort and privacy.</li>\r\n<li><strong>5 BHK Villas</strong>: Larger villas offering expansive living space and luxury features.</li>\r\n<li><strong>6 BHK Villas</strong>: The largest villas, designed with exclusive features and extensive space for luxurious living.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The exact size (in square feet) for each configuration may vary, but typically, villas in this development range from around <strong>4,000 sq. ft. to over 6,000 sq. ft.</strong>, depending on the specific villa model and the plot size.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Design Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The villas have private front and back lawns, individual water bodies, and large floor plans designed to optimize natural light and ventilation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These villas are crafted for luxury living, with large floor spaces offering privacy, exclusivity, and comfort.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Location and Connectivity:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Sector 112 offers excellent connectivity to key areas in Gurgaon and Delhi. The development is near the Dwarka Expressway, providing easy access to business hubs like Cyber City and the Indira Gandhi International Airport. The area is also well-served by public transportation, including proximity to the Dwarka Metro Station, enhancing connectivity to the rest of Delhi.</li>\r\n<li>Experion Windchants aims to provide a luxurious and comfortable living experience, combining modern design with extensive amenities and strategic location advantages.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Luxury Amenities at Experion Windchants</strong></p>\r\n<p>Experion Windchants is equipped with a variety of luxury amenities that cater to the high-end living standards of its residents:</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Clubhouse</strong>: A state-of-the-art clubhouse offering a range of recreational activities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Swimming Pool</strong>: An outdoor pool for relaxation and fitness.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Gymnasium</strong>: A fully equipped fitness center with modern workout equipment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Tennis Court</strong>: A professionally designed tennis court for residents to enjoy.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Basketball Court</strong>: A court for basketball enthusiasts.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Cricket Pitch</strong>: A dedicated space for cricket lovers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Landscaped Gardens</strong>: Beautiful gardens for walks, relaxation, and children\'s play areas.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Children\'s Play Area</strong>: A dedicated safe zone for children to play and interact.</li>\r\n<li><strong>1.4 km Skywalk</strong>: One of the largest residential skywalks in Asia, offering panoramic views and recreation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Multipurpose Hall</strong>: For community events and gatherings.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Water Bodies</strong>: Private water bodies and landscaped water features around the villas for a serene atmosphere.</li>\r\n<li><strong>24/7 Security</strong>: Round-the-clock security with surveillance systems for the safety of residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Power Backup</strong>: Uninterrupted power supply to ensure convenience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Smart Home Features</strong>: Some villas come with home automation systems for better control and convenience.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Location Benefits</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Dwarka Expressway</strong>: Provides easy access to key locations in Gurgaon, Delhi, and the airport.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: Close to business hubs like Cyber City, Golf Course Extension Road, and Dwarka Metro Station.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Green Spaces</strong>: The development is surrounded by greenery, offering a peaceful and serene environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Steps to Book a Villa through A2P Realtech:</strong></h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Visit the A2P Realtech Website or Contact Them:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Start by visiting the official website of <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> or directly calling their customer support for information on available villas in <strong>Experion Windchants</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>You can also visit their office to get a personalized consultation or inquiry.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Choose Your Villa Type:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>A2P Realtech will assist you in selecting the villa based on your preferences such as the number of bedrooms (4 BHK, 5 BHK, or 6 BHK), size, and location within the community.</li>\r\n<li>Depending on availability, you may choose from various sizes, ranging from 4,000 sq. ft. to 7,000 sq. ft.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Arrange a Site Visit:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Request a site visit through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> to explore the villas firsthand. This will give you a chance to check the layout, amenities, and location.</li>\r\n<li>A2P Realtech representatives will guide you through the site, showcasing the villa\'s features, community amenities, and the surrounding area.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Review Pricing and Payment Plans:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Discuss the pricing, available offers, and payment plans with A2P Realtech. They can provide detailed cost breakdowns and guide you through financing options.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Pricing</strong> for the villas typically ranges from ?10 crore to ?20 crore, depending on size and customization.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Choose a Villa and Confirm Booking:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Once you have selected the villa of your choice, confirm your booking with <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>They will assist you with all the paperwork, including the booking agreement, terms and conditions, and payment schedules.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Make Initial Payment/Advance:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Pay the necessary booking amount or advance payment as per the agreement.</li>\r\n<li>The exact booking amount will be communicated to you by A2P Realtech based on the villa selected.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Documentation and Agreement:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Complete all required documentation with A2P Realtech. They will guide you through the process, including providing valid identity and address proofs.</li>\r\n<li>You&rsquo;ll need to sign the sale agreement and other legal documents related to the property.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Finalizing Payment and Handover:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>After completing all necessary payments, A2P Realtech will provide you with a timeline for possession and any additional steps.</li>\r\n<li>You&rsquo;ll receive the keys and handover details once the property is ready, and all payments have been made.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Post-Booking Support:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>A2P Realtech offers after-sales services for any queries related to possession, registration, or other property-related matters.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Contact A2P Realtech:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Phone Number</strong>: Contact A2P Realtech\'s customer service for quick assistance.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Website</strong>: Visit their official website for more details on available villas and to book an appointment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>By following these steps, you can successfully book your luxury villa at <strong>Experion Windchants</strong> through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> and start your journey towards owning a luxurious home on the Dwarka Expressway.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '', 'Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'OQZO8NT4', 19, 'Experion Windchants Villas Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Experion Windchants Villas, Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, A2P Realtech', 'Experion Windchants is a luxury residential project located in Sector 112 along the Dwarka Expressway in Gurgaon, India. Developed by Experion Developers, the project spans approximately 23 acres and offers a range of high-end residential options, including 2.5 BHK, 3.5 BHK, 4.5 BHK apartments, as well as villas, duplexes, and penthouses', NULL, NULL),
(188, 'Duplex Unit in Experion Windchants Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '080325111827Experion-Windchants-Duplex-Sec-112-Dwarka-Expressway-with-A2P-Realtech (1).jpg', '<h3 data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"487\"><strong data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"491\">1. Premium Residential Features:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1324\" data-start=\"528\">\r\n<li data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"528\"><strong data-end=\"557\" data-start=\"530\">Spacious Duplex Layouts</strong>: The duplex units offer expansive floor plans with sizes ranging from <strong data-end=\"654\" data-start=\"628\">4,492 to 8,515 sq. ft.</strong>, providing a luxurious and open living environment.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"707\"><strong data-end=\"739\" data-start=\"709\">Double-Height Living Rooms</strong>: The double-height living spaces in the duplex units add to the grandeur and spaciousness of the home.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1027\" data-start=\"843\"><strong data-end=\"877\" data-start=\"845\">Private Gardens and Terraces</strong>: Many of the duplex units come with <strong data-end=\"934\" data-start=\"914\">private terraces</strong> and <strong data-end=\"955\" data-start=\"939\">garden areas</strong>, offering exclusive outdoor spaces for residents to relax or entertain.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1167\" data-start=\"1028\"><strong data-end=\"1058\" data-start=\"1030\">Floor-to-Ceiling Windows</strong>: Large windows allow for ample natural light and spectacular views, enhancing the overall living experience.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1324\" data-start=\"1168\"><strong data-end=\"1192\" data-start=\"1170\">Designer Interiors</strong>: High-end finishes, <strong data-end=\"1233\" data-start=\"1213\">premium flooring</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1255\" data-start=\"1235\">modular kitchens</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"1284\" data-start=\"1261\">luxurious bathrooms</strong> are all standard in these duplex units.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"1326\"><strong data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"1330\">2. Skywalk &amp; Elevated Spaces:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1364\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1563\" data-start=\"1364\"><strong data-end=\"1404\" data-start=\"1366\">Asia\'s Largest Residential Skywalk</strong>: The iconic <strong data-end=\"1428\" data-start=\"1417\">skywalk</strong> provides residents with elevated access to common areas while offering <strong data-end=\"1518\" data-start=\"1500\">stunning views</strong> of the surrounding green spaces and skyline.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1564\"><strong data-end=\"1580\" data-start=\"1566\">Sky Garden</strong>: A <strong data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1584\">sky garden</strong> with landscaping provides a serene retreat, promoting an eco-friendly lifestyle and enhancing the luxury experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1751\" data-start=\"1717\"><strong data-end=\"1751\" data-start=\"1721\">3. Recreational Amenities:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2415\" data-start=\"1752\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1874\" data-start=\"1752\"><strong data-end=\"1780\" data-start=\"1754\">Infinity Swimming Pool</strong>: A large infinity pool that allows residents to unwind and relax while enjoying scenic views.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1986\" data-start=\"1875\"><strong data-end=\"1897\" data-start=\"1877\">Open-Air Jacuzzi</strong>: For a luxury spa-like experience, residents can enjoy a <strong data-end=\"1966\" data-start=\"1955\">jacuzzi</strong> near the pool area.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2114\" data-start=\"1987\"><strong data-end=\"2019\" data-start=\"1989\">Multipurpose Sports Courts</strong>: Includes <strong data-end=\"2040\" data-start=\"2030\">tennis</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2055\" data-start=\"2042\">badminton</strong>, and other sports facilities to cater to active residents.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2270\" data-start=\"2115\"><strong data-end=\"2147\" data-start=\"2117\">State-of-the-Art Gymnasium</strong>: A fully equipped fitness center with modern workout machines and equipment for residents to maintain an active lifestyle.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2412\" data-start=\"2271\"><strong data-end=\"2313\" data-start=\"2273\">Dedicated Jogging and Cycling Tracks</strong>: To promote fitness, the community offers <strong data-end=\"2377\" data-start=\"2356\">designated tracks</strong> for jogging, walking, and cycling.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2456\" data-start=\"2416\"><strong data-end=\"2456\" data-start=\"2420\">4. Health &amp; Wellness Facilities:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2820\" data-start=\"2457\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2585\" data-start=\"2457\"><strong data-end=\"2486\" data-start=\"2459\">Spa and Wellness Center</strong>: A high-end spa facility offering rejuvenating therapies, massages, and other wellness treatments.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2702\" data-start=\"2586\"><strong data-end=\"2616\" data-start=\"2588\">Yoga and Meditation Deck</strong>: A dedicated space for yoga and meditation to promote physical and mental well-being.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2820\" data-start=\"2703\"><strong data-end=\"2729\" data-start=\"2705\">Sauna and Steam Room</strong>: For relaxation and rejuvenation, these amenities offer a luxury retreat after a long day.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2853\" data-start=\"2822\"><strong data-end=\"2853\" data-start=\"2826\">5. Exclusive Clubhouse:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3161\" data-start=\"2854\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3023\" data-start=\"2854\"><strong data-end=\"2879\" data-start=\"2856\">Luxurious Clubhouse</strong>: A multi-purpose clubhouse for socializing and leisure activities, including a <strong data-end=\"2974\" data-start=\"2959\">lounge area</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2993\" data-start=\"2976\">banquet halls</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"3022\" data-start=\"2999\">indoor gaming zones</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3158\" data-start=\"3024\"><strong data-end=\"3047\" data-start=\"3026\">Indoor Games Room</strong>: Includes facilities for games like <strong data-end=\"3097\" data-start=\"3084\">billiards</strong>, <strong data-end=\"3115\" data-start=\"3099\">table tennis</strong>, and other indoor recreational activities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3206\" data-start=\"3162\"><strong data-end=\"3206\" data-start=\"3166\">6. Smart Home &amp; Automation Features:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3560\" data-start=\"3207\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3395\" data-start=\"3207\"><strong data-end=\"3228\" data-start=\"3209\">Home Automation</strong>: Integrated <strong data-end=\"3263\" data-start=\"3241\">smart home systems</strong> allow residents to control lighting, air conditioning, security, and other systems via their smartphones or central control panels.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3557\" data-start=\"3396\"><strong data-end=\"3424\" data-start=\"3398\">Smart Security Systems</strong>: High-tech security systems with <strong data-end=\"3479\" data-start=\"3458\">CCTV surveillance</strong>, <strong data-end=\"3505\" data-start=\"3481\">24/7 manned security</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"3534\" data-start=\"3511\">intercom facilities</strong> provide peace of mind.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3603\" data-start=\"3561\"><strong data-end=\"3603\" data-start=\"3565\">7. Green and Sustainable Features:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"4009\" data-start=\"3604\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3710\" data-start=\"3604\"><strong data-end=\"3630\" data-start=\"3606\">Rainwater Harvesting</strong>: To conserve water, the development includes a <strong data-end=\"3702\" data-start=\"3678\">rainwater harvesting</strong> system.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3855\" data-start=\"3711\"><strong data-end=\"3740\" data-start=\"3713\">Solar Power Integration</strong>: The project features <strong data-end=\"3779\" data-start=\"3763\">solar panels</strong> to support sustainable living by reducing reliance on non-renewable energy.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4006\" data-start=\"3856\"><strong data-end=\"3886\" data-start=\"3858\">Waste Management Systems</strong>: Advanced systems for <strong data-end=\"3930\" data-start=\"3909\">waste segregation</strong> and <strong data-end=\"3949\" data-start=\"3935\">composting</strong> to maintain cleanliness and reduce environmental impact.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"4044\" data-start=\"4010\"><strong data-end=\"4044\" data-start=\"4014\">8. Security &amp; Convenience:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"4470\" data-start=\"4045\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4202\" data-start=\"4045\"><strong data-end=\"4064\" data-start=\"4047\">24/7 Security</strong>: Round-the-clock <strong data-end=\"4104\" data-start=\"4082\">security personnel</strong>, <strong data-end=\"4127\" data-start=\"4106\">CCTV surveillance</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"4166\" data-start=\"4133\">access-controlled entry gates</strong> ensure the safety of all residents.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4327\" data-start=\"4203\"><strong data-end=\"4229\" data-start=\"4205\">High-Speed Elevators</strong>: The building is equipped with <strong data-end=\"4279\" data-start=\"4261\">fast elevators</strong> for easy and efficient movement between floors.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4470\" data-start=\"4328\"><strong data-end=\"4353\" data-start=\"4330\">Ample Parking Space</strong>: The development includes <strong data-end=\"4407\" data-start=\"4380\">dedicated parking areas</strong> for residents and visitors, ensuring convenience for everyone.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"4504\" data-start=\"4472\"><strong data-end=\"4504\" data-start=\"4476\">9. Additional Amenities:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"4943\" data-start=\"4505\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4608\" data-start=\"4505\"><strong data-end=\"4527\" data-start=\"4507\">Visitor&rsquo;s Lounge</strong>: A well-designed lounge area where guests can relax while waiting for residents.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4698\" data-start=\"4609\"><strong data-end=\"4632\" data-start=\"4611\">Convenience Store</strong>: On-site shops and convenience stores for residents&rsquo; daily needs.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4817\" data-start=\"4699\"><strong data-end=\"4723\" data-start=\"4701\">Private Lift Lobby</strong>: Some duplex units offer <strong data-end=\"4773\" data-start=\"4749\">private lift lobbies</strong>, adding to the exclusivity of the property.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4943\" data-start=\"4818\"><strong data-end=\"4837\" data-start=\"4820\">Private Pools</strong>: Some duplex units include a private pool within the unit itself, elevating the luxury living experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"4989\" data-start=\"4945\"><strong data-end=\"4989\" data-start=\"4949\">10. Green Landscaping &amp; Open Spaces:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"5307\" data-start=\"4990\">\r\n<li data-end=\"5175\" data-start=\"4990\"><strong data-end=\"5018\" data-start=\"4992\">Lush Green Landscaping</strong>: The project features beautifully designed <strong data-end=\"5084\" data-start=\"5062\">landscaped gardens</strong>, <strong data-end=\"5109\" data-start=\"5086\">tree-lined pathways</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"5131\" data-start=\"5115\">water bodies</strong>, creating a tranquil and serene atmosphere.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"5307\" data-start=\"5176\"><strong data-end=\"5199\" data-start=\"5178\">Ample Open Spaces</strong>: The development offers plenty of <strong data-end=\"5249\" data-start=\"5234\">open spaces</strong> for residents to enjoy outdoor activities and recreation.</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 284, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>Duplex Unit in Experion Windchants Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Experion Windchants is a luxury residential development located in Sector 112, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway, just 0 km from Delhi. Spanning approximately 23 acres, the project offers a range of residential options, including 2BHK, 3BHK, 4BHK, 5BHK, and 6BHK apartments, as well as villas and duplex units. The sizes of these units range from 2,441 to 8,515 square feet.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Duplex Unit Sizes and Configurations:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Duplex Unit Sizes</strong>: The sizes of the duplex units range from approximately <strong>4,492 to 8,515 square feet</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Configurations</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>3BHK Duplex</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>4BHK Duplex</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>5BHK Duplex</strong></li>\r\n<li>Larger configurations with additional features, offering luxury living spaces with multiple levels, private terraces, and high-end finishes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Double-Height Living Areas</strong>: The duplex units typically have double-height living rooms, adding a grand and spacious feel to the living space.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Private Garden and Terrace</strong>: Some of the units include private gardens and terraces, enhancing the luxury experience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Modern Amenities</strong>: These units come with advanced home automation, premium flooring, designer interiors, and large windows for abundant natural light.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Experion Windchants offers a wide range of <strong>luxury amenities</strong> designed to provide a premium living experience for its residents. Located in Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, the development is focused on providing high-end living with modern facilities and features. Some of the key luxury amenities at Experion Windchants include:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Skywalk and Green Spaces:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Asia&rsquo;s Largest Residential Skywalk</strong>: The elevated skywalk spans the development, offering stunning views and a relaxing environment, surrounded by manicured gardens and exotic flora.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sky Garden and Herb Garden</strong>: Residents can enjoy lush greenery and peaceful surroundings on the skywalk, enhancing the natural environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Sports and Recreational Facilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>State-of-the-Art Sports Facilities</strong>: Including tennis courts, badminton courts, and other recreational spaces for outdoor activities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Open-Air Poolside Jacuzzi</strong>: A luxury feature that allows residents to unwind in style.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Dedicated Hobby Zones</strong>: Areas for various hobbies and leisure activities to enhance the lifestyle of residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Health and Fitness:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Fully Equipped Gymnasium</strong>: A modern gym with high-end equipment for fitness enthusiasts.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Swimming Pool</strong>: An outdoor pool designed for relaxation and fitness.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Spa and Wellness Centre</strong>: A luxurious spa offering relaxation and wellness treatments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Clubhouse and Community Spaces:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Luxurious Clubhouse</strong>: Featuring an array of recreational and social activities with a lounge, banquet hall, and dedicated areas for events.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Indoor Games Room</strong>: A space for residents to enjoy indoor games like billiards, table tennis, and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Security and Convenience:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>24/7 Security</strong>: The development has round-the-clock security with CCTV surveillance and manned entry points for enhanced safety.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Smart Home Automation</strong>: Units come with home automation for controlling lighting, security, climate, and entertainment systems.</li>\r\n<li><strong>High-Speed Elevators</strong>: Ensuring convenience and efficiency in movement across the multiple floors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Other Luxury Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Private Gardens and Terraces</strong>: Some duplex units feature private gardens and terraces for outdoor relaxation and entertainment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Ample Parking</strong>: Ample space for residents and visitors, ensuring convenience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Visitor&rsquo;s Lounge</strong>: A well-designed lounge for guests.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Environmental Sustainability:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Rainwater Harvesting</strong>: An eco-friendly initiative to manage water resources efficiently.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Solar Panels</strong>: Installed to provide clean energy, reducing environmental impact.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Waste Management Systems</strong>: Advanced systems for recycling and waste disposal.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Luxury Interiors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>High-End Interiors</strong>: Spacious layouts with designer flooring, modular kitchens, and imported fittings.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Double-Height Living Areas</strong>: For a sense of grandeur in duplex units.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These amenities are designed to offer an elevated living experience, providing a combination of relaxation, fitness, security, and entertainment options, all integrated into a luxury lifestyle.</p>\r\n<p>Experion Windchants, located in <strong>Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong>, offers several <strong>location advantages</strong> that make it a prime residential choice for luxury living. Here are the key benefits of its location:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Proximity to Dwarka Expressway:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Direct Access to Dwarka Expressway</strong>: The project is situated along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, which is a major connecting road between <strong>Gurgaon</strong> and <strong>Dwarka</strong>, Delhi. This provides seamless connectivity to both cities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Reduced Travel Time</strong>: The proximity to the expressway ensures quick access to key areas in Delhi and Gurgaon, reducing commute times significantly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Connectivity to Major Locations:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Near to IGI Airport</strong>: Located just around <strong>15-20 minutes</strong> away from the <strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport (IGI)</strong>, making it convenient for frequent travelers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Well-Connected to Delhi</strong>: The location allows easy access to central and South Delhi, as well as to commercial hubs like <strong>Connaught Place</strong>, <strong>Cyber Hub</strong>, and <strong>MG Road</strong> in Gurgaon.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Metro Station</strong>: The upcoming <strong>Dwarka Expressway metro corridor</strong> will further improve the connectivity of this location to the metro network.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Commercial and Business Hubs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Corporate and Business Districts</strong>: Gurgaon&rsquo;s thriving business hubs like <strong>Cyber City</strong>, <strong>Udyog Vihar</strong>, <strong>MG Road</strong>, and <strong>Golf Course Road</strong> are just a short drive away, making it an ideal location for professionals.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Affordable Alternative to Central Gurgaon</strong>: Sector 112 provides a quieter and more spacious environment while still being close to commercial areas.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Educational and Healthcare Facilities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Top Schools and Colleges</strong>: The location is close to prestigious educational institutions such as <strong>The Heritage School</strong>, <strong>Delhi Public School</strong>, and <strong>KIIT College of Engineering</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Hospitals</strong>: Several top-rated hospitals like <strong>Medanta</strong>, <strong>Fortis</strong>, and <strong>Artemis</strong> are located nearby, ensuring world-class healthcare facilities are within reach.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Retail and Entertainment Hubs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Close to Shopping Malls and Retail Centers</strong>: The project is near major shopping malls like <strong>Ambience Mall</strong>, <strong>MGF Metropolitan Mall</strong>, and <strong>Sahara Mall</strong>, offering premium retail experiences and entertainment options.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Restaurants and Cafes</strong>: The area is dotted with high-end restaurants, cafes, and social spots, providing residents with plenty of dining and leisure options.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Serene Environment:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Green Surroundings</strong>: Despite being close to key urban centers, Sector 112 offers a more peaceful and green environment with large open spaces, parks, and tree-lined roads.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Reduced Traffic Congestion</strong>: The location avoids the heavy traffic in central Gurgaon, offering residents a more tranquil living experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Future Growth and Infrastructure Development:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Ongoing Infrastructure Development</strong>: With the ongoing development of the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> and other infrastructure projects, the area is expected to see significant growth in property values in the coming years.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proposed Metro Stations</strong>: The planned metro line along the Dwarka Expressway will further improve the connectivity of the region.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Strategic Location for Investment:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>High Investment Potential</strong>: The location&rsquo;s connectivity, proximity to key amenities, and future infrastructure growth make it an attractive investment option. The demand for premium properties in the area is likely to increase as more developments are completed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>The&nbsp;<strong>Return on Investment (ROI)</strong> potential at <strong>Experion Windchants</strong> in <strong>Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Return on Investment (ROI)</strong> potential at <strong>Experion Windchants</strong> in <strong>Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> is significant due to several location advantages that enhance its appeal to both homeowners and investors. Here are the key factors contributing to the <strong>ROI benefit</strong> for this luxury property:</p>\r\n<h3><strong>1. Strategic Location with Strong Connectivity</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Dwarka Expressway</strong>: The direct access to Dwarka Expressway ensures easy connectivity to both <strong>Delhi</strong> and <strong>Gurgaon</strong>. This elevated connectivity reduces commute times and increases the attractiveness of the property for both end-users and renters, which in turn drives demand and property value appreciation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Close to IGI Airport</strong>: Being just <strong>15-20 minutes</strong> away from <strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport (IGI)</strong>, the location is ideal for business executives, NRIs, and frequent travelers, increasing demand for high-end residential properties.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Upcoming Metro Line</strong>: The Dwarka Expressway metro corridor will further improve connectivity, making the area even more desirable for both buyers and renters, which will have a positive effect on property prices in the long run.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>2. High Demand from Professionals and Executives</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Corporate Hubs</strong>: The location is close to major business districts such as <strong>Cyber City</strong>, <strong>MG Road</strong>, and <strong>Golf Course Road</strong>, which are home to numerous multinational companies and IT firms. The high number of professionals working in these areas increases demand for residential properties like those at <strong>Experion Windchants</strong>, especially from high-income groups, ensuring both capital appreciation and rental yields.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Demand for Luxury Housing</strong>: The luxurious amenities and spacious layouts cater to high-net-worth individuals (HNIs) and expatriates, ensuring that the development attracts a premium customer base with stable demand.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>3. Appreciation Potential due to Infrastructure Development</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Ongoing and Upcoming Infrastructure Projects</strong>: As the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> continues to develop and metro connectivity improves, the area will see a significant rise in demand for residential properties. Such infrastructure development directly impacts the appreciation of real estate values.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sector 112\'s Growth as a Premium Location</strong>: As more luxury developments emerge in the area, it is likely to become one of the most sought-after addresses in Gurgaon. This will translate into higher property prices and rental yields.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>4. High-Quality Amenities Ensuring Value Addition</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Premium Amenities</strong>: The world-class amenities offered by <strong>Experion Windchants</strong>, such as the <strong>Asia&rsquo;s Largest Residential Skywalk</strong>, open-air jacuzzi, sports facilities, and private gardens, set it apart from other properties in the region. This exclusive offering attracts high-end buyers who are willing to pay a premium, leading to long-term value retention and growth.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Low-Density Development</strong>: The low-density nature of the project ensures a more spacious and private living experience, making it attractive to those seeking luxury living, thereby ensuring stable demand.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>5. Strong Rental Demand</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Attractive for Renters</strong>: The proximity to business hubs, the airport, and other key amenities make it a highly desirable location for professionals and expatriates. High demand for rental properties in Gurgaon, particularly in sectors along the Dwarka Expressway, can yield strong rental income for property owners.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Premium Rent Yields</strong>: Given the luxury aspect of the duplex units, owners can expect <strong>higher rental yields</strong> compared to standard properties, which is an attractive factor for investors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>6. Future Capital Appreciation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Growing Investment Potential</strong>: As the area continues to develop and the region sees an influx of corporate offices and business activity, property values are likely to increase. <strong>Experion Windchants</strong>, with its high-end offerings and prime location, is expected to experience steady capital appreciation over time.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Future Developments in the Area</strong>: With the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> connecting to other important regions, and the overall infrastructure development continuing in the area, property prices are likely to see sustained growth.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>7. NRI and HNI Appeal</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Attractive for Non-Resident Indians (NRIs)</strong>: With easy access to the airport and its luxurious features, Experion Windchants is an attractive option for NRIs looking for high-end properties in Gurgaon. This also ensures a steady stream of demand from the NRI community, boosting both occupancy rates and capital appreciation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>High-Net-Worth Individuals (HNI) Target</strong>: The project is designed for individuals seeking exclusive, spacious, and luxurious living. The demand from this segment ensures a consistent market for both buying and renting, positively influencing the overall ROI.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>8. Long-Term Investment Horizon</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Stable Long-Term Growth</strong>: Given the premium location and luxury offerings, Experion Windchants is likely to see stable growth in property values, making it an ideal investment for long-term capital appreciation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Tangible Assets</strong>: Real estate, especially in a sought-after location like Sector 112, offers investors a tangible asset that can provide both short-term rental income and long-term growth.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Conclusion: ROI Benefits</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>High Capital Appreciation</strong>: The combination of superior location, accessibility, and ongoing infrastructure developments creates strong potential for long-term value growth.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Premium Rental Yields</strong>: The strategic location near business hubs and the airport, coupled with luxurious amenities, makes it highly attractive for high-income tenants, ensuring high rental yields.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Appeal to NRIs and HNIs</strong>: The luxurious offerings at Experion Windchants cater to NRIs and HNIs, ensuring demand for both buying and renting, which supports strong ROI prospects.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Steps to Book a Duplex Unit in Experion Windchants Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway through A2P Realtech:</h3>\r\n<h4>1. <strong>Visit the A2P Realtech Website or Contact Them Directly:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Online Website</strong>: Visit the official website of <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> if they have one, where you can find detailed information on the available duplex units, pricing, and other specifics.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Contact A2P Realtech</strong>: You can call or email their customer service or sales team directly for guidance on booking a unit. They may also have a <strong>Whatsapp contact</strong> for quicker communication.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sales Office Visit</strong>: If you\'re in the area, visiting their office or the Experion Windchants sales office can help you get a personalized walkthrough of available units and pricing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>2. <strong>Provide Your Requirements:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Unit Preferences</strong>: Share your specific preferences such as <strong>size</strong>, <strong>configuration (3BHK, 4BHK, etc.)</strong>, and <strong>budget</strong>. They will help you find available duplex units that fit your needs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Down Payment and Financing Options</strong>: A2P Realtech will assist you in understanding the payment structure, and if you need financing, they can guide you through the process of securing a <strong>home loan</strong> or <strong>financing options</strong> from associated banks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>3. <strong>Select Your Desired Duplex Unit:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Based on your budget and requirements, A2P Realtech will provide you with available duplex units and options in <strong>Experion Windchants</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Availability Check</strong>: Duplex units in premium locations like this often have limited availability, so be sure to check availability and reserve your preferred unit quickly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>4. <strong>Initial Booking Process:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Fill Out the Booking Form</strong>: You will need to complete a booking form, either online or offline, provided by <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Booking Amount</strong>: You will typically be required to pay an <strong>initial booking amount</strong> or <strong>advance</strong> to secure the unit. This can range from a few lakhs to a percentage of the property value.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Documents</strong>: Be ready with necessary documentation like <strong>ID proof</strong>, <strong>address proof</strong>, <strong>PAN card</strong>, and <strong>passport-sized photos</strong> for the booking process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>5. <strong>Sign the Booking Agreement:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>After confirming your booking, you&rsquo;ll receive the <strong>booking agreement</strong> or <strong>letter of intent</strong> outlining the terms, payment schedule, and other important details.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Agreement Signing</strong>: Once you sign the agreement and make the initial payment, your unit will be reserved for you.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>6. <strong>Payment Plan and Financial Formalities:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Payment Schedule</strong>: The payment schedule will be discussed, which is usually linked to the construction milestones of the project. Ensure you&rsquo;re clear about <strong>EMI options</strong>, <strong>payment deadlines</strong>, and other charges.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Financing Options</strong>: If you are opting for a home loan, A2P Realtech can connect you with financing institutions like <strong>HDFC</strong>, <strong>ICICI</strong>, or other banks offering home loans for luxury properties.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>7. <strong>Confirmation and Documentation:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Once your payment and paperwork are completed, you&rsquo;ll receive a <strong>confirmation letter</strong> from Experion Developers and <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> confirming your booking.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sale Agreement</strong>: A <strong>final sale agreement</strong> will be signed once the unit is ready for possession or handover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>8. <strong>Handover and Possession:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>As the project nears completion, <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> will inform you about the possession date.</li>\r\n<li>You will need to make the final payments or loan disbursements to take possession of your unit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Additional Tips:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Site Visit</strong>: It&rsquo;s always a good idea to visit the site and explore the layout and amenities to ensure the property matches your expectations.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Consult A2P Realtech for Offers</strong>: Ask if there are any <strong>special offers</strong> or <strong>discounts</strong> available at the time of booking.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Legal Assistance</strong>: Make sure you have legal clarity on the title deed and other property documents, which <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> can assist with.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '4,492 to 8,515 square feet.', 'Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'WSBC3TYW', 19, 'Duplex Unit in Experion Windchants Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Duplex Unit in Experion, Experion Windchants, Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech, Duplex, Villas', 'Experion Windchants is a luxury residential development located in Sector 112, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway, just 0 km from Delhi. Spanning approximately 23 acres, the project offers a range of residential options, including 2BHK, 3BHK, 4BHK, 5BHK, and 6BHK apartments, as well as villas and duplex units. The sizes of these units range from 2,441 to 8,515 square feet.', NULL, NULL);
