(189, 'Indiabulls Estate and Club Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '090325062749Indiabulls-Estate-and-club-sec-104-Dwarka-Expressway-A2P-Realtech.jpg', '<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li data-end=\"444\" data-start=\"319\">\r\n<p data-end=\"444\" data-start=\"321\"><strong data-end=\"339\" data-start=\"321\">Swimming Pool:</strong> A well-maintained pool area for relaxation and leisure activities.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"569\" data-start=\"448\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"444\" data-start=\"319\">\r\n<p data-end=\"569\" data-start=\"448\"><strong data-end=\"462\" data-start=\"448\">Gymnasium:</strong> A fully equipped fitness center catering to various workout regimes.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"688\" data-start=\"573\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"444\" data-start=\"319\">\r\n<p data-end=\"688\" data-start=\"573\"><strong data-end=\"588\" data-start=\"573\">Club House:</strong> A dedicated space for social gatherings and community events.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"835\" data-start=\"692\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"444\" data-start=\"319\">\r\n<p data-end=\"835\" data-start=\"692\"><strong data-end=\"717\" data-start=\"692\">EV Charging Stations:</strong> Facilities to support electric vehicle owners with convenient charging options.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"444\" data-start=\"319\">\r\n<p><strong data-end=\"860\" data-start=\"839\">Landscape Garden:</strong> Beautifully designed green spaces for relaxation and outdoor activities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"837\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1094\" data-start=\"975\"><strong data-end=\"993\" data-start=\"975\">Cricket Pitch:</strong> A dedicated area for cricket enthusiasts to practice and play.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1228\" data-start=\"1098\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"837\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1228\" data-start=\"1098\"><strong data-end=\"1118\" data-start=\"1098\">Football Ground:</strong> A full-sized field suitable for football matches and training sessions.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1360\" data-start=\"1232\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"837\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1360\" data-start=\"1232\"><strong data-end=\"1257\" data-start=\"1232\">Yoga/Meditation Area:</strong> A serene environment designed for yoga practices and meditation.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1499\" data-start=\"1364\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"837\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1499\" data-start=\"1364\"><strong data-end=\"1381\" data-start=\"1364\">Indoor Games:</strong> Facilities for various indoor games to cater to diverse recreational interests.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1629\" data-start=\"1503\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"837\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1629\" data-start=\"1503\"><strong data-end=\"1516\" data-start=\"1503\">Open Gym:</strong> An outdoor gym setup for fitness enthusiasts who prefer open-air workouts.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1752\" data-start=\"1633\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"837\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1752\" data-start=\"1633\"><strong data-end=\"1647\" data-start=\"1633\">Cafeteria:</strong> An on-site caf&eacute; offering a variety of food and beverage options.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 280, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2>Indiabulls Estate and Club Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</h2>\r\n<p>Indiabulls Estate and Club is a luxury residential project located in Sector 104, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. Spanning nearly 17 acres, with over 7 acres dedicated to landscaped greens, this gated community offers resort-style living.</p>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #3598db; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Inventory</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #3598db; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Size</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3BHK Apartment</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Carpet Area</strong><strong> </strong><strong>1328 - 1404 sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>4BHK Apartment</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Carpet Area</strong><strong> </strong><strong>1780 - 2804 sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Project Highlights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Configurations:</strong> The development comprises 354 units, including 3, 4, and 5 BHK apartments and penthouses. Unit sizes range from 1,760 to 5,006 sq.ft.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Amenities:</strong> Residents can enjoy a vast clubhouse spanning nearly 100,000 sq.ft., a sports and wellness center, private terraces overlooking green spaces, and an adventure park for children.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Clubhouse:</strong> One of the standout features is its expansive clubhouse, spanning nearly 1 lakh sq.ft. across three iconic buildings, providing residents with ample recreational space.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Green Spaces:</strong> The project boasts over 7 acres of verdant green cover, ensuring a serene environment for its residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Location Advantages:</strong> The project\'s strategic location ensures easy access to Gurgaon and Delhi. Nearby landmarks include Cyber City, Aerocity, Diplomatic Enclave, Dwarka Golf Course, and the international airport.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages of Indiabulls Estate &amp; Club, Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></p>\r\n<p>Indiabulls Estate &amp; Club enjoys a <strong>strategic location on the Dwarka Expressway</strong>, providing excellent connectivity to major business hubs, entertainment centers, and transportation facilities.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Location Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Major Roads &amp; Highways</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Directly on <strong>Dwarka Expressway (NH-248BB)</strong> for seamless connectivity.</li>\r\n<li><strong>8-10 minutes</strong> drive to <strong>NH-48 (Delhi-Jaipur Highway)</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Easy access to <strong>Pataudi Road</strong> and <strong>Old Gurgaon Road</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Connectivity to Business Hubs &amp; Commercial Zones</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Cyber City &amp; Udyog Vihar (25-30 minutes drive)</strong> &ndash; Major employment hubs.</li>\r\n<li><strong>DLF Cyber Park &amp; Golf Course Road (30 minutes drive)</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Aerocity &amp; Diplomatic Enclave (20-25 minutes drive)</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Nearby Transport Facilities</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport (IGI) &ndash; 20-25 minutes</strong> via Dwarka Expressway.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Gurgaon Railway Station &ndash; 10-15 minutes drive</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proposed Metro Corridor on Dwarka Expressway</strong> &ndash; Ensuring future connectivity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Educational Institutions Nearby</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Delhi Public School (DPS), Gurgaon</strong> &ndash; 15 minutes.</li>\r\n<li><strong>GEMS International School</strong> &ndash; 10 minutes.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Euro International School</strong> &ndash; 5 minutes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Healthcare &amp; Medical Facilities</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Columbia Asia Hospital</strong> &ndash; 15 minutes.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Medanta Medicity &amp; Fortis Hospital</strong> &ndash; 25 minutes.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Artemis Hospital</strong> &ndash; 30 minutes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Shopping &amp; Entertainment Centers</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Ambience Mall &amp; Cyber Hub (25 minutes drive)</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>MGF Metropolitan Mall, Sector 29 (30 minutes drive)</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Retail &amp; Commercial Plazas nearby</strong> for daily needs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Upcoming Infrastructure Developments</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway Completion</strong> &ndash; Boosting property appreciation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Delhi-Mumbai Industrial Corridor (DMIC)</strong> impact.</li>\r\n<li><strong>AIIMS Jhajjar Extension nearby</strong> for world-class healthcare.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Interior Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Modular Kitchen:</strong> Each apartment comes with a fully loaded modular kitchen equipped with modern appliances, ensuring a seamless cooking experience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Air Conditioning:</strong> The residences are fitted with all-weather inverter VRV (Variable Refrigerant Volume) air conditioning systems, providing efficient cooling and heating solutions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> Bathrooms are fully fitted with premium sanitary fixtures from luxury brands, offering both functionality and elegance.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Flooring:</strong> The apartments feature imported marble flooring, adding a touch of sophistication and luxury to the living spaces.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Smart Home Features:</strong> Designed as smart homes, these residences incorporate AI features, allowing residents to control various aspects of their home environment with ease.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Additional Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Security:</strong> A comprehensive 5-tier security system ensures the safety and peace of mind of all residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Power Backup:</strong> The development provides 100% power backup for each apartment, ensuring uninterrupted power supply.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Fire Safety:</strong> An intelligent addressable fire detection and alarm system is in place to enhance safety measures.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Amenities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Clubhouse:</strong> A sprawling 1 lakh sq. ft. 7-star luxury clubhouse offers a range of recreational and wellness facilities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Swimming Pools:</strong> Residents can enjoy multiple swimming pools, including temperature-controlled indoor pools.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sports Facilities:</strong> The project boasts various sports amenities such as squash courts, basketball courts, and a football field.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Fitness Center:</strong> A state-of-the-art gymnasium equipped with modern fitness equipment caters to the health and wellness needs of residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Children\'s Play Area:</strong> Dedicated spaces are available for children\'s recreational activities, ensuring a family-friendly environment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Green Spaces:</strong> The development includes 7 acres of landscaped greenery, providing a serene and eco-friendly living environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Developer Background:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Indiabulls Real Estate Limited is one of India\'s largest real estate companies, with a diversified presence in residential development across various segments. The company has a significant portfolio in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region (MMR) and the National Capital Region (NCR).</p>\r\n<p><strong>Possession Timeline:</strong></p>\r\n<p>The project was launched in January 2025, with possession expected to commence in September 2029.</p>\r\n<h3>To book a unit in <strong>Indiabulls Estate &amp; Club</strong> located in Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these steps:</h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Contact A2P Realtech:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Website:</strong> Visit <a href=\"../\" target=\"_new\">A2P Realtech\'s official website</a> to learn more about their services and expertise in luxury condominiums in the Delhi and NCR region.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Use the contact details provided on their website to reach out directly. This may include phone numbers, email addresses, or a contact form.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Consultation:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Arrange a meeting or call with an A2P Realtech representative to discuss your interest in Indiabulls Estate &amp; Club. They can provide detailed information about available units, pricing, and the booking process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Site Visit:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>If possible, schedule a site visit to view the property firsthand. This will give you a better understanding of the project\'s layout, amenities, and overall environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Review Documentation:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Carefully review all project-related documents, including floor plans, payment schedules, and terms of agreement. Ensure you understand all aspects before proceeding.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Complete Booking Formalities:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Once you\'ve selected a unit, follow the booking procedures as guided by A2P Realtech. This typically involves filling out application forms and making the initial payment as per the agreed terms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Stay Informed:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Maintain regular communication with A2P Realtech for updates on construction progress, possession timelines, and any other relevant information.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>By collaborating with A2P Realtech, you can navigate the booking process for a unit in Indiabulls Estate &amp; Club with confidence, ensuring a smooth and informed experience.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '', 'Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'LCKP44EK', 19, 'Indiabulls Estate and Club Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Indiabulls, Estate and Club, Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, A2P Realtech', 'Indiabulls Estate and Club is a luxury residential project located in Sector 104, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. Spanning nearly 17 acres, with over 7 acres dedicated to landscaped greens, this gated community offers resort-style living', NULL, NULL),
(190, 'Penthouses available in Experion Windchants Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '090325070841Penthouses-available-in-Experion-Windchants-Sector-112 .jpg', '<p data-end=\"553\" data-start=\"351\"><strong data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"351\">1. Club Windchimes:</strong> A state-of-the-art clubhouse serving as a social hub, featuring a restaurant, spa, and library, offering a mix of relaxation and recreation.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"756\" data-start=\"555\"><strong data-end=\"595\" data-start=\"555\">2. Swimming Pool &amp; Open-Air Jacuzzi:</strong> A well-maintained swimming pool complemented by an open-air poolside jacuzzi, providing a refreshing escape for residents.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"942\" data-start=\"758\"><strong data-end=\"783\" data-start=\"758\">3. Sports Facilities:</strong> Multiple sports amenities, including tennis and basketball courts, and a cricket pitch, catering to fitness enthusiasts.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1107\" data-start=\"944\"><strong data-end=\"970\" data-start=\"944\">4. Wellness Amenities:</strong> Facilities such as a gymnasium, steam room, sauna, and spa services promote health and well-being.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1340\" data-start=\"1109\"><strong data-end=\"1135\" data-start=\"1109\">5. Landscaped Gardens:</strong> Beautifully landscaped gardens and open spaces provide a tranquil oasis amidst the bustling city, offering a serene environment for relaxation and outdoor activities.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1482\" data-start=\"1342\"><strong data-end=\"1370\" data-start=\"1342\">6. Children\'s Play Area:</strong> Dedicated play areas ensure a safe and engaging environment for children.</p>\r\n<p><strong data-end=\"1512\" data-start=\"1484\">7. Additional Amenities:</strong> The development also offers a reading room, cards room, exclusive mini-theater, outdoor party area, restaurant, elevated pathways at the 7th level, banquet halls with pre-function areas, a well-appointed gym, jogging tracks, a kids\' play area, a Zen garden, and a basketball court.</p>', 0, 1, 286, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>Penthouses available in Experion Windchants Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Experion Windchants, located in Sector 112 along the Dwarka Expressway in Gurgaon, is a premium residential development by Experion Developers. Spanning over 23 acres, this project offers a variety of luxury living options, including apartments, villas, and penthouses.</p>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #236fa1; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Inventory</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #236fa1; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Size</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>5BHK Apartment</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>6325 Sq.Ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>4BHK Apartment</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 239.4pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3731</strong> Sq.Ft.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Penthouses at Experion Windchants:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Configuration:</strong> The penthouses are available in expansive configurations, such as 5 BHK layouts, catering to those seeking spacious and luxurious living spaces.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Size:</strong> These penthouses offer generous living areas, with sizes reaching up to 6,325 sq. ft., providing ample space for comfort and entertainment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Features:</strong> Designed to epitomize luxury, the penthouses come with multiple bedrooms, bathrooms, balconies, and additional spaces like servant rooms, store rooms, and pooja rooms, depending on the specific unit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Amenities and Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Skywalk:</strong> One of the standout features of Experion Windchants is the skywalk located on the seventh level, which is recognized as one of Asia\'s largest residential skywalks.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Low-Density Living:</strong> The project is designed with a low-density layout, ensuring maximum space per resident and enhancing privacy and exclusivity.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Landscaping:</strong> The development boasts extensive and well-defined landscaping, crafted by Site Concepts, a Singapore-based company, offering residents serene green spaces.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Situated adjacent to the borders of Delhi and Gurgaon, the project offers seamless connectivity to both cities. It\'s located within 400 meters of the Dwarka Expressway, ensuring easy access to major destinations.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Nature:</strong> The development is adjacent to Delhi\'s Reserve Green Area, providing residents with a pollution-free environment and scenic views.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> The Indira Gandhi International Airport (Terminal 3) is approximately a 10-minute drive away, and the upcoming Sector 25 Metro Station in Dwarka is just 4 kilometers from the project.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>The penthouses at <strong>Experion Windchants</strong> in Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, are designed to offer residents a luxurious and holistic living experience. These exclusive residences come with a plethora of high-end amenities, ensuring comfort, recreation, and a vibrant community lifestyle. Key luxury amenities include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Club Windchimes:</strong> A state-of-the-art clubhouse featuring a restaurant, spa, library, multipurpose hall, and spaces for social gatherings.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Swimming Pool &amp; Open-Air Jacuzzi:</strong> A well-maintained swimming pool complemented by an open-air poolside jacuzzi for relaxation and leisure.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sports Facilities:</strong> Multiple sports amenities, including tennis and basketball courts, a cricket pitch, and a basketball court, catering to fitness enthusiasts.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Wellness Amenities:</strong> Facilities such as a gymnasium, steam room, sauna, and spa services promote health and well-being.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Landscaped Gardens:</strong> Beautifully landscaped gardens and open spaces provide a serene environment for relaxation and outdoor activities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Children\'s Play Area:</strong> Dedicated play areas ensure a safe and engaging environment for children.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Additional Amenities:</strong> The development also offers a reading room, cards room, exclusive mini-theater, outdoor party area, restaurant, elevated pathways at the 7th level, banquet halls with pre-function areas, a well-appointed gym, jogging tracks, a kids\' play area, a Zen garden, and a basketball court.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>ROI Benefit of penthouses at Experion Windchants in Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Investing in the penthouses at <strong>Experion Windchants</strong> in Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, presents a compelling opportunity for substantial returns. Several factors contribute to the attractiveness of this investment:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Strategic Location:</strong> Situated along the rapidly developing Dwarka Expressway, Experion Windchants benefits from enhanced connectivity between Gurgaon and Delhi. This strategic positioning has transformed the area into a sought-after real estate corridor, attracting both investors and end-users.</p>\r\n<p><strong>2. Infrastructure Development:</strong> Significant investments exceeding ?9,000 crore have been allocated to the construction of the Dwarka Expressway. This development is expected to reduce travel time between key destinations, further boosting the area\'s appeal and potentially increasing property values.</p>\r\n<p><strong>3. Appreciating Property Values:</strong> The Dwarka Expressway region has witnessed a notable 58% surge in property prices, reflecting robust demand and investor confidence. This upward trend indicates strong appreciation potential for properties like the penthouses at Experion Windchants.</p>\r\n<p><strong>4. Ready-to-Move-In Advantage:</strong> Experion Windchants offers ready-to-move-in penthouses, allowing investors to immediately capitalize on rental income opportunities. Gurgaon\'s thriving job market ensures a steady demand for upscale rental properties, enhancing the return on investment.</p>\r\n<p><strong>5. Luxury Amenities and Developer Reputation:</strong> The project boasts world-class amenities, including a clubhouse, swimming pools, sports facilities, and landscaped gardens, catering to the luxury segment. Developed by Experion, a reputable real estate developer backed by Experion Holdings Pte Ltd, Singapore, investors can be assured of quality and credibility.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>To book a penthouse at Experion Windchants in Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, through A2P Realtech, you can follow these steps</strong>:</h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Contact A2P Realtech Directly:</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>Contact A2P Realtech Sales Team through websites or contact page of websites</p>\r\n<ol start=\"2\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li>Reaching out directly will provide you with the most accurate and up-to-date information on availability, pricing, and the booking process.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Visit A2P Realtech\'s Official Website:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Explore detailed information about the project, including floor plans, amenities, and virtual tours. You can also fill out an enquiry form to express your interest.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Site Visit:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>It\'s advisable to visit the property to experience the penthouse firsthand. You can schedule a site visit through A2P Realtech by contacting their sales team.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Prepare Necessary Documentation:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Be ready with essential documents such as identification proof, address proof, and financial statements to facilitate a smooth booking process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Understand Payment Plans:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Discuss available payment plans, financing options, and any applicable discounts with the A2P Realtech representative to choose the plan that best suits your financial strategy.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>By following these steps, you can efficiently navigate the booking process for a penthouse at Experion Windchants through A2P Realtech and secure a luxurious living space in one of Gurgaon\'s premier residential developments.</p>', '', '', '', '23 acres', 'Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'B5N88C6V', 19, 'Penthouses available in Experion Windchants Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Penthouses, Experion Windchants, Sector 112, A2P Realtech,', 'Experion Windchants, located in Sector 112 along the Dwarka Expressway in Gurgaon, is a premium residential development by Experion Developers. Spanning over 23 acres, this project offers a variety of luxury living options, including apartments, villas, and penthouses. ', NULL, NULL);
