(192, 'Experion Windchants Nova Sec 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '130325062138Experion-Windchants-Nova-Sector-112-Dwarka-Expressway-A2P-Realtech.jpg', '<h3 data-end=\"238\" data-start=\"214\">1. <strong data-end=\"238\" data-start=\"221\">Swimming Pool</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"349\" data-start=\"242\">\r\n<li data-end=\"349\" data-start=\"242\">A <strong data-end=\"273\" data-start=\"246\">luxurious swimming pool</strong> for residents to relax, exercise, or simply unwind in a serene environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"371\" data-start=\"351\">2. <strong data-end=\"371\" data-start=\"358\">Gymnasium</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"509\" data-start=\"375\">\r\n<li data-end=\"509\" data-start=\"375\">A state-of-the-art <strong data-end=\"409\" data-start=\"396\">gymnasium</strong> equipped with the latest fitness equipment to cater to residents who prioritize health and fitness.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"545\" data-start=\"511\">3. <strong data-end=\"545\" data-start=\"518\">Spa and Wellness Center</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"549\">\r\n<li data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"549\">A dedicated <strong data-end=\"590\" data-start=\"563\">spa and wellness center</strong> offering relaxation and rejuvenation services, providing residents with a tranquil space to unwind.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"720\" data-start=\"692\">4. <strong data-end=\"720\" data-start=\"699\">Indoor Games Room</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"864\" data-start=\"724\">\r\n<li data-end=\"864\" data-start=\"724\">A well-equipped <strong data-end=\"763\" data-start=\"742\">indoor games room</strong> featuring various recreational activities, such as table tennis, pool, and other games for all ages.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"892\" data-start=\"866\">5. <strong data-end=\"892\" data-start=\"873\">Theater/AV Room</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"896\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"896\">An exclusive <strong data-end=\"930\" data-start=\"911\">theater/AV room</strong> for private screenings, entertainment, or family movie nights, offering a premium cinematic experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1066\" data-start=\"1036\">6. <strong data-end=\"1066\" data-start=\"1043\">Double-Height Lobby</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1070\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1070\">A <strong data-end=\"1103\" data-start=\"1074\">grand double-height lobby</strong> at the entrance of each tower, creating a sophisticated and welcoming atmosphere for residents and guests.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1243\" data-start=\"1212\">7. <strong data-end=\"1243\" data-start=\"1219\">Grand Reception Desk</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1376\" data-start=\"1247\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1376\" data-start=\"1247\">A <strong data-end=\"1275\" data-start=\"1251\">grand reception desk</strong> in each tower with professional concierge services to assist residents and enhance their experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1378\">8. <strong data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1385\">24/7 Security</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1530\" data-start=\"1406\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1530\" data-start=\"1406\">Round-the-clock <strong data-end=\"1445\" data-start=\"1424\">security services</strong> with advanced surveillance systems, ensuring safety and peace of mind for residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1563\" data-start=\"1532\">9. <strong data-end=\"1563\" data-start=\"1539\">High-Speed Elevators</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1699\" data-start=\"1567\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1699\" data-start=\"1567\"><strong data-end=\"1593\" data-start=\"1569\">High-speed elevators</strong> for quick and smooth access to all floors of the towers, contributing to a comfortable living experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1722\" data-start=\"1701\">10. <strong data-end=\"1722\" data-start=\"1709\">Clubhouse</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1844\" data-start=\"1726\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1844\" data-start=\"1726\">A fully equipped <strong data-end=\"1758\" data-start=\"1745\">clubhouse</strong> that serves as a social hub, offering spaces for gatherings, events, and socializing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1846\">11. <strong data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1854\">Children&rsquo;s Play Area</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2015\" data-start=\"1882\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2015\" data-start=\"1882\">A dedicated and safe <strong data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1905\">children&rsquo;s play area</strong> where kids can have fun and engage in outdoor activities within a secure environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2047\" data-start=\"2017\">12. <strong data-end=\"2047\" data-start=\"2025\">Landscaped Gardens</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2197\" data-start=\"2051\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2197\" data-start=\"2051\"><strong data-end=\"2085\" data-start=\"2053\">Beautiful landscaped gardens</strong> and green spaces within the complex, offering a peaceful and rejuvenating environment for relaxation and walks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2228\" data-start=\"2199\">13. <strong data-end=\"2228\" data-start=\"2207\">Sports Facilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2362\" data-start=\"2232\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2362\" data-start=\"2232\"><strong data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2234\">Dedicated sports facilities</strong>, including outdoor sports courts, catering to residents interested in active outdoor recreation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2397\" data-start=\"2364\">14. <strong data-end=\"2397\" data-start=\"2372\">Smart Home Automation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2549\" data-start=\"2401\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2549\" data-start=\"2401\"><strong data-end=\"2422\" data-start=\"2403\">Home automation</strong> features that enable smart control of lighting, security systems, and appliances, enhancing convenience and energy efficiency.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2590\" data-start=\"2551\">15. <strong data-end=\"2590\" data-start=\"2559\">24/7 Water and Power Supply</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2710\" data-start=\"2594\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2710\" data-start=\"2594\"><strong data-end=\"2636\" data-start=\"2596\">Reliable 24/7 water and power supply</strong> with <strong data-end=\"2663\" data-start=\"2642\">backup generators</strong> to ensure uninterrupted services at all times.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2737\" data-start=\"2712\">16. <strong data-end=\"2737\" data-start=\"2720\">Parking Space</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2865\" data-start=\"2741\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2865\" data-start=\"2741\"><strong data-end=\"2766\" data-start=\"2743\">Ample parking space</strong> with dedicated spots for residents and guests, ensuring convenience and security for all vehicles.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2905\" data-start=\"2867\">17. <strong data-end=\"2905\" data-start=\"2875\">Walking and Jogging Tracks</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3037\" data-start=\"2909\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3037\" data-start=\"2909\">Well-maintained <strong data-end=\"2957\" data-start=\"2927\">walking and jogging tracks</strong> set within the project\'s landscape, encouraging a healthy and active lifestyle.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3074\" data-start=\"3039\">18. <strong data-end=\"3074\" data-start=\"3047\">Cafes and Retail Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3209\" data-start=\"3078\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3209\" data-start=\"3078\">On-premise <strong data-end=\"3118\" data-start=\"3091\">cafes and retail spaces</strong>, making daily errands and socializing easier without leaving the comfort of the community.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3239\" data-start=\"3211\">19. <strong data-end=\"3239\" data-start=\"3219\">Community Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3385\" data-start=\"3243\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3385\" data-start=\"3243\">Spacious <strong data-end=\"3273\" data-start=\"3254\">community halls</strong> for events, parties, and social gatherings, allowing residents to host and participate in community activities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3417\" data-start=\"3387\">20. <strong data-end=\"3417\" data-start=\"3395\">Pet-Friendly Areas</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"3562\" data-start=\"3421\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3562\" data-start=\"3421\"><strong data-end=\"3445\" data-start=\"3423\">Pet-friendly zones</strong> where residents can take their pets for walks and outdoor play, ensuring a quality lifestyle for all family members.</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 306, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<h2><strong>Experion Windchants Nova Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Experion Windchants Nova is an upcoming luxury residential project located in Sector 112, Gurgaon, adjacent to the Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Experion Developers, it offers spacious 4.5 BHK apartments with sizes starting from 4,350 sq. ft.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 56.1224%;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #c2e0f4; border-style: solid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.7815%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Unit Type</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 34.2715%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Unit Size</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.947%; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Unit</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.7815%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>4.5 BHK</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 34.2715%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>4350 SQ.FT</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.947%; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;2 Unit Each Floor</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Key Features of Experion Windchants Nova Sec 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong>1. Location</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity</strong>: Located on the Dwarka Expressway, the project offers easy access to Delhi, Gurgaon, and the <strong>IGI Airport</strong>, just about 30 minutes away.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: The expressway ensures seamless connectivity to other parts of the <strong>NCR (National Capital Region)</strong>, making it highly accessible.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Design &amp; Layout</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Project Size</strong>: The development spans over <strong>25 acres</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Towers</strong>: It consists of <strong>8 high-rise towers</strong>, each with <strong>G+43 floors</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Luxury Apartments</strong>: Spacious <strong>4.5 BHK apartments</strong> with sizes starting from <strong>4,350 sq. ft.</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Modern Architecture</strong>: Apartments are designed for luxury with high-end finishes and contemporary design.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Amenities</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Leisure &amp; Fitness</strong>: Includes a <strong>swimming pool</strong>, <strong>gymnasium</strong>, <strong>spa</strong>, and an <strong>indoor games room</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Entertainment</strong>: The project offers an <strong>AV room/theater</strong> for entertainment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Luxury Touch</strong>: A <strong>double-height lobby</strong> and <strong>grand reception desk</strong> for individual towers enhance the luxurious feel.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Security</strong>: Top-notch security systems for a safe and secure living environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Environmental Design</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Green Spaces</strong>: The project is designed with large green areas, offering a peaceful and serene environment.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sustainability</strong>: Environment-friendly design considerations ensure a balance with nature.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Modern Infrastructure</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Smart Homes</strong>: Equipped with the latest in <strong>home automation</strong>, making living convenient and efficient.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Elevators</strong>: High-speed elevators and modern infrastructure.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Water &amp; Power Supply</strong>: Reliable 24/7 power backup and water supply.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Excellent Investment Opportunity</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Growing Area</strong>: Located in a fast-developing area, this property is an excellent long-term investment with the potential for high returns due to its strategic location along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Proximity to Key Areas</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Close to major commercial hubs, shopping malls, schools, hospitals, and recreational areas, making it an ideal location for families.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Premium Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Marble Flooring</strong>: High-quality marble and flooring materials in all apartments.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Italian Kitchens</strong>: Modular and spacious kitchens designed with Italian finishes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Experion Nova is designed to provide a luxurious and comfortable living experience with state-of-the-art amenities and great connectivity.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Investment Advantage of Experion Nova Sec 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Investing in <strong data-end=\"30\" data-start=\"13\">Experion Nova</strong> in <strong data-end=\"76\" data-start=\"34\">Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> offers several key advantages:</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"134\" data-start=\"109\">1. <strong data-end=\"134\" data-start=\"116\">Prime Location</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"537\" data-start=\"138\">\r\n<li data-end=\"347\" data-start=\"138\"><strong data-end=\"162\" data-start=\"140\">Strategic Location</strong>: Located along the <strong data-end=\"203\" data-start=\"182\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>, one of the most sought-after corridors in Gurgaon, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to <strong data-end=\"310\" data-start=\"301\">Delhi</strong>, <strong data-end=\"323\" data-start=\"312\">Gurgaon</strong>, and other NCR regions.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"537\" data-start=\"351\"><strong data-end=\"381\" data-start=\"353\">Proximity to IGI Airport</strong>: Just a 30-minute drive to the <strong data-end=\"452\" data-start=\"413\">Indira Gandhi International Airport</strong>, enhancing its appeal for frequent travelers and businesses with global connections.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"539\">2. <strong data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"546\">Excellent Connectivity</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"902\" data-start=\"576\">\r\n<li data-end=\"773\" data-start=\"576\">The <strong data-end=\"603\" data-start=\"582\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> enhances accessibility to important areas such as <strong data-end=\"667\" data-start=\"654\">Cyber Hub</strong>, <strong data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"669\">MG Road</strong>, and major commercial zones, making it highly desirable for both professionals and families.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"902\" data-start=\"777\">Future metro connectivity planned along the expressway is expected to further enhance the value of properties in this area.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"944\" data-start=\"904\">3. <strong data-end=\"944\" data-start=\"911\">Rapid Urbanization and Growth</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1444\" data-start=\"948\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1105\" data-start=\"948\"><strong data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"950\">Developing Infrastructure</strong>: Sector 112 and the surrounding areas are undergoing rapid development with modern infrastructure, increasing property value.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1297\" data-start=\"1109\"><strong data-end=\"1138\" data-start=\"1111\">Proximity to Major Hubs</strong>: The project is close to prominent IT parks, business centers, and retail zones, which further boosts its demand among corporate professionals and businesses.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1444\" data-start=\"1301\">The <strong data-end=\"1328\" data-start=\"1307\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> is expected to become a significant business and residential hub, raising long-term capital appreciation potential.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1474\" data-start=\"1446\">4. <strong data-end=\"1474\" data-start=\"1453\">Reputed Developer</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1750\" data-start=\"1478\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1627\" data-start=\"1478\"><strong data-end=\"1503\" data-start=\"1480\">Experion Developers</strong> is a well-known name in the real estate industry, ensuring high-quality construction, timely delivery, and value for money.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1750\" data-start=\"1631\">Their projects are known for luxury and contemporary design, making them attractive to investors and end-users alike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1790\" data-start=\"1752\">5. <strong data-end=\"1790\" data-start=\"1759\">High Rental Yield Potential</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2109\" data-start=\"1794\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1946\" data-start=\"1794\">Given the location&rsquo;s proximity to commercial zones and the growing demand for luxury homes, the property offers potential for <strong data-end=\"1945\" data-start=\"1922\">high rental returns</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2109\" data-start=\"1950\">The apartments\' size (starting from 4,350 sq. ft.) caters to high-net-worth individuals (HNWIs) and corporate professionals, leading to better rental yields.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2154\" data-start=\"2111\">6. <strong data-end=\"2154\" data-start=\"2118\">Emerging Premium Real Estate Hub</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2473\" data-start=\"2158\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2359\" data-start=\"2158\">As more high-end residential projects, offices, and commercial spaces develop along the Dwarka Expressway, the area will continue to evolve into a premium real estate hub, pushing up property values.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2473\" data-start=\"2363\">Investments in such locations tend to appreciate faster due to growing demand and limited land availability.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2513\" data-start=\"2475\">7. <strong data-end=\"2513\" data-start=\"2482\">Infrastructure Developments</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2888\" data-start=\"2517\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2708\" data-start=\"2517\"><strong data-end=\"2541\" data-start=\"2519\">Metro Connectivity</strong>: The planned metro line along the Dwarka Expressway is expected to significantly increase the area\'s real estate demand, providing easier access to Gurgaon and Delhi.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2888\" data-start=\"2712\"><strong data-end=\"2739\" data-start=\"2714\">Social Infrastructure</strong>: Nearby malls, schools, hospitals, and leisure options are vital for long-term growth, as they cater to both the working professionals and families.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2939\" data-start=\"2890\">8. <strong data-end=\"2939\" data-start=\"2897\">Luxurious Living at Competitive Prices</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3319\" data-start=\"2943\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3129\" data-start=\"2943\"><strong data-end=\"2968\" data-start=\"2945\">Spacious Apartments</strong>: With larger-than-usual 4.5 BHK layouts (starting from 4,350 sq. ft.), the project offers superior luxury, making it appealing to affluent buyers and investors.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3319\" data-start=\"3133\"><strong data-end=\"3158\" data-start=\"3135\">Competitive Pricing</strong>: Given its premium features and location, Experion Nova is priced competitively compared to other luxury projects in Gurgaon, offering a good value proposition.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3359\" data-start=\"3321\">9. <strong data-end=\"3359\" data-start=\"3328\">Future Capital Appreciation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3694\" data-start=\"3363\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3542\" data-start=\"3363\">As the area continues to develop and more infrastructure projects are completed (such as the Dwarka Expressway\'s final phases), the property will see continuous growth in value.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3694\" data-start=\"3546\">With fewer projects offering such high-end offerings in this area, the supply-demand imbalance will ensure steady appreciation in property prices.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3731\" data-start=\"3696\">10. <strong data-end=\"3731\" data-start=\"3704\">Comprehensive Amenities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"4104\" data-start=\"3735\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3946\" data-start=\"3735\">The project offers world-class amenities like a <strong data-end=\"3802\" data-start=\"3785\">swimming pool</strong>, <strong data-end=\"3817\" data-start=\"3804\">gymnasium</strong>, <strong data-end=\"3826\" data-start=\"3819\">spa</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"3843\" data-start=\"3832\">AV room</strong>, which make it highly attractive to tenants, ensuring long-term rental income potential for investors.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4104\" data-start=\"3950\">These luxury amenities attract HNWIs looking for quality living spaces in prime locations, increasing demand and the potential for capital appreciation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"4152\" data-start=\"4106\">11. <strong data-end=\"4152\" data-start=\"4114\">Sustainability and Modern Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"4438\" data-start=\"4156\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4322\" data-start=\"4156\">The development&rsquo;s eco-friendly design and modern infrastructure make it a preferred choice for future-conscious investors, who value energy-efficient living spaces.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4438\" data-start=\"4326\"><strong data-end=\"4342\" data-start=\"4328\">Smart home</strong> features and top-tier finishes cater to a growing demand for high-tech, low-maintenance living.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><strong>Luxury Amenities in Experion Nova in Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<h3>1. <strong data-end=\"238\" data-start=\"221\">Swimming Pool</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"349\" data-start=\"242\">\r\n<li data-end=\"349\" data-start=\"242\">A <strong data-end=\"273\" data-start=\"246\">luxurious swimming pool</strong> for residents to relax, exercise, or simply unwind in a serene environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"371\" data-start=\"351\">2. <strong data-end=\"371\" data-start=\"358\">Gymnasium</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"509\" data-start=\"375\">\r\n<li data-end=\"509\" data-start=\"375\">A state-of-the-art <strong data-end=\"409\" data-start=\"396\">gymnasium</strong> equipped with the latest fitness equipment to cater to residents who prioritize health and fitness.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"545\" data-start=\"511\">3. <strong data-end=\"545\" data-start=\"518\">Spa and Wellness Center</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"549\">\r\n<li data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"549\">A dedicated <strong data-end=\"590\" data-start=\"563\">spa and wellness center</strong> offering relaxation and rejuvenation services, providing residents with a tranquil space to unwind.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"720\" data-start=\"692\">4. <strong data-end=\"720\" data-start=\"699\">Indoor Games Room</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"864\" data-start=\"724\">\r\n<li data-end=\"864\" data-start=\"724\">A well-equipped <strong data-end=\"763\" data-start=\"742\">indoor games room</strong> featuring various recreational activities, such as table tennis, pool, and other games for all ages.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"892\" data-start=\"866\">5. <strong data-end=\"892\" data-start=\"873\">Theater/AV Room</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"896\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"896\">An exclusive <strong data-end=\"930\" data-start=\"911\">theater/AV room</strong> for private screenings, entertainment, or family movie nights, offering a premium cinematic experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1066\" data-start=\"1036\">6. <strong data-end=\"1066\" data-start=\"1043\">Double-Height Lobby</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1070\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1070\">A <strong data-end=\"1103\" data-start=\"1074\">grand double-height lobby</strong> at the entrance of each tower, creating a sophisticated and welcoming atmosphere for residents and guests.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1243\" data-start=\"1212\">7. <strong data-end=\"1243\" data-start=\"1219\">Grand Reception Desk</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1376\" data-start=\"1247\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1376\" data-start=\"1247\">A <strong data-end=\"1275\" data-start=\"1251\">grand reception desk</strong> in each tower with professional concierge services to assist residents and enhance their experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1378\">8. <strong data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1385\">24/7 Security</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1530\" data-start=\"1406\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1530\" data-start=\"1406\">Round-the-clock <strong data-end=\"1445\" data-start=\"1424\">security services</strong> with advanced surveillance systems, ensuring safety and peace of mind for residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1563\" data-start=\"1532\">9. <strong data-end=\"1563\" data-start=\"1539\">High-Speed Elevators</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1699\" data-start=\"1567\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1699\" data-start=\"1567\"><strong data-end=\"1593\" data-start=\"1569\">High-speed elevators</strong> for quick and smooth access to all floors of the towers, contributing to a comfortable living experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1722\" data-start=\"1701\">10. <strong data-end=\"1722\" data-start=\"1709\">Clubhouse</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1844\" data-start=\"1726\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1844\" data-start=\"1726\">A fully equipped <strong data-end=\"1758\" data-start=\"1745\">clubhouse</strong> that serves as a social hub, offering spaces for gatherings, events, and socializing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1846\">11. <strong data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1854\">Children&rsquo;s Play Area</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2015\" data-start=\"1882\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2015\" data-start=\"1882\">A dedicated and safe <strong data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1905\">children&rsquo;s play area</strong> where kids can have fun and engage in outdoor activities within a secure environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2047\" data-start=\"2017\">12. <strong data-end=\"2047\" data-start=\"2025\">Landscaped Gardens</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2197\" data-start=\"2051\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2197\" data-start=\"2051\"><strong data-end=\"2085\" data-start=\"2053\">Beautiful landscaped gardens</strong> and green spaces within the complex, offering a peaceful and rejuvenating environment for relaxation and walks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2228\" data-start=\"2199\">13. <strong data-end=\"2228\" data-start=\"2207\">Sports Facilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2362\" data-start=\"2232\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2362\" data-start=\"2232\"><strong data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2234\">Dedicated sports facilities</strong>, including outdoor sports courts, catering to residents interested in active outdoor recreation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2397\" data-start=\"2364\">14. <strong data-end=\"2397\" data-start=\"2372\">Smart Home Automation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2549\" data-start=\"2401\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2549\" data-start=\"2401\"><strong data-end=\"2422\" data-start=\"2403\">Home automation</strong> features that enable smart control of lighting, security systems, and appliances, enhancing convenience and energy efficiency.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2590\" data-start=\"2551\">15. <strong data-end=\"2590\" data-start=\"2559\">24/7 Water and Power Supply</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2710\" data-start=\"2594\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2710\" data-start=\"2594\"><strong data-end=\"2636\" data-start=\"2596\">Reliable 24/7 water and power supply</strong> with <strong data-end=\"2663\" data-start=\"2642\">backup generators</strong> to ensure uninterrupted services at all times.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2737\" data-start=\"2712\">16. <strong data-end=\"2737\" data-start=\"2720\">Parking Space</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2865\" data-start=\"2741\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2865\" data-start=\"2741\"><strong data-end=\"2766\" data-start=\"2743\">Ample parking space</strong> with dedicated spots for residents and guests, ensuring convenience and security for all vehicles.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2905\" data-start=\"2867\">17. <strong data-end=\"2905\" data-start=\"2875\">Walking and Jogging Tracks</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3037\" data-start=\"2909\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3037\" data-start=\"2909\">Well-maintained <strong data-end=\"2957\" data-start=\"2927\">walking and jogging tracks</strong> set within the project\'s landscape, encouraging a healthy and active lifestyle.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3074\" data-start=\"3039\">18. <strong data-end=\"3074\" data-start=\"3047\">Cafes and Retail Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3209\" data-start=\"3078\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3209\" data-start=\"3078\">On-premise <strong data-end=\"3118\" data-start=\"3091\">cafes and retail spaces</strong>, making daily errands and socializing easier without leaving the comfort of the community.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3239\" data-start=\"3211\">19. <strong data-end=\"3239\" data-start=\"3219\">Community Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3385\" data-start=\"3243\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3385\" data-start=\"3243\">Spacious <strong data-end=\"3273\" data-start=\"3254\">community halls</strong> for events, parties, and social gatherings, allowing residents to host and participate in community activities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3417\" data-start=\"3387\">20. <strong data-end=\"3417\" data-start=\"3395\">Pet-Friendly Areas</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3562\" data-start=\"3421\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3562\" data-start=\"3421\"><strong data-end=\"3445\" data-start=\"3423\">Pet-friendly zones</strong> where residents can take their pets for walks and outdoor play, ensuring a quality lifestyle for all family members.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Steps to book unit in Experion Nova in Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon through A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>To book a unit in <strong data-end=\"35\" data-start=\"18\">Experion Nova</strong> in <strong data-end=\"81\" data-start=\"39\">Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> through <strong data-end=\"106\" data-start=\"90\">A2P Realtech</strong>, you can follow these steps:</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"168\" data-start=\"137\">1. <strong data-end=\"168\" data-start=\"144\">Contact A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"562\" data-start=\"172\">\r\n<li data-end=\"391\" data-start=\"172\"><strong data-end=\"203\" data-start=\"174\">Reach Out to A2P Realtech</strong>: First, contact A2P Realtech, either through their website or by calling their customer service number. You can also email them for more information regarding available units and pricing.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"562\" data-start=\"395\"><strong data-end=\"420\" data-start=\"397\">Request Information</strong>: Provide details of your preferences (e.g., apartment size, budget, preferred floor) so that they can assist you in selecting the right unit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"602\" data-start=\"564\">2. <strong data-end=\"602\" data-start=\"571\">Site Visit and Consultation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"606\">\r\n<li data-end=\"811\" data-start=\"606\"><strong data-end=\"633\" data-start=\"608\">Schedule a Site Visit</strong>: A2P Realtech will arrange a visit to the <strong data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"676\">Experion Nova</strong> project. During the visit, you can explore the property, check out the available units, and experience the amenities.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"815\"><strong data-end=\"841\" data-start=\"817\">Consult with Experts</strong>: Discuss any queries you have regarding the project, its amenities, payment plans, and available units. Their team will guide you through the entire process.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1028\" data-start=\"1001\">3. <strong data-end=\"1028\" data-start=\"1008\">Select Your Unit</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1314\" data-start=\"1032\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1203\" data-start=\"1032\"><strong data-end=\"1054\" data-start=\"1034\">Choose Your Unit</strong>: Once you&rsquo;ve reviewed the available units, choose the one that meets your preferences in terms of size, floor plan, and location within the complex.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1314\" data-start=\"1207\"><strong data-end=\"1243\" data-start=\"1209\">Unit Availability Confirmation</strong>: A2P Realtech will confirm the availability of the unit you&rsquo;ve chosen.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1347\" data-start=\"1316\">4. <strong data-end=\"1347\" data-start=\"1323\">Review Payment Plans</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1351\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1553\" data-start=\"1351\"><strong data-end=\"1380\" data-start=\"1353\">Discuss Payment Options</strong>: A2P Realtech will share the available <strong data-end=\"1437\" data-start=\"1420\">payment plans</strong> with you, which may include <strong data-end=\"1495\" data-start=\"1466\">construction-linked plans</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1519\" data-start=\"1497\">down payment plans</strong>, or <strong data-end=\"1552\" data-start=\"1524\">flexible payment options</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1557\"><strong data-end=\"1586\" data-start=\"1559\">Choose the Payment Plan</strong>: Select the payment plan that works best for your financial situation. The team will guide you through the terms and conditions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1753\" data-start=\"1717\">5. <strong data-end=\"1753\" data-start=\"1724\">Documentation and Booking</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2343\" data-start=\"1757\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1943\" data-start=\"1757\"><strong data-end=\"1788\" data-start=\"1759\">Submit Required Documents</strong>: You will need to provide personal identification documents, such as your <strong data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1863\">Aadhar card</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1892\" data-start=\"1880\">PAN card</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1919\" data-start=\"1894\">passport-sized photos</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"1942\" data-start=\"1925\">address proof</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2206\" data-start=\"1947\"><strong data-end=\"1979\" data-start=\"1949\">Sign the Booking Agreement</strong>: Once all the documents are in place, you will need to sign a <strong data-end=\"2063\" data-start=\"2042\">booking agreement</strong>. This agreement will outline the terms and conditions of your purchase, including payment milestones, possession dates, and other key details.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2343\" data-start=\"2210\"><strong data-end=\"2240\" data-start=\"2212\">Make the Initial Payment</strong>: Make the required <strong data-end=\"2287\" data-start=\"2260\">initial booking payment</strong> as per the agreed payment plan to confirm your booking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2382\" data-start=\"2345\">6. <strong data-end=\"2382\" data-start=\"2352\">Confirmation and Allotment</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"2817\" data-start=\"2386\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2661\" data-start=\"2386\"><strong data-end=\"2406\" data-start=\"2388\">Unit Allotment</strong>: After the payment is processed, A2P Realtech will <strong data-end=\"2482\" data-start=\"2458\">confirm your booking</strong> and provide the <strong data-end=\"2517\" data-start=\"2499\">unit allotment</strong>. You will also receive an <strong data-end=\"2564\" data-start=\"2544\">allotment letter</strong> with details of your unit, including the floor number, size, and any other relevant information.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2817\" data-start=\"2665\"><strong data-end=\"2699\" data-start=\"2667\">Receive Registration Details</strong>: A2P Realtech will guide you through the process of <strong data-end=\"2777\" data-start=\"2752\">property registration</strong> once the possession of the unit is due.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2851\" data-start=\"2819\">7. <strong data-end=\"2851\" data-start=\"2826\">Follow-up and Updates</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3167\" data-start=\"2855\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3025\" data-start=\"2855\"><strong data-end=\"2875\" data-start=\"2857\">Track Progress</strong>: A2P Realtech will keep you updated about the <strong data-end=\"2947\" data-start=\"2922\">construction progress</strong> and provide any necessary updates related to possession or project timelines.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3167\" data-start=\"3029\"><strong data-end=\"3048\" data-start=\"3031\">Final Payment</strong>: Make further payments as per the payment plan. A2P Realtech will inform you about the due dates for each installment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3190\" data-start=\"3169\">8. <strong data-end=\"3190\" data-start=\"3176\">Possession</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3407\" data-start=\"3194\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3407\" data-start=\"3194\"><strong data-end=\"3218\" data-start=\"3196\">Possession of Unit</strong>: Once the project is completed and all payments are cleared, you will receive possession of your unit. A2P Realtech will assist you with all formalities related to possession and handover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3442\" data-start=\"3409\">9. <strong data-end=\"3442\" data-start=\"3416\">Post-Purchase Services</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"3632\" data-start=\"3446\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3632\" data-start=\"3446\"><strong data-end=\"3477\" data-start=\"3448\">Assistance with Moving In</strong>: A2P Realtech can also assist with the <strong data-end=\"3538\" data-start=\"3517\">moving-in process</strong> and ensure that everything is in order when you move into your new unit at <strong data-end=\"3631\" data-start=\"3614\">Experion Nova</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"3841\" data-start=\"3639\">By following these steps with <strong data-end=\"3685\" data-start=\"3669\">A2P Realtech</strong>, you can smoothly book a unit in <strong data-end=\"3736\" data-start=\"3719\">Experion Nova</strong> and begin your journey toward owning a luxury home in one of the most sought-after locations in Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '4350', 'Sector 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', '0Q8CR2H0', 19, 'Experion Windchants Nova Sec 112 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Experion Nova, Windchants, Sector 112, Dwarka Expressway, Luxury Apartment, A2P Realtech', 'Experion Windchants Nova is an upcoming luxury residential project located in Sector 112, Gurgaon, adjacent to the Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Experion Developers, it offers spacious 4.5 BHK apartments with sizes starting from 4,350 sq. ft.', NULL, NULL);
