8. 24/7 Security and Surveillance</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The development is equipped with <strong>24/7 security systems</strong> and surveillance, including CCTV cameras and professional security personnel, ensuring the safety and peace of mind of the residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. High-Speed Elevators</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The building features <strong>high-speed elevators</strong>, ensuring quick and efficient movement between floors, especially for larger families or during peak times.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>10. Power Backup</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>24/7 power backup</strong> ensures that residents face no disruption in their daily lives, with electricity supply maintained during power outages.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>11. Ample Parking Space</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The project provides <strong>ample parking space</strong> for residents and guests, ensuring convenience and hassle-free parking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>12. Modern Interiors and Premium Finishes</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The apartments are designed with <strong>high-quality materials</strong>, offering premium finishes, spacious layouts, and modern interiors to elevate the living experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>13. Spa and Wellness Center</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Some units may include a <strong>spa and wellness center</strong> offering services such as massages, beauty treatments, and relaxation therapies to help residents de-stress and rejuvenate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>14. Multipurpose Hall</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The development includes a <strong>multipurpose hall</strong> that can be used for various events, parties, or gatherings, providing a perfect venue for socializing and hosting celebrations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>15. Sustainability Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The project emphasizes <strong>sustainability</strong>, with eco-friendly features such as rainwater harvesting, waste management systems, and energy-efficient lighting, promoting a greener lifestyle.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These luxurious amenities are designed to provide a high standard of living, combining convenience, comfort, and indulgence in a prime location like Sector 46, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon.</p>', 0, 1, 309, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46 is an upcoming ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 46, Gurugram, along the Dwarka Expressway. Developed by the esteemed Shapoorji Pallonji Group, the project spans approximately 4.5 acres and offers spacious 3 and 4 BHK apartments with sizes ranging from 2,800 to 3,600 sq. ft.</p>\r\n<p>Step into a realm of elegance and comfort with Shapoorji Pallonji\'s latest offering: stunning 3 &amp; 4 BHK apartments in Sector 46, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon. This exclusive development is designed for those who crave the finer things in life, seamlessly blending modern luxury with timeless sophistication. Nestled in a prime location, these residences provide not just a home, but a lifestyle of convenience and grandeur, with easy access to the bustling heart of Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<p>Imagine waking up each day in a spacious, thoughtfully crafted space that reflects your taste and aspirations. Whether you\'re hosting dinner parties or enjoying a quiet evening with your family, every inch of these apartments radiates style and comfort. With premium amenities and lush landscapes surrounding you, Shapoorji Pallonji redefines what it means to live in luxury. Discover how you can elevate your living experiences in this vibrant community&mdash;your dream home awaits!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; width: 72.0764%; height: 166.172px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.3906px; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #3598db;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Unit Type</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Size</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>3 BHK</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>2800 Sq. Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>4 BHK</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 0%; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>3600 Sq. Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Location advantage of Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46, located along the Dwarka Expressway in Gurgaon, offers several location advantages that make it an attractive choice for residents. Here are some key points:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Excellent Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>: The development is strategically located along the Dwarka Expressway, ensuring seamless connectivity to key areas in Delhi and Gurgaon.</li>\r\n<li><strong>IGI Airport</strong>: The Indira Gandhi International Airport is just a short drive away (approximately 20-25 minutes), making it highly convenient for frequent travelers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Huda City Centre Metro Station</strong>: Located nearby, this metro station offers easy access to Delhi and other parts of Gurgaon.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Proximity to Key Business Hubs</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Cyber City</strong>: One of the major business districts of Gurgaon, Cyber City, is just a short drive away, making it an ideal location for professionals working in this area.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Golf Course Road &amp; NH-8</strong>: The project enjoys easy access to these important roads, connecting it to various business and commercial centers in Gurgaon.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Educational Institutions</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The area is home to reputed schools and universities, making it convenient for families with children. Notable institutions nearby include <strong>Shiv Nadar School</strong>, <strong>DPS International School</strong>, and <strong>Amity University</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Healthcare Facilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Medanta &ndash; The Medicity</strong>, one of the leading hospitals in India, is just a short distance away from the project, ensuring easy access to world-class healthcare.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Shopping &amp; Entertainment</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Malls &amp; Shopping Centers</strong>: The development is in close proximity to top shopping malls such as <strong>Sahara Mall</strong>, <strong>MGF Metropolitan Mall</strong>, and <strong>Ambience Mall</strong>, offering retail, dining, and entertainment options.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Recreation</strong>: Residents can enjoy nearby recreational options, such as parks, cafes, and restaurants.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Green Surroundings</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The area is surrounded by green spaces, offering a peaceful and serene living environment, making it an ideal escape from the hustle and bustle of the city.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These location advantages make Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46 Dwarka Expressway a highly sought-after residential destination in Gurgaon, offering a blend of connectivity, convenience, and luxury.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Luxury Amenities Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, offers a wide range of <strong>luxury amenities</strong> to ensure a comfortable and premium living experience for its residents. Some of the standout amenities include:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Clubhouse</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>A <strong>state-of-the-art clubhouse</strong> that serves as a central hub for social and recreational activities, offering residents a space to relax, unwind, and connect with others.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Fully Equipped Gymnasium</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>A <strong>modern gymnasium</strong> with the latest equipment, catering to fitness enthusiasts who prefer to work out in the comfort of their home.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Swimming Pool</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>A <strong>luxurious swimming pool</strong> where residents can enjoy leisure time or indulge in fitness routines, offering a refreshing escape during the warmer months.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Landscaped Gardens</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The development is designed with <strong>beautifully landscaped gardens</strong> and green spaces that create a serene environment, promoting well-being and a connection with nature.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Children&rsquo;s Play Area</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Dedicated play areas for children, equipped with safe and fun play equipment, ensuring that kids have their own space for entertainment and social interaction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Sports Facilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The property offers a variety of <strong>sports facilities</strong>, such as tennis courts, badminton courts, and other recreational options for residents to engage in physical activities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Walking and Jogging Tracks</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Dedicated walking and jogging tracks</strong> for fitness enthusiasts who enjoy a morning jog or evening walk in a peaceful, green environment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. 24/7 Security and Surveillance</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The development is equipped with <strong>24/7 security systems</strong> and surveillance, including CCTV cameras and professional security personnel, ensuring the safety and peace of mind of the residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. High-Speed Elevators</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The building features <strong>high-speed elevators</strong>, ensuring quick and efficient movement between floors, especially for larger families or during peak times.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>10. Power Backup</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>24/7 power backup</strong> ensures that residents face no disruption in their daily lives, with electricity supply maintained during power outages.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>11. Ample Parking Space</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The project provides <strong>ample parking space</strong> for residents and guests, ensuring convenience and hassle-free parking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>12. Modern Interiors and Premium Finishes</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The apartments are designed with <strong>high-quality materials</strong>, offering premium finishes, spacious layouts, and modern interiors to elevate the living experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>13. Spa and Wellness Center</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Some units may include a <strong>spa and wellness center</strong> offering services such as massages, beauty treatments, and relaxation therapies to help residents de-stress and rejuvenate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>14. Multipurpose Hall</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The development includes a <strong>multipurpose hall</strong> that can be used for various events, parties, or gatherings, providing a perfect venue for socializing and hosting celebrations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>15. Sustainability Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The project emphasizes <strong>sustainability</strong>, with eco-friendly features such as rainwater harvesting, waste management systems, and energy-efficient lighting, promoting a greener lifestyle.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These luxurious amenities are designed to provide a high standard of living, combining convenience, comfort, and indulgence in a prime location like Sector 46, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>ROI Benefit of Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>ROI (Return on Investment)</strong> benefit of investing in <strong>Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> can be quite attractive for several reasons. Here are key factors that contribute to its potential for strong returns:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Prime Location</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Key Business Hubs</strong>: The project is strategically located along the Dwarka Expressway, offering excellent connectivity to business districts like <strong>Cyber City</strong>, <strong>MG Road</strong>, and the <strong>Udyog Vihar</strong> area. This makes it an ideal location for professionals and executives, thus ensuring high demand for residential properties.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to the Airport</strong>: The development is only a 20-25 minute drive from <strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport</strong>, which is a significant advantage for frequent travelers and executives. This adds to its appeal as a high-demand residential destination.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Rapid Infrastructure Development</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> itself is one of the most significant infrastructure developments in Gurgaon, improving connectivity between Delhi and Gurgaon. As the expressway and surrounding infrastructure continue to improve, property prices are expected to rise.</li>\r\n<li>Additionally, there are other ongoing infrastructure projects in the area, such as <strong>metro connectivity</strong>, which will enhance accessibility and make the location even more desirable.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Price Appreciation Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>High demand in the region</strong> due to the growing commercial and industrial activities in nearby areas contributes to the potential for price appreciation. The development of sectors like <strong>Dwarka, Aerocity, and New Gurgaon</strong> makes Sector 46 an attractive investment location.</li>\r\n<li>As more residents and businesses move into the area, the value of properties in Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46 is likely to increase. Gurgaon&rsquo;s real estate market has a history of <strong>steady price growth</strong>, especially in high-demand sectors along major expressways.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Luxury Segment Demand</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The premium amenities offered in <strong>Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46</strong>, such as a <strong>clubhouse, gym, swimming pool, and green spaces</strong>, cater to the upper-middle-class and high-net-worth individuals (HNIs) looking for a luxurious living experience.</li>\r\n<li>The demand for luxury properties in <strong>Gurgaon</strong> continues to grow, especially with the influx of corporate professionals, NRIs, and business executives. This creates a stable rental demand and resale potential for investors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Rental Income</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Due to its <strong>location advantage</strong> and proximity to business hubs, hospitals, educational institutions, and shopping centers, the property has a <strong>high potential for rental income</strong>. It is ideal for tenants working in <strong>Cyber City</strong>, <strong>Udyog Vihar</strong>, and other commercial areas.</li>\r\n<li>The residential demand from expatriates, business executives, and high-income professionals will continue to drive rental yields, which could range from <strong>3-5% annually</strong>, depending on the exact location and type of apartment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Growing Appeal of Gurgaon as a Hub</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Gurgaon has emerged as a major business hub, with numerous MNCs and IT companies setting up offices in the city. This growth is expected to continue in the future, boosting demand for quality housing options.</li>\r\n<li>With the <strong>Delhi-Mumbai Industrial Corridor (DMIC)</strong>, <strong>Smart City Projects</strong>, and <strong>Gurugram-Manesar Urban Complex</strong> initiatives, the region&rsquo;s growth prospects are solid, positively impacting property values in the long run.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Developer Reputation (Shapoorji Pallonji Group)</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The Shapoorji Pallonji Group is one of India&rsquo;s most trusted and reputed real estate developers, known for its commitment to quality, timely delivery, and luxurious projects. Investing in a project from such a developer assures both confidence and the potential for capital appreciation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Sustainability and Green Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>With a growing emphasis on <strong>sustainability</strong>, the project&rsquo;s green features such as <strong>rainwater harvesting, energy-efficient systems</strong>, and <strong>landscaped gardens</strong> appeal to environmentally conscious buyers, adding further long-term value to the property.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. Tax Benefits for Homebuyers</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>As a homebuyer, investing in residential property may also provide <strong>tax benefits</strong> under sections like <strong>80C</strong> (principal repayment) and <strong>24(b)</strong> (interest on home loan). This can reduce the effective cost of investment, making it more attractive for both first-time buyers and investors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Conclusion:</strong></p>\r\n<p>The ROI potential for <strong>Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46</strong> is strong, with the combination of a <strong>highly desirable location</strong>, <strong>luxury amenities</strong>, and <strong>future infrastructure development</strong> making it an attractive investment. With growing demand for residential properties in Gurgaon, both for rental income and capital appreciation, investors can expect consistent returns over time. The Shapoorji Pallonji brand also adds an extra layer of reliability to the investment.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Steps to book unit in Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46 Gurgaon through A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>To book a unit in <strong>Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, you can follow these steps:</p>\r\n<p><strong>Step 1: Contact A2P Realtech</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Reach Out</strong>: Get in touch with A2P Realtech either by visiting their office or by calling their customer service.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Online Inquiry</strong>: You can also visit their website and fill out the inquiry form or chat with their representatives online for more details.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Email</strong>: You can send an email to A2P Realtech expressing your interest in booking a unit in Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 2: Select the Unit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Discuss Preferences</strong>: A representative from A2P Realtech will assist you in understanding the different available units (3 BHK, 4 BHK, or specific floor preferences).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Tour the Property</strong>: You may want to schedule a site visit to view the property, the amenities, and available units before finalizing your decision.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 3: Check Availability</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Unit Availability</strong>: A2P Realtech will check the availability of your preferred unit and provide you with details about the floor plan, pricing, and other terms.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Discuss Financing Options</strong>: If you require financing, A2P Realtech can assist in connecting you with banks for home loan options.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 4: Negotiate and Finalize Terms</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Price and Payment Plan</strong>: Discuss and finalize the pricing, payment plan, and any discounts or offers that may be available.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Agreement Terms</strong>: Understand the terms of the sale agreement, including the booking amount, possession date, and any additional charges such as maintenance fees or stamp duty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 5: Submit Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Required Documents</strong>: Provide the necessary documents, including:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Government-issued ID (Aadhar card, Passport, etc.)</li>\r\n<li>PAN card</li>\r\n<li>Address proof</li>\r\n<li>Passport-sized photographs</li>\r\n<li>Income proof (if financing via loan)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>KYC (Know Your Customer)</strong>: Complete any required KYC procedures if needed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 6: Pay the Booking Amount</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Booking Payment</strong>: Pay the required <strong>booking amount</strong> as specified by A2P Realtech (typically a percentage of the total unit cost). The booking amount is usually refundable (as per the terms) or can be adjusted in the total cost of the property.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Receipt</strong>: After the payment is made, ensure you receive a <strong>booking receipt</strong> and confirmation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 7: Sign the Agreement</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Agreement of Sale</strong>: After the booking amount is paid, you will be asked to sign the <strong>Sale Agreement</strong> with A2P Realtech. This agreement will outline the payment schedule, project timelines, and the terms of purchase.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 8: Payment Plan</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Follow Payment Schedule</strong>: Based on the negotiated payment plan, make the subsequent payments as per the scheduled timeline (e.g., during construction milestones or possession).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 9: Regular Updates</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Project Progress</strong>: A2P Realtech will provide you with regular updates on the construction progress, including timelines for possession and any changes or developments.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Possession of Unit</strong>: Once the construction is completed, the company will inform you about the <strong>possession date</strong>. At this point, you can inspect the unit and take possession of your new home.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Step 10: Final Handover</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Final Payment</strong>: Ensure that all dues are cleared before possession.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Handover Process</strong>: After completing the formalities and documentation, you will receive the keys to your unit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>By following these steps, you can successfully book a unit at <strong>Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>. Their team will guide you through the entire process, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free experience.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3508.408780908281!2d77.04978347615933!3d28.4370912929278!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d19002b67be4d%3A0x3de978035c482907!2sShapoorji%20Pallonji%20Dualis!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1746956559051!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '3600 Sq. Ft.', 'Sector 46 Gurgaon', '', '', '6UZDFI88', 19, 'Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Shapoorji Pallonji, Sector 46, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech', 'Shapoorji Pallonji Sector 46 is an upcoming ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 46, Gurugram, along the Dwarka Expressway. Developed by the esteemed Shapoorji Pallonji Group, the project spans approximately 4.5 acres and offers spacious 3 and 4 BHK apartments with sizes ranging from 2,800 to 3,600 sq. ft.', NULL, NULL),
(194, 'Puri diplomatic greens sector 111 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '260325081759Puri-Diplomatic-Greens-A2P-Realtech.jpg', '<h2 data-end=\"91\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"89\" data-start=\"3\">Luxury Amenities at Puri Diplomatic Greens, Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-end=\"231\" data-start=\"93\">Puri Diplomatic Greens offers a <strong data-end=\"158\" data-start=\"125\">high-end lifestyle experience</strong> with world-class amenities designed for luxury, comfort, and wellness.</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"233\"><strong data-end=\"274\" data-start=\"237\">Clubhouse &amp; Leisure Facilities</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"277\"><strong data-end=\"308\" data-start=\"279\">Exclusive Grand Clubhouse</strong> (25,000+ sq. ft.)<br data-end=\"329\" data-start=\"326\"><strong data-end=\"363\" data-start=\"331\">Luxury Spa &amp; Wellness Center</strong><br data-end=\"366\" data-start=\"363\"><strong data-end=\"403\" data-start=\"368\">Multi-Cuisine Restaurant &amp;&nbsp;Caf&eacute;</strong><br data-end=\"406\" data-start=\"403\"><strong data-end=\"447\" data-start=\"408\">Mini-Theater for Private Screenings</strong><br data-end=\"450\" data-start=\"447\"><strong data-end=\"481\" data-start=\"452\">Banquet Hall &amp; Party Lawn</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"488\" data-start=\"485\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"530\" data-start=\"490\"><strong data-end=\"528\" data-start=\"494\">&nbsp;Sports &amp; Fitness Facilities</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"723\" data-start=\"531\"><strong data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"533\">Olympic-Sized Swimming Pool &amp; Kids\' Pool</strong><br data-end=\"580\" data-start=\"577\"><strong data-end=\"618\" data-start=\"582\">State-of-the-Art Gym &amp; Yoga Deck</strong><br data-end=\"621\" data-start=\"618\"><strong data-end=\"652\" data-start=\"623\">Tennis &amp; Badminton Courts</strong><br data-end=\"655\" data-start=\"652\"><strong data-end=\"688\" data-start=\"657\">Squash Court &amp; Table Tennis</strong><br data-end=\"691\" data-start=\"688\"><strong data-end=\"721\" data-start=\"693\">Jogging &amp; Cycling Tracks</strong></p>', 0, 1, 315, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h1><strong>Puri diplomatic greens sector 111 Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h1>\r\n<p>Puri Diplomatic Greens is a luxurious residential project located in Sector 111, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Puri Constructions, the project offers a blend of modern architecture and upscale amenities, catering to discerning homebuyers seeking comfort and convenience.</p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 48.7528%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; border: 1px solid #000000;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: #236fa1; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 44.5033%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Inventory</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.4425%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Size</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 44.5033%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3BHK Apartment</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.4425%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Super Built-up Area </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>1700 - 2215&nbsp;sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 44.5033%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>4BHK Apartment</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.4425%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Super Built-up Area </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>2950 - 4500&nbsp;sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 44.5033%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>5 BHK Villa</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.4425%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Built-up Area </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>7000 - 8000&nbsp;sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of Puri Diplomatic Greens, Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway,&nbsp;Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Puri Diplomatic Greens is a premium residential project by <strong>Puri Constructions</strong>, strategically located in <strong>Sector 111, Gurgaon</strong>, along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>. This high-end gated community offers <strong>luxurious apartments, duplexes, and villas</strong> with modern amenities and world-class infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Project Highlights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Spread across:</strong> 20 acres of prime land</li>\r\n<li><strong>Number of Towers:</strong> 24</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Units:</strong> Approx. 460 apartments &amp; villas</li>\r\n<li><strong>Configurations Available:</strong> 3BHK, 4BHK, Duplexes &amp; Poolside Villas</li>\r\n<li><strong>Size Range:</strong> 1,700 sq. ft. &ndash; 8,000 sq. ft.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Possession Status:</strong> Ready-to-Move</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Amenities &amp; Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Exclusive Clubhouse</strong> with spa, gym &amp; wellness center</li>\r\n<li><strong>Swimming pool &amp; kids\' pool</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Landscaped gardens &amp; jogging tracks</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Tennis, badminton &amp; basketball courts</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Multipurpose hall &amp; indoor games area</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>24x7 security &amp; CCTV surveillance</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Dedicated parking &amp; visitor parking</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><strong>Location Advantages of Puri Diplomatic Greens, Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway,&nbsp;Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Puri Diplomatic Greens enjoys a <strong>strategic location</strong> that ensures seamless connectivity to key hubs in Delhi-NCR.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Connectivity Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Located on&nbsp;Dwarka Expressway</strong> &ndash; Ensures easy access to both Delhi &amp; Gurgaon<br><strong>2-minute drive to Delhi Border</strong> &ndash; Making it one of the closest projects to the national capital<br><strong>10-minute drive to&nbsp;IGI Airport &amp; Aerocity</strong><br><strong>15-minute drive to&nbsp;Cyber City &amp; Udyog Vihar (Gurgaon&rsquo;s IT Hub)</strong><br><strong>Proximity to NH-8 &amp;&nbsp;Gurgaon Railway Station</strong> for enhanced connectivity</p>\r\n<p><strong>Nearby Infrastructure &amp; Social Amenities:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Metro Connectivity:</strong> Close to the proposed <strong>Diplomatic Enclave Metro Station</strong> (Dwarka Expressway)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Educational Institutions:</strong> GD Goenka School, Delhi Public School, and Indira Gandhi Institute of Technology</li>\r\n<li><strong>Hospitals:</strong> Columbia Asia, Fortis, and Medanta within a 10-15 min drive</li>\r\n<li><strong>Shopping &amp; Entertainment:</strong> Nearby Ambience Mall, Dwarka Sector 21 Market, and DLF Cyber Hub</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><strong>Why Choose Puri Diplomatic Greens?</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong>Luxury Living:</strong> High-end residences with premium specifications<br><strong>Prime Location:</strong> Closest residential project to Delhi on Dwarka Expressway<br><strong>Excellent Investment Opportunity:</strong> High appreciation potential due to rapid development in the area<br><strong>World-Class Amenities:</strong> Offering a lifestyle that blends luxury and convenience</p>\r\n<p><strong>ROI Benefits of Investing in Puri Diplomatic Greens, Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></p>\r\n<p>Investing in <strong>Puri Diplomatic Greens</strong> offers strong <strong>Return on Investment (ROI)</strong> potential due to <strong>strategic location, growing infrastructure, and increasing property demand</strong>. Here&rsquo;s why it stands out as a lucrative real estate investment:</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>1. Prime Location &amp; Future Growth Potential</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Proximity to Delhi:</strong> Located just <strong>2 minutes from Delhi Border</strong>, offering direct connectivity to the capital.<br><strong>Dwarka Expressway Advantage:</strong> This project is along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway (NH-248BB)</strong>, which is <strong>set to boost real estate prices</strong> in the coming years.<br><strong>Close to&nbsp;IGI Airport &amp; Aerocity:</strong> Just <strong>10 minutes from Indira Gandhi International Airport &amp; Aerocity</strong>, making it a preferred choice for business executives and NRIs.<br><strong>Near Upcoming Diplomatic Enclave &amp; Delhi Metro Extension:</strong> Once operational, property values are expected to appreciate <strong>20-30%</strong> over the next few years.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>2. High Property Appreciation &amp; Resale Value</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Current Price Trend (March 2025):</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>18,000 &ndash; ?21,000 per sq. ft.</strong> (for apartments)</li>\r\n<li><strong>24,000 &ndash; ?26,000 per sq. ft.</strong> (for villas)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Past Appreciation:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Property rates in <strong>Sector 111</strong> have grown by <strong>35-40% in the last 5 years</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>With the <strong>Dwarka Expressway nearing completion</strong>, further appreciation of <strong>15-20% in the next 2-3 years</strong> is anticipated.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Rental Income Potential:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>3BHK apartments:</strong> ?65,000 - ?80,000 per month</li>\r\n<li><strong>4BHK apartments:</strong> ?90,000 - ?1.2 lakh per month</li>\r\n<li><strong>Villas &amp; Duplexes:</strong> ?2.5 lakh - ?3 lakh per month</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Ideal for:</strong> Investors seeking long-term capital appreciation &amp; high rental yield.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>3. Infrastructure Boom &amp; Rapid Urban Development</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Government Infrastructure Projects Boosting Demand:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Completion of Dwarka Expressway (NH-248BB)</strong> in 2025 will make it a <strong>prime residential &amp; commercial hub</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Upcoming Metro Connectivity</strong> (Dwarka Expressway Metro Line) will enhance accessibility.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Expansion of Aerocity &amp; Business Parks nearby</strong> will attract high-net-worth individuals, corporates &amp; expats.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Commercial Development Impact:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>More MNCs, IT companies, &amp; startups</strong> setting up in <strong>Cyber City, Udyog Vihar &amp; Aerocity</strong> will increase rental demand.</li>\r\n<li><strong>5-star hotels, retail hubs &amp; office spaces</strong> around the expressway will further drive up property prices.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>4. Luxury Living with Limited Inventory</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Premium Lifestyle with Limited Supply:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Only 460 residences</strong>, making it an <strong>exclusive &amp; sought-after community</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>High-end amenities like <strong>clubhouse, infinity pool, sports facilities, landscaped greens, &amp; concierge services</strong> increase desirability.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Comparative Advantage:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Better ROI than other Gurgaon sectors</strong> due to proximity to Delhi.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Higher rental yields than Golf Course Road &amp; Sohna Road properties.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>5. Strong Investment Security &amp; Brand Trust</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Developer Reputation:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Puri Constructions</strong> has a proven track record of delivering high-quality luxury projects.</li>\r\n<li>Timely completion &amp; excellent <strong>resale value compared to other Gurgaon projects</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Safe Investment:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>RERA-approved project</strong> ensures transparency &amp; compliance.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Low vacancy rates due to high demand from professionals, NRIs &amp; corporate tenants.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Final Verdict: A Smart Investment for High ROI</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Estimated Appreciation:</strong> 15-20% in the next 2-3 years<br><strong>Rental Yield:</strong> 4-5% annually (higher than Gurgaon&rsquo;s avg. of 2-3%)<br><strong>Ideal for:</strong> Investors looking for <strong>long-term appreciation &amp; passive rental income</strong></p>\r\n<h3><strong>Steps to Book a Unit in Puri Diplomatic Greens, Sector 111, Gurgaon via A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you&rsquo;re interested in purchasing a unit in <strong>Puri Diplomatic Greens</strong> through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these steps:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Contact A2P Realtech</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Call/WhatsApp:</strong> Reach out to A2P Realtech\'s sales team for available inventory, pricing, and offers.<br><strong>Email Inquiry:</strong> Send an inquiry via their official website or email for more details.<br><strong>Visit Website:</strong> Check their official site for property listings and latest updates.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>2. Schedule a Site Visit</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Visit the Project Location:</strong> Schedule a site tour with an A2P Realtech representative to explore apartments, villas, and amenities.<br><strong>Check Floor Plans &amp; Views:</strong> Discuss layout options, unit positioning, and customizations (if available).</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>3. Select Your Preferred Unit</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Choose the Configuration:</strong> Select between <strong>3BHK, 4BHK, Duplex, or Villa</strong> based on size and budget.<br><strong>Confirm Availability:</strong> Ensure your preferred unit is available and reserve it with the sales team.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>4. Discuss Pricing &amp; Payment Plans</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Get Price Breakdown:</strong> Understand the total cost, including <strong>base price, GST, registration, and maintenance charges</strong>.<br><strong>Check Payment Plans:</strong> Discuss <strong>CLP (Construction-Linked Plan), Down Payment, or Subvention Schemes</strong> if applicable.<br><strong>Negotiate for Offers:</strong> A2P Realtech may offer discounts, pre-launch benefits, or exclusive deals.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>5. Book the Unit</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Pay the Booking Amount:</strong> Secure your unit by making the initial <strong>token payment (typically ?5-10 lakhs)</strong>.<br><strong>Receive Booking Confirmation:</strong> Get an official booking receipt from A2P Realtech and developer Puri Constructions.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>6. Complete Documentation &amp; Loan Assistance</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Submit&nbsp;KYC Documents:</strong> Provide required documents (<strong>ID proof, address proof, PAN card, and photographs</strong>).<br><strong>Apply for Home Loan (if needed):</strong> A2P Realtech can assist in <strong>loan processing with leading banks like HDFC, ICICI, SBI, etc.</strong></p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>7. Sign the Agreement &amp; Final Payment</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Sign the Builder-Buyer Agreement:</strong> After completing the down payment, sign the <strong>Agreement to Sell</strong>.<br><strong>Complete Payments as per Schedule:</strong> Make payments based on the agreed <strong>construction-linked or full-payment plan</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>8. Handover &amp; Registration</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Possession Process:</strong> Once payments are completed, receive <strong>possession of your apartment/villa</strong>.<br><strong>Property Registration:</strong> Finalize <strong>property registration at the Gurgaon authority office</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Contact A2P Realtech for Booking Assistance</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.a2prealtech.com\" target=\"_new\">A2P Realtech Official Site</a><br><strong>Office Address:</strong> S-3 2nd floor Malik plaza plot No -5 sector 4 Dwarka New Delhi 110078</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><a href=\"../contact.php\"><br></a>Need help with pricing, loan assistance, or investment guidance? Let me know! ?</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', '', 'Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'AA7AN0AW', 19, 'Puri diplomatic greens sector 111 Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon', 'Puri Diplomatic Greens, Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech, Apartment', 'Puri Diplomatic Greens is a luxurious residential project located in Sector 111, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Puri Constructions, the project offers a blend of modern architecture and upscale amenities, catering to discerning homebuyers seeking comfort and convenience.', NULL, NULL);
