(195, 'Puri Diplomatic Residency Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '270325111649Puri-Diplomatic-Residency-sec-111-A2P-Realtech.jpg', '<p data-end=\"145\" data-start=\"42\">Puri Diplomatic Residences in Sector 111, Gurgaon, offers an array of luxury amenities designed to provide residents with a sophisticated and comfortable living experience. Key features include:?</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1677\" data-start=\"147\">\r\n<li data-end=\"288\" data-start=\"147\">\r\n<p data-end=\"288\" data-start=\"149\"><strong data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"149\">Swimming Pools</strong>: Enjoy the luxury of two swimming pools&mdash;a rooftop pool and an all-weather indoor pool&mdash;catering to diverse preferences. ?</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"426\" data-start=\"290\">\r\n<p data-end=\"426\" data-start=\"292\"><strong data-end=\"305\" data-start=\"292\">Clubhouse</strong>: A sprawling 65,000 sq. ft. clubhouse featuring a triple-height lobby, providing an opulent space for social and recreational activities. ?</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"426\" data-start=\"290\">\r\n<p data-end=\"426\" data-start=\"292\"><strong data-end=\"451\" data-start=\"430\">Sports Facilities</strong>: Stay active with amenities such as indoor badminton and squash courts, a fully equipped gymnasium with world-class Technogym equipment, and a professional boxing ring.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"738\" data-start=\"578\">\r\n<p data-end=\"738\" data-start=\"580\"><strong data-end=\"611\" data-start=\"580\">Indoor Games and Recreation</strong>: Engage in various indoor games, including table tennis, snooker, billiards, and chess. The residence also features a yoga and meditation lounge, a dance room, and a karaoke area for diverse recreational options.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"738\" data-start=\"578\">\r\n<p data-end=\"738\" data-start=\"580\"><strong data-end=\"759\" data-start=\"742\">Entertainment</strong>: Experience a gold-class ambiance in the mini theatre, perfect for movie nights or watching thrilling sporting events. ?</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"738\" data-start=\"578\">\r\n<p data-end=\"738\" data-start=\"580\"><strong data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"890\">Business and Meeting Facilities</strong>: Conduct meetings or work in the dedicated business center and meeting rooms, designed to cater to professional needs. ?</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1054\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1056\"><strong data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"1056\">Library and Reading Lounge</strong>: A well-stocked library and reading lounge offer a serene environment for reading and study.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"1215\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1369\" data-start=\"1217\"><strong data-end=\"1242\" data-start=\"1217\">Children\'s Play Areas</strong>: Dedicated kids\' play areas and sand pits ensure that children have safe and engaging spaces to play.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1522\" data-start=\"1371\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1522\" data-start=\"1373\"><strong data-end=\"1395\" data-start=\"1373\">Landscaped Gardens</strong>: Beautifully designed free-flowing landscapes at ground and podium levels provide a tranquil environment for relaxation. ?</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1522\" data-start=\"1371\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1522\" data-start=\"1373\"><strong data-end=\"1550\" data-start=\"1526\">Additional Amenities</strong>: Residents can benefit from a creche, amphitheatre, library/reading lounge, and a terrace party lawn and banquet hall for hosting events.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 315, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>Puri Diplomatic Residency Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Puri Diplomatic Residences is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 111, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Puri Constructions, this project offers a blend of modern architecture and premium amenities.</p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 48.7528%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; border: 1px solid #000000;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: #3598db; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.7736%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Inventory</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.1698%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Size</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.7736%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3BHK + Study</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.1698%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Carpet Area</strong><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>2282 - 2440 sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.7736%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>4BHK + Study + Servant</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.1698%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Carpet Area</strong><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Up to 3,475 sq. ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of Puri Diplomatic Residences, Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong>Puri Diplomatic Residences</strong> is an ultra-luxury residential project by <a href=\"../service_detail/puri-diplomatic-greens-sector-111-dwarka-expressway-gurgaon.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Puri Constructions</strong></a>, strategically located in <strong>Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong>. The project offers premium 3 &amp; 4 BHK apartments with high-end interiors, world-class amenities, and excellent connectivity to key destinations in Delhi-NCR.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Project Highlights</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Developer:</strong> Puri Constructions</li>\r\n<li><strong>Location:</strong> Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</li>\r\n<li><strong>Project Type:</strong> Luxury Residential Apartments</li>\r\n<li><strong>Apartment Sizes:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>3 BHK + Study:</strong> 2,282 &ndash; 2,440 sq. ft.</li>\r\n<li><strong>4 BHK + Study + Servant:</strong> Up to 3,475 sq. ft.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Towers &amp; Floors:</strong> 6 high-rise towers, 32 floors each</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Area:</strong> Approx. 6 acres</li>\r\n<li><strong>RERA Registration No.:</strong> RC/REP/HARERA/GGM/787/519/2024/14</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features &amp; Amenities</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Modern Architecture:</strong> Stylish and spacious apartments with imported stone flooring and modular kitchens.<br><strong>Luxury Clubhouse:</strong> A <strong>65,000 sq. ft.</strong> clubhouse with exclusive recreational facilities.<br><strong>Swimming Pools:</strong> Includes a <strong>rooftop pool</strong> and an <strong>all-weather indoor swimming pool</strong>.<br><strong>Triple-Height Lobbies:</strong> Grand entrance lobbies with designer drop-off zones.<br><strong>Gated Community:</strong> 24/7 security with CCTV surveillance.<br><strong>Landscaped Stilts &amp; Greenery:</strong> Thoughtfully designed green spaces and podium-level landscaping.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Connectivity &amp; Location Advantages</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Excellent Location:</strong> Situated on <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, offering seamless connectivity to major hubs.<br><strong>Near&nbsp;IGI Airport:</strong> Just a <strong>15-minute drive</strong> from Indira Gandhi International Airport.<br><strong>Close to Delhi:</strong> Easily accessible to <strong>Dwarka, South Delhi, and Gurgaon business districts</strong>.<br>&nbsp;<strong>Business &amp; IT Hubs:</strong> Near <strong>Cyber City, Aerocity, and Udyog Vihar</strong>.<br>&nbsp;<strong>Top Schools Nearby:</strong> Close to <strong>DPS Dwarka, Venkateshwar International, and Presidium</strong>.<br>&nbsp;<strong>Healthcare Facilities:</strong> Near <strong>Manipal Hospital, Fortis, and Columbia Asia Hospital</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Why Choose Puri Diplomatic Residences?</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Premium Construction Quality:</strong> Puri Constructions has delivered <strong>5,000+ luxury homes</strong> in Gurgaon.<br><strong>High Rental &amp; Investment Value:</strong> Strategically located for strong appreciation potential.<br><strong>Exclusive Lifestyle:</strong> A blend of luxury, comfort, and convenience with top-tier amenities.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages of Puri Diplomatic Residences, Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></p>\r\n<p>Puri Diplomatic Residences enjoys a <strong>prime location in Sector 111, Gurgaon</strong>, along the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, offering seamless connectivity to Delhi and other key areas in NCR.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Strategic Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Dwarka Expressway (NPR):</strong> Direct access to <strong>8-lane expressway</strong>, ensuring smooth travel.<br><strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport (IGI):</strong> Just <strong>15 minutes away</strong>, making it ideal for frequent travelers.<br><strong>NH-48 &amp;&nbsp;SPR Connectivity:</strong> Quick access to <strong>NH-48 (Delhi-Jaipur Highway)</strong> and <strong>Southern Peripheral Road (SPR)</strong>.<br><strong>Metro Connectivity:</strong> Close to <strong>Dwarka Sector 21 Metro Station</strong> &amp; upcoming <strong>Metro Corridor along Dwarka Expressway</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Proximity to Key Business Hubs</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Cyber City &amp; Udyog Vihar:</strong> 15-20 minutes drive to <strong>DLF Cyber City</strong> and <strong>Udyog Vihar (Gurgaon&rsquo;s IT hub)</strong>.<br><strong>Aerocity &amp; Yashobhoomi Convention Centre:</strong> A short drive to Delhi&rsquo;s commercial hub and India\'s largest convention center.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Diplomatic Enclave:</strong> Close to upcoming <strong>Diplomatic Enclave-II</strong>, boosting investment potential.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong>Nearby Social &amp; Lifestyle Infrastructure</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Top Schools:</strong> Close to <strong>Delhi Public School (DPS Dwarka), Venkateshwar International School, &amp; Presidium</strong>.<br><strong>Healthcare Facilities:</strong> Near reputed hospitals like <strong>Manipal Hospital, Columbia Asia, and Fortis</strong>.<br><strong>Shopping &amp; Entertainment:</strong> Easy access to <strong>Ambience Mall, Vegas Mall, and Pacific Mall</strong> for shopping &amp; leisure.<br><strong>Recreational Parks:</strong> Near <strong>Bharat Vandana Park</strong>, a mega urban park in Dwarka.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><strong>Why is Sector 111 a Prime Location?</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong>Bordering Delhi:</strong> One of the closest sectors to <strong>South Delhi &amp; Dwarka</strong>.<br><strong>Developing Infrastructure:</strong> Part of <strong>New Gurgaon&rsquo;s rapidly growing real estate corridor</strong>.<br><strong>High Appreciation Potential:</strong> Due to <strong>expressway connectivity, luxury developments, and proximity to the Diplomatic Enclave</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>Puri Diplomatic Residences is in a <strong>highly sought-after</strong> area for both <strong>residents &amp; investors</strong>. Do you need more details on property pricing or investment potential?</p>\r\n<h2><strong>ROI Benefits of Puri Diplomatic Residences, Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Investing in <strong>Puri Diplomatic Residences</strong> offers <strong>high ROI potential</strong> due to its <strong>strategic location, premium amenities, and rapid infrastructure development</strong> in the <strong>Dwarka Expressway corridor</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3><strong>Key Factors Driving High ROI</strong></h3>\r\n<h4><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong><strong>Prime Location with Excellent Connectivity</strong></h4>\r\n<p><strong>Dwarka Expressway (8-lane expressway)</strong> ensures <strong>seamless connectivity</strong> to Gurgaon, Dwarka, and Delhi.<br><strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport (IGI)</strong> is just <strong>15 minutes away</strong>.<br><strong>Upcoming Metro Corridor</strong> will further <strong>boost property demand and prices</strong>.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Impact on ROI:</strong> Properties near expressways &amp; metro corridors <strong>appreciate 20-30% faster</strong> than others.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h4><strong>Strong Rental Demand &amp; High Yield</strong></h4>\r\n<p><strong>Close to&nbsp;Cyber City, Udyog Vihar, and Aerocity</strong>, attracting <strong>corporates &amp; expats</strong>.<br><strong>Near Diplomatic Enclave-II</strong>, making it ideal for <strong>diplomats, government officials, and NRIs</strong>.<br><strong>High-end lifestyle amenities</strong> attract <strong>premium tenants</strong>, ensuring <strong>higher rental income</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4><strong>Rapid Infrastructure Growth &amp; High Appreciation Potential</strong></h4>\r\n<p><strong>Dwarka Expressway&rsquo;s completion</strong> (expected by 2025) will <strong>boost property prices by 30-40%</strong>.<br><strong>Proximity to Bharat&nbsp;Vandana Park, Yashobhoomi Convention Centre &amp; upcoming Diplomatic Enclave</strong> adds <strong>investment value</strong>.<br><strong>Surrounding developments</strong> (M3M, Godrej, Sobha projects) indicate <strong>luxury real estate growth in Sector 111</strong>.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Expected Appreciation:</strong> <strong>40-50% in the next 5 years</strong>, making it a <strong>top investment pick</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3><strong>&nbsp;Why Puri Diplomatic Residences is a Smart Investment?</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>Luxury Brand:</strong> Developed by <strong>Puri Constructions</strong>, known for <strong>premium projects</strong> like Diplomatic Greens &amp; Emerald Bay.<br><strong>RERA Approved:</strong> Secure investment with <strong>strong legal compliance</strong>.<br><strong>Limited Availability:</strong> <strong>Only 6 towers</strong>, ensuring <strong>high exclusivity &amp; resale value</strong>.</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p><strong> Investment Verdict:</strong><br><strong>Ideal for End-Users &amp; Investors</strong> looking for <strong>high appreciation, rental yield &amp; luxury living</strong>.<br><strong>Best Time to Invest:</strong> Prices are still <strong>competitive</strong>, and <strong>early buyers</strong> can benefit from pre-launch offers.</p>\r\n<p>Would you like <strong>pricing details, payment plans, or a site visit</strong>?</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Steps to Book a Unit in Puri Diplomatic Residency Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon through A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Booking a unit in&nbsp;<strong>Puri Diplomatic Residences</strong>, located in Sector 111 along the Dwarka Expressway in Gurgaon, through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> involves a structured process. A2P Realtech is a real estate consultancy offering services for this project. ?</p>\r\n<p><strong>Steps to Book a Unit:</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Initial Consultation:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Contact A2P Realtech:</strong> Reach out via their official website or contact number to express your interest in Puri Diplomatic Residences. ?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Requirement Discussion:</strong> Discuss your preferences, budget, and specific requirements with their sales team.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Project Briefing:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Detailed Information:</strong> A2P Realtech will provide comprehensive details about the project, including available unit configurations, pricing, payment plans, and amenities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Clarify Queries:</strong> Address any questions or concerns regarding the project specifications or the booking process.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Site Visit Arrangement:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Schedule Visit:</strong> Coordinate with A2P Realtech to arrange a visit to the Puri Diplomatic Residences site to inspect the location, construction status, and model apartments.?</li>\r\n<li><strong>On-Site Assistance:</strong> A representative from A2P Realtech will accompany you to provide insights and answer queries during the visit.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Unit Selection:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Choose Preferred Unit:</strong> Based on availability and your preferences, select the unit that best suits your needs.?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Review Floor Plans:</strong> Examine detailed floor plans and unit layouts to make an informed decision.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Booking Formalities:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Complete Application:</strong> Fill out the booking application form provided by A2P Realtech.?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Submit Documents:</strong> Provide necessary documents such as identification proof, address proof, and PAN card.?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Pay Booking Amount:</strong> Make the initial booking payment as per the project\'s payment plan.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Confirmation and Allotment:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Receive Allotment Letter:</strong> After processing your application and payment, you will receive an allotment letter confirming your unit.?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Builder-Buyer Agreement:</strong> Review and sign the agreement detailing the terms and conditions of the purchase.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Payment Schedule Adherence:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Follow Payment Plan:</strong> Adhere to the agreed-upon payment schedule, which may be construction-linked or time-bound.?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Regular Updates:</strong> A2P Realtech will keep you informed about construction progress and any relevant developments.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Possession and Handover:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Final Payment:</strong> Complete all pending payments, including registration charges and maintenance fees.?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Property Handover:</strong> Upon project completion and obtaining the occupancy certificate, take possession of your unit.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Contact Information for A2P Realtech:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href=\"../\" target=\"_new\">A2P Realtech</a></li>\r\n<li><strong>Contact Number:</strong> Available on their official website. ?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>By partnering with A2P Realtech, you can navigate the booking process for Puri Diplomatic Residences with professional guidance and support.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', '', '', '', '', 'Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', '4UU5Q0XE', 19, 'Puri Diplomatic Residency Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Puri Diplomatic Residency , Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech, Luxury Home,', 'Puri Diplomatic Residences is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 111, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Puri Constructions, this project offers a blend of modern architecture and premium amenities.', NULL, NULL),
