vity to both Delhi and Gurgaon&rsquo;s key business, commercial, and recreational hubs. The <strong>IGI Airport</strong> is approximately 20 minutes away, making it highly accessible for frequent travelers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Type of Development</strong>: Puri Emerald Bay is a <strong>luxury residential complex</strong>, offering <strong>2BHK, 3BHK, and 4BHK apartments</strong>. The units are designed with contemporary architecture, spacious interiors, and smart layouts that enhance comfort and provide a premium living experience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Project Design</strong>: The project is thoughtfully designed to maximize space, with ample natural light and ventilation in all apartments. The development incorporates modern amenities and green building features, making it eco-friendly and sustainable.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Amenities</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Clubhouse</strong> with a range of recreational facilities</li>\r\n<li><strong>Swimming pool</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Fully-equipped gymnasium</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Landscaped gardens</strong> and open spaces</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sports facilities</strong> like badminton and basketball courts</li>\r\n<li><strong>Kids&rsquo; play area</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>24/7 security</strong> with CCTV surveillance</li>\r\n<li><strong>Power backup</strong> and <strong>water supply</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Infrastructure and Connectivity</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> enhances connectivity to various parts of Delhi and Gurgaon, making commuting easier.</li>\r\n<li>Close to <strong>key social infrastructure</strong> like schools, hospitals, shopping centers, and entertainment hubs.</li>\r\n<li>The upcoming <strong>Diplomatic Enclave</strong> and <strong>commercial zones</strong> nearby are expected to boost the area&rsquo;s real estate value.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Key Locations</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka</strong>: Around 10-15 minutes drive, offering proximity to <strong>Dwarka Sector 21 Metro Station</strong> and the <strong>IGI Airport</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Cyber Hub</strong> and other business centers in Gurgaon: 20-25 minutes away.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Malls and retail outlets</strong>: Malls like <strong>Ambience Mall</strong> and <strong>MGF Metropolitan</strong> are nearby.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Investment Potential</strong>: The area is poised for significant growth due to its proximity to the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> and ongoing infrastructural improvements. With multiple residential and commercial projects being developed in the region, <strong>Puri Emerald Bay</strong> offers good investment potential in the medium to long term.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Lifestyle</strong>: The project is designed to offer a <strong>premium lifestyle</strong> with a mix of luxury, convenience, and comfort. Its well-planned design and amenities aim to cater to the needs of modern-day living.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Why choose puri emerald bay sector 104 Dwarka Expressway gurgaon ?</strong></p>\r\n<p>Choosing <strong>Puri Emerald Bay</strong> in <strong>Sector 104</strong>, near the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, Gurgaon, offers a unique combination of luxury, convenience, and investment potential. Here are several reasons why it stands out as a top choice for homebuyers and investors:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Prime Location &amp; Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Location</strong>: Located near the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, Puri Emerald Bay offers easy access to both <strong>Delhi</strong> and <strong>Gurgaon</strong>, making commuting hassle-free.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Key Locations</strong>: The project is just <strong>20 minutes from IGI Airport</strong> and is close to major commercial and business centers like <strong>Cyber Hub</strong> and <strong>MGF Metropolitan Mall</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Better Connectivity</strong>: The <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> is a major infrastructure project, enhancing the overall connectivity of the area, which further boosts its value.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Luxury and Comfort</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Spacious Homes</strong>: The project offers <strong>2BHK, 3BHK, and 4BHK apartments</strong> with thoughtful layouts designed to maximize space, natural light, and ventilation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Contemporary Design</strong>: Puri Emerald Bay focuses on modern architecture, with homes that reflect elegance and luxury, offering a comfortable living experience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Premium Amenities</strong>: The project is equipped with a <strong>clubhouse, swimming pool, gym, landscaped gardens, and sports facilities</strong>, ensuring a premium lifestyle for its residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Investment Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Rapid Infrastructure Development</strong>: The Dwarka Expressway is set to become a major corridor, connecting key parts of Delhi and Gurgaon. With increasing demand in the area, <strong>Puri Emerald Bay</strong> is a sound investment choice for those looking for long-term growth in real estate value.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Ongoing Developments</strong>: The surrounding region is seeing significant commercial and residential developments, making it a highly sought-after location for both living and investment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Proximity to Essential Services</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Educational Institutions</strong>: Several reputed schools and universities are in the vicinity, making it an ideal choice for families.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Healthcare Facilities</strong>: Leading hospitals and healthcare centers are located nearby, ensuring that residents have easy access to medical services.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Shopping &amp; Entertainment</strong>: With shopping malls, entertainment zones, and dining options within close reach, <strong>Puri Emerald Bay</strong> offers residents a well-rounded lifestyle.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Security &amp; Safety</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>24/7 Security</strong>: The project ensures <strong>round-the-clock security</strong>, including CCTV surveillance and strict access controls, offering peace of mind to residents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Gated Community</strong>: The entire development is a <strong>gated community</strong>, ensuring a safe and secure living environment for families.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Sustainability and Eco-friendly Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Green Living</strong>: Puri Emerald Bay incorporates eco-friendly features like <strong>rainwater harvesting, energy-efficient systems</strong>, and the use of sustainable materials, promoting a greener and more sustainable lifestyle.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Landscaped Open Spaces</strong>: The project has abundant open spaces and landscaped gardens, contributing to a healthier, more refreshing environment for residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Reputed Developer</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Puri Constructions</strong> is a well-established name in the real estate industry, known for delivering high-quality projects with a focus on excellence in design and construction. Their commitment to quality assures buyers of the project\'s reliability and long-term value.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Growing Neighborhood</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Developing Area</strong>: Sector 104 and the surrounding areas are witnessing rapid growth in residential and commercial projects, making it a future-ready location with increased demand for properties.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Urban Infrastructure</strong>: The development of roads, public transport systems, and nearby facilities ensures that the area is well-equipped for future residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Steps to Book a Unit in puri emerald bay sector 104 Dwarka Expressway gurgaon through A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p>To book a unit in <strong>Puri Emerald Bay</strong>, Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, you can follow these general steps:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Contact A2P Realtech</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Reach out to A2P Realtech</strong> through their website, phone number, or email. You can also visit their office for a direct consultation. A2P Realtech is a real estate service provider, and they will guide you through the entire process.</li>\r\n<li>Website: Search for <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> online to find their official website or contact details.</li>\r\n<li>Phone/Email: You may find the contact details for A2P Realtech from their website or listings on real estate platforms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Express Interest</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Provide your preferences</strong>: Share the type of unit you are looking for (2BHK, 3BHK, or 4BHK) and your budget. A2P Realtech can provide you with available options that match your requirements.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Ask for project details</strong>: Get more information about the project, including the layout, floor plans, pricing, and amenities offered in <strong>Puri Emerald Bay</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Site Visit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>A2P Realtech will arrange a <strong>site visit</strong> for you to tour the <strong>Puri Emerald Bay</strong> project. This is a crucial step to help you get a better understanding of the development, its amenities, and the exact location of the units you are interested in.</li>\r\n<li>During the visit, you can ask questions and clarify any doubts you may have regarding the property.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Select Your Unit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>After the site visit, based on your preferences, you can <strong>select the unit</strong> you want to purchase (whether it&rsquo;s a 2BHK, 3BHK, or 4BHK apartment).</li>\r\n<li>Confirm the <strong>floor plan, unit location</strong>, and pricing details with the A2P Realtech team.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Payment Plan &amp; Documentation</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>A2P Realtech will share the <strong>payment plan</strong> details, which may include options like <strong>down payment</strong>, <strong>EMI plans</strong>, and the payment schedule.</li>\r\n<li>They will also provide you with all necessary <strong>documentation</strong> related to the property, such as agreements, title deeds, etc. Review all the documents carefully.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Booking the Unit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Fill out the booking form</strong>: Once you&rsquo;ve decided on the unit and agreed on the terms, you will need to fill out the booking form for <strong>Puri Emerald Bay</strong>.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Pay the booking amount</strong>: The booking amount is generally a percentage of the total cost (e.g., 5-10%) and must be paid to confirm your booking. The amount can be paid via <strong>cheque</strong>, <strong>demand draft</strong>, or <strong>online transfer</strong>, as per the builder&rsquo;s guidelines.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Sign the Agreement</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>After the booking amount is paid, A2P Realtech will help you draft and sign the <strong>Sale and Purchase Agreement</strong>. This document will contain detailed terms and conditions about the property, payment schedule, possession timeline, and other clauses.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Final Payment</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Follow the payment schedule</strong>: The remaining amount will be paid as per the agreed payment plan, which could be based on <strong>construction milestones</strong> or <strong>possession stages</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. Obtain All Necessary Receipts &amp; Documents</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Ensure that you <strong>receive all receipts</strong> for your payments, and keep a copy of the signed agreement, payment receipts, and booking confirmation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>10. Registration of Property</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Once the full payment has been made, and possession is ready, A2P Realtech will assist you with the <strong>registration process</strong> of your property with the appropriate authorities. This will legally transfer the ownership of the unit to you.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>11. Possession of the Unit</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Once all payments are complete and the registration is done, you will be handed over the keys and <strong>possession</strong> of your unit in <strong>Puri Emerald Bay</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\r\n<p>By following these steps, with the assistance of <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, you can easily book your unit at <strong>Puri Emerald Bay</strong>, Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon. They will guide you throughout the process, from selection to final possession, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free experience.</p>\r\n<p>Make sure to contact A2P Realtech directly for any specific documentation or requirements related to their services.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', '', '', '', '', 'Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'S67EF2VK', 19, 'Puri emerald bay sector 104 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Puri emerald bay, Sec 104, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech', 'Puri Emerald Bay is a premium residential project located in Sector 104, near the Dwarka Expressway, in Gurgaon (now called Gurugram). It is developed by Puri Constructions, a well-known name in the real estate sector.', NULL, NULL);
