(197, 'MRG Group Sector 106 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '300325111154MRG-Group-Sec-106-A2P-Realtech.jpg', '<p data-end=\"209\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"66\" data-start=\"0\">MRG Group\'s projects in Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong>, especially <strong data-end=\"92\" data-start=\"79\">MRG Crown</strong> and <strong data-end=\"122\" data-start=\"97\">MRG World The Skyline</strong>, come with a range of premium amenities. Here&rsquo;s a list of the key amenities available:</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"266\" data-start=\"211\"><strong data-end=\"265\" data-start=\"215\">Amenities in MRG Crown (Luxury Low-Rise Units)</strong>:</h3>\r\n<ol data-end=\"1601\" data-start=\"267\">\r\n<li data-end=\"353\" data-start=\"267\">\r\n<p data-end=\"353\" data-start=\"270\"><strong data-end=\"283\" data-start=\"270\">Clubhouse</strong>: A <strong data-end=\"305\" data-start=\"287\">22,000 sq. ft.</strong> clubhouse with various recreational facilities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"438\" data-start=\"354\">\r\n<p data-end=\"438\" data-start=\"357\"><strong data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"357\">Swimming Pool</strong>: A <strong data-end=\"414\" data-start=\"378\">half-Olympic-sized swimming pool</strong> for residents to enjoy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"532\" data-start=\"439\">\r\n<p data-end=\"532\" data-start=\"442\"><strong data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"442\">EV Charging Points</strong>: Charging stations for electric vehicles, promoting sustainability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"638\" data-start=\"533\">\r\n<p data-end=\"638\" data-start=\"536\"><strong data-end=\"554\" data-start=\"536\">Leisure Island</strong>: A <strong data-end=\"585\" data-start=\"558\">1.5-acre leisure island</strong> designed for relaxation and recreational activities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"703\" data-start=\"639\">\r\n<p data-end=\"703\" data-start=\"642\"><strong data-end=\"655\" data-start=\"642\">Gymnasium</strong>: A fully equipped fitness center for residents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"790\" data-start=\"704\">\r\n<p data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"707\"><strong data-end=\"728\" data-start=\"707\">Sports Facilities</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"790\" data-start=\"733\">\r\n<li data-end=\"750\" data-start=\"733\">\r\n<p data-end=\"750\" data-start=\"735\">Badminton court</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"768\" data-start=\"754\">\r\n<p data-end=\"768\" data-start=\"756\">Tennis court</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"790\" data-start=\"772\">\r\n<p data-end=\"790\" data-start=\"774\">Basketball court</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"891\" data-start=\"791\">\r\n<p data-end=\"891\" data-start=\"794\"><strong data-end=\"818\" data-start=\"794\">Children\'s Play Area</strong>: A safe and fun space for kids to play and engage in outdoor activities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"892\">\r\n<p data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"895\"><strong data-end=\"912\" data-start=\"895\">24/7 Security</strong>: Security systems, including CCTV surveillance, for the safety of residents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"990\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"993\"><strong data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"993\">Visitor Parking</strong>: Dedicated parking spaces for visitors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1143\" data-start=\"1053\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1143\" data-start=\"1057\"><strong data-end=\"1079\" data-start=\"1057\">Landscaped Gardens</strong>: Green spaces and gardens for relaxation and outdoor enjoyment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1231\" data-start=\"1144\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1231\" data-start=\"1148\"><strong data-end=\"1172\" data-start=\"1148\">Rainwater Harvesting</strong>: Sustainable water management practices to conserve water.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1232\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1236\"><strong data-end=\"1254\" data-start=\"1236\">Solar Lighting</strong>: Solar-powered lighting systems in common areas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1368\" data-start=\"1304\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1368\" data-start=\"1308\"><strong data-end=\"1330\" data-start=\"1308\">Wi-Fi Connectivity</strong>: Wi-Fi in common areas for residents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1444\" data-start=\"1369\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1444\" data-start=\"1373\"><strong data-end=\"1389\" data-start=\"1373\">Power Backup</strong>: Backup power for common areas and essential services.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1520\" data-start=\"1445\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1520\" data-start=\"1449\"><strong data-end=\"1474\" data-start=\"1449\">Open Air Amphitheater</strong>: A space for community events and gatherings.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1601\" data-start=\"1521\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1601\" data-start=\"1525\"><strong data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1525\">Elevators</strong>: Modern and spacious elevators for easy access between floors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-end=\"2978\" data-start=\"2821\">&nbsp;</p>', 0, 1, 285, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>MRG Group Sector 106 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</h2>\r\n<p>MRG Group is a prominent real estate developer in Gurgaon, offering a variety of residential projects in Sector 106 along the Dwarka Expressway. This area has become a sought-after destination due to its strategic location and the quality of developments by MRG Group.?</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 450.8pt; border-color: #000000;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>MRG Crown</strong> (Luxury Residential Units)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Types of Unit</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Sizes</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3 BHK Low-Rise Floor</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>1,359 </strong><strong data-end=\"333\" data-start=\"316\">&nbsp;sq. ft.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3 BHK Low-Rise Floor</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>1503 sq. ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>3 BHK Low-Rise Floor</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Open Sans\', \'Helvetica Neue\', sans-serif;\">1593 sq. ft</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key Projects by MRG Group in Sector 106:</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>MRG Crown:</strong>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Overview:</strong> MRG Crown is a luxury gated community spanning 8.16 acres, offering 3-bedroom low-rise floors. The project features a 22,000 sq. ft. clubhouse, a half-Olympic-sized swimming pool, a 1.5-acre leisure island, EV charging points, and dedicated visitor parking.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Location:</strong> Situated in Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon.?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Unit Details:</strong> 3 BHK apartments ranging from 1,359 to 1,593 sq. ft.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages of Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Proximity to the Dwarka Expressway ensures seamless connectivity to Delhi and other parts of Gurgaon.?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> The area is well-connected to major landmarks, including the IGI Airport, proposed metro stations, and the Gurugram railway station. ?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Amenities:</strong> Residents have access to essential services such as schools, hospitals, shopping complexes, and business parks in the vicinity.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><strong>Overview of&nbsp;MRG Group Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon:</strong></h2>\r\n<p>MRG Group is a well-known real estate developer in Gurgaon, and their projects in <strong>Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway</strong> have garnered attention due to their quality, strategic location, and diverse range of offerings catering to different segments of the market.</p>\r\n<p>Some of their notable developments in the area include:</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>MRG Crown</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>A luxurious, gated residential community with low-rise 3-bedroom floors, spread across 8.16 acres.</li>\r\n<li>Offers a 22,000 sq. ft. clubhouse, a half-Olympic-sized swimming pool, EV charging points, a leisure island, and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Strategic Connectivity</strong>:</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> is one of the most significant corridors connecting Gurgaon to Delhi, ensuring quick access to both cities.</li>\r\n<li>The area enjoys seamless connectivity to <strong>IGI Airport</strong>, which is just a short drive away.</li>\r\n<li>The upcoming <strong>Dwarka Expressway metro station</strong> and other proposed metro links will further enhance access to public transport, making commuting even more convenient.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Key Locations</strong>:\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Gurgaon Railway Station</strong> is easily accessible from the sector, ensuring excellent connectivity to other parts of the city and beyond.</li>\r\n<li>Major business hubs and shopping complexes in <strong>Gurgaon</strong> are within easy reach, including DLF Cyber City, MG Road, and Sector 29.</li>\r\n<li>Schools, hospitals, and shopping centers are located in the vicinity, ensuring convenience for residents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Real Estate Growth and Development</strong>:\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>Sector 106 is part of the rapidly developing area along Dwarka Expressway, which is seeing an increase in both residential and commercial projects.</li>\r\n<li>This region is expected to experience substantial growth in the coming years, making it a prime investment area for real estate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Infrastructure and Amenities</strong>:\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li>The sector is well-equipped with essential infrastructure like water supply, electricity, and sewage systems, with plans for further development.</li>\r\n<li>In addition to residential facilities, the area offers green spaces, parks, sports facilities, and modern amenities that enhance the overall living experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2><strong>ROI Benefit to Invest in MRG Group Sector 106 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Investing in <strong>MRG Group\'s properties in Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> offers several potential <strong>Return on Investment (ROI)</strong> benefits, thanks to the area\'s strategic location, infrastructure development, and the reputation of MRG Group in the real estate market. Here\'s a breakdown of the ROI benefits:</p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Strategic Location and Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> is a key arterial road connecting <strong>Gurgaon</strong> to <strong>Delhi</strong>, making the area highly attractive for both residential and commercial investments.</li>\r\n<li>The proximity to the <strong>IGI Airport</strong> (about 20-25 minutes) and the upcoming <strong>Dwarka Expressway metro station</strong> adds further value by improving connectivity to other parts of Delhi and Gurgaon.</li>\r\n<li>As this expressway is a major development corridor, properties in this area are expected to appreciate in value due to the improving infrastructure and connectivity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Strong Infrastructure Growth</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The region around Dwarka Expressway is witnessing rapid infrastructure development, with several new commercial and residential projects coming up. This growth is likely to boost property values over time.</li>\r\n<li><strong>MRG Group</strong> has designed its projects with modern amenities and sustainable features, making them highly desirable for buyers.</li>\r\n<li>With continuous development, including new metro lines, roads, and public facilities, properties in Sector 106 are expected to see substantial appreciation, enhancing the ROI for early investors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3.&nbsp;</strong><strong>4. High Rental Potential</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The growing demand for residential properties near <strong>business hubs</strong> like <strong>Cyber City</strong>, <strong>MG Road</strong>, and the commercial developments in the region creates a strong rental market.</li>\r\n<li>Investors looking for rental income can expect a good ROI due to the influx of professionals and corporate tenants seeking housing near their workplaces.</li>\r\n<li>The area is also close to educational institutions and healthcare centers, adding to its appeal for families looking to rent homes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Proximity to Key Amenities</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Sector 106 is strategically located near schools, hospitals, shopping centers, and leisure hubs, which are essential for day-to-day living. This makes the location highly desirable for potential buyers and renters.</li>\r\n<li>The area\'s growth potential is backed by the presence of world-class amenities, further increasing the long-term capital appreciation potential.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Stable Long-Term Growth</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Real estate in areas with significant infrastructure development like the <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> tends to see consistent appreciation over the years. This makes it a safe bet for investors looking for long-term growth.</li>\r\n<li>Given the ongoing development of commercial, residential, and social infrastructure in the area, properties in Sector 106 are positioned for sustained appreciation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Developer Reputation</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>MRG Group</strong> is known for delivering quality projects on time, which adds credibility to their developments. Properties by reputed developers generally appreciate faster and offer a higher resale value, making it an attractive investment choice.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Key ROI Factors:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Appreciation in Property Value</strong>: Due to increasing infrastructure development and strategic location.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Rental Yield</strong>: High demand for rentals due to proximity to business hubs and essential services.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>To book a unit in&nbsp;<strong>MRG Group Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these steps:</h3>\r\n<p><strong>1. Contact A2P Realtech:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Visit the official website</strong> of A2P Realtech or reach out via their <strong>contact number</strong> or <strong>email</strong> for inquiries.</li>\r\n<li>You can also visit their <strong>office</strong> if located nearby for in-person consultation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Get Detailed Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Consult with A2P Realtech</strong> to get the latest information on available units in MRG Group\'s projects in Sector 106, such as <strong>MRG Crown.</strong></li>\r\n<li>Confirm details such as pricing, floor plans, sizes, amenities, and expected possession timelines.</li>\r\n<li>If interested, schedule a <strong>site visit</strong> to the project location to get a firsthand view of the development and the surrounding area.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Select the Unit:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Based on your preferences (unit type, size, floor, etc.), select the unit you want to book.</li>\r\n<li>You can choose between luxury apartments like <strong>MRG Crown</strong>&nbsp;, depending on your budget and requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>4. Review Payment Plans and Documents:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>A2P Realtech</strong> will provide you with the available <strong>payment plans</strong> and guide you on financing options such as <strong>home loans</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Make sure to review the terms and conditions, including <strong>booking amount</strong>, <strong>EMI options</strong>, and the <strong>final cost</strong> of the unit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>5. Submit Documents:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>You\'ll need to submit <strong>identity proof</strong>, <strong>address proof</strong>, <strong>PAN card</strong>, and any other required documents for verification.</li>\r\n<li>If you are applying for a <strong>home loan</strong>, A2P Realtech can assist you with the loan application process and documentation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. Pay the Booking Amount:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Once everything is in place, pay the <strong>booking amount</strong> to secure your unit. The payment details will be provided by A2P Realtech, and they will ensure that the booking is confirmed with the developer.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>7. Receive Booking Confirmation:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>After making the payment, you will receive a <strong>booking confirmation</strong> along with an <strong>allotment letter</strong> for the booked unit.</li>\r\n<li>A2P Realtech will also assist you in keeping track of the status of your booking, payment schedules, and any updates from the developer.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>8. Sign the Agreement:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>Once the booking is confirmed and the payment is made, you will be asked to sign the <strong>sale agreement</strong> with MRG Group. A2P Realtech will help facilitate this process and ensure that all terms and conditions are clearly outlined.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>9. Monitor Construction Progress:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>A2P Realtech</strong> will provide you with periodic updates on the construction progress of the project.</li>\r\n<li>You can also visit the site or stay in touch with A2P for any information regarding possession dates, completion timelines, or any changes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>10. Final Payment and Possession:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>On the completion of construction, <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> will assist you with the final payments and ensure that all legal and administrative processes are in place for possession.</li>\r\n<li>After the final payment is done, you will be handed over the possession of your unit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Bonus Tip:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Follow-Up</strong>: Keep in touch with <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> for any future updates regarding the project, as well as assistance with moving in or additional services like renting the property or selling it later.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>By following these steps, you can smoothly book a unit in <strong>MRG Group Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', '', '', '', '', 'Sector 106 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'Q6UKJ0FT', 19, 'MRG Group Sector 106 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'MRG Group, MRG The Skyline, MRG Crown, Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech', 'MRG Group is a prominent real estate developer in Gurgaon, offering a variety of residential projects in Sector 106 along the Dwarka Expressway. This area has become a sought-after destination due to its strategic location and the quality of developments by MRG Group', NULL, NULL),
