</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;State-of-the-art Gym &amp; Wellness Center</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Landscaped Gardens &amp; Green Spaces</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Tennis, Badminton &amp; Basketball Courts</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Jogging &amp; Cycling Tracks</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Co-working Spaces &amp; Multipurpose Hall</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>On Dwarka Expressway</li>\r\n<li>12 minutes to Indira Gandhi International Airport</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Easy access to NH-8 &amp; Cyber City</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Near Top Schools &amp; Hospitals (DPS, Medanta, Fortis)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Sustainable &amp; Smart Living</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rainwater Harvesting &amp; Green Energy Solutions</li>\r\n<li>EV Charging Stations</li>\r\n<li>24/7 Smart Security &amp; Surveillance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Why Choose The Palatial by Hero Homes?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Ultra-luxurious lifestyle &amp; exclusive amenities</li>\r\n<li>Prime location in a rapidly growing area</li>\r\n<li>Developed by Hero Realty &ndash; A trusted brand in real estate</li>\r\n<li>High investment returns in Gurgaon&rsquo;s luxury corridor</li>\r\n<li>High ROI potential due to Gurgaon&rsquo;s expanding luxury market</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><strong>Luxury Amenities &amp;&nbsp;ROI Benefits at The Palatial by Hero Homes</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"301\" data-start=\"251\"><strong data-end=\"299\" data-start=\"255\">1. Grand Lifestyle &amp; Wellness Facilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"302\"><strong>Exclusive Clubhouse</strong> with luxury lounges &amp; entertainment areas</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"302\"><strong data-end=\"405\" data-start=\"374\">Infinity-edge Swimming Pool</strong> &amp; <strong data-end=\"432\" data-start=\"408\">Dedicated Kids\' Pool</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"302\"><strong data-end=\"479\" data-start=\"437\">State-of-the-art Gym &amp; Wellness Center</strong></li>\r\n<