>\r\n<li><strong>Project Briefing:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Detailed Information:</strong> A2P Realtech will provide comprehensive details about The Palatial, including apartment configurations, pricing, amenities, and the expected possession date.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Site Visit Arrangement:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Visit:</strong> Coordinate with A2P Realtech to arrange a guided tour of the project site. This visit allows you to experience the location, view model apartments, and understand the project\'s surroundings.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Unit Selection:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Choose Your Apartment:</strong> Based on your preferences and requirements, select the unit that best suits your needs. A2P Realtech will assist in providing floor plans and availability status to aid your decision.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Price Negotiation and Payment Terms:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Discuss Financials:</strong> A2P Realtech will facilitate discussions regarding the pricing, payment plans, and any available financing options to ensure they align with your financial planning.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Documentation and Booking:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Complete Formalities:</strong> With A2P Realtech\'s guidance, fill out the necessary application forms and submit the required documents, such as identification and financial proofs.?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Booking Amount Payment:</strong> Pay the initial booking amount as per the agreed terms to secure your selected unit.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Allotment and Agreement:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Receive Allotment Letter:</strong> After processing your application and payment, you\'ll receive an allotment letter confirming your unit.?</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sign Agreement:</strong> Review and sign the Builder-Buyer Agreement, detailing all terms and conditions of the purchase.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li><strong>Ongoing Support:</strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Continuous Assistance:</strong> A2P Realtech will provide support throughout the process, including updates on construction progress and assistance with any queries until possession.?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>By partnering with A2P Realtech, you ensure a streamlined and professional approach to securing your luxury residence at The Palatial by Hero Homes.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', '', '', '', '11+ Acres', 'Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon', '', '', 'M2QYKCD5', 19, 'The PALATIAL by the hero homes Sector 104 Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon', '', '', NULL, NULL);
