>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1039\"><strong data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1045\">3. Rental Yield Opportunities</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1399\" data-start=\"1079\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1079\"><strong data-end=\"1096\" data-start=\"1081\">High demand</strong> from expats, HNIs, and corporate tenants looking for luxury rentals.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1166\">Estimated <strong data-end=\"1195\" data-start=\"1178\">rental yields</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1199\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1240\" data-start=\"1199\">Studio apartments: ?55,000&ndash;70,000/month</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1272\" data-start=\"1243\">3 BHK: ?1.5&ndash;2.25 lakh/month</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1275\">4 BHK: ?2.5&ndash;3.5 lakh/month</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"1399\" data-start=\"1304\">Proximity to schools, hospitals, and business hubs makes it attractive for long-term renters.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"1440\" data-start=\"1406\"><strong data-end=\"1440\" data-start=\"1413\">4. Brand Value of&nbsp;Sobha</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1705\" data-start=\"1441\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1540\" data-start=\"1441\">Sobha is known for <strong data-end=\"1491\" data-start=\"1462\">high construction quality</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1512\" data-start=\"1493\">timely delivery</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"1539\" data-start=\"1518\">premium detailing</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1656\" data-start=\"1541\">Projects by Sobha typically maintain and grow value better over time compared to other builders in the same area.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1705\" data-start=\"1657\">Strong resale value due to builder reputation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"1754\" data-start=\"1712\"><strong data-end=\"1754\" data-start=\"1718\">5. Long-Term Investment Security</strong></h2>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1960\" data-start=\"1755\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1848\" data-start=\"1755\">The project is <strong data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1772\">RERA registered</strong> and <strong data-end=\"1818\" data-start=\"1796\">IGBC pre-certified</strong>, making it a safe investment.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1960\" data-start=\"1849\">With possession in <strong data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1870\">2028</strong>, early investors can benefit from <strong data-end=\"1935\" data-start=\"1913\">pre-launch pricing</strong> and phased appreciation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2013\" data-start=\"1967\">? Summary: Why Sobha Altus Is ROI-Friendly</h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 6144px; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"6144\" cellpadding=\"0\" data-end=\"2293\" data-start=\"2014\">\r\n<thead data-end=\"2034\" data-start=\"2014\">\r\n<tr style=\"border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" data-end=\"2034\" data-start=\"2014\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\">\r\n<p><strong><button></button>Factor</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000;\">\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Benefit</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" data-end=\"2097\" data-start=\"2056\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000;\" data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"2056\">\r\n<p>Location</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000;\" data-end=\"2097\" data-start=\"2067\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Strategic &amp; well-connected</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" data-end=\"2135\" data-start=\"2098\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000;\" data-end=\"2108\" data-start=\"2098\">\r\n<p>Builder</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000;\" data-end=\"2135\" data-start=\"2108\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Sobha = trust + premium</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" data-end=\"2171\" data-start=\"2136\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000;\" data-end=\"2151\" data-start=\"2136\">\r\n<p>Appreciation</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000;\" data-end=\"2171\" data-start=\"2151\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 25&ndash;40% potential</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" data-end=\"2230\" data-start=\"2172\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000;\" data-end=\"2187\" data-start=\"2172\">\r\n<p>Rental Yield</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000;\" data-end=\"2230\" data-start=\"2187\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;High demand from professionals &amp; expats</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr data-end=\"2293\" data-start=\"2231\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000;\" data-end=\"2246\" data-start=\"2231\">\r\n<p>Project Type</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: #000000;\" data-end=\"2293\" data-start=\"2246\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Low-density luxury (higher long-term value)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Process to Book the unit in Sobha Altus Sector 106 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon throgh A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>To book a unit in <strong data-end=\"113\" data-start=\"58\">Sobha Altus, Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong> through <strong data-end=\"138\" data-start=\"122\">A2P Realtech</strong>, please follow these steps:</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\" data-end=\"1723\" data-start=\"168\">\r\n<li data-end=\"375\" data-start=\"168\"><strong data-end=\"195\" data-start=\"171\">Contact A2P Realtech</strong>: Reach out to A2P Realtech, an authorized channel partner for Sobha Altus, to express your interest in booking a unit. You can contact them via their official website or by phone.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"539\" data-start=\"377\"><strong data-end=\"409\" data-start=\"380\">Provide Your Requirements</strong>: Share your preferences regarding the type of unit (Studio, 3 BHK, or 4 BHK), budget, and any specific floor or view preferences.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"716\" data-start=\"541\"><strong data-end=\"558\" data-start=\"544\">Site Visit</strong>: Schedule a site visit to Sobha Altus with A2P Realtech. This will allow you to view the property, understand the layout, and assess the amenities firsthand.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"827\" data-start=\"718\"><strong data-end=\"738\" data-start=\"721\">Select a Unit</strong>: Based on availability and your preferences, select a unit that suits your requirements.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1010\" data-start=\"829\"><strong data-end=\"850\" data-start=\"832\">Booking Amount</strong>: Pay the required booking amount to confirm your unit. The booking amount is typically a percentage of the total cost and will be communicated by A2P Realtech.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1258\" data-start=\"1012\"><strong data-end=\"1032\" data-start=\"1015\">Documentation</strong>: Complete the necessary documentation, including:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"1258\" data-start=\"1086\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1136\" data-start=\"1086\">Proof of identity (Aadhaar card, passport, etc.)</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1158\" data-start=\"1140\">Proof of address</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1172\" data-start=\"1162\">PAN card</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1204\" data-start=\"1176\">Passport-sized photographs</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1258\" data-start=\"1208\">Any other documents as specified by A2P Realtech</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"1412\" data-start=\"1260\"><strong data-end=\"1276\" data-start=\"1263\">Agreement</strong>: Review and sign the sale agreement, which outlines the terms and conditions of the purchase, payment schedule, and possession details.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1573\" data-start=\"1414\"><strong data-end=\"1433\" data-start=\"1417\">Payment Plan</strong>: Choose a suitable payment plan (construction-linked, possession-linked, etc.) as offered by Sobha Limited and facilitated by A2P Realtech.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1723\" data-start=\"1575\"><strong data-end=\"1594\" data-start=\"1578\">Confirmation</strong>: Upon successful booking and completion of formalities, you will receive a booking confirmation along with details of your unit.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3506.1642942590784!2d77.00174497491253!3d28.504704289875047!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d179fda5e015b%3A0xc902226cd3c3f5e!2sSOBHA%20Altus!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '5.51 Acres', 'Sector 106 Dwarka Expressway Gurugram', '', '', 'K8DD47I3', 19, 'Luxury Apartments in Sobha Altus Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway Gurugram', 'Luxury Apartments, Sobha Altus, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, Sector 106, A2P Realtech', 'Sobha Altus is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 106, Gurgaon, along the Upper Dwarka Expressway. This project offers 3.5 , 4.5 & 5.5 BHK Apartments and with sizes ranging from 2870 to 4,017 sq. ft. The apartments are designed with minimal shared walls and no directly facing units, ensuring privacy and panoramic views.', NULL, NULL);
