ographs</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l10 level2 lfo11; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1295\">Proof of address</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1380\"><strong data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1322\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Agreement Signing</span></strong>: Sign the booking agreement and other required documents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1406\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">5. <strong data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1406\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',\'serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\">Payment Plan</span></strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1693\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1586\"><strong data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1435\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Choose Payment Plan</span></strong>: Select from available payment options:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1586\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l13 level2 lfo12; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1517\"><strong data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1517\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Construction Linked Plan (CLP)</span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l13 level2 lfo12; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1557\"><strong data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1557\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Possession Linked Plan (PLP)</span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l13 level2 lfo12; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\" data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1586\"><strong data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1586\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Subvention Scheme</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1693\"><strong data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1612\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Payment Schedule</span></strong>: A2P Realtech will provide a detailed payment schedule based on the chosen plan.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1738\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">6. <strong data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1738\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',\'serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\">Home Loan Assistance (Optional)</span></strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1934\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1844\"><strong data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1764\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Loan Application</span></strong>: If financing is required, A2P Realtech can assist in applying for a home loan.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1934\"><strong data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1866\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Bank Tie-ups</span></strong>: They have tie-ups with leading banks for seamless loan processing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1967\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">7. <strong data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1967\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',\'serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\">Final Documentation</span></strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2157\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo14; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2063\"><strong data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1991\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Sale Agreement</span></strong>: Upon full payment or as per the payment plan, sign the sale agreement.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo14; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2157\"><strong data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2090\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">RERA Registration</span></strong>: Ensure the property is registered under RERA for legal assurance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2181\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">8. <strong data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2181\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',\'serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\">Possession</span></strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2365\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo15; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2278\"><strong data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2201\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Completion</span></strong>: Upon project completion, A2P Realtech will coordinate the handover process.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo15; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2365\"><strong data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2307\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Possession Handover</span></strong>: Receive keys and possession documents for your new home.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2370\"></div>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2398\">Contact Information</h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2625\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo16; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2504\"><strong data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2425\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">A2P Realtech Office</span></strong>: S-3, 2nd Floor, Malik Plaza, Plot No. 5, Sector 4, Dwarka, New Delhi &ndash; 110078</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo16; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2532\"><strong data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2516\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Calibri\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal;\">Website</span></strong>: <a href=\"../\" target=\"_new\" data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2625\">a2prealtech.com</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>', '', '', '', 'Spread across 5 acres with 75% open green space', 'Okhla Phase 1 South Delhi', '', '', 'TTA39YL8', 19, 'Godrej South Estate Okhla Phase - 1, South Delhi', 'Godrej South Estate, Okhla Phase 1, South Delhi, A2P Realtech, 3 BHK, 4 BHK, Apartments, Luxury Apartment,', 'Godrej South Estate in Okhla Phase 1, South Delhi, is an ultra-luxury residential development by Godrej Properties, set to redefine upscale living in the city. Scheduled for possession in June 2025, the project offers expansive 3 and 4 BHK apartments with sizes ranging from 2,234 to 3,851 sq. ft. ', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(202, 'SOBHA International City Sector 109 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon Haryana', '290525094956Sobha-International-City.webp', '<h3 data-end=\"201\" data-start=\"172\">Clubhouse &amp; Recreation</h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"203\">\r\n<li data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"203\">\r\n<p data-end=\"263\" data-start=\"205\"><strong data-end=\"224\" data-start=\"205\">Grand Clubhouse</strong>: Spanning over 65,000 sq. ft. across five levels and two basements, the clubhouse serves as the community\'s social and recreational hub. It houses:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"266\">\r\n<li data-end=\"305\" data-start=\"266\">\r\n<p data-end=\"305\" data-start=\"268\">A multi-facility gymnasium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"347\" data-start=\"308\">\r\n<p data-end=\"347\" data-start=\"310\">Yoga and aerobics studios</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"389\" data-start=\"350\">\r\n<p data-end=\"389\" data-start=\"352\">Indoor sports facilities such as badminton and squash courts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"431\" data-start=\"392\">\r\n<p data-end=\"431\" data-start=\"394\">Billiards and table tennis rooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"473\" data-start=\"434\">\r\n<p data-end=\"473\" data-start=\"436\">A multi-cuisine restaurant and coffee shop</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"515\" data-start=\"476\">\r\n<p data-end=\"515\" data-start=\"478\">A spa and salon for relaxation and wellness</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"518\">\r\n<p data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"520\">Ten well-appointed guest rooms for visitors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"603\" data-start=\"562\">\r\n<p data-end=\"603\" data-start=\"564\">A rooftop swimming pool with a 25-meter lap pool, kids\' pool, and jacuzzi</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"606\">\r\n<p data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"608\">A terrace garden and pergola for leisure and social gatherings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"738\" data-start=\"735\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"766\" data-start=\"740\">Sports &amp; Fitness</h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1225\" data-start=\"768\">\r\n<li data-end=\"828\" data-start=\"768\">\r\n<p data-end=\"828\" data-start=\"770\"><strong data-end=\"787\" data-start=\"770\">Swimming Pool</strong>: A temperature-controlled swimming pool for residents to unwind.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"889\" data-start=\"829\">\r\n<p data-end=\"889\" data-start=\"831\"><strong data-end=\"848\" data-start=\"831\">Tennis Courts</strong>: Multiple outdoor tennis courts for enthusiasts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"953\" data-start=\"890\">\r\n<p data-end=\"953\" data-start=\"892\"><strong data-end=\"912\" data-start=\"892\">Badminton Courts</strong>: Indoor and outdoor courts catering to all age groups.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1017\" data-start=\"954\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1017\" data-start=\"956\"><strong data-end=\"976\" data-start=\"956\">Basketball Court</strong>: An outdoor court for basketball lovers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1018\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1020\"><strong data-end=\"1037\" data-start=\"1020\">Jogging Track</strong>: A dedicated track for morning walks and runs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1225\" data-start=\"1079\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1225\" data-start=\"1081\"><strong data-end=\"1098\" data-start=\"1081\">Cricket Field</strong>: A space for cricket matches and practice sessions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1230\" data-start=\"1227\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"1232\">Landscaping &amp; Open Spaces</h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1537\" data-start=\"1266\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1331\" data-start=\"1266\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1331\" data-start=\"1268\"><strong data-end=\"1290\" data-start=\"1268\">Landscaped Gardens</strong>: Meticulously designed gardens with flowering plants and fruit trees enhance the aesthetic appeal.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1393\" data-start=\"1332\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1393\" data-start=\"1334\"><strong data-end=\"1352\" data-start=\"1334\">Walking Trails</strong>: Tree-lined avenues and green spaces on both sides of roads provide a tranquil environment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1537\" data-start=\"1394\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1537\" data-start=\"1396\"><strong data-end=\"1410\" data-start=\"1396\">Party Lawn</strong>: An expansive lawn for hosting events and gatherings.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1539\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1577\" data-start=\"1544\">Security &amp; Infrastructure</h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1983\" data-start=\"1579\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1639\" data-start=\"1579\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1639\" data-start=\"1581\"><strong data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1581\">24/7 Security</strong>: Gated community with round-the-clock security personnel and CCTV surveillance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1699\" data-start=\"1640\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1699\" data-start=\"1642\"><strong data-end=\"1658\" data-start=\"1642\">Power Backup</strong>: Uninterrupted power supply to all villas and common areas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1759\" data-start=\"1700\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1759\" data-start=\"1702\"><strong data-end=\"1718\" data-start=\"1702\">Water Supply</strong>: 24-hour water supply with a central water treatment plant.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1827\" data-start=\"1760\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1827\" data-start=\"1762\"><strong data-end=\"1786\" data-start=\"1762\">Rainwater Harvesting</strong>: Sustainable water management through rainwater harvesting systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1983\" data-start=\"1828\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1983\" data-start=\"1830\"><strong data-end=\"1856\" data-start=\"1830\">Sewage Treatment Plant</strong>: On-site sewage treatment to ensure environmental sustainability.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1988\" data-start=\"1985\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2026\" data-start=\"1990\">Family &amp; Community Facilities</h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2364\" data-start=\"2028\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2095\" data-start=\"2028\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2095\" data-start=\"2030\"><strong data-end=\"2054\" data-start=\"2030\">Children&rsquo;s Play Area</strong>: Safe and engaging play zones for kids.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2157\" data-start=\"2096\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2157\" data-start=\"2098\"><strong data-end=\"2116\" data-start=\"2098\">Daycare Center</strong>: Facilities to cater to the needs of working parents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2222\" data-start=\"2158\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2222\" data-start=\"2160\"><strong data-end=\"2181\" data-start=\"2160\">Multipurpose Hall</strong>: A hall for hosting community events, meetings, and celebrations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2364\" data-start=\"2223\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2364\" data-start=\"2225\"><strong data-end=\"2237\" data-start=\"2225\">Pet Park</strong>: Designated areas for pets to play and socialize.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 283, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p>Sobha International City in Sector 109, Gurgaon, is a premium villa community developed by Sobha Limited, offering an unparalleled luxury living experience along the Dwarka Expressway. The project spans approximately 150 acres and is being developed in four phases, with Phases 1 and 2 are ready for possession; Phase 3 is under development..</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Project Overview</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Developer</strong>: Sobha Limited, a renowned name in luxury real estate.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Location</strong>: Sector 109, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Area</strong>: Approximately 150 acres.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Configuration</strong>: Villas, Duplex Villas, and Super Luxury Row Houses.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Density</strong>: Low-density community with about 6 plots per acre.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Completion</strong>: Phases 1 and 2 are ready for possession; Phase 3 is under development.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Presidential Villa Sizes &amp; Configurations</strong></h2>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; background-color: #c2e0f4;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Vila type</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center; background-color: #c2e0f4;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Size </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>5 BHK Villa</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>400 to 500 Sq. Yd &nbsp;(5,812&ndash;7,330 sq. ft.)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1637\" data-start=\"799\">\r\n<li data-end=\"864\" data-start=\"799\"><strong data-end=\"823\" data-start=\"801\">Multi-Level Design</strong>: Ground + 2 floors</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"928\" data-start=\"865\"><strong data-end=\"887\" data-start=\"867\">Private Elevator</strong>: Ensures seamless connectivity between floors</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"990\" data-start=\"929\"><strong data-end=\"949\" data-start=\"931\">Terrace Garden</strong>: Spacious outdoor area for relaxation</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"991\"><strong data-end=\"1011\" data-start=\"993\">Jacuzzi Option</strong>: Available in select units</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1118\" data-start=\"1053\"><strong data-end=\"1077\" data-start=\"1055\">Front &amp; Back Lawns</strong>: Private green spaces</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1186\" data-start=\"1119\"><strong data-end=\"1145\" data-start=\"1121\">VRF Air Conditioning</strong>: For efficient climate control</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1249\" data-start=\"1187\"><strong data-end=\"1208\" data-start=\"1189\">Modular Kitchen</strong>: Equipped with high-end fittings</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1321\" data-start=\"1250\"><strong data-end=\"1280\" data-start=\"1252\">Imported Marble Flooring</strong>: In living and dining areas</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1390\" data-start=\"1322\"><strong data-end=\"1349\" data-start=\"1324\">Double-Glazed Windows</strong>: For enhanced insulation</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1455\" data-start=\"1391\"><strong data-end=\"1414\" data-start=\"1393\">24/7 Power Backup</strong>: Ensures uninterrupted power supply</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1519\" data-start=\"1456\"><strong data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1458\">Piped Gas Supply</strong>: For convenience</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1637\" data-start=\"1520\"><strong data-end=\"1550\" data-start=\"1522\">Pressurized Water Supply</strong>: Ensures consistent water pressure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Duplex Villas &ndash; Sizes &amp; Configurations</strong></h2>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; background-color: #c2e0f4;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Vila type</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; background-color: #c2e0f4;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Size </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>3 BHK Villa</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>500 Sq. Yd &nbsp;(3,153 sq. ft.)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>3 BHK Villa</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>500 Sq. Yd &nbsp;(4,221 sq. ft.)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>4 BHK Villa</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 225.4pt; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>600 Sq. Yd &nbsp;(4,497 sq. ft.)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1568\" data-start=\"1238\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1291\" data-start=\"1238\"><strong data-end=\"1250\" data-start=\"1240\">Design</strong>: Ground + 2 floors with a duplex layout, offering spacious living areas.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1353\" data-start=\"1292\"><strong data-end=\"1312\" data-start=\"1294\">Private Spaces</strong>: Each villa includes a private terrace garden, front and back lawns, and an optional in-built Jacuzzi.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1409\" data-start=\"1354\"><strong data-end=\"1368\" data-start=\"1356\">Elevator</strong>: Select units come with a private elevator for enhanced convenience.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1465\" data-start=\"1410\"><strong data-end=\"1424\" data-start=\"1412\">Interior</strong>: Features a double-height entrance lobby, ensuring a grand welcome.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1568\" data-start=\"1466\"><strong data-end=\"1481\" data-start=\"1468\">Clubhouse</strong>: Access to a 65,000 sq. ft. clubhouse with amenities like a rooftop swimming pool, gymnasium, and more</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><strong>Super Luxury Row Houses &ndash; Size &amp; Configuration</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&middot; &nbsp;<strong data-end=\"291\" data-start=\"268\">Size</strong>: Approximately 4,017 sq. ft. (373 sq. meters)</p>\r\n<p>&middot; &nbsp;<strong data-end=\"350\" data-start=\"333\">Configuration</strong>: 4 Bedrooms, 5 Bathrooms, Servant Room, Puja Room</p>\r\n<p>&middot; &nbsp;<strong data-end=\"402\" data-start=\"392\">Floors</strong>: Ground + 2 Floors with a Basement</p>\r\n<p>&middot; &nbsp;<strong data-end=\"455\" data-start=\"444\">Parking</strong>: 2 Car Parks (side-by-side)?</p>\r\n<h3>Key Features &amp; Amenities</h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"704\">\r\n<li data-end=\"985\" data-start=\"704\"><strong data-end=\"718\" data-start=\"706\">Interior</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"985\" data-start=\"722\">\r\n<li data-end=\"763\" data-start=\"722\">Modular Kitchen with Utility Area</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"807\" data-start=\"766\">Convenient Quarters for Domestic Help</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"851\" data-start=\"810\">Front and Rear Lawns</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"895\" data-start=\"854\">Large Terrace Area</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"985\" data-start=\"898\">High-Quality Fittings and Fixtures?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"987\"><strong data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"989\">Community Amenities</strong>:</li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\" data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"1016\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1057\" data-start=\"1016\">Clubhouse with Spa and Sauna</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1101\" data-start=\"1060\">Swimming Pool and Tennis Court</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1145\" data-start=\"1104\">Badminton Court and Squash Court</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1189\" data-start=\"1148\">Children&rsquo;s Play Area and Landscaped Gardens</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1233\" data-start=\"1192\">Rainwater Harvesting and Solar Lighting</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"1236\">24/7 Security and Power Backup</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2><strong>ROI Benefits in Sobha International City Sector 109 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon Haryana</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>Investing in <strong data-end=\"41\" data-start=\"13\">Sobha International City</strong>, Sector 109, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, offers promising <strong data-end=\"130\" data-start=\"100\">Return on Investment (ROI)</strong> benefits due to its strategic location, premium offerings, and robust infrastructure developments. Here\'s an overview:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"283\" data-start=\"256\">&nbsp;Capital Appreciation</h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"570\" data-start=\"285\">\r\n<li data-end=\"424\" data-start=\"285\"><strong data-end=\"303\" data-start=\"287\">Price Trends</strong>: The average price per square foot in Sector 109 has increased by approximately <strong data-end=\"102\" data-start=\"79\">22.17% year-on-year</strong>, reflecting a healthy appreciation in property values</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"570\" data-start=\"426\"><strong data-end=\"449\" data-start=\"428\">Historical Growth</strong>: Gurgaon&rsquo;s residential properties have historically witnessed an average annual appreciation of over <strong data-end=\"106\" data-start=\"100\">9%</strong> in the past decade, indicating a consistent upward trajectory in property values. ?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"577\">Infrastructure Development</h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1245\" data-start=\"937\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1087\" data-start=\"937\"><strong data-end=\"960\" data-start=\"939\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>: The 150-meter wide Dwarka Expressway enhances connectivity between Gurgaon and Delhi, reducing travel time to key locations. ?</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1245\" data-start=\"1089\"><strong data-end=\"1118\" data-start=\"1091\">Upcoming Metro Corridor</strong>: The proposed metro line along Dwarka Expressway is expected to further boost connectivity and property values in the region. ?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Premium Offerings</h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1584\" data-start=\"1278\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1428\" data-start=\"1278\"><strong data-end=\"1301\" data-start=\"1280\">Luxury Residences</strong>: Sobha International City offers a range of luxurious residences, including presidential villas, duplex villas, and row houses, each designed to provide the ultimate living experience. &nbsp;</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1584\" data-start=\"1430\"><strong data-end=\"1457\" data-start=\"1432\">World-Class Amenities</strong>: The development boasts a grand clubhouse, modern gymnasium, swimming pool, and various sports facilities, enhancing the overall living experience.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1616\" data-start=\"1591\">Strategic Location</h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1618\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1773\" data-start=\"1618\"><strong data-end=\"1646\" data-start=\"1620\">Proximity to Key Areas</strong>: Only 5 km from IGI Airport, 10 km from Dwarka, and 25 minutes from South Delhi, ensuring excellent connectivity.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1775\"><strong data-end=\"1805\" data-start=\"1777\">Surrounding Developments</strong>: The area is surrounded by other luxury residential projects, making it a hub for upscale living.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Process to book a villa in Sobha International City Sector 109 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon Haryana through A2P Realtech</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>If you\'re interested in booking a villa at <strong data-end=\"113\" data-start=\"85\">Sobha International City</strong>, Sector 109, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, through <strong data-end=\"179\" data-start=\"163\">A2P Realtech</strong>, here\'s a comprehensive guide to assist you:</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"728\" data-start=\"698\">Contacting A2P&nbsp;Realtech</h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"831\" data-start=\"730\">To initiate the booking process, you can reach out to <strong data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"784\">A2P Realtech</strong> through the websites</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1068\" data-start=\"1046\">&nbsp;Booking Process</h3>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\" data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1070\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1179\" data-start=\"1070\"><strong data-end=\"1092\" data-start=\"1073\">Initial Inquiry</strong>: Contact A2P Realtech to express your interest in Sobha International City. Provide details such as preferred villa type, budget, and any specific requirements.?</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1285\" data-start=\"1181\"><strong data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1184\">Site Visit</strong>: Schedule a visit to the property to view the available villas and assess the amenities. A2P Realtech can assist in arranging this visit.?</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1390\" data-start=\"1287\"><strong data-end=\"1303\" data-start=\"1290\">Selection</strong>: Choose the villa that best suits your preferences and requirements.?</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1499\" data-start=\"1392\"><strong data-end=\"1412\" data-start=\"1395\">Documentation</strong>: Submit necessary documents, including identification proof, address proof, and financial statements.?</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1604\" data-start=\"1501\"><strong data-end=\"1517\" data-start=\"1504\">Agreement</strong>: Review and sign the sale agreement, which outlines the terms and conditions of the purchase</li>\r\n<li><strong>Payment</strong>: Make the initial booking amount as specified in the agreement. A2P Realtech will provide details on the payment schedule.?</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1709\"><strong data-end=\"1726\" data-start=\"1712\">Possession</strong>: Upon completion of the villa, A2P Realtech will assist in the possession process.?</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3506.088791743865!2d77.00707907571561!3d28.506976175733545!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1755ee01a7fd%3A0x50997ebf32922b82!2sSobha%20International%20City%2C%20Sector%20109%2C%20Pawala%20Khasrupur%2C%20Haryana%20122017!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 109 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'PRZQ043Q', 19, 'SOBHA International City Sector 109 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon Haryana', 'Sobha International city, Sector 109, Dwarka Expressway, A2P Realtech, Vill in Sector 109, ', 'Sobha International City in Sector 109, Gurgaon, is a premium villa community developed by Sobha Limited, offering an unparalleled luxury living experience along the Dwarka Expressway. The project spans approximately 150 acres and is being developed in four phases, with Phases 1 and 2 are ready for possession; Phase 3 is under development..', NULL, NULL);
