es</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"882\" data-start=\"703\">\r\n<li data-end=\"740\" data-start=\"703\">\r\n<p data-end=\"740\" data-start=\"705\">Outdoor caf&eacute;s and food truck area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"795\" data-start=\"741\">\r\n<p data-end=\"795\" data-start=\"743\">Interactive musical fountain with lighting effects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"844\" data-start=\"796\">\r\n<p data-end=\"844\" data-start=\"798\">Performance plaza for events and exhibitions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"882\" data-start=\"845\">\r\n<p data-end=\"882\" data-start=\"847\">Open-air amphitheater-style seating</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"887\" data-start=\"884\">\r\n<h4 data-end=\"929\" data-start=\"889\"><strong data-end=\"929\" data-start=\"897\">Convenience &amp; Infrastructure</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1166\" data-start=\"930\">\r\n<li data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"930\">\r\n<p data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"932\">100% power backup for shops and offices</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1022\" data-start=\"974\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1022\" data-start=\"976\">High-speed elevators in individual buildings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1061\" data-start=\"1023\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1061\" data-start=\"1025\">Ample surface and basement parking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1114\" data-start=\"1062\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1114\" data-start=\"1064\">Water-efficient landscaping with drip irrigation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1166\" data-start=\"1115\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1166\" data-start=\"1117\">Provision for individual air conditioning units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1171\" data-start=\"1168\">\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1203\" data-start=\"1173\"><strong data-end=\"1203\" data-start=\"1182\">Safety &amp; Security</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1380\" data-start=\"1204\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1251\" data-start=\"1204\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1251\" data-start=\"1206\">24x7 CCTV surveillance and security patrols</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1294\" data-start=\"1252\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1294\" data-start=\"1254\">Fire detection and suppression systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1334\" data-start=\"1295\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1334\" data-start=\"1297\">Access-controlled entry/exit points</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1380\" data-start=\"1335\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1380\" data-start=\"1337\">Emergency exits and signage per NBC norms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1385\" data-start=\"1382\">\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1428\" data-start=\"1387\"><strong data-end=\"1428\" data-start=\"1395\">Sustainability &amp; Green Spaces</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1592\" data-start=\"1429\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1460\" data-start=\"1429\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1460\" data-start=\"1431\">Rainwater harvesting system</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1509\" data-start=\"1461\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1509\" data-start=\"1463\">Lush landscaped gardens and shaded trellises</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1555\" data-start=\"1510\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1555\" data-start=\"1512\">Energy-efficient lighting in public areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1592\" data-start=\"1556\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1592\" data-start=\"1558\">Green building compliance features</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1597\" data-start=\"1594\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1620\" data-start=\"1599\">&nbsp;</h3>', 0, 1, 291, '', '', '', '010525093001Emaar EBD 114 Nxt A4 Brochure Digital.pdf', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>Emaar Business District 114 (EBD 114) &ndash; Sector 114, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Emaar Business District 114 (EBD 114) is a premium commercial development situated in Sector 114, along the Dwarka Expressway in Gurugram, Haryana. Spanning approximately 17 acres, this project offers 86 meticulously designed Shop-Cum-Office (SCO) plots, catering to businesses seeking a blend of retail and office spaces.?</p>\r\n<p><strong>Project Specifications</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Plot Sizes</strong>: 129 to 154 Sq. Yard.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Building Structure</strong>: Ground + 4 floors with basement and terrace rights, allowing a maximum height of 15 meters.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Ownership</strong>: Freehold land ownership, ensuring long-term asset security.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Total Units</strong>: 86 limited edition SCO plots</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Key Features &amp; Amenities</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Location</strong>: Proximity to the Dwarka Expressway offers seamless connectivity to Delhi and other parts of Gurugram.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Pedestrian-Friendly Design</strong>: The development is planned as a pedestrian paradise, enhancing footfall and customer engagement.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Modern Infrastructure</strong>: High-speed lifts, 100% power backup, provision for individual AC units, and ample parking facilities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Community-Oriented Spaces</strong>: Features like a performance plaza, outdoor caf&eacute;, food truck zone, interactive fountain with lights, and shade trellis for outdoor restaurants.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Security &amp; Safety</strong>: 24/7 security surveillance, fire alarm systems, and emergency exits.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sustainable Practices</strong>: Incorporation of rainwater harvesting and landscaped greens.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: Just a 10-minute drive from Indira Gandhi International Airport.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Residential Proximity</strong>: Surrounded by over 50,000 families within a 5 km radius, ensuring a steady customer base.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Accessibility</strong>: Easy access to major commercial hubs like Cyber City and IFFCO Chowk.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Educational &amp; Healthcare Institutions</strong>: Close to reputed schools and hospitals, adding to the area\'s appeal.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Builder Profile &ndash; Emaar India</strong></p>\r\n<p>Emaar India is a subsidiary of the globally renowned Emaar Group, known for landmark developments like the Burj Khalifa. In India, Emaar has established a reputation for delivering high-quality residential and commercial projects, blending luxury with functionality. Their commitment to excellence is evident in the design and execution of EBD 114.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"1280\" height=\"658\"></strong></p>\r\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2><strong>ROI benefit in EMAAR&nbsp;EBD 114, Sector 114, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram, Haryana 122017</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Investing in Emaar Business District 114 (EBD 114) in Sector 114, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram, presents a promising opportunity for commercial real estate investors seeking robust returns. Here\'s an overview of the potential Return on Investment (ROI) and factors influencing it:?</p>\r\n<p><strong>ROI Potential in Emaar EBD 114</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>1. Capital Appreciation:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The area has experienced a <strong>15% price increase post-pandemic</strong>, indicating a strong upward trend in property values.</li>\r\n<li>With ongoing infrastructure development and increasing demand, further appreciation is anticipated. ?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2. Rental Yields:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>EBD 114\'s strategic location and amenities make it attractive for businesses, potentially leading to <strong>competitive rental yields</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Proximity to residential complexes, educational institutions, and commercial hubs enhances tenant demand. ?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. Diverse Usage Options:</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li>The flexibility of SCO plots allows for various business setups, including retail stores, restaurants, and office spaces, broadening the tenant base and income streams. ?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Factors Enhancing ROI</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Strategic Location:</strong> Situated along the Dwarka Expressway, EBD 114 offers seamless connectivity to Delhi and other parts of Gurugram, increasing its accessibility and appeal.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Proximity to Key Areas:</strong> The development is close to IGI Airport, Manesar Industrial Belt, and the Airport Metro Line, further enhancing its strategic value.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Infrastructure Developments:</strong> Ongoing and upcoming infrastructure projects are expected to boost connectivity and infrastructure, positively impacting property values.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Community Growth:</strong> The surrounding area is witnessing significant residential development, contributing to a growing customer base for businesses. ?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Investment Snapshot</strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li><strong>Plot Sizes:</strong> Ranging from 129 to 154 sq. yd.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Ownership:</strong> Freehold, allowing for long-term capital appreciation<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>To book a plot in <strong>Emaar EBD 114</strong> (Sector 114, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram) through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these steps:</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Booking Process with A2P Realtech</strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li><strong>Contact A2P Realtech</strong>:\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Visit</strong>: <u>www.a2prealtech.com</u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Schedule a Site Visit</strong>:\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Purpose</strong>: Assess plot availability, location, and amenities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Select a Plot</strong>:\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Options</strong>: Choose from sizes ranging between 129 to 154 sq. yds.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Submit Expression of Interest (EOI)</strong>:\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Deposit</strong>: Typically ?5&ndash;10 lakh (adjusted against the booking amount).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sign Booking Agreement</strong>:\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Documents</strong>: Provide PAN, Aadhar, passport-sized photos, and address proof.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Receive Allotment Letter</strong>:\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Details</strong>: Confirmed plot number, size, and payment schedule.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><strong>Possession &amp; Registration</strong>:\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li><strong>Timeline</strong>: Expected in 2025.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Final Steps</strong>: Complete remaining payments and register the plot.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3505.0784381165154!2d77.01388217571666!3d28.537361975716827!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1bafa7a6acb3%3A0x800edcbabb513f57!2sEmaar%20EBD%20114!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1746091865279!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', '  Sector 114 Dwarka Expressway Gurugram', '', '', 'MD4PQIJB', 20, 'Emaar Business District 114 (EBD 114) – Sector 114, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram', 'EMAAR, EBD Sector 114, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, Plots available, A2P Realtech, EBD 114, ', 'Emaar Business District 114 (EBD 114) is a premium commercial development situated in Sector 114, along the Dwarka Expressway in Gurugram, Haryana. Spanning approximately 17 acres, this project offers 86 meticulously designed Shop-Cum-Office (SCO) plots, catering to businesses seeking a blend of retail and office spaces.', NULL, NULL);
