(204, 'Elan The Emperor Sector 106 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '060525063613ELAN-THE-EMPEROR-A2P-Realtech2025.jpg', '<h3 data-end=\"84\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"84\" data-start=\"4\">Luxury Amenities at Elan The Emperor, Sector 106, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"86\"><strong data-end=\"106\" data-start=\"86\">Elan The Emperor</strong> is designed to offer a high-end living experience with a perfect blend of <strong data-end=\"191\" data-start=\"181\">luxury</strong>, <strong data-end=\"204\" data-start=\"193\">comfort</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"225\" data-start=\"210\">convenience</strong>. The development is packed with world-class amenities to cater to the modern needs of residents, enhancing their lifestyle with relaxation, fitness, recreation, and more. Here&rsquo;s a comprehensive list of the <strong data-end=\"452\" data-start=\"432\">luxury amenities</strong> available at <strong data-end=\"486\" data-start=\"466\">Elan The Emperor</strong>:</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"530\" data-start=\"494\"><strong data-end=\"530\" data-start=\"498\">1. Clubhouse &amp; Social Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1118\" data-start=\"532\">\r\n<li data-end=\"801\" data-start=\"532\">\r\n<p data-end=\"801\" data-start=\"534\"><strong data-end=\"557\" data-start=\"534\">Luxurious Clubhouse</strong>: The clubhouse at <strong data-end=\"596\" data-start=\"576\">Elan The Emperor</strong> is an epitome of luxury, offering a spacious environment for relaxation, entertainment, and social gatherings. Equipped with high-end furnishings and modern decor, it serves as the heart of the community.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"988\" data-start=\"802\">\r\n<p data-end=\"988\" data-start=\"804\"><strong data-end=\"825\" data-start=\"804\">Indoor Games Area</strong>: The clubhouse includes a <strong data-end=\"866\" data-start=\"852\">games room</strong> with options like <strong data-end=\"901\" data-start=\"885\">table tennis</s