(207, 'Shapoorji Pallonji Joyville Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '110525115252Shapoorji-pallonji-Joyville-Sector102-Dwarka-Expressway.jpg', '<h3><strong>Outdoor &amp; Recreational Amenities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1343\" data-start=\"656\">\r\n<li data-end=\"712\" data-start=\"656\"><strong data-end=\"671\" data-start=\"658\">Clubhouse</strong>: Spanning 24,000&ndash;50,000 sq. ft., offering various indoor and outdoor activities.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"773\" data-start=\"713\"><strong data-end=\"732\" data-start=\"715\">Swimming Pool</strong>: For relaxation and fitness.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"830\" data-start=\"774\"><strong data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"776\">Gymnasium</strong>: Fully equipped for workouts.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"905\" data-start=\"831\"><strong data-end=\"864\" data-start=\"833\">Yoga Deck &amp; Meditation Pods</strong>: Spaces dedicated to wellness.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"966\" data-start=\"906\"><strong data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"908\">Jogging Track</strong>: For daily fitness routines.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1040\" data-start=\"967\"><strong data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"969\">Tennis &amp; Basketball Courts</strong>: For sports enthusiasts.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1111\" data-start=\"1041\"><strong data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"1043\">Kids Play Area &amp; Cr&egrave;che</strong>: Safe zones for children.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1112\"><strong data-end=\"1141\" data-start=\"1114\">BBQ Area &amp; Amphitheater</strong>: For social gatherings.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1343\" data-start=\"1183\"><strong data-end=\"1223\" data-start=\"1185\">Landscaped Gardens &amp; Floral Courts</strong>: Including Topaz, Coral, and Sapphire gardens.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1388\" data-start=\"1350\"><strong>Security &amp; Safety Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\" data-end=\"1794\" data-start=\"1389\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1449\" data-start=\"1389\"><strong data-end=\"1408\" data-start