urious Shapoorji Pallonji Joyville, nestled in the heart of Sector 102 along the Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon. These exquisite apartments redefine elegance and comfort, offering residents an unrivaled lifestyle infused with sophistication and tranquility. With meticulously crafted interiors and state-of-the-art amenities, Joyville is designed for those who seek both style and functionality. Imagine waking up to panoramic views and a community that prioritizes wellness, with lush greenery and leisure spaces at your doorstep. Located just a stone\'s throw away from key business hubs and a wealth of shopping and dining options, this prime location seamlessly blends urban convenience with serene living. Whether you\'re a young professional, a growing family, or looking to invest in a dream home, Shapoorji Pallonji Joyville stands as a beacon of luxury and a sanctuary for all. Embrace a lifestyle that resonates with your aspirations and elevates your everyday living experience.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Shapoorji Pallonji Joyville Project details </strong></h2>\r\n<h3><strong>2 , 3 &amp; 4 BHK Luxury Apartments in Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h3>\r\n<table style=\"width: 44.7758%; height: 280.156px; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; border: 1px solid #000000;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 59.0199px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.5634%; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Unit Type</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 46.5047%; background-color: #c2e0f4; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Size</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 55.2841px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 53.5634%; text-align: center; border-color: #000000;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>2 BHK 