New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Little E Step Pre School (1 km) </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Healthcare Facilities:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Residents have access to several healthcare options:</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">The Signature Advanced Super Speciality Hospital (300 beds)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Medanta-The Medicity (9 km)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Park Hospital (800 meters)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">SGT Hospital (1 km) </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 318, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"relative\">MVN Aero One is an ultra-luxurious residential project in Sector 37D, along the Dwarka Expressway in Gurugram.</span> <span class=\"relative\">This development offers expansive&nbsp; 5.5 BHK apartments, designed to provide a sophisticated living experience.</span> <span class=\"relative\">The project is currently under construction, with possession expected by January 2029.</span> <span class=\"relative\">&nbsp;MVN Aero One comprises 159 units across multiple high-rise towers.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Geomanist Book\',\'serif\'; color: black; background: white;\">MVN Aero One: The Ultimate Living Experience in Sector 37D, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-IN;\">Welcome to a world where luxury meets tranquility&mdash;welcome to MVN Aero One, the pinnacle of modern living in Sector 37D, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram. Imagine stepping into a residence that seamlessly blends cutting-edge design with nature\'s serenity, creating an oasis that feels like home when you arrive. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-IN;\">This exclusive community is not just about elegant interiors and state-of-the-art amenities; it&rsquo;s about fostering a lifestyle that prioritizes well-being and comfort. With lush green spaces, expansive layouts, and thoughtful touches throughout, MVN Aero One offers an unparalleled living experience that caters to both families and professionals alike. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-IN;\">Nestled in one of Gurugram\'s most coveted locations, residents enjoy seamless connectivity and proximity to key business districts, shopping hubs, and recreational areas. Join us as we explore MVN Aero One and discover how this exceptional development redefines the notion of luxurious living in one of the fastest-growing urban landscapes in India. Your dream home awaits!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-IN;\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN;\">5.5 BHK One of the Largest Apartments in Gurugram</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\">MVN Aero One in Sector 37D, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram, offers some of the most expansive and luxurious residential units in the region. Among its offerings, the 5.5 BHK apartments stand out as some of the largest and most opulent living spaces available in Gurugram.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">5.5 BHK Apartments at MVN Aero One</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\