 outdoor gym. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Sports Facilities:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> Engage in various sports with facilities including tennis and basketball courts, a multi-use court, and a skate park. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Children&rsquo;s Play Areas:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> Dedicated zones for children, including a kids\' play area and a children\'s pool, ensuring safety and fun. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Community Spaces:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> Enjoy social gatherings in the amphitheater, multipurpose hall, and senior citizen corner. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'s