ts, designed to provide ample space and privacy.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l14 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Premium Interiors</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Each unit features high-quality flooring, modular kitchens, and elegant fixtures, ensuring a comfortable and stylish living experience. </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">World-Class Amenities</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Recreational Facilities</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Enjoy an infinity pool, spa, gymnasium, yoga and meditation lawns, and a multi-use court. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Family-Friendly Spaces</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: The development includes children\'s play areas, a skate park, and a senior citizen corner, catering to all age groups. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Convenience Services</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: On-site amenities such as a salon, spa, doctor\'s room, e-library, and co-working space cater to everyday needs. </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Sustainable Living</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l18 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Eco-Friendly Practices</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: The project incorporates green building practices, rainwater harvesting systems, and energy-efficient lighting to minimize environmental impact. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l18 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Green Spaces</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Landscaped gardens and walking paths provide residents with tranquil outdoor spaces. </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Strategic Location</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo14; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Connectivity</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Located along the Dwarka Expressway, MVN Aero One offers seamless connectivity to major parts of Gurugram, Delhi, and beyond. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo14; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Proximity to Key Hubs</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: The development is close to employment centers like Cyber City, Udyog Vihar, and Manesar, reducing commute times for professionals. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo14; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Educational Institutions</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Reputed schools such as Euro International School and Suncity School are within a short distance. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo14; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Healthcare Facilities</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Nearby hospitals include Medanta-The Medicity and Park Hospital, ensuring access to quality medical care. </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Investment Potential</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">With its prime location, luxurious amenities, and sustainable design, MVN Aero One offers significant potential for long-term value appreciation, making it an attractive investment opportunity.</span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 9.1pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt;\">Process to book a unit in MVN Aero One &ndash; Sector 37D, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram through A2P Realtech</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Booking a unit at&nbsp;<strong>MVN Aero One</strong> in Sector 37D, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram, through <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> involves a structured process to ensure a seamless experience. Here\'s a step-by-step guide to assist you:</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Step 1: Initial Inquiry</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo15; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Contact A2P Realtech</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Reach out to A2P Realtech to express your interest in MVN Aero One. They will provide detailed information about available units, pricing, and payment plans.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo15; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Provide Requirements</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Share your preferences regarding unit size, floor level, and any specific amenities you\'re interested in.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Step 2: Site Visit</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l16 level1 lfo16; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Schedule a Visit</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: A2P Realtech will arrange a site visit to MVN Aero One, allowing you to tour the property, view sample flats, and assess the project\'s progress.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l16 level1 lfo16; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">On-Site Assistance</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: During the visit, A2P Realtech representatives will be available to answer any questions and provide insights into the project\'s features and amenities.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Step 3: Documentation and Booking</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo17; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Submit Documents</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Provide necessary documents such as identity proof, address proof, and PAN card.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo17; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Booking Form</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Complete the booking form provided by A2P Realtech.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo17; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Token Amount</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Pay the token amount as specified by the developer to secure your chosen unit.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Step 4: Payment Plan and Agreement</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo18; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Discuss Payment Plans</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: A2P Realtech will present various payment options, including construction-linked plans, to suit your financial preferences.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo18; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Agreement Drafting</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Once the payment plan is finalized, A2P Realtech will assist in drafting the sale agreement, ensuring all terms and conditions are clearly outlined.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo18; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Sign Agreement</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: Review and sign the sale agreement, making the booking official.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Step 5: Post-Booking Support</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l17 level1 lfo19; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Regular Updates</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: A2P Realtech will provide regular updates on the project\'s construction status and any developments.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l17 level1 lfo19; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Assistance with Possession</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">: As the project nears completion, A2P Realtech will assist with the possession process, ensuring a smooth transition into your new home.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-IN;\">&nbsp;</span></p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3508.376771101631!2d76.95934787604055!3d28.438056592884504!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d17005773aa1b%3A0xb8a95fce7abe34f2!2sMVN%20Aero%20One!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1747482535034!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', '37D Dwarka Expressway Gurugram', '', '', '0J81SEFR', 19, 'MVN Aero One: The Ultimate Living Experience in Sector 37D, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram', 'MVN Aero One, Sector 37D, Apartments, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram', 'Welcome to a world where luxury meets tranquility—welcome to MVN Aero One, the pinnacle of modern living in Sector 37D, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram. Imagine stepping into a residence that seamlessly blends cutting-edge design with nature\'s serenity, creating an oasis that feels like home the moment you arrive. This exclusive community is not just about elegant interiors and state-of-the-art amenities; it’s about fostering a lifestyle that prioritizes well-being and comfort. With lush green spaces, expansive layouts, and thoughtful touches throughout, MVN Aero One offers an unparalleled living experience that caters to both families and professionals alike. Nestled in one of Gurugram\'s most coveted locations, residents enjoy seamless connectivity and proximity to key business districts, shopping hubs, and recreational areas. Join us as we explore MVN Aero One and discover how this exceptional development redefines the notion of luxurious living in one of the fastest-growing urban landscapes in India. Your dream home awaits!', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(209, 'Book Your Residential Constructions', '290525063244BOOK-YOUR-Residential-Constructions-A2P-Realtech.jpg', '<h2 data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"312\">Luxury Amenities for Your Dream Home</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"365\">Offered by A2P Realtech &ndash; Redefining Fine Living</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"596\">Upgrade your home into a lifestyle statement. A2P Realtech&rsquo;s luxury construction packages offer <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"484\">premium amenities</strong> that combine <strong data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"553\">comfort, aesthetics, technology, and sustainability</strong>&mdash;customized to your taste and expectations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"601\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"646\"><strong data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"646\">Architectural &amp; Design Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"907\">\r\n<li data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"685\">\r\n<p data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"685\">Grand double-height entrance foyer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"745\">\r\n<p data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"745\">Designer exterior fa&ccedil;ade with cladding or Italian stone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<p data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"797\">Custom false ceiling designs with cove lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"865\">\r\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"865\">Premium paint &amp; wall textures (Asian Royale, Royale Play, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"907\">\r\n<p data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"907\">3D elevation with landscape integration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"912\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"950\"><strong data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"950\">Premium Interior Finishes</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"1183\">\r\n<li data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"1002\">\r\n<p data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1002\">Imported marble or high-quality wooden flooring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1049\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1049\">Modular wardrobes with soft-close fittings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1090\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1090\">Designer wall panels &amp; feature walls</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1131\">POP molding and premium cornice work</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1183\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1183\">Acoustic-treated ceilings (home theater, lounges)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1227\"><strong data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1227\">Modular &amp; Smart Interiors</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1473\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1303\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1303\"><strong data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1249\">Modular kitchen</strong> with soft-close drawers, granite/quartz countertops</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1388\">Built-in <strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1337\">kitchen appliances</strong> (chimney, hob, microwave, dishwasher &ndash; optional)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1426\">Walk-in closets in master bedroom</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1473\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1473\">Customized vanity units and designer mirrors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1478\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1520\"><strong data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1520\">Luxury Bath &amp; Wellness Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1768\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1583\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1583\">Branded bath fittings (Grohe, Kohler, Jaquar Artize, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1631\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1631\">Rain showers, body jets, and glass cubicles</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1677\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1677\">Bathtubs or jacuzzi setups in master bath</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1733\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1733\">Anti-skid designer floor tiles and wall-mounted WCs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1768\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1768\">His &amp; her sinks with sensor taps</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1773\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1815\"><strong data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1815\">Outdoor &amp; Lifestyle Additions</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"2067\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1868\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1868\">Landscaped garden with water features or pergola</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1910\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1910\">Private terrace garden or lounge deck</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1964\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1964\">Infinity-style or plunge swimming pool (optional)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2017\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2017\">Outdoor seating with pavers and ambient lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2067\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2067\">Boundary wall with stonework or designer finish</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2072\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2106\"><strong data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2106\">Smart Home Automation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2336\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2145\">App-based lighting and fan control</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2193\">Video door phone with biometric lock system</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2249\">Motion sensor lighting in washrooms and passageways</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2290\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2290\">CCTV surveillance with remote access</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2336\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2336\">Centralized Wi-Fi setup with hidden cabling</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2341\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2383\"><strong data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2383\">Green &amp; Sustainable Additions</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2631\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2443\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2443\">Rooftop <strong data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2419\">solar panel provision</strong> for energy efficiency</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2490\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2490\">Rainwater harvesting with underground sump</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2528\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2528\">Greywater reuse system (optional)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2584\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2584\">Low-E glass for better insulation and natural light</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2631\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2631\">Energy-efficient LED fixtures and smart fans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2636\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2673\"><strong data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2673\">Parking &amp; Entry Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2850\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2716\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2716\">Paved driveway with designer car porch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2752\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2752\">Automatic sliding or swing gate</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2790\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2790\">EV charging point in parking area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2850\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2850\">Wall lights and landscaping lamps for driveway and fa&ccedil;ade</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2852\" data-end=\"2855\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2892\"><strong data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2892\">Utility &amp; Service Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"3092\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2958\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"2958\">Separate <strong data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2920\">laundry room</strong> with washing machine &amp; dryer points</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"3002\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"3002\">Store room/pantry with built-in shelves</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3051\">Servant&rsquo;s room with attached bath (optional)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3092\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3092\">Utility balcony for drying and storage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3097\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3163\"><strong data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3139\">Entertainment &amp; Add-On Spaces</strong> <em data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3161\">(Optional Upgrades)</em></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3164\" data-end=\"3308\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3164\" data-end=\"3204\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3204\">Home theater room with soundproofing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3231\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3231\">Indoor bar/lounge area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3263\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3263\">Game room or home gym setup</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3308\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3308\">Library or study room with custom woodwork</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3313\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3358\">Experience the True Meaning of Luxury</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3475\">Let your home speak elegance, comfort, and smart design&mdash;with every detail thoughtfully crafted by <strong data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3474\">A2P Realtech</strong>.</p>', 0, 1, 319, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p>Building your dream home should be a journey filled with excitement and inspiration, and A2P Realtech is here to make that vision a reality.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>With a reputation for excellence in residential construction, A2P Realtech combines quality craftsmanship with innovative design, ensuring that each project reflects your unique style and needs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Whether you&rsquo;re dreaming of a cozy cottage or a modern architectural marvel, our dedicated team is committed to bringing your ideas to life with precision and care.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We understand that constructing a new home is not just about bricks and mortar; it\'s about creating a space where memories will flourish. Join us as we embark on this transformative journey together, and let A2P Realtech lay the foundation for your future.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Experience the difference that passion and expertise can make in residential constructions&mdash;it\'s time to turn your vision into an address.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"266\">Book Your Residential Construction with A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"320\">Your Vision. Our Expertise. One Solid Foundation.</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"480\">Ready to build your dream home? <strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"370\">A2P Realtech</strong> offers customized, end-to-end residential construction services tailored to your plot, budget, and lifestyle.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"485\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"518\">Why Choose A2P Realtech?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"1006\"><strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"547\">Customizable Packages</strong> &ndash; Tailored to your preferences, plot size, and budget<br data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"604\"><strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"629\">Transparent Pricing</strong> &ndash; No hidden costs, clear itemized estimates<br data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"676\"><strong data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"708\">Architect-Approved Designs</strong> &ndash; Vastu-compliant, practical, and stylish<br data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"753\"><strong data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"776\">Premium Materials</strong> &ndash; Choose from top brands in tiles, fittings, electricals, and more<br data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"846\"><strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"868\">On-Time Delivery</strong> &ndash; Milestone-based execution with dedicated project tracking<br data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"931\"><strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"954\">Turnkey Solutions</strong> &ndash; From structure to interiors, we handle everything</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1011\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1066\">Our Residential Construction Services Include:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1113\">Independent Homes / Villas / Duplex Houses</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1150\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1150\">G+1 to G+4 Custom Floor Projects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1183\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1183\">Farmhouses and Weekend Homes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1225\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1225\">Renovations, Rebuilds, and Extensions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1269\">Interior Design &amp; Modular Work (Optional)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1274\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1315\">What\'s Included in Your Package?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1358\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1358\">Architectural design and 3D elevations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1396\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1396\">Structural and civil construction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1429\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1429\">Plumbing and electrical work</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1472\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1472\">Flooring, painting, windows, and doors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1539\">Optional: Modular kitchen, wardrobes, false ceiling, landscaping</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1544\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1569\">Booking Process:</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1852\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1628\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1628\"><strong data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1594\">Free Consultation</strong> &ndash; Tell us about your dream home</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1697\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1697\"><strong data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1657\">Site Visit &amp; Proposal</strong> &ndash; Tailored design + transparent quote</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1779\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1779\"><strong data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1720\">Finalize &amp; Book</strong> &ndash; Pay booking amount and lock your construction schedule</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1852\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1852\"><strong data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1804\">Project Execution</strong> &ndash; We build while you track progress hassle-free</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1857\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1881\">Book Now &amp; Get:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"2004\"><em data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1911\">Free 3D Elevation Design</em><br data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1914\"><em data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1955\">Special discounts for early bookings</em><br data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1958\"><em data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2004\">Dedicated site engineer &amp; project manager</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2009\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"246\">Overview of Residential Construction Services</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"314\">By A2P Realtech &ndash; Building Homes with Quality, Precision &amp; Care</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"653\">At <strong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"335\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we specialize in delivering <strong data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"414\">end-to-end residential construction solutions</strong> tailored to your plot, vision, and lifestyle. Whether you\'re building a compact home or a luxury villa, we provide comprehensive services&mdash;from design to handover&mdash;ensuring <strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"652\">quality construction, transparent pricing, and timely delivery</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"658\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"710\">&nbsp;Our Core Residential Construction Services:</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"749\">1 <strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"749\">Custom Home Construction</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"899\">\r\n<li data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"800\">Ground Floor, G+1, G+2, G+3, or G+4 structures</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"849\">Independent homes, duplex houses, and villas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"899\">\r\n<p data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"899\">Vastu-compliant designs and modern architecture</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"944\">2 <strong data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"944\">Turnkey Construction Solutions</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1110\">\r\n<li data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1027\">\r\n<p data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"1027\">We handle everything: structure, interiors, electrical, plumbing, and finishes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1057\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1057\">Ready-to-move-in delivery</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1110\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1110\">Ideal for clients seeking a hassle-free experience</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1154\">3&nbsp; <strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1154\">Plot-Based Design &amp; Execution</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1225\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1225\">Design tailored to your specific land size, shape, and orientation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1287\">Full assistance with building plan approvals and compliance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1329\">4 <strong data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1329\">Reconstruction &amp; Renovation</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1465\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1374\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1374\">Demolition and rebuild of old structures</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1423\">Home extensions (additional floors or rooms)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1465\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1465\">Structural retrofitting and remodelling</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1515\">5 <strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1515\">Interior Fit-Outs (Optional Add-On)</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1571\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1571\">Modular kitchen, wardrobes, false ceiling, lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1623\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1623\">Customized interior themes and furniture layout</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1673\">Space planning for functionality and aesthetics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1678\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1744\">&nbsp;What&rsquo;s Included in Our Residential Construction Package:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1798\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1798\">Architectural design, floor plans &amp; 3D elevations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1848\">Structural engineering and civil construction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1890\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1890\">Electrical and plumbing installations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1929\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1929\">Flooring, painting, windows, doors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1969\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1969\">Waterproofing and quality assurance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2011\">Site supervision and project management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2016\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2038\">&nbsp;Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2268\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2087\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2087\">Branded materials (as per budget and choice)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2136\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2136\">Transparent milestone-based payment schedule</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2188\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2188\">Weekly progress updates &amp; client access to site</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2222\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2222\">Dedicated project coordinator</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2268\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2268\">Optional eco-friendly &amp; smart home features</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2452\">Ideal for:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2611\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2487\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2487\">Plot owners ready to construct</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2529\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2529\">NRIs looking to build a home in India</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2563\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2563\">Families rebuilding old homes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2611\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2611\">Investors developing rental units or duplexes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"213\">The A2P Realtech Construction Process</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"258\">Transparent. Professional. Step-by-Step.</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"542\">At <strong data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"279\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we follow a structured and transparent construction process that ensures your project is completed <strong data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"433\">on time, within budget, and exactly as envisioned</strong>. From concept to completion, we handle every detail&mdash;so you can focus on what matters most: your future home.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"547\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"581\">Step Construction Process</h3>\r\n<hr data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"586\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"642\"><strong data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"640\">1. Free Consultation &amp; Requirement Gathering</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"695\">We start with a detailed discussion to understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<li data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"717\">\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"717\">Your land details</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"766\">\r\n<p data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"766\">Desired structure (G+1, villa, duplex, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"809\">\r\n<p data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"809\">Style, space, and material preferences</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<p data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"844\">Budget and timeline expectations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"905\"><strong><em data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"905\">Goal: </em></strong><em data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"905\">Understand your needs and offer expert guidance.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"955\"><strong data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"953\">2. Site Visit &amp; Feasibility Check</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1007\">Our engineering team inspects the site to assess:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1049\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1049\">Plot condition, size, and orientation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1110\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1110\">Local construction rules (setbacks, height limits, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1143\">Soil type and foundation needs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1196\"><strong><em data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1196\">Goal: </em></strong><em data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1196\">Ensure designs are viable and compliant.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1240\"><strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1238\">3. Custom Design &amp; Planning</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1254\">We prepare:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1294\">Floor plans and structural drawings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1332\">3D elevations and fa&ccedil;ade concepts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1379\">Cost estimate with multiple material options</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1458\"><strong><em data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1458\">Goal: </em></strong><em data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1458\">Provide a tailored design with flexibility in finish and features.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1463\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1509\"><strong data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1507\">4. Project Proposal &amp; Finalization</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1536\">You review and finalize:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1655\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1580\">Package type (Basic / Premium / Luxury)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1605\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1605\">Materials and brands</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1655\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1655\">Payment milestones and overall project timeline</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1711\"><em data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1711\"><strong>Goal:</strong> Sign off on design and budget transparency.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1716\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1750\"><strong data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1748\">5. Booking &amp; Agreement</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1889\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1789\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1789\">Pay the <strong data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1787\">initial booking amount</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1827\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1827\">Sign a <strong data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1825\">construction agreement</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1889\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1889\">Submit necessary documents (ownership proof, approvals, ID)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1956\"><em data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1956\"><strong>Goal: </strong>Secure your construction slot and start documentation.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1961\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2009\"><strong data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2007\">6. Approvals &amp; Documentation Support</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2027\">We assist with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2127\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2054\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2054\">Building plan approval</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2080\">Municipal permissions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2127\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2127\">Electricity, water, and sewerage connections</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2190\"><em data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2190\"><strong>Goal:</strong> Ensure legal readiness before construction begins.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2195\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2240\"><strong data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2238\">7. Project Kickoff &amp; Mobilization</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2384\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2282\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2282\">Site preparation and material staging</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2320\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2320\">Foundation marking and excavation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2384\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2384\">Assigning dedicated <strong data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2360\">site engineer</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2384\">project manager</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2451\"><em data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2451\"><strong>Goal: </strong>Begin work with quality and safety protocols in place.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2456\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2508\"><strong data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2506\">8. Stage-Wise Construction &amp; Supervision</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2543\">Work progresses in clear stages:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2688\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2594\">Foundation &rarr; Plinth &rarr; Superstructure &rarr; Roofing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2643\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2643\">Masonry &rarr; Electrical &amp; Plumbing &rarr; Plastering</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2688\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2688\">Flooring &rarr; Painting &rarr; Fixtures &amp; Finishing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2756\"><em data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2756\"><strong>Goal:</strong> Execute with regular quality checks and client updates.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2761\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2811\"><strong data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2809\">9. Client Walkthrough &amp; Final Handover</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2924\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2840\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2840\">Final quality inspection</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2878\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2878\">Client walkthrough with checklist</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2924\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2924\">Completion certificate and handover of keys</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2984\"><em data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2984\"><strong>Goal: </strong>Deliver a fully finished home, ready to occupy.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"2989\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3026\"><strong data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3024\">10. Post-Handover Support</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3157\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3075\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3075\">Help with utility connections, documentation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3113\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3113\">Minor rectifications, if required</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3157\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3157\">Optional maintenance and warranty support</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3221\"><em data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3221\"><strong>Goal:</strong> Ensure peace of mind even after project completion.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3223\" data-end=\"3226\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3255\">&nbsp;What You Can Expect:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Timely execution</li>\r\n<li>Quality craftsmanship</li>\r\n<li>Branded materials</li>\r\n<li>Transparent pricing</li>\r\n<li>Proactive communication<br data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3349\"><br data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3325\"><br></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"235\">Key Benefits of Booking with A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"288\">Your Trusted Partner in Residential Construction</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"494\">When you choose <strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"322\">A2P Realtech</strong>, you\'re not just booking a construction service&mdash;you\'re investing in <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"446\">peace of mind, professionalism, and premium quality</strong>. Here\'s why homeowners and investors prefer us:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"499\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"538\">&nbsp;1. <strong data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"538\">Custom-Tailored Packages</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"751\">\r\n<li data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"613\">Design and construction based on your specific plot, style, and budget</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"681\">\r\n<p data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"681\">Choose between <strong data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"679\">Basic, Standard, Premium, or Luxury finishes</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"751\">\r\n<p data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"751\">Full flexibility in material selection, layout, and service add-ons</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"756\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"802\">&nbsp;2. <strong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"802\">End-to-End Project Management</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n<li data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"867\">\r\n<p data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"867\">From soil testing and design to interiors and final handover</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"916\">\r\n<p data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"916\">One team, one contract&mdash;no third-party hassle</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"987\">Dedicated project manager for updates, supervision, and coordination</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"992\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1054\">&nbsp;3. <strong data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1054\">Transparent Pricing &amp; Milestone-Based Payments</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1229\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1111\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1111\">No hidden costs&mdash;itemized quotations for full clarity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1168\">Payments are linked to clear construction milestones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1229\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1229\">Cost control and change management included in the process</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1234\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1276\">&nbsp;4. <strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1276\">Architect-Approved Designs</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1421\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1319\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1319\">Vastu-compliant, space-optimized plans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1378\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1378\">3D elevation and layout options tailored to your taste</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1421\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1421\">Practical and future-ready floor designs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1479\">&nbsp;5. <strong data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1479\">Branded Materials &amp; Quality Assurance</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1658\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1552\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1552\">Use of trusted brands in tiles, electricals, sanitary fittings, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1603\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1603\">On-site quality checks and construction audits</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1658\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1658\">Documented material usage and workmanship guarantees</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1705\">&nbsp;6. <strong data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1705\">Timely Delivery Commitment</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1876\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1758\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1758\">Realistic project timelines with buffer planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1809\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1809\">Progress updates via WhatsApp, calls, or email</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1876\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1876\">Delays are minimized with smart scheduling and inventory control</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1881\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1935\">&nbsp;7. <strong data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1935\">Optional Turnkey &amp; Interior Solutions</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"2093\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1998\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1998\">Modular kitchen, wardrobes, false ceiling, lighting &amp; more</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2047\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2047\">Complete handover&mdash;move in without the stress</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2093\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2093\">Custom d&eacute;cor solutions available on request</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2098\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2149\">&nbsp;8. <strong data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2149\">Approval &amp; Documentation Assistance</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2334\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2215\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2215\">Help with building plans, sanctioning, and government permits</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2269\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2269\">Legal document review and compliance coordination</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2334\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2334\">Support for occupancy certificate (OC) and utility connections</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2339\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2381\">&nbsp;9. <strong data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2381\">Post-Construction Support</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2543\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2430\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2430\">Rectification of minor snags before handover</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2482\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2482\">Customer support for any issues post-completion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2543\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2543\">Optional AMC (Annual Maintenance Contract) plans available</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2548\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2605\">&nbsp;10. <strong data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2605\">Local Expertise with Professional Ethics</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2791\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2665\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2665\">Experienced engineers, architects, and site supervisors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2726\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2726\">Strong local vendor network for timely material sourcing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2791\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2791\">Transparent communication, ethical contracts, and no shortcuts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2796\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2833\">Build Smarter. Live Better.</h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"254\">A2P Realtech&rsquo;s Commitment to Quality &amp; Sustainability</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"312\">Building Stronger Homes. Creating a Greener Tomorrow.</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"577\">At <strong data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"333\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we believe that construction isn&rsquo;t just about putting up structures&mdash;it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"442\">delivering lasting value</strong> while <strong data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"479\">respecting the environment</strong>. Our core commitment lies in creating homes that are durable, safe, efficient, and eco-conscious.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"582\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"616\"><strong data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"616\">Our Quality Commitment</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"664\">&nbsp;1. <strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"664\">Top-Grade Materials, Every Time</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"876\">\r\n<li data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"755\">\r\n<p data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"755\">Use of <strong data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"706\">certified, branded materials</strong> for structural, electrical, and plumbing works</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"819\">\r\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"819\">Strict material quality checks before and during site usage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"876\">\r\n<p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"876\">Transparent material documentation shared with clients</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"933\">&nbsp;2. <strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"933\">Skilled Workforce &amp; Supervised Execution</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<li data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"992\">\r\n<p data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"992\">Trained masons, electricians, plumbers, and carpenters</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1042\">\r\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1042\">Daily site supervision by qualified engineers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1094\">Third-party quality audits available upon request</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1141\">&nbsp;3. <strong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1141\">Defined Construction Standards</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1224\">Adherence to <strong data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1169\">IS codes</strong>, local building norms, and seismic safety guidelines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1281\">Step-by-step checklists for every construction phase</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1357\">Quality control at foundation, slab, masonry, finishing &amp; handover stages</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1403\">&nbsp;4. <strong data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1403\">On-Time, As-Promised Delivery</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1574\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1457\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1457\">Milestone-based scheduling with progress tracking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1518\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1518\">Realistic timelines, buffer planning, and accountability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1574\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1574\">Dedicated project manager for proactive communication</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1579\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1621\"><strong data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1621\">Our Sustainability Principles</strong></h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1660\">&nbsp;1. <strong data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1660\">Eco-Conscious Planning</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1857\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1734\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1734\">Passive design strategies for better ventilation and natural lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1797\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1797\">Reduced energy dependency through smart layout orientation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1857\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1857\">Material reuse and waste minimization during construction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1902\">&nbsp;2. <strong data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1902\">Green Technology Integration</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"2084\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1951\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1951\"><strong data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1930\">Solar panel readiness</strong> and rooftop access</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"2002\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2002\">Provision for <strong data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2000\">rainwater harvesting systems</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2084\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2084\">Options for energy-efficient lighting, low-VOC paints, and smart water fittings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2126\">&nbsp;3. <strong data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2126\">Water &amp; Energy Efficiency</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2398\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2201\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2201\">Dual flush systems, low-flow faucets, and sustainable plumbing options</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2292\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2292\">Wiring and conduits designed for easy integration of home automation and solar systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2398\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2398\">Optional installation of <strong data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2343\">solar water heaters</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2366\">EV charging ports</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2391\">inverter backup</strong> setups</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2443\">&nbsp;4. <strong data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2443\">Responsible Waste Management</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2623\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2490\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2490\">On-site segregation of construction debris</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2568\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2568\">Proper disposal in accordance with municipal and environmental guidelines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2623\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2623\">Avoidance of hazardous materials and non-recyclables</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2628\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2687\">Quality You Can Trust. Sustainability You Can Feel.</h2>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"263\">&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"263\">Understanding the Cost of Residential Construction</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"264\" data-end=\"324\">Transparent, Tailored, and Trustworthy with A2P Realtech</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"622\">Building a home is a major investment&mdash;and understanding what goes into the cost can help you <strong data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"451\">plan better, avoid surprises</strong>, and get the best value from your budget. At <strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"513\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we provide complete transparency in pricing and offer flexible custom packages to suit your specific needs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"627\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"685\">Key Components That Influence Construction Cost:</h3>\r\n<hr data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"690\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"724\"><strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"724\">1 Plot Size &amp; Location</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<li data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<p data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"808\"><strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"766\">Plot area (in sq. ft. or sq. yards)</strong> directly affects the construction scale</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"889\">Location impacts material transport, labor availability, and local regulations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"942\"><em data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"942\">Urban vs. suburban construction costs may vary</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"981\"><strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"981\">2 Type of Construction</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1153\">\r\n<li data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1082\">\r\n<p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1082\"><strong data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1014\">G+1, Duplex, G+3, or Villa</strong>&mdash;different designs = different structural loads and material needs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1153\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1153\">Complex architecture (curves, cantilevers, basements) increases cost</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1158\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1203\"><strong data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1203\">3 Quality of Materials &amp; Finishes</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1264\">Choice of tiles, paint, fittings, wiring, woodwork, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1301\">Packages typically categorized as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1342\"><strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1315\">Basic</strong>: Functional &amp; affordable</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1359\">Standard</strong>: Balanced mix of style and value</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1447\"><strong data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1417\">Premium/Luxury</strong>: High-end brands and finishes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1495\"><strong data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1495\">4 Design &amp; Engineering Services</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1575\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1575\">Architectural drawings, 3D elevations, structural designs, and MEP planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1647\">Included in A2P Realtech&rsquo;s custom packages for clarity and compliance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1652\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1689\"><strong data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1689\">5 Labor &amp; Site Conditions</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1840\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1765\">Labor costs depend on site accessibility, design complexity, and region</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1840\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1840\">Sloped or waterlogged land may need extra groundwork and foundation work</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1845\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1886\"><strong data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1886\">6 Government Approvals &amp; Fees</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"2033\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1921\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1921\">Building plan approval charges</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1978\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1978\">Utility connection fees (electricity, water, sewage)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2033\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2033\">Property taxes or regularization fees, if applicable</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2086\"><em data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2086\">We assist in obtaining all necessary approvals</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2091\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2121\"><strong data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2121\">7 Optional Add-Ons</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2180\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2180\">Modular kitchen, wardrobes, false ceiling, landscaping</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2247\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2247\">Solar power setup, rainwater harvesting, smart home automation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2286\">Boundary wall, gate, external paving</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"249\">Conclusion &amp; Next Steps for Your Dream Home</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"302\">You Dream It, We Build It &mdash; The A2P Realtech Way</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"628\">At <strong data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"323\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we don&rsquo;t just build houses &mdash; we create homes designed around your lifestyle, your needs, and your future. With our <strong data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"520\">custom construction packages, transparent pricing, expert project management</strong>, and a strong commitment to quality, we ensure a building experience that is smooth, honest, and rewarding.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"756\">Your dream home deserves more than just a builder.<br data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"683\">It deserves a partner &mdash; <strong data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"755\">one who listens, delivers, and stands by you</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"761\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"784\">What to Do Next</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"826\"><strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"826\">1. Book Your Free Consultation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"984\">Let&rsquo;s talk about your vision, your plot, and your goals.<br data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"886\"><strong>Call us:</strong> [Your Phone Number]<br data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"920\"><strong>Email:</strong> [Your Email Address]<br data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"953\"><strong>Visit: </strong><a href=\"https://www.a2prealtech.com\">www.a2prealtech.com</a><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">&nbsp;</a></p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3503.0806853061254!2d77.04727277616337!3d28.59735618567611!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1b8d7ee000e5%3A0x5a6f1f8f031ff9fb!2sA2P%20Realtech%20Private%20Limited!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'F22VLFI0', 21, 'Transform Your Dream Home into Reality: Why A2P Realtech is Your Go-To for Residential Constructions', 'Book Your Constructions, Residential, Commercial, Villa, Penthouse, Duplex, Independent Floor, A2P Realtech,', 'Creating your dream home is more than just an aspiration; it\'s a journey that transforms your vision into a stunning reality. At A2P Realtech, we understand that every detail matters, from the grand architectural designs to the intimate touches that make a house truly a home. Specializing in residential constructions, we pride ourselves on delivering exceptional quality and unparalleled craftsmanship tailored to your unique needs. Our dedicated team is committed to guiding you through every step, ensuring a seamless experience as we bring your ideas to life. Whether you desire a contemporary oasis or a timeless classic, A2P Realtech combines innovation with expertise to craft spaces that reflect your lifestyle. Let us help you embark on the exciting adventure of building the home you\'ve always dreamed of. It\'s time to turn that dream into reality with A2P Realtech by your side.', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(210, 'Chintels Serenity Sector 109 on Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '300525015958chintels-cerenity-sector-109.jpg', '<h3><strong>Luxury Amenities at Chintels Serenity</strong>, Sector 109, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</h3><p><strong>Chintels Serenity</strong> offers a premium lifestyle with a focus on luxury, wellness, and community living. The amenities provided reflect a commitment to comfort, modernity, and high-end urban living.</p><h3><strong>Health &amp; Wellness Amenities</strong></h3><p><strong>Swimming Pool with Deck</strong><br>Includes a main pool, kids’ pool, and lounging areas.</p><p><strong>Fully Equipped Gymnasium</strong><br>With modern fitness machines, weights, and personal training zones.</p><p><strong>Yoga &amp; Meditation Lawn</strong><br>Open green zones designed for peaceful, rejuvenating sessions.</p><p><strong>Spa &amp; Salon</strong> <i>(in select clubhouse areas)</i><br>On-site grooming and wellness services for residents.</p><h3><strong>Sports &amp; Outdoor Recreation</strong></h3><p><strong>Tennis Court</strong></p><p><strong>Squash Court</strong></p><p><strong>Basketball Court</strong></p><p><strong>Badminton Court</strong></p><p><strong>Cricket Practice Pitch</strong></p><p><strong>Skating Rink</strong></p><p><strong>Kids’ Play Area</strong></p><p><strong>Jogging and Cycling Tracks</strong><br>Well-paved paths winding through landscaped areas.</p><h3><strong>Lifestyle &amp; Leisure Amenities</strong></h3><p><strong>Grand Clubhouse</strong><br>A social hub with indoor games, lounges, and banquet space.</p><p><strong>Multipurpose Hall / Party Lawn</strong><br>For hosting community events, gatherings, and celebrations.</p><p><strong>Amphitheatre</strong><br>For open-air performances and cultural events.</p><p><strong>Indoor Games Room</strong><br>Featuring billiards, table tennis, carrom, and chess.</p><h3><strong>Green &amp; Sustainable Features</strong></h3><p><strong>90% Open Area</strong><br>Designed with lush landscaping, water features, and sit-outs.</p><p><strong>Eco-Friendly Infrastructure</strong><br>Includes rainwater harvesting, energy-efficient lighting, and waste segregation.</p><p><strong>Dedicated Pet Area</strong> <i>(where permitted)</i></p><p><strong>Senior Citizen Zone</strong><br>Quiet spaces with seating, shade, and easy access paths.</p><h3><strong>Convenience &amp; Daily Needs</strong></h3><p><strong>On-site Convenience Store</strong></p><p><strong>Daycare / Creche Facility</strong></p><p><strong>Café / Snack Bar</strong></p><p><strong>Library / Reading Room</strong> <i>(in select towers or club zones)</i></p><h3><strong>Security &amp; Smart Living</strong></h3><p><strong>24x7 Manned Security &amp; CCTV Surveillance</strong></p><p><strong>Video Door Phone &amp; Intercom System</strong></p><p><strong>Boom Barriers &amp; Smart Card Access</strong></p><p><strong>Fire Fighting System &amp; Sprinklers on Every Floor</strong></p><p><strong>High-Speed Elevators with Power Backup</strong></p><h3><strong>Parking &amp; Accessibility</strong></h3><p><strong>Basement and Stilt Parking</strong><br>Ample space for residents and guests.</p><p><strong>EV Charging Points</strong> <i>(future-ready infrastructure)</i></p><p><strong>Wheelchair-Accessible Ramps &amp; Lifts</strong><br>Ensuring inclusivity for the elderly and differently-abled.</p>', 0, 1, 312, '', '', '', '300525015958serenity-brochure-curve-36-pages-FINAL (3).pdf', '', '', '', '<h2><strong>Discover Chintels Serenity: Your Dream Home Awaits in Gurgaon’s Sector 109 on Dwarka Expressway</strong></h2><p>Welcome to Chintels Serenity, where your dream home becomes a reality in the heart of Gurgaon’s Sector 109 along the vibrant Dwarka Expressway. Imagine waking up to expansive green landscapes and modern amenities that blend seamlessly with luxurious living. This exceptional residential enclave offers more than just a home; it promises a lifestyle filled with comfort and elegance. With thoughtfully designed apartments and unmatched accessibility to key locations, Chintels Serenity is perfect for families seeking a harmonious balance of tranquility and urban convenience. Whether you’re enjoying a sunny afternoon at the landscaped gardens or discussing plans in the state-of-the-art clubhouse, every moment here is crafted to elevate your living experience. Discover how this idyllic community can offer you not just a house but a place to truly call home. Your future begins at Chintels Serenity, where every corner speaks of quality and sophistication. Don’t just dream about it—experience it!</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><th><h3><strong>Unit</strong></h3></th><td><h3><strong>Unit Size</strong></h3></td></tr><tr><th>3 BHK + SERVANT ROOM</th><td>1590 TO 2375 SQ.FT</td></tr><tr><th>4 BHK + SERVANT ROOM</th><td>2925 SQ.FT</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Discover Chintels Serenity in Sector 109, Gurgaon—a luxurious residential project offering modern living with unparalleled connectivity and world-class amenities.</h3><p>Project Overview</p><ul><li><strong>Developer</strong>: Chintels India</li><li><strong>Location</strong>: Sector 109, Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram, Haryana</li><li><strong>Project Type</strong>: High-rise residential apartments</li><li><strong>Total Units</strong>: Approximately 450</li><li><strong>Configuration</strong>: <strong>3 BHK + Servant Room, 4 BHK + Servant Room</strong></li><li><strong>Possession Status</strong>: Ready to move in</li><li><strong>RERA Registration</strong>: Yes, RERA No. GGM/307/39/2019/01</li><li><strong>Land Area</strong>: 18 acres</li><li><strong>Towers</strong>: 9 towers with 20 floors each</li><li><strong>Completion</strong>: Phase 1 completed; Phase 2 structure complete</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Overview of Gurgaon’s Sector 109</strong></h3><p><strong>Sector 109</strong> is a rapidly developing residential and commercial hub in <strong>Gurugram (Gurgaon), Haryana</strong>, strategically located along the <a href=\"https://a2prealtech.com/blog_detail/dwarka-expressway-luxury-projects.php\"><strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong></a>. It is emerging as a prime real estate destination due to its connectivity, upcoming infrastructure, and modern urban planning.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Location &amp; Connectivity</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Dwarka Expressway Access</strong>: Directly connected via the 150-meter-wide Dwarka Expressway, also known as the Northern Peripheral Road (NPR).</li><li><strong>Proximity to Delhi</strong>: Shares its boundary with <strong>Dwarka Sector 21</strong>, making it ideal for professionals commuting to Delhi.</li><li><strong>Distance to IGI Airport</strong>: Approximately <strong>20 minutes</strong> by car.</li><li><strong>Metro Connectivity</strong>: Proposed <strong>Dwarka-Gurgaon metro corridor</strong> will enhance accessibility.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Real Estate Development</strong></p><ul><li>Sector 109 hosts several mid- to high-end <strong>residential projects</strong>, including:<ul><li><strong>Chintels Serenity</strong></li><li><strong>ATS Tourmaline</strong></li><li><strong>Sobha International City</strong></li><li><strong>Raheja Atharva</strong></li></ul></li><li>Properties range from <strong>luxury apartments and penthouses</strong> to <strong>villas and builder floors</strong>.</li><li><strong>RERA-approved projects</strong> with modern amenities are common, attracting both homebuyers and investors.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Social Infrastructure</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Schools</strong>: The Delhi Public School, Euro International School, and others are within easy reach.</li><li><strong>Hospitals</strong>: Columbia Asia Hospital, Metro Hospital, and Medeor Hospital are accessible.</li><li><strong>Retail &amp; Entertainment</strong>: Proximity to malls like <strong>Ambience Mall</strong>, <strong>Dwarka City Centre</strong>, and upcoming shopping complexes along the expressway.</li><li><strong>Green Spaces</strong>: Landscaped parks, wide roads, and low-density planning contribute to a cleaner, more organized neighborhood.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Advantages of Sector 109</strong></p><ul><li>Excellent connectivity to <strong>Delhi NCR</strong></li><li>Rising property value due to infrastructure projects</li><li>Close to business hubs like <strong>Cyber City</strong> and <strong>Udyog Vihar</strong></li><li>Gated communities with top-notch security and lifestyle amenities</li><li>Suitable for <strong>both investment and end-use</strong></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Things to Consider</strong></p><ul><li>Some areas may still be under development, including parts of internal roads and drainage systems.</li><li>Construction noise or traffic congestion might occur during peak project activity.</li></ul><h3>The Significance of <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> (Northern Peripheral Road - NPR)</h3><p>The <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> is one of the most transformative infrastructure projects in the Delhi NCR region, designed to ease congestion, boost real estate, and enhance regional connectivity.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Length</strong>: ~29 kilometers</li><li><strong>Route</strong>: Connects <strong>Dwarka (Delhi)</strong> to <strong>Gurgaon (Haryana)</strong>, terminating at <strong>Kherki Daula Toll Plaza</strong> on NH-48.</li><li><strong>States Covered</strong>: Delhi and Haryana</li><li><strong>Structure</strong>: 8-lane, grade-separated expressway with service roads, underpasses, and flyovers.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Key Benefits &amp; Significance</strong></h3><h4>1. <strong>Decongestion of NH-48</strong></h4><ul><li>Eases heavy traffic between Delhi and Gurgaon, offering an alternative to NH-48 (Delhi–Jaipur Highway).</li><li>Especially useful for commuters from South Delhi, West Delhi, and Dwarka.</li></ul><h4>2. <strong>Boost to Real Estate Development</strong></h4><ul><li>Sparked rapid urbanization and high-end residential projects in sectors along the expressway (e.g., Sectors 109–113, 82–115 in Gurgaon).</li><li>Home to premium projects like Sobha International City, ATS Tourmaline, and Chintels Serenity.</li></ul><h4>3. <strong>Enhanced Connectivity</strong></h4><ul><li>Seamless link between <strong>IGI Airport</strong>, <strong>Dwarka Sub-City</strong>, <strong>Gurgaon</strong>, and <strong>Manesar</strong>.</li><li>Future integration with the <strong>Dwarka Metro</strong> and <strong>Delhi Metro Phase 4</strong> will further enhance accessibility.</li></ul><h4>4. <strong>Economic Impact</strong></h4><ul><li>Unlocks potential for commercial hubs, IT parks, hospitality, and logistics zones.</li><li>Promotes Gurgaon as a more livable and business-friendly destination.</li></ul><h4>5. <strong>Smart Urban Planning</strong></h4><ul><li>Designed with wide green belts, stormwater drainage, LED street lighting, and underground utilities.</li><li>Promotes sustainable growth and urban aesthetics.</li></ul><h3><strong>Architectural Features of Chintels Serenity</strong></h3><p><strong>Architectural Highlights</strong></p><ul><li><strong>High-Rise Towers with Open Layouts</strong>: The development comprises nine 20-story towers, each designed with only two apartments per floor. This configuration ensures maximum privacy and unobstructed views.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Stilted Design for Open Spaces</strong>: All buildings are elevated on stilts, allowing for expansive green areas beneath. These spaces are utilized for recreational activities, children\'s play zones, and elderly seating areas, fostering a community-centric atmosphere.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Continuous Balconies</strong>: Each apartment features continuous balconies that wrap around the building, providing panoramic views and enhancing natural ventilation. These balconies face south to maximize sunlight exposure, creating a bright and airy living environment.</li><li><strong>Centralized Pedestrian Pathways</strong>: The layout prioritizes pedestrian movement by centralizing walkways and minimizing vehicular interference. This design promotes a safe and tranquil environment within the complex.</li><li><strong>Water Features and Artistic Elements</strong>: The entrance is accentuated by a waterfall that descends from the clubhouse to the basement, adding a calming auditory and visual element to the space.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Interior Specifications</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Living and Dining Areas</strong>: Floors are adorned with imported marble, and walls are finished with smooth surfaces and acrylic emulsion paint, creating an elegant ambiance.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Bedrooms</strong>: High-quality laminated wooden flooring complements the smooth wall finishes, with modular wardrobes providing ample storage.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Kitchens</strong>: Equipped with premium modular setups, granite countertops, stainless steel sinks, and branded CP fittings, ensuring functionality and style&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Bathrooms</strong>: Imported marble or anti-skid ceramic tiles line the floors, with ceramic tile dado and oil-bound distemper on walls. Premium sanitary ware and shower enclosures in master bathrooms enhance luxury.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Balconies</strong>: Anti-skid ceramic tiles ensure safety, while MS railings with handrails provide security and aesthetic appeal.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Doors and Windows</strong>: Interior doors feature high-quality hardwood frames with flush/moulded shutters, while external openings are made of aluminum powder-coated materials for durability and minimal maintenance.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp;Sustainable Design Features</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Rainwater Harvesting</strong>: Percolation pits are incorporated to recharge the groundwater table, promoting environmental sustainability.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Energy-Efficient Systems</strong>: The use of VRV air conditioning systems in all bedrooms, living, and dining areas ensures energy efficiency and optimal comfort.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Fire Safety Measures</strong>: The complex is equipped with wet risers, hydrants on all floors, automatic sprinklers, and smoke/heat detectors, ensuring the safety of all residents</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Amenities and Facilities at Chintels Serenity, Sector 109, Gurgaon</strong></h3><p>Chintels Serenity is designed to provide a luxurious, secure, and community-oriented lifestyle. Here’s a detailed look at the <strong>amenities and facilities</strong> that make this residential project stand out:</p><p><strong>Clubhouse &amp; Recreation</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Fully Equipped Clubhouse</strong><br>Includes indoor games, lounges, and meeting areas.</li><li><strong>Gymnasium</strong><br>State-of-the-art fitness center with cardio and weight training equipment.</li><li><strong>Swimming Pool</strong><br>Outdoor pool with separate kids’ pool and poolside deck.</li><li><strong>Indoor Games Room</strong><br>Billiards, table tennis, carrom, and chess.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Sports &amp; Outdoor Facilities</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Tennis Court</strong></li><li><strong>Basketball Court</strong></li><li><strong>Badminton Court</strong></li><li><strong>Squash Court</strong></li><li><strong>Jogging Track</strong><br>Landscaped path for morning walks and running.</li><li><strong>Cycling Track</strong><br>Dedicated lane for bicycles within the premises.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Green and Open Spaces</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Landscaped Gardens</strong><br>Designed with walkways, water features, and seasonal flora.</li><li><strong>90% Open Area</strong><br>Ensures ample breathing space and reduces congestion.</li><li><strong>Yoga and Meditation Zones</strong></li><li><strong>Children’s Play Area</strong><br>Safe, secure, and age-appropriate equipment.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Convenience &amp; Lifestyle</strong></p><ul><li><strong>On-site Convenience Store</strong></li><li><strong>Café &amp; Restaurant</strong></li><li><strong>Creche / Daycare Facility</strong></li><li><strong>Amphitheater</strong><br>For community events and cultural performances.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Safety &amp; Security</strong></p><ul><li><strong>24x7 Security Surveillance</strong><br>With CCTV coverage and manned security gates.</li><li><strong>Video Door Phones &amp; Intercom</strong></li><li><strong>Smart Card Access</strong><br>For residents and controlled visitor entry.</li><li><strong>Fire Safety Systems</strong><br>Including sprinklers, smoke detectors, and hydrants on each floor.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Utilities &amp; Services</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Power Backup</strong><br>100% backup for common areas and apartments.</li><li><strong>High-Speed Elevators</strong><br>With power backup and service elevator in each tower.</li><li><strong>Waste Management System</strong></li><li><strong>Water Treatment Plant &amp; Rainwater Harvesting</strong></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Parking &amp; Accessibility</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Basement and Stilt Parking</strong><br>With designated slots for residents and visitors.</li><li><strong>Wheelchair Accessibility</strong><br>Ramps and lifts ensure ease of access for the elderly and differently-abled.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Community Living</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Event Lawn &amp; Banquet Space</strong></li><li><strong>Senior Citizen Zones</strong></li><li><strong>Library / Reading Room</strong> <i>(in select towers or clubhouse zones)</i></li></ul><h3>Lifestyle and Community Experience at <strong>Chintels Serenity</strong>, Sector 109, Gurgaon</h3><p><strong>Chintels Serenity</strong> offers more than just luxurious apartments—it’s a lifestyle destination that blends modern comforts, vibrant community living, and serene surroundings to deliver a well-rounded, fulfilling experience for residents.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Key Lifestyle Features</strong></h3><h4><strong>Spacious, Thoughtful Living</strong></h4><ul><li>Low-density layout with <strong>only two apartments per floor</strong> ensures privacy and peace.</li><li>Large balconies and expansive interiors create a bright, airy atmosphere.</li><li>Smart features like <strong>VRV air-conditioning</strong>, modular kitchens, and premium finishes enhance comfort.</li></ul><h4><strong>Tranquil, Green Environment</strong></h4><ul><li>Over <strong>90% open green spaces</strong> with landscaped gardens, water bodies, and shaded walkways.</li><li>Pedestrian-friendly zones and minimal vehicular intrusion support a calm, pollution-free setting.</li><li>Yoga lawns, meditation corners, and wellness zones encourage a mindful lifestyle.</li></ul><h4><strong>Luxury with Functionality</strong></h4><ul><li>Residents enjoy high-end interiors—<strong>imported marble</strong>, wooden flooring, and stylish fittings.</li><li>Continuous balconies provide stunning views and promote natural light and ventilation.</li><li>Smart-card access and video intercom systems add a layer of security and sophistication.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Community Engagement &amp; Social Life</strong></h3><h4><strong>Inclusive, Family-Friendly Culture</strong></h4><ul><li>Regular community events, sports tournaments, and festival celebrations foster neighborly bonds.</li><li>Safe, vibrant spaces for children (playgrounds, indoor activity zones) encourage outdoor play and learning.</li><li><strong>Senior citizen zones</strong> and quiet seating areas promote intergenerational interaction.</li></ul><h4><strong>Vibrant Social Amenities</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>Clubhouse activities</strong> such as yoga sessions, reading clubs, or hobby groups create daily engagement opportunities.</li><li><strong>Amphitheater</strong> and lawns host cultural events and community gatherings.</li></ul><h4><strong>Health &amp; Wellness Focus</strong></h4><ul><li>Full-fledged <strong>fitness center</strong>, jogging and cycling tracks support an active lifestyle.</li><li><strong>Swimming pool</strong>, tennis courts, and other facilities encourage residents to stay fit and connected.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Convenience at Your Doorstep</strong></h3><ul><li>On-site <strong>grocery store</strong>, café, daycare center, and salon reduce the need to travel far for everyday needs.</li><li>Nearby top-rated <strong>schools, hospitals, and malls</strong> on Dwarka Expressway add to the ease of daily life.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Safe, Gated Living</strong></h3><ul><li>24x7 <strong>CCTV surveillance</strong> and manned security ensure peace of mind.</li><li>Community-specific WhatsApp groups and apps help with issue reporting, event notifications, and resident engagement.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Resident Feedback Snapshot</strong></h3><p>“Living here feels peaceful, green, and secure. The community is warm and active—there’s always something going on for kids and adults alike.”<br>— Resident of Tower 5</p><p>“The layout is amazing—wide balconies, lots of light, and so much green space. It really feels like a retreat in the middle of the city.”<br>— Family in a 3BHK + Servant Unit</p><h3>Investment Potential in <strong>Gurgaon Real Estate</strong> (2025 Overview)</h3><p>Gurgaon (Gurugram) continues to be one of the most lucrative real estate markets in India, particularly for residential and commercial investors. With rapid infrastructure upgrades, policy support, and a strong economic base, it offers both short-term gains and long-term appreciation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Why Gurgaon Is a Prime Investment Destination</strong></h3><h4>1. <strong>Strategic Location</strong></h4><ul><li>Proximity to <strong>Delhi</strong>, <strong>Indira Gandhi International Airport</strong>, and <strong>Cyber City</strong></li><li>Excellent connectivity via <strong>NH-48</strong>, <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, <strong>KMP Expressway</strong>, and upcoming <strong>Metro corridors</strong></li></ul><h4>2. <strong>Economic Hub</strong></h4><ul><li>Headquarters for <strong>Fortune 500 companies</strong>, MNCs, and tech startups</li><li>Strong presence of IT/ITeS, BFSI, consulting, and manufacturing industries</li><li>Rapid commercial development in <strong>Golf Course Road</strong>, <strong>Cyber Hub</strong>, and <strong>Udyog Vihar</strong></li></ul><h4>3. <strong>Infrastructure Growth</strong></h4><ul><li>Completion of <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> is unlocking new growth corridors (like Sector 109, 113, and 102)</li><li>Upcoming <strong>Metro expansions</strong>, <strong>Global City project</strong>, and <strong>urban redevelopment</strong> plans</li><li>Improvement in social infrastructure: schools, hospitals, malls, and entertainment centers</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Nearby Attractions &amp; Connectivity of Chintels Serenity</strong>, Sector 109, Gurgaon</h3><p>Located in the heart of <strong>Sector 109 on the Dwarka Expressway</strong>, Chintels Serenity enjoys <strong>exceptional connectivity</strong> and is surrounded by urban conveniences, making it a well-connected and lifestyle-rich residential address.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Connectivity Highlights</strong></h3><h4><strong>Road Access</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>Dwarka Expressway (NPR)</strong>: Direct frontage, providing fast access to Delhi and major Gurgaon sectors.</li><li><strong>NH-48 (Delhi-Jaipur Highway)</strong>: Easily accessible via alternate routes.</li><li><strong>150-meter-wide internal roads</strong> ensure smooth traffic flow within the area.</li></ul><h4><strong>Air Travel</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>Indira Gandhi International (IGI) Airport</strong>:<br>~20 minutes via Dwarka Expressway – ideal for frequent flyers and NRIs.</li></ul><h4><strong>Metro Connectivity (Upcoming &amp; Proposed)</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>Dwarka Sector 21 Metro Station</strong>: Closest operational station (~20 minutes).</li><li><strong>Proposed Gurgaon-Dwarka Metro Line</strong>: Will pass nearby, enhancing last-mile connectivity.</li><li><strong>Delhi Metro Blue Line &amp; Airport Express Line</strong>: Will further integrate Sector 109 with the NCR Metro network.</li></ul><h4><strong>Public Transport</strong></h4><ul><li>Bus stops and shared autos are available for local travel; Uber/Ola services are frequent in the area.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Nearby Sectors &amp; Landmarks</strong></h3><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Location/Sector</th><th>Distance (Approx.)</th><th>Highlights</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Sector 113</strong></td><td>2–3 km</td><td>DLF luxury projects, commercial growth</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sector 104</strong></td><td>2 km</td><td>Retail spaces, restaurants, shopping zones</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dwarka Sector 21</strong></td><td>6–8 km</td><td>Metro station, DDA parks</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cyber City</strong></td><td>12–15 km</td><td>IT &amp; business hub</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ambience Mall</strong></td><td>15 minutes</td><td>High-end shopping, dining, and entertainment</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Palam Vihar</strong></td><td>10 minutes</td><td>Schools, hospitals, local markets</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Golf Course Road</strong></td><td>25 minutes</td><td>Upscale dining, clubs, premium offices</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Schools &amp; Education Nearby</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Delhi Public School (DPS), Sector 102</strong></li><li><strong>Euro International School</strong></li><li><strong>GEMS International School</strong></li><li><strong>Imperial Heritage School</strong></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Healthcare Facilities</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Columbia Asia Hospital</strong>, Palam Vihar</li><li><strong>Metro Hospital</strong>, Sector 1</li><li><strong>Signature Hospital</strong>, Sector 37D</li><li><strong>Medeor Hospital</strong>, Sector 14</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Retail &amp; Entertainment</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>SS Highpoint Mall</strong>, Sector 86</li><li><strong>Ansals Townwalk</strong>, Sector 104</li><li><strong>Dwarka City Centre Mall</strong></li><li>Cafés, supermarkets, and convenience stores within a 2–3 km radius</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Spiritual &amp; Cultural Places</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>ISKCON Dwarka</strong></li><li><strong>Sheetla Mata Mandir</strong>, Sector 6</li><li><strong>Sai Ka Angan Temple</strong>, Sushant Lok</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Summary: Why Location Matters</h3><p>Chintels Serenity offers:</p><ul><li>Quick airport access</li><li>Seamless Delhi-Gurgaon connectivity</li><li>Proximity to workplaces, schools, hospitals, and malls</li></ul><h3>Resident Testimonials for <strong>Chintels Serenity</strong>, Sector 109, Gurgaon</h3><p>Chintels Serenity in Sector 109, Gurgaon, has garnered a mix of feedback from its residents. Here\'s a consolidated overview of their experiences:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>Positive Aspects Highlighted by Residents</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: Residents appreciate the project\'s proximity to major roads and business hubs. One resident noted, \"The location is incredibly convenient with all amenities nearby.\"</li><li><strong>Amenities</strong>: The society offers a range of facilities, including a clubhouse, swimming pool, squash court, and sports areas. A resident mentioned, \"The basic amenities provided are a club, swimming pool, squash court, spa &amp; saloon, and various sports courts.\"&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Community Environment</strong>: Many residents find the community to be friendly and cooperative, fostering a positive living atmosphere.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>Areas for Improvement</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>Maintenance Response Time</strong>: Some residents have expressed concerns about the time taken to resolve maintenance issues. One tenant shared, \"Maintenance issues often take time to solve, which poses a significant drawback.\"&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Clubhouse Accessibility</strong>: There are requests for extended hours of operation for the clubhouse to accommodate residents\' schedules.</li><li><strong>Pet Policy</strong>: A strict no-pet policy in certain areas has been a point of contention for pet owners.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>Resident Experiences</strong></h4><ul><li><strong>Kavitamalik (Tenant)</strong>: \"Connectivity-wise, the location is incredibly convenient with all amenities nearby. The society boasts a range of amenities, and the residents are generally friendly and cooperative.\"</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Riya Mehta (Owner)</strong>: \"The walking path is outstanding in the society, and connectivity is also good. However, the opening time for the clubhouse should be increased, and I sometimes face leakage issues on walls.\"&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Shailesh (Owner)</strong>: \"It has launched a residential complex that is totally budget-friendly. The basic amenities provided are a club, swimming pool, squash court, spa &amp; saloon, cricket practice area, pool game area, basketball, football court, skating area, tennis court, badminton court, and kids play area.\"</li></ul><h3>Why <strong>Chintels Serenity</strong> Is Your Ideal Home in Sector 109, Gurgaon</h3><p>If you\'re seeking a home that combines <strong>luxury, comfort, community, and connectivity</strong>, <strong>Chintels Serenity</strong> delivers on every front. Strategically located on <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong> in Sector 109, this premium residential project is designed for modern families, working professionals, and long-term investors alike.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Top Reasons to Choose Chintels Serenity</strong></h3><h4>1. <strong>Prime Location</strong></h4><ul><li>Directly on <strong>Dwarka Expressway</strong>, offering smooth connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, and Cyber City.</li><li>Upcoming metro link and proximity to key Gurgaon sectors enhance long-term accessibility.</li></ul><h4>2. <strong>Architectural Excellence</strong></h4><ul><li>Designed by acclaimed firm <strong>Design Forum International</strong>.</li><li>Only <strong>two apartments per floor</strong> for greater privacy and natural light.</li><li>Continuous balconies, open layouts, and stilted towers for green space utilization.</li></ul><h4>3. <strong>Lush &amp; Open Living</strong></h4><ul><li>Over <strong>90% open area</strong> with landscaped gardens, jogging tracks, and pedestrian-friendly pathways.</li><li>Water features and green buffers create a calm, resort-like atmosphere.</li></ul><h4>4. <strong>Comprehensive Amenities</strong></h4><ul><li>Clubhouse, gym, swimming pool, tennis, squash, and badminton courts.</li><li>Kids’ play areas, senior citizen zones, yoga lawns, and indoor games.</li><li>Convenience stores, café, and daycare within the complex.</li></ul><h4>5. <strong>Safety &amp; Sustainability</strong></h4><ul><li>Gated community with <strong>24/7 security</strong>, CCTV, and access control.</li><li><strong>Rainwater harvesting</strong>, VRV air-conditioning, and energy-efficient systems.</li><li>Fire safety measures and waste management for sustainable living.</li></ul><h4>6. <strong>Community-Centric Lifestyle</strong></h4><ul><li>Active residential association with festivals, fitness clubs, and hobby groups.</li><li>Inclusive vibe with family-friendly spaces and quiet zones for relaxation.</li><li>Resident reviews highlight <strong>friendliness, open space, and peaceful environment</strong>.</li></ul><h4>7. <strong>Investment Potential</strong></h4><ul><li>Sector 109 is one of the fastest-growing corridors due to Dwarka Expressway completion.</li><li>Strong rental demand from professionals working in Delhi and Gurgaon.</li><li>High appreciation prospects in a regulated, RERA-compliant market.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Booking a unit at <strong>Chintels Serenity</strong>, Sector 109, Gurgaon, through <strong>A2P Realtech Pvt. Ltd.</strong> is a straightforward process. Here\'s a step-by-step guide to assist you:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>1. Initial Consultation with A2P Realtech</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Contact Information</strong>:<ul><li><strong>Company</strong>: A2P Realtech Pvt. Ltd.</li><li><strong>Websites : </strong><a href=\"https://a2prealtech.com/\"><strong>https://a2prealtech.com/</strong></a></li></ul></li><li><strong>Schedule a Meeting</strong>: Reach out to A2P Realtech to schedule a site visit and discuss available units, pricing, and payment plans.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>2. Site Visit and Unit Selection</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Visit the Site</strong>: Tour the Chintels Serenity project to view available units and assess the amenities.</li><li><strong>Select Your Unit</strong>: Choose from the available 3 and 4 BHK apartments in Phase I (Ready to Move-In) or Phase II (Under Construction).</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>3. Sign the Agreement</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Agreement of Sale</strong>: Once the payment plan is finalized, A2P Realtech will assist you in signing the Agreement of Sale with Chintels India Ltd.</li><li><strong>Stamp Duty</strong>: Pay the applicable stamp duty as per Haryana state regulations.</li></ul><p><strong>4. Contact A2P Realtech</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Reach Out</strong>: Contact A2P Realtech to initiate the booking process and receive personalized assistance.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3505.848942438308!2d77.00190947616123!3d28.51419218944373!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d10ab2ffad34d%3A0x9562201972482dba!2sChintels%20Serenity!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1748612848346!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 109 on Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'A2L214XE', 19, 'Discover Chintels Serenity: Your Dream Home Awaits in Gurgaon’s Sector 109 on Dwarka Expressway', 'Chintels Serenity,Dwarka Expressway, 3BHK, 4 BHK, Sector 109, Ready to Move, A2P Realtech ', 'Welcome to Chintels Serenity, where your dream home becomes a reality in the heart of Gurgaon’s Sector 109 along the vibrant Dwarka Expressway. Imagine waking up to expansive green landscapes and modern amenities that blend seamlessly with luxurious living. This exceptional residential enclave offers more than just a home; it promises a lifestyle filled with comfort and elegance. With thoughtfully designed apartments and unmatched accessibility to key locations, Chintels Serenity is perfect for families seeking a harmonious balance of tranquility and urban convenience. Whether you’re enjoying a sunny afternoon at the landscaped gardens or discussing plans in the state-of-the-art clubhouse, every moment here is crafted to elevate your living experience. Discover how this idyllic community can offer you not just a house but a place to truly call home. Your future begins at Chintels Serenity, where every corner speaks of quality and sophistication. Don’t just dream about it—experience it!', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(211, 'Book Your Commercial Construction with A2P Realtech', '030625094659Commercial-Construction-A2P-Realtech.jpg', '<h2 data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"225\">Luxury Amenities for Commercial Construction</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"279\">Elevate Your Business Space with Premium Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"558\">At <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"300\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we understand that luxury and functionality go hand-in-hand to create commercial spaces that impress clients, inspire employees, and stand out in the market. Here&rsquo;s a curated list of luxury amenities you can include in your commercial construction package:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"563\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"605\">&nbsp;Architectural &amp; Design Features</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<li data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n<p data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"668\">Grand entrance lobbies with designer flooring and lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"723\">Double-height ceilings and expansive glass fa&ccedil;ades</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"826\">\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"826\">Custom fa&ccedil;ade treatments: stone cladding, aluminum composite panels (ACP), and LED accent lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"892\">\r\n<p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"892\">Smart automated access and security systems (biometric, RFID)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n<p data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"953\">Concierge desks and reception areas with modern aesthetics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"958\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"994\">Advanced Building Systems</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1348\">\r\n<li data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<p data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1077\">Intelligent Building Management Systems (BMS) for lighting, HVAC, and security</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1156\">High-speed elevators with smart control panels and energy-efficient drives</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1216\">State-of-the-art fire detection and suppression systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1282\">Advanced HVAC with air purification and climate control zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1348\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1348\">Integrated CCTV surveillance and remote monitoring capabilities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1353\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1383\">Interior Amenities</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1718\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1458\">Premium flooring options: marble, granite, hardwood, or designer tiles</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1523\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1523\">Modular office partitions with soundproofing and glass walls</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1584\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1584\">Smart lighting systems with adjustable ambiance settings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1658\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1658\">High-quality washrooms with sensor-based fixtures and luxury finishes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1718\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1718\">Custom break rooms and pantry areas with premium fittings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1768\">Outdoor &amp; Common Area Enhancements</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"2055\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1829\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1829\">Landscaped gardens and green terraces with seating areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1879\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1879\">Rooftop lounges or cafes with panoramic views</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1944\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1944\">Outdoor parking with EV charging stations and valet services</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"2009\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2009\">Jogging tracks or wellness zones within commercial complexes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2055\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2055\">Outdoor digital signage and branding spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2106\">Wellness &amp; Lifestyle Facilities</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2369\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2164\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2164\">On-site gyms with modern equipment and wellness rooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2228\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2228\">Dedicated meditation or quiet zones for employee relaxation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2300\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2300\">Cafeterias offering healthy food options and smart vending machines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2369\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2369\">Childcare centers or daycare facilities within commercial premises</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2374\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2410\">Technology &amp; Connectivity</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2475\">High-speed fiber optic internet connectivity and Wi-Fi zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2546\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2546\">Conference rooms equipped with video conferencing and smart boards</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2606\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2606\">Smart energy management systems for optimal power usage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2668\">Automated parking management with app-based slot allocation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2673\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2743\">Build a Commercial Space That Defines Excellence and Innovation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2894\">Contact <strong data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2768\">A2P Realtech</strong> today to customize your luxury commercial construction package and create a workspace that impresses, motivates, and endures.</p>', 0, 1, 320, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p>When it comes to commercial construction, choosing the right partner can make all the difference. <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> stands out in the bustling industry, offering a blend of innovation and reliability that ensures your project is not just another build, but a foundation for your success. With a dedicated team of professionals adept in the latest construction techniques and project management practices, A2P Realtech takes your vision and turns it into reality. Whether you\'re planning a sleek office space, a dynamic retail environment, or a state-of-the-art facility, we are committed to exceeding your expectations from concept to completion. Discover how our collaborative approach and attention to detail can help you navigate the complexities of commercial construction with ease. Book your commercial construction project with A2P Realtech today, and let us build the future you envision!</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"253\">Book Your Commercial Construction with A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"298\">Built for Business. Designed for Growth.</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"509\">Whether you\'re constructing a retail space, office building, warehouse, or mixed-use facility, <strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"411\">A2P Realtech</strong> delivers commercial construction solutions that are <strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"508\">scalable, strategic, and success-focused</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"692\">With our expertise in commercial architecture, compliance, and turnkey delivery, we ensure your project meets both functional demands and business goals &mdash; <strong data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"692\">on time and on budget.</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"697\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"754\">Why Choose A2P Realtech for Commercial Projects?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"876\"><strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"791\">Customized Construction Plans</strong><br data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"794\">Tailored for your industry &mdash; from retail to hospitality, healthcare to education</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"999\"><strong data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"916\">Compliance &amp; Approval Assistance</strong><br data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"919\">Support for commercial plan sanctions, fire NOC, environmental clearance, etc.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1111\"><strong data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1031\">Strong Structural Design</strong><br data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1034\">Commercial-grade RCC, load-bearing analysis, and future expansion readiness</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1230\"><strong data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1150\">Modern Design &amp; Smart Utilities</strong><br data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1153\">Optimized layouts, fa&ccedil;ade engineering, lighting, HVAC, and automation ready</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1323\"><strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1257\">Transparent Costing</strong><br data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1260\">Detailed BOQ, clear terms, and milestone-based payment system</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1432\"><strong data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1351\">End-to-End Execution</strong><br data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1354\">From foundation to finish &mdash; including interiors, MEP, and signage installation</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1437\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1455\">&nbsp;We Build:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1495\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1495\">Retail Showrooms &amp; Franchise Spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1536\">Office Buildings &amp; Co-working Spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1576\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1576\">Clinics, Salons &amp; Education Centers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1613\">Warehouses &amp; Logistic Facilities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1656\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1656\">Mixed-Use Commercial Floors (G+2, G+3)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1705\">Hospitality Units (caf&eacute;s, restaurants, lodges)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1710\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1774\">What&rsquo;s Included in Our Commercial Construction Package:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1814\">Architectural &amp; structural drawings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1861\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1861\">Civil construction, plumbing &amp; electricals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1903\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1903\">HVAC ducting &amp; fire safety provisions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1957\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1957\">Custom fa&ccedil;ades with glass, ACP, or stone cladding</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2017\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2017\">Commercial-grade flooring, lighting &amp; branding elements</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2060\">Project supervision with quality control</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"246\">Overview of Commercial Construction Services</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"308\">By A2P Realtech &ndash; Where Business Meets Smart Construction</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"613\">At <strong data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"329\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we specialize in delivering <strong data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"407\">end-to-end commercial construction solutions</strong> for a wide range of industries. Our expertise lies in creating <strong data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"545\">functionally efficient, aesthetically modern, and regulatory-compliant</strong> commercial spaces that help businesses grow and operate seamlessly.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"784\">Whether you\'re planning a small retail outlet or a multi-level commercial complex, our team ensures <strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"757\">quality execution, transparent pricing</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"783\">on-time delivery</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"789\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"811\">&nbsp;What We Build</h3>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"850\"><strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"850\">Retail &amp; Showroom Spaces</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<li data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"911\">\r\n<p data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"911\">Branded outlets, flagship stores, and franchise fit-outs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<p data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"964\">Glass fa&ccedil;ade structures with signage integration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<p data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1020\">Optimal space planning for customer flow &amp; visibility</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1063\"><strong data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1063\">Office Buildings &amp; Workspaces</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1124\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1124\">Corporate offices, co-working hubs, and business centers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1182\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1182\">HVAC, networking, and modular partition-ready designs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1235\">Smart energy systems and ergonomic layout planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1274\"><strong data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1274\">Clinics &amp; Wellness Spaces</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1319\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1319\">Dental/medical clinics, salons, and spas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1403\">Hygienic construction with special MEP (Mechanical, Electrical, Plumbing) focus</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1450\">Compliant with local health and safety norms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1501\"><strong data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1501\">Educational &amp; Institutional Buildings</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1684\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1556\">Coaching centers, preschools, and training centers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1620\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1620\">Soundproof rooms, fire safety systems, ventilation planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1684\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1684\">Flexible layout for classrooms, admin zones, and common areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1733\"><strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1733\">Industrial &amp; Warehousing Facilities</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1894\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1796\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1796\">Warehouses, godowns, fabrication units, and logistics hubs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1835\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1835\">High load-bearing RCC construction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1894\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1894\">Ramps, loading docks, and ventilation for heavy-duty use</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1938\"><strong data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1938\">Hospitality &amp; Mixed-Use Spaces</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"2011\">Lodges, caf&eacute;s, small hotels, banquet halls, and commercial G+ floors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2075\">Integration of plumbing, kitchen ducting, and service zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2134\">Custom fa&ccedil;ade, branding elements, and exterior landscape</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2139\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2165\">&nbsp;Services We Offer</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2453\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2208\"><strong data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2206\">Feasibility Study &amp; Site Planning</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2250\"><strong data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2248\">Architectural &amp; Structural Design</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2291\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2291\"><strong data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2289\">Project Management &amp; Supervision</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2333\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2333\"><strong data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2331\">Electrical, Plumbing &amp; HVAC Works</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2375\"><strong data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2373\">Fire Safety &amp; Security Compliance</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2411\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2411\"><strong data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2409\">Interior Fit-Out (Optional)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2453\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2453\"><strong data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2453\">Landscaping &amp; Branding Installation</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2458\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2497\">Compliance &amp; Approvals Support</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2621\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2535\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2535\">Commercial building plan sanction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2573\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2573\">Fire NOC &amp; environment clearances</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2621\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2621\">Trade license assistance &amp; legal coordination</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2652\">&nbsp;Why A2P Realtech?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2905\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2697\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2697\">Dedicated engineers and project managers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2743\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2743\">Transparent BOQs and timeline commitments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2799\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2799\">Expert coordination with architects and consultants</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2846\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2846\">Quality workmanship with branded materials</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2905\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2905\">Smart, scalable designs tailored for your business goals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2910\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2957\">Let&rsquo;s Build What Your Business Deserves</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"3121\">Whether you own the land or are leasing a space, we offer <strong data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3050\">custom construction solutions</strong> designed to maximize your <strong data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3120\">ROI, functionality, and long-term value</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"3121\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"222\">Why Choose A2P Realtech for Your Project?</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"279\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Experience, Excellence, and Commitment You Can Trust</span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"493\">At <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"300\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we don&rsquo;t just build structures&mdash;we build relationships grounded in trust, transparency, and superior quality. Here&rsquo;s why clients consistently choose us as their preferred construction partner:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"498\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"551\">&nbsp;1. <strong data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"549\">Customized Solutions Tailored to You</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"718\">We understand that every project is unique. Whether residential or commercial, we offer flexible packages that align perfectly with your vision, budget, and timeline.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"769\">&nbsp;2. <strong data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"767\">End-to-End Project Management</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"931\">From initial consultation and site analysis to design, construction, and handover&mdash;we manage every phase, ensuring smooth communication and hassle-free execution.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"936\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"990\">&nbsp;3. <strong data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"988\">Transparent Pricing &amp; No Hidden Costs</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1142\">Our detailed quotations and milestone-based payment plans guarantee clarity and control over your investment, with no surprises or last-minute charges.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1147\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1201\">&nbsp;4. <strong data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1199\">Quality Materials &amp; Skilled Workforce</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1354\">We use only trusted brands and source premium materials, complemented by a team of trained engineers, architects, and craftsmen dedicated to excellence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1404\">&nbsp;5. <strong data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1402\">Timely Delivery &amp; Commitment</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1555\">We respect your time and investment. Our well-planned schedules and proactive supervision ensure projects are completed on or before agreed deadlines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1610\">&nbsp;6. <strong data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1608\">Compliance &amp; Regulatory Expertise</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1780\">Navigating approvals, permits, and legal requirements can be daunting. We simplify this by managing all compliance aspects, so your project stays smooth and stress-free.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1785\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1829\">7. <strong data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1827\">Sustainability &amp; Innovation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1983\">We integrate eco-friendly practices and smart technologies that add long-term value, reduce environmental impact, and enhance your property\'s efficiency.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2030\">&nbsp;8. <strong data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2028\">Post-Construction Support</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2183\">Our relationship doesn&rsquo;t end at handover. We provide ongoing support, warranty services, and maintenance options to keep your investment safe and sound.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2183\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"221\">Key Benefits of Working with A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"395\">Choosing <strong data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"248\">A2P Realtech</strong> means partnering with a construction company that puts your needs, quality, and satisfaction first. Here are the key advantages our clients enjoy:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"400\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"443\">1. <strong data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"441\">Personalized Custom Packages</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"574\">We tailor every project package to suit your specific requirements, preferences, and budget &mdash; no one-size-fits-all solutions here.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"579\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"619\">2. <strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"617\">Expert Project Management</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"743\">Our dedicated team ensures seamless coordination of all construction phases, keeping your project on track and hassle-free.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"748\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"803\">3. <strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"801\">Transparent Pricing &amp; Detailed Estimates</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"929\">With clear, milestone-based payment plans and no hidden costs, you stay fully informed and in control throughout the project.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"975\">4. <strong data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"973\">Superior Quality Assurance</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1084\">We use premium, certified materials and skilled craftsmen to deliver structures that stand the test of time.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1132\">5. <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1130\">Timely Completion Guaranteed</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1247\">Our disciplined scheduling and proactive supervision ensure your project is completed within the agreed timeframe.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1252\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1299\">6. <strong data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1297\">Comprehensive Regulatory Support</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1420\">We handle all necessary approvals and permits, minimizing delays and ensuring full compliance with local building codes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1425\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1480\">7. <strong data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1478\">Sustainable &amp; Energy-Efficient Solutions</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1601\">Incorporating eco-friendly practices and energy-saving technologies that reduce your carbon footprint and utility costs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1606\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1656\">8. <strong data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1654\">Post-Construction Service &amp; Support</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1770\">Our commitment extends beyond project completion &mdash; offering warranty coverage, maintenance, and customer support.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1775\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1832\">9. <strong data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1830\">Innovative Design &amp; Technology Integration</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1940\">From smart home systems to modern aesthetics, we bring the latest trends and technologies to your doorstep.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1945\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1997\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Build with Confidence. Build with A2P Realtech.</span></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"203\">The Commercial Construction Process Explained</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"276\">Step-by-Step Guide to Building Your Business Space with A2P Realtech</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"548\">Constructing a commercial building is a complex project that requires careful planning, expert execution, and continuous communication. At <strong data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"433\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we streamline this process to deliver high-quality, timely, and cost-effective commercial construction solutions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"553\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"612\">1. <strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"610\">Initial Consultation &amp; Project Understanding</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"786\">\r\n<li data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"676\">\r\n<p data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"676\">Discuss your business goals, space requirements, and budget</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"722\">\r\n<p data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"722\">Understand site details and project scope</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"786\">\r\n<p data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"786\">Outline the construction package options suited to your needs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"791\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"844\">2. <strong data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"842\">Site Assessment &amp; Feasibility Analysis</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<li data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"916\">\r\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"916\">Conduct detailed site surveys including soil testing and topography</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"991\">\r\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"991\">Check local zoning laws, building codes, and environmental regulations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1046\">Identify any challenges that may impact construction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1051\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1086\">3. <strong data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1084\">Design &amp; Engineering</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1154\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1154\">Develop architectural plans and 3D renderings for your approval</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1213\">Structural engineering to ensure safety and durability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1292\">MEP (Mechanical, Electrical, Plumbing) designs customized for commercial use</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1297\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1331\">4. <strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1329\">Approvals &amp; Permits</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1395\">Prepare and submit necessary documents to local authorities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1476\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1476\">Secure building permits, fire safety clearances, and environmental approvals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1536\">Coordinate with regulatory agencies for smooth compliance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1541\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1582\">5. <strong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1580\">Procurement &amp; Mobilization</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1642\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1642\">Source premium commercial-grade materials and equipment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1696\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1696\">Schedule timely delivery of resources to the site</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1743\">Prepare the site for construction activities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1748\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1781\">6. <strong data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1779\">Construction Phase</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"2010\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1820\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1820\">Groundbreaking and foundation work</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1874\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1874\">Structural framing including RCC work and masonry</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1953\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1953\">Installation of electrical wiring, plumbing, HVAC, and fire safety systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2010\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2010\">Frequent site inspections and quality assurance checks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2015\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2059\">7. <strong data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2057\">Interior &amp; Exterior Finishing</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2241\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2119\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2119\">Flooring, painting, ceiling work, and fa&ccedil;ade treatments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2194\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2194\">Fit-outs including partitions, lighting, signage, and security systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2241\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2241\">Landscaping and external works if applicable</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2246\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2287\">8. <strong data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2285\">Project Handover &amp; Support</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2474\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2356\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2356\">Final walkthrough with client and resolution of punch list items</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2421\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2421\">Delivery of compliance certificates, warranties, and manuals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2474\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2474\">Post-construction maintenance and support services</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2479\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2516\">Why Partner with A2P Realtech?</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2678\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2571\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2571\">Comprehensive expertise in commercial construction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2621\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2621\">Transparent communication and clear timelines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2678\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2678\">Commitment to quality, safety, and client satisfaction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"264\">Project Management and Coordination at A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"339\">Ensuring Your Construction Journey is Smooth, Transparent, and On-Time</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"664\">At <strong data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"360\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we understand that successful construction goes beyond just laying bricks&mdash;it requires expert project management and seamless coordination among all stakeholders. That&rsquo;s why we provide a comprehensive management system designed to keep your project on track, within budget, and aligned with your vision.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"669\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"709\">Our Project Management Approach</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"910\"><strong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"743\">1. Dedicated Project Manager</strong><br data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"746\">From day one, a skilled project manager is assigned to your project to oversee all activities, act as your single point of contact, and ensure smooth communication.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1079\"><strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"944\">2. Detailed Project Planning</strong><br data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"947\">We create realistic timelines and detailed schedules covering every phase&mdash;from design and procurement to construction and finishing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1236\"><strong data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1118\">3. Resource &amp; Vendor Coordination</strong><br data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1121\">Managing subcontractors, suppliers, and labor efficiently to guarantee material availability and on-time execution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1410\"><strong data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1279\">4. Quality Control &amp; Safety Oversight</strong><br data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1282\">Regular site inspections and strict adherence to safety protocols ensure top-quality workmanship and a safe working environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1562\"><strong data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1440\">5. Transparent Reporting</strong><br data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1443\">You receive regular updates on progress, milestones achieved, budget status, and any changes or challenges encountered.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1567\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1608\">&nbsp;Coordination Across Stakeholders</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1743\"><strong data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1624\">Clients:</strong> We keep you informed and involved through scheduled meetings, progress reports, and quick responses to your queries.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1847\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1847\"><strong data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1773\">Architects &amp; Engineers:</strong> Close collaboration to ensure design integrity and technical precision.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1953\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1953\"><strong data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1878\">Suppliers &amp; Contractors:</strong> Streamlined procurement and logistics to avoid delays and cost overruns.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2060\"><strong data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1983\">Regulatory Authorities:</strong> Timely submissions and compliance checks to clear approvals and inspections.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2065\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2089\">Benefits to You</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2520\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2174\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2174\"><strong data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2111\">Reduced Risks:</strong> Proactive identification and mitigation of potential issues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2261\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2261\"><strong data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2197\">Time Efficiency:</strong> Strict adherence to project timelines to avoid costly delays.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2335\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2335\"><strong data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2286\">Cost Transparency:</strong> Real-time tracking of expenses against budget.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2428\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2428\"><strong data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2360\">Quality Assurance:</strong> Consistent monitoring and quality checks throughout construction.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2520\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2520\"><strong data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2449\">Peace of Mind:</strong> A dedicated team focused on delivering your dream project hassle-free.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2525\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2600\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">&nbsp;Trust A2P Realtech to Manage Your Project with Precision and Care</span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2709\">We take pride in delivering projects that not only meet but exceed client expectations&mdash;on time, every time.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2709\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"207\">How to Get Started with A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"268\">Your Journey to a Dream Construction Project Begins Here</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"481\">Starting a construction project can feel overwhelming, but at <strong data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"348\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we make it simple and hassle-free. Follow these easy steps to kick off your residential or commercial construction with confidence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"486\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"516\">1. <strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"514\">Reach Out to Us</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"651\">Contact us via phone, email, or our website to schedule an initial consultation. Tell us about your project, requirements, and vision.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"656\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"701\">2. <strong data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"699\">Free Consultation &amp; Site Visit</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"845\">Our experts will visit your site to assess feasibility, discuss your goals, and explain available construction packages tailored to your needs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"905\">3. <strong data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"903\">Project Proposal &amp; Custom Package Design</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"1043\">Based on your input and site assessment, we create a detailed proposal outlining scope, timelines, cost estimates, and optional upgrades.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1048\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1088\">4. <strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1086\">Review &amp; Finalize Package</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1200\">We collaborate with you to refine the proposal, ensuring every detail aligns with your expectations and budget.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1205\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1247\">5. <strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1245\">Agreement &amp; Advance Booking</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1354\">Once finalized, sign the contract and pay the advance booking amount to confirm your project&rsquo;s start date.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1399\">6. <strong data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1397\">Design &amp; Approval Process</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1506\">Our architects and engineers develop detailed designs and help you obtain necessary approvals and permits.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1511\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1546\">7. <strong data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1544\">Construction Kickoff</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1665\">With plans approved and materials ready, our skilled team begins construction, keeping you updated at every milestone.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1717\">8. <strong data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1715\">Regular Updates &amp; Quality Checks</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1843\">You receive ongoing progress reports, site visits (if desired), and quality inspections to ensure the project stays on track.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1892\">9. <strong data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1890\">Project Completion &amp; Handover</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"2024\">After final inspections and finishing touches, we hand over your fully constructed property along with all necessary documentation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2029\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2070\">10. <strong data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2068\">Post-Construction Support</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2175\">Enjoy dedicated support with warranty services, maintenance advice, and assistance whenever you need it.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2180\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2221\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Ready to Build Your Dream Project?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2317\">Don&rsquo;t wait to bring your dream project to life. Reach out now for a <strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"798\">free consultation</strong> and discover how A2P Realtech can make your construction experience smooth, efficient, and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"1023\">&nbsp;</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3503.0806853061254!2d77.04727277616337!3d28.59735618567611!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1b8d7ee000e5%3A0x5a6f1f8f031ff9fb!2sA2P%20Realtech%20Private%20Limited!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'WI0ODZH8', 21, 'Book Your Commercial Construction with A2P Realtech', 'Commercial Construction, A2P Realtech, Office, Shop, Mall, Complexes, Warehouse', 'Commercial Construction: We specialize in building high-quality office spaces, retail shops, commercial complexes, and warehouses tailored to meet your business needs.', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(212, 'Book Your Renovation and Remodeling with A2P Realtech', '050625084403Home-Renovation-Services-A2P.jpg', '<h2 data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"330\"><strong data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"330\">Home Renovation Amenities</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"366\">Aesthetic &amp; Comfort Upgrades</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"674\">\r\n<li data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"408\">\r\n<p data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"408\">Modern flooring (hardwood, vinyl, tile)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"442\">\r\n<p data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"442\">Fresh interior &amp; exterior paint</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"498\">\r\n<p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"498\">Custom wall paneling, wallpaper, or textured finishes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"555\">\r\n<p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"555\">Ceiling treatments (coffered, tray, recessed lighting)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<p data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"590\">Energy-efficient windows &amp; doors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"643\">\r\n<p data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"643\">Smart home systems (lighting, thermostats, blinds)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"674\">\r\n<p data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"674\">High-efficiency HVAC systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"705\">&nbsp;Storage &amp; Organization</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"843\">\r\n<li data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"738\">\r\n<p data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"738\">Built-in cabinetry or shelving</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n<p data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"776\">Custom closets and wardrobe systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"808\">Under-stair storage solutions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"843\">\r\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"843\">Mudrooms with cubbies or lockers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"868\">&nbsp;Outdoor Features</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"1022\">\r\n<li data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"908\">\r\n<p data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"908\">Decks, patios, pergolas, and verandas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<p data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"941\">Outdoor kitchens and fire pits</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"977\">\r\n<p data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"977\">Landscaping and exterior lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1022\">\r\n<p data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1022\">Garage remodeling and EV charging stations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1027\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1081\"><strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1081\">Bathroom &amp; Kitchen Remodeling Amenities</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1107\">&nbsp;Kitchen Amenities</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1150\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1150\">Custom cabinetry with soft-close drawers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1191\">Quartz, granite, or marble countertops</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1233\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1233\">Central island with seating and storage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1282\">Pull-out pantries and corner cabinet solutions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1330\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1330\">Built-in appliances (fridge, oven, microwave)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1368\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1368\">Under-cabinet and recessed lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1402\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1402\">Backsplash with decorative tile</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1438\">Smart faucets and touchless sinks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1465\">Bathroom Amenities</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1505\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1505\">Walk-in showers with glass enclosures</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1539\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1539\">Freestanding or jetted bathtubs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1575\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1575\">Double vanity with stone counters</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1602\">In-floor radiant heating</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1623\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1623\">Heated towel racks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1660\">LED mirrors with anti-fog features</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1694\">Smart toilets and bidet systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1741\">Waterproof speakers or entertainment systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1746\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1790\"><strong data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1790\">Structural Alteration Amenities</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1825\">&nbsp;Load-Bearing Modifications</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"2018\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1874\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1874\">Open-concept living by removing interior walls</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1923\">Reinforced beams or columns (steel, LVL, wood)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1963\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1963\">Additional floors or loft conversions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2018\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2018\">Basement finishing with insulation and waterproofing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2061\">&nbsp;Room Additions &amp; Reconfigurations</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2212\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2091\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2091\">Home offices or flex spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2127\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2127\">In-law suites or guest apartments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2177\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2177\">Converting garages or attics into livable space</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2212\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2212\">Soundproofing walls and ceilings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2249\">&nbsp;Technical &amp; Utility Upgrades</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2488\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2302\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2302\">Rewiring for added circuits, outlets, and lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2359\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2359\">Upgraded plumbing lines for capacity or layout changes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2426\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2426\">Advanced home automation integration (security, lights, climate)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2488\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2488\">Enhanced insulation and envelope sealing for energy savings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 321, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2 data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"308\"><strong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"308\">A2P Realtech : Upgrading, Modifying &amp; Redesigning Existing Structures</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"420\">Are you ready to transform your living space into the dream home you\'ve always imagined? Look no further than A2P Realtech! With our expert renovation and remodeling services, we breathe new life into your interiors, ensuring every corner reflects your unique style and personality.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"420\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"420\">Whether you\'re looking to modernize your kitchen, revamp your bathroom, or create a cozy outdoor retreat, our dedicated team is here to bring your vision to life. We understand that each project is a journey, and we pride ourselves on delivering exceptional quality and craftsmanship every step of the way.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"420\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"420\">Book your renovation with A2P Realtech today and unlock the potential of your home. Let&rsquo;s turn your ideas into reality and create a space that perfectly fits your lifestyle!</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"420\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"254\">Book Your Renovation and Remodeling with A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"308\">Transform Spaces. Renew Value. Elevate Lifestyle.</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"641\">Whether you\'re upgrading your home, modernizing your office, or revitalizing a commercial space, <strong data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"423\">A2P Realtech</strong> is your trusted partner for <strong data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"503\">high-quality renovation and remodeling services</strong>. We bring your space back to life with smart design, durable materials, and seamless execution &mdash; all customized to your needs and budget.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"646\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"688\">Our Renovation Services Include:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<li data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"801\">\r\n<p data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"801\"><strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"718\">Residential Renovation:</strong> Kitchens, bathrooms, living spaces, flooring, false ceilings, painting, and more</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"901\">\r\n<p data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"901\"><strong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"830\">Commercial Remodeling:</strong> Retail, offices, showrooms, and salons with brand-specific makeovers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1007\">\r\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1007\"><strong data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"933\">Structural Modifications:</strong> Wall removal/addition, open layouts, mezzanine floors, and retrofitting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1099\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1099\"><strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1030\">Facade Upgrades:</strong> External cladding, paint, lighting, and modern design enhancements</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1216\"><strong data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1137\">Plumbing &amp; Electrical Overhaul:</strong> Complete rewiring, new fittings, fire safety, and energy-efficient solutions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1320\"><strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1250\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Outs:</strong> Modular kitchens, wardrobes, designer lighting, and custom finishes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1325\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1373\">Why Choose A2P Realtech for Renovation?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1685\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1432\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1432\">&nbsp;Personalized renovation plans tailored to your needs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1481\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1481\">&nbsp;Expert engineers, designers, and craftsmen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1521\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1521\">&nbsp;Budget-friendly to luxury options</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1574\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1574\">Strict quality control and on-site supervision</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1639\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1639\">Minimal disruption to ongoing activities during renovation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1685\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1685\">&nbsp;Transparent pricing and timely completion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1718\">How to Get Started:</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"2120\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1804\"><strong data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1752\">Schedule a Free Site Visit</strong> &ndash; We inspect your property and discuss your goals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1888\"><strong data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1848\">Receive a Custom Renovation Proposal</strong> &ndash; Detailed scope of work and estimate</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1958\"><strong data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1910\">Confirm &amp; Book</strong> &ndash; Lock in your timeline and design selections</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2038\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2038\"><strong data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1982\">Execution Begins</strong> &ndash; With quality assurance and regular progress updates</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2120\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2120\"><strong data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2060\">Final Handover</strong> &ndash; We deliver your transformed space, ready to use and enjoy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"246\">Why Choose A2P Realtech for Your Renovation Needs?</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"288\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Trusted. Transparent. Transformative.</span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"567\">Renovating your home or commercial space is more than just construction &mdash; it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"414\">enhancing value, comfort, and style</strong> while preserving what matters to you. At <strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"472\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we bring your renovation vision to life with precision, care, and a commitment to excellence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"572\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"617\">&nbsp;1. <strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"615\">Tailor-Made Renovation Plans</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"768\">We don&rsquo;t believe in cookie-cutter solutions. Your needs, taste, and budget shape every detail of our proposal &mdash; from layout changes to final finishes.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"773\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"810\">&nbsp;2. <strong data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"808\">End-to-End Expertise</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"957\">From structural upgrades to interior design, plumbing, and electrical rewiring &mdash; we manage every aspect of your renovation project under one roof.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1021\">&nbsp;3. <strong data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1019\">Seamless Execution with Minimal Disruption</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1163\">Our experienced team works efficiently and respectfully, especially in occupied spaces, ensuring a hassle-free renovation experience for you.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1224\">4. <strong data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1222\">Premium Quality with Proven Workmanship</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1356\">We use high-grade materials and employ skilled craftsmen who take pride in every detail, ensuring durability and a flawless finish.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1361\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1415\">&nbsp;5. <strong data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1413\">Transparent Pricing &amp; Clear Timelines</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1544\">No hidden costs, no vague deadlines. You&rsquo;ll receive a detailed scope of work with fixed milestones and regular progress updates.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1549\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1588\">&nbsp;6. <strong data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1586\">Design + Functionality</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1726\">We balance style with practicality &mdash; offering modern, aesthetic design solutions that also improve your space&rsquo;s efficiency and usability.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1731\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1777\">&nbsp;7. <strong data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1775\">Licensed, Insured &amp; Compliant</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1895\">From local approvals to safety standards, we handle all legal and compliance requirements so you don&rsquo;t have to worry.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1940\">&nbsp;8. <strong data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1938\">Post-Renovation Support</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"2073\">Our service doesn&rsquo;t end at handover. We offer warranty-backed work and are available for maintenance, touch-ups, or future upgrades.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2078\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2121\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Transform Your Space with Confidence</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2197\">Choose <strong data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2145\">A2P Realtech</strong> &mdash; where thoughtful design meets reliable execution.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2197\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"256\">The Renovation Process: What to Expect</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"326\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">With A2P Realtech, Renovation is Seamless, Smart, and Stress-Free</span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"544\">Renovating your home, office, or commercial space can feel like a big step &mdash; but with <strong data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"430\">A2P Realtech</strong>, you&rsquo;ll experience a structured, transparent, and well-managed journey from start to finish. Here&rsquo;s how it works:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"549\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"597\">1. <strong data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"595\">Initial Consultation &amp; Site Visit</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>We begin by understanding your goals, preferences, budget, and timeline.</strong><br data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"673\">Discussion of requirements (residential or commercial)<br data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"732\">Free site inspection to assess existing conditions<br data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"787\">Basic measurements and renovation feasibility</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"839\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"878\">2. <strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"876\">Concept &amp; Planning Phase</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"1108\"><strong>Once we understand your needs, we craft a clear plan of action.</strong><br data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"945\">&nbsp;Proposed layout changes and design mood boards<br data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"996\">Recommendations on structural, electrical, or plumbing upgrades<br data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1064\">Detailed cost estimate and package options</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1159\">3. <strong data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1157\">Design Finalization &amp; Approvals</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1378\"><strong>Your ideas meet our technical expertise.</strong><br data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1203\">Interior &amp; exterior design concepts (2D/3D as needed)<br data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1261\">Selection of materials, finishes, and color palettes<br data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1318\">Assistance with required approvals or NOCs (if applicable)</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1383\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1434\">4. <strong data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1432\">Execution &amp; Demolition (if required)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1643\"><strong>Our trained team begins renovation with safety and care.</strong><br data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1494\">Site preparation and debris protection<br data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1537\">Demolition of outdated elements (walls, flooring, fittings)<br data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1601\">Structural modifications and repair work</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1648\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1689\">5. <strong data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1687\">Civil, MEP &amp; Interior Work</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1901\"><strong>This is where your space begins to transform.</strong><br data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1738\">Plumbing &amp; electrical rewiring/upgrades<br data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1782\">Wall modifications, flooring, tiling, painting<br data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1833\">Modular kitchen, cabinetry, false ceiling, and decor installations</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1906\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1958\">6. <strong data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1956\">Supervision, Quality Checks &amp; Updates</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2171\"><strong>We ensure your project stays on track and to the highest standards.</strong><br data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2029\">Regular on-site supervision by project manager<br data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2080\">Quality control at every stage<br data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2115\">Transparent progress updates (photos, reports, visits)</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2176\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2217\">7. <strong data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2215\">Final Finishing &amp; Handover</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2415\"><strong>Your space is polished and ready to impress.</strong><br data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2265\">Final fittings, polishing, and deep cleaning<br data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2314\">Client walkthrough and punch-list resolution<br data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2363\">Handover with warranties and support documentation</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2420\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2458\">8. <strong data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2456\">Post-Renovation Support</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2647\"><strong>We&rsquo;re just a call away, even after completion.</strong><br data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2508\">Warranty on work and materials (as per package)<br data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2560\">Touch-ups and minor fixes included<br data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2599\">Ongoing support for future upgrades or add-ons</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2652\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2705\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Your Space, Reinvented &mdash; The A2P Realtech Way</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2820\">Let us help you make the most of your existing space &mdash; beautifully, efficiently, and with complete peace of mind.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2820\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"230\">Types of Renovation Services Offered</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"276\">Complete Makeovers Tailored to Your Needs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"522\">At <strong data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"297\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we offer a wide range of renovation services to breathe new life into your residential, commercial, or industrial property. Whether you\'re looking to enhance comfort, functionality, or visual appeal &mdash; we&rsquo;ve got you covered.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"527\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"571\"><strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"571\">Residential Renovation Services</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"636\">Transform your home with expert craftsmanship and modern design.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<li data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"730\">\r\n<p data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"730\"><strong data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"662\">Kitchen Renovation</strong><br data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"665\">Modular upgrades, countertops, cabinetry, plumbing &amp; lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"830\">\r\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"830\"><strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"756\">Bathroom Remodeling</strong><br data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"759\">Premium fixtures, tiling, waterproofing, and layout reconfiguration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<p data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"926\"><strong data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"857\">Living Room Makeover</strong><br data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"860\">False ceilings, modern lighting, wall treatments, and flooring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1021\"><strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"951\">Bedroom Renovation</strong><br data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"954\">Custom wardrobes, wall finishes, window work, and decor styling</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1122\"><strong data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1044\">Full Home Revamp</strong><br data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1047\">Structural changes, re-layouts, MEP work, and complete interior finishing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1127\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1172\"><strong data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1170\">Commercial Renovation Services</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1240\">Upgrade your business space to match modern standards and branding.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1352\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1352\"><strong data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1271\">Office Space Remodeling</strong><br data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1274\">Open-plan layouts, partitions, smart lighting, and furniture installations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1449\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1449\"><strong data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1386\">Retail &amp; Showroom Makeovers</strong><br data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1389\">Fa&ccedil;ade upgrades, display enhancements, lighting redesign</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1565\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1565\"><strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1488\">Clinic, Salon &amp; Caf&eacute; Renovations</strong><br data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1491\">Layout optimization, plumbing, custom interiors, and branding elements</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1673\"><strong data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1596\">Coworking Space Upgrades</strong><br data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1599\">Acoustic improvements, ergonomic workstations, and collaborative layouts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1678\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1723\"><strong data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1721\">Industrial Renovation Services</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1791\">Safe, durable upgrades tailored to functional and compliance needs.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"2106\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1891\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1891\"><strong data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1815\">Warehouse Refits</strong><br data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1818\">Flooring, ventilation, insulation, loading docks, and safety measures</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"2002\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"2002\"><strong data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1924\">Factory &amp; Workshop Updates</strong><br data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1927\">Retrofitting, electrical rewiring, lighting upgrades, safety compliance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2106\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2106\"><strong data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2041\">Administrative Block Renovations</strong><br data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2044\">Office interiors, restrooms, reception, and staff facilities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2111\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2153\"><strong data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2153\">Specialty Renovation Services</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2213\">Unique solutions for evolving lifestyle and business needs.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2734\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2316\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2316\"><strong data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2241\">Fa&ccedil;ade Modernization</strong><br data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2244\">ACP cladding, glass upgrades, lighting accents, signage improvements</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2425\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2425\"><strong data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2347\">Structural Modifications</strong><br data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2350\">Wall demolition/addition, mezzanine construction, space reconfiguration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2521\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2521\"><strong data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2461\">Smart Home/Office Integration</strong><br data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2464\">Automation systems, security cameras, access controls</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2626\"><strong data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2553\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</strong><br data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2556\">Custom furniture, decor styling, partitions, and turnkey interiors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2734\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2734\"><strong data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2657\">Eco-Friendly Renovations</strong><br data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2660\">Energy-efficient lighting, solar panel integration, water-saving systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2763\">Why A2P Realtech?</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"3006\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2834\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2834\">Versatile solutions for homes, offices, retail &amp; industrial spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2890\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2890\">Custom packages for partial or complete renovations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2944\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2944\">Design + Build approach with end-to-end execution</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"3006\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"3006\">Quality materials, certified workforce, and timely delivery</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"224\">Benefits of Remodeling Your Home</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"289\">Upgrade Your Lifestyle, Value, and Comfort with A2P Realtech</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"554\">Remodeling your home isn\'t just about making it look better &mdash; it\'s a smart investment that enhances your daily living and long-term property value. At <strong data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"458\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we help you unlock the full potential of your space with thoughtful, high-quality renovations.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"559\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"598\">&nbsp;1. <strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"596\">Improved Functionality</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"758\">Redesign layouts to make your home work better for your lifestyle &mdash; add a home office, expand your kitchen, or create open living areas that suit modern needs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"763\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"804\">&nbsp;2. <strong data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"802\">Increased Property Value</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"951\">Well-planned renovations significantly boost resale value. Kitchens, bathrooms, and energy-efficient upgrades are especially attractive to buyers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1002\">&nbsp;3. <strong data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1000\">Enhanced Comfort &amp; Livability</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1140\">Upgrade your flooring, lighting, windows, and insulation to create a more comfortable, energy-efficient, and peaceful living environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1145\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1184\">&nbsp;4. <strong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1182\">Updated Style &amp; Design</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1318\">Replace outdated finishes and fixtures with modern aesthetics that reflect your personal taste &mdash; from minimalist to luxury interiors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1323\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1371\">&nbsp;5. <strong data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1369\">Energy Efficiency &amp; Lower Bills</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1505\">Install new windows, LED lighting, better insulation, or solar panels to reduce energy consumption and save on monthly utility costs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1510\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1549\">6. <strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1547\">Smart Home Integration</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1678\">Bring in modern technology &mdash; automated lighting, climate control, security systems &mdash; for convenience, safety, and peace of mind.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1683\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1727\">&nbsp;7. <strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1725\">More Storage &amp; Organization</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1858\">Maximize space with custom cabinets, hidden storage solutions, and smart furniture to eliminate clutter and improve functionality.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1863\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1900\">&nbsp;8. <strong data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1898\">Repair Hidden Issues</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"2060\">Address plumbing, electrical, or structural problems before they become costly. Remodeling allows for preventive maintenance along with aesthetic improvements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2065\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2103\">&nbsp;9. <strong data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2101\">Adapt to Life Changes</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2226\">Accommodate growing families, aging-in-place needs, or work-from-home setups with tailored remodels and space conversions.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2231\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2273\">10. <strong data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2271\">Boost Pride in Ownership</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2413\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">A beautiful, functional home makes you feel happier and more confident &mdash; whether you&rsquo;re hosting guests or simply relaxing with your family.</span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2418\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2487\">Let A2P Realtech Transform Your Home into a Space You&rsquo;ll Love</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2634\">Whether it\'s a single-room remodel or a full home renovation, our team ensures seamless design, planning, and execution &mdash; with results that last.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2634\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"224\">A2P Realtech&rsquo;s Unique Approach to Renovation</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"283\">Thoughtful Design. Seamless Execution. Lasting Impact.</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"620\">Renovation isn&rsquo;t just about replacing the old with the new &mdash; it&rsquo;s about <strong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"383\">reimagining your space</strong> to better suit your lifestyle, business goals, and long-term value. At <strong data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"471\">A2P Realtech</strong>, we approach renovation with precision, creativity, and client-first thinking, making your transformation smooth, stress-free, and truly customized.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"625\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"664\">&nbsp;1. <strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"664\">Client-Centric Planning</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"814\">We start by listening &mdash; really listening. We understand your goals, lifestyle, timeline, and budget to develop a solution that fits your exact needs.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"943\">\r\n<li data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"852\">\r\n<p data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"852\">One-on-one consultation sessions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"908\">\r\n<p data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"908\">Customized design and functionality recommendations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"943\">\r\n<p data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"943\">Clear communication from day one</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"990\">2. <strong data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"990\">Design + Build Integration</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1102\">Unlike traditional firms, we combine architecture, engineering, and construction under one roof. This leads to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1225\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1144\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1144\">Faster decision-making and execution</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1187\">Better cost control and accountability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1225\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1225\">Fewer errors, smoother coordination</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1230\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1270\">&nbsp;3. <strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1270\">Smart Space Optimization</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1402\">We don&rsquo;t just renovate &mdash; we rethink. Our designers look at ways to improve space usage, natural light, ventilation, and ergonomics.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1513\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1446\">Open floor plans and modular solutions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1485\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1485\">Space-saving furniture and storage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1513\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1513\">Enhanced flow and comfort</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1518\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1564\">&nbsp;4. <strong data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1564\">Material &amp; Vendor Transparency</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1667\">We only work with <strong data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1604\">trusted suppliers</strong> and offer options across budgets without compromising quality.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1793\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1711\">Transparent pricing with brand options</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1750\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1750\">On-site material selection support</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1793\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1793\">No hidden charges or low-grade shortcuts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1798\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1842\">5. <strong data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1842\">Minimal Disruption Execution</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1951\">Renovating an occupied home or office? We get it. Our team works in phases, keeping your daily life in mind.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"2109\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1994\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1994\">Clean, safe, and organized work zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2070\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2070\">Fast-tracked timelines for essential spaces (kitchens, bathrooms, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2109\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2109\">Regular site updates and supervision</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2114\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2152\">6. <strong data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2152\">Rigorous Quality Checks</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2240\">Every phase of renovation is thoroughly inspected by our internal quality control team.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2343\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2269\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2269\">Multi-stage inspections</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2317\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2317\">Punch-list resolution before final handover</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2343\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2343\">Work backed by warranty</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2348\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2387\">7. <strong data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2387\">Post-Renovation Support</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2485\">We stay connected even after your renovation is complete &mdash; because trust doesn&rsquo;t end at handover.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2608\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2532\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2532\">Warranty on workmanship and installations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2581\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2581\">Guidance for maintenance and future upgrades</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2608\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2608\">Responsive customer care</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"228\">How to Book Your Renovation with A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"266\">Simple. Transparent. Hassle-Free.</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"449\">Renovating your home or commercial space should feel exciting &mdash; not overwhelming. That&rsquo;s why A2P Realtech makes it easy to get started with a smooth, client-focused booking process.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"454\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"492\"><strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"490\">Step 1: Reach Out to Us</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"674\">Contact us via phone, email, or our website to schedule your <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"575\">free consultation</strong>.<br data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"579\"><br></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"679\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"740\"><strong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"738\">Step 2: On-Site Visit &amp; Requirement Discussion</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"860\"><strong>We visit your property to assess the space, understand your needs, and suggest potential design and renovation options.</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"977\">&nbsp;Detailed space analysis<br data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"890\">Style, budget, and timeline preferences<br data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"934\">Customization ideas and feasibility check</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1041\"><strong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1039\">Step 3: Receive a Custom Renovation Proposal</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1094\">Based on your goals, we create a detailed plan with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1113\">Scope of work</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1136\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1136\">Estimated timeline</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1176\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1176\">Material options (basic to premium)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1218\">Transparent pricing and package options</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1273\"><strong data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1271\">Step 4: Finalize the Scope &amp; Design</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1420\">Work with our team to fine-tune layout changes, designs, and finish selections. We\'ll ensure it matches your expectations and functionality needs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1425\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1480\"><strong data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1478\">Step 5: Sign Agreement &amp; Confirm Booking</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1534\">Once you\'re happy with the proposal, we proceed with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1572\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1572\">Signing the renovation agreement</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1621\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1621\">Confirming start date and milestone schedule</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1660\">Advance payment as per project scope</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1665\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1705\"><strong data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1703\">Step 6: Renovation Begins</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1815\">Our skilled team starts work &mdash; with full supervision, timely updates, and minimal disruption to your routine.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1820\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1871\"><strong data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1869\">Step 7: Final Walkthrough &amp; Handover</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1991\">We conduct a thorough inspection with you, make any final adjustments, and officially hand over your transformed space.</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3503.0806853061254!2d77.04727277616337!3d28.59735618567611!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1b8d7ee000e5%3A0x5a6f1f8f031ff9fb!2sA2P%20Realtech%20Private%20Limited!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', '', '', '', '2BYQ8Z1C', 21, 'Book Your Renovation and Remodeling with A2P Realtech', 'Renovation & Remodeling, upgrading, modifying, redesigning existing structures, Home Renovation, Bathroom & Kitchen Remodeling, Structural Alterations ', 'A2P Realtech for a Renovation & Remodeling Book that focuses on upgrading, modifying, or redesigning existing structures, with sections dedicated to Home Renovation, Bathroom & Kitchen Remodeling, and Structural Alterations. This outline can be expanded into a full book or used to develop a course, blog, or client guide.', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(213, 'Interior Fit Out Services', '080625083327Interior-design-Services-A2P-Realtech.jpg', '<h3 data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"250\"><strong data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"250\">Interior Fit-Out Services &ndash; Key Amenities</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"394\">We provide a comprehensive range of fit-out amenities to ensure every space is functional, aesthetically pleasing, and tailored to your needs:</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"433\"><strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"433\">Design &amp; Layout Planning</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"564\">\r\n<li data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"471\">Concept design &amp; 3D visualization</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"503\">\r\n<p data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"503\">Space optimization &amp; zoning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"564\">\r\n<p data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"564\">Theme-based interiors (modern, traditional, minimal, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"600\"><strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"600\">Civil &amp; Carpentry Work</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n<li data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"644\">\r\n<p data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"644\">Partition walls (gypsum, glass, wooden)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"675\">\r\n<p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"675\">False ceilings &amp; bulkheads</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"718\">Customized furniture &amp; storage solutions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"753\"><strong data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"753\">Electrical &amp; Lighting</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n<li data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"793\">\r\n<p data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"793\">Ambient, task &amp; decorative lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"836\">Concealed wiring &amp; electrical fittings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"872\">Smart lighting system integration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"904\"><strong data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"904\">HVAC &amp; Ventilation</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<li data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<p data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"938\">Air conditioning installation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"970\">\r\n<p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"970\">Ventilation system planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1005\">Energy-efficient climate control</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1047\"><strong data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1047\">Plumbing &amp; Sanitary Fixtures</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1079\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1079\">Bathroom &amp; kitchen plumbing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1112\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1112\">Installation of sanitaryware</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1148\">Water heater &amp; filtration systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1189\"><strong data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1189\">Modular Kitchen &amp; Wardrobes</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1311\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1219\">Tailor-made kitchen units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1274\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1274\">Soft-close drawers, pull-out trays, and tall units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1311\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1311\">Sliding or hinged wardrobe systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1341\"><strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1341\">Finishes &amp; Decor</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1390\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1390\">Wall treatments (paint, wallpaper, paneling)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1436\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1436\">Flooring (tiles, vinyl, hardwood, carpet)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1487\">Window blinds, curtains &amp; decorative accessories</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1518\"><strong data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1518\">Safety &amp; Security</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1623\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1555\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1555\">Fire alarm &amp; suppression systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1587\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1587\">Access control &amp; CCTV setup</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1623\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1623\">Emergency lighting &amp; exit signage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1652\"><strong data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1652\">IT &amp; Networking</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1744\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1675\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1675\">Structured cabling</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1704\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1704\">Internet and Wi-Fi setup</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1744\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1744\">AV &amp; conferencing systems for offices</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 322, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Book A2P Realtech for Your Interior Fit-Out Services</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Transform your space with <strong>A2P Realtech</strong> &mdash; your trusted partner for end-to-end <strong>interior fit-out solutions</strong>. Whether it\'s a commercial office, retail store, hospitality venue, or residential project, we bring your vision to life with precision, creativity, and quality craftsmanship.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 4;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 4;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"Modern Kitchen Design-A2P Realtech\" width=\"519\" height=\"435\"></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 4;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Why Choose A2P Realtech?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Expert Design &amp; Space Planning<br>Seamless Project Management<br>Premium Quality Materials &amp; Workmanship<br>Timely Delivery &amp; Budget-Friendly Solutions<br>Tailored Fit-Outs for Offices, Homes, Retail &amp; More</span></p>\r\n<h3><strong>Interior Fit-Out Services</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"211\"><strong data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"211\">Book Interior Designing and Furnishing Works Post-Construction</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"213\" data-end=\"424\">Enhance your newly built space with complete interior fit-out solutions tailored to your needs. From design to execution, we transform bare structures into fully functional and beautifully finished environments.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"463\"><strong data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"463\">Our Fit-Out Options Include:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"587\"><strong>Residential Interiors</strong><br data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"496\">Create warm, stylish, and personalized living spaces that reflect your lifestyle and taste.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"719\"><strong>Commercial Interiors</strong><br data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"619\">Design smart, efficient workspaces and retail environments that boost productivity and brand appeal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"864\"><strong>Modular Kitchens &amp; Wardrobes</strong><br data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"760\">Upgrade with modern, space-saving, and fully customizable modular kitchen systems and storage solutions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Interior Fit-Out Services</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> refer to the process of making interior spaces suitable for occupation. It typically involves all activities from the shell and core stage (bare building) to a fully operational interior environment, ready for use by its occupants.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Types of Interior Fit-Outs</span></strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Shell and Core</span></strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">The basic structure of the building, including the frame, base walls, and sometimes elevators and staircases.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Category A (Cat A) Fit-Out</span></strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Provides a functional but empty space, ready for further customization. Includes:</span></li>\r\n<ul type=\"square\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo1; tab-stops: list 108.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Raised floors and suspended ceilings</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo1; tab-stops: list 108.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Basic lighting</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo1; tab-stops: list 108.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">HVAC systems</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo1; tab-stops: list 108.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Basic fire protection</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Category B (Cat B) Fit-Out</span></strong></li>\r\n<ul type=\"circle\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Final customization according to the tenant&rsquo;s specific needs. Includes:</span></li>\r\n<ul type=\"square\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo1; tab-stops: list 108.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Partitioning (meeting rooms, offices)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo1; tab-stops: list 108.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Furniture installation</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo1; tab-stops: list 108.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">IT and AV systems</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo1; tab-stops: list 108.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Branding elements</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo1; tab-stops: list 108.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Flooring, wall finishes, and decorative touches</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style