t-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">No. At A2P Realtech, the same integrated team that handles your pre-construction will also manage your construction. This ensures continuity, accountability, and clear communication.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Can I use A2P Realtech only for pre-construction?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Yes. While we offer complete turnkey services, clients may choose to engage us for pre-construction only, and we&rsquo;ll still provide full support and deliverables.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Conclusion &amp; Next Steps</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Start Strong &mdash; Finish Better</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Pre-construction is not just a phase &mdash; it&rsquo;s the strategic backbone of your project. At <strong>A2P Realtech</strong>, we turn your ideas into actionable plans with clarity, precision, and foresight.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Whether you&rsquo;re building a dream home, a modern office, or a commercial space, starting with <strong>our expert pre-construction services</strong> puts you firmly on the path to success.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Next Steps</span></strong></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo33; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Contact A2P Realtech</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> via phone, email, or online inquiry form</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo33; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Book a free consultation</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> with our project planning team</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo33; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Receive your personalized proposal</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"> and design roadmap</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo33; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Start your project with confidence</span></strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Let&rsquo;s lay the foundation for your vision &mdash; together.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><br>Call us | Email us | Visit <a href=\"https://www.a2prealtech.com\" target=\"_new\"><span style=\"color: blue;\">www.a2prealtech.com</span></a></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3503.0806853061254!2d77.04727277616337!3d28.59735618567611!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1b8d7ee000e5%3A0x5a6f1f8f031ff9fb!2sA2P%20Realtech%20Private%20Limited!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'FSHCS1JQ', 21, 'Book Your Pre-Construction Services with A2P Realtech', 'Pre-Construction, Book, A2P Realtech, Construction services, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon,', 'Are you ready to turn your dream project into a reality? At A2P Realtech, we specialize in pre-construction services designed to set the foundation for your vision. Whether you\'re planning a residential build, commercial development, or renovation, our dedicated team is here to guide you every step of the way. We understand that the pre-construction phase is crucial; it’s where your ideas take shape and your aspirations begin to unfold. With our extensive industry knowledge and commitment to excellence, we ensure that every aspect of your project is meticulously planned and executed. From site analysis to budgeting and permitting, A2P Realtech offers tailored solutions that cater to your unique needs. Don’t leave your project to chance—book your pre-construction services with us today, and let’s embark on a journey towards creating something extraordinary together. Your dream space awaits, and with A2P Realtech, it\'s closer than ever!', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(216, 'Your Custom Package Booking with A2P Realtech', '090625033311Your-Custome-Package-A2P-Realtech.jpg', '<h2 data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"297\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Amenities Included in A2P Realtech&rsquo;s Custom Booking Packages</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"487\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Our custom packages come with a wide range of <strong data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"380\">essential and premium amenities</strong> designed to elevate your living or working space. Choose the amenities that fit your lifestyle and budget!</span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"492\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"540\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"540\">Structural &amp; Construction Amenities</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"823\">\r\n<li data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"587\">\r\n<p data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"587\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"587\">Earthquake-resistant RCC frame structure</strong></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"642\">\r\n<p data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"642\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">High-quality foundation with waterproofing treatment</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"722\">\r\n<p data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"722\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Solid concrete flooring with options for vitrified/tiles/marble/wooden finish</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"770\">\r\n<p data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"770\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">External plaster with weather-resistant paint</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"823\">\r\n<p data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"823\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internal plaster and putty finish for smooth walls</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"828\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"862\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"862\">Electrical &amp; Lighting</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"1111\">\r\n<li data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"926\">\r\n<p data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"926\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Concealed wiring with branded electrical switches and sockets</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"985\">\r\n<p data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"985\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Adequate power points and lighting outlets as per design</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1053\">\r\n<p data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1053\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Energy-efficient LED lighting fixtures (optional premium upgrade)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1111\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1111\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Provision for solar panel connection and inverter setup</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1148\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1148\">Plumbing &amp; Sanitary</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1229\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1229\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Branded CP fittings and sanitary ware (choose from standard to premium brands)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1281\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Concealed plumbing with high-grade PVC/CPVC pipes</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1335\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1335\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Hot and cold water lines for bathrooms and kitchens</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1379\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Rainwater harvesting provision (optional)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1384\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1412\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1412\">Doors &amp; Windows</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1484\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1484\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Main door: Teakwood or engineered wood frame with designer flush door</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1544\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1544\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internal doors: Flush doors with laminate or paint finish</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1612\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1612\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Windows: Powder-coated aluminum or UPVC frames with mosquito nets</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1653\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Safety grills as per client preference</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1658\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1711\">Interiors &amp; Finishes (Optional Add-Ons)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1767\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Modular kitchen with branded cabinets and accessories</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1813\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1813\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Wardrobes and storage solutions in bedrooms</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1853\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1853\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">False ceilings with LED cove lighting</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1900\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Designer tiles or laminated flooring options</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1935\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1935\">Outdoor Amenities</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1993\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1993\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Landscaped garden/yard with lawn and pathway (optional)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2041\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2041\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Boundary wall and gate with security features</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2075\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Paved driveway and parking area</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2110\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2110\">Security &amp; Safety</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2239\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2158\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2158\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">CCTV provision and intercom system (optional)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2200\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2200\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fire safety measures as per local norms</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2239\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2239\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Anti-theft grills and security locks</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2244\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2289\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2289\">Eco-Friendly Features (Optional)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2433\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2318\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2318\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Solar water heating system</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2347\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2347\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Rainwater harvesting setup</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2400\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Energy-efficient building materials and insulation</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2433\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2433\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Wastewater recycling provision</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2438\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2487\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2487\">Connectivity &amp; Smart Home (Optional)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2642\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2528\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2528\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet and cable TV wiring provision</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2581\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2581\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Smart lighting and automated security system setup</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2642\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2642\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Home automation options for lighting, fans, and appliances</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2647\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2689\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2689\">Additional Services Included</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2916\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2746\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2746\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Complete project management by dedicated coordinator</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2808\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2808\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Assistance with all municipal approvals and documentation</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2867\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2867\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Periodic site inspections and quality assurance checks</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2916\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2916\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Post-handover support and maintenance guidance</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2951\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Customizable Amenities</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"3084\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We understand every client is different&mdash;amenities can be tailored or upgraded to meet your specific needs and lifestyle preferences.</span></p>', 0, 1, 325, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: Geomanist, \'serif\';\">Your Custom Package Booking with A2P Realtech for Real Estate Construction</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 11.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Geomanist Book\', \'serif\'; color: black; background: white; font-size: 14pt;\">In the ever-evolving landscape of real estate construction, finding the perfect fit for your project can feel daunting. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 11.25pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 11.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Geomanist Book\', \'serif\'; color: black; background: white; font-size: 14pt;\">With A2P Realtech, the process becomes seamless and tailored to your needs. Our custom package booking is designed to provide you with a hassle-free experience, allowing you to focus on what truly matters: your vision. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 11.25pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 11.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Geomanist Book\', \'serif\'; color: black; background: white; font-size: 14pt;\">Whether you\'re building your dream home or embarking on a large-scale development, our dedicated team is here to support every step with innovative solutions and personalized service. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 11.25pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 11.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Geomanist Book\', \'serif\'; color: black; background: white; font-size: 14pt;\">Discover how A2P Realtech can transform your construction journey, ensuring that each detail aligns with your specific requirements. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 11.25pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 11.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Geomanist Book\', \'serif\'; color: black; background: white; font-size: 14pt;\">Dive into a world where your aspirations meet our expertise, and let&rsquo;s build the future together, one unique project at a time.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"muitypography-root\" style=\"background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 11.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Geomanist, \'serif\';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Understanding Custom Package Booking in Real Estate Construction</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">A <strong>Custom Package Booking</strong> refers to a <strong>personalized construction solution</strong> offered by A2P Realtech, tailored to match the specific requirements, budget, and preferences of an individual client or property owner.</span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">What Is a Custom Package?</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Unlike standard or pre-defined construction packages (which may include fixed materials, layouts, and designs), a <strong>custom package</strong> allows the client to:</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l33 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Select specific design elements (interior/exterior styles)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l33 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Choose materials, fittings, and finishes</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l33 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Decide the scope of services (e.g., structure only, turnkey, interiors included)</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l33 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Define the project timeline based on their own needs</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l33 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Adapt the project to a specific plot size, location, or regulatory requirement</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Key Features of Custom Package Booking:</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"mso-cellspacing: 1.5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184;\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Feature</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Description</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Personalization</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Every element of the construction process is customized to the client\'s taste and functional needs.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Flexibility in Budget</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Clients can decide how much to spend and on what, making the package suitable for a variety of budget ranges.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\