astu, eco-friendly design, accessibility)</span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"950\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><em data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"950\">\"We don&rsquo;t offer &lsquo;one size fits all&rsquo;&mdash;we listen, then build.\"</em></strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"955\"></div>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1002\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2. <strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1002\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',\'serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\">Site Analysis &amp; Feasibility Check</span></strong></span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l29 level1 lfo15; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1069\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Our team evaluates your <strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1069\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast;\">plot location, size, and orientation</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l29 level1 lfo15; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1156\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Checks for <strong data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1104\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast;\">local regulations</span></strong>, building norms, soil condition, and utility access</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l29 level1 lfo15; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1232\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Identifies opportunities to <strong data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1232\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast;\">maximize space, ventilation, and sunlight</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1237\"></div>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1286\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3. <strong data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1286\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',\'serif\'; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\">Customized Design &amp; Layout Planning</span></strong></span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l36 level1 lfo16; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1373\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Our architects create <strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1334\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast;\">bespoke floor plans</span></strong> and 3D elevations based on your vision</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l36 level1 lfo16; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1428\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Multiple iterations and feedback cycles are included</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l36 level1 lfo16; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\" data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1513\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso