le=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Schedule Your Free Consultation</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Let&rsquo;s talk about your land, ideas, and goals. No pressure&mdash;just information.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3; mso-list: l42 level1 lfo60;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Site Visit &amp; Planning</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Our team will assess your site, understand your space, and begin preparing a <strong>custom design and cost proposal</strong> just for you.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3; mso-list: l42 level1 lfo60;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Review &amp; Finalize Your Package</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">We&rsquo;ll walk you through all the details:<br></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Design options<br></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Material choices<br></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Cost estimate<br></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Payment milestones<br></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Timeline</span></span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3; mso-list: l42 level1 lfo60;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Book Your Project</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Secure your construction schedule with a simple <strong>booking amount</strong>, and we&rsquo;ll take it from there&mdash;managing everything from documentation to handover.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Your Dream Space Starts Here.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', \'serif\';\">Let&rsquo;s build something that&rsquo;s truly yours&mdash;with clarity, quality, and care.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3503.0806853061254!2d77.04727277616337!3d28.59735618567611!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1b8d7ee000e5%3A0x5a6f1f8f031ff9fb!2sA2P%20Realtech%20Private%20Limited!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', '', '', '', '5IP88LBC', 21, 'Your Custom Package Booking with A2P Realtech for Real Estate Construction', 'Custom Package Booking , Real Estate, A2P Realtech, construction solution , custom package ', 'In the ever-evolving landscape of real estate construction, finding the perfect fit for your project can feel daunting. With A2P Realtech, the process becomes seamless and tailored to your needs. Our custom package booking is designed to provide you with a hassle-free experience, allowing you to focus on what truly matters: your vision. Whether you\'re building your dream home or embarking on a large-scale development, our dedicated team is here to support every step with innovative solutions and personalized service. Discover how A2P Realtech can transform your construction journey, ensuring that each detail aligns with your specific requirements. Dive into a world where your aspirations meet our expertise, and let’s build the future together, one unique project at a time.', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(217, 'Gaia by BPTP A Signature Lifestyle Address', '20260131180649_BPTP-Gaia-Residences-sec-Dwarka-Expressway.webp', '<h3 data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2750\"><strong data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2750\">Amenities That Enrich Every Moment</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2919\">At <strong data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2763\">Gaia</strong>, life goes far beyond the four walls of your home. The project is packed with <strong data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2873\">premium lifestyle amenities</strong> designed to meet the needs of all age groups.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"3237\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2963\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2963\">Clubhouse with gym, spa &amp; indoor games</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"2991\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"2991\">Swimming pool with deck</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3035\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3035\">Walking trails &amp; open-air yoga pavilion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3070\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3070\">Children&rsquo;s play areas &amp; creche</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3108\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3108\">Multipurpose court &amp; amphitheatre</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3155\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3111\" data-end=\"3155\">Co-working lounge for remote professionals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3204\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3204\">Retail convenience stores within the complex</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3237\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3237\">24x7 security &amp; power backup</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 294, '', '', '', '260725020537E-Brochure GAIA Residences - converted.pdf', '', '', '', '<h3 data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"255\"><strong data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"255\">Experience Elevated Living at Gaia by BPTP, Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"626\">Introducing <strong data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"285\">Gaia by BPTP</strong>, an iconic residential project that redefines luxury, sustainability, and connectivity in the heart of <strong data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"413\">Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway, Gurugram</strong>. Located just off the fast-developing <strong data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"473\">Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong>, Gaia is not just a home &mdash; it&rsquo;s a <strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"539\">signature lifestyle address</strong> where sophistication meets serenity, and urban convenience meets eco-conscious living.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"852\">Crafted by <strong data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"647\">BPTP</strong>, one of India&rsquo;s most trusted real estate developers, <strong data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"709\">Gaia</strong> promises a perfect blend of world-class amenities, lush green spaces, and thoughtfully designed homes that offer a truly elevated way of life.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"111\">Project Overview</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"434\">\r\n<li data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"193\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"13\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Developer</strong>: BPTP Ltd., a well-known name in the Delhi&ndash;NCR real estate sector, with a strong track record of quality and timely delivery</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"274\">\r\n<p data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"274\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"12\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Location</strong>: Bang on the Dwarka Expressway in Sector 102, Gurgaon/Gurugram &mdash; part of BPTP&rsquo;s expansive <strong data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"124\">Amstoria township</strong> (approx. 126&ndash;200 acres total)</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"355\">\r\n<p data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"355\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"13\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Land Area</strong>: Around <strong data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"43\">12.05&ndash;12.08 acres</strong>, hosting just three towers with <strong data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"89\">531 units</strong> &mdash; making it a low?density luxury enclave.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"434\">\r\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"434\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"16\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Architecture</strong>: The first residential project along the Dwarka Expressway to feature a <strong data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"110\">full glass fa&ccedil;ade</strong> and skyscraper?style vertical development (45 storeys, Zone?5 seismic compliant)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"120\">Project Launch &amp; Architecture</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"280\">\r\n<li data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"201\">\r\n<p data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"201\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">GAIA Residences is the <strong data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"81\">first residential development with a full glass fa&ccedil;ade</strong> on the Dwarka Expressway, featuring 45-storey towers with double-glazed thermal-acoustic glass</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"280\">\r\n<p data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"280\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">It forms part of BPTP&rsquo;s ~12-acre sector within the larger ~150&ndash;200 acre Amstoria township along the expressway.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"316\">Developer Credentials &amp; RERA</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"476\">\r\n<li data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"397\">\r\n<p data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"397\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Developed by BPTP Ltd., with global consultant collaboration: DP Architects (Singapore), Grant Associates (UK), Aedas, Blink (Singapore), and Whitby Wood (UK)</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"476\">\r\n<p data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"476\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">RERA registration: <strong data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"56\">RC/REP/HARERA/GGM/963/695/2025/66</strong>, issued June 27, 2025</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 21.8443%; background-color: #c2e0f4; border: 1px solid #000000;\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 51.3625%; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><strong>Type</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.6375%; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p><strong>Area (Sq.Ft.)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 51.3625%; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>3 BHK - T6 - Type 2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.6375%; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>2100 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 51.3625%; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>3 BHK - T6 - Type 1 Corner Unit</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.6375%; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>2100 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 51.3625%; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>3 BHK - T8 - Type 1 Corner Unit</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.6375%; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>2100 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 51.3625%; text-align: center;\">\r\n<p>3 BHK - T8 - Type 2&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 48.6375%; text-align: center;\">2100 Sq.Ft</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"857\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"916\"><strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"916\">Prime Location: Sector 102, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1339\">Gaia enjoys an enviable location on the <strong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"979\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>, one of Gurugram&rsquo;s most promising corridors of growth. The expressway connects directly to <strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1115\">Dwarka, IGI Airport, Delhi NCR, and NH-8</strong>, making daily commutes smooth and time-efficient. Sector 102 is quickly emerging as a premium residential zone, with excellent infrastructure, reputed schools, hospitals, malls, and business hubs all within close proximity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1491\">Whether it&rsquo;s a quick drive to Cyber City, a family outing to Ambience Mall, or easy access to Delhi, Gaia places you at the <strong data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1490\">center of convenience</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1496\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1534\"><strong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1534\">Design Inspired by Nature</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1800\">Named after <strong data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1603\">Gaia &ndash; the Greek goddess symbolizing Earth and life</strong>, the project is rooted in a <strong data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1661\">green, sustainable vision</strong>. The entire development is interwoven with landscaped gardens, tree-shaded pathways, aromatic herb gardens, and eco-friendly architecture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1922\">Gaia by BPTP is designed to foster <strong data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1863\">well-being and harmony</strong>, both with nature and within the community. Features like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"2032\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1947\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1947\">Rainwater harvesting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1981\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1981\">Solar-powered street lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2003\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2003\">Waste segregation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2032\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2032\">Energy-efficient systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2088\">ensure your home contributes to a <strong data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2087\">better tomorrow</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"../service_detail/verti-greens-bptp-sector-102-dwarka-expressway-gurgaon.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>VERTI GREENS BPTP Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></a></span></h2>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2093\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2143\"><strong data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2143\">Elegant, Smart Homes for Every Family</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2366\">Gaia offers a choice of <strong data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2208\">3 BHK spacious apartments</strong>, meticulously designed to bring in natural light and ventilation. Wide balconies, premium fittings, and smart layouts create a sense of openness and comfort.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2509\">Each unit is a seamless blend of <strong data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2445\">aesthetic elegance and functional design</strong>, ideal for families that aspire for modern, future-ready homes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2536\"><strong data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2536\">Key features include:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2697\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2564\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2564\">Vastu-compliant layouts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2606\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2606\">Modular kitchens &amp; designer bathrooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2636\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2636\">Energy-efficient lighting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2661\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2661\">Smart access systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2697\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2697\">Ample storage and utility space</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2702\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"../service_detail/bptp-amstoria-sector-102-dwarka-expressway-gurgaon.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BPTP AMSTORIA Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</a></span></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2750\"><strong data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2750\">Amenities That Enrich Every Moment</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2919\">At <strong data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2763\">Gaia</strong>, life goes far beyond the four walls of your home. The project is packed with <strong data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2873\">premium lifestyl