meets the expectations of today&rsquo;s homebuyers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3629\" data-end=\"3632\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3634\" data-end=\"3680\"><strong data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3680\">Why Choose Gaia by BPTP, Sector 102 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3928\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3728\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3684\" data-end=\"3728\">&nbsp;Strategic location on Dwarka Expressway</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"3785\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3785\">&nbsp;Superior connectivity to Delhi, Airport, and NH-8</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3839\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3788\" data-end=\"3839\">&nbsp;Green, sustainable, and Vastu-compliant design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"3887\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3887\">&nbsp;Premium amenities for a modern lifestyle</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3928\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3890\" data-end=\"3928\">&nbsp;Backed by the trusted BPTP legacy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3930\" data-end=\"3933\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"3990\"><strong data-start=\"3942\" data-end=\"3990\">Gaia by BPTP &ndash; A Home, A Legacy, A Lifestyle</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4220\">Discover a world where luxury is responsible, design is thoughtful, and community is everything. <strong data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4105\">Gaia by BPTP</strong> is not just an address &ndash; it&rsquo;s a place where you build your future, grow with your loved ones, and live with pride.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4220\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"37\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">If you wish to <strong data-start=\"15\" data-end=\"116\">book a unit in BPTP Gaia Residences (Sector?102, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon) through A2P Realtech</strong>, he