, the upcoming metro, and locality trends. Get a feel for the overall what\'s on offer.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"371\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"405\">3. Unit Selection &amp; Pricing</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"607\">\r\n<li data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"485\">\r\n<p data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"485\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P Realtech, being a <strong data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"51\">preferred channel partner</strong>, often has access to <strong data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"96\">exclusive inventory</strong>, priority units, and pre-launch pricing offers unavailable to general buyers.</span> <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\"><a class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"../blog_detail/best-real-estate-agents-channel-partner-and-brokers-in-dwarka-expressway-gurgaon-haryana.php?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\">a2prealtech.com</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"525\">\r\n<p data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"525\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">They will help you choose a specific <strong data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"68\">unit, floor, or orientation</strong> (e.g. corner vs interior) and get the builder&rsquo;s pricing.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"612\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"651\">4. Document Submission &amp; Booking</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<li data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"695\">\r\n<p data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"695\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Provide basic <strong data-start=\"14\" data-end=\"31\">KYC documents</strong>, such as Aadhaar, PAN, address proof, photographs.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"739\">\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"739\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"37\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Sign a booking or token agreement</strong> via A2P Realtech and pay the booking amount (typically ~5&ndash;10% or as per developer&rsquo;s EOI terms).</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<p data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"781\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P Realtech will assist in preparing all official paperwork, including:</span></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<li data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"804\">\r\n<p data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"804\">Allotment letter</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<p data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"850\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Builder-Buyer Agreement (aligned with RERA norms)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n<p data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"934\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Payment schedule details (e.g., 30:30:40 plan with defined milestones).</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"939\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"984\">5. Payment Process &amp; Agreement to Sale</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1154\">\r\n<li data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1028\">\r\n<p data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1028\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">After booking, pay the first 30% as part of the structured payment plan.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1072\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1072\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P Realtech will help schedule milestone payments based on construction progress (e.g. slab completion, podium, OC stage).</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1154\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1154\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Builder&rsquo;s official <strong data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"40\">Agreement to Sale</strong> is executed and stamped as per RERA-approved terms.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1211\">6. Loan Assistance &amp; Legal Support (Optional)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1255\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1255\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P Realtech provides <strong data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"43\">home loan support</strong>, recommending banks, helping compare interest rates, eligibility, and documentation.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1337\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">They also offer optional <strong data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"43\">legal advisory</strong>, helping verify RERA compliance, title clarity, and reviewing agreements.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1391\">7. Booking Confirmation &amp; Allotment Letter</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1435\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1435\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Post payment, you receive a <strong data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"59\">Booking Confirmation Letter</strong> from A2P Realtech.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1517\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">BPTP issues the <strong data-start=\"16\" data-end=\"45\">official allotment letter</strong>, which confirms your unit, cost breakdown, and payment schedule.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1573\">8. Construction Updates &amp; Possession Process</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1617\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1617\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P Realtech keeps you posted on project progress and milestones.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1661\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1661\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Final 40% payment is made at possession or upon issuance of the Occupation Certificate, as per the Agreement.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1664\" data-e