d businesses, clinics</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1405\">Balanced accessibility &amp; footfall</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1506\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1431\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rear/side Plots</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1470\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Offices, back-end support units</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1506\">Quieter, less frontage costs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1511\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1548\">Suggested Marketing Sections</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"2213\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1666\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1666\"><strong data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1575\">Overview of Layout</strong>: Highlight overall site plan&mdash;park &amp; shop boulevard, road frontage, plot size distribution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1811\"><strong data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1700\">Plot Configuration Options</strong>: Emphasize adaptable modules&mdash;retail spaces with double-height, flexible office floors, uniform column spacing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1950\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1950\"><strong data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1839\">Circulation &amp; Access</strong>: Showcase two/three-side open plots for enhanced visibility, pedestrian-friendly corridors, and service lanes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"2061\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2061\"><strong data-start=\"1954\"