of commercial real estate that combine retail (shops) and office space within a single building&mdash;offering flexibility, ownership, and high returns for business owners and investors alike.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"298\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"337\"><strong data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"337\">Key Features of SCO Plots:</strong></h3>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; background-color: rgb(194, 224, 244); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; width: 68.6319%; height: 201.515px;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"364\">\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"364\">\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 24.3169%; height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"349\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Feature</th>\r\n<th style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 72.5839%; height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"364\" data-col-size=\"md\">Description</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<tr style=\"height: 44.7812px;\" data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"512\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 24.3169%; height: 44.7812px;\" data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"425\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"424\">Freehold Commercial Plot</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 72.5839%; height: 44.7812px;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"512\">You own the land and can construct as per approved bylaws (usually G+4 + Basement).</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"634\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 24.3169%; height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"541\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"540\">Shop + Office Use</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 72.5839%; height: 22.3906px;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"634\">Ideal for combining retail (ground floor) with office or service business (upper floors).</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"757\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 24.3169%; height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"663\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"662\">High ROI Potential</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 72.5839%; height: 22.3906px;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"757\">Strong rental income + long-term appreciation&mdash;especially in developing zones like Gurgaon.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 44.7812px;\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"873\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 24.3169%; height: 44.7812px;\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"793\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"792\">Self-Built &amp; Customizable</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 72.5839%; height: 44.7812px;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"873\">Build your own commercial building, unlike pre-built shops with limitations.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"986\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 24.3169%; height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"906\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"905\">Independent Entry/Exit</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 72.5839%; height: 22.3906px;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"986\">Each SCO has its own frontage and access; great for branding and visibility.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1116\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 24.3169%; height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1019\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1018\">Located in Prime Zones</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 72.5839%; height: 22.3906px;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1116\">Often found in master-planned sectors, especially along expressways or near residential hubs.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1121\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1144\"><strong data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1144\">Ideal For:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1347\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1193\">Retail outlets (fashion, electronics, grocery)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1231\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1231\">Caf&eacute;s, restaurants, salons, clinics</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1269\">Corporate offices, coaching centers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1310\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1310\">Banks, insurance, real estate agencies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1347\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1347\">Co-working spaces or start-up hubs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1352\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1422\"><strong data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1422\">Why Are SCO Plots Popular in Gurgaon &amp; Dwarka Expressway?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1720\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1524\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1524\">These areas are booming with <strong data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1482\">residential developments</strong>, creating high demand for local services.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1598\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1598\"><strong data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1545\">Better returns</strong> than residential property due to business potential.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1650\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1650\">Freedom to build, lease, or resell at your terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1720\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1720\"><strong data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1684\">Government-approved formats</strong> make them a safe, legal investment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1368\"><strong data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1368\">Why Invest in Spaze Grand Central 114?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1611\">With the rise of mixed-use real estate and rapid infrastructure upgrades, commercial plots here offer <strong data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1492\">high rental yield</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1531\">long-term capital appreciation</strong>. Whether you&rsquo;re a business owner or investor, this is a location that delivers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1611\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1611\"><strong>Advantages of Investing in SCO Plots</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"268\">Investing in <strong data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"44\">SCO (Shop-Cum-Office) plots</strong> offers several strategic advantages&mdash;especially in rapidly developing areas like <strong data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"155\">Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong>. These plots combine the flexibility of land ownership with the high income potential of commercial real estate.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"325\"><strong data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"325\">Top Advantages of Investing in SCO Plots</strong></h3>\r\n<hr data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"330\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"364\">1. <strong data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"364\">Freehold Ownership</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"543\">\r\n<li data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"432\">\r\n<p data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"432\">You own the land <strong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"396\">outright</strong>&mdash;not just a space inside a building.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"487\">\r\n<p data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"487\">Gives full control to build, modify, lease, or sell.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"543\">\r\n<p data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"543\">No shared ownership like in malls or pre-built shops.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"548\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"588\">2.&nbsp; <strong data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"588\">Dual Use &ndash; Shop + Office</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"778\">\r\n<li data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"701\">\r\n<p data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"701\">Flexibility to run a retail business on the ground floor and an office or service-based setup on upper floors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"778\">\r\n<p data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"778\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"772\">doctors, consultants, startups, restaurants, showrooms</strong>, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"783\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"839\">3. <strong data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"839\">High Rental Yield &amp; Capital Appreciation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"1072\">\r\n<li data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"916\">\r\n<p data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"916\">SCOs generally offer <strong data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"887\">higher rental income</strong> than residential properties.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<p data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"999\">Strategic locations like <strong data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"965\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> see <strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"998\">rapid price appreciation</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1072\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1072\">Ideal for long-term investors seeking passive income and asset growth.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1145\">4.&nbsp; <strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1145\">Build as You Want (G+4 + Basement Typically Allowed)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1206\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1206\">Customize your building based on business or tenant needs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1267\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1267\">Use upper floors for coworking, office, or studio rentals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1332\">Option to generate <strong data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1317\">multiple revenue streams</strong> from one plot.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1380\">5.&nbsp; <strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1380\">Prime Location + Visibility</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1551\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1483\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1483\">Typically located in high-footfall zones near expressways, residential townships, or corporate hubs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1551\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1551\">Excellent road frontage boosts visibility for brands and tenants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1596\">6. <strong data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1596\">Flexible Leasing Options</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1755\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1663\">Lease entire building or individual floors to different tenants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1755\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1755\">Can be structured as <strong data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1709\">multi-brand retail</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1729\">corporate hubs</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1754\">service clusters</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1760\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1817\">7.&nbsp; <strong data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1817\">Better Than Mall Shops or Pre-built Units</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"2003\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1883\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1883\">No restrictions on operating hours, branding, or business type.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1946\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1946\">Lower maintenance and no shared service charges as in malls.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2003\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2003\">No competition from dozens of similar shops next door.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2060\">8. <strong data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2060\">Secure Investment with Legal Clarity</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2192\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2113\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2113\">Approved under government commercial zoning plans.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2192\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2192\">Clear title, freehold ownership, and legally permitted for G+4 construction.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2252\">9. <strong data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2252\">Ready Demand from Surrounding Catchment</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2404\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2331\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2331\">Surrounded by residential sectors, these areas have built-in customer bases.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2404\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2404\">Perfect for essential services, clinics, eateries, salons, and retail.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2409\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2462\">10. <strong data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2462\">Low Risk, High Potential Asset Class</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2640\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2552\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2552\">More resilient to market shocks compared to residential or volatile commercial sectors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2640\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2640\">Highly favored by <strong data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2639\">retail chains, investors, doctors, restaurateurs, and startups</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"233\">Location Benefits of Dwarka Expressway Sector 114, Gurgaon</h2>\r\n<hr data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"238\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"269\">1. <strong data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"269\">Prime Connectivity</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"608\">\r\n<li data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"441\">\r\n<p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"441\">Direct access to <strong data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"337\">Dwarka Expressway (Northern Peripheral Road)</strong> &mdash; a 29 km long, 8-lane expressway connecting <strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"401\">Dwarka (Delhi)</strong> to <strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"416\">Gurgaon</strong> and the <strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"440\">IGI Airport</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"532\">\r\n<p data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"532\">Quick travel to <strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"468\">NH-8</strong>, <strong data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"506\">IGI Airport (approx. 15-20 mins)</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"531\">Dwarka Sub-City</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"608\">\r\n<p data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"608\">Seamless connectivity to Delhi, Gurgaon&rsquo;s Cyber City, and other NCR hubs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"613\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"658\">2. <strong data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"658\">Rapid Infrastructure Development</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n<li data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"763\">\r\n<p data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"763\">Ongoing development of wide roads, underpasses, flyovers, and metro connectivity boosts accessibility.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"867\">\r\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"867\">Government&rsquo;s focus on turning Dwarka Expressway into a <strong data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"866\">major commercial and residential corridor</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n<p data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"956\">Proposed metro extension plans are set to enhance public transport facilities further.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"961\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1001\">3. <strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1001\">Strategic Commercial Growth</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1308\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1075\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1075\">Sector 114 lies on the <strong data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1063\">fast-developing western corridor</strong> of Gurgaon.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1208\">Emerging as a hotspot for <strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1142\">commercial and retail developments</strong> like Spaze Grand Central, Reach Buzz, and other premium projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1308\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1308\">Increasing presence of corporates, startups, and retail chains due to proximity and connectivity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1356\">4. <strong data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1356\">Residential Catchment &amp; Demand</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1684\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1496\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1496\">Surrounded by numerous <strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1430\">upcoming and established residential sectors</strong>&mdash;drawing a large population of working professionals and families.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1602\">High demand for retail, office spaces, healthcare, education, and entertainment within close proximity.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1684\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1684\">Growing community ensures consistent footfall and customer base for businesses.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1728\">5. <strong data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1728\">Proximity to Key Landmarks</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1824\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1824\">Close to <strong data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1755\">IGI Airport</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1765\">NH-8</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1793\">Cyber City Gurgaon</strong> (approx. 15-25 minutes drive).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1904\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1904\">Near upcoming <strong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1903\">educational institutions, hospitals, and recreational hubs</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"2020\">Easy access to Delhi University South Campus, Dwarka Sector 21 Metro station, and other essential city amenities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2058\">6. <strong data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2058\">Investment Potential</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2358\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2170\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2170\">Dwarka Expressway is considered one of the <strong data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2140\">best investment corridors in NCR</strong> with high appreciation rates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2281\">Commercial properties and SCO plots in Sector 114 are witnessing strong demand from investors and end-users.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2358\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2358\">Ideal for long-term capital growth combined with attractive rental yields.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2363\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2409\">7. <strong data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2409\">Well-Planned Urban Infrastructure</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2653\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2563\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2563\">Sector 114 benefits from planned urban infrastructure&mdash;wide roads, landscaped green belts, efficient drainage, and uninterrupted power and water supply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2653\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2653\">Planned commercial and residential mix ensures balanced development and sustainability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"248\"><strong data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"248\">Market Trends Along Dwarka Expressway</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"300\">1. <strong data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"300\">Significant Property Price Appreciation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"736\">\r\n<li data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"522\">\r\n<p data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"522\"><strong data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"331\">Over the past five years</strong>, property prices along the Dwarka Expressway have surged by approximately <strong data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"414\">153%</strong>, reflecting the area\'s growing appeal among homebuyers and investors .</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"736\">\r\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"736\"><strong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"546\">From 2020 to 2024</strong>, average property rates have nearly doubled, increasing from ?9,000 per sq ft to ?18,000 per sq ft, driven by improved infrastructure and connectivity .</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"779\">2. <strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"779\">Robust Residential Development</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"1302\">\r\n<li data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<p data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"1030\">In 2023, a record <strong data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"824\">11,270 housing units</strong> were launched along the Dwarka Expressway corridor, accounting for 69% of the overall launches in Gurugram, indicating strong developer interest and market confidence .</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1302\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1302\">The <strong data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1076\">completion of the Dwarka Expressway</strong> has drastically reduced travel time between Delhi and Gurgaon, making sectors along the expressway, including Sector 114, highly desirable for both residential and commercial investments .</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1355\">3. <strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1355\">Enhanced Connectivity and Infrastructure</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1662\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1662\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1662\">The <strong data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1401\">completion of the Dwarka Expressway</strong>, along with the upcoming metro connectivity and the relocation of the Kherki Daula toll plaza, is expected to further boost accessibility and reduce commuting time, enhancing the attractiveness of properties in Sector 114 .</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1667\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1726\"><strong data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1726\">Investment Potential of Spaze Grand Central 114</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1757\">1. <strong data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1757\">Strategic Location</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1994\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1994\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1994\">Situated on the <strong data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1811\">75-meter-wide Dwarka Expressway</strong>, Sector 114 offers excellent connectivity to key areas such as IGI Airport, Cyber City, and NH-8, making it a prime location for commercial developments like Spaze Grand Central 114.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2025\">2. <strong data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2025\">High Rental Yields</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2207\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2207\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2207\">The surge in residential developments in the vicinity has increased the demand for retail and office spaces, leading to higher rental yields for commercial properties in the area.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2240\">3. <strong data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2240\">Capital Appreciation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2445\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2445\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2445\">Given the ongoing infrastructure developments and the area\'s transformation into a commercial hub, properties in Sector 114 are expected to experience continued capital appreciation in the coming years.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2479\">4. <strong data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2479\">Developer Credibility</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2671\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2671\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2671\">Developed by the renowned <strong data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2523\">Spaze Group</strong>, known for delivering quality projects on time, Spaze Grand Central 114 offers investors confidence in the project\'s execution and long-term value.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2676\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2702\"><strong data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2702\">Future Outlook</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"3315\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"3033\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"3033\">The <strong data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2759\">completion of pending infrastructure projects</strong>, including metro connectivity and arterial road improvements, is expected by 2026, further enhancing the corridor\'s accessibility and commercial attractiveness, potentially driving additional appreciation in commercial property values .</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3315\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3315\">As the commercial market matures, <strong data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3131\">rental yields are expected to stabilize at premium levels</strong>, while capital appreciation moderates to sustainable long-term rates, establishing the corridor as a stable, high-quality commercial destination .</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 9.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Geomanist, \'serif\';\">How to Purchase SCO Plots at Spaze Grand Central through A2P Realtech?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"183\">To purchase an SCO plot at <strong data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"94\">Spaze Grand Central 114</strong> in Sector 114, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon, through <strong data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"162\">A2P Realtech</strong>, follow these steps:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"188\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"226\">About Spaze Grand Central 114</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"803\">\r\n<li data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"282\">\r\n<p data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"282\"><strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"243\">Developer</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Spaze Group</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"336\">\r\n<p data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"336\"><strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"297\">Location</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Sector 114, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"394\">\r\n<p data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"394\"><strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"355\">Project Type</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Shop-Cum-Office (SCO) Plots</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"454\"><strong data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"413\">Size Options</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">66 to 160 sq. yds.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"610\">\r\n<p data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"610\"><strong data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"569\">Ownership</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Freehold with terrace rights</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"667\">\r\n<p data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"667\"><strong data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"626\">Structure</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Basement + Ground + 4 Floors + Terrace (DTCP approved)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"803\">\r\n<p data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"803\"><strong data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"683\">Amenities</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">24/7 security, ample parking, modern lifts, Wi-Fi, and more</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"837\">? Contact A2P Realtech</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"952\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A2P Realtech is a trusted real estate agency specializing in commercial properties in Gurgaon.</span> To initiate the purchase process:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1206\">\r\n<li data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1006\"><strong data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"965\">Visit</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><a href=\"../\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"47\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">A2P Realtech Website</a></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1058\"><strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1070\">Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:team@a2prealtech.com\">team@a2prealtech.com</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1206\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1206\"><strong data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1126\">WhatsApp</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Use the WhatsApp link on their website for instant messaging.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1211\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1237\">Steps to Purchase</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1342\"><strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1262\">Express Interest</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Contact A2P Realtech via phone, email, or WhatsApp to express your interest in purchasing an SCO plot at Spaze Grand Central 114.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1441\"><strong data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1361\">Site Visit</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Schedule a site visit to view the available plots and assess the location and amenities.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1541\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1541\"><strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1461\">Select Plot</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Choose the plot size and location that best suits your requirements.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1681\"><strong data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1563\">Documentation</strong>: Provide necessary documents, including ID proof, address proof, and PAN card.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1836\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1836\"><strong data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1699\">Agreement</strong>: Review and sign the sale agreement, which will outline the terms and conditions of the purchase.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1940\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1940\"><strong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1852\">Payment</strong>: Make the required payment as per the agreement.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"2071\"><strong data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1961\">Registration</strong>: Complete the registration process to transfer the property ownership.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2076\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2108\">&nbsp;Why Choose A2P Realtech?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2421\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2175\"><strong data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2125\">Expertise</strong>: Specialized in commercial properties in Gurgaon.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2232\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2232\"><strong data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2194\">Transparency</strong>: Clear and straightforward processes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2305\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2305\"><strong data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2246\">Support</strong>: Assistance at every step, from selection to registration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2421\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2421\"><strong data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2319\">Network</strong>: Strong relationships with developers and legal professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3505.1364538410844!2d77.00777977616184!3d28.535617988473984!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d112efb5c5a97%3A0xfc290ad779d311cb!2sGrand%20Central%20114!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1753867235843!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 114 on Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon.', '', '', '51EYXOCN', 20, 'Premium SCO Plots for Sale at Spaze Grand Central 114, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon', 'Spaze Grand Central 114, SCO plots in Gurgaon, SCO plots Dwarka Expressway, commercial plots in Sector 114 Gurgaon, shop cum office plots Gurgaon, Spaze SCO plots for sale, buy SCO plots Gurgaon, Dwarka Expressway commercial property, Spaze Group commercial projects, SCO plots near Delhi, premium SCO plots Gurgaon, SCO investment Gurgaon, commercial real estate Gurgaon', 'Unlock the future of business with Spaze Grand Central 114 – the most sought-after SCO (Shop-Cum-Office) plots on Dwarka Expressway.  Located in Sector 114, Gurgaon, right on the high-growth Dwarka Expressway corridor, Spaze Grand Central 114 offers a rare opportunity to own a freehold commercial plot in a fully integrated business district. Ideal for retail, office spaces, showrooms, and eateries – these premium SCO plots combine flexibility, visibility, and investment security.', NULL, NULL);
