nd=\"2308\">Security &amp; Smart Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2604\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2371\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2371\"><strong data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2341\">Multi-tier security system</strong> with 24x7 CCTV surveillance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2418\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2418\">Video door phone and <strong data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2416\">intercom facility</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2462\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2462\"><strong data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2460\">Boom barrier entry with RFID access</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2501\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2501\">Earthquake-resistant RCC structure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2558\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2558\">100% <strong data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2525\">power backup</strong> and uninterrupted water supply</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2604\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2604\">Treated water supply via <strong data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2604\">RO plant &amp; STP</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2658\"><strong data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2658\">Children &amp; Family-Focused Facilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2823\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2699\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2699\">Safe and secure <strong data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2697\">kids\' play zones</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2732\"><strong data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2718\">Toddler zone</strong> and sandpit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2785\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2785\">Weekend community events and workshops (planned)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2823\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2823\">Family picnic lawns and BBQ spots</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2870\">Unique Features That Set It Apart:</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"3113\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2921\">Low-density living: Only <strong data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2919\">2 units per floor</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2982\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2982\">Scenic <strong data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2945\">360&deg; views</strong> of water bodies and green expanses</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3016\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3016\">Over <strong data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3014\">80% open green space</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3063\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3063\"><strong data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3043\">Architectural design</strong> by ARCOP (Canada)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3113\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3113\"><strong data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3086\">Landscape design</strong> by M. Paul Friedberg (USA)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 279, '', '', '', '060825060917Vatika Sovereign Park Ph. 2 Brochure (1).pdf.pdf', '', '', '', '<h2 data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"330\"><strong data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"330\">Vatika Sovereign Park, Sector 99, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon &ndash; Luxury Residences with Panoramic Views and Premium Lifestyle Amenities</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"757\">Vatika Sovereign Park is a premium residential development located in <strong data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"424\">Sector 99, Gurgaon</strong>, strategically positioned on the rapidly growing <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"506\">Dwarka Expressway (NH-248BB)</strong>. Developed by <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"537\">Vatika Group</strong>, this high-end gated community offers a rare combination of <strong data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"683\">luxury living, expansive green spaces, panoramic views, and seamless connectivity</strong> to major urban hubs like <strong data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"756\">Delhi, IGI Airport, Cyber City, and Manesar</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"757\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"1332\">Spread over <strong data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"785\">10.3 acres</strong>, Vatika Sovereign Park features <strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"842\">low-density planning</strong> with just <strong data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"866\">312 units</strong> and <strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"904\">only two apartments per floor</strong>, offering residents privacy, exclusivity, and serenity. The project is surrounded by over <strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1035\">140 acres of uninterrupted open land</strong>, including <strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1109\">water bodies, landscaped greens, and low-rise developments</strong>, ensuring a permanent, scenic view from every home. Designed by <strong data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1192\">ARCOP (Canada)</strong> and landscaped by renowned architect <strong data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1262\">M. Paul Friedberg (New York)</strong>, the township sets new benchmarks in urban design and sustainability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1360\">Project Highlights:</h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 41.7989%; border-width: 1px; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; height: 93.3124px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50.0759%;\"><col style=\"width: 50.0759%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 26.1406px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; height: 26.1406px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>Inventory Type</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; height: 26.1406px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>Size in Squre Ft.</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; height: 22.3906px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">3 BHK + Servant Rooms</span></strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; height: 22.3906px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">2,670 Sq. Ft</span></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; height: 22.3906px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">4 BHK + Servant Rooms</span></strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; height: 22.3906px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">&nbsp;3,360 Sq. Ft</span></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; height: 22.3906px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">Premium Penthoused</span></strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; height: 22.3906px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">6,300 Sq. Ft.</span></strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1360\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1850\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1441\">Located on the <strong data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1399\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>, Gurgaon&rsquo;s most promising growth corridor</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1547\">Spacious <strong data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1502\">3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments with servant rooms</strong>, ranging from <strong data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1547\">2,670 sq.ft to 3,360 sq.ft</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1620\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1620\">Premium penthouses of <strong data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1592\">6,300 sq.ft</strong> with stunning skyline views</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1705\">Thoughtfully designed layouts with <strong data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1705\">maximum natural light and cross ventilation</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1783\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1783\"><strong data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1725\">80% open area</strong> with landscaped parks, central greens, and walking trails</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1850\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1850\">Grand entrance lobby, designer drop-off plaza, and modern fa&ccedil;ade</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1882\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1882\">Amenities &amp; Facilities:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"2008\">Vatika Sovereign Park offers a wide range of <strong data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1963\">world-class lifestyle amenities</strong>, curated for both relaxation and recreation:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2620\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2102\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2102\"><strong data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2031\">Luxury clubhouse</strong> with lounge, caf&eacute;, terrace garden, reading room, and co-working spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2167\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2167\"><strong data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2123\">Swimming pools</strong> (half-Olympic size for adults + kids&rsquo; pool)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2240\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2240\"><strong data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2188\">Fitness center</strong>, yoga/meditation room, and spa with sauna and salon</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2335\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2335\">Sports courts for <strong data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2283\">tennis, basketball</strong>, skating rink, jogging tracks, and kids&rsquo; play zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2420\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2420\">Landscaped gardens with <strong data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2380\">herbal gardens</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2400\">fruit orchards</strong>, and shaded seating</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2498\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2498\"><strong data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2441\">On-site retail</strong>, pharmacy, and grocery convenience store for daily needs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2620\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2620\">Smart features including <strong data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2548\">EV charging points</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2568\">parcel lockers</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2620\">multi-tier security with CCTV surveillance</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2653\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2653\">Location &amp; Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2804\">Situated in Sector 99, Gurgaon, Vatika Sovereign Park is part of a well-planned urban neighborhood with <strong data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2803\">excellent road, metro, and airport access</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"3206\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2888\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2888\">Directly on <strong data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2840\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> &ndash; connects Delhi to Gurgaon in under 20 minutes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"3025\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"3025\">Close proximity to <strong data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2925\">IGI Airport</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"2951\">Diplomatic Enclave 2</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2987\">Delhi Metro (Dwarka Sector 21)</strong>, and upcoming <strong data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3025\">Global City project</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3133\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3028\" data-end=\"3133\">Easy access to <strong data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3051\">NH-8</strong>, <strong data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3087\">Southern Peripheral Road (SPR)</strong>, <strong data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3107\">KMP Expressway</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3133\">Hero Honda Chowk</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3206\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3206\">Near upcoming <strong data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3158\">ISBT</strong>, schools, hospitals, malls, and commercial hubs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3246\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3246\">Investment &amp; Value Proposition:</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3247\" data-end=\"3401\">Vatika Sovereign Park stands out as a compelling investment opportunity for homebuyers and investors seeking long-term appreciation and premium lifestyle:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3759\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3480\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3506\">end-users</strong> looking for space, security, and high-end amenities in Gurgaon</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3661\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3661\">High rental potential due to proximity to <strong data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3661\">corporate offices, schools, and expressways</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3759\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3759\">Strong capital appreciation expected with <strong data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3745\">ongoing infrastructure developments</strong> in the region</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3800\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3761\" data-end=\"3800\">Why Choose Vatika Sovereign Park Sector 99 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"4134\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3897\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3897\">Developed by <strong data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3832\">Vatika Group</strong>, a trusted real estate brand with decades of delivery experience</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3972\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3972\"><strong data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3920\">Ready-to-move-in</strong> and nearing full occupancy &ndash; no construction delays</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3973\" data-end=\"4063\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3975\" data-end=\"4063\">Designed for modern families seeking <strong data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4063\">luxury, connectivity, and peaceful surroundings</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4134\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4066\" data-end=\"4134\">Low-density layout promotes <strong data-start=\"4094\" data-end=\"4134\">healthier, quieter, and safer living</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4136\" data-end=\"4139\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4141\" data-end=\"4169\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4141\" data-end=\"4169\">Ready to Make a Move?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4170\" data-end=\"4401\">Explore luxury living at Vatika Sovereign Park, Sector 99, Gurgaon. Contact us today to schedule a site visit, get updated pricing, or learn more about floor plans and payment plans. Your dream home on the Dwarka Expressway awaits!</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4170\" data-end=\"4401\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"248\">How to Book a Unit at Vatika Sovereign Park Through A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"522\">Booking your dream home at <strong data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"322\">Vatika Sovereign Park, Sector 99, Gurgaon</strong> through <strong data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"347\">A2P Realtech</strong> is a smooth and transparent process. A2P Realtech is a trusted channel partner for premium residential projects across Gurgaon, including properties on the Dwarka Expressway.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"559\">Step-by-Step Booking Process:</h3>\r\n<hr data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"564\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"597\"><strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"597\">1. Initial Consultation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"620\"><strong data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"618\">&nbsp;What Happens:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<li data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"721\">\r\n<p data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"721\">Speak to a certified <strong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"677\">A2P Realtech property advisor</strong> via call, WhatsApp, or in-person meeting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"816\">\r\n<p data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"816\">Share your requirements (budget, BHK type, view preference, floor, investment goal, etc.).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"871\">Receive <strong data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"859\">detailed project information</strong>, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<li data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"889\">Floor plans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"913\">\r\n<p data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"913\">Unit availability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"946\">\r\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"946\">Price list &amp; payment plans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"972\">\r\n<p data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"972\">Possession timeline</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"977\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1015\"><strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1015\">2. Site Visit / Virtual Tour</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1038\"><strong data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1036\">What Happens:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1293\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1137\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1137\">Schedule a <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1073\">guided site visit</strong> to Vatika Sovereign Park with an A2P Realtech representative.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1223\">For outstation or international buyers, a <strong data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1204\">virtual video tour</strong> can be arranged.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1293\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1293\">Review actual sample apartments, clubhouse, landscaping, and views.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1298\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1325\"><strong data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1325\">3. Unit Selection</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1348\"><strong data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1346\">&nbsp;What Happens:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1621\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1418\">Choose your preferred unit (tower, floor, facing, configuration).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1522\">Your A2P advisor will confirm <strong data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1477\">real-time availability</strong> and block the unit temporarily, if needed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1621\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1621\">Understand <strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1575\">PLC (Preferential Location Charges)</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1591\">floor rise</strong>, and any <strong data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1620\">discount offers</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1626\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1672\"><strong data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1672\">4. Application Form &amp; Booking Amount</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1695\"><strong data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1693\">What Happens:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"2086\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1759\">Fill out the <strong data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1739\">Booking/Application Form</strong> with KYC documents:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1774\">PAN card</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1801\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1801\">Aadhar card/passport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1827\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1827\">Passport-size photo</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1882\">Address proof (utility bill or rental agreement)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"2015\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1923\">Pay the <strong data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1911\">booking amount</strong>, typically:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"2015\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1964\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1964\">?5&ndash;10 Lakhs (depending on unit size)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2015\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2015\">Payment modes: Cheque, DD, NEFT/RTGS, or UPI</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2086\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2086\">A2P Realtech will issue a <strong data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2063\">Booking Receipt</strong> on builder letterhead.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2091\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2140\"><strong data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2140\">5. Allotment Letter &amp; Agreement to Sell</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2163\"><strong data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2161\">What Happens:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2429\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2259\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2259\">Within 15&ndash;30 days, Vatika Group will issue an <strong data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2232\">Allotment Letter</strong> confirming unit details.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2335\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2335\">You&rsquo;ll be guided through the <strong data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2324\">Builder Buyer Agreement (BBA)</strong> process.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2429\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2429\">Legal team available to assist with any <strong data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2403\">document verification</strong> or <strong data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2428\">loan coordination</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2434\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2478\"><strong data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2478\">6. Home Loan Assistance (Optional)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2501\"><strong data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2499\">What Happens:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2640\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2640\">If required, A2P Realtech will connect you with <strong data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2581\">approved banking partners</strong> for fast loan processing (HDFC, ICICI, SBI, Axis, etc.).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2657\">Get help with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2686\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2686\">Loan eligibility check</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2713\">Document preparation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2750\">Sanction &amp; disbursement tracking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2755\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2797\"><strong data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2797\">7. Payment Schedule &amp; Possession</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2820\"><strong data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2818\">What Happens:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"3114\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2914\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2914\">Follow the agreed <strong data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2864\">Construction Linked</strong> or <strong data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2889\">Down Payment Plan</strong> as per your selection.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2917\" data-end=\"2953\">A2P Realtech keeps you updated with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2974\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2974\">Demand letters</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"2997\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"2997\">Progress reports</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3024\">Possession timelines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3114\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3114\">Upon completion, assist with <strong data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3073\">final payment</strong>, <strong data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3091\">registration</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3113\">key handover</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3119\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3159\">&nbsp;Documents Required for Booking:</h3>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border