a-start=\"650\" data-end=\"680\">\r\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"680\">Jogging and cycling tracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"720\">\r\n<p data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"720\">Indoor games room (TT, chess, carrom)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"725\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"756\">Outdoor &amp; Green Living</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"976\">\r\n<li data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"795\">\r\n<p data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"795\">Landscaped gardens with 700+ trees</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"833\">\r\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"833\">Walking trails &amp; reflexology path</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"872\">Water bodies &amp; central green court</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"903\">\r\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"903\">Pet park &amp; sensory gardens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"951\">\r\n<p data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"951\">Car-free ground level for safety &amp; serenity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"976\">\r\n<p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"976\">Outdoor amphitheatre</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"981\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1027\">Community &amp; Family Amenities</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1068\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1068\">Children&rsquo;s play area &amp; activity room</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1107\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1107\">Toddler pool and kids\' splash zone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1146\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1146\">Intergenerational community spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1193\">Celebration lawns &amp; social gathering zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1227\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1227\">Mini theatre / screening room</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1256\">Art, music &amp; hobby rooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1293\">Convenience &amp; Services</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1510\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1345\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1345\">In-house retail plaza (grocery, pharmacy, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1381\">Caf&eacute;, deli &amp; co-working lounges</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1423\">Concierge desk &amp; parcel delivery zone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1446\">EV charging points</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1471\">High-speed elevators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1510\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1510\">24/7 power backup and water supply</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1515\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1546\">Safety &amp; Smart Living</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1751\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1587\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1587\">Smart home automation (select units)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1609\">Video door phones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1643\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1643\">Multi-tier security with CCTV</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1673\">Access-controlled lobbies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1714\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1714\">Fire detection &amp; suppression systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1751\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1751\">Basement and stilt-level parking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 298, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2 data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"337\">Max Estate 360: Premium 3 &amp; 4 BHK Flats on Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"751\">Max Estate 360 (also called Max Estates 360) is a new luxury residential project by <strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"452\">Max Estates</strong>, located in <strong data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"479\">Sector 36A</strong> along the <strong data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"511\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>, Gurugram. This development is being promoted as an <em data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"591\">inter?generational living</em> community, combining high?end homes, wellness features, modern amenities, senior?living options, and strong connectivity.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"789\">Product / Apartment Details</h3>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\r\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" style=\"width: 78.3069%; height: 201.5px;\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"817\">\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"817\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1001%; height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"807\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Specification</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.164%; height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"817\" data-col-size=\"lg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Detail</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1001%; height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"848\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"847\">Type of units</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.164%; height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"938\" data-col-size=\"lg\">3BHK and 4?BHK flats (also some &ldquo;3.5 BHK&rdquo; etc.)&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1086\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1001%; height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"951\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"950\">Sizes</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.164%; height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"1086\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Ranges from about <strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"986\">2,500 sq.ft</strong> up to ~ <strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1010\">3,500 sq.ft</strong> super built?up for 3 &amp; 4 BHK units.&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\" data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1217\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1001%; height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1108\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1107\">Starting Price</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.164%; height: 22.3906px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1217\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Details available on Request</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 44.7812px;\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1001%; height: 44.7812px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1246\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1245\">Project area &amp; Layout</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.164%; height: 44.7812px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1414\">Approximately <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1274\">14 acres</strong>, with six high?rise towers. Two towers are dedicated to <strong data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1348\">senior living</strong> under the &ldquo;Antara&rdquo; brand.&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 44.7656px;\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1001%; height: 44.7656px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1443\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1442\">Total Towers</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.164%; height: 44.7656px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1554\">6 &amp; Unit: 1000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1001%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; height: 22.3906px;\"><strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1442\">Greenery</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.164%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; height: 22.3906px;\">9 Acres of Land with Greenery</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1001%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\"><strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1442\">Healthcare</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.164%; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\">Modern Healthcare Club</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2094\"><strong data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2094\">Unit Configurations &amp; Sizes</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2476\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2210\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2210\">3 BHK flats typically from ~ <strong data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2151\">2,500 to 2,800 sq.ft</strong> depending on type. (3 BHK + Staff &amp; Store &amp; 3 BHK + Spacious)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2330\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2330\">4 BHK flats are larger: ~ <strong data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2254\">3,500 sq.ft</strong> (for 4 BHK + staff / service room).&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2476\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2476\">Some units include staff room / service room / home office space, separate entries for staff/storage.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2503\"><strong data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2503\">Design &amp; Architecture</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"3137\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2783\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2783\">The architectural style uses a blend of traditional Indian elements (red brick, terracotta facades, jaali?inspired patterns) with modern design sensibilities. These design features help with ventilation, natural light, and aesthetics.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2937\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2937\">Each home has wraparound balconies / decks, which provide scenic views, more daylight, and cross?ventilation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"3137\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"3137\">Car?free ground design: underground parking / separation of vehicular traffic so that the ground level is safe for seniors, kids, and walking / play areas.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3174\"><strong data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3174\">Certifications &amp; Sustainability</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3610\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3402\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3402\">The community is <strong data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3226\">IGBC Platinum pre certified</strong>, which is a top level in sustainability ratings. This means attention to energy efficiency, water management, green landscaping, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3610\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3610\">There are 700+ trees across ~33 species, landscaped gardens, lake/water features, winding walking trails etc., to bring in green aesthetics and ecological balance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3615\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3651\">Amenities &amp; Lifestyle Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3802\">The project promises a large spread of amenities aimed at enhancing lifestyle, wellness, community interaction, and comfort. Here are the major ones:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3804\" data-end=\"5199\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3804\" data-end=\"4032\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"4032\"><strong data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3822\">Clubhouse(s)</strong>: Large clubhouse(s) covering ~100,000 sq.ft. called &ldquo;The Hub&rdquo; (or similarly branded), with facilities like gym, lounge, arcade, co working / social spaces, delis, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4234\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4234\"><strong data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4055\">Sports &amp; Outdoor</strong>: Tennis, badminton, padel courts; cricket pitch / practice nets; jogging and cycling tracks; outdoor green parks; pet park; senior park.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4235\" data-end=\"4391\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4391\"><strong data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4255\">Swimming Pools</strong>: Including temperature controlled indoor pool, possibly toddlers&rsquo; pool, outdoor pool options.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4392\" data-end=\"4665\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4394\" data-end=\"4665\"><strong data-start=\"4394\" data-end=\"4434\">Children &amp; Senior Specific Amenities</strong>: Children&rsquo;s play areas, kids&rsquo; den, safe play zones; for seniors there are residences under Antara, healthcare support (physiotherapy, consulting doctors etc.), engagement areas for elders.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4666\" data-end=\"4816\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4816\"><strong data-start=\"4668\" data-end=\"4687\">Health &amp; Safety</strong>: Primary healthcare amenities inside the project, emergency response, safety features.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4817\" data-end=\"4978\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4819\" data-end=\"4978\"><strong data-start=\"4819\" data-end=\"4852\">Convenience Retail &amp; Services</strong>: Community plaza / conveniences like grocery, pharmacy, salons, possibly caf&eacute;/deli.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4979\" data-end=\"5199\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4981\" data-end=\"5199\"><strong data-start=\"4981\" data-end=\"5000\">Luxury Finishes</strong>: Modular kitchens, premium flooring (marble, etc.), high end fixtures, smart and home automation in some units (lighting, AC, fans controlled via app etc.).&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5201\" data-end=\"5204\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"5234\" data-end=\"5594\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5493\" data-end=\"5594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5495\" data-end=\"5594\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5601\" data-end=\"5624\">Possession &amp; Status</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5626\" data-end=\"5894\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5626\" data-end=\"5755\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5628\" data-end=\"5755\">The project is under development. It is a new launch (bookings open) as of 2024/2025.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5756\" data-end=\"5894\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5758\" data-end=\"5894\">Possession for certain units (particularly 4 BHK) is estimated around <strong data-start=\"5828\" data-end=\"5843\">August 2030</strong> onwards.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5896\" data-end=\"5899\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5901\" data-end=\"5953\">What Sets It Apart (Unique Selling Propositions)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5955\" data-end=\"7223\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5955\" data-end=\"6333\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5957\" data-end=\"6333\"><strong data-start=\"5957\" data-end=\"5989\">Inter generational community</strong>: Not only are there luxury flats, but dedicated senior living residences (Antara) are integrated, meaning special designs and services (healthcare, amenities) to support elders. This makes it suitable for families wanting to live together across generations while maintaining comfort, safety, privacy.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6334\" data-end=\"6671\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6336\" data-end=\"6671\"><strong data-start=\"6336\" data-end=\"6377\">Design blending tradition &amp; modernity</strong>: Use of jaali patterns, red brick / terracotta on facades etc., wraparound balconies, courtyards. These not only give aesthetic appeal, but better lighting, ventilation. The architecture claims to embrace local heritage elements while being luxurious.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6672\" data-end=\"6957\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6674\" data-end=\"6957\"><strong data-start=\"6674\" data-end=\"6700\">Car?free ground design</strong>: Vehicular traffic is underground or relegated so that the ground level is safer and more pedestrian friendly. Particularly beneficial for children, seniors, and people wishing for more green, open walkable spaces.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6958\" data-end=\"7223\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6960\" data-end=\"7223\"><strong data-start=\"6960\" data-end=\"6990\">Sustainability credentials</strong>: IGBC Platinum pre certified, large number of trees, green landscape, water features, efficient design. This appeals to modern buyers focusing on environment and long term operational costs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7225\" data-end=\"7228\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7230\" data-end=\"7254\">Target Buyer Profile</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7256\" data-end=\"7282\"><strong>Max Estate 360 appeals to:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7284\" data-end=\"7838\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7284\" data-end=\"7357\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7286\" data-end=\"7357\">Affluent families wanting large, premium homes with spacious designs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7358\" data-end=\"7474\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7360\" data-end=\"7474\">Multi?generation households (parents, in Laws, kids) because of senior?living aspects integrated in the project.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7475\" data-end=\"7571\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7477\" data-end=\"7571\">Buyers who value wellness, green living, sustainability, ample amenities, high?end finishes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7572\" data-end=\"7682\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7574\" data-end=\"7682\">Professionals who prefer homes with luxury, quiet, good connectivity, yet not deep inside congested areas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7683\" data-end=\"7838\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7685\" data-end=\"7838\">Investors who believe in long term appreciation along the Dwarka Expressway corridor &mdash; considering the brand, location, demand for high?quality luxury.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7840\" data-end=\"7843\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7845\" data-end=\"7877\">Pros &amp; Cons / Considerations</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7879\" data-end=\"7888\"><strong data-start=\"7879\" data-end=\"7888\">Pros:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"7890\" data-end=\"8420\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7890\" data-end=\"8045\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7893\" data-end=\"8045\"><strong data-start=\"7893\" data-end=\"7926\">Prime location &amp; connectivity</strong>: Dwarka Expressway is developing fast; proximity to highways, metro proposals, business hubs adds significant value.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8046\" data-end=\"8139\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8049\" data-end=\"8139\"><strong data-start=\"8049\" data-end=\"8071\">High amenity value</strong>: Extensive facilities, clubhouse, sports blocks, healthcare, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8140\" data-end=\"8243\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8143\" data-end=\"8243\"><strong data-start=\"8143\" data-end=\"8162\">Luxury &amp; design</strong>: Premium units, good finishes, wraparound balconies, architectural aesthetics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8244\" data-end=\"8338\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8247\" data-end=\"8338\"><strong data-start=\"8247\" data-end=\"8271\">Green / eco features</strong>: Sustainability, minimal ground traffic, ample open/green areas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8339\" data-end=\"8420\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8342\" data-end=\"8420\"><strong data-start=\"8342\" data-end=\"8370\">Integrated senior living</strong>: Unique feature not many projects do this well.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"8422\" data-end=\"8450\"><strong data-start=\"8422\" data-end=\"8450\">Risks / Things to Check:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"8452\" data-end=\"9103\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8452\" data-end=\"8613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8455\" data-end=\"8613\"><strong data-start=\"8455\" data-end=\"8468\">High cost</strong>: Premium pricing may be a barrier; also &ldquo;on request&rdquo; for many units, so actual rate for higher floor, better facing can be substantially more.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8614\" data-end=\"8806\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8617\" data-end=\"8806\"><strong data-start=\"8617\" data-end=\"8638\">Possession delays</strong>: With big luxury projects, there is always risk of delays due to labour, supply chain, approvals etc. August 2030 is not close. Buyers need to verify current status.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8807\" data-end=\"8960\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8810\" data-end=\"8960\"><strong data-start=\"8810\" data-end=\"8841\">Maintenance &amp; running costs</strong>: Big amenities and luxury finishes mean higher ongoing maintenance charges, service charges, electricity, staff etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8961\" data-end=\"9103\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8964\" data-end=\"9103\"><strong data-start=\"8964\" data-end=\"9003\">Traffic &amp; infrastructure dependency</strong>: The value depends on how well the expressway / metro / road infrastructure develops on schedule.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9105\" data-end=\"9108\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"9110\" data-end=\"9134\">Investment Potential</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9136\" data-end=\"9740\">\r\n<li data-start=\"9136\" data-end=\"9355\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9138\" data-end=\"9355\">The Dwarka Expressway corridor is one of the fastest growing real estate zones in Gurgaon / NCR. Good infrastructure investment, proposed metro alignment, increasing demand for luxury homes gives a positive outlook.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9356\" data-end=\"9487\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9358\" data-end=\"9487\">Being a premium launch by established developer enhances credibility and reduces risk compared to smaller / unknown developers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9488\" data-end=\"9593\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9490\" data-end=\"9593\">High per sq.ft rates mean higher investment, but potential appreciation is also high if demand holds.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9594\" data-end=\"9740\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9596\" data-end=\"9740\">Resale value in such luxury brackets tends to be more sensitive to amenities, delivery timelines, brand, and exact unit (floor, facing, etc.).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9742\" data-end=\"9745\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9760\" data-end=\"10287\">Max Estate 360 (Estate 360) is one of the flagship luxury residential developments in Gurgaon, especially for those looking for spacious, high?end 3 &amp; 4 BHK homes. More than just apartments, it aims to be a lifestyle community &mdash; combining wellness, senior living, architectural beauty, modern luxury finishes, green landscaping, and excellent connectivity. If you are seeking a premium home that offers both comfort and prestige, plus the promise of long term value, this project is designed to meet exactly those expectations.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"10289\" data-end=\"10508\">However, because of its premium nature, it requires careful consideration of cost, delivery schedule, maintenance charges, and real?possibility of those luxury amenities being delivered as promised. Always advisable to:</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1733\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4543\">Who Should Buy This</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4899\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4644\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4547\" data-end=\"4644\">Families looking for luxurious, spacious flats in Gurgaon and who can invest at the higher end.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4645\" data-end=\"4719\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4719\">Buyers who value good amenities, wellness features, designer finishes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4720\" data-end=\"4821\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4722\" data-end=\"4821\">Elderly or people looking for inter?generational living (senior care / senior?friendly features).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4822\" data-end=\"4899\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4824\" data-end=\"4899\">Investors aiming for appreciation / capital growth along Dwarka Expressway.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"144\">Book Your Dream Home Today</strong><br data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"147\">Interested in luxury living at <strong data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"196\">MAX Estate 360</strong>, Sector 36A, Gurgaon?<br data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"221\"><strong data-start=\"224\" data-end=\"257\">Contact the A2P Realtech Team</strong> now to get floor plans, pricing, and site visit assistance.<br data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"320\">Limited units available &ndash; Secure your 3 or 4 BHK apartment today!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d14035.678687881316!2d76.9442691871582!3d28.421680600000002!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d178a86b5ae6f%3A0x99f9b67e04618c25!2sEstate%20360%20by%20Max%20Estates!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1760428028717!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', 'Land Area 14 Acres', 'Max Sector 36A Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'JA5T7CNS', 19, 'Max Sector 36A Gurgaon – Premium 3 & 4 BHK Flats on Dwarka Expressway', 'Max Estate 360 Gurgaon, Max Sector 36A Dwarka Expressway, Max Estate 360 3 BHK Flats, ,4 BHK Apartments Dwarka Expressway, Luxury Flats in Gurgaon, Max Estates Sector 36A  Antara Senior Living Gurgaon  Premium residential projects in Gurgaon  Buy property on Dwarka Expressway  Luxury apartments near IGI Airport,  Max Estates, Dwarka Expressway launch,  Intergenerational living Gurgaon', 'Discover luxury 3 & 4 BHK flats at Max Estate 360, Sector 36A, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon. Premium homes with world-class amenities & senior living options.', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(228, 'Your Dream Home Awaits 2 to 5 BHK Luxury Apartments in Tashee Capital Gateway', '20251016170741_Dream-Home-Tashee-Capital-Gateway-Sector-111-Dwarka-Expressway-Gurgaon.jpg', '<p><strong>Amenities:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Residents of Tashee Capital Gateway can enjoy a range of amenities designed for comfort and recreation:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Sports Facilities:</strong>&nbsp;Tennis courts and other sports amenities promote an active lifestyle.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Children\'s Play Area:</strong>&nbsp;Dedicated zones ensure a safe and engaging environment for children.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Power Backup:</strong>&nbsp;100% power backup ensures uninterrupted electricity supply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Water Supply:</strong>&nbsp;Round-the-clock water supply is maintained for residents\' convenience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Parking:</strong>&nbsp;Ample car parking space is available for residents and visitors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Location Advantages:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Strategically located along the Dwarka Expressway, Tashee Capital Gateway offers excellent connectivity and proximity to key destinations:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Proximity to Delhi:</strong>&nbsp;The project is approximately 2.4 km from Dwarka Metro Station, providing easy access to the capital city.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Airport Access:</strong>&nbsp;Indira Gandhi International Airport is conveniently accessible, facilitating convenient travel.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Expressway Connectivity:</strong>&nbsp;The 150-meter-wide Dwarka Expressway enhances connectivity to various parts of Gurgaon and Delhi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Educational Institutions:</strong>&nbsp;Reputed schools like GLOBAL SCHOOL, Mount School, and Indra Public School are in close proximity, ensuring quality education options for families.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Healthcare Facilities:</strong>&nbsp;Nearby hospitals provide prompt medical assistance and healthcare services.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Commercial Hubs:</strong>&nbsp;The project\'s location offers easy access to Gurgaon\'s major commercial and business centers, making it convenient for professionals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 326, '', '', '', '20251016171412_Capital_Gateway_Brochure_A2P_Reatech.pdf', '', '', '', '<h2 data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"664\">Luxury Flats Available in Tashee Capital Gateway, Sector 111</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"1425\">In the competitive real?estate landscape of Gurgaon, <em data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"761\">Tashee Capital Gateway</em> in Sector 111 (Dwarka Expressway) stands out as a signature project that promises not just a home, but a high?end lifestyle. Spread across approximately <strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"929\">10.5 acres</strong>, the project offers a mix of <strong data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"999\">2, 3, 4, and 5 BHK luxury apartments</strong>, combining architectural elegance, premium amenities, and a location that gives you both connectivity and prestige. But like many large residential projects in NCR, it also comes with its share of complexities&mdash;especially in terms of abiding by delivery timelines. This article explores everything: the unit types, pricing, amenities, location advantages, pros &amp; cons, and what homebuyers should keep in mind before investing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1452\">Project Overview</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1580\"><strong data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1469\">Developer</strong>: Tashee Group &mdash; a well known name in the Delhi NCR real estate market.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1793\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1793\"><strong data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1595\">Location</strong>: Sector 111, Gurgaon, along the Dwarka Expressway. This is a prime region given its proximity to the Delhi border, IGI Airport, NH?8 and key hubs in Gurgaon.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1869\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1869\"><strong data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1809\">Land Area</strong>: ~10.46 to10.5 acres.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"2021\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"2021\"><strong data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1901\">Number of Towers &amp; Floors</strong>: 10 high rise towers, each tower with ~18 floors (G + 17) in many descriptions.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2117\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2117\"><strong data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2043\">Number of Units</strong>: About <strong data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2076\">550 luxury apartments</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2297\"><strong data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2143\">Open Space &amp; Layout</strong>: ~60 to 70% of the project is open / landscaped green space; wide balconies, natural light, well?ventilated layouts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 949px; margin-left: 0.3pt; border: 1pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"949\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 176.75px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt; background-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" width=\"159\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Project Name</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 168.984px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt; background-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" width=\"152\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Developer</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 146.688px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt; background-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" width=\"132\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Possession Start</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 137.891px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt; background-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" width=\"124\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Unit Type</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.109px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt; background-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Unit Sizes (sq ft)</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 144.297px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt; background-color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Types of Projects</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 30.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 176.75px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"159\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tashee Capital Gateway-111</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 168.984px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"152\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Tashee Group</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 146.688px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"132\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2026</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 137.891px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"124\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Phase I(3 BHK)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Phase I(4 BHK)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Phase-II (5 BHK)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 155.109px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">1695-2359</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2675-2990</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">3735</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 144.297px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0.75pt; height: 30.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"130\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Ready to Move</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4332\" data-end=\"4356\">Amenities &amp; Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4358\" data-end=\"4517\">What truly defines &ldquo;luxury&rdquo; in a project is not just size, but what you get <em data-start=\"4434\" data-end=\"4442\">around</em> it. Tashee Capital Gateway offers a good suite of amenities. Key features:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"5279\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"4654\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4521\" data-end=\"4654\"><strong data-start=\"4521\" data-end=\"4553\">Clubhouse &amp; Community Spaces</strong>: Multipurpose banquet halls, spaces for social gatherings.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4655\" data-end=\"4806\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4657\" data-end=\"4806\"><strong data-start=\"4657\" data-end=\"4680\">Sports &amp; Recreation</strong>: Indoor &amp; outdoor courts (badminton, tennis, basketball), swimming pool, gymnasium.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4807\" data-end=\"4968\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4809\" data-end=\"4968\"><strong data-start=\"4809\" data-end=\"4832\">Green &amp; Open Spaces</strong>: Large landscaped gardens, jogging/cycling tracks, yoga/meditation zones. Over 60% open area.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"5134\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4971\" data-end=\"5134\"><strong data-start=\"4971\" data-end=\"4995\">Utilities &amp; Security</strong>: Full power backup, water supply backup, CCTV, gated access, intercom systems, high speed lifts.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5135\" data-end=\"5279\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5137\" data-end=\"5279\"><strong data-start=\"5137\" data-end=\"5155\">Other Features</strong>: Wide balconies, modular kitchens, Vastu?compliant layout, well ventilated units.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5281\" data-end=\"5284\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5324\">Connectivity &amp; Location Advantages</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5326\" data-end=\"5405\">One of the strong selling points of Tashee Capital Gateway is its connectivity:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5407\" data-end=\"5953\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5407\" data-end=\"5589\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5409\" data-end=\"5589\"><strong data-start=\"5409\" data-end=\"5430\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>: This new corridor provides excellent access to both Delhi and Gurgaon, and helps reduce travel times significantly.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5590\" data-end=\"5799\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5592\" data-end=\"5799\"><strong data-start=\"5592\" data-end=\"5641\">Proximity to IGI Airport &amp; Diplomatic Enclave</strong>: Many listings note how it&rsquo;s just minutes away from these hubs, which is valuable for frequent flyers or officials.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5800\" data-end=\"5953\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5802\" data-end=\"5953\"><strong data-start=\"5802\" data-end=\"5864\">Access to NH?8, Metro Stations, Schools, Hospitals &amp; Malls</strong>: All essential services are within easy reach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5955\" data-end=\"5958\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5960\" data-end=\"6012\">Price Trends, Market Position &amp; Resale Potential</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6014\" data-end=\"6754\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6199\" data-end=\"6335\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6201\" data-end=\"6335\">Units are listed both <strong data-start=\"6223\" data-end=\"6240\">ready to move</strong> and <strong data-start=\"6245\" data-end=\"6267\">under construction</strong> depending on tower/phase.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6336\" data-end=\"6521\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6338\" data-end=\"6521\">There is resale market activity, especially for premium units &ndash; those with large area, good floors, better views / orientation are in demand.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6522\" data-end=\"6754\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6524\" data-end=\"6754\">Appreciation potential is considered strong given the strategic location, future infrastructure (expressways, metros etc.), and scarcity of large, high-quality flats in that price bracket.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6756\" data-end=\"6759\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6761\" data-end=\"6781\">Concerns &amp; Risks</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6783\" data-end=\"6869\">No property is perfect. Here are the drawbacks / risks that buyers should be aware of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6871\" data-end=\"7889\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6871\" data-end=\"7137\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6873\" data-end=\"7137\"><strong data-start=\"6873\" data-end=\"6896\">Delay in possession</strong>: One of the biggest issues. The project was launched around <strong data-start=\"6957\" data-end=\"6965\">2010</strong>, expected completion ~2015, but there have been serious delays. As of 2023, Phase 1 was about 60% complete and Phase?2 about 40%.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7138\" data-end=\"7317\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7140\" data-end=\"7317\">Buyers have staged protests, sought legal redress via HARERA, citing delayed delivery despite full/near full payments to the developer.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7318\" data-end=\"7511\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7320\" data-end=\"7511\">Amenities promised may not yet be fully operational / completed in many towers. Buyers should verify which amenities are ready and which are pending.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7512\" data-end=\"7664\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7514\" data-end=\"7664\">Because of the delays, many existing buyers are paying EMI + rent simultaneously, an additional cost burden.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7665\" data-end=\"7889\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7667\" data-end=\"7889\">Buyers should carefully review the builder&rsquo;s sales agreement: what is promised, what is the penalty for delay, whether the flat is truly &ldquo;ready to move&rdquo; and if occupancy certificates (OC) are in place or being processed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7891\" data-end=\"7894\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7896\" data-end=\"7927\">What to Check Before Buying</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7929\" data-end=\"8008\">Here are practical steps / checkpoints to ensure you make an informed decision:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"8010\" data-end=\"8894\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8010\" data-end=\"8112\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8013\" data-end=\"8112\"><strong data-start=\"8013\" data-end=\"8031\">Visit the site</strong>: See the actual towers, check what&rsquo;s built vs what&rsquo;s promised in the brochure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8113\" data-end=\"8246\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8116\" data-end=\"8246\"><strong data-start=\"8116\" data-end=\"8135\">OC / Compliance</strong>: Ensure the flat you buy has (or will soon get) the Occupancy Certificate, approvals from local authorities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8247\" data-end=\"8479\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8250\" data-end=\"8479\"><strong data-start=\"8250\" data-end=\"8277\">Check RERA registration</strong>: The project is RERA registered; get the RERA number for your specific tower/unit. Understand the developer&rsquo;s obligation to pay interest on delayed possession.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8480\" data-end=\"8639\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8483\" data-end=\"8639\"><strong data-start=\"8483\" data-end=\"8517\">Confirm readiness of amenities</strong>: Which facilities are already working vs which are in future plans. This affects both quality of life and resale value.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8640\" data-end=\"8786\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8643\" data-end=\"8786\"><strong data-start=\"8643\" data-end=\"8675\">Evaluate resale/rental yield</strong>: Bigger flats (4 &amp; 5 BHK) are premium and less frequent; good resale potential, but also higher holding costs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8787\" data-end=\"8894\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8790\" data-end=\"8894\"><strong data-start=\"8790\" data-end=\"8805\">Legal terms</strong>: Examine agreement for sale, payment schedule, buyer protections, penalty clauses etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"278\">To &ldquo;book a unit through A2P Realtech&rdquo; for <em data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"79\">Tashee Capital Gateway &ndash; Sector 111</em>, here&rsquo;s a step?by?step guide + things to verify &amp; sample outreach message. I couldn&rsquo;t confirm a direct listing for Tashee Capital Gateway via A2P Realtech, so you will need to coordinate and verify.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"286\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"337\">Step by Step: Booking Process via A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"454\">Here is a typical workflow when booking a residential unit through a real estate channel partner like A2P Realtech:</p>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\r\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"2663\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"500\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"500\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"463\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Step</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"472\" data-col-size=\"md\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Action</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"500\" data-col-size=\"lg\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>What You Should Do / Ask</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"2663\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"773\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"540\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"539\">1. Initial Contact</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"626\" data-col-size=\"md\">Reach out to A2P Realtech expressing interest in Tashee Capital Gateway, Sector 111</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"773\">Use their official contact via phone, email, or website. Give details: project name, unit type (2/3/4/5 BHK), your budget, preferred floor/wing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"796\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"795\">2. Verification</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"886\" data-col-size=\"md\">Confirm whether A2P is an authorized channel partner / broker for this specific project</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"971\">Ask for proof (agreement with Tashee Group, listing of the project on A2P&rsquo;s site)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1178\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1007\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1006\">3. Site Visit &amp; Unit Options</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1084\" data-col-size=\"md\">A2P should arrange for you to see the site, model flats, unit availability</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1178\">Attend the site visit, inspect construction, amenities, neighboring towers, infrastructure</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1210\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1209\">4. Select Unit &amp; Pricing</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1309\">Choose the particular flat (tower, floor, facing) and confirm price, payment plan, extra charges</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1410\">Ask for a written price sheet, orientation, additional costs (parking, club membership, tax, GST)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1608\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1449\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1448\">5. Documentation / Booking Form</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1532\">Fill in the booking form, submit identity proof, address proof, PAN, photos etc.</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1608\">Check all fields carefully: buyer name, unit number, plan, timeline etc.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1781\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1649\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1648\">6. Booking Amount / Token Payment</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1704\">Pay the token / advance amount to secure the booking</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1781\">Get a receipt / acknowledgment. Usually 5&ndash;10% or a token amount is taken.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1985\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1813\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1812\">7. Allotment &amp; Agreement</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1896\" data-col-size=\"md\">After booking, you will get an allotment letter and then sign the Sale Agreement</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1985\">Carefully read the agreement: possession date, penalty for delay, specifications etc.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2012\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2011\">8. Payment Schedule</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2110\">Pay subsequent installments per the pre?agreed schedule (construction linked, time linked etc.)</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2208\">Keep records of each payment. Request payment receipts, update schedule, site progress reports</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2421\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2251\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2250\">9. Follow?up &amp; Construction Updates</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2340\">A2P should give periodic updates, photos, site visits, and coordinate with the builder</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2421\">Track development status, completion of amenities, structural work, interiors</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2663\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2454\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2453\">10. Possession &amp; Handover</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2545\" data-col-size=\"md\">On completion, pay the remaining balance, sign handover documents, complete registration</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2663\">Inspect the flat, check defects, ensure occupancy certificate (OC) is in place, register the property in your name</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4955\" data-end=\"5023\">&nbsp;</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3505.739951724295!2d77.02781207616135!3d28.517470689295134!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1a1ee24e1803%3A0x6e3b2f439d02e0b9!2sCapital%20Gateway!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!', '', '', '', 'Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'PABN8UAH', 19, 'Your Dream Home Awaits: 2 to 5 BHK Luxury Apartments in Tashee Capital Gateway, Sector 111 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Tashee Capital Gateway, Capital Gateway Sector 111, Tashee Group Gurgaon, Sector 111 Gurgaon projects, Dwarka Expressway apartments, luxury flats Gurgaon, 2 BHK in Sector 111, 3 BHK Tashee Capital Gateway, Tashee Capital Gateway possession status, RERA approved projects Gurgaon, Tashee Capital Gateway price, ready to move flats Sector 111, Gurgaon real estate projects, new residential projects Dwarka Expressway', 'Explore Tashee Capital Gateway in Sector 111, Gurgaon – a luxury residential project on Dwarka Expressway offering spacious 2, 3, 4 & 5 BHK apartments with premium amenities. Check floor plans, prices, possession updates, and RERA status.', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(229, 'Elan Imperial Sector 82 Gurgaon A New Benchmark in Luxury Commercial Real Estate', '20251121181039_Elan-Imperial-Sector-82-Investment-Plan.jpg', '<p data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4754\"><strong data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4754\">Amenities &amp; Features</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4836\">Elan Imperial promises a high-end commercial experience with top-tier amenities:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4838\" data-end=\"5725\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4838\" data-end=\"4965\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4840\" data-end=\"4965\"><strong data-start=\"4840\" data-end=\"4857\">24&times;7 security</strong> and multi-tier security systems to ensure safety and exclusivity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4966\" data-end=\"5086\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4968\" data-end=\"5086\"><strong data-start=\"4968\" data-end=\"4989\">Full power backup</strong>, so operations won&rsquo;t be disrupted even during outages.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5087\" data-end=\"5229\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5089\" data-end=\"5229\"><strong data-start=\"5089\" data-end=\"5134\">High-speed escalators and smart elevators</strong> for smooth vertical movement across multiple floors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5230\" data-end=\"5358\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5232\" data-end=\"5358\"><strong data-start=\"5232\" data-end=\"5249\">Ample parking</strong>, spread across multiple levels for both shoppers and hotel guests.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5359\" data-end=\"5487\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5361\" data-end=\"5487\"><strong data-start=\"5361\" data-end=\"5417\">Landscaped plazas, water bodies or serene open areas</strong> to enhance the luxury feel.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5488\" data-end=\"5594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5490\" data-end=\"5594\"><strong data-start=\"5490\" data-end=\"5520\">Concierge / valet services</strong> (expected in the luxury setup).&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5595\" data-end=\"5725\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5597\" data-end=\"5725\"><strong data-start=\"5597\" data-end=\"5619\">EV charging points</strong> in parking (mentioned by some marketing?brochure?like sources).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 274, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p>In the rapidly expanding tapestry of New Gurgaon, a landmark development is rising that promises to redefine commercial luxury: <strong data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"269\">Elan Imperial</strong>, located in Sector?82, Gurugram. More than just a mall, Elan Imperial is envisioned as an integrated commercial destination that combines retail, dining, entertainment, and hospitality under one roof. Developed by the reputable <strong data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"512\">Elan Group</strong> and designed by the world?renowned architectural firm <strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"576\">Benoy</strong>, this ambitious project is set to become a magnet for both premium brands and discerning investors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"710\"><strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"710\">Elan Imperial Location &amp; Connectivity</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"1444\">Elan Imperial&rsquo;s location in Sector 82 is one of its strongest selling points. Strategically positioned with <strong data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"842\">two-sided frontage</strong> on major roads, the project ensures maximum visibility for retail and F&amp;B establishments. It enjoys seamless connectivity to <strong data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1038\">NH?48 (Delhi&ndash;Jaipur Highway)</strong> and the <strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1068\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>, making it easily accessible from key business and residential hubs. The location is further bolstered by its proximity to a rapidly growing residential catchment: Elan claims over <strong data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1307\">55,000 families</strong> live in the immediate vicinity, and more than <strong data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1372\">100,000 people</strong> reside within walking distance.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"1444\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1610\">This integration of a commercial hub within a densely populated residential area ensures sustained footfall and strong demand for retail, dining, and entertainment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1610\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1637\"><strong data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1637\">Elan Imperial Project Overview</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"2019\">Spanning <strong data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1661\">7.6 acres</strong>, Elan Imperial is not just another mall &mdash; it is being marketed as New Gurgaon\'s <strong data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1763\">first luxury mall</strong> with a distinctive multi?use profile. &nbsp;The project is registered under <strong data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1890\">RERA (Haryana)</strong> with the number <strong data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1921\">15 of 2024</strong>, providing a layer of regulatory transparency for buyers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"2019\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2057\">The development features a mix of:</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2326\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2100\"><strong data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2076\">Retail shops</strong> (luxury and flagship)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2181\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2181\"><strong data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2118\">Food courts</strong> and restaurants (including double- and triple-height spaces)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2228\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2228\">A <strong data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2208\">4-screen multiplex</strong> for entertainment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2326\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2326\">A <strong data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2249\">5-star hotel</strong>, integrated into the same structure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2358\"><strong data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2358\">Elan Imperial Sector 82 Design &amp; Architecture</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2902\">One of the most compelling aspects of Elan Imperial is its architectural pedigree: the project has been designed by <strong data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2485\">Benoy</strong>, a globally recognized firm known for iconic retail and commercial projects.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2902\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2902\">The design includes <strong data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2638\">triple-height</strong> shops on the ground floor, giving a grand sense of scale and luxury. The fa&ccedil;ades are modern yet elegant, with glass elements, efficient zoning, and high visibility from both main roads.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"3456\">For F&amp;B, there are double-height restaurants, some with terrace space, providing a mix of premium dining settings. The entertainment zone is located on the upper floors (5th), housing a multiplex as well as other leisure-driven components.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"3456\">The integration of a hotel above the retail and entertainment space makes this project uniquely positioned &mdash; combining hospitality with commerce to cater to both local and destination traffic.</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"ititle\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 class=\"ititle\"><span class=\"suptitle d-block\">Elan Imperial 82 </span><strong class=\"mtitle text-uppercase d-block\">Price List &amp; Area</strong></h3>\r\n<p><span class=\"mtitle text-uppercase d-block\">The payment plan is investor-friendly: a 40:30:30 split, combined with a 12% per annum assured return until possession, which makes it especially attractive for commercial investors.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\">\r\n<table class=\"my-table\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: rgb(53, 152, 219); border-style: solid;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Floor</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Type</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Size(SQFT)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Pay Plan</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Rental</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">Ground Floor</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">Triple Height Shop</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">1500 - 5000</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">40:30:30</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">12% PA</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">Lower Ground Floor</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">Shop/Retail</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">1500 - 2500</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">40:30:30</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">12% PA</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">1st Floor</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">Shop/Retail</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">1000 - 1500</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">40:30:30</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">12% PA</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">2nd Floor</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">Retail</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">800 - 1500</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">40:30:30</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">12% PA</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">3rd Floor</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">Food-courts</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">800 - 1500</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">40:30:30</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">12% PA</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">4rd Floor</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">Double Height Restaurant</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">2800</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">40:30:30</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">12% PA</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">5rd Floor</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">Entertainment Zone</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">500 - 2500</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">40:30:30</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\">12% PA</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5732\" data-end=\"5772\"><strong data-start=\"5732\" data-end=\"5772\">Investment Potential &amp; Business Case</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5774\" data-end=\"5844\">From an investment perspective, Elan Imperial is very well positioned:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"5846\" data-end=\"6733\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5846\" data-end=\"6013\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5849\" data-end=\"6013\"><strong data-start=\"5849\" data-end=\"5878\">Strong Demand &amp; Footfall:</strong> The surrounding residential density (55,000+ families nearby) ensures a ready customer base.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6014\" data-end=\"6186\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6017\" data-end=\"6186\"><strong data-start=\"6017\" data-end=\"6037\">Assured Returns:</strong> 12% p.a. until possession makes it an attractive deal for investors seeking stable pre-possession returns.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6187\" data-end=\"6364\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6190\" data-end=\"6364\"><strong data-start=\"6190\" data-end=\"6211\">Brand Visibility:</strong> Triple-height shops, double-height restaurants, and a two-sided open layout give retailers premium visibility.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6365\" data-end=\"6534\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6368\" data-end=\"6534\"><strong data-start=\"6368\" data-end=\"6400\">Diversified Revenue Streams:</strong> Because the project houses retail, F&amp;B, entertainment, and a hotel, risk is spread across multiple verticals &mdash; making it resilient.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6535\" data-end=\"6733\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6538\" data-end=\"6733\"><strong data-start=\"6538\" data-end=\"6568\">Luxury Destination Appeal:</strong> The presence of a 5?star hotel, multiplex, and high-end retail will draw both local and destination footfall, which can push up retail leasing demand and valuation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7690\" data-end=\"7725\"><strong data-start=\"7690\" data-end=\"7725\">Sustainability &amp; Future Outlook</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7727\" data-end=\"8111\">Elan Imperial is designed to be more than a transactional shopping space &mdash; it\'s a <strong data-start=\"7809\" data-end=\"7824\">destination</strong>. With its architecture, mix of uses, and strong connectivity, it is likely to become a landmark in Gurgaon&rsquo;s commercial landscape. Given the rapid growth of New Gurgaon, and increasing demand for premium commercial real estate, the project is strategically poised for long-term success.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"8113\" data-end=\"8395\">Moreover, Elan Group\'s reputation and past track record add confidence. heir commitment to integrated luxury spaces (combining retail, hospitality, and entertainment) aligns well with evolving consumer and business trends, especially in NCR.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"8113\" data-end=\"8395\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"8418\" data-end=\"8857\"><strong data-start=\"8418\" data-end=\"8446\">Elan Imperial, Sector 82</strong> is more than just another mall; it\'s a statement. By marrying luxury retail with entertainment and hospitality, the project sets a new benchmark in commercial real estate for New Gurgaon. For investors, it offers a compelling mix of high visibility, diversified revenue, and assured returns. For brands and businesses, it provides an opportunity to establish a presence in a premium, high-footfall environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"8859\" data-end=\"9039\">If executed well, Elan Imperial could well become one of Gurgaon\'s most iconic commercial destinations &mdash; a place where business meets lifestyle, and where luxury meets opportunity.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"277\">Process to Book Inventory Through A2P Realtech</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"5507\">\r\n<li data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"313\"><strong data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"311\">Initial Contact / Inquiry</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<li data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"461\">\r\n<p data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"461\">Reach out to A2P Realtech via their <strong data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"366\">website</strong>, phone, or email. You can also drop into their office.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"503\">Explain your requirements clearly:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<li data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"592\">\r\n<p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"592\">What kind of property you are interested in (commercial / retail / residential)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"682\">\r\n<p data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"682\">Preferred project or location (for example, &ldquo;Elan Imperial, Sector 82&rdquo; or other)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"769\">Budget, size (sq ft), configuration, and your purpose (investment vs end?use)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<p data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"815\"><strong data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"813\">Requirement Analysis &amp; Shortlisting</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<li data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"1021\">A2P Realtech&rsquo;s property advisors will analyze your inputs and suggest relevant inventory. They have deep market insights, especially in Gurgaon&rsquo;s micro-markets.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1069\">They will provide you with details like:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1102\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1102\">Brochures / floor plans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1125\">Payment plans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1188\">RERA registration and legal status of available units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1224\"><strong data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1222\">Site Visit / Virtual Tour</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1357\">They will arrange a <strong data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1264\">site visit</strong> so you can physically inspect the project and units.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1491\">If you aren&rsquo;t local (or prefer), they may offer a <strong data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1429\">virtual tour</strong> or video walkthrough.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1525\">During the visit, you can:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1554\">Examine model units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1600\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1600\">Check orientation, views, and layout</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1669\">Ask about construction quality, amenities, and neighborhood</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"2073\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1694\"><strong data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1692\">Unit Selection</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"2073\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1919\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1804\">Based on your visit / review, choose your <strong data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1763\">preferred unit(s)</strong>. This includes making decisions about:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1919\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1833\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1833\">Floor (which level)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1882\">Facing (north/south, road-facing, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1919\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1919\">Unit size and configuration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"2073\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"2073\">Ask A2P about <strong data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1979\">preferential location charges (PLCs)</strong>, floor-rise charges, or any extra costs for premium units. (As is common in many projects.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2823\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2119\"><strong data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2117\">Documentation &amp; Booking Formalities</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2823\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2320\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2320\">Fill out a <strong data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2169\">booking form/application form</strong> via A2P. You&rsquo;ll need to submit KYC documents &mdash; typically: photo ID, address proof, PAN card, photographs, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2520\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2520\">Pay a <strong data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2358\">token / booking amount</strong>: This is a deposit to reserve the unit. For residential / villa projects, it\'s often around <strong data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2460\">5&ndash;10%</strong> of the total price.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2713\">Make the payment through the modes accepted by A2P / developer: this could be cheque, bank transfer (NEFT/RTGS), or UPI (depending on the project).&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2823\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2823\">After payment and form submission, you should get a <strong data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2795\">booking confirmation</strong> or a <strong data-start=\"2801\" data-end=\"2820\">booking receipt</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"3318\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2857\"><strong data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2855\">Agreement and Allotment</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"3318\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"3009\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"3009\">Once your booking is confirmed, you will receive an <strong data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2935\">Allotment Letter</strong> from the developer (through A2P).&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3233\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3114\">Next, you&rsquo;ll need to sign a <strong data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3076\">Builder-Buyer Agreement (BBA)</strong> or a Sale Agreement which includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3233\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3135\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3135\">Total price</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3174\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3174\">Payment schedule (milestones)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3199\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3199\">Possession date</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3233\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3233\">Other terms &amp; conditions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3318\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3318\">It&rsquo;s a good idea to have a legal advisor review the agreement before signing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3832\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3341\"><strong data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3339\">Payment Plan</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3832\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3702\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3419\">Depending on the project, you can choose from different payment plans:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3702\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3541\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3541\"><strong data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3469\">Construction-Linked Payment Plan (CLP)</strong> &mdash; pay as construction advances.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3660\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3660\"><strong data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3581\">Possession-Linked Plan (PLP)</strong> &mdash; pay larger parts closer to handover.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"3702\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3702\"><strong data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3687\">Subvention Plan</strong> (if offered)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3832\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3832\">Make payments as per the agreed schedule. Keep all receipts / acknowledgment from the developer or A2P for each installment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"4095\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3837\" data-end=\"3875\"><strong data-start=\"3837\" data-end=\"3873\">Home Loan Assistance (If Needed)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3879\" data-end=\"4095\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3879\" data-end=\"3991\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3991\">If you need a loan, A2P Realtech helps connect you to partner banks.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4095\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4095\">They assist in: loan application, document preparation, and tracking disbursement with the bank.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4097\" data-end=\"4364\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4126\"><strong data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4124\">Construction Updates</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4364\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4276\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4276\">A2P Realtech often keeps buyers informed about construction progress &mdash; via emails, messages, or calls.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4364\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4282\" data-end=\"4364\">They may also share milestone photos, site reports, or scheduled demand letters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4370\" data-end=\"4397\"><strong data-start=\"4370\" data-end=\"4395\">Possession &amp; Handover</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4402\" data-end=\"4769\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4402\" data-end=\"4673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4493\">When construction is complete or when the project reaches the possession stage, you&rsquo;ll:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4500\" data-end=\"4673\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4500\" data-end=\"4535\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4535\">Receive a <strong data-start=\"4512\" data-end=\"4533\">possession letter</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4591\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4544\" data-end=\"4591\">Make the <strong data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4570\">final payment</strong> (as per agreement)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4600\" data-end=\"4673\">Inspect the unit with A2P / builder to ensure everything is as expected</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4678\" data-end=\"4769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4680\" data-end=\"4769\">After inspection and final payment, you&rsquo;ll take physical <strong data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"4766\">handover of your property</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4771\" data-end=\"5093\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4775\" data-end=\"4809\"><strong data-start=\"4775\" data-end=\"4807\">Registration / Legal Closure</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4814\" data-end=\"5093\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4814\" data-end=\"4955\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4816\" data-end=\"4955\">A2P Realtech assists you with the <strong data-start=\"4850\" data-end=\"4882\">registration of the property</strong> (sale deed, stamp duty, etc.).&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"5093\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4962\" data-end=\"5093\">Ensure all legal documents are in order, and get copies of: the registered deed, final sales agreement, and other necessary papers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5095\" data-end=\"5507\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5099\" data-end=\"5122\"><strong data-start=\"5099\" data-end=\"5120\">Post?Sale Support</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5127\" data-end=\"5507\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5127\" data-end=\"5398\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5129\" data-end=\"5176\">After possession, A2P Realtech can help with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5183\" data-end=\"5398\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5183\" data-end=\"5220\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5185\" data-end=\"5220\">Interior coordination (if needed)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5227\" data-end=\"5255\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5229\" data-end=\"5255\">Resale or leasing advice</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5262\" data-end=\"5398\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5398\">Property management or maintenance support, based on the type of project and their services.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5403\" data-end=\"5507\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5405\" data-end=\"5507\">They also provide legal / documentation support for mutation, society formation, or other formalities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5509\" data-end=\"5512\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5514\" data-end=\"5547\">Tips &amp; Things to Watch Out For</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5549\" data-end=\"6498\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5549\" data-end=\"5710\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5551\" data-end=\"5710\"><strong data-start=\"5551\" data-end=\"5579\">Verify RERA Registration</strong>: Before booking any unit, check that the project is RERA-registered and that the unit / phase you&rsquo;re booking is covered by RERA.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5711\" data-end=\"5867\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5713\" data-end=\"5867\"><strong data-start=\"5713\" data-end=\"5737\">Payment Plan Clarity</strong>: Make sure you understand the <strong data-start=\"5768\" data-end=\"5788\">payment schedule</strong> &mdash; when payments are due, and what the consequences are for delayed payments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5868\" data-end=\"6003\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5870\" data-end=\"6003\"><strong data-start=\"5870\" data-end=\"5899\">Use Written Documentation</strong>: Insist on booking receipts, allotment letters, and signed agreements. Don&rsquo;t rely on verbal promises.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6004\" data-end=\"6131\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6006\" data-end=\"6131\"><strong data-start=\"6006\" data-end=\"6022\">Legal Review</strong>: Always have a lawyer or a legal consultant review agreements, title documents, and builder&rsquo;s credentials.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6132\" data-end=\"6275\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6134\" data-end=\"6275\"><strong data-start=\"6134\" data-end=\"6156\">Track Construction</strong>: Stay engaged during construction &mdash; ask for periodic updates (photos, site visits) so that you\'re aware of progress.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6276\" data-end=\"6383\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6278\" data-end=\"6383\"><strong data-start=\"6278\" data-end=\"6292\">Loan Terms</strong>: If taking a loan, understand interest rate, disbursement schedule, processing fees etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6384\" data-end=\"6498\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6386\" data-end=\"6498\"><strong data-start=\"6386\" data-end=\"6403\">Exit Strategy</strong>: Even if you\'re buying for investment, think about exit options: resale, lease, or assignment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3510.026204172879!2d76.95303287615802!3d28.388276495129453!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d3d001b4d4b81%3A0xccd1625649564915!2sElan%20Imperial!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 82 Gurgaon', '', '', 'TFGLFZUD', 20, 'Elan Imperial, Sector 82 Gurgaon: A New Benchmark in Luxury Commercial Real Estate', 'Elan Imperial Sector 82, Gurgaon commercial property, Sector 82 retail space,  Elan Group projects,  Luxury mall Gurgaon, Retail investment Gurgaon, Gurgaon luxury commercial hub, Commercial property investment,  New Gurgaon retail mall, Multiplex and hotel Gurgaon', 'Elan Imperial, Sector 82 Gurgaon – Luxury retail, dining, multiplex & hotel. Prime commercial investment with assured returns in New Gurgaon', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(230, 'Neo Square Sector 109 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon Project details', '20251123022143_Is-It-Worth-to-Invest-in-Neo-Square-Sec-109-Gurgaon__1_.jpg', '<p data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2292\"><strong data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2290\">Specifications &amp; Amenities</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2950\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2381\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2381\">Intelligent Building Management System (BMS)&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2454\">Centralized air-conditioning&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2516\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2516\">100% Power Backup&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2598\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2598\">Fire detection &amp; firefighting systems&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2662\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2662\">CCTV / Surveillance&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2752\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2752\">High-speed data cabling, telecom connectivity&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2881\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2881\">Support for accessibility: driver lounges, restrooms for physically challenged, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2950\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2950\">Valet parking (optional)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 311, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2 data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"467\">Neo Square &ndash; Sector 109, Dwarka Expressway</h2>\r\n<p>Dwarka Expressway has emerged as one of the most transformative growth corridors in the Delhi&ndash;Gurgaon real estate landscape. Among the various commercial developments along this expressway, <strong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"695\">Neo Square in Sector 109</strong> stands out as a modern, fully integrated commercial hub designed to cater to retail, office, entertainment, and hospitality businesses. Positioned on a prime location and backed by contemporary infrastructure, Neo Square is today regarded as one of the key commercial projects attracting investors and business owners looking for high-footfall, high-visibility, and long-term appreciation potential.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"498\"><strong data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"496\">1. Overview &amp; Developer</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"975\">\r\n<li data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"589\">\r\n<p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"589\">Project: <strong data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"524\">Neo Square</strong> (commercial / mixed-use)&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n<p data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"671\">Developer: <strong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"631\">Neo Developers Pvt. Ltd.</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"774\">\r\n<p data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"774\">Use: Commercial (Retail, Offices, Food Court, Entertainment)&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<p data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"844\">Land Area: ~ <strong data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"804\">3.07 acres</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"975\">\r\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"975\">Total Built-up Area: ~ <strong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"888\">3,97,020 sq ft</strong> (&asymp; 397,000 sq ft) according to Neo Developers.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"980\">\r\n<p data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1014\"><strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1012\">2. Location &amp; Connectivity</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1399\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1145\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1145\">Situated in <strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1043\">Sector 109</strong>, Gurgaon (Gurugram), on the <strong data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1104\">150 m-wide Dwarka Expressway</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1259\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1259\">Very good connectivity: close to <strong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1196\">IGI Airport</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1206\">NH-8</strong>, and Dwarka.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1399\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1399\">Proximity to upcoming residential clusters: Several large residential projects around Sector 109.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1404\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1535\"><strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1447\">3. Project Configuration &amp; Components</strong><br data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1450\">Neo Square is quite diversified in terms of commercial offerings. Here&rsquo;s a breakdown:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1654\"><strong data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1555\">Retail Shops</strong>: Multiple levels (ground to some upper floors) for retail.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1759\"><strong data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1668\">Offices</strong>: Office space from floor ~5 to 17 (per one report)&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1871\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1871\"><strong data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1782\">Food Court / F&amp;B</strong>: Dedicated food court and restaurants planned.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"2008\"><strong data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1891\">Entertainment</strong>: There is an &ldquo;Octane&rdquo; zone &mdash; virtual gaming, bowling alley, climbing, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2155\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2155\"><strong data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2022\">Parking</strong>: Multi-level basement parking. According to one report, over <strong data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2112\">1,600+ car parking spots</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2250\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2250\"><strong data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2171\">Elevators</strong>: High-speed lifts for easy movement.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2255\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2292\"><strong data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2290\">4. Specifications &amp; Amenities</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2950\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2381\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2381\">Intelligent Building Management System (BMS)&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2454\">Centralized air-conditioning&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2516\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2516\">100% Power Backup&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2598\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2598\">Fire detection &amp; firefighting systems&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2662\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2662\">CCTV / Surveillance&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2752\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2752\">High-speed data cabling, telecom connectivity&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2881\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2881\">Support for accessibility: driver lounges, restrooms for physically challenged, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2950\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2950\">Valet parking (optional)&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2955\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2995\"><strong data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2993\">5. Approvals / Regulatory Status</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3438\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3152\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3152\">They have obtained <strong data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3048\">Occupation Certificate (OC)</strong>. According to a news report, the project got OC in Sept 2024.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3217\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3217\">Security: 24x7 CCTV.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3329\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3329\">RERA: The original RERA registration was <strong data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3286\">HRERA No. 109 of 2017</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3438\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3438\">Note: According to some sources, RERA renewal is &ldquo;under review.&rdquo;&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3443\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3478\"><strong data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3476\">6. Sizes, Pricing &amp; Payment</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"4369\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3479\" data-end=\"3734\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3496\"><strong data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3495\">Unit Sizes</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3734\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3613\">Retail shops: ~ 250 to 2,000 sq ft (according to Neo Square&rsquo;s website)&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3616\" data-end=\"3734\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3734\">Office space: wide range; some listings mention 550 sq ft to 17,000 sq ft.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4195\" data-end=\"4369\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4369\"><strong data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4213\">Payment Plan</strong>: According to Realty Smartz, there was a 50:50 payment plan (half now, half on possession) for some office units.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4371\" data-end=\"4374\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4408\"><strong data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4406\">7. Recent / Current Update</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4867\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4542\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4411\" data-end=\"4542\">As mentioned, the project received its <strong data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4481\">Occupation Certificate (OC)</strong> in September 2024.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4708\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4708\">There are &ldquo;pre-leased&rdquo; properties available, meaning some units are already leased out or meant for long-term investment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4867\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4711\" data-end=\"4867\">According to a listing, possession for some office units was expected around <strong data-start=\"4788\" data-end=\"4804\">Jan&ndash;Feb 2025</strong> (per Realty Smartz).&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4869\" data-end=\"4872\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4874\" data-end=\"4920\">Pros / Strengths of Neo Square (Sector 109)</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4922\" data-end=\"5556\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4922\" data-end=\"5064\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4924\" data-end=\"5064\"><strong data-start=\"4924\" data-end=\"4946\">Strategic Location</strong>: On Dwarka Expressway &rarr; good connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, NH-8, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5065\" data-end=\"5194\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5067\" data-end=\"5194\"><strong data-start=\"5067\" data-end=\"5080\">Mixed Use</strong>: Because it has retail, offices, entertainment, food court, it can attract high footfall and diverse customers.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5195\" data-end=\"5294\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5197\" data-end=\"5294\"><strong data-start=\"5197\" data-end=\"5222\">Modern Infrastructure</strong>: Good building management, full power backup, advanced security, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5295\" data-end=\"5390\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5297\" data-end=\"5390\"><strong data-start=\"5297\" data-end=\"5316\">High Visibility</strong>: Retail shops on expressway-facing frontage; good for brand visibility.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5391\" data-end=\"5464\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5393\" data-end=\"5464\"><strong data-start=\"5393\" data-end=\"5404\">Parking</strong>: Large basement parking is good for commercial viability.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5465\" data-end=\"5556\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5467\" data-end=\"5556\"><strong data-start=\"5467\" data-end=\"5487\">Return Potential</strong>: As a commercial project with OC, it could generate rental income.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1 data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"326\"><strong data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"326\">Process to Book a Unit Through A2P Realtech &ndash; Sales Channel Partner</strong></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"538\">Booking a residential or commercial unit through <strong data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"393\">A2P Realtech</strong> is designed to be transparent, smooth, and well-coordinated. Below is the complete workflow followed by buyers, A2P Realtech, and the developer.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"543\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"575\"><strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"575\">1. Initial Consultation</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"654\">The process starts with a detailed discussion to understand the buyer&rsquo;s needs.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"688\">A2P Realtech Helps You With:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"897\">\r\n<li data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"753\">\r\n<p data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"753\">Type of property needed (Retail/Office/Residential/Investment)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"773\">\r\n<p data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"773\">Budget planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"811\">\r\n<p data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"811\">Preferred locations or developers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"853\">\r\n<p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"853\">ROI expectations / rental yield goals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"897\">\r\n<p data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"897\">Shortlisting the most suitable projects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"962\"><strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"911\">Outcome:</strong> Shortlisted options tailored to the buyer&rsquo;s needs.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"967\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1013\"><strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1013\">2. Project Explanation &amp; Unit Options</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1061\">A2P Realtech provides complete project details:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1090\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1090\">Brochures &amp; floor plans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1106\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1106\">Price lists</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1129\">Availability chart</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1147\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1147\">Payment plans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1172\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1172\">Developer background</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1203\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1203\">Pros &amp; cons of the project</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1228\">Investment potential</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1299\"><strong data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1242\">Outcome:</strong> Buyer understands everything needed before a site visit.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1304\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1341\"><strong data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1341\">3. Site Visit / Project Tour</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1405\">A physical or virtual tour (depending on location) is arranged.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1420\">Includes:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1627\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1463\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1463\">Pick-up/drop facility (when available)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1489\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1489\">Visit to sample units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1527\">Visit to actual construction site</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1571\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1571\">Checking views, location, access points</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1627\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1627\">On-ground explanation of amenities &amp; specifications</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1693\"><strong data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1641\">Outcome:</strong> Buyer gets full clarity on product and environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1724\"><strong data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1724\">4. Unit Selection</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1762\">After the visit, the buyer finalizes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1852\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1781\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1781\">Tower / Block</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1791\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1791\">Floor</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1807\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1807\">Unit number</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1825\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1825\">Facing &amp; size</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1852\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1852\">Preferred payment plan</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1924\">A2P Realtech cross-checks the <strong data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1904\">latest inventory</strong> with the developer.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1984\"><strong data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1938\">Outcome:</strong> Final unit is locked temporarily for booking.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"1989\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2030\"><strong data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2030\">5. Booking Form &amp; KYC Completion</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2097\">Once the unit is confirmed, A2P Realtech helps the buyer complete:</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2122\">Required Documents:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2135\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2135\">PAN Card</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2163\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2163\">Aadhaar Card / Passport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2193\">Passport-size photographs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2211\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2211\">Address proof</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2266\">GST details (for commercial bookings, if applicable)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2343\">A2P Realtech ensures the booking form is filled accurately to avoid delays.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2348\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2390\"><strong data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2390\">6. Token / Booking Amount Payment</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2467\">To reserve the unit, the buyer pays the <strong data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2449\">booking amount</strong> to the developer.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2497\">Payment Can Be Made Via:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2565\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2508\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2508\">Cheque</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2524\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2524\">RTGS / NEFT</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2548\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2548\">Online payment link</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2565\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2565\">Demand draft</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2671\">A2P Realtech ensures the payment is made <strong data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2647\">directly to the developer&rsquo;s account</strong>, ensuring transparency.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2739\"><strong data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2685\">Outcome:</strong> Unit is officially blocked in the developer&rsquo;s system.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2744\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2779\"><strong data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2779\">7. Allotment Letter Issued</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2816\">Once the booking amount is received:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2975\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2866\">The developer issues an <strong data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2864\">Allotment Letter</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2928\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2928\">Includes unit details, price, payment schedule, and terms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2975\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2975\">Buyer signs and acknowledges the allotment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3046\">A2P Realtech double-checks all calculations and terms on your behalf.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3051\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3112\"><strong data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3112\">8. Agreement to Sell (ATS) / Builder-Buyer Agreement</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3163\">Depending on the project status, the next step is:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3253\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3194\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3194\">Apartment Buyer Agreement</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3225\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3225\">Commercial Space Agreement</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3253\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3253\">Builder Buyer Agreement</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3326\">A2P Realtech coordinates the signing, documentation, and legal queries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3331\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3369\"><strong data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3369\">9. Loan Assistance (Optional)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3370\" data-end=\"3415\">If the buyer needs home loan/commercial loan:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3444\">A2P Realtech supports with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3580\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3471\">Loan eligibility check</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3526\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3526\">Selecting best bank (HDFC, ICICI, SBI, Axis, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3527\" data-end=\"3556\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3556\">Loan documents submission</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3580\">Follow-up with bank</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3582\" data-end=\"3585\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3587\" data-end=\"3620\"><strong data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3620\">10. Payment Plan Execution</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3621\" data-end=\"3676\">Depending on the construction stage, the buyer follows:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3790\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3712\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3712\">CLP (Construction Linked Plan)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3713\" data-end=\"3727\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3715\" data-end=\"3727\">30:70 plan</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3747\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3747\">Subvention plan</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3769\">Down payment plan</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3770\" data-end=\"3790\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3772\" data-end=\"3790\">Time-linked plan</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3792\" data-end=\"3805\">A2P Realtech:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3946\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3839\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3839\">Tracks your payment schedule</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"3859\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3842\" data-end=\"3859\">Sends reminders</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3860\" data-end=\"3892\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3892\">Coordinates with the builder</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3946\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3895\" data-end=\"3946\">Ensures timely receipts &amp; payment acknowledgments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"3951\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"4001\"><strong data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"4001\">11. Regular Updates &amp; After-Sales Support</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4055\">After booking, A2P Realtech continues to assist with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4257\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4090\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4059\" data-end=\"4090\">Construction progress updates</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4117\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4117\">Demand letter tracking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4148\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4148\">Any change of unit queries</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4149\" data-end=\"4193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4193\">Add-on services (parking, storage, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4194\" data-end=\"4229\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4229\">Pre-handover inspection support</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4257\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4257\">Possession coordination</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6753\" data-end=\"6918\">&nbsp;</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3506.1921059097203!2d77.006000776161!3d28.503867389910642!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d17efa88dc971%3A0x5a90bbb429e307dc!2sNeoSquare!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1763835452063!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 109 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon ', '', '', '8S79QG8E', 20, 'Neo Square Sector 109, Dwarka Expressway: Project Details', 'Neo Square Sector 109, Dwarka Expressway commercial project, Neo Square Gurgaon review, Neo Square price, Neo Square floor plan, Neo Square investment, Neo Square amenities, Neo Square booking process, A2P Realtech partner, Gurgaon commercial space, retail shops Gurgaon, office space Dwarka Expressway, Neo Developers Gurgaon', 'Neo Square Sector 109 Dwarka Expressway: Complete project review, price, floor plans, amenities, investment potential & booking process through A2P Realtech.', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(231, 'Kashish Manor One A Luxury Address on Dwarka Expressway Sector 111 Gurgaon', '20251127182307_Luxury-Address-Monor-One-Sector-111-Dwarka-Expressway.jpg', '<h2 data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2615\"><strong data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2615\">Amenities &amp; Lifestyle Features</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2653\"><strong data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2653\">Clubhouse &amp; Indoor Amenities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2748\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2676\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2676\">Fully equipped gym</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2698\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2698\">Multipurpose hall</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2720\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2720\">Indoor games area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2748\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2748\">Yoga &amp; meditation space</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2774\"><strong data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2774\">Outdoor Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2898\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2792\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2792\">Swimming pool</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2815\">Landscaped gardens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2841\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2841\">Jogging/walking track</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2866\">Children&rsquo;s play area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2898\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2898\">Multi-purpose sports courts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2928\"><strong data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2928\">Safety &amp; Convenience</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"3069\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2963\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2963\">24/7 security with gated entry</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"3005\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3005\">CCTV surveillance across common areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3022\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3022\">Power backup</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3047\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3047\">High-speed elevators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3069\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3069\">Dedicated parking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3074\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3112\"><strong data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3112\">Construction Quality &amp; Design</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3192\">Kashish Manor One is built with a strong emphasis on durability and aesthetics.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3386\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3217\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3217\">RCC frame structure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3249\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3249\">Earthquake-resistant design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3300\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3252\" data-end=\"3300\">High-quality electrical and plumbing materials</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3347\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3347\">Modern fa&ccedil;ade and stylish entrance lobbies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3348\" data-end=\"3386\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3386\">Well-planned internal road network</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3454\">The project ensures long-term reliability and structural strength.</p>', 0, 1, 327, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2>Kashish Manor One Sector 111 Gurgaon &ndash; Complete Project Review</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"975\">Gurgaon has rapidly evolved into one of India&rsquo;s most desirable real-estate destinations, especially for urban luxury living. Among the many premium residential developments emerging along the strategic Dwarka Expressway corridor, <strong data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"702\">Kashish Manor One in Sector 111, Gurgaon</strong>, stands out for its thoughtful planning, high-end design, and exceptional connectivity. Developed to blend comfort with architectural elegance, Manor One is a residential address built for modern families who seek premium living within the city&rsquo;s most vibrant growth zone.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1281\">This blog offers a <strong data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1035\">detailed, in-depth 2000-word review</strong> of Kashish Manor One &ndash; covering location advantages, project features, amenities, configuration details, investment potential, connectivity benefits, construction quality, and why this project continues to attract homebuyers and investors alike.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1286\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1348\"><strong data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1348\">1. The Rise of Dwarka Expressway Living</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1840\">Dwarka Expressway, officially known as the Northern Peripheral Road (NPR), has become one of India&rsquo;s most important real-estate micro-markets. Connecting <strong data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1524\">Gurgaon to Delhi</strong>, this eight-lane expressway offers unparalleled connectivity benefits that were previously unavailable in the city&rsquo;s crowded central sectors. As infrastructural upgrades, metro expansions, and commercial zones continue developing around the expressway, residential projects here have witnessed exponential interest.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"2115\"><strong data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1856\">Sector 111</strong>, located on the Delhi-Gurgaon border, is among the most strategically located sectors on this stretch. Kashish Manor One benefits immensely from this positioning, offering residents the advantage of living in Gurgaon while enjoying Delhi-level accessibility.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2120\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2181\"><strong data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2181\">2. About the Developer: Kashish Developers Pvt. Ltd.</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2476\">Kashish Developers is known for delivering thoughtfully designed residential spaces with a focus on quality and user-centric planning. Over the past decade, the developer has built a strong reputation in the NCR region, with Manor One being one of their flagship premium residential offerings.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2508\">The company is recognized for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2622\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2537\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2537\">Modern design philosophy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2567\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2567\">High-quality construction</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2594\">Transparent operations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2622\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2622\">Timely delivery efforts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2767\">These attributes have allowed Kashish Manor One to gain steady attention among homebuyers seeking long-term reliability and value appreciation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2772\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2819\"><strong data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2819\">3. Project Overview: Kashish Manor One</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"3061\">Kashish Manor One is a <strong data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2891\">premium multi-tower residential development</strong> offering spacious apartments with world-class amenities. Designed for luxury living, the project seamlessly blends architectural creativity with practical functionality.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"3061\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"245\">Apartment Configurations &amp; Sizes</h3>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\r\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"629\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"311\">\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"311\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"263\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Configuration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"311\" data-col-size=\"md\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Size in Sq.Ft</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"629\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"459\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"393\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2 BHK</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"459\"><strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"419\">1,715 sq.ft.</strong>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"536\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"476\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3 BHK + Servant</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"536\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"496\">&nbsp;2,325 sq.ft.</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"629\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"569\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4 BHK + Study + Servant (Premium / Larger Unit)</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"629\"><strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"589\">5,450 sq.ft.</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3093\"><strong data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3093\">Key Project Highlights</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3337\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3137\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3137\">Spacious 2, 3, and 4 BHK configurations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3165\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3165\">Modern high-rise towers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3201\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3201\">Large landscaped central greens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3252\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3252\">Clubhouse with premium recreational facilities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3294\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3294\">High-end security and gated community</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3295\" data-end=\"3337\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3337\">Located just off the Dwarka Expressway</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3447\">The project is designed to cater to families looking for convenience, exclusivity, and refined urban living.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3447\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3519\"><strong data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3519\">4. Location Advantage: Sector 111 &ndash; The Gateway to Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3748\">One of the biggest reasons for the popularity of Kashish Manor One is its extraordinary location. Sector 111 is positioned right along the <strong data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3681\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>, one of the most significant new highways in the Delhi-NCR region.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3785\"><strong data-start=\"3754\" data-end=\"3785\">4.1 Connectivity Highlights</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"4058\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3826\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3788\" data-end=\"3826\"><strong data-start=\"3788\" data-end=\"3803\">5&ndash;7 minutes</strong> to Dwarka Expressway</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3872\"><strong data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3843\">10 minutes</strong> to IGI Airport, Terminal 3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3873\" data-end=\"3910\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3910\">Adjacent to <strong data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3908\">Delhi&rsquo;s Sector 28</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3911\" data-end=\"3965\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"3965\">Easy access to UER-II (Delhi&rsquo;s upcoming ring road)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"4015\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3968\" data-end=\"4015\">Close to Palam Vihar, Sector 113, Sector 110A</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4058\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4018\" data-end=\"4058\">15&ndash;20 minutes to Cyber Hub and MG Road</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4119\">The location caters especially to professionals working in:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4230\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4134\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4134\">Cyber City</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4135\" data-end=\"4150\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4137\" data-end=\"4150\">Udyog Vihar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4184\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4184\">Aerocity Hospitality District</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4185\" data-end=\"4230\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4187\" data-end=\"4230\">Diplomatic Enclave 2 (future development)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4335\">As these zones continue developing, Sector 111 is expected to become a high-demand residential hotspot.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4337\" data-end=\"4340\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4388\"><strong data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4388\">5. Apartment Layouts and Configurations</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4390\" data-end=\"4493\">Kashish Manor One offers a wide variety of apartment sizes, appealing to both small and large families.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4495\" data-end=\"4523\"><strong data-start=\"4499\" data-end=\"4523\">Configuration Spread</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4524\" data-end=\"4709\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4524\" data-end=\"4575\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4526\" data-end=\"4575\"><strong data-start=\"4526\" data-end=\"4546\">2 BHK Apartments</strong> &ndash; Ideal for young families</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4576\" data-end=\"4638\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4638\"><strong data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4598\">3 BHK Apartments</strong> &ndash; Spacious units designed for comfort</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4639\" data-end=\"4709\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4709\"><strong data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4669\">4 BHK Premium Apartments</strong> &ndash; Luxurious homes for larger families</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4711\" data-end=\"4737\">The floor plans emphasize:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4738\" data-end=\"4855\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4738\" data-end=\"4755\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4740\" data-end=\"4755\">Natural light</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4777\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4777\">Cross ventilation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4810\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4780\" data-end=\"4810\">Functional space utilization</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4855\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4813\" data-end=\"4855\">Privacy between living and bedroom areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4857\" data-end=\"4948\">Large balconies, wide windows, and smartly designed interiors add to the living experience.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"4953\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4955\" data-end=\"5010\"><strong data-start=\"4958\" data-end=\"5010\">6. Amenities: Designed for an Elevated Lifestyle</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5012\" data-end=\"5155\">One of the main USPs of Manor One is its impressive list of lifestyle amenities, designed to offer residents comfort, recreation, and wellness.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5157\" data-end=\"5200\"><strong data-start=\"5161\" data-end=\"5200\">6.1 Clubhouse and Indoor Facilities</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5201\" data-end=\"5232\">The premium clubhouse includes:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5233\" data-end=\"5385\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5233\" data-end=\"5261\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5235\" data-end=\"5261\">Fully equipped gymnasium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5262\" data-end=\"5291\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5291\">Yoga and meditation space</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5292\" data-end=\"5346\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5294\" data-end=\"5346\">Indoor games (billiards, table tennis, cards room)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5347\" data-end=\"5385\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5349\" data-end=\"5385\">Banquet hall for social gatherings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5387\" data-end=\"5416\"><strong data-start=\"5391\" data-end=\"5416\">6.2 Outdoor Amenities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5417\" data-end=\"5579\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5417\" data-end=\"5454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5419\" data-end=\"5454\">Swimming pool for adults and kids</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5455\" data-end=\"5496\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5457\" data-end=\"5496\">Landscaped gardens and walking trails</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5497\" data-end=\"5526\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5499\" data-end=\"5526\">Jogging and cycling paths</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5527\" data-end=\"5547\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5529\" data-end=\"5547\">Kids&rsquo; play zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5548\" data-end=\"5579\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5550\" data-end=\"5579\">Multi-purpose sports courts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5581\" data-end=\"5617\"><strong data-start=\"5585\" data-end=\"5617\">6.3 Security and Convenience</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5618\" data-end=\"5796\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5618\" data-end=\"5658\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5620\" data-end=\"5658\">24x7 security with CCTV surveillance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5659\" data-end=\"5684\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5661\" data-end=\"5684\">Intercom connectivity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5685\" data-end=\"5732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5687\" data-end=\"5732\">Power backup in common areas and apartments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5733\" data-end=\"5761\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5735\" data-end=\"5761\">Dedicated parking spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5762\" data-end=\"5796\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5764\" data-end=\"5796\">High-speed lifts in all towers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5798\" data-end=\"5896\">These amenities ensure a comfortable lifestyle that matches the expectations of modern homebuyers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5898\" data-end=\"5901\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5903\" data-end=\"5950\"><strong data-start=\"5906\" data-end=\"5950\">7. Construction Quality and Architecture</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5952\" data-end=\"6069\">Kashish Developers have ensured that Manor One reflects a premium aesthetic combined with robust structural planning.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6071\" data-end=\"6099\"><strong data-start=\"6075\" data-end=\"6099\">Key Quality Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6100\" data-end=\"6284\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6100\" data-end=\"6124\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6102\" data-end=\"6124\">RCC framed structure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6125\" data-end=\"6156\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6127\" data-end=\"6156\">Earthquake-resistant design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6157\" data-end=\"6195\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6159\" data-end=\"6195\">High-quality fittings and fixtures</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6196\" data-end=\"6241\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6198\" data-end=\"6241\">Branded electrical and plumbing materials</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6242\" data-end=\"6284\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6244\" data-end=\"6284\">Fire safety measures across all floors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6286\" data-end=\"6405\">The fa&ccedil;ade design, entrance lobbies, and landscaping showcase a fine blend of modern architecture and natural elements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6407\" data-end=\"6410\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"6412\" data-end=\"6461\"><strong data-start=\"6415\" data-end=\"6461\">8. Social Infrastructure Around Sector 111</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6463\" data-end=\"6625\">A residential project is only as good as the infrastructure around it. Fortunately, Sector 111 is surrounded by rapidly growing social and commercial development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6627\" data-end=\"6649\"><strong data-start=\"6631\" data-end=\"6649\">Nearby Schools</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6650\" data-end=\"6728\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6650\" data-end=\"6673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6652\" data-end=\"6673\">Delhi Public School</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6674\" data-end=\"6689\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6676\" data-end=\"6689\">G.D. Goenka</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6690\" data-end=\"6707\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6692\" data-end=\"6707\">Modern School</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6708\" data-end=\"6728\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6710\" data-end=\"6728\">Presidium School</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6730\" data-end=\"6754\"><strong data-start=\"6734\" data-end=\"6754\">Nearby Hospitals</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6755\" data-end=\"6851\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6755\" data-end=\"6781\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6757\" data-end=\"6781\">Columbia Asia Hospital</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6782\" data-end=\"6800\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6784\" data-end=\"6800\">Metro Hospital</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6801\" data-end=\"6820\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6803\" data-end=\"6820\">Fortis Hospital</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6821\" data-end=\"6851\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6823\" data-end=\"6851\">Artemis Hospital (20 mins)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6853\" data-end=\"6883\"><strong data-start=\"6857\" data-end=\"6883\">Retail &amp; Entertainment</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6884\" data-end=\"7012\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6884\" data-end=\"6906\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6886\" data-end=\"6906\">Vegas Mall, Dwarka</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6907\" data-end=\"6937\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6909\" data-end=\"6937\">Ambience Mall, Vasant Kunj</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6938\" data-end=\"6959\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6940\" data-end=\"6959\">Sector 110 Market</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6960\" data-end=\"7012\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6962\" data-end=\"7012\">Local shopping complexes and fine-dining options</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7014\" data-end=\"7099\">The area offers all essentials within a short distance, making it ideal for families.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7101\" data-end=\"7104\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7106\" data-end=\"7167\"><strong data-start=\"7109\" data-end=\"7167\">9. Investment Potential: Why Manor One is a Strong Bet</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7169\" data-end=\"7208\"><strong data-start=\"7173\" data-end=\"7208\">9.1 Growth of Dwarka Expressway</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7209\" data-end=\"7417\">Now that the expressway is operational in major patches, property prices in nearby sectors have already witnessed sharp appreciation. As more infrastructure gets completed, demand is expected to rise further.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7419\" data-end=\"7478\"><strong data-start=\"7423\" data-end=\"7478\">9.2 Proximity to the Airport and Diplomatic Enclave</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7479\" data-end=\"7616\">Being within minutes from IGI Airport and the upcoming Diplomatic Enclave 2 gives Manor One a significant capital appreciation advantage.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7618\" data-end=\"7644\"><strong data-start=\"7622\" data-end=\"7644\">9.3 Rental Returns</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7645\" data-end=\"7794\">Professionals working in Cyber City, Udyog Vihar, and Aerocity prefer renting homes near Dwarka Expressway, making Manor One ideal for rental income.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7796\" data-end=\"7829\"><strong data-start=\"7800\" data-end=\"7829\">9.4 Future Infrastructure</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7830\" data-end=\"7946\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7830\" data-end=\"7865\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7832\" data-end=\"7865\">Metro expansion (Phase-4 plans)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7866\" data-end=\"7889\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7868\" data-end=\"7889\">UER-II Connectivity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7890\" data-end=\"7923\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7892\" data-end=\"7923\">New commercial business parks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7924\" data-end=\"7946\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7926\" data-end=\"7946\">Wider road network</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7948\" data-end=\"8003\">All these factors are expected to boost property value.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8005\" data-end=\"8008\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"8010\" data-end=\"8061\"><strong data-start=\"8013\" data-end=\"8061\">10. Who Should Consider Buying in Manor One?</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8063\" data-end=\"8097\"><strong data-start=\"8070\" data-end=\"8095\">End-users (families):</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8098\" data-end=\"8163\">Because of spacious layouts, premium amenities, and connectivity.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8165\" data-end=\"8183\"><strong data-start=\"8172\" data-end=\"8181\">NRIs:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8184\" data-end=\"8245\">Due to high investment potential and rental income prospects.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8247\" data-end=\"8278\"><strong data-start=\"8254\" data-end=\"8276\">First-time buyers:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8279\" data-end=\"8334\">Looking for a long-term home near Delhi-Gurgaon border.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8336\" data-end=\"8359\"><strong data-start=\"8343\" data-end=\"8357\">Investors:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8360\" data-end=\"8443\">Because the region is expected to appreciate significantly over the next 5&ndash;7 years.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8445\" data-end=\"8448\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"8450\" data-end=\"8495\"><strong data-start=\"8453\" data-end=\"8495\">11. Pros and Cons of Kashish Manor One</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8497\" data-end=\"8509\"><strong data-start=\"8501\" data-end=\"8509\">Pros</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8510\" data-end=\"8703\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8510\" data-end=\"8549\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8512\" data-end=\"8549\">Prime location on Dwarka Expressway</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8550\" data-end=\"8574\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8552\" data-end=\"8574\">Close to IGI Airport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8575\" data-end=\"8610\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8577\" data-end=\"8610\">Spacious and premium apartments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8611\" data-end=\"8637\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8613\" data-end=\"8637\">Well-planned amenities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8638\" data-end=\"8669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8640\" data-end=\"8669\">Strong investment potential</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8670\" data-end=\"8703\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8672\" data-end=\"8703\">Growing social infrastructure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8705\" data-end=\"8717\"><strong data-start=\"8709\" data-end=\"8717\">Cons</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8718\" data-end=\"8878\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8718\" data-end=\"8749\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8720\" data-end=\"8749\">Currently a developing area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8750\" data-end=\"8794\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8752\" data-end=\"8794\">Some road stretches still under upgrades</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8795\" data-end=\"8878\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8797\" data-end=\"8878\">Traffic can be heavy during peak hours (expected to reduce after full completion)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8880\" data-end=\"8883\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"8885\" data-end=\"8941\"><strong data-start=\"8888\" data-end=\"8941\">12. Is Kashish Manor One Worth It?</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8943\" data-end=\"9214\"><strong data-start=\"8943\" data-end=\"9001\">Yes &mdash; Kashish Manor One is a strong residential choice</strong> for homebuyers looking for luxury, connectivity, and long-term appreciation. With its premium facilities, spacious homes, and strategic location, the project offers excellent value for both living and investment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"9216\" data-end=\"9413\">The combination of Dwarka Expressway&rsquo;s growth, sector-level infrastructure, and high-quality construction makes Manor One a standout residential project in Gurgaon&rsquo;s competitive real-estate market.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"9415\" data-end=\"9522\">If you are planning to invest in Dwarka Expressway, <strong data-start=\"9467\" data-end=\"9521\">Kashish Manor One deserves to be on your shortlist</strong>.</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1752.7197575253483!2d77.03802468887682!3d28.52650620051108!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1a3b5652046d%3A0xbce5832ffe76fc35!2sMANOR%20ONE%2C%20Sector%20111%2C%20manor%20one%2C%20Delhi%20122017!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Dwarka Expressway Sector 111 Gurgaon', '', '', '3HXNRYNY', 19, 'Kashish Manor One  A Luxury Address on Dwarka Expressway Sector 111 Gurgaon', 'kashish manor one, kashish manor one gurgaon, manor one sector 111, kashish manor one dwarka expressway, sector 111 gurgaon property, premium flats gurgaon, 2 bhk flats gurgaon, 3 bhk apartments gurgaon, 4 bhk luxury flats gurgaon, apartments near igi airport, delhi gurgaon border projects, gurgaon real estate, luxury residential projects gurgaon, dwarka expressway property, new projects in sector 111, kashish developers gurgaon, ready to move flats dwarka expressway, premium housing gurgaon, best residential projects gurgaon, gurgaon property investment', 'Kashish Manor One in Sector 111 Gurgaon offers premium 2, 3 & 4 BHK flats on Dwarka Expressway with luxury amenities, excellent connectivity to IGI Airport, and modern lifestyle features. Explore spacious apartments, world-class facilities, and strong investment potential on the Delhi–Gurgaon border.', NULL, NULL);
