gardens</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1918\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1918\">Senior citizen relaxation zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1947\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1947\">Jogging &amp; walking tracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1987\">Kids&rsquo; play area with safe equipment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2030\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2030\">Open-air seating and leisure pavilions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2073\"><strong data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2073\">Sports &amp; Wellness Amenities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2196\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2106\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2106\">Swimming pool with deck area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2131\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2131\">Dedicated kids&rsquo; pool</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2167\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2167\">Basketball and badminton courts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2196\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2196\">Outdoor fitness stations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2231\"><strong data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2231\">&nbsp;Security &amp; Convenience</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2435\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2262\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2262\">24x7 <strong data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2260\">CCTV surveillance</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2296\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2296\">Controlled access entry gates</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2318\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2318\">Intercom facility</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2347\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2347\">Dedicated parking spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2372\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2372\">High-speed elevators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2405\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2405\">Power backup in common areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2435\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2435\">On-site maintenance staff</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 270, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2 data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"715\"><strong data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"256\">1. Project Highlights</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"715\"><strong data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"256\">Kashish Manor One</strong> is a luxury residential development located at <strong data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"345\">Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong>, offering premium homes designed for modern, upscale living. The project combines elegant architecture, spacious floor plans, and world-class amenities within a secure gated community. Situated on the rapidly growing Dwarka Expressway corridor, Manor One promises an elevated lifestyle with excellent connectivity to Delhi, Gurgaon, and the upcoming Diplomatic Enclave.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"739\"><strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"739\">Key Highlights</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<li data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"812\">\r\n<p data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"812\"><strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"763\">Luxury apartments</strong> with premium finishes and contemporary layouts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n<p data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"885\"><strong data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"837\">Strategic location</strong> on Dwarka Expressway, just minutes from Delhi</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"942\">\r\n<p data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"942\"><strong data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"907\">Gated community</strong> with multi-tier security systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"1022\">\r\n<p data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1022\"><strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"981\">Environment-friendly development</strong> with landscaped greens and open spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1089\"><strong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1045\">Modern clubhouse</strong> with recreational and wellness facilities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1157\"><strong data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1155\">Proximity to IGI Airport, Dwarka Metro, and commercial hubs</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1244\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1244\"><strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1191\">High appreciation potential</strong> due to upcoming infrastructure and diplomatic zone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1324\"><strong data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1284\">Ideal for end-users and investors</strong> looking for premium living in Gurgaon</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"blog-details__title\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"../service_detail/kashish-manor-one-a-luxury-address-on-dwarka-expressway-sector-111-gurgaon.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kashish Manor One A Luxury Address on Dwarka Expressway Sector 111 Gurgaon</a></span></h3>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"568\"><strong data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"568\">Kashish Manor One Price List&nbsp; Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"814\">Kashish Manor One offers spacious and premium residences at highly attractive prices considering the luxury, size, and location benefits. Each configuration is designed to deliver maximum comfort and high value for both end-users and investors.</p>\r\n<div class=