"980\" data-end=\"1007\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1006\">3 BHK + Servant Room</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1026\"><strong data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1025\">2,325 sq.ft.</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1048\"><em data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1046\">Price on Request</em></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1102\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1101\">4 BHK + Study + Servant (Premium / Large Unit)</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1121\"><strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1120\">5,450 sq.ft.</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1143\"><em data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1141\">Price on Request</em></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1251\"><em data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1251\">For the latest offers, deals, and complete pricing details, site visits can be arranged upon request.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1318\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1318\">2. Floor Plan Descriptions (Detailed &amp; SEO-Friendly)</strong></h1>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1351\"><strong data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1351\">&nbsp;2 BHK&nbsp; 1,715 sq.ft.</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1478\">The 2 BHK layout is crafted for small families or couples looking for a spacious and balanced home.<br data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1454\"><strong data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1478\">Key Layout Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1716\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1509\">Large living &amp; dining area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1557\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1557\">2 spacious bedrooms with attached wardrobes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1593\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1593\">Well-ventilated modular kitchen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1634\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1634\">Balcony overlooking green landscapes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1669\">Thoughtfully planned washrooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1716\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1716\">Efficient use of space with wide corridors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1780\">Perfect for those wanting luxury without compromising comfort.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1785\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1828\"><strong data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1828\">&nbsp;3 BHK + Servant&nbsp; 2,325 sq.ft.</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1970\">The 3 BHK + Servant configuration is a premium option designed for mid-to-large families seeking elegant living with an additional help room.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"1996\"><strong data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"1996\">Key Layout Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2298\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2021\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2021\">Grand entrance foyer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2060\">Spacious living room &amp; dining zone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2105\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2105\">3 large bedrooms with attached bathrooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2145\">Servant&rsquo;s room with separate access</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2185\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2185\">Modern kitchen with utility balcony</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2236\">Multiple balconies for airflow &amp; natural light</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2298\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2298\">Superior privacy layout separating living &amp; bedroom zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2369\">Ideal for families desiring space, functionality, and premium living.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2374\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2449\"><strong data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2449\">&nbsp;4 BHK + Study + Servant&nbsp; 5,450 sq.ft. (Premium / Larger Unit)</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2567\">This luxurious configuration is the crown jewel of Kashish Manor One &mdash; designed like a super-sized private residence.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2593\"><strong data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2593\">Key Layout Features:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2939\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2636\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2636\">Expansive living &amp; formal dining areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2700\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2700\">4 large bedrooms with walk-in wardrobes &amp; premium washrooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2736\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2736\">Dedicated <strong data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2734\">study and office room</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2776\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2776\">Servant room with independent entry</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2825\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2825\">Huge balconies and terrace-style open spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2865\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2865\">Ultra-spacious kitchen with utility</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2912\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2912\">Grand master suite with lounge style space</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2939\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2939\">Separate family lounge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"3046\">Perfect for ultra-luxury seekers, HNIs, and those wanting a villa style living experience in a high rise.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1382\"><strong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1382\">2. Amenities List&nbsp;</strong></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1526\">Kashish Manor One offers an impressive collection of lifestyle, leisure, and wellness amenities designed to redefine luxury living in Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1568\"><strong data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1568\">Clubhouse &amp; Indoor Facilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1799\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1608\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1608\">Luxurious <strong data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1606\">multi-level clubhouse</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1648\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1648\">Fully equipped <strong data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1646\">modern gymnasium</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1677\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1677\">Yoga &amp; meditation studio</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1729\">Indoor games room (Table tennis, Carrom, Chess)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1767\">Reading lounge &amp; co-working space</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1799\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1799\">Party hall and banquet area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1841\"><strong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1841\">&nbsp;Outdoor &amp; Recreational Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"2030\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1882\">Large <strong data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1880\">central landscaped gardens</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1918\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1918\">Senior citizen relaxation zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1947\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1947\">Jogging &amp; walking tracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1987\">Kids&rsquo; play area with safe equipment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2030\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2030\">Open-air seating and leisure pavilions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2073\"><strong data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2073\">&nbsp;Sports &amp; Wellness Amenities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2196\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2106\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2106\">Swimming pool with deck area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2131\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2131\">Dedicated kids&rsquo; pool</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2167\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2167\">Basketball and badminton courts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2196\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2196\">Outdoor fitness stations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2231\"><strong data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2231\">&nbsp;Security &amp; Convenience</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2435\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2262\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2262\">24x7 <strong data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2260\">CCTV surveillance</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2296\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2296\">Controlled access entry gates</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2318\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2318\">Intercom facility</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2347\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2347\">Dedicated parking spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2372\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2372\">High-speed elevators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2405\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2405\">Power backup in common areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2435\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2435\">On-site maintenance staff</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2504\"><strong data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2504\">3. Location Advantages &ndash; Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway</strong></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2683\">Sector 111 is considered one of Gurgaon&rsquo;s most strategic and high-value micro-markets, thanks to its ideal positioning and rapid development driven by the <strong data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2682\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2718\"><strong data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2718\">&nbsp;Excellent Connectivity</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2953\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2761\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2761\">Direct access to <strong data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2759\">Dwarka Expressway</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2813\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2813\">5&ndash;10 mins to <strong data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2811\">Dwarka Sector 21 Metro Station</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2855\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2855\">15 mins to <strong data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2853\">IGI Airport Terminal 3</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2910\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2910\">Quick access to <strong data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2908\">NH-8, Udyog Vihar &amp; Cyber City</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2953\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2953\">20 mins to <strong data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2951\">Gurgaon Railway Station</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2993\"><strong data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2993\">&nbsp;Major Infrastructure Around</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3169\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3045\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3045\">Close to the upcoming <strong data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3043\">Diplomatic Enclave II</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3103\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3103\">Near <strong data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3101\">India International Convention Centre (IICC)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3169\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3169\">Surrounded by premium residential and commercial developments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3203\"><strong data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3203\">&nbsp;Social Infrastructure</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3457\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3268\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3268\">Top schools: Delhi Public School, G.D. Goenka, Modern School</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3340\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3340\">Renowned hospitals: Columbia Asia, Metro Hospital, Manipal Hospital</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3403\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3403\">Retail hubs: Ambience Mall, Vegas Mall, Palam Vihar Market</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1 data-start=\"4004\" data-end=\"4057\"><strong data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4057\">4. FAQ Section&nbsp;</strong></h1>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4059\" data-end=\"4108\"><strong data-start=\"4063\" data-end=\"4106\">Q1. Where is Kashish Manor One located?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4109\" data-end=\"4234\">It is located in <strong data-start=\"4126\" data-end=\"4167\">Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong>, close to Delhi, IGI Airport, and the upcoming Diplomatic Enclave.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4239\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4241\" data-end=\"4294\"><strong data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4292\">Q2. What are the apartment sizes available?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4407\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4323\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4323\"><strong data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4321\">2 BHK &ndash; 1,715 sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4362\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4362\"><strong data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4360\">3 BHK + Servant &ndash; 2,325 sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4363\" data-end=\"4407\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4407\"><strong data-start=\"4365\" data-end=\"4407\">4 BHK + Study + Servant &ndash; 5,450 sq.ft.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4412\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4414\" data-end=\"4455\"><strong data-start=\"4418\" data-end=\"4453\">Q3. Are there luxury amenities?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4456\" data-end=\"4578\">Yes, including a clubhouse, swimming pool, gym, sports courts, landscaped greens, kids&rsquo; play area, indoor games, and more.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4580\" data-end=\"4583\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4585\" data-end=\"4640\"><strong data-start=\"4589\" data-end=\"4638\">Q4. Is Kashish Manor One good for investment?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4641\" data-end=\"4793\">Absolutely. Its location on Dwarka Expressway and proximity to Delhi and the Diplomatic Enclave makes it a <strong data-start=\"4748\" data-end=\"4792\">high-appreciation investment opportunity</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4795\" data-end=\"4798\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4800\" data-end=\"4862\"><strong data-start=\"4804\" data-end=\"4860\">Q5. What is the price of flats in Kashish Manor One?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4958\">Prices are available <strong data-start=\"4884\" data-end=\"4898\">on request</strong>. Attractive offers and flexible payment plans are provided.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"4963\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"5009\"><strong data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"5007\">Q6. Is the project well-connected?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5010\" data-end=\"5112\">Yes. It offers quick connectivity to Dwarka, IGI Airport, NH-8, Cyber City, and major commercial hubs.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3457\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3457\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3457\">Banks, supermarkets &amp; daily utility stores nearby</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3459\" data-end=\"3496\"><strong data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3496\">&nbsp;Business &amp; Employment Hubs</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3647\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3545\">10&ndash;15 mins to <strong data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3543\">Cyber Hub &amp; DLF Cyber City</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3608\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3608\">Close to corporate offices in <strong data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3593\">Udyog Vihar</strong>, DLF Phase 3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3647\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3647\">Easy commute to South &amp; West Delhi</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1 data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"248\"><strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"248\">Process to Book a Unit in Kashish Manor One Through A2P Realtech</strong></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"406\">Buying a home at <strong data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"288\">Kashish Manor One</strong> through <strong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"313\">A2P Realtech</strong> is simple, transparent, and well-guided. Below is the complete step-by-step booking process:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"411\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"462\"><strong data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"462\">Initial Consultation With A2P Realtech</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"598\">Your journey begins with a consultation call or meeting with an A2P Realtech property expert.<br data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"559\">During this stage, the consultant will:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"815\">\r\n<li data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"673\">Understand your requirements (budget, size, facing, floor preference)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<p data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"747\">Share project details, videos, floor plans, and available inventories</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"815\">\r\n<p data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"815\">Explain amenities, location highlights, and investment benefits</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"820\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"876\"><strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"876\">&nbsp;Schedule a Site Visit (Physical or Virtual)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"975\">A2P Realtech arranges a <strong data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"920\">free site visit</strong> to Kashish Manor One.<br data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"945\">What happens during the visit:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1210\">\r\n<li data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<p data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1004\">Tour of the sample flat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1046\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1046\">Viewing of actual construction status</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1105\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1105\">Amenity walkthrough (clubhouse, gardens, towers, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1157\">Discussion on available units &amp; their positions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1210\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1210\">Clarification of all technical and legal aspects</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1271\"><em data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1271\">Virtual tours are available for NRI or outstation buyers.</em></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1276\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1322\"><strong data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1322\">&nbsp;Shortlisting &amp; Selecting the Unit</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1411\">After the site visit, the A2P Realtech team helps you shortlist the best units based on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1432\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1432\">Preferred floor</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1481\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1481\">View (park-facing, pool-facing, road-facing)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1508\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1508\">Sunlight &amp; ventilation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1529\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1529\">Tower preference</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1560\">Budget &amp; payment structure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1614\">Once decided, a <strong data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1601\">Unit Selection Form</strong> is prepared.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1619\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1670\"><strong data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1670\">&nbsp;Verify Pricing, Payment Plans &amp; Offers</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1693\">A2P Realtech provides:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1717\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1717\">Latest price sheet</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1789\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1789\">Detailed payment plans (CLP, Flexi, or Down Payment, if applicable)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1844\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1844\">Any ongoing offers, discounts, or special benefits</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1900\">Additional charges (PLC, parking, club, IFMS, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1954\">Everything is explained in writing for transparency.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1959\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1994\"><strong data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1994\">&nbsp;Booking Amount Payment</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2144\">To lock your chosen unit, you pay the <strong data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2051\">booking amount</strong> (usually via cheque, RTGS, or online transfer) in favor of the developer&rsquo;s official account.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2167\">A2P Realtech ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2196\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2196\">Correct payment details</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2241\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2241\">Proper acknowledgment from the developer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2286\">Booking receipt is generated immediately</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2291\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2323\"><strong data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2323\">&nbsp;KYC &amp; Documentation</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2379\">You submit the standard documents required for booking:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2484\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2393\">PAN card</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2409\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2409\">Aadhar card</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2434\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2434\">Passport-size photos</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2452\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2452\">Address proof</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2484\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2484\">NRI documents (if applicable)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2550\">A2P Realtech assists you in completing all paperwork accurately.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2555\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2591\"><strong data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2591\">&nbsp;Allotment Letter Issued</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2713\">Once the booking amount is cleared and documents are verified, the developer issues an <strong data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2699\">Allotment Letter</strong> in your name.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2729\">This confirms:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2838\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2751\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2751\">Your unit number</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2776\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2776\">Size &amp; configuration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2811\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2811\">Total price &amp; payment schedule</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2838\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2838\">All terms &amp; conditions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2905\">A2P Realtech ensures you receive a copy and verifies all entries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2910\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2966\"><strong data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2966\">&nbsp;Agreement Signing (Builder&ndash;Buyer Agreement)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3061\">After the allotment, you sign the <strong data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3034\">Builder Buyer Agreement (BBA)</strong> within the given timeline.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3076\">A2P Realtech:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3203\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3114\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3114\">Helps you understand each clause</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3160\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3160\">Coordinates with the developer&rsquo;s CRM team</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3203\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3203\">Ensures no clause is missed or unclear</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3208\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3243\"><strong data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3243\">&nbsp;Payment Plan Execution</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3309\">You start paying as per the selected plan.<br data-start=\"3286\" data-end=\"3289\">A2P Realtech offers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3412\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3332\">Regular reminders</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3370\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3370\">Guidance on installment timelines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3412\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3412\">Help with loan processing if required</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3414\" data-end=\"3417\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3419\" data-end=\"3461\"><strong data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3461\">&nbsp;Home Loan Assistance (If Needed)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3508\">A2P Realtech provides end-to-end loan support:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3641\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3531\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3531\">Eligibility check</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3556\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3556\">Paperwork submission</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3609\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3609\">Coordination with banks (HDFC, ICICI, SBI, etc.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3610\" data-end=\"3641\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3641\">Quick loan sanction support</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3646\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3694\"><strong data-start=\"3651\" data-end=\"3694\">&nbsp;Handover &amp; Possession Assistance</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3695\" data-end=\"3762\">When the unit is ready for possession, A2P Realtech helps you with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3764\" data-end=\"3922\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3764\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3766\" data-end=\"3797\">Possession letter formalities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3826\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3800\" data-end=\"3826\">Final payment settlement</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3859\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3859\">Inspection of your apartment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3860\" data-end=\"3897\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3897\">Snag checking (to ensure quality)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3922\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3922\">Key handover process</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3927\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"3929\" data-end=\"3967\">&nbsp;Why Book Through <strong data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3966\">A2P Realtech</strong>?</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"4236\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"4031\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3971\" data-end=\"4031\">100% <strong data-start=\"3976\" data-end=\"3991\">transparent</strong> &amp; <strong data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4012\">zero brokerage</strong> on primary sales</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4066\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4034\" data-end=\"4066\">Dedicated relationship manager</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4067\" data-end=\"4097\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4097\">Accurate inventory updates</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4119\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4119\">Best deal support</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4153\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4153\">Premium site visit assistance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4183\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4183\">Loan &amp; documentation help</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4236\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4186\" data-end=\"4236\">Personalized guidance from booking to possession</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1752.7197575253483!2d77.03802468887682!3d28.52650620051108!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d1a3b5652046d%3A0xbce5832ffe76fc35!2sMANOR%20ONE%2C%20Sector%20111%2C%20manor%20one%2C%20Delhi%20122017!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Kashish Manor One Sector 111 on Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '', '', 'KMTYRYF1', 19, 'Luxury Flats in Gurgaon | Kashish Manor One, Sector 111 on Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'kashish manor one, kashish manor one gurgaon, manor one sector 111, kashish manor one dwarka expressway, sector 111 gurgaon property, premium flats gurgaon, 2 bhk flats gurgaon, 3 bhk apartments gurgaon, 4 bhk luxury flats gurgaon, apartments near igi airport, delhi gurgaon border projects, gurgaon real estate, luxury residential projects gurgaon, dwarka expressway property, new projects in sector 111, kashish developers gurgaon, ready to move flats dwarka expressway, premium housing gurgaon, best residential projects gurgaon, gurgaon property investment', 'Kashish Manor One in Sector 111, Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon offers premium luxury flats designed for modern living. With spacious layouts, high-end interiors, landscaped greens, clubhouse, swimming pool, gym, kids’ play areas, and multi-tier security, the project ensures a refined lifestyle. Located near the upcoming Diplomatic Enclave, Delhi Airport, and major commercial hubs, Manor One provides unmatched connectivity and high investment potential. Explore floor plans, pricing, and exclusive features of luxury homes at Kashish Manor One today.', NULL, NULL);
