1\" data-end=\"988\">Nature &amp; Outdoor Spaces</strong></h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<li data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1033\">80%+ open space with <strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1033\">landscaped greens</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1074\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1074\">Beautiful <strong data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1074\">water bodies &amp; fountains</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1108\">Japanese-themed <strong data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1108\">zen gardens</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1140\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1140\">Tree-lined <strong data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1140\">walking trails</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1188\">Seating courts &amp; quiet corners for relaxation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1236\"><strong data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1236\">Community &amp; Convenience Features</strong></h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1276\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1276\"><strong data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1261\">Multi-purpose hall</strong> for gatherings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1301\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1301\"><strong data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1301\">Pet-friendly zones</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1332\"><strong data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1332\">Library &amp; reading lounge</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1359\">Mini theatre / AV room</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1412\">Retail shops / daily-need stores (within township)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1417\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1449\"><strong data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1449\">Safety &amp; Smart Living</strong></h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1667\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1505\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1505\"><strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1480\">3-tier / 5-tier security</strong> with CCTV surveillance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1556\">Smart card access &amp; digital visitor management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1597\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1597\">Fire detection &amp; suppression systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1632\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1632\">Earthquake-resistant structure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1667\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1667\">High-speed <strong data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1667\">premium elevators</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1672\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1707\"><strong data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1707\">Parking &amp; Infrastructure</strong></h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1741\">Ample <strong data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1739\">covered car parking</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1764\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1764\">EV charging points</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1788\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1788\">Wide internal roads</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1814\">24&times;7 <strong data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1812\">power backup</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1862\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1862\">Water treatment &amp; sewage management systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 270, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2 data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1902\"><strong data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1902\">Krisumi Waterside Residences &ndash; Where Japanese Design Meets Gurgaon&rsquo;s New Luxury Hub</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"2280\">Located in <strong data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1938\">Sector 36A, Gurgaon</strong>, Krisumi Waterside Residences is an ultra-modern luxury residential development crafted through the prestigious collaboration between <strong data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2105\">Sumitomo Corporation (Japan)</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2135\">Krishna Group (India)</strong>. Spread across a beautifully planned township zone, the project reflects Japanese precision, clean architecture, and long-lasting build quality.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2313\"><strong data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2313\">&nbsp;Location Advantages</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2521\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2356\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2356\">Direct access to <strong data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2354\">Dwarka Expressway</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2393\">20&ndash;25 minutes to <strong data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2391\">IGI Airport</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2463\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2463\">Close to upcoming <strong data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2429\">Global City</strong>, top schools, malls &amp; hospitals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2521\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2521\">Fast access to NH-48, Cyber City, and commercial hubs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2549\"><strong data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2549\">Apartment Types</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2733\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2588\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2588\"><strong data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2561\">2-LDK</strong> large premium residences</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2624\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2624\"><strong data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2600\">3-LDK</strong> spacious family homes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2678\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2678\">High ceilings, premium finishes, modular kitchens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2733\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2733\">VRV air-conditioning and energy-efficient features</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3576\">Typical Unit Types&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"4218\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3638\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3638\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3601\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong>Configuration / Size</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"4218\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3790\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3723\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2-LDK (&asymp; 1,740 sq ft)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3880\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3813\" data-col-size=\"sm\">2-LDK + S / 2.5-LDK</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"3973\">\r\n<td style=\"text-align: left; bord