nd=\"1431\">Multi-purpose sports court</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1475\"><strong data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1473\">Table tennis &amp; indoor sports area</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1511\"><strong data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1511\">Family &amp; Social</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1728\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1556\"><strong data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1554\">Kids&rsquo; activity rooms / creche spaces</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1591\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1591\"><strong data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1589\">Community gathering lounge</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1624\"><strong data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1622\">Multipurpose party rooms</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1686\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1686\"><strong data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1648\">Co-working spaces</strong> for professionals working from home</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1728\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1728\"><strong data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1728\">Guest rooms / serviced guest suites</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1760\"><strong data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1760\">Convenience &amp; Safety</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"2029\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1827\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1827\"><strong data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1799\">Ample covered parking facilities</strong> (multi-level / basements)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1861\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1861\"><strong data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1859\">Dedicated visitor parking</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1891\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1891\"><strong data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1889\">Valet parking service</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1933\"><strong data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1931\">24&times;7 security &amp; CCTV surveillance</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1972\"><strong data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1970\">Access control at entry points</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2029\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2029\"><strong data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2029\">Fire safety systems &amp; emergency response equipment</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2073\"><strong data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2073\">Everyday Services &amp; Convenience</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2125\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2125\"><strong data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2123\">Convenience retail shops within the complex</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2166\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2166\"><strong data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2164\">Salon / beauty &amp; grooming center</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2207\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2207\"><strong data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2194\">Laundry service point</strong> (optional)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2256\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2256\"><strong data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2254\">Parcel delivery lockers / reception desk</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2294\"><strong data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2294\">ATM / banking kiosks (optional)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2331\"><strong data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2331\">Smart Tech &amp; Connectivity</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2496\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2374\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2374\"><strong data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2372\">High-speed broadband &amp; Wi-Fi zones</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2419\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2419\"><strong data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2417\">Smart home infrastructure (optional)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2455\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2455\"><strong data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2453\">App-based facility bookings</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2496\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2496\"><strong data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2496\">Advanced intercom &amp; access systems</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2536\"><strong data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2536\">Environment &amp; Sustainability</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2736\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2572\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2572\"><strong data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2570\">Rainwater harvesting system</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2627\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2627\"><strong data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2625\">Sewage treatment plant (STP) &amp; water recycling</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2683\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2683\"><strong data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2681\">Solar street lights / energy-efficient lighting</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2736\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2736\"><strong data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2736\">Green buffer zones &amp; bio-diversity landscaping</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2779\"><strong data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2779\">Kid-Friendly &amp; Community Spaces</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2914\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2805\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2805\"><strong data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2803\">Toddler play area</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2834\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2834\"><strong data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2832\">Youth activity zones</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2860\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2860\"><strong data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2858\">Art &amp; craft space</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2914\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2914\"><strong data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2914\">Interactive outdoor boards / fitness challenges</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2947\"><strong data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2947\">Pet-Friendly Features</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"3043\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2981\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2981\"><strong data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2979\">Pet play / pet care zones</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3004\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3004\"><strong data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3002\">Pet wash areas</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3043\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3043\"><strong data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3043\">Dedicated walking paths for pets</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3048\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3099\"><strong data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3099\">Why These Amenities Elevate the Lifestyle</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3653\"><strong data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3126\">Wellness &amp; Fitness:</strong> From yoga decks to a fully equipped gym, every resident can maintain a healthy lifestyle without leaving home.<br data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3240\"><strong data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3268\">Leisure &amp; Social Life:</strong> With banquet halls, party lawns, and lounges, socializing becomes effortless.<br data-start=\"3346\" data-end=\"3349\"><strong data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3372\">Safety &amp; Comfort:</strong> 24&times;7 security, parking, and smart access systems ensure peace of mind.<br data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3446\"><strong data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3468\">Family-Friendly:</strong> Kids&rsquo; play areas, senior zones, and multipurpose spaces cater to all age groups.<br data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3552\"><strong data-start=\"3554\" data-end=\"3577\">Sustainable Living:</strong> Eco-friendly systems reduce environmental impact while saving on utilities.</p>', 0, 1, 270, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h1 data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1180\"><strong data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1180\">Satya Levante Residences &mdash; The Ultimate Luxury Address on Dwarka Expressway</strong></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1701\"><strong data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1210\">Satya Levante Residences</strong> is one of Gurgaon&rsquo;s most awaited ultra-luxury residential developments by the prestigious <strong data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1316\">Satya Group</strong>, in collaboration with <strong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1355\">Maple Group</strong>, situated at <strong data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1417\">Sector 104 on the Dwarka Expressway corridor</strong>. This premium project has been designed to offer spacious 3 BHK, 4 BHK and 5 BHK homes with world-class amenities, excellent connectivity, landscaped green spaces, and a lifestyle tailored for modern families, professionals, and investors alike.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1761\"><strong data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1761\">Project Overview: What Makes Levante Unique</strong></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1783\">&nbsp;Project Name:</strong> Satya Levante Residences<br data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1811\"><strong data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1827\">&nbsp;Location:</strong> Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon<br data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1869\"><strong data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1886\">Developer:</strong> Satya Group &amp; Maple Group</li>\r\n<li><strong data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1935\">Project Size:</strong> ~4.6&ndash;5 acres of prime land parcel<br data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1972\"><strong data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"1986\">Towers:</strong> 3 residential high-rise towers (G+47)<br data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2027\"><strong data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2040\">Units:</strong> Approx. 488 premium residences<br data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2074\"><strong data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2101\">Possession Timeline:</strong> Targeted by 2030-2032 (as per RERA)<br data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2140\"><strong data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2165\">RERA Registration:</strong> RC/REP/HARERA/GGM/1000/732/2025/103</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This project embodies <em data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2284\">ultra-luxury living</em> &mdash; combining <strong data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2325\">architectural excellence</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2355\">spacious elevated design</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2383\">resort-style amenities</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2420\">premium lifestyle offerings</strong> right in one of Gurgaon&rsquo;s most rapidly transforming urban corridors.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5497\" data-end=\"5539\"><strong data-start=\"5500\" data-end=\"5539\">Apartment Configurations &amp; Sizes</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5541\" data-end=\"5658\">The project offers a range of&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"5571\" data-end=\"5606\">luxury apartment configurations</strong>&nbsp;to suit different family sizes and lifestyle needs:</p>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0px; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"5660\" data-end=\"5992\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"5660\" data-end=\"5702\">\r\n<tr style=\"background-color: rgb(53, 152, 219); border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"5660\" data-end=\"5702\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\" data-start=\"5660\" data-end=\"5676\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Configuration</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\" data-start=\"5676\" data-end=\"5702\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Approx. Size (Sq. Ft.)</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"5746\" data-end=\"5992\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"5808\" data-end=\"5855\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\"><strong>3 BHK + SR</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\">2180 SQ.FT.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5856\" data-end=\"5895\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\"><strong>3 BHK + SR</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\">2240 SQ.FT.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"5896\" data-end=\"5992\">\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\"><strong>4 BHK + SR</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\">2656 SQ.FT.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\"><strong>4 BHK + SR</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\">2653 SQ.FT.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\"><strong>4 BHK + SR</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\">3130 SQ.FT.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\"><strong>5 BHK + SR</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-width: 1px;\">3463 SQ.FT.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p data-start=\"5994\" data-end=\"6019\"><strong>These residences feature:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6020\" data-end=\"6248\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6020\" data-end=\"6059\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6022\" data-end=\"6059\">Large balconies with expansive views,</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6060\" data-end=\"6101\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6062\" data-end=\"6101\">Well-planned kitchens and living areas,</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6102\" data-end=\"6144\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6104\" data-end=\"6144\">Spacious master suites and family zones,</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6145\" data-end=\"6248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6147\" data-end=\"6248\">Servant or utility rooms (in select layouts) for convenience.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2594\"><strong data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2594\">Home Configurations &mdash; Perfect for Every Lifestyle</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2728\">Satya Levante offers multiple configurations, giving homebuyers a variety of options based on family size and lifestyle preferences:</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2757\"><strong data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2757\">3 BHK Apartments</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"3084\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2786\">Size: ~2180&ndash;2240 sq. ft.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2848\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2848\">Spacious layouts with excellent ventilation and daylight.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2967\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2967\">Large living areas, private balconies, modern kitchens, utility spaces and servant rooms in select configurations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3084\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"3084\">Ideal choice for large families and professionals seeking comfort and style.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3137\"><strong data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3137\">Larger Options (For Scale &amp; Flexibility)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3384\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3190\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3190\"><strong data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3157\">4 BHK &amp; 5 BHK</strong> &mdash; ranging up to ~3463 sq. ft.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3266\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3266\">Configurations with servant/utility space and duplex layouts available.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3384\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3384\">Designed for multi-generational living or premium owners wanting extra space.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3462\"><strong data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3462\">Prime Location Advantage &mdash; Why Sector 104, Dwarka Expressway?</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3574\">One of Levante&rsquo;s strongest selling points is <strong data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3521\">location</strong> &mdash; a key factor for both <em data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3557\">end-users</em> and <em data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3573\">investors</em>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3609\"><strong data-start=\"3583\" data-end=\"3609\">Unmatched Connectivity</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3610\" data-end=\"4294\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3610\" data-end=\"3778\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3778\">Located right on the <em data-start=\"3633\" data-end=\"3663\">150 m wide Dwarka Expressway</em> &mdash; this corridor is a major growth engine in Gurgaon&rsquo;s real &shy;estate market.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3918\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3918\"><strong data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3826\">Just ~10&ndash;12 minutes from IGI Airport (T3)</strong> &mdash; ideal for frequent flyers and business travelers.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"4104\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3921\" data-end=\"4104\"><strong data-start=\"3921\" data-end=\"4006\">Quick access to NH-8, Southern Peripheral Road (SPR), Pataudi Road and Cyber City</strong> &mdash; simplifies everyday commuting to major employment hubs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4294\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4294\"><strong data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4164\">Upcoming Sector 101 Metro Station &amp; Yashobhoomi Metro</strong> &mdash; further enhances public transport access, increasing both convenience and property value.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4296\" data-end=\"4327\"><strong data-start=\"4303\" data-end=\"4327\">In-Town Connectivity</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4328\" data-end=\"4572\">The Dwarka Expressway corridor connects Gurgaon seamlessly with Delhi, IGI Airport, Udyog Vihar, NH-48, and major urban nodes &mdash; making it one of the most sought-after investment addresses in the NCR region.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4574\" data-end=\"4611\"><strong data-start=\"4581\" data-end=\"4611\">Proximity to Key Landmarks</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4612\" data-end=\"4932\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4612\" data-end=\"4708\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4614\" data-end=\"4708\">Top schools such as Delhi Public School &amp; GD Goenka.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4812\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4711\" data-end=\"4812\">Leading hospitals like Medanta &amp; Artemis within easy reach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4813\" data-end=\"4932\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4815\" data-end=\"4932\">Shopping, entertainment, leisure and hospitality zones are just minutes away.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4934\" data-end=\"5199\">This locational edge not only ensures daily convenience for residents, but also offers <strong data-start=\"5021\" data-end=\"5075\">excellent long-term capital appreciation potential</strong>, especially given the ongoing infrastructure developments and metro link expansion.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5201\" data-end=\"5204\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5206\" data-end=\"5251\"><strong data-start=\"5212\" data-end=\"5251\">Amenities That Define Luxury Living</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5253\" data-end=\"5492\">Satya Levante Residences is not just about spacious apartments &mdash; it&rsquo;s about delivering an <em data-start=\"5343\" data-end=\"5363\">elevated lifestyle</em> where luxury meets convenience. Spread across expansive landscaped zones, this project features a host of world-class amenities:</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5494\" data-end=\"5543\"><strong data-start=\"5504\" data-end=\"5543\">Clubhouse &amp; Recreational Facilities</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5544\" data-end=\"6072\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5544\" data-end=\"5707\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5546\" data-end=\"5707\"><strong data-start=\"5546\" data-end=\"5598\">1,00,000+ sq. ft. double-height luxury clubhouse</strong> &mdash; a social hub for fitness, leisure, gatherings, and celebrations.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5708\" data-end=\"5826\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5710\" data-end=\"5826\"><strong data-start=\"5710\" data-end=\"5750\">Temperature-controlled swimming pool</strong> &mdash; for leisure as well as fitness.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5827\" data-end=\"5940\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5829\" data-end=\"5940\"><strong data-start=\"5829\" data-end=\"5845\">Banquet hall</strong> &mdash; perfect for family functions and community events.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5941\" data-end=\"6072\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5943\" data-end=\"6072\"><strong data-start=\"5943\" data-end=\"5986\">Mini-theatre &amp; indoor recreation spaces</strong> &mdash; for entertainment and cultural engagements.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6074\" data-end=\"6105\"><strong data-start=\"6081\" data-end=\"6105\">Lifestyle &amp; Wellness</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6106\" data-end=\"6480\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6106\" data-end=\"6226\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6108\" data-end=\"6226\"><strong data-start=\"6108\" data-end=\"6130\">Gym &amp; wellness spa</strong> &mdash; with modern fitness equipment and relaxation zones.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6227\" data-end=\"6325\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6229\" data-end=\"6325\"><strong data-start=\"6229\" data-end=\"6256\">Yoga &amp; meditation areas</strong> &mdash; for holistic well-being.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6326\" data-end=\"6480\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6328\" data-end=\"6480\"><strong data-start=\"6328\" data-end=\"6379\">Landscaped gardens, walking trails &amp; open lawns</strong> &mdash; 75% open green spaces that promote serenity and fresh air.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6482\" data-end=\"6523\"><strong data-start=\"6495\" data-end=\"6523\">Family-Friendly Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6524\" data-end=\"6843\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6524\" data-end=\"6631\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6526\" data-end=\"6631\"><strong data-start=\"6526\" data-end=\"6546\">Kids&rsquo; play areas</strong> &mdash; safe and joyful play zones for children.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6632\" data-end=\"6753\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6634\" data-end=\"6753\"><strong data-start=\"6634\" data-end=\"6660\">Outdoor leisure spaces</strong> &mdash; including barbecues, reading nooks and sit-outs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6754\" data-end=\"6843\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6756\" data-end=\"6843\"><strong data-start=\"6756\" data-end=\"6798\">Multi-purpose halls &amp; co-working zones</strong> &mdash; ideal for social events or remote working.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6845\" data-end=\"6876\"><strong data-start=\"6852\" data-end=\"6876\">Convenience &amp; Safety</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6877\" data-end=\"7234\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6877\" data-end=\"7012\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6879\" data-end=\"7012\"><strong data-start=\"6879\" data-end=\"6922\">Zero vehicular movement on ground level</strong> &mdash; ensuring safety for children and pedestrians.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7013\" data-end=\"7122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7015\" data-end=\"7122\"><strong data-start=\"7015\" data-end=\"7032\">Ample parking</strong> &mdash; with multi-level parking including basements.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7123\" data-end=\"7234\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7125\" data-end=\"7234\"><strong data-start=\"7125\" data-end=\"7164\">24&times;7 security, CCTV, access control</strong> &mdash; for resident peace of mind.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7236\" data-end=\"7239\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7241\" data-end=\"7286\"><strong data-start=\"7247\" data-end=\"7286\">Why 3 BHK at Levante Is a Smart Buy</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7288\" data-end=\"7312\"><strong data-start=\"7295\" data-end=\"7312\">For End-Users</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7313\" data-end=\"7771\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7313\" data-end=\"7416\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7315\" data-end=\"7416\"><strong data-start=\"7315\" data-end=\"7349\">Spacious, premium living space</strong> with thoughtful layouts.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7417\" data-end=\"7524\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7419\" data-end=\"7524\">Ideal for nuclear and joint families seeking comfort + privacy.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7525\" data-end=\"7676\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7527\" data-end=\"7676\">Proximity to employment hubs and educational institutions supports daily convenience and lifestyle quality.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7677\" data-end=\"7771\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7679\" data-end=\"7771\">Modern amenities promote active, healthy lifestyles.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7773\" data-end=\"7797\"><strong data-start=\"7780\" data-end=\"7797\">For Investors</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7798\" data-end=\"8339\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7798\" data-end=\"8008\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7800\" data-end=\"8008\">Dwarka Expressway is one of NCR&rsquo;s most dynamic growth corridors &mdash; with property prices appreciating steadily due to infrastructure development and metro connectivity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8009\" data-end=\"8172\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8011\" data-end=\"8172\">Low-density premium residences typically witness strong rental demand from working professionals and corporate tenants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8173\" data-end=\"8339\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8175\" data-end=\"8339\">Strategic location ensures long-term capital growth &mdash; making 3 BHK homes attractive for both capital gains and rental yield.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8341\" data-end=\"8344\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8648\" data-end=\"8762\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"8769\" data-end=\"8812\"><strong data-start=\"8776\" data-end=\"8812\">Construction &amp; Quality Assurance</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8814\" data-end=\"9216\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8814\" data-end=\"8951\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8816\" data-end=\"8951\">Built using <strong data-start=\"8828\" data-end=\"8861\">MIVAN construction technology</strong> &mdash; known for high strength and precise formwork.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8952\" data-end=\"9093\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8954\" data-end=\"9093\">Strong structural planning with safety features like earthquake resistance and quality finishing.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9094\" data-end=\"9216\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9096\" data-end=\"9216\">Thoughtful design maximizing <strong data-start=\"9125\" data-end=\"9161\">natural ventilation and sunlight</strong> in every home.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9218\" data-end=\"9221\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"9223\" data-end=\"9282\"><strong data-start=\"9229\" data-end=\"9282\">A Lifestyle That Matches Aspirations</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9284\" data-end=\"9649\">Satya Levante Residences in Sector 104 Gurgaon is much more than a residential complex &mdash; <strong data-start=\"9373\" data-end=\"9405\">it&rsquo;s a lifestyle destination</strong>. With <strong data-start=\"9412\" data-end=\"9437\">luxurious 3 BHK homes</strong>, <strong data-start=\"9439\" data-end=\"9464\">world-class amenities</strong>, <strong data-start=\"9466\" data-end=\"9492\">expansive green spaces</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"9498\" data-end=\"9524\">top-notch connectivity</strong>, this project caters to modern buyers who demand comfort, convenience, and prestige.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"9651\" data-end=\"9911\">Whether you&rsquo;re looking for a <strong data-start=\"9680\" data-end=\"9712\">premium home for your family</strong> or a <strong data-start=\"9718\" data-end=\"9783\">high-value investment in Gurgaon&rsquo;s growing real estate market</strong>, Satya Levante presents an unmatched opportunity on the <strong data-start=\"9840\" data-end=\"9861\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> corridor.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"9651\" data-end=\"9911\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"294\"><strong data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"294\">Why Book Your Satya Levante Residence Through A2P Realtech</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"719\">Choosing the right <strong data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"338\">real estate partner</strong> is just as important as choosing the right home. When you&rsquo;re considering a premium property like <strong data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"486\">Satya Levante Residences in Sector 104 Gurgaon</strong>, working with an experienced, trustworthy realty specialist can make all the difference &mdash; for pricing, transparency, support, and a seamless buying journey. Here&rsquo;s why <strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"671\">A2P Realtech</strong> stands out as the best choice for your booking:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"724\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"778\"><strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"778\">1. Trusted &amp; Verified Real Estate Experts</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"1127\">A2P Realtech is more than just a brokerage &mdash; we are a <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"867\">verified real estate advisory</strong> with deep expertise in Gurgaon&rsquo;s luxury property market. Our team understands key corridors like <strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"986\">Dwarka Expressway</strong>, price trends, builder credibility, timelines, and legal compliance &mdash; ensuring you get <strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1112\">authentic, transparent information</strong> at every step.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1183\"><strong data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1183\">2. Official &amp; Authorized Sales Partner</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1276\">A2P Realtech is an <strong data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1232\">authorized sales partner</strong> for <em data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1263\">Satya Levante Residences</em>. This means:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1487\">Direct access to actual inventory and floor plans</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1487\">First-hand updates on bookings and price revisions</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1487\">Early access to premium unit allocations</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1487\">Genuine delivery timelines as approved by the builder</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1571\">You avoid misinformation and the risk of dealing with unauthorized intermediaries.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1576\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1620\"><strong data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1620\">3. Best Price &amp; Exclusive Deals</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1671\">We negotiate directly with developers to provide:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1929\"><strong data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1703\">Special negotiated rates</strong> not available on generic portals<br data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1739\"><strong data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1808\">Waivers on PLC / preferential location charges (where eligible)</strong><br data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1811\"><strong data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1864\">Choice of floor plans and best available blocks</strong><br data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1867\"><strong data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1895\">Flexible payment plans</strong> as per your financial convenience</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1996\">This ensures that you maximize value without compromising choice.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2001\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2043\"><strong data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2043\">4. End-to-End Booking Support</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2207\">Buying a luxury property involves documentation, statutory checks, RERA compliance, builder agreements, and financial coordination. With A2P Realtech you receive:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Complete guidance on RERA &amp; legal documentation</li>\r\n<li>Assistance with <em data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2295\">booking amount</em>, <em data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2318\">agreement execution</em>, and <em data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2343\">payment schedule</em></li>\r\n<li>Coordination with finance partners for <em data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2399\">home loans</em></li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Dedicated assistance at every stage until possession</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2522\">We don&rsquo;t just help you book &mdash; we help you <em data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2521\">buy with confidence</em>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2527\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2580\"><strong data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2580\">5. Market Insights &amp; Investment Advisory</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2696\">Whether you&rsquo;re an end-user looking for a family home or an investor seeking returns, A2P Realtech equips you with:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2942\">Real time price trends on Dwarka Expressway</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2942\">Analysis of rental potential &amp; capital appreciation</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2942\">Comparisons with other projects &mdash; making your decision data-driven</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2942\">ROI estimates based on location, infrastructure &amp; future demand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3027\">This positions you to make an informed, strategic investment &mdash; not just a purchase.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3032\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3092\"><strong data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3092\">6. Dedicated After-Sales &amp; Relationship Support</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3158\">Our relationship doesn&rsquo;t end once you book. A2P Realtech offers:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3395\">&nbsp;After-sales support for documentation &amp; transition</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3395\">Regular updates on construction progress</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3395\">Assistance with interior referrals, shifting services, and property management&nbsp;Help with resale or rental support when needed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3444\"><strong>We build relationships &mdash; not just transactions.</strong></h4>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3449\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3503\"><strong data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3503\">7. Personalized Approach &amp; Customer Focus</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3505\" data-end=\"3576\"><strong>At A2P Realtech, you&rsquo;re not just a lead &mdash; you&rsquo;re a partner. We provide:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3792\">Customized property recommendations based on your needs</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3792\">Priority support via phone, email, or in-person meetings</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3792\">Transparent pricing breakdowns</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3792\">Assistance in English, Hindi, and regional languages</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3855\"><strong>Your priorities drive our process &mdash; not the other way around.</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"3860\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3913\"><strong data-start=\"3868\" data-end=\"3913\">In Short &mdash; What You Get with A2P Realtech</strong></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"4136\">&nbsp;Peace of mind with verified information</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"4136\">Best available price &amp; inventory access</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"4136\">Smooth booking without paperwork hassles</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"4136\">Expert advice tailored to your goals</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"4136\">End-to-end support from inquiry to possession</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4141\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4198\"><strong data-start=\"4149\" data-end=\"4198\">Your Ideal Home Starts with the Right Partner</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4466\">Booking your <strong data-start=\"4213\" data-end=\"4267\">3 BHK luxury apartment at Satya Levante Residences</strong> through <strong data-start=\"4276\" data-end=\"4292\">A2P Realtech</strong> means you&rsquo;re backed by deep market experience, trustworthy guidance, and dedicated service &mdash; all designed to make your investment rewarding and your home journey effortless.</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3506.66215214891!2d76.99805267616071!3d28.489719490550478!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d178b1019b90d%3A0xf6a5f97443c23ba8!2sSatya%20Levante%20Residences!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1765735752604!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 104 Gurgaon Dwarka Expressway', '', '', 'H5QOJ80E', 19, 'Satya Levante Residences, Sector 104 Gurgaon: Unmatched Lifestyle, World-Class Amenities & Smart Investment', 'Satya Levante Residences, Satya Levante Sector 104, 3 BHK Apartment Gurgaon, Luxury Apartments Dwarka Expressway, Satya Group Gurgaon, Premium Residential Projects Gurgaon, Luxury Homes in Sector 104 Gurgaon, New Launch Apartments Gurgaon, Dwarka Expressway Property, High Rise Luxury Apartments Gurgaon', 'Explore luxury 3 BHK apartments at Satya Levante Residences, Sector 104 Gurgaon. Prime Dwarka Expressway location, world-class amenities & premium lifestyle', NULL, NULL);
