a-end=\"3690\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3690\"><strong data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3612\">Water Features &amp; Lakeside Ambience</strong> &ndash; Calm, scenic outdoor environment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3692\" data-end=\"3695\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3736\"><strong data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3736\">Sustainability &amp; Green Living</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"4119\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3859\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3739\" data-end=\"3859\"><strong data-start=\"3739\" data-end=\"3770\">Extensive Landscaped Greens</strong> &ndash; Eco-friendly and pollution-free environment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3860\" data-end=\"3994\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3994\"><strong data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3904\">Rainwater Harvesting &amp; Green Practices</strong> &ndash; Designed for long-term environmental benefit.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4119\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4119\"><strong data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4040\">Open Green Spaces &amp; Forest-Themed Zones</strong> &ndash; Connect with nature right at home.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4121\" data-end=\"4124\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4126\" data-end=\"4163\"><strong data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4163\">Why These Amenities Matter</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4164\" data-end=\"4457\">These luxury amenities at <strong data-start=\"4190\" data-end=\"4216\">AIPL Lake City Gurgaon</strong> elevate everyday living, promote family wellness, foster community interactions, and enhance property value &mdash; making it a <strong data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4391\">prime choice for luxury homebuyers and investors</strong> on the Dwarka Expressway.&nbsp;</p>', 0, 1, 328, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h1 data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"753\"><strong data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"753\">Luxury 3 BHK Apartments in AIPL Lake City Gurgaon &ndash; Premium Living on Dwarka Expressway</strong></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"1140\">The real estate landscape of <strong data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"795\">Gurgaon</strong> is witnessing a powerful transformation, and at the heart of this growth lies <a href=\"../search_result.php?query=dwarka+expressway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"895\">Dwarka Expressway</strong></a>&mdash;India&rsquo;s fastest emerging luxury residential corridor. Among the most awaited premium developments here is <strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1020\">AIPL Lake City</strong>, a thoughtfully planned township offering <strong data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1090\">luxury 3 BHK apartments</strong> designed for modern families and smart investors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1340\">Presented by <strong data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1171\">A2P Realtech</strong>, this project combines location advantage, lifestyle luxury, and long-term investment growth, making it one of the <strong data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1333\">best luxury residential options in Gurgaon</strong> today.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1345\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2647\"><strong data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2647\">Project Overview: Design, Layout &amp; Configurations</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2858\">AIPL Lake City is planned as a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2725\">low-density, premium residential township</strong>&nbsp;with thoughtfully designed towers and expansive green spaces. The project focuses on space optimization, privacy, and luxury living.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #000000;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); border-style: solid;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>APARTMENTS TYPE</strong></span></td>\r\n<