 data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1726\">low-density living</strong>, green surroundings, and world-class amenities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1806\">This development is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1937\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1842\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1842\">End-users seeking a luxury home</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1882\">NRIs looking for high-return assets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1937\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1937\">Investors targeting Dwarka Expressway appreciation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2005\"><strong data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2005\">Prime Location: Sector 103, Dwarka Expressway, Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2059\">Location is the biggest advantage of AIPL Lake City.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2090\"><strong data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2090\">Key Location Benefits</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2344\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2125\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2125\"><strong data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2125\">Bang on Dwarka Expressway</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2170\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2170\">&nbsp;5 minutes from <strong data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2170\">Delhi-Gurgaon border</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2207\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2207\">20 minutes from <strong data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2207\">IGI Airport</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2267\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2267\">Seamless connectivity to <strong data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2267\">Cyber City &amp; Udyog Vihar</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2309\">\r\n<p data-