2\" data-end=\"3844\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3844\">Senior citizen seating zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3845\" data-end=\"3873\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"3873\">Community gathering spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3903\"><strong data-start=\"3879\" data-end=\"3903\">Safety &amp; Convenience</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"4102\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3904\" data-end=\"3944\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3906\" data-end=\"3944\">24&times;7 security with CCTV surveillance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"3981\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3981\">Access-controlled entry and exit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3982\" data-end=\"4029\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3984\" data-end=\"4029\">Fire safety systems and emergency protocols</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4030\" data-end=\"4054\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4032\" data-end=\"4054\">High-speed elevators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4055\" data-end=\"4102\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4102\">Ample parking space and EV charging provision</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4104\" data-end=\"4132\"><strong data-start=\"4108\" data-end=\"4132\">Sustainable Features</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4265\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4165\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4135\" data-end=\"4165\">Rainwater harvesting systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4211\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4168\" data-end=\"4211\">Energy-efficient lighting in common areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4212\" data-end=\"4238\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4214\" data-end=\"4238\">Green landscaped zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4265\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4241\" data-end=\"4265\">Waste management systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4270\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4321\"><strong data-start=\"4275\" data-end=\"4321\">Location &amp; Connectivity &ndash; Dwarka Sector 17</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4323\" data-end=\"4565\">Eldeco Dwarka Sector 17 enjoys a <strong data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4374\">prime location</strong> in Dwarka, a well-planned residential hub in South West Delhi. Its location ensures <strong data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4564\">excellent connectivity, proximity to essential services, and access to Delhi NCR&rsquo;s major destinations</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4567\" data-end=\"4602\"><strong data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4602\">Key Connectivity Advantages</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4603\" data-end=\"4948\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4603\" data-end=\"4672\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4672\">Near <strong data-start=\"4610\" data-end=\"4670\">Dwarka Metro Stations (Blue Line &amp; Airport Express Line)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4757\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4675\" data-end=\"4757\">Close to <strong data-start=\"4684\" data-end=\"4705\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> for seamless road connectivity to Gurgaon &amp; NH-48</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4810\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4760\" data-end=\"4810\">Approximately <strong data-start=\"4774\" data-end=\"4808\">20&ndash;25 minutes from IGI Airport</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4874\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4813\" data-end=\"4874\">Quick access to South Delhi and neighboring commercial hubs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"4948\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4877\" data-end=\"4948\">Well-connected to local markets, schools, hospitals, and shopping malls</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"4991\"><strong data-start=\"4954\" data-end=\"4991\">Nearby Landmarks &amp; Infrastructure</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4992\" data-end=\"5268\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4992\" data-end=\"5071\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4994\" data-end=\"5071\">Educational Institutions: DPS Dwarka, Sri Venkateshwar International School</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5072\" data-end=\"5139\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5074\" data-end=\"5139\">Hospitals: Venkateshwar Hospital, Max Multi Speciality Hospital</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5140\" data-end=\"5210\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5142\" data-end=\"5210\">Malls &amp; Retail: Vegas Mall, Pacific Mall, local shopping complexes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5211\" data-end=\"5268\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5213\" data-end=\"5268\">Parks &amp; Green Spaces: Sector 17 park, community gardens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5270\" data-end=\"5379\">This connectivity and infrastructure make Eldeco Dwarka Sector 17 <strong data-start=\"5336\" data-end=\"5372\">ideal for families and investors</strong> alike.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5381\" data-end=\"5384\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5447\"><strong data-start=\"5389\" data-end=\"5447\">ROI Benefits &ndash; Why Eldeco Dwarka is a Smart Investment</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5449\" data-end=\"5626\">Investing in <strong data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5489\">Eldeco Dwarka Sector 17</strong> is not only about owning a home but also <strong data-start=\"5531\" data-end=\"5567\">earning strong long-term returns</strong>. Here&rsquo;s why it is a <strong data-start=\"5588\" data-end=\"5625\">high-value investment opportunity</strong>:</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5628\" data-end=\"5656\"><strong data-start=\"5632\" data-end=\"5656\">Capital Appreciation</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5657\" data-end=\"5974\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5657\" data-end=\"5745\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5659\" data-end=\"5745\">Dwarka is a rapidly developing residential hub with limited high-end housing supply.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5746\" data-end=\"5862\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5748\" data-end=\"5862\">Infrastructure projects like <strong data-start=\"5777\" data-end=\"5808\">Dwarka Expressway expansion</strong> and metro connectivity drive property value growth.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5863\" data-end=\"5974\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5865\" data-end=\"5974\">Appreciation trends in Dwarka show <strong data-start=\"5900\" data-end=\"5927\">steady long-term growth</strong>, making this project attractive for investors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5976\" data-end=\"6007\"><strong data-start=\"5980\" data-end=\"6007\">Rental Income Potential</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6008\" data-end=\"6266\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6008\" data-end=\"6099\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6010\" data-end=\"6099\">The project&rsquo;s <strong data-start=\"6024\" data-end=\"6071\">premium positioning and lifestyle amenities</strong> attract high-end tenants.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6100\" data-end=\"6194\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6102\" data-end=\"6194\">Proximity to <strong data-start=\"6115\" data-end=\"6158\">IGI Airport, metro, and commercial hubs</strong> ensures consistent rental demand.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6195\" data-end=\"6266\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6197\" data-end=\"6266\">Strong rental yields are expected for both <strong data-start=\"6240\" data-end=\"6265\">3 BHK and 4 BHK units</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6268\" data-end=\"6291\"><strong data-start=\"6272\" data-end=\"6291\">Safe Investment</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6292\" data-end=\"6488\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6292\" data-end=\"6365\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6294\" data-end=\"6365\">Developed by the <strong data-start=\"6311\" data-end=\"6335\">reputed Eldeco Group</strong> with a strong track record.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6366\" data-end=\"6426\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6368\" data-end=\"6426\">RERA-compliant project with transparent legal approvals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6427\" data-end=\"6488\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6429\" data-end=\"6488\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"6439\" data-end=\"6487\">end-users, NRI buyers, and corporate tenants</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6490\" data-end=\"6493\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"6495\" data-end=\"6566\"