 data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1035\">Badminton Court</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1062\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1062\"><strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1062\">Half-Football Ground</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1092\"><strong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1092\">Petanque / Lawn Bowling</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1123\"><strong data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1123\">Outdoor Fitness Stations</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1128\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1163\"><strong data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1163\">Parks &amp; Outdoor Leisure</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1463\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1193\"><strong data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1193\">Central Landscaped Park</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1243\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1243\"><strong data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1243\">Themed Gardens (Herbal, Floral, Zen Garden)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1275\"><strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1275\">Picnic Lawns &amp; Open Lawns</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1313\"><strong data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1313\">Amphitheatre for Outdoor Events</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1361\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1361\"><strong data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1361\">Children&rsquo;s Play Area with Safety Flooring</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1391\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1391\"><strong data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1391\">Senior Citizen Sit-outs</strong></p>\r\n<