\n<p data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2165\"><strong data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2165\">Senior Activity Zone</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2194\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2194\"><strong data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2194\">Kid-friendly Club Zone</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2220\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2220\"><strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2220\">Family Picnic Areas</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2254\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2254\"><strong data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2254\">Interactive Water Play Area</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2317\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2317\"><strong data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2317\">Drive-through Entry &amp; Valet Services (subject to design)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2322\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2369\"><strong data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2369\">Eco-friendly &amp; Sustainable Features</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2604\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2404\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2404\"><strong data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2404\">Rainwater Harvesting Systems</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2451\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2451\"><strong data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2451\">Green Buffer Zones &amp; Tree-lined Pathways</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2496\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2496\"><strong data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2496\">Solar-powered Lighting in Common Areas</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2529\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2529\"><strong data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2529\">Waste-segregation Stations</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2568\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2568\"><strong data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2568\">Energy-efficient Street Lighting</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2604\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2604\"><strong data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2604\">Eco-pavilions &amp; Nature Trails</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2650\"><strong data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2650\">Premium Residential Comforts</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2884\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2697\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2697\"><strong data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2697\">Grand Entrance Lobby with Concierge Desk</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2741\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2741\"><strong data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2741\">Designer Elevators with Natural Light</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2777\"><strong data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2777\">Well-lit Corridors &amp; Walkways</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2824\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2824\"><strong data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2824\">Fire Safety &amp; Emergency Protocol Systems</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2884\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2884\"><strong data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2884\">Dedicated Servant / Utility Entry (in select layouts)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"2889\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2925\"><strong data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2925\">Smart &amp; Connected Living</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"3068\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2958\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2958\"><strong data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2958\">App-based Facility Booking</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2986\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2986\"><strong data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2986\">Home Automation Ready</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3031\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3031\"><strong data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3031\">Visitor Alerts &amp; Remote Access Control</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3068\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3068\"><strong data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3068\">Package Pickup &amp; Delivery Zone</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 271, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h2 data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"454\"><strong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"452\">M3M GIC &mdash; Gurgaon International City, Sector M9, IMT Manesar</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"535\"><strong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"535\">Luxury Living | Integrated Urban Township | Strategic Growth Destination</strong></h3>\r\n<hr data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"540\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"602\"><strong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"602\">&nbsp;A Next-Generation Integrated Township</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"1122\">M3M GIC, officially known as <strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"669\">Gurgaon International City (GIC)</strong> by <strong data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"691\">M3M Properties</strong>, is an ambitious, large-scale integrated urban development set in Sector M9 (with extensions into M10 &amp; M11), <strong data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"826\">IMT Manesar, Gurgaon</strong>. This project reimagines modern living by blending premium residential spaces with commercial ventures, industry hubs, retail parks, open green zones, and social infrastructure &mdash; transforming traditional real estate into a holistic live-work-play ecosystem.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1559\">Sprawling across a significant land parcel of approximately <strong data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1202\">140+ acres</strong>, M3M GIC is envisioned as one of the region&rsquo;s most transformative developments &mdash; strategically located along major corridors like <strong data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1395\">NH-48, Dwarka Expressway, KMP Expressway, and Pataudi Road</strong>. It enables seamless connectivity to Haryana&rsquo;s industrial belt, employment zones, Delhi, Gurgaon, and other parts of the NCR.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1887\">Designed for discerning homebuyers, professionals, families, and investors, this integrated township aims to deliver <em data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1767\">world-class living spaces, superior infrastructure, and compelling investment potential</em> &mdash; making it a landmark destination within the rapidly expanding Manesar corridor.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"263\"><strong data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"263\">M3M GIC Manesar | Luxury Apartments &amp; High-Growth Investment Hub</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"611\"><strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"284\">M3M GIC Manesar</strong> is your opportunity to own a premium home or make a smart investment in one of NCR&rsquo;s fastest-growing real estate destinations. Located in <strong data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"449\">Sector M9, IMT Manesar</strong>, this iconic integrated township by <strong data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"499\">M3M India</strong> offers a perfect blend of luxury living, modern infrastructure, and exceptional return on investment potential.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"844\">Designed for discerning homebuyers and forward-thinking investors, M3M GIC brings together upscale residences, world-class amenities, expansive green spaces, and seamless connectivity &mdash; all within a self-sufficient urban ecosystem.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"898\"><strong data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"898\">Premium Homes Designed for Modern Lifestyles</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"1163\">Step into a world of elegance with <strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"977\">spacious 2, 3 &amp; 4 BHK luxury apartments</strong> at M3M GIC Manesar. Each residence is thoughtfully designed with smart layouts, large balconies, abundant natural light, and premium finishes that reflect contemporary living standards.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1473\">The project offers a host of <strong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1224\">luxury lifestyle amenities</strong>, including a grand clubhouse, swimming pool, state-of-the-art fitness center, landscaped gardens, jogging tracks, children&rsquo;s play areas, and dedicated sports facilities. Every detail is crafted to enhance comfort, convenience, and community living.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1526\"><strong data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1526\">Unmatched Location &amp; Connectivity Advantage</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1705\">M3M GIC enjoys a <strong data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1576\">strategic location advantage</strong> in IMT Manesar &mdash; one of the largest industrial and employment hubs in North India. The project offers excellent connectivity to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1740\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1740\"><strong data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1740\">NH-48 (Delhi&ndash;Jaipur Highway)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1764\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1764\"><strong data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1764\">Dwarka Expressway</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1785\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1785\"><strong data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1785\">KMP Expressway</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1804\"><strong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1804\">Pataudi Road</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"2034\">With easy access to major corporate hubs, industrial zones, business parks, and logistics centers, M3M GIC is ideal for working professionals, entrepreneurs, and families seeking reduced travel time and better work-life balance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2086\"><strong data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2086\">A Smart Investment with High ROI Potential</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2346\">For investors, M3M GIC Manesar presents a <strong data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2167\">high-growth investment opportunity</strong>. The rapid development of Manesar as an industrial and commercial hub, combined with upcoming infrastructure projects, is driving strong demand for quality housing in the region.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2388\">The integrated township concept ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2596\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2467\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2467\"><strong data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2413\">High rental demand</strong> from professionals working in IMT Manesar &amp; Gurgaon</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2532\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2532\"><strong data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2501\">Strong capital appreciation</strong> over the medium to long term</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2596\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2596\"><strong data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2555\">Low vacancy risk</strong> due to proximity to employment centers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2750\">Backed by the trusted <strong data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2633\">M3M brand</strong>, known for delivering landmark projects, this development offers reliability, value appreciation, and peace of mind.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2787\"><strong data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2787\">Why Buy at M3M GIC Manesar?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"3050\">Premium apartments in an integrated township</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"3050\">Strategic location near major highways &amp; industrial hubs</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"3050\">&nbsp;World-class amenities &amp; green living environment</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"3050\">High appreciation &amp; rental income potential</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"3050\">Trusted developer with strong market reputation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1953\"><strong data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1953\">1. Project Highlights &mdash; Defining Modern Urban Living</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2003\"><strong data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2003\">1.1 A Vast, Integrated Urban Masterpiece</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2378\">At its core, M3M GIC is <strong data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2073\">far more than just a residential complex</strong> &mdash; it&rsquo;s a thoughtfully planned township where <em data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2213\">homes, offices, retail destinations, industrial hubs, and green spaces co-exist harmoniously</em>. This holistic approach ensures residents live in a self-sufficient environment with access to all essential urban facilities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2432\">The township features multiple zones designated for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2747\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2491\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2491\"><strong data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2465\">Residential neighbourhoods</strong> with premium apartments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2529\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2529\"><strong data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2527\">Commercial &amp; retail precincts</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2577\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2577\"><strong data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2575\">Office spaces &amp; co-working environments</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2617\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2617\"><strong data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2615\">Industrial and innovation parks</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2659\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2659\"><strong data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2657\">Public infrastructure &amp; amenities</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2747\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2747\"><strong data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2709\">Parks, forests, and recreational landscapes</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"3029\">Nearly <strong data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2769\">46+ acres</strong> are earmarked exclusively for eco-friendly industries and workplaces like IT offices, data centres, and innovation hubs &mdash; transforming GIC into a <strong data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2941\">live-work destination</strong> that drives both employment and community growth.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3098\"><strong data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3098\">1.2 Landscape &amp; Environment &mdash; Green, Open, and Well-Planned</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3497\">A remarkable feature of the township is its dedicated open and green space. M3M GIC demonstrates a strong focus on <em data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3257\">healthy living and environmental quality</em>, with large stretches of parks, forest-inspired landscapes, eco zones, walking trails, water features, and recreational lawns &mdash; allowing residents to enjoy nature without sacrificing urban convenience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3705\">These green areas not only enhance the visual appeal of the environment but also improve air quality, reduce noise pollution, and create serene community spaces for leisure, exercise, and family activities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3707\" data-end=\"3776\"><strong data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3776\">1.3 Phased, Modern Construction with Architectural Excellence</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"4145\">The development consists of <strong data-start=\"3806\" data-end=\"3833\">multiple premium towers</strong> rising up to <em data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"3863\">G + 30+ floors</em> with meticulously designed layouts that balance aesthetic appeal and functional space planning. Each phase is carefully engineered to offer abundant daylight, great ventilation, scenic views, and well-organized circulation within the property.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4147\" data-end=\"4150\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4219\"><strong data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4219\">2. Apartment Configurations &mdash; Home Options for Diverse Needs</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4445\">M3M GIC offers a thoughtfully curated portfolio of residential apartments designed to suit various lifestyle requirements &mdash; from modern urban families to professionals and luxury buyers.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4480\"><strong data-start=\"4451\" data-end=\"4480\">2.1 Types &amp; Size Variants</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4516\">The residential offerings include: (Unit Size <strong>1250-2400 SQFT)</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4831\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4593\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4593\"><strong data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4540\">2 BHK Apartments</strong> (ideal for young professionals and small families)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4594\" data-end=\"4646\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4596\" data-end=\"4646\"><strong data-start=\"4596\" data-end=\"4618\">2.5 BHK Residences</strong> with flexible space usage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4695\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4649\" data-end=\"4695\"><strong data-start=\"4649\" data-end=\"4669\">3 BHK Apartments</strong> (spacious family homes)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4696\" data-end=\"4759\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4698\" data-end=\"4759\"><strong data-sta