&amp; Smart Infrastructure</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7043\" data-end=\"7083\"><strong data-start=\"7047\" data-end=\"7083\">3.3 Smart &amp; Sustainable Features</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"7085\" data-end=\"7351\">M3M GIC incorporates eco-sensitive design elements and future-ready construction practices &mdash; such as energy-efficient systems, rainwater harvesting, and green belts &mdash; that promote sustainability and lower environmental impact.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7353\" data-end=\"7356\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7358\" data-end=\"7428\"><strong data-start=\"7361\" data-end=\"7428\">4. Location &amp; Connectivity &mdash; Strategic Advantage in IMT Manesar</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7430\" data-end=\"7754\">One of the strongest pillars of M3M GIC&rsquo;s appeal is its <strong data-start=\"7486\" data-end=\"7508\">strategic location</strong> in Sector M9/M10/M11 near <strong data-start=\"7535\" data-end=\"7550\">IMT Manesar</strong>, one of NCR&rsquo;s major industrial and employment hubs. This location positions GIC at the heart of <strong data-start=\"7647\" data-end=\"7672\">rapid regional growth</strong> and extensive infrastructure development.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"7756\" data-end=\"7792\"><strong data-start=\"7760\" data-end=\"7792\">4.1 Road &amp; Expressway Access</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7794\" data-end=\"8229\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7794\" data-end=\"7913\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7796\" data-end=\"7913\"><strong data-start=\"7796\" data-end=\"7828\">NH-48 (Delhi&ndash;Jaipur Highway)</strong> provides direct regional connectivity to Delhi, Jaipur, and surrounding corridors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7914\" data-end=\"7997\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7916\" data-end=\"7997\"><strong data-start=\"7916\" data-end=\"7937\">Dwarka Expressway</strong> enhances access to Gurgaon, Dwarka, and south-west Delhi.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7998\" data-end=\"8099\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8000\" data-end=\"8099\"><strong data-start=\"8000\" data-end=\"8018\">KMP Expressway</strong> connects key ring roads around the NCR for seamless movement across districts.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8100\" data-end=\"8229\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8102\" data-end=\"8229\"><strong data-start=\"8102\" data-end=\"8118\">Pataudi Road</strong> and <strong data-start=\"8123\" data-end=\"8144\">Rewari Expressway</strong> further extend regional reach for commuters.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"8231\" data-end=\"8447\">These expressways significantly reduce travel time to major business zones, airports, hospitals, and educational institutions, making daily commuting efficient and stress-free.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8449\" data-end=\"8496\"><strong data-start=\"8453\" data-end=\"8496\">4.2 Proximity to Key Destination Points</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"8498\" data-end=\"8895\">\r\n<li data-start=\"8498\" data-end=\"8549\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8500\" data-end=\"8549\"><strong data-start=\"8500\" data-end=\"8515\">IGI Airport</strong> &mdash; approx. <em data-start=\"8526\" data-end=\"8541\">20&ndash;35 minutes</em> drive</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8550\" data-end=\"8618\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8552\" data-end=\"8618\"><strong data-start=\"8552\" data-end=\"8582\">Gurgaon Business Districts</strong> &mdash; quick access via major highways</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8619\" data-end=\"8681\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8621\" data-end=\"8681\"><strong data-start=\"8621\" data-end=\"8657\">Industrial Hubs like IMT Manesar</strong> &mdash; immediate proximity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8682\" data-end=\"8765\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8684\" data-end=\"8765\"><strong data-start=\"8684\" data-end=\"8741\">Commercial &amp; IT Parks (Cyber City, Udyog Vihar, etc.)</strong> &mdash; direct connectivity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"8766\" data-end=\"8895\">\r\n<p data-start=\"8768\" data-end=\"8895\"><strong data-start=\"8768\" data-end=\"8808\">Educational Institutions &amp; Hospitals</strong> &mdash; close to reputed schools and medical centres</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8897\" data-end=\"8939\"><strong data-start=\"8901\" data-end=\"8939\">4.3 Future Infrastructure Upgrades</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8941\" data-end=\"9253\">The township&rsquo;s location is expected to gain further connectivity advantages from <em data-start=\"9022\" data-end=\"9050\">planned transport projects</em>, including the <strong data-start=\"9066\" data-end=\"9096\">Gurgaon&ndash;Manesar Metro Line</strong> and <strong data-start=\"9101\" data-end=\"9134\">Haryana Orbital Rail Corridor</strong>, which will greatly enhance public transit options and regional accessibility.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9255\" data-end=\"9258\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"9260\" data-end=\"9322\"><strong data-start=\"9263\" data-end=\"9322\">5. Investment &amp; ROI Benefits &mdash; Growth, Demand &amp; Returns</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9324\" data-end=\"9542\">M3M GIC&rsquo;s strategic positioning within <strong data-start=\"9363\" data-end=\"9409\">IMT Manesar and Gurgaon International City</strong> makes it exceptionally appealing for <em data-start=\"9447\" data-end=\"9477\">both end-users and investors</em> seeking long-term value.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"9544\" data-end=\"9581\"><strong data-start=\"9548\" data-end=\"9581\">5.1 Growth Corridor Potential</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9583\" data-end=\"9974\">This region of Manesar and GIC is part of one of the fastest-growing real estate corridors in north-west India. With expanding industrial parks, multinational companies, and emerging IT/innovation hubs nearby, demand for quality residential properties is expected to remain strong &mdash; creating favourable conditions for <em data-start=\"9901\" data-end=\"9933\">capital appreciation over time</em>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"9976\" data-end=\"10014\"><strong data-start=\"9980\" data-end=\"10014\">5.2 Employment &amp; Rental Demand</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10016\" data-end=\"10319\">Proximity to major employment centres such as <strong data-start=\"10062\" data-end=\"10135\">IMT Manesar, Gurugram&rsquo;s corporate clusters, and future business parks</strong> increases rental demand. This makes owning a residence here attractive not just for lifestyle purposes but also for <em data-start=\"10252\" data-end=\"10278\">rental income generation</em>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"10321\" data-end=\"10373\"><strong data-start=\"10325\" data-end=\"10373\">5.3 Infrastructure-Driven Value Appreciation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10375\" data-end=\"10673\">With ongoing investments in expressways, metro connectivity, urban infrastructure, and township amenities, the area is poised for <em data-start=\"10505\" data-end=\"10535\">steady property value growth</em> &mdash; offering investors the potential to realise healthy returns over a medium to long-term horizon.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"10675\" data-end=\"10725\"><strong data-start=\"10679\" data-end=\"10725\">5.4 Developer Reputation &amp; Township Appeal</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10727\" data-end=\"11019\">M3M India is a well-established name in Indian real estate with a track record of delivering large developments. Their focus on integrated township planning, attention to design quality, and delivery of key amenities further boosts investor confidence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11021\" data-end=\"11024\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"11026\" data-end=\"11088\"><strong data-start=\"11029\" data-end=\"11088\">A Future-Ready, Integrated Urban Ecosystem</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"11090\" data-end=\"11526\"><strong data-start=\"11090\" data-end=\"11125\">M3M GIC, Sector M9, IMT Manesar</strong> is poised to set new benchmarks in urban living &mdash; blending <strong data-start=\"11185\" data-end=\"11270\">luxury homes, sustainable design, smart infrastructure, and world-class amenities</strong> within a <em data-start=\"11280\" data-end=\"11313\">self-sufficient integrated city</em>. Its strategic location, strong connectivity, and expansive township concept make it an <em data-start=\"11402\" data-end=\"11485\">ideal choice for modern lifestyles, family comfort, and long-term wealth creation</em>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"11528\" data-end=\"11852\">Whether you are buying a home to live in or investing for future returns, M3M GIC offers a compelling combination of <strong data-start=\"11645\" data-end=\"11721\">lifestyle convenience, growth potential, and future-ready infrastructure</strong> &mdash; establishing it as one of the most desirable real estate opportunities in the NCR today.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"339\"><strong data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"339\">Step-by-Step: Booking a Unit Through A2P Realtech (Channel Partner)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"554\">Booking a premium apartment at <strong data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"391\">M3M GIC Manesar</strong> through <strong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"416\">A2P Realtech</strong> combines personalized guidance with developer-approved procedures &mdash; giving you <em data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"522\">assistance at every step</em>, from inquiry to documentation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"601\"><strong data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"601\">1. Initial Contact &amp; Project Briefing</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"1021\">&nbsp;Reach out to A2P Realtech through call, WhatsApp, or contact form with your interest in M3M GIC Manesar.<br data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"712\"><strong>A2P Realtech</strong> will provide <strong data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"773\">detailed project information</strong>, floor plans, price sheets, payment plans, and brochure &mdash; tailored to your budget and requirements.<br data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"876\">They&rsquo;ll highlight key selling points such as <strong data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"982\">unit options, pricing, amenities, and investment benefits</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1026\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1076\"><strong data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1076\">2. Requirement Assessment &amp; Shortlisting</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1140\">&nbsp;A sales expert from A2P will connect with you to understand:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1288\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1168\">Your <strong data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1168\">preferred budget</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1228\"><strong data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1205\">Apartment size / configuration</strong> (e.g., 2, 3, or 4 BHK)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1285\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1285\">Desired <strong data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1285\">floor / view / location within the project</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1390\">Based on your inputs, they&rsquo;ll help you <strong data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1356\">shortlist suitable units</strong> that best match your preferences.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1433\"><strong data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1433\">3. Site Visit &amp; Presentation</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>A2P Realtech</strong> will arrange a <strong data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1479\">site visit</strong> to the project location in Sector M9, Manesar, or a <strong data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1561\">project experience center</strong> (if available).<br data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1580\">During the visit, you&rsquo;ll get:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Actual site feel</li>\r\n<li>Tour of sample apartments (if ready)</li>\r\n<li>View of clubhouse, amenities, surrounding infrastructure</li>\r\n<li>Expert answers to all questions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1837\">This helps you <em data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1836\">visualize your future home before choosing the unit</em>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1842\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1894\"><strong data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1894\">4. Review of Pricing &amp; Available Inventory</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"2126\">A2P will share the <strong data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1944\">latest inventory status</strong> &mdash; including unit availability, price, floor plans, and any developer offers, discounts, or launch benefits.<br data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2055\">This ensures you make an <strong data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2099\">informed choice</strong> before initiating booking.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2131\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2180\"><strong data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2180\">5. Documentation &amp; Booking Confirmation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2210\">&nbsp;Once you decide on a unit:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2600\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2292\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2292\"><strong data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2240\">Booking form is filled</strong> &mdash; capturing buyer details, unit details, and price.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2379\"><strong data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2338\">Token amount / initial booking payment</strong> is paid as per the developer&rsquo;s schedule.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2471\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2471\">This amount is typically a fixed booking sum agreed upon with A2P and the developer.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2600\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2600\">A2P Realtech facilitates the submission of all <strong data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2544\">required documents</strong> (PAN, Aadhaar, contact details, etc.) to the developer.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2751\">When the booking form and token payment are accepted, the unit is <em data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2699\">officially marked as reserved</em> in your name.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2756\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2802\"><strong data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2802\">6. Coordinate with Financing &amp; Loans</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"3124\">&nbsp;If you require a <strong data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2836\">home loan</strong>, A2P can help you connect with trusted lenders and get pre-approval or sanction letters quickly.<br data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2936\">They assist with coordinating <strong data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3026\">bank documentation, rate discussion, and loan submission</strong>, making the buying process much smoother.<br data-start=\"3068\" data-end=\"3071\">This adds value for buyers needing financing support.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3129\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3160\"><strong data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3160\">7. Agreement for Sale</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3215\">Once your payment schedule and terms are finalized:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3383\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3286\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3218\" data-end=\"3286\">You&rsquo;ll be asked to <strong data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3268\">sign the Agreement for Sale</strong> with the builder.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3287\" data-end=\"3383\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3383\">This contract includes payment details, possession date, unit specifications, and legal terms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3546\">A2P Realtech will coordinate with the developer&rsquo;s sales team to schedule this step, ensuring <strong data-start=\"3478\" data-end=\"3507\">accuracy in documentation</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3551\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3583\"><strong data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3583\">8. Payment &amp; Allotment</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3584\" data-end=\"3617\">After the Agreement is signed:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3799\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3691\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3691\">You follow the <strong data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3651\">payment plan</strong> (installments / down payment schedule).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3692\" data-end=\"3799\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3799\">The developer issues the <strong data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3761\">Allotment Letter / Confirmation Letter</strong> &mdash; assigning the specific unit to you.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3891\">A2P assists in tracking these payments and reconfirming deadlines so you stay on schedule.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3896\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3932\"><strong data-start=\"3902\" data-end=\"3932\">9. Registration &amp; Handover</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"3993\">&nbsp;Upon completion of project milestones and final receipts:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4199\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4117\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3996\" data-end=\"4117\">You proceed to <strong data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4037\">register the sale deed</strong> at the Sub-Registrar&rsquo;s office with required stamp duty and registration fees.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4199\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4120\" data-end=\"4199\">Once registered, you get <strong data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4159\">possession</strong> and keys to your new M3M GIC apartment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4279\">A2P Realtech will continue to support you through final handover coordination.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4281\" data-end=\"4284\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4317\"><strong data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4317\">10. After-Sales Support</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4376\">A2P often provides <strong data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4366\">post-booking assistance</strong>, such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4377\" data-end=\"4491\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4377\" data-end=\"4406\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4379\" data-end=\"4406\">Helping with RERA updates</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4407\" data-end=\"4447\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4409\" data-end=\"4447\">Following up on possession timelines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4491\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4491\">Clarifying any queries after registration</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4493\" data-end=\"4559\">This ensures a <em data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4532\">long-term relationship</em>, not just a one-time sale.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4561\" data-end=\"4564\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4566\" data-end=\"4606\"><strong data-start=\"4572\" data-end=\"4606\">Why Book Through A2P Realtech?</strong></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4893\">Personalized guidance from inquiry to possession</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4893\">Direct access to project details and pricing</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4893\">Assistance with documentation &amp; legal checks</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4893\">Help with loan coordination and financing</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4893\">Smooth coordination with developer sales teams</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4607\" data-end=\"4893\">Reduced hassle for first-time buyers</li>\r\n</ul>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3510.2283436420266!2d76.87645657603905!3d28.382170395404824!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d3f94bfe92053%3A0xdb6fbed5dd4d76fd!2sM3M%20Gic%20Manesar%20-%20Sector%20M9!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1768756312753!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Gurgaon International City, Sector M9, IMT Manesar', '', '', 'A2KGAHVS', 19, 'M3M GIC Manesar | Luxury Apartments & Investment Hub', 'M3M GIC Manesar, M3M Gurgaon International City, M3M GIC Sector M9, luxury apartments Manesar, property in IMT Manesar, M3M residential project, integrated township Manesar, Gurgaon real estate investment, M3M upcoming project, premium homes Manesar', 'Discover M3M GIC Manesar – luxury residences in an integrated township with strong infrastructure, seamless connectivity, and excellent ROI potential.', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `subproduct` (`id`, `name`, `photo`, `des`, `fld_order`, `actstat`, `subcat`, `pcode`, `photo2`, `photo3`, `photo4`, `photo5`, `photo6`, `photo7`, `pro_additionalinfo`, `pro_shortdes`, `pro_discountprice`, `pro_mainprice`, `pro_specification`, `pro_lable`, `developer`, `city`, `code`, `subcat2`, `meta_title`, `meta_keyword`, `meta_description`, `related_blogs`, `related_products`) VALUES
(244, 'Luxury Apartments M3M GIC Gurgaon International City Sector M9 IMT Manesar', '20260128161604_M3M-GIC-Manesar-Gurgaon.jpg', '<h2 data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"301\"><strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"301\">Luxury Amenities at M3M GIC Manesar &mdash; Unmatched Comfort &amp; Lifestyle</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"634\">M3M GIC Manesar isn&rsquo;t just a residence &mdash; it&rsquo;s a <strong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"384\">premium lifestyle destination</strong> crafted to deliver the ultimate combination of <strong data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"473\">comfort, convenience, and exclusivity</strong>. Every amenity reflects thoughtful planning, contemporary design, and world-class standards, ensuring a superior living experience for homeowners and residents.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"639\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"683\"><strong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"683\">1. Grand Entrance &amp; Signature Lobby</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"932\">From the moment you arrive, experience a sense of elegance. The <strong data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"772\">grand entrance plaza</strong> and <strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"802\">signature lobby areas</strong> are designed with premium finishes, architectural finesse, and welcoming aesthetics &mdash; setting the tone for a luxurious lifestyle.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"937\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"984\"><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"984\">2. Landscaped Gardens &amp; Green Walkways</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1226\">Step into impeccably designed <strong data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1037\">landscaped gardens</strong> with lush green lawns, serene walkways, and themed spaces. These meticulously curated outdoor areas offer peaceful environments for morning strolls, evening walks, and quality family time.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1231\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1275\"><strong data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1275\">3. Clubhouse &amp; Multi-Purpose Lounge</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1469\">The dedicated <strong data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1303\">clubhouse</strong> at M3M GIC Manesar is a vibrant social hub for community gathering, celebrations, and leisure activities. With stylish interiors and flexible spaces, it&rsquo;s ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1584\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1509\">Private parties and family gatherings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1545\">Community events and celebrations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1584\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1584\">Indoor recreation and social meetups</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1589\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1629\"><strong data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1629\">4. Premium Swimming Pool &amp; Deck</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1854\">Enjoy a resort-style experience with a <strong data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1693\">luxury swimming pool</strong> and pool deck &mdash; perfect for relaxation, family fun, or refreshing morning laps. The poolside setting features comfortable seating areas and elegant landscaping.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1899\"><strong data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1899\">5. Advanced Fitness &amp; Gymnasium</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"2145\">Stay active and healthy with a <strong data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1959\">fully equipped gymnasium</strong> featuring modern strength and cardio equipment. Designed to cater to all age groups, the fitness centre encourages a balanced and active lifestyle without stepping out of the community.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2150\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2187\"><strong data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2187\">6. Sports &amp; Recreation Zones</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2283\">Recreation is part of everyday living at M3M GIC Manesar. Residents enjoy dedicated spaces for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2383\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2307\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2307\">Outdoor sports courts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2330\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2330\">Children&rsquo;s play area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2359\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2359\">Jogging and cycling tracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2383\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2383\">Open recreation lawns</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2454\">These amenities are ideal for families and fitness enthusiasts alike.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2459\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2495\"><strong data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2495\">7. Retail Boulevard &amp; Caf&eacute;s</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2746\">A curated <strong data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2526\">retail boulevard</strong> brings essential convenience and lifestyle retail within easy reach. Discover boutique stores, caf&eacute;s, specialty outlets, and casual dining &mdash; all set within a pedestrian-friendly zone that adds vibrancy to everyday life.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2751\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2788\"><strong data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2788\">8. Executive Business Centre</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2906\">For professionals and residents who work from home or run their businesses, the <strong data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2898\">Executive Business Centre</strong> offers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"3008\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2936\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2936\">Work pods and meeting rooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2961\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2961\">High-speed Wi-Fi zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2962\" data-end=\"3008\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"3008\">Comfortable seating and collaborative spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3083\">It&rsquo;s the perfect blend of convenience and connectivity for modern living.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3088\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3126\"><strong data-start=\"3093\" data-end=\"3126\">9. Amphitheatre &amp; Event Plaza</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3362\">A beautifully designed <strong data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3166\">amphitheatre</strong> and events plaza make community gatherings and cultural events more memorable. Whether it&rsquo;s a weekend performance or a festive celebration, this space is crafted for engagement and entertainment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3367\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3414\"><strong data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3414\">10. 24&times;7 Security &amp; Smart Surveillance</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3498\">Your safety and peace of mind are top priorities. M3M GIC Manesar is equipped with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3610\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3521\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3521\">24&times;7 manned security</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3522\" data-end=\"3545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3545\">Smart CCTV monitoring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3570\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3570\">Access control systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3571\" data-end=\"3610\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3610\">Well-lit internal pathways and plazas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3701\">This ensures a secure and comfortable environment for families and residents of all ages.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3706\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3750\"><strong data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3750\">11. Power Backup &amp; Utility Services</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3821\">Never worry about discomfort due to outages. The development provides:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3987\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3853\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3853\">Power backup for common areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3887\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3856\" data-end=\"3887\">Reliable utility infrastructure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3890\" data-end=\"3987\">Efficient waste management systems<br data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3927\">These services ensure uninterrupted comfort and convenience.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"3992\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3994\" data-end=\"4037\"><strong data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4037\">12. Ample Parking &amp; Traffic Planning</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4038\" data-end=\"4090\">Designed for ease of living, M3M GIC Manesar offers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4240\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4142\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4142\">Spacious parking areas for residents and visitors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4168\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4168\">Dedicated parking zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4169\" data-end=\"4205\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4171\" data-end=\"4205\">Well-planned entry and exit routes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4240\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4208\" data-end=\"4240\">Smooth internal vehicle movement</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4242\" data-end=\"4314\">This thoughtful planning enhances everyday convenience and traffic flow.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4316\" data-end=\"4319\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4321\" data-end=\"4354\"><strong data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4354\">Why These Amenities Matter</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4460\">The luxury amenities at M3M GIC Manesar are not just features &mdash; they&rsquo;re lifestyle enablers that cater to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4461\" data-end=\"4653\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4461\" data-end=\"4501\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4501\"><strong data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4474\">Comfort</strong> for families and seniors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4548\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4548\"><strong data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4525\">Social engagement</strong> for community living</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4549\" data-end=\"4595\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4551\" data-end=\"4595\"><strong data-start=\"4551\" data-end=\"4573\">Wellness &amp; fitness</strong> for everyday health</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4596\" data-end=\"4653\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4653\"><strong data-start=\"4598\" data-end=\"4628\">Convenience &amp; connectivity</strong> for modern professionals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4655\" data-end=\"4808\">These amenities elevate your living experience and add significant value to the property, making it an ideal choice for both <strong data-start=\"4780\" data-end=\"4807\">end users and investors</strong>.</p>', 0, 1, 270, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h1 data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"360\"><strong data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"360\">M3M GIC &mdash; Gurgaon International City, Sector M9, IMT Manesar | Luxury Apartments &amp; High-Growth Investment Hub</strong></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"791\"><strong data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"402\">M3M GIC &ndash; Gurgaon International City</strong>, located in <strong data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"441\">Sector M9, IMT Manesar</strong>, is a landmark mixed-use development that redefines modern urban living and smart investment opportunities in Gurgaon. Conceptualized and developed by the trusted <strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"618\">M3M Group</strong>, this project seamlessly blends <strong data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"721\">luxury residential apartments with a thriving commercial ecosystem</strong>, making it an ideal destination for both <strong data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"790\">end users and investors</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"1072\">Strategically positioned in one of Gurgaon&rsquo;s fastest-growing industrial and commercial corridors, M3M GIC Manesar is designed to cater to the evolving needs of professionals, families, corporates, and investors seeking long-term growth, lifestyle comfort, and asset appreciation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"1072\">M3M GIC High Rise Apartment Configuration</h3>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 44.0665%; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 134.344px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 45.1486%;\"><col style=\"width: 54.8514%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 22.3906px; background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Types of Apartment</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 22.3906px; background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong>Size of Apartment</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\">2 BHK</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\">1200 Sq. Ft</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\">3 BHK</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\">1700 - 1800 Sq. Ft</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\">4 BHK</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 22.3906px; text-align: center;\">2400 Sq. Ft</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1136\"><strong data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1136\">About M3M Group &ndash; A Symbol of Trust and Excellence</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1419\">The <strong data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1155\">M3M Group</strong> is one of India&rsquo;s leading real estate developers, renowned for delivering iconic residential and commercial projects across Gurgaon. Known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and timely delivery, M3M has consistently raised benchmarks in urban development.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1649\">With M3M GIC Gurgaon International City, the developer brings its expertise to IMT Manesar, envisioning a <strong data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1563\">self-sustained urban destination</strong> that integrates homes, workplaces, retail, and leisure into one cohesive environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1716\"><strong data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1716\">Strategic Location Advantage &ndash; Sector M9, IMT Manesar</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1888\">Location plays a decisive role in real estate value, and <strong data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1804\">M3M GIC Sector M9 Manesar</strong> enjoys a highly strategic position within Gurgaon&rsquo;s industrial and commercial belt.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1922\"><strong data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1922\">Key Location Highlights:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"2255\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1962\">Located in <strong data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1962\">Sector M9, IMT Manesar</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2023\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2023\">Excellent connectivity to <strong data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2023\">NH-48 (Delhi&ndash;Jaipur Highway)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2084\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2084\">Easy access to <strong data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2084\">Gurgaon, Bhiwadi, Rewari, and Delhi NCR</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2155\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2155\">Proximity to major <strong data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2155\">industrial units, SEZs, and corporate offices</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2196\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2196\">Smooth connectivity to <strong data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2196\">IGI Airport</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2255\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2255\">Close to existing and upcoming <strong data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2255\">residential townships</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2437\">IMT Manesar is home to several multinational manufacturing companies, logistics hubs, and corporate offices, ensuring <strong data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2436\">constant demand for quality housing and commercial spaces</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\n<h3 class=\"blog-details__title\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"../service_detail/m3m-gic-manesar-gurgaon-a-new-landmark-for-modern-living.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">M3M GIC Manesar Gurgaon A New Landmark for Modern Living</a></span></h3>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2502\"><strong data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2502\">Project Overview &ndash; Gurgaon International City (GIC)</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2598\"><strong data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2515\">M3M GIC</strong> is envisioned as a <strong data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2570\">future-ready international city</strong> offering a balanced mix of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2751\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2632\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2632\">Luxury residential apartments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2672\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2672\">Modern commercial and office spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2715\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2715\">High-street retail and lifestyle zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2751\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2751\">Green landscapes and open areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2922\">The project focuses on <strong data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2846\">urban convenience, efficient planning, and sustainable development</strong>, creating a vibrant environment where people can live, work, and socialize.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2927\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2976\"><strong data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2976\">Luxury Residential Apartments at M3M GIC</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3018\"><strong data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3018\">Apartment Configurations &amp; Sizes</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3251\">M3M GIC offers a thoughtfully curated range of <strong data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3101\">premium residential apartments</strong>, designed to suit diverse lifestyle needs. Unit sizes range from <strong data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3201\">1,250 sq. ft. to 2,400 sq. ft.</strong>, ensuring spacious layouts and functional living.</p>\r\n<h4 data-start=\"3253\" data-end=\"3287\"><strong data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3287\">Available Configurations:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3288\" data-end=\"3674\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3288\" data-end=\"3363\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3363\"><strong data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3310\">2 BHK Apartments</strong> &ndash; Ideal for young professionals and small families</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3443\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3443\"><strong data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3388\">2.5 BHK Residences</strong> &ndash; Additional flexible space for study or home office</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3506\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3506\"><strong data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3466\">3 BHK Apartments</strong> &ndash; Spacious homes for growing families</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3577\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3577\"><strong data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3539\">3.5 BHK Premium Residences</strong> &ndash; Enhanced comfort with extra space</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3674\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3674\"><strong data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3607\">4 BHK Luxury Apartments</strong> &ndash; Expansive homes for ultra-luxury living and executive families</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3676\" data-end=\"3787\">Each residence is designed with <strong data-start=\"3708\" data-end=\"3786\">modern architecture, optimal space utilization, and premium specifications</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3792\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3794\" data-end=\"3831\"><strong data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3831\">Design &amp; Lifestyle Highlights</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"4096\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3872\">Spacious and well-ventilated layouts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3873\" data-end=\"3914\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3914\">Large windows for ample natural light</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3948\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3917\" data-end=\"3948\">Premium fittings and finishes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3949\" data-end=\"3999\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3951\" data-end=\"3999\">Well-defined living, dining, and private zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4000\" data-end=\"4046\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4046\">Balconies with open views <em data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4044\">(select units)</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4047\" data-end=\"4096\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4096\">Peaceful, low-density residential environment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4235\">The apartments at M3M GIC Manesar offer an ideal balance of <strong data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4192\">comfort, privacy, and elegance</strong>, making them perfect for long-term living.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4240\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4242\" data-end=\"4307\"><strong data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4307\">Commercial &amp; Retail Spaces &ndash; A Thriving Business Ecosystem</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4309\" data-end=\"4484\">Alongside luxury residences, <strong data-start=\"4338\" data-end=\"4376\">M3M GIC Gurgaon International City</strong> also features well-planned commercial and retail spaces designed to support a vibrant business environment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4486\" data-end=\"4518\"><strong data-start=\"4490\" data-end=\"4518\">Commercial Office Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"4703\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"4545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4521\" data-end=\"4545\">Efficient floor plates</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4546\" data-end=\"4613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4613\">Suitable for corporates, MSMEs, and industrial support services</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4614\" data-end=\"4653\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4616\" data-end=\"4653\">Modern infrastructure and amenities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4654\" data-end=\"4703\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4656\" data-end=\"4703\">High-speed elevators and professional lobbies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4705\" data-end=\"4744\"><strong data-start=\"4709\" data-end=\"4744\">Retail &amp; High-Street Commercial</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4937\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4745\" data-end=\"4777\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4747\" data-end=\"4777\">High-visibility retail shops</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4860\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4780\" data-end=\"4860\">Ideal for branded showrooms, caf&eacute;s, restaurants, and daily convenience outlets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4861\" data-end=\"4937\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4937\">Designed to attract consistent footfall from residents and professionals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4939\" data-end=\"5060\">This mixed-use format enhances the overall value of the project and ensures <strong data-start=\"5015\" data-end=\"5059\">round-the-clock activity and convenience</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5062\" data-end=\"5065\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5067\" data-end=\"5100\"><strong data-start=\"5070\" data-end=\"5100\">Amenities &amp; Infrastructure</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5102\" data-end=\"5232\">M3M GIC is planned with <strong data-start=\"5126\" data-end=\"5180\">world-class infrastructure and lifestyle amenities</strong> to enhance everyday living and business operations.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5234\" data-end=\"5263\"><strong data-start=\"5238\" data-end=\"5263\">Key Features Include:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5541\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5313\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5266\" data-end=\"5313\">Wide internal roads and planned access points</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5314\" data-end=\"5358\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5316\" data-end=\"5358\">Ample parking for residents and visitors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5359\" data-end=\"5397\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5361\" data-end=\"5397\">Landscaped gardens and open spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5437\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5400\" data-end=\"5437\">24&times;7 security and CCTV surveillance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5438\" data-end=\"5471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5440\" data-end=\"5471\">Power backup for common areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5472\" data-end=\"5508\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5474\" data-end=\"5508\">Fire safety systems as per norms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5509\" data-end=\"5541\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5511\" data-end=\"5541\">Pedestrian-friendly pathways</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5543\" data-end=\"5619\">These features ensure a <strong data-start=\"5567\" data-end=\"5618\">safe, comfortable, and future-ready environment</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5621\" data-end=\"5624\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5626\" data-end=\"5684\"><strong data-start=\"5629\" data-end=\"5684\">Investment Potential &ndash; Why Investors Choose M3M GIC</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5686\" data-end=\"5777\">From an investor&rsquo;s perspective, <strong data-start=\"5718\" data-end=\"5747\">M3M GIC Sector M9 Manesar</strong> offers compelling advantages:</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5779\" data-end=\"5810\"><strong data-start=\"5783\" data-end=\"5810\">1. High-Growth Location</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5811\" data-end=\"5933\">IMT Manesar continues to witness rapid industrial expansion, infrastructure upgrades, and rising employment opportunities.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5935\" data-end=\"5966\"><strong data-start=\"5939\" data-end=\"5966\">2. Strong Rental Demand</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5967\" data-end=\"6085\">Proximity to industrial hubs and corporate offices ensures <strong data-start=\"6026\" data-end=\"6050\">steady rental demand</strong> from professionals and executives.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6087\" data-end=\"6118\"><strong data-start=\"6091\" data-end=\"6118\">3. Capital Appreciation</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6119\" data-end=\"6255\">With increasing development and limited supply of premium housing, property values in this region are poised for long-term appreciation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6257\" data-end=\"6295\"><strong data-start=\"6261\" data-end=\"6295\">4. Trusted Developer Advantage</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6296\" data-end=\"6361\">M3M&rsquo;s brand value enhances buyer confidence and resale potential.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6363\" data-end=\"6394\"><strong data-start=\"6367\" data-end=\"6394\">5. Diverse Unit Options</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6395\" data-end=\"6484\">A wide range of apartment sizes attracts multiple tenant profiles, reducing vacancy risk.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6486\" data-end=\"6489\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"6491\" data-end=\"6543\"><strong data-start=\"6494\" data-end=\"6543\">End-User Benefits &ndash; Why It&rsquo;s Ideal for Living</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6545\" data-end=\"6575\">For end users, M3M GIC offers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6576\" data-end=\"6842\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6576\" data-end=\"6624\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6578\" data-end=\"6624\">Spacious, modern homes with premium features</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6625\" data-end=\"6681\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6627\" data-end=\"6681\">Close proximity to workplaces, reducing commute time</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6682\" data-end=\"6744\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6684\" data-end=\"6744\">A well-planned environment with essential amenities nearby</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6745\" data-end=\"6794\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6747\" data-end=\"6794\">A safe, secure, and family-friendly community</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6795\" data-end=\"6842\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6797\" data-end=\"6842\">Long-term lifestyle comfort and asset value</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6844\" data-end=\"7013\">It is particularly suitable for <strong data-start=\"6876\" data-end=\"6932\">working professionals, business owners, and families</strong> seeking a balanced lifestyle away from congestion yet well-connected to Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7015\" data-end=\"7018\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7020\" data-end=\"7063\"><strong data-start=\"7023\" data-end=\"7063\">Social Infrastructure &amp; Connectivity</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7065\" data-end=\"7096\">Residents enjoy easy access to:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7097\" data-end=\"7267\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7097\" data-end=\"7137\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7099\" data-end=\"7137\">Schools and educational institutions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7138\" data-end=\"7177\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7140\" data-end=\"7177\">Hospitals and healthcare facilities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7178\" data-end=\"7219\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7180\" data-end=\"7219\">Hotels, malls, and entertainment hubs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7220\" data-end=\"7267\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7222\" data-end=\"7267\">Banks, ATMs, and daily convenience services</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7269\" data-end=\"7374\">This robust social infrastructure further strengthens the livability and desirability of M3M GIC Manesar.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7376\" data-end=\"7379\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7381\" data-end=\"7426\"><strong data-start=\"7384\" data-end=\"7426\">Sustainability &amp; Future-Ready Planning</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7428\" data-end=\"7489\">M3M GIC incorporates sustainable planning principles such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7490\" data-end=\"7599\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7490\" data-end=\"7514\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7492\" data-end=\"7514\">Optimized land usage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7515\" data-end=\"7536\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7517\" data-end=\"7536\">Green landscaping</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7537\" data-end=\"7565\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7539\" data-end=\"7565\">Energy-efficient systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7566\" data-end=\"7599\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7568\" data-end=\"7599\">Smart infrastructure planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7601\" data-end=\"7688\">These elements ensure <strong data-start=\"7623\" data-end=\"7687\">lower operational costs and long-term environmental benefits</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7690\" data-end=\"7693\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7695\" data-end=\"7738\"><strong data-start=\"7698\" data-end=\"7738\">Who Should Invest or Buy at M3M GIC?</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7740\" data-end=\"7754\"><strong data-start=\"7740\" data-end=\"7754\">Ideal for:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7755\" data-end=\"8030\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7755\" data-end=\"7810\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7757\" data-end=\"7810\">End users seeking luxury homes in a growth corridor</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7811\" data-end=\"7865\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7813\" data-end=\"7865\">Investors targeting rental income and appreciation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7866\" data-end=\"7916\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7868\" data-end=\"7916\">Corporate professionals working in IMT Manesar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7917\" data-end=\"7978\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7919\" data-end=\"7978\">Business owners seeking integrated live-work environments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7979\" data-end=\"8030\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7981\" data-end=\"8030\">NRIs looking for reliable long-term investments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8032\" data-end=\"8035\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"8037\" data-end=\"8095\"><strong data-start=\"8040\" data-end=\"8095\">A Smart Choice for Living &amp; Investment</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8097\" data-end=\"8490\"><strong data-start=\"8097\" data-end=\"8161\">M3M GIC &ndash; Gurgaon International City, Sector M9, IMT Manesar</strong> stands out as a <strong data-start=\"8178\" data-end=\"8228\">premium residential and commercial destination</strong> offering the perfect blend of <strong data-start=\"8259\" data-end=\"8313\">luxury living and high-growth investment potential</strong>. Backed by the credibility of M3M Group and the rapid development of IMT Manesar, this project promises <strong data-start=\"8418\" data-end=\"8489\">lifestyle excellence, strong returns, and future-ready urban living</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"8492\" data-end=\"8631\">Whether you are looking for a <strong data-start=\"8522\" data-end=\"8536\">dream home</strong> or a <strong data-start=\"8542\" data-end=\"8578\">strategic real estate investment</strong>, M3M GIC Manesar is a destination worth considering.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"373\"><strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"373\">Frequently Asked Questions &ndash; M3M GIC Gurgaon International City</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"431\"><strong data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"431\">1. What is M3M GIC &ndash; Gurgaon International City?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"720\">M3M GIC &ndash; Gurgaon International City is a premium mixed-use development by the reputed M3M Group, located in Sector M9, IMT Manesar. The project offers luxury residential apartments along with well-planned commercial and retail spaces, making it suitable for both end users and investors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"725\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"763\"><strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"763\">2. Where is M3M GIC located?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"993\">M3M GIC is strategically located in Sector M9, IMT Manesar, Gurgaon. The project enjoys excellent connectivity to NH-48 (Delhi&ndash;Jaipur Highway) and offers smooth access to Gurgaon city, Delhi NCR, Bhiwadi, Rewari, and IGI Airport.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"998\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1061\"><strong data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1061\">3. What types of apartments are available at M3M GIC?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1312\">M3M GIC offers a wide range of luxury apartment configurations including 2 BHK, 2.5 BHK, 3 BHK, 3.5 BHK, and 4 BHK apartments. Unit sizes range from approximately 1,250 sq. ft. to 2,400 sq. ft., catering to different lifestyle and space requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1317\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1370\"><strong data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1370\">4. Is M3M GIC a good option for investment?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1677\">Yes, M3M GIC is considered a strong investment option due to its location in the fast-growing IMT Manesar corridor, rising commercial and industrial activity, strong rental demand, and the credibility of the M3M Group. The project offers potential for both rental income and long-term capital appreciation.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1682\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1740\"><strong data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1740\">5. Who should consider buying a home at M3M GIC?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1920\">M3M GIC is ideal for working professionals, business owners, families, corporate executives, and NRIs looking for luxury living or a high-growth real estate investment in Gurgaon.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1925\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1990\"><strong data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1990\">6. What makes IMT Manesar a prime real estate location?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2302\">IMT Manesar is one of Gurgaon&rsquo;s fastest-developing industrial and commercial hubs. It hosts several multinational companies, manufacturing units, and logistics centers. Continuous infrastructure development and employment growth have made Manesar a preferred location for residential and commercial real estate.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2307\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2370\"><strong data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2370\">7. Does M3M GIC include commercial and retail spaces?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2618\">Yes, M3M GIC is a mixed-use development that includes modern office spaces and high-street retail areas. These spaces are designed to support businesses, retail brands, restaurants, and service outlets, creating a self-sustained urban environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2623\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2691\"><strong data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2691\">8. What amenities and facilities are available at M3M GIC?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2913\">M3M GIC offers modern infrastructure and amenities such as landscaped open spaces, wide internal roads, ample parking, 24&times;7 security, CCTV surveillance, power backup for common areas, and well-planned pedestrian pathways.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2918\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2969\"><strong data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2969\">9. Is M3M GIC suitable for rental income?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"3171\">Yes, the project&rsquo;s proximity to industrial hubs, corporate offices, and commercial zones in IMT Manesar ensures strong and consistent rental demand, especially from professionals and executive tenants.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3173\" data-end=\"3176\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3254\"><strong data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3254\">10. Why should buyers choose M3M GIC over other projects in Manesar?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3505\">M3M GIC stands out due to its premium construction quality, trusted M3M branding, luxury residential offerings, integrated commercial ecosystem, strategic location, and strong future growth potential, making it ideal for both end users and investors.</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3510.2283436420266!2d76.87645657603905!3d28.382170395404824!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d3f94bfe92053%3A0xdb6fbed5dd4d76fd!2sM3M%20Gic%20Manesar%20-%20Sector%20M9!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1768756312753!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'M3M GIC – Gurgaon International City', '', '', 'CWOJ5D1R', 19, 'M3M GIC — Gurgaon International City, Sector M9, IMT Manesar | Luxury Apartments & High-Growth Investment Hub', 'M3M GIC, Gurgaon International City, M3M GIC Manesar, M3M GIC Sector M9, IMT Manesar apartments, luxury apartments Manesar, 2 BHK Manesar, 3 BHK Manesar, 4 BHK Manesar, M3M luxury apartments, Gurgaon investment property, Manesar real estate, premium apartments Gurgaon, M3M GIC investment, commercial and residential Manesar.', 'M3M GIC – Gurgaon International City in Sector M9, IMT Manesar offers luxury 2/2.5/3/3.5/4 BHK apartments with premium amenities, modern infrastructure, and high-growth investment potential. Ideal for end users and investors seeking a smart lifestyle and strong capital appreciation in Gurgaon.', NULL, NULL);
