"1563\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1585\">High-speed elevators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1617\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1617\">Power backup for common areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1644\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1644\">Dedicated parking spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1649\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1688\"><strong data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1688\">Sustainable &amp; Green Living</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1718\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1718\">Rainwater harvesting system</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1751\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1751\">Solar lighting in common areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1778\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1778\">Water-efficient plumbing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1814\">EV charging points (select areas)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1846\">Eco-friendly waste management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1851\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1888\"><strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1888\">Why These Amenities Matter</strong></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"2081\">Enhances <strong data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1929\">daily lifestyle &amp; comfort</strong></li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"2081\">Increases <strong data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1976\">rental demand &amp; resale value</strong></li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"2081\">&nbsp;Appeals to <strong data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2030\">luxury end users &amp; premium tenants</strong></li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"2081\">&nbsp;Future-ready, sustainable living environment</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 270, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h1 data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"266\"><strong data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"266\">Smartworld GIC Gurgaon-Manesar Apartments &ndash; Luxury Homes Near NH-48 &amp; Dwarka Expressway</strong></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"750\">The real estate landscape of <strong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"308\">Gurgaon</strong> is undergoing a transformational shift, and at the heart of this evolution lies <strong data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"434\">Smartworld GIC Gurgaon-Manesar Apartments</strong>, a premium residential development located within <strong data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"521\">Gurgaon International City (GIC)</strong>. Strategically positioned near <strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"584\">NH-48 and Dwarka Expressway</strong>, this project is fast emerging as a <strong data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"693\">top choice for luxury homebuyers, long-term investors, and end users</strong> seeking modern living combined with exceptional returns.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"1032\">In this detailed guide, we explore <strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"821\">Smartworld GIC Gurgaon-Manesar</strong> from every perspective&mdash;<strong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"1031\">location advantage, project highlights, lifestyle amenities, investment potential, price appreciation, connectivity, and why it is an ideal option for both living and wealth creation</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1095\"><strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1095\">1. Introduction to Smartworld GIC Gurgaon-Manesar</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1391\"><strong data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1122\">Smartworld Developers</strong>, a renowned name in India&rsquo;s real estate sector, is known for redefining urban living through innovation, quality construction, and futuristic design. Their flagship development at <strong data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1356\">Gurgaon International City (GIC), Gurgaon-Manesar</strong> is a testimony to this philosophy.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1572\">Smartworld GIC is not just a residential project&mdash;it is a <strong data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1482\">well-planned urban ecosystem</strong> offering luxury apartments that seamlessly blend comfort, elegance, and smart technology.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1760\">Designed for <strong data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1654\">new-age professionals, high-net-worth individuals, and families</strong>, Smartworld GIC Gurgaon-Manesar Apartments promise a lifestyle that balances work, leisure, and wellness.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1835\"><strong data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1835\">2. Prime Location Advantage: Gurgaon International City (GIC)</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1878\"><strong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1878\">2.1 Strategic Location Near NH-48</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1992\">NH-48 (Delhi&ndash;Jaipur Highway) is one of India&rsquo;s most important commercial corridors. Being close to NH-48 ensures:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2048\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2048\">Smooth connectivity to <strong data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2048\">Delhi, Manesar, and Jaipur</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2106\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2106\">Quick access to <strong data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2106\">corporate hubs and industrial zones</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2175\">Faster daily commute for professionals working in Gurgaon or Delhi</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2219\"><strong data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2219\">2.2 Proximity to Dwarka Expressway</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2356\">Dwarka Expressway is rapidly becoming Gurgaon&rsquo;s <strong data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2301\">most premium real estate belt</strong>. Smartworld GIC&rsquo;s proximity to this expressway offers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2533\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2399\">Seamless connectivity to <strong data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2399\">IGI Airport</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2458\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2458\">Direct access to <strong data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2458\">Dwarka, West Delhi, and South Delhi</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2533\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2533\">Massive appreciation potential due to ongoing infrastructure development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2578\"><strong data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2578\">2.3 Gurgaon-Manesar Growth Corridor</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2646\">Gurgaon-Manesar is a <strong data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2635\">high-growth investment corridor</strong> driven by:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2771\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2669\">Industrial expansion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2694\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2694\">IT &amp; corporate offices</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2724\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2724\">Proposed metro connectivity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2771\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2771\">Government-backed urban planning initiatives</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2854\">This makes Smartworld GIC an ideal destination for <strong data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2853\">future-ready urban living</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2859\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2930\"><strong data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2930\">3. Project Overview: Smartworld GIC Gurgaon-Manesar Apartments</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"3051\">Smartworld GIC offers <strong data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2987\">luxury residential apartments</strong> thoughtfully designed to meet the aspirations of modern buyers.</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #000000;\" border=\"1\" data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"3261\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2828\">\r\n<th style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2777\" data-col-size=\"lg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2776\">Unit Type</strong></span></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2804\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2803\">Approx. Size (sq.ft)</strong></span></th>\r\n<th style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(35, 111, 161); border-style: solid;\" data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2828\" data-col-size=\"md\"><span style=\"color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\"><strong data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2826\">Typical Features</strong></span></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"3261\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2969\">\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2908\" data-col-size=\"lg\">2.5 BHK</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2920\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1250&ndash;1400</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" da