nd Smart Living</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Sobha 63A integrates sustainable design practices that promote responsible luxury:</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Energy-efficient systems</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Water conservation measures</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Environment-friendly materials</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Ample green landscaping</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Luxury here is conscious, modern, and future-oriented.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Why Sobha 63A Stands Apart from Other Luxury Projects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">In a market crowded with &ldquo;luxury&rdquo; labels, Sobha 63A stands out because:</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">It prioritizes quality over quantity</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">It offers real, usable space</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">It is backed by a developer with an impeccable track record</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">It is located in Gurgaon&rsquo;s most prestigious corridor</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">This is not just another high-rise&mdash;it&rsquo;s a <strong>statement address</strong>.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"0\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">A Rare Opportunity to Own Iconic Luxury</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Sobha 63A on Golf Course Extension Road represents the pinnacle of <strong>ultra-luxury apartments in Gurgaon</strong>. It combines location advantage, impeccable design, superior construction quality, and long-term value into one exceptional offering.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">For those who seek more than just a home&mdash;for those who seek <strong>distinction, comfort, and legacy</strong>&mdash;Sobha 63A is an address that truly delivers.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: 128.8pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"301\">Process to Book a Unit Through A2P Realtech (Authorized Sales Channel Partner)</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"337\">Step 1: Initial Consultation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"618\">Connect with <strong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"367\">A2P Realtech</strong> for a detailed discussion of your requirements, including preferred configuration (3 / 4 / 4.5 BHK), budget, floor preference, and investment or end-use goals. Our experts provide personalized guidance to help you shortlist the most suitable options.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"667\">Step 2: Project Presentation &amp; Site Visit</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"905\">A2P Realtech arranges a comprehensive project presentation, followed by a <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"763\">guided site visit</strong> to experience the location, master plan, sample layouts, and surrounding infrastructure. This ensures complete clarity before moving forward.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"956\">Step 3: Unit Selection &amp; Availability Check</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1149\">Based on your preferences, A2P Realtech assists in checking <strong data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1053\">real-time inventory availability</strong>, views, floor plans, and price details. The most suitable unit is then shortlisted for booking.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1198\">Step 4: Price Confirmation &amp; Payment Plan</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1405\">You receive a transparent breakdown of the <strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1298\">unit price, applicable charges, and payment schedule</strong> directly from the developer. A2P Realtech ensures all details are clearly explained, with no hidden costs.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1464\">Step 5: Expression of Interest (EOI) / Token Amount</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1620\">To block the selected unit, an <strong data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1519\">EOI or token amount</strong> is paid in favor of the developer as per the booking terms. This temporarily reserves the apartment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1655\">Step 6: Documentation &amp; KYC</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1824\">Submit required documents such as <strong data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1735\">KYC, PAN, address proof, and booking form</strong>. A2P Realtech supports you throughout the documentation process for a smooth experience.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1862\">Step 7: Allotment Confirmation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1999\">Upon successful submission of documents and payment, the developer issues an <strong data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1969\">official allotment letter</strong> confirming your unit details.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2043\">Step 8: Agreement &amp; Further Payments</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2191\">The <strong data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2075\">Builder-Buyer Agreement</strong> is executed as per the payment milestone. A2P Realtech coordinates with the developer and assists until completion.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2236\">Step 9: Dedicated After-Sales Support</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2368\">A2P Realtech continues to support you post-booking with payment reminders, construction updates, and coordination until possession.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2373\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2409\">Why Book Through A2P Realtech?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2615\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2440\">Authorized Channel Partner</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2493\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2493\">End-to-end assistance from inquiry to possession</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2536\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2536\">Transparent pricing &amp; inventory access</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2577\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2577\">Priority coordination with developer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2615\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2615\">Dedicated relationship management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3509.8899880711906!2d77.08676657518276!3d28.392390544945858!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d2324e72372c3%3A0x4e93635e78570b8a!2sSobha%20Sector%2063A%20Gurgaon!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1770377376724!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sobha 63A Gurgaon on Golf Course Extension Road', '', '', 'Z3AT3P8R', 19, 'Ultra-Luxury Apartments in Gurgaon: Sobha 63A on Golf Course Extension Road', 'Sobha 63A Gurgaon, Sobha Sector 63A, Ultra Luxury Apartments in Gurgaon, Sobha Luxury Apartments Golf Course Extension Road, 3 BHK 4 BHK Sobha Gurgaon, Premium Apartments Sector 63A Gurgaon, Sobha Realty Gurgaon Projects, High-end Residences Gurgaon, Luxury Homes Golf Course Extension Road, Sobha New Launch Gurgaon', 'Experience ultra-luxury living at Sobha 63A Gurgaon on Golf Course Extension Road. Premium 3 & 4 BHK residences with world-class amenities, superior craftsmanship, excellent connectivity, and high investment potential. Book your dream luxury home today.', NULL, NULL);
