573\" data-end=\"1617\">Power backup for common areas &amp; apartments</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1642\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1642\">Rainwater harvesting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1669\">Sewage treatment plant</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1698\">Dedicated drop-off zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 0, 1, 270, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<h1 data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"450\"><strong data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"450\">Sobha 63A Golf Course Extension Road Gurgaon &ndash; Premium Luxury Homes</strong></h1>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"518\">Elevate Your Lifestyle at Sector 63A&rsquo;s Most Prestigious Address</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"893\">Sobha 63A at Golf Course Extension Road, Gurgaon, is a landmark ultra-luxury residential development designed for those who seek exclusivity, space, elegance, and a refined lifestyle. Spread across <strong data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"744\">12 acres of prime land</strong>, this iconic project features <strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"825\">5 magnificent towers rising up to G+40 storeys</strong>, offering breathtaking skyline views and panoramic Aravalli vistas.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"1071\">Crafted by the reputed Sobha Group, known for uncompromising construction quality and architectural excellence, Sobha 63A is not just a residence&mdash;it is a statement of prestige.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1076\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1096\">Project Overview</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1129\"><strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1117\">Project Name:</strong> Sobha 63A</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1195\"><strong data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1145\">Location:</strong> Sector 63A, Golf Course Extension Road, Gurgaon</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1224\"><strong data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1213\">Total Area:</strong> 12 Acres</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1248\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1248\"><strong data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1244\">Total Towers:</strong> 5</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1280\"><strong data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1265\">Structure:</strong> G+40 Storeys</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1314\"><strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1312\">Configurations Available:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1340\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1340\">3 BHK &ndash; 2300 Sq.Ft.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1366\">4 BHK &ndash; 2700 Sq.Ft.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1400\">4.5 BHK &ndash; Up to 3000 Sq.Ft.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1525\">This development is designed for low-density luxury living, ensuring privacy, exclusivity, and spacious green surroundings.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1573\">Unit Configurations &amp; Layout Excellence</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1715\">Sobha 63A offers meticulously designed residences with intelligent space planning, ensuring maximum natural light, ventilation, and comfort.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1739\">3 BHK &ndash; 2300 Sq.Ft.</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1837\">Ideal for modern families who value space and functionality, the 3 BHK homes at Sobha 63A offer:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1876\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1876\">Expansive living and dining areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1917\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1917\">Large balconies with panoramic views</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1967\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1967\">Spacious master bedroom with premium fittings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2005\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2005\">Modular kitchen with utility area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2054\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2054\">Elegant bathrooms with high-end sanitaryware</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2080\">Smart home provisions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2199\">This configuration is perfect for nuclear and growing families looking for a balance between luxury and practicality.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2204\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2228\">4 BHK &ndash; 2700 Sq.Ft.</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2322\">The 4 BHK residences are designed for larger families who desire more space and exclusivity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2341\">Features include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2584\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2367\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2367\">Grand entrance foyer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2411\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2411\">Separate formal and family living areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2454\">Large master suite with walk-in closet</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2484\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2484\">Premium imported flooring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2508\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2508\">Expansive balconies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2545\">High ceilings enhancing openness</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2584\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2584\">Separate utility and service areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2664\">These homes are built for comfort, elegance, and elevated lifestyle standards.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2669\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2695\">4.5 BHK &ndash; 3000 Sq.Ft.</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2790\">For those who want nothing but the best, the 4.5 BHK residences redefine ultra-luxury living.</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"3016\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2817\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2817\">Ultra-spacious layout</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2850\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2850\">Dedicated study/servant room</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2878\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2878\">Expansive balcony decks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2922\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2922\">Designer kitchen with high-end fittings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2951\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2951\">Premium branded fixtures</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2979\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2979\">Smart security features</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3016\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3016\">VRV/VRF air conditioning systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3128\">These residences are ideal for business leaders, HNIs, and luxury seekers who want exclusivity at every level.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3130\" data-end=\"3133\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3184\">Location Advantage &ndash; Golf Course Extension Road</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3307\">Location plays a crucial role in real estate investment, and Sobha 63A stands in one of Gurgaon&rsquo;s most premium corridors.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3309\" data-end=\"3337\">Connectivity Highlights:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3565\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3339\" data-end=\"3386\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3341\" data-end=\"3386\">Direct access to Golf Course Extension Road</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3387\" data-end=\"3421\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3421\">Seamless connectivity to NH-48</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3446\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3424\" data-end=\"3446\">Close to Rapid Metro</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3490\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3449\" data-end=\"3490\">Easy access to Cyber City &amp; Udyog Vihar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3491\" data-end=\"3531\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3493\" data-end=\"3531\">Approx. 25&ndash;30 minutes to IGI Airport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3565\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3534\" data-end=\"3565\">Proximity to Sohna Road &amp; SPR</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3600\">Nearby Social Infrastructure:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3786\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3647\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3604\" data-end=\"3647\">Top Schools (Heritage, DPS, St. Xavier&rsquo;s)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3696\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3696\">Leading Hospitals (Medanta, Artemis, Fortis)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3731\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3731\">Premium Malls &amp; Retail Centers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3732\" data-end=\"3749\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3749\">5-Star Hotels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3786\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3786\">Fine Dining &amp; Entertainment Hubs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3788\" data-end=\"3873\">The project is surrounded by luxury developments, making it a high-appreciation zone.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3878\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"3880\" data-end=\"3906\">Architectural Brilliance</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3908\" data-end=\"4031\">Sobha 63A&rsquo;s G+40 storey towers redefine Gurgaon&rsquo;s skyline. The five high-rise towers are thoughtfully positioned to ensure:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4156\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4033\" data-end=\"4052\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4035\" data-end=\"4052\">Maximum privacy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4053\" data-end=\"4074\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4055\" data-end=\"4074\">Cross ventilation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4102\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4077\" data-end=\"4102\">Stunning Aravalli views</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4103\" data-end=\"4129\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4129\">Abundant natural light</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4156\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4132\" data-end=\"4156\">Wind flow optimization</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4235\">The fa&ccedil;ade reflects contemporary design blended with timeless sophistication.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4240\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"4242\" data-end=\"4265\">World-Class Amenities</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4346\">Sobha 63A offers an unmatched lifestyle experience with resort-style amenities:</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4348\" data-end=\"4373\">Clubhouse &amp; Recreation</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4375\" data-end=\"4490\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4375\" data-end=\"4401\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4377\" data-end=\"4401\">Grand luxury clubhouse</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4402\" data-end=\"4423\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4423\">Indoor games area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4424\" data-end=\"4443\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4443\">Business lounge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4465\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4446\" data-end=\"4465\">Multipurpose hall</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4466\" data-end=\"4490\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4468\" data-end=\"4490\">Caf&eacute; &amp; social spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4492\" data-end=\"4511\">Health &amp; Fitness</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4631\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4541\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4515\" data-end=\"4541\">Fully equipped gymnasium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4542\" data-end=\"4568\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4544\" data-end=\"4568\">Yoga &amp; meditation deck</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4569\" data-end=\"4587\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4587\">Jogging tracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4605\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4605\">Swimming pool</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4606\" data-end=\"4631\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4608\" data-end=\"4631\">Spa &amp; wellness center</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4633\" data-end=\"4653\">Sports Facilities</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4655\" data-end=\"4758\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4655\" data-end=\"4671\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4657\" data-end=\"4671\">Tennis court</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4672\" data-end=\"4691\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4674\" data-end=\"4691\">Badminton court</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4692\" data-end=\"4712\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4694\" data-end=\"4712\">Basketball court</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4713\" data-end=\"4732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4715\" data-end=\"4732\">Kids&rsquo; play area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4733\" data-end=\"4758\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4735\" data-end=\"4758\">Outdoor fitness zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4760\" data-end=\"4775\">Green Living</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4777\" data-end=\"4876\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4777\" data-end=\"4799\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4779\" data-end=\"4799\">Landscaped gardens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4800\" data-end=\"4820\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4802\" data-end=\"4820\">Open green lawns</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4821\" data-end=\"4839\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4823\" data-end=\"4839\">Water features</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4840\" data-end=\"4857\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4842\" data-end=\"4857\">Sitting decks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4858\" data-end=\"4876\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4860\" data-end=\"4876\">Walking trails</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4878\" data-end=\"4946\">More than 70% open space ensures peaceful and pollution-free living.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4948\" data-end=\"4951\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"4953\" data-end=\"4992\">Construction Quality &amp; Specifications</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4994\" data-end=\"5061\">Sobha is known for backward integration and strict quality control.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5063\" data-end=\"5086\">Key Specifications:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5088\" data-end=\"5344\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5088\" data-end=\"5133\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5090\" data-end=\"5133\">Imported marble flooring in living/dining</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5134\" data-end=\"5165\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5136\" data-end=\"5165\">Wooden flooring in bedrooms</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5207\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5207\">Modular kitchen with premium fittings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5208\" data-end=\"5232\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5210\" data-end=\"5232\">Branded sanitaryware</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5233\" data-end=\"5257\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5235\" data-end=\"5257\">High-speed elevators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5258\" data-end=\"5284\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5260\" data-end=\"5284\">3-tier security system</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5285\" data-end=\"5305\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5287\" data-end=\"5305\">Video door phone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5306\" data-end=\"5322\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5308\" data-end=\"5322\">Power backup</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5323\" data-end=\"5344\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5325\" data-end=\"5344\">Dedicated parking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5346\" data-end=\"5416\">Every detail reflects craftsmanship and attention to luxury standards.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5418\" data-end=\"5421\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"5423\" data-end=\"5469\">Investment Potential &ndash; Why Buy at Sobha 63A?</h1>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5471\" data-end=\"5504\">1. Prime Location Appreciation</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5505\" data-end=\"5585\">Golf Course Extension Road is one of Gurgaon&rsquo;s fastest-growing luxury corridors.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5587\" data-end=\"5604\">2. Brand Value</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5605\" data-end=\"5673\">Sobha&rsquo;s reputation ensures trust, resale value, and timely delivery.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5675\" data-end=\"5699\">3. High Rental Demand</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5700\" data-end=\"5762\">Close proximity to corporate hubs ensures strong rental yield.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5764\" data-end=\"5787\">4. Limited Inventory</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5788\" data-end=\"5858\">5 towers within 12 acres ensure exclusivity and demand-driven pricing.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"5860\" data-end=\"5887\">5. Infrastructure Growth</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"5888\" data-end=\"5957\">Ongoing road expansions and metro connectivity increase future value.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5959\" data-end=\"5962\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"5964\" data-end=\"5981\">Who Should Buy?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"5983\" data-end=\"6006\">Sobha 63A is ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6008\" data-end=\"6156\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6008\" data-end=\"6035\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6010\" data-end=\"6035\">Corporate professionals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6055\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6038\" data-end=\"6055\">Business owners</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6056\" data-end=\"6064\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6058\" data-end=\"6064\">NRIs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6065\" data-end=\"6073\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6067\" data-end=\"6073\">HNIs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6074\" data-end=\"6113\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6076\" data-end=\"6113\">Families upgrading to luxury living</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6114\" data-end=\"6156\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6116\" data-end=\"6156\">Investors seeking capital appreciation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6158\" data-end=\"6161\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"6163\" data-end=\"6185\">Lifestyle Experience</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6187\" data-end=\"6377\">Imagine waking up to Aravalli views from your balcony. Enjoy morning coffee in landscaped gardens. Spend evenings at the clubhouse. Let your children grow in a safe, secure, green community.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6379\" data-end=\"6396\">Sobha 63A offers:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6398\" data-end=\"6456\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6398\" data-end=\"6409\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6400\" data-end=\"6409\">Privacy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6410\" data-end=\"6419\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6412\" data-end=\"6419\">Space</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6420\" data-end=\"6432\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6422\" data-end=\"6432\">Security</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6433\" data-end=\"6443\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6435\" data-end=\"6443\">Luxury</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6444\" data-end=\"6456\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6446\" data-end=\"6456\">Prestige</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6458\" data-end=\"6507\">It&rsquo;s not just an apartment&mdash;it&rsquo;s a legacy address.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6509\" data-end=\"6512\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"6514\" data-end=\"6542\">Why Sobha 63A is Different</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"6544\" data-end=\"6597\">Unlike regular luxury projects, Sobha 63A focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6599\" data-end=\"6749\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6599\" data-end=\"6623\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6601\" data-end=\"6623\">Low-density planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6624\" data-end=\"6663\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6626\" data-end=\"6663\">Large unit sizes (2300&ndash;3000 Sq.Ft.)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6664\" data-end=\"6690\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6666\" data-end=\"6690\">Premium specifications</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6691\" data-end=\"6718\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6693\" data-end=\"6718\">High-rise iconic living</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6719\" data-end=\"6749\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6721\" data-end=\"6749\">Superior finishing quality</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6751\" data-end=\"6845\">Few projects in Gurgaon combine brand trust, prime location, and ultra-luxury scale like this.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6847\" data-end=\"6850\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"6852\" data-end=\"6885\">Booking Process &amp; Payment Plans</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6887\" data-end=\"7035\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6887\" data-end=\"6913\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6889\" data-end=\"6913\">Easy booking procedure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6914\" data-end=\"6943\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6916\" data-end=\"6943\">Attractive launch pricing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6944\" data-end=\"6970\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6946\" data-end=\"6970\">Flexible payment plans</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6971\" data-end=\"7005\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6973\" data-end=\"7005\">Home loan assistance available</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7006\" data-end=\"7035\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7008\" data-end=\"7035\">Transparent documentation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7037\" data-end=\"7117\">Early investors often benefit from pre-launch or early-phase pricing advantages.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7119\" data-end=\"7122\">\r\n<h1 data-start=\"7124\" data-end=\"7161\">Own a Landmark Address</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"7163\" data-end=\"7456\">Sobha 63A Golf Course Extension Road Gurgaon is designed for those who refuse to compromise. With 12 acres of prime land, 5 iconic towers rising G+40 storeys, and spacious 3 &amp; 4 BHK residences ranging from 2300 to 3000 Sq.Ft., this development stands as a symbol of sophistication and success.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7458\" data-end=\"7610\">Whether you are looking for your dream home or a premium investment, Sobha 63A delivers on every front&mdash;location, luxury, lifestyle, and long-term value.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7612\" data-end=\"7654\"><strong data-start=\"7612\" data-end=\"7654\">Experience grandeur. Experience Sobha.</strong></p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3509.8899880711906!2d77.08676657518276!3d28.392390544945858!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390d2324e72372c3%3A0x4e93635e78570b8a!2sSobha%20Sector%2063A%20Gurgaon!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1770377376724!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', '63A Golf Course Extension Road Gurgaon', '', '', 'A9662AXK', 19, 'Sobha 63A Golf Course Extension Road Gurgaon – Premium Luxury Homes', 'Sobha 63A Gurgaon, Sobha Golf Course Extension Road, Sobha Sector 63A, Sobha Luxury Apartments Gurgaon, Premium Homes in Gurgaon, 3 BHK 4 BHK Luxury Apartments Gurgaon, Golf Course Extension Road Projects, Sobha New Launch Gurgaon, Luxury Flats in Sector 63A, High Rise Apartments Gurgaon, Gurgaon Premium Real Estate, Sobha Residential Project Gurgaon, Luxury Homes Near Golf Course Extension Road', 'Discover premium luxury living at Sobha 63A on Golf Course Extension Road, Gurgaon. Offering spacious 3 & 4 BHK luxury apartments with world-class amenities, prime connectivity, and elegant design. Book your dream home in Sector 63A Gurgaon today', NULL, NULL);
