(251, 'Premium Plots at Experion The Westerlies Sector 108 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', '20260305071507_Dream-Plots-Experion-Sector-108-Gurgaon.jpg', '<h1 data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"231\">Amenities at Experion The Westerlies</h1>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"262\">Lifestyle &amp; Club Amenities</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"447\">\r\n<li data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"286\">\r\n<p data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"286\">Exclusive clubhouse</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"334\">\r\n<p data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"334\">Multipurpose hall for events and gatherings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"357\">\r\n<p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"357\">Caf&eacute; &amp; lounge area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"379\">\r\n<p data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"379\">Indoor games room</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"406\">\r\n<p data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"406\">Library / reading zone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"447\">\r\n<p data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"447\">Amphitheatre for cultural activities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"616\">These facilities create a vibrant social environment where residents can relax, celebrate occasions, and interact with neighbors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"652\">Sports &amp; Fitness Amenities</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"862\">\r\n<li data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"681\">\r\n<p data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"681\">Fully equipped gymnasium</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"714\">\r\n<p data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"714\">Swimming pool with kids pool</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n<p data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"731\">Tennis court</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"752\">\r\n<p data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"752\">Basketball court</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"786\">\r\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"786\">Cricket pitch / sports ground</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"817\">\r\n<p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"817\">Jogging and walking tracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<p data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"836\">Cycling tracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"862\">\r\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"862\">Outdoor exercise zone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"991\">These amenities encourage a healthy and active lifestyle for residents of all age groups.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"996\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1032\">Wellness &amp; Relaxation Amenities</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1061\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1061\">Yoga and meditation zone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1085\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1085\">Reflexology pathway</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1118\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1118\">Landscaped gardens and lawns</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1156\">Fish pond and serene water bodies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1189\">Senior citizen sitting areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1320\">These peaceful spaces help residents relax, meditate, and enjoy nature within the township.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1325\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1353\">Kids &amp; Family Amenities</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1500\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1383\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1383\">Dedicated kids&rsquo; play area</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1412\">Toddlers&rsquo; activity zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1432\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1432\">Open play lawns</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1464\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1464\">Creche / childcare facility</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1500\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1500\">Nursery and preschool provision</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1618\">These facilities make the township highly suitable for families with children.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1623\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1653\">Green &amp; Outdoor Amenities</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1683\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1683\">10+ acres green boulevard</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1706\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1706\">Tree-lined avenues</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1739\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1739\">Landscaped parks and gardens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1772\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1772\">Barbecue area for gatherings</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1811\">Plazas and open recreational zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"2002\">The project is also located near the Delhi Green Reserve Zone, which enhances the natural environment and provides cleaner air and scenic surroundings.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2007\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2039\">Safety &amp; Security Amenities</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2080\">24&times;7 security with trained personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2122\">CCTV surveillance across the township</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2169\">Gated community with controlled entry/exit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2208\">Video door phone facility in homes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2236\">Well-lit internal roads</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2353\">These measures ensure a secure and peaceful living environment for residents.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2358\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2401\">Infrastructure &amp; Convenience Amenities</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2629\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2439\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2439\">100% power backup (as applicable)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2464\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2464\">24-hour water supply</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2496\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2496\">Rainwater harvesting system</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2530\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2530\">Underground electrical wiring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2578\">Wide internal roads for smooth traffic flow</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2629\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2629\">International-standard water management system</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2755\">These features ensure efficient infrastructure and sustainable living in the township.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2760\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2804\">Community &amp; Daily Convenience Amenities</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2988\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2837\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2837\">Retail shops for daily needs</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2878\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2878\">Provision for school within township</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2924\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2924\">Nursing home / medical facility provision</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2953\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"2953\">Dedicated parking spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2988\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2988\">Taxi stand and visitor parking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3121\">Such facilities allow residents to access essential services without leaving the community.</p>', 0, 1, 269, '', '', '', '20260305073128_RAJENDRA_VISITING.pdf', '', '', '', '<h2 data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"172\">Premium Plots at Experion The Westerlies, Sector 108 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"871\">In the rapidly evolving real estate landscape of the National Capital Region, Gurugram has emerged as one of the most sought-after destinations for premium residential investments. Among the many promising developments transforming this region, <strong data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"460\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Experion The Westerlies</span></span></strong> stands out as a landmark plotted development offering luxury, convenience, and future appreciation. Strategically located in <strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"627\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Sector 108, Gurugram</span></span></strong> along the fast-developing <strong data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"695\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Dwarka Expressway</span></span></strong>, this premium plotted township offers an exceptional opportunity for homeowners and investors who want to build their dream home in one of the most promising corridors of NCR.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"1367\">Developed by <strong data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"927\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Experion Developers</span></span></strong>, a reputed real estate brand known for delivering world-class residential and commercial projects, Experion The Westerlies combines thoughtful planning, high-quality infrastructure, and modern lifestyle amenities within a secure gated community. The project offers spacious residential plots that allow buyers to design and construct homes tailored to their preferences while enjoying the benefits of a well-developed township environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"1367\"><iframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NwbcEcjqlYg?si=d4fZJXCQTCYSVw35\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\r\n<h2><strong>Plot available Details in Sector 108 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Plots in Experion The Westerlies vary in size and pricing, catering to diverse preferences and investment capacities.</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 18.2162%;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 58.3756%; background-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Inventory Type</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; width: 41.6244%; background-color: rgb(194, 224, 244);\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><strong>Size</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 58.3756%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>Plot</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 41.6244%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>1,935 Sq.Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 58.3756%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>Plot</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 41.6244%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>4,500 Sq. Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 58.3756%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>Plot</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 41.6244%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>4,950 Sq. Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 58.3756%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>Plot</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 41.6244%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>4,968 Sq. Ft</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1419\">A Prestigious Address on Dwarka Expressway</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1735\">Location plays a crucial role when investing in real estate, and Experion The Westerlies enjoys one of the most strategic addresses in Gurugram. The project is situated in Sector 108, which lies directly along the Dwarka Expressway corridor&mdash;an emerging residential and commercial hub connecting Delhi and Gurugram.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"2050\">The Dwarka Expressway, also known as the Northern Peripheral Road, has rapidly become one of the most important infrastructure developments in NCR. This expressway offers seamless connectivity between Dwarka in Delhi and various sectors of Gurugram, significantly reducing travel time and improving accessibility.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2150\">Residents of Experion The Westerlies benefit from smooth connectivity to key destinations such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2348\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2178\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2178\">Dwarka and IGI Airport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2214\">Central Gurugram and Cyber City</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2247\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2247\">NH-48 (Delhi-Jaipur Highway)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2299\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2299\">Golf Course Road and Golf Course Extension Road</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2348\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2348\">Major business hubs and commercial districts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2678\">The proximity to Delhi makes Sector 108 particularly attractive for professionals working in corporate hubs across Gurugram and South Delhi. The area is also witnessing significant infrastructure upgrades, new residential developments, and commercial projects, making it one of the most promising investment destinations in NCR.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2683\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2741\">A Premium Plotted Township Designed for Modern Living</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"3053\">Experion The Westerlies has been thoughtfully designed as a premium plotted development that balances open green spaces, modern infrastructure, and community living. Unlike high-rise apartments, plotted developments offer buyers the flexibility to build homes according to their own vision and lifestyle needs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3291\">The project features a well-planned layout with wide internal roads, landscaped green areas, and modern civic infrastructure. Every plot is designed to ensure maximum usability, proper ventilation, and easy access to essential services.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3346\">Some key highlights of the township planning include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3348\" data-end=\"3569\">\r\n<li data-start=\"3348\" data-end=\"3382\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3382\">Wide tree-lined internal roads</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3417\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3417\">Underground electrical cabling</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3418\" data-end=\"3459\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3459\">Efficient drainage and sewage systems</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3460\" data-end=\"3496\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3496\">Landscaped parks and green zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3530\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3530\">Dedicated pedestrian pathways</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3569\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3569\">Secure gated community environment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3571\" data-end=\"3727\">The layout promotes a sense of openness and privacy, allowing residents to enjoy independent living while still being part of a well-connected neighborhood.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"3732\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3769\">Freedom to Build Your Dream Home</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3771\" data-end=\"4022\">One of the biggest advantages of buying a plot in Experion The Westerlies is the freedom it provides. Instead of adjusting to predefined apartment layouts, buyers can design and construct homes according to their own preferences, needs, and lifestyle.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4024\" data-end=\"4202\">Whether you envision a luxurious villa, a modern duplex, or a spacious multi-storey home, owning a plot here gives you the flexibility to bring your architectural vision to life.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4204\" data-end=\"4229\">Homeowners can customize:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"4231\" data-end=\"4374\">\r\n<li data-start=\"4231\" data-end=\"4254\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4233\" data-end=\"4254\">Architectural style</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4275\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4275\">Interior layouts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4276\" data-end=\"4296\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4278\" data-end=\"4296\">Number of floors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4297\" data-end=\"4324\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4324\">Landscaping and gardens</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4374\">\r\n<p data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4374\">Outdoor spaces such as terraces and balconies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4512\">This flexibility is particularly attractive for families who want personalized living spaces that reflect their tastes and requirements.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4514\" data-end=\"4517\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"4519\" data-end=\"4548\">Modern Lifestyle Amenities</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"4778\">Experion The Westerlies is more than just a plotted development&mdash;it is a complete lifestyle destination designed to enhance everyday living. The township offers a wide range of amenities that cater to residents of all age groups.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"4780\" data-end=\"4814\">Clubhouse and Community Spaces</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"4816\" data-end=\"5009\">The project features a modern clubhouse that acts as the social and recreational hub for residents. It provides spaces where families can relax, socialize, and enjoy various leisure activities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5011\" data-end=\"5040\">Facilities typically include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5158\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5064\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5064\">Indoor games areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5065\" data-end=\"5086\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5067\" data-end=\"5086\">Multipurpose hall</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5087\" data-end=\"5117\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5089\" data-end=\"5117\">Fitness and wellness zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5118\" data-end=\"5158\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5120\" data-end=\"5158\">Lounge and community gathering areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5160\" data-end=\"5271\">The clubhouse creates a vibrant social environment where neighbors can connect and build lasting relationships.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5273\" data-end=\"5276\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5278\" data-end=\"5311\">Sports and Fitness Facilities</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5313\" data-end=\"5506\">Healthy living is an important aspect of modern lifestyle communities. Experion The Westerlies offers multiple sports and fitness facilities that encourage residents to stay active and healthy.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"5508\" data-end=\"5550\">Sports and recreational amenities include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"5552\" data-end=\"5681\">\r\n<li data-start=\"5552\" data-end=\"5569\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5554\" data-end=\"5569\">Tennis courts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5570\" data-end=\"5591\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5572\" data-end=\"5591\">Basketball courts</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5592\" data-end=\"5622\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5594\" data-end=\"5622\">Jogging and cycling tracks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5623\" data-end=\"5652\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5625\" data-end=\"5652\">Yoga and meditation zones</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"5653\" data-end=\"5681\">\r\n<p data-start=\"5655\" data-end=\"5681\">Outdoor fitness stations</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"5683\" data-end=\"5786\">These facilities make it easy for residents to incorporate physical activity into their daily routines.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"5788\" data-end=\"5791\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"5793\" data-end=\"5820\">Landscaped Green Spaces</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"5822\" data-end=\"6057\">One of the defining features of Experion The Westerlies is its emphasis on greenery and open spaces. The township features beautifully landscaped parks, gardens, and tree-lined avenues that create a refreshing and tranquil environment.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6059\" data-end=\"6106\">Green spaces offer several benefits, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6108\" data-end=\"6243\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6108\" data-end=\"6132\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6110\" data-end=\"6132\">Improved air quality</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6133\" data-end=\"6165\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6135\" data-end=\"6165\">Relaxation and stress relief</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6166\" data-end=\"6206\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6168\" data-end=\"6206\">Safe outdoor play areas for children</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6207\" data-end=\"6243\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6209\" data-end=\"6243\">Scenic walking and jogging paths</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6245\" data-end=\"6364\">Residents can enjoy morning walks, evening strolls, and outdoor activities amidst nature without leaving the community.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6366\" data-end=\"6369\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"6371\" data-end=\"6396\">Children&rsquo;s Play Areas</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"6398\" data-end=\"6610\">Families with children will appreciate the thoughtfully designed play zones within the township. These areas provide a safe and engaging environment where kids can play, explore, and interact with other children.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"6612\" data-end=\"6635\">The play areas include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"6637\" data-end=\"6746\">\r\n<li data-start=\"6637\" data-end=\"6658\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6639\" data-end=\"6658\">Swings and slides</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6659\" data-end=\"6682\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6661\" data-end=\"6682\">Climbing structures</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6683\" data-end=\"6702\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6685\" data-end=\"6702\">Open play lawns</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"6703\" data-end=\"6746\">\r\n<p data-start=\"6705\" data-end=\"6746\">Activity zones for different age groups</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"6748\" data-end=\"6840\">Such facilities encourage outdoor play and help create a lively family-friendly environment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"6842\" data-end=\"6845\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"6847\" data-end=\"6874\">A Secure Gated Community</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"6876\" data-end=\"7038\">Safety and security are essential aspects of modern residential living, and Experion The Westerlies ensures peace of mind through a comprehensive security system.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7040\" data-end=\"7066\">Security features include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7068\" data-end=\"7225\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7068\" data-end=\"7118\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7070\" data-end=\"7118\">Gated community with controlled entry and exit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7119\" data-end=\"7146\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7121\" data-end=\"7146\">24/7 security personnel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7147\" data-end=\"7184\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7149\" data-end=\"7184\">CCTV surveillance in common areas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7185\" data-end=\"7225\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7187\" data-end=\"7225\">Well-lit internal roads and pathways</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7227\" data-end=\"7317\">These measures help create a safe and secure environment for residents and their families.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7319\" data-end=\"7322\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7324\" data-end=\"7368\">Excellent Connectivity and Infrastructure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7370\" data-end=\"7503\">The strategic location of Experion The Westerlies ensures excellent connectivity to major infrastructure and transportation networks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"7505\" data-end=\"7541\">Key connectivity advantages include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"7543\" data-end=\"7720\">\r\n<li data-start=\"7543\" data-end=\"7579\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7545\" data-end=\"7579\">Easy access to Dwarka Expressway</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7580\" data-end=\"7615\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7582\" data-end=\"7615\">Close proximity to Delhi border</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7616\" data-end=\"7645\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7618\" data-end=\"7645\">Convenient reach to NH-48</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7646\" data-end=\"7687\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7648\" data-end=\"7687\">Connectivity to upcoming metro routes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"7688\" data-end=\"7720\">\r\n<p data-start=\"7690\" data-end=\"7720\">Smooth access to IGI Airport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"7722\" data-end=\"7823\">This connectivity significantly enhances the convenience of daily commuting and travel for residents.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"7825\" data-end=\"7828\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"7830\" data-end=\"7877\">Proximity to Essential Social Infrastructure</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"7879\" data-end=\"8042\">Living at Experion The Westerlies means having easy access to essential social infrastructure such as schools, hospitals, shopping centers, and entertainment hubs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"8044\" data-end=\"8070\">Nearby facilities include:</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8072\" data-end=\"8100\">Educational Institutions</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8102\" data-end=\"8240\">The region is home to several reputed schools and educational institutions, ensuring quality education options for families with children.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8242\" data-end=\"8267\">Healthcare Facilities</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8269\" data-end=\"8419\">Residents have access to leading hospitals and medical centers located within a short driving distance, ensuring quick medical assistance when needed.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"8421\" data-end=\"8451\">Shopping and Entertainment</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"8453\" data-end=\"8632\">The Dwarka Expressway corridor is witnessing rapid commercial development, with shopping malls, retail outlets, restaurants, and entertainment centers coming up in nearby sectors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"8634\" data-end=\"8714\">This ensures that residents can enjoy modern conveniences without traveling far.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"8716\" data-end=\"8719\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"8721\" data-end=\"8751\">Strong Investment Potential</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"8753\" data-end=\"8989\">Apart from being a great place to live, Experion The Westerlies also offers excellent investment potential. The Dwarka Expressway corridor is one of the fastest-growing real estate zones in NCR, attracting both homebuyers and investors.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"8991\" data-end=\"9072\">Several factors contribute to the strong appreciation potential of this location:</p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"9074\" data-end=\"9602\">\r\n<li data-start=\"9074\" data-end=\"9213\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9077\" data-end=\"9213\"><strong data-start=\"9077\" data-end=\"9107\">Infrastructure Development</strong><br data-start=\"9107\" data-end=\"9110\">The completion of the Dwarka Expressway has significantly boosted property demand in nearby sectors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9215\" data-end=\"9327\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9218\" data-end=\"9327\"><strong data-start=\"9218\" data-end=\"9240\">Proximity to Delhi</strong><br data-start=\"9240\" data-end=\"9243\">Easy connectivity to Dwarka and South Delhi increases the appeal of the location.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9329\" data-end=\"9466\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9332\" data-end=\"9466\"><strong data-start=\"9332\" data-end=\"9363\">Growing Commercial Activity</strong><br data-start=\"9363\" data-end=\"9366\">New commercial developments are creating employment opportunities and driving residential demand.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9468\" data-end=\"9602\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9471\" data-end=\"9602\"><strong data-start=\"9471\" data-end=\"9506\">Limited Supply of Premium Plots</strong><br data-start=\"9506\" data-end=\"9509\">Plotted developments in prime locations are limited, which enhances their long-term value.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"9604\" data-end=\"9689\">Investing in a premium plot today can lead to substantial appreciation in the future.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"9691\" data-end=\"9694\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"9696\" data-end=\"9732\">Ideal for End Users and Investors</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"9734\" data-end=\"9798\">Experion The Westerlies appeals to both end users and investors.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"9800\" data-end=\"9817\">For End Users</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"9819\" data-end=\"9944\">Families looking to build their dream home in a premium and well-connected location will find this project highly attractive.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"9946\" data-end=\"9963\">Benefits include:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"9965\" data-end=\"10084\">\r\n<li data-start=\"9965\" data-end=\"9987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9967\" data-end=\"9987\">Independent living</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"9988\" data-end=\"10016\">\r\n<p data-start=\"9990\" data-end=\"10016\">Personalized home design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10017\" data-end=\"10053\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10019\" data-end=\"10053\">Premium neighborhood environment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10054\" data-end=\"10084\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10056\" data-end=\"10084\">Access to modern amenities</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"10086\" data-end=\"10103\">For Investors</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"10105\" data-end=\"10235\">Investors can benefit from strong appreciation potential and increasing demand for residential properties along Dwarka Expressway.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"10237\" data-end=\"10338\">Plotted developments also offer flexibility for resale, construction, or rental income in the future.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10340\" data-end=\"10343\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"10345\" data-end=\"10378\">Why Choose Experion Developers</h2>\r\n<p><img title=\"Premium Plots at Experion The Westerlies, Sector 108\" src=\"https://pink-sheep-796549.hostingersite.com/upload/20260305070914_69a92c1a106d6.jpg\" alt=\"Own a Plot at Experion The Westerlies, Gurgaon\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"10380\" data-end=\"10594\">The credibility of the developer is an important factor when investing in real estate. Experion Developers has built a strong reputation for delivering high-quality residential and commercial projects across India.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"10596\" data-end=\"10619\">The company focuses on:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"10621\" data-end=\"10742\">\r\n<li data-start=\"10621\" data-end=\"10655\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10623\" data-end=\"10655\">Transparent business practices</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10656\" data-end=\"10690\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10658\" data-end=\"10690\">Innovative design and planning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10691\" data-end=\"10722\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10693\" data-end=\"10722\">High construction standards</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"10723\" data-end=\"10742\">\r\n<p data-start=\"10725\" data-end=\"10742\">Timely delivery</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"10744\" data-end=\"10818\">This commitment to quality ensures that buyers can invest with confidence.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"10820\" data-end=\"10823\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"10825\" data-end=\"10855\">A Future-Ready Neighborhood</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"10857\" data-end=\"11145\">Sector 108 is part of a rapidly developing region that is expected to become one of the most vibrant residential zones in Gurugram. With ongoing infrastructure projects, improved connectivity, and new commercial developments, the area is poised for significant growth in the coming years.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"11147\" data-end=\"11281\">Future developments around the Dwarka Expressway corridor will further enhance the convenience and value of properties in this region.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"11283\" data-end=\"11469\">As more families and professionals move to this area, the demand for premium residential spaces is expected to increase, making Experion The Westerlies an excellent long-term investment.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"11471\" data-end=\"11474\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"11476\" data-end=\"11534\">Experience the Perfect Blend of Luxury and Independence</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"11536\" data-end=\"11900\">Experion The Westerlies offers a rare opportunity to enjoy the luxury of a premium township while maintaining the independence of plotted living. With its strategic location, thoughtfully planned infrastructure, modern amenities, and strong investment potential, this project represents one of the most attractive residential opportunities along Dwarka Expressway.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"11902\" data-end=\"12128\">Whether you are planning to build your dream home or looking for a high-value real estate investment, Experion The Westerlies in Sector 108 Gurgaon provides the perfect combination of location, lifestyle, and long-term growth.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"12130\" data-end=\"12320\">Owning a plot here means becoming part of a vibrant community that offers comfort, convenience, and a premium lifestyle in one of the most promising locations in the National Capital Region.</p>', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m16!1m12!1m3!1d3505.8623131171043!2d76.98275317590367!3d28.513789968386796!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!2m1!1sexperion%20the%20westerlies%20sector%20108%20gurgaon!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1772695088273!5m2!1sen!2sin', '', '', '', 'Sector 108 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Experion', 'Gurgaon', '9HSCXGSZ', 19, 'Premium Plots at Experion The Westerlies, Sector 108 Dwarka Expressway Gurgaon', 'Experion The Westerlies, Experion Westerlies Sector 108, plots in Sector 108 Gurgaon, Dwarka Expressway plots, premium plots in Gurgaon, Experion plots Gurgaon, residential plots Dwarka Expressway, plots near Delhi border Gurgaon, luxury plots Sector 108 Gurugram, plots near IGI Airport Gurgaon, Experion Developers projects Gurgaon, gated community plots Gurgaon, investment plots Dwarka Expressway.', 'Explore premium residential plots at Experion The Westerlies in Sector 108, Gurgaon on Dwarka Expressway. A luxury plotted township offering world-class amenities, green landscapes, excellent connectivity to Delhi and IGI Airport, and strong investment potential for homebuyers and investors.', '91', NULL),
(252, '', '', '', 0, 1, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'XM4ANPFS', 0, '', '', '', '', NULL);

